values
  ('1055436580218828325', 'The Doll', 1962, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Arne Mattsson, Åke Dahlqvist', 'Lars Forssell, Eva Seeberg', 'Per Oscarsson, Gio Petré, Tor Isedal, Elsa Prawitz, Bengt Eklund, Malou, Dagmar Olsson, Mimi Nelson', null, 'A lonely nightwatchman at a department store develops a fixation on one of the store''s mannequins. He soon steals her and takes her to his home, where he can be with her all the time. One day, she comes to life...', 'A lonely nightwatchman at a department store develops a fixation on one of the store''s mannequins. He soon steals her and takes her to his home, where he can be with her all the time. One day, she comes to life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTie1xOyIZeT3lcXay8t0QBvNV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129877'),
  ('864540545388920285', 'The Doll', 1968, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Wojciech Has, Stefan Matyjaszkiewicz, Halina Garus', 'Wojciech Has', 'Mariusz Dmochowski, Beata Tyszkiewicz, Tadeusz Fijewski, Jadwiga Halina Gallowa, Wiesław Gołas, Kalina Jędrusik, Jan Koecher, Jan Kreczmar', null, 'Set in the 19th century Warsaw. The indolence of aristocrats who, secure with their pensions, are too lazy to undertake new business risks, frustrates Wokulski. His ability to make money is respected but his lack of family and social rank is condescended to. Because of his "help" (in secret) to "the doll''s" impecunious but influential father, the girl becomes aware of his affection.', 'Set in the 19th century Warsaw. The indolence of aristocrats who, secure with their pensions, are too lazy to undertake new business risks, frustrates Wokulski. His ability to make money is respected but his lack of family and social rank is condescended to. Because of his "help" (in secret) to "the doll''s" impecunious but influential father, the girl becomes aware of his affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIvdBu6kPme0i5nkTdE64U08Itq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81315'),
  ('1033199826725174056', 'The Doll', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Dewi Yulia Razif, Agusti Tanjung, Rocky Soraya', 'Riheam Junianti', 'Shandy Aulia, Denny Sumargo, Sara Wijayanto, Vitta Mariana, Demian Aditya, Faiza Mahnur, Hans Gunawan, Aslam Abad', null, 'Anya and Daniel just moved to their new house in Bandung. Daniel brings home a doll from his workplace. Anya, who is a dollmaker, welcomes the doll happily to their house. They later learned that the doll belonged to a little girl named Uci, who died when she and her family were brutally murdered in a robbery. Strange things begin to happen.....', 'Anya and Daniel just moved to their new house in Bandung. Daniel brings home a doll from his workplace. Anya, who is a dollmaker, welcomes the doll happily to their house. They later learned that the doll belonged to a little girl named Uci, who died when she and her family were brutally murdered in a robbery. Strange things begin to happen.....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvbE67kjH7aeXKMTCdULIfw6U28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416497'),
  ('72988539396028093', 'The Doll Master', 2004, 'Horror', 'Jeong Yong-ki', 'Jeong Yong-ki', 'Lim Eun-kyung, Kim Yu-mi, Shim Hyung-tak, Ok Ji-young, Lim Hyung-jun, Lee Ka-yeong, Cheon Ho-jin', null, 'Five people are invited to a remote doll museum and one by one they are mysteriously killed. The survivors find out the truth: dolls have spirits, and they have come to settle scores.', 'Five people are invited to a remote doll museum and one by one they are mysteriously killed. The survivors find out the truth: dolls have spirits, and they have come to settle scores.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hayajVOmjk8LhqvYDHdQ7K5Ler2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56790'),
  ('314013375684195370', 'The Doll of Satan', 1969, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Ferruccio Casapinta, Francesco Attenni', 'Carlo M. Lori, Ferruccio Casapinta, Giorgio Cristallini', 'Erna Schürer, Roland Carey, Aurora Bautista, Ettore Ribotta, Lucia Bomez, Manlio Salvatori, Franco Daddi, Beverly Fuller', null, 'Following the death of her uncle, Elisabeth returns to her family''s castle for the reading of his will. She is informed of legends about the castle''s ghost and experiences erotically charged nightmares, before being kidnapped by a hooded figure and tortured in the dungeon. Meanwhile, her boyfriend Jack suspects a plot to gain Elisabeth''s inheritance and begins his own investigation...', 'Following the death of her uncle, Elisabeth returns to her family''s castle for the reading of his will. She is informed of legends about the castle''s ghost and experiences erotically charged nightmares, before being kidnapped by a hooded figure and tortured in the dungeon. Meanwhile, her boyfriend Jack suspects a plot to gain Elisabeth''s inheritance and begins his own investigation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MFJS2CTTXrenKClGTOtZ0vQMgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104944'),
  ('1040974745382336533', 'The Doll Squad', 1973, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Ted V. Mikels, Anthony Salinas', 'Pam Eddy, Jack Richesin, Ted V. Mikels', 'Michael Ansara, Francine York, Anthony Eisley, Lisa Todd, John Carter, Rafael Campos, Lillian Garrett-Groag, William Bagdad', 'PG', 'After a terrorist plot to sabotage a Cape Canaveral space mission is discovered, a squad of attractive and lethal spies have to locate the culprits. On their mission, they use a wide range of secret weapons.', 'After a terrorist plot to sabotage a Cape Canaveral space mission is discovered, a squad of attractive and lethal spies have to locate the culprits. On their mission, they use a wide range of secret weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NFwk6pa0vi20g4eMHcJHJLwcQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94752'),
  ('759941365768015087', 'The Dollars Are Coming!', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Mario Costa, Mario Tota, Raniero Mangione', 'Gigliola Falluto, Ruggero Maccari, Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Alberto Sordi, Isa Miranda, Nino Taranto, Mario Riva, Riccardo Billi, Rita Giannuzzi, Sergio Raimondi, Turi Pandolfini', null, 'A widow goes to Italy from South Africa to find out whether or not her late husband''s five nephews are worthy of his inheritance...', 'A widow goes to Italy from South Africa to find out whether or not her late husband''s five nephews are worthy of his inheritance...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KevwkavQLQnj0ZL90YwOq9V2Xk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62351'),
  ('145584314839413776', 'The Dollmaker', 1984, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Gary Daigler, Katterli Frauenfelder, Daniel Petrie', null, 'Jane Fonda, Levon Helm, Amanda Plummer, Susan Kingsley, Ann Hearn, Robert Swan, Geraldine Page, Jason Yearwood', 'PG-13', 'During World War II, hard-luck farmer Colvis Nevels leaves his rural Kentucky home to take a factory job in bustling Detroit. Reluctantly accompanying Colvis is his long-suffering wife, Gertie, a talented woodcarver set in her traditional ways. When the perils of city life and Colvis'' reckless squandering of money send the Nevels into precarious financial straits, Gertie starts a business making hand-carved dolls in order to provide for her family.', 'During World War II, hard-luck farmer Colvis Nevels leaves his rural Kentucky home to take a factory job in bustling Detroit. Reluctantly accompanying Colvis is his long-suffering wife, Gertie, a talented woodcarver set in her traditional ways. When the perils of city life and Colvis'' reckless squandering of money send the Nevels into precarious financial straits, Gertie starts a business making hand-carved dolls in order to provide for her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxtkWi3F2rUxex7ciVJUCPB8f1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63092'),
  ('564908786467635491', 'The Dolls', 1965, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Franco Rossi, Mauro Bolognini, Luigi Comencini', 'Tullio Pinelli, Luigi Magni, Leonardo Benvenuti', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Nino Manfredi, Elke Sommer, Jean Sorel, Monica Vitti, Virna Lisi, Akim Tamiroff, Alicia Brandet', null, 'This semi-amusing sex (romance) comedy has four separate stories: "The Telephone Call", written by Rodolfo Sonego, directed by Dino Risi. "A Treatise on Eugenics", written by Tullio Pinelli from a story by Luciano Salce and Steno, directed by Luigi Comencini. "The Soup", written by Rodolfo Sonego and Luigi Magni, directed by Franco Rossi. "Monsignor Cupid", written by Leo Benvenuti and Piero de Bernardi from a story by Boccaccio, directed by Mauro Bolognini.', 'This semi-amusing sex (romance) comedy has four separate stories: "The Telephone Call", written by Rodolfo Sonego, directed by Dino Risi. "A Treatise on Eugenics", written by Tullio Pinelli from a story by Luciano Salce and Steno, directed by Luigi Comencini. "The Soup", written by Rodolfo Sonego and Luigi Magni, directed by Franco Rossi. "Monsignor Cupid", written by Leo Benvenuti and Piero de Bernardi from a story by Boccaccio, directed by Mauro Bolognini.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4l9FbzslSvveJUpURgvPs1z0E4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81871'),
  ('952746035203158410', 'The Dolly Sisters', 1945, 'Romance, Music, Drama', 'Ernest Palmer, Irving Cummings', 'Marian Spitzer, John Francis Larkin', 'Betty Grable, John Payne, June Haver, S.Z. Sakall, Reginald Gardiner, Frank Latimore, Gene Sheldon, Sig Ruman', 'NR', 'Two sisters from Hungary become famous entertainers in the early 1900s. Fictionalized biography with lots of songs.', 'Two sisters from Hungary become famous entertainers in the early 1900s. Fictionalized biography with lots of songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30pEBwqwQiSHF16voYzU3A0C0tD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107973'),
  ('170537436880946148', 'The Dolphin', 1987, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Walter Lima Jr., Pedro Farkas', 'Affonso Romano de Santanna, Walter Lima Jr., Tairone Feitosa', 'Carlos Alberto Riccelli, Cássia Kis, Ney Latorraca, Dira Paes, Ruy Polanah, Paulo Vinícius, Rolando Boldrin, Tonico Pereira', null, 'According to an amazonian legend, every month, during the full moon, a brazilian fishing village receives a mysterious guest: the Dolphin, who transforms into a human to seduce and be loved by women and hated by men. One of her conquests is the daughter of a fisherman, who has a son with the Dolphin. He constantly reappears to seduce her, and even when she marries, he continues to look for her. This provokes the ire of the husband, who wants to kill him anyway.', 'According to an amazonian legend, every month, during the full moon, a brazilian fishing village receives a mysterious guest: the Dolphin, who transforms into a human to seduce and be loved by women and hated by men. One of her conquests is the daughter of a fisherman, who has a son with the Dolphin. He constantly reappears to seduce her, and even when she marries, he continues to look for her. This provokes the ire of the husband, who wants to kill him anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIQG9dcCZeNPZFpDWCIYQRh4cFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128147'),
  ('540846381785536372', 'The Dolphin: Story of a Dreamer', 2009, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Eduardo Schuldt', 'Sergio Bambaren', 'Robbie Daymond, Debra L. Repashy, Michael Ferreri, Steven Booth, Giovanni Ciccia, Bruno Ascenzo, Bruno Odar, Margarita León', 'PG', 'The amazing story of Daniel, a dolphin who abandons the safety of his pod to explore the ocean and discover the true purpose of his life.', 'The amazing story of Daniel, a dolphin who abandons the safety of his pod to explore the ocean and discover the true purpose of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sI5sGON9A6TCuEdlCkSmZwzQPbn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51800'),
  ('486375870978416153', 'The Dolphins', 1960, 'Drama', 'Francesco Maselli, Berto Pelosso, Ahmed Harzallah', 'Ennio De Concini, Francesco Maselli, Alberto Moravia', 'Claudia Cardinale, Gérard Blain, Betsy Blair, Anna Maria Ferrero, Sergio Fantoni, Tomas Milian, Enzo Garinei, Claudio Gora', null, 'An acid portrait of Italian youth at the time, I DELFINI follows a dreary season of discontent and viciousness in the lives of a thoroughly unpleasant group of mostly rich youngsters in a small Adriatic coast city.', 'An acid portrait of Italian youth at the time, I DELFINI follows a dreary season of discontent and viciousness in the lives of a thoroughly unpleasant group of mostly rich youngsters in a small Adriatic coast city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MvdH1XNX1tOLqS5oEFVBsHJLZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275098'),
  ('255487310588367042', 'The Domain', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Tiago Guedes, Ana Mariz, António Pinhão Botelho', 'Rui Cardoso Martins, Tiago Guedes', 'Albano Jerónimo, Sandra Faleiro, Miguel Borges, João Vicente, João Pedro Mamede, Ana Vilela da Costa, Rodrigo Tomás, Teresa Madruga', null, 'The chronicle of a Portuguese family that owns one of the largest estates in Europe, on the south bank of the River Tagus. The Domain delves deeply into the secrets of their homestead, portraying the historical, political, economic and social life of Portugal, since the 1940''s to these days.', 'The chronicle of a Portuguese family that owns one of the largest estates in Europe, on the south bank of the River Tagus. The Domain delves deeply into the secrets of their homestead, portraying the historical, political, economic and social life of Portugal, since the 1940''s to these days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHqhWgDnnOWKb4rY9bBVrrhOPVj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617776'),
  ('1052182691971534451', 'The Domain of the Moment', 1977, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Four films in contemplation upon those events which are so centered upon one moment that chronology seems almost obliterated or at least unimportant in remembrance.', 'Four films in contemplation upon those events which are so centered upon one moment that chronology seems almost obliterated or at least unimportant in remembrance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBbEGOu4id5nAupfRfV5xWBrCON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164592'),
  ('309166875262642582', 'The Domestics', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mike P. Nelson, Manuel Alberto Claro', 'Mike P. Nelson', 'Kate Bosworth, Tyler Hoechlin, Sonoya Mizuno, Lance Reddick, Kaden Washington Lewis, Jacinte Blankenship, Mikaela Kimani Armstrong, David Dastmalchian', 'R', 'A young husband and wife must fight to return home in a post-apocalyptic mid-western landscape ravaged by gangs.', 'A young husband and wife must fight to return home in a post-apocalyptic mid-western landscape ravaged by gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j64I3u1wwgPct3stvvKU2ikl14w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426814'),
  ('130020699869907509', 'The Dominici Affair', 1973, 'Crime, Drama', 'Claude Bernard-Aubert, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Louis-Émile Galey', 'Jean Gabin, Victor Lanoux, Max Amyl, Paul Crauchet, Gérard Depardieu, Henri Vilbert, Gérard Darrieu, Jean-Pierre Castaldi', null, 'In August 1952, a family of British tourists is found by the roadside in Haute Provence, brutally murdered. In the ensuing, very public, investigation a local landowner, 75 year old Gaston Dominici, is arrested for the murders, having been denounced by his sons. Under police interrogation, Dominici confesses to have killed the family and it looks certain that he will be charged, tried and sentenced to death. But then the case begins to collapse. The old man retracts his confession and the lack of evidence against him becomes apparent…', 'In August 1952, a family of British tourists is found by the roadside in Haute Provence, brutally murdered. In the ensuing, very public, investigation a local landowner, 75 year old Gaston Dominici, is arrested for the murders, having been denounced by his sons. Under police interrogation, Dominici confesses to have killed the family and it looks certain that he will be charged, tried and sentenced to death. But then the case begins to collapse. The old man retracts his confession and the lack of evidence against him becomes apparent…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXsqBWiBcdxaOvm1FQby0oohn2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74817'),
  ('56330417046093691', 'The Domino Principle', 1977, 'Thriller, Action', 'Stanley Kramer, Ernest Laszlo, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Adam Kennedy', 'Gene Hackman, Candice Bergen, Richard Widmark, Mickey Rooney, Edward Albert, Eli Wallach, Ken Swofford, Neva Patterson', 'R', 'Roy Tucker, a Vietnam war veteran with excellent shooting skills, is serving a long prison sentence when a mysterious visitor promises him that he will be released if he agrees to carry out a dangerous assignment.', 'Roy Tucker, a Vietnam war veteran with excellent shooting skills, is serving a long prison sentence when a mysterious visitor promises him that he will be released if he agrees to carry out a dangerous assignment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6weTBnv6tsFYpI5of123JSWQP5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32029'),
  ('933449361857368999', 'The Don Is Dead', 1973, 'Crime, Drama', 'Richard Fleischer, Richard H. Kline', 'Marvin H. Albert', 'Anthony Quinn, Frederic Forrest, Robert Forster, Al Lettieri, Angel Tompkins, Charles Cioffi, Jo Anne Meredith, Barry Russo', 'R', 'After his mistress is murdered, a Mafia leader goes after the killer with a bloody vengeance. Soon after the hunt begins, a gang war ensues.', 'After his mistress is murdered, a Mafia leader goes after the killer with a bloody vengeance. Soon after the hunt begins, a gang war ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXTi6BeRJr6B0t0VbeNipwEADK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94741'),
  ('259736370700735926', 'The Donner Party', 1992, 'Documentary, History', 'Ric Burns, Allen Moore, Buddy Squires', 'Ric Burns', 'David McCullough, J.D. Cannon, Timothy Hutton, Gene Jones, Amy Madigan, Donal McCann, George Plimpton, Paul Roebling', null, 'Doomed attempt to get to California in 1846. More than just a riveting tale of death, endurance and survival. The Donner Party''s nightmarish journey penetrated to the very heart of the American Dream at a crucial phase of the nation''s "manifest destiny." Touching some of the most powerful social, economic and political currents of the time, this extraordinary narrative remains one of the most compelling and enduring episodes to come out of the West.', 'Doomed attempt to get to California in 1846. More than just a riveting tale of death, endurance and survival. The Donner Party''s nightmarish journey penetrated to the very heart of the American Dream at a crucial phase of the nation''s "manifest destiny." Touching some of the most powerful social, economic and political currents of the time, this extraordinary narrative remains one of the most compelling and enduring episodes to come out of the West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCN9V1J5amR8Za9DpqIEteHVbKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253949'),
  ('775050544425920627', 'The Donor Party', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Thom Harp, Andrew Russo, Anthony J. Kraus', 'Thom Harp', 'Malin Åkerman, Jerry O''Connell, Rob Corddry, Erinn Hayes, Bria Samoné Henderson, Meadow Williams, Ryan Hansen, Patty Guggenheim', 'NR', 'Follows Jaclyn who really wants a baby, and realizes she doesn''t need a husband to be a mother after a messy divorce and wasted years of online dating, so she and her best friends create a plan to get her pregnant at a very special party.', 'Follows Jaclyn who really wants a baby, and realizes she doesn''t need a husband to be a mother after a messy divorce and wasted years of online dating, so she and her best friends create a plan to get her pregnant at a very special party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIdA8Q5sdR2GaoeNfUgh0P3yzSh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081683'),
  ('343482579313463344', 'The Doolins of Oklahoma', 1949, 'Western', 'Sam Nelson, Charles Lawton Jr., Gordon Douglas', 'Kenneth Gamet', 'Randolph Scott, George Macready, Louise Allbritton, John Ireland, Noah Beery Jr., Virginia Huston, Charles Kemper, Dona Drake', 'PG', 'When the Daltons are killed at Coffeyville, gang member Bill Doolin, arriving late, escapes but kills a man. Now wanted for murder, he becomes the leader of the Doolin gang. He eventually leaves the gang and tries to start a new life under a new name, but the old gang members appear and his true identity becomes known. Once again he becomes an outlaw trying to escape from the law.', 'When the Daltons are killed at Coffeyville, gang member Bill Doolin, arriving late, escapes but kills a man. Now wanted for murder, he becomes the leader of the Doolin gang. He eventually leaves the gang and tries to start a new life under a new name, but the old gang members appear and his true identity becomes known. Once again he becomes an outlaw trying to escape from the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umik8lJr8X8Id3twJwEdnLB1esg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130101'),
  ('163833476344743735', 'The Doom Generation', 1995, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Gregg Araki, Jim Fealy, Peter Bækkel', 'Gregg Araki', 'Rose McGowan, James Duval, Johnathon Schaech, Cress Williams, Dustin Nguyễn, Lauren Tewes, Margaret Cho, Christopher Knight', 'NR', 'Jordan White and Amy Blue, two troubled teens, pick up an adolescent drifter, Xavier Red. Together, the threesome embarks on a sex- and violence-filled journey through a United States of psychos and quickie marts.', 'Jordan White and Amy Blue, two troubled teens, pick up an adolescent drifter, Xavier Red. Together, the threesome embarks on a sex- and violence-filled journey through a United States of psychos and quickie marts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRzRj2UBvIH8ryWhu5PNL2PzV7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13552'),
  ('1131487952510161151', 'The Doomsday Cult of Antares de la Luz', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Santiago Correa', 'Valerie Schenkman', 'Florencia Berner, Jorge Herreros, Juan Estay, Gustavo Gaete, Isabel Soublette', null, 'Almost 10 years after being charged with a heinous crime, former members of a Chilean cult share their haunting experiences.', 'Almost 10 years after being charged with a heinous crime, former members of a Chilean cult share their haunting experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/st3VI4lNOTB4SPsqsk91TSYMEBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1279863'),
  ('994685837162880045', 'The Door', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Nina Shorina', null, 'Anatoliy Barantsev, Boris Novikov, Muza Krepkogorskaya, Ekaterina Gromova, Vladimir Mashchenko', null, 'The residents of a building have found novel ways to enter and exit as their front door is broken. However, once the door is repaired they continue to avoid the door.', 'The residents of a building have found novel ways to enter and exit as their front door is broken. However, once the door is repaired they continue to avoid the door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6VATVNQtNPsRIl6kPNIgUl4T1K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335038'),
  ('345127143078684153', 'The Door', 2009, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Anno Saul, Bella Halben', 'Akif Pirinçci', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Jessica Schwarz, Valeria Eisenbart, Heike Makatsch, Tim Seyfi, Thomas Thieme, Stefan Gebelhoff, Suzan Anbeh', null, 'A successful artist loses control of his life after his young daughter''s death. A chance for a new start appears, but all is not what it seems.', 'A successful artist loses control of his life after his young daughter''s death. A chance for a new start appears, but all is not what it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quSIt48GX1rp6AfOaHjeOHPohym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51365'),
  ('991006145219803487', 'The Door and the Butcher''s Wife', 1969, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Chano Urueta, Luis Alcoriza, Ismael Rodríguez', null, 'Ana Luisa Peluffo, Carlos Piñar, Armando Silvestre, Beatriz Baz, Hedi Blue, Luis Lomelí, Letícia Robles, July Furlong', null, 'A movie divided in two segments, the first "La puerta" (The Door) is about a high society gathering in which a door inside the mansion leads to a bizarre corridor where a naked and menacing human figure appears. The second "La mujer del carnicero" (The Butcher''s Wife) is set during the Mexican revolution and is about horrifying hallucinations felt by a lieutenant after committing a murder.', 'A movie divided in two segments, the first "La puerta" (The Door) is about a high society gathering in which a door inside the mansion leads to a bizarre corridor where a naked and menacing human figure appears. The second "La mujer del carnicero" (The Butcher''s Wife) is set during the Mexican revolution and is about horrifying hallucinations felt by a lieutenant after committing a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eX8jjCOTLmAWH9ILAEWCklorjEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340593'),
  ('106986409659140357', 'The Door in the Floor', 2004, 'Drama', 'Tod Williams, Terry Stacey', 'Tod Williams', 'Jeff Bridges, Kim Basinger, Jon Foster, Mimi Rogers, Elle Fanning, Bijou Phillips, Larry Pine, John Rothman', 'R', 'The lives of Ted and Marion Cole are thrown into disarray when their two adolescent sons die in a car wreck. Marion withdraws from Ted and Ruth, the couple''s daughter. Ted, a well-known writer, hires as his assistant a student named Eddie, who looks oddly similar to one of the Coles'' dead sons. The couple separate, and Marion begins an affair with Eddie, while Ted has a dalliance with his neighbor Evelyn.', 'The lives of Ted and Marion Cole are thrown into disarray when their two adolescent sons die in a car wreck. Marion withdraws from Ted and Ruth, the couple''s daughter. Ted, a well-known writer, hires as his assistant a student named Eddie, who looks oddly similar to one of the Coles'' dead sons. The couple separate, and Marion begins an affair with Eddie, while Ted has a dalliance with his neighbor Evelyn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2elMSIcQ9wDuFz1uzLU72AAKFOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1944'),
  ('388285723285925699', 'The Door into Summer', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Takahiro Miki, Mitsuru Komiyama', 'Tomoe Kanno', 'Kento Yamazaki, Kaya Kiyohara, Naohito Fujiki, Natsuna Watanabe, Hidekazu Mashima, Taizo Harada, Rin Takanashi, Kenta Hamano', null, 'A pioneering roboticist awakens in 2025 after decades in cryosleep. To change the past and reunite with his adopted sister, he seeks a way back to 1995.', 'A pioneering roboticist awakens in 2025 after decades in cryosleep. To change the past and reunite with his adopted sister, he seeks a way back to 1995.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n82h2wqgV5VjviHHWShBoOSBy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722798'),
  ('1005741259402756433', 'The Door Lock', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Orkenbek Baysenbay, Yizeng Liu', 'Orkenbek Baysenbay, Chen Zhuzhu, Zhao Haozhe', 'Bai Baihe, Adam Fan, Wang Zixuan, White-K, Marc Ma, Liu Huan, Liu Di, Lü Xiaolin', null, 'A woman living alone starts to feel uneasy when she discovers traces of a stranger having been in her home. Single and beautiful Fang Hui works alone in the big city. One night, she suddenly hears someone outside the door trying to break in, violently pulling the door. A security guard notices that the floors monitor are broken. This made Fang Hui''s peaceful life of living alone suddenly shrouded in the shadow of anxiety. When the night came again, sleeping Fang Hui vaguely notices that someone had entered her room... but she didn''t find any signs when she wakes up.', 'A woman living alone starts to feel uneasy when she discovers traces of a stranger having been in her home. Single and beautiful Fang Hui works alone in the big city. One night, she suddenly hears someone outside the door trying to break in, violently pulling the door. A security guard notices that the floors monitor are broken. This made Fang Hui''s peaceful life of living alone suddenly shrouded in the shadow of anxiety. When the night came again, sleeping Fang Hui vaguely notices that someone had entered her room... but she didn''t find any signs when she wakes up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kClXbkn1fzaQemrMzKxOJuG655W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878706'),
  ('839136403161375015', 'The Door with Seven Locks', 1940, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Norman Lee, Ernest Palmer, Alex Bryce', 'Gilbert Gunn, Norman Lee', 'Leslie Banks, Lilli Palmer, Cathleen Nesbitt, Gina Malo, David Horne, Romilly Lunge, Richard Bird, J.H. Roberts', null, 'A wealthy lord dies and is entombed with a valuable deposit of jewels. Seven keys are required to unlock the tomb and get hold of the treasure. A mad doctor uses an iron maiden to systematically eliminate the heirs to the fortune.', 'A wealthy lord dies and is entombed with a valuable deposit of jewels. Seven keys are required to unlock the tomb and get hold of the treasure. A mad doctor uses an iron maiden to systematically eliminate the heirs to the fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMR0ahTkPEmTAktEQPtOAPEMyNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46939'),
  ('533555180234933701', 'The Door with Seven Locks', 1962, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Alfred Vohrer, Karl Löb', 'Harald G. Petersson, Johannes Kai, Gerhard F. Hummel', 'Heinz Drache, Eddi Arent, Sabine Sesselmann, Pinkas Braun, Hans Nielsen, Gisela Uhlen, Werner Peters, Klaus Kinski', null, 'A rich man bequeaths seven keys to seven of his friends, but only one will unlock the door to untold wealth.', 'A rich man bequeaths seven keys to seven of his friends, but only one will unlock the door to untold wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1MnWc5ch7eXOKT5xJS4ZsbGJoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84937'),
  ('619755087454132233', 'The Door-to-Door Bookstore', 2024, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'The Chau Ngo, The Chau Ngo', 'Andi Rogenhagen', 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Yuna Bennett, Ronald Zehrfeld, Edin Hasanović, Hanna Hilsdorf, Maren Kroymann, Tristan Seith, Ruth Gilliam', null, 'Carl’s life runs like clockwork: every day, he goes door-to-door delivering books to a handful of loyal customers. He knows their preferences and takes pride in selecting the perfect story for each of them. But his well-ordered life is turned upside down by a cheerful nine-year-old girl, Schascha, who decides to join him on his daily book round. Schascha’s unique outlook on life helps Carl to come out of his shell and realise that his customers are so much more than just that to him. But when Carl unexpectedly loses his job, this vibrant community starts to fall apart - and it will take the power of books and all Schascha’s determination to bring them back together again.', 'Carl’s life runs like clockwork: every day, he goes door-to-door delivering books to a handful of loyal customers. He knows their preferences and takes pride in selecting the perfect story for each of them. But his well-ordered life is turned upside down by a cheerful nine-year-old girl, Schascha, who decides to join him on his daily book round. Schascha’s unique outlook on life helps Carl to come out of his shell and realise that his customers are so much more than just that to him. But when Carl unexpectedly loses his job, this vibrant community starts to fall apart - and it will take the power of books and all Schascha’s determination to bring them back together again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVtrx976wxF07YQX4CLc1CFUvV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214074'),
  ('1147401103414176013', 'The Doorman', 2020, 'Action, Thriller', 'Anca Butoi, Laurentiu Dinga, Ionut Sirbu', 'Devon Rose', 'Ruby Rose, Jean Reno, Aksel Hennie, Rupert Evans, Julian Feder, David Sakurai, Hideaki Ito, Philip Whitchurch', 'R', 'A former Marine turned doorman at a luxury New York City high-rise must outsmart and battle a group of art thieves and their ruthless leader — while struggling to protect her sister''s family. As the thieves become increasingly desperate and violent, the doorman calls upon her deadly fighting skills to end the showdown.', 'A former Marine turned doorman at a luxury New York City high-rise must outsmart and battle a group of art thieves and their ruthless leader — while struggling to protect her sister''s family. As the thieves become increasingly desperate and violent, the doorman calls upon her deadly fighting skills to end the showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pklyUbh4k1DbHdnsOMASyw7C6NH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737568'),
  ('580950815434322706', 'The Doorman', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Juarez Pavelak, Suzana Amancio, Paulo Fontenelle', 'Paulo Fontenelle', 'Alexandre Lino, Maurício Manfrini, Cacau Protásio, Daniela Fontan, Aline Campos, Bruno Ferrari, César Boaes, Heitor Martinez', null, 'Waldisney works as a doorman in a building where confusion is constant. However, the employee is great at maintaining a certain order. When wrongly accused of stealing something, he will need to prove that he is anything but a thief.', 'Waldisney works as a doorman in a building where confusion is constant. However, the employee is great at maintaining a certain order. When wrongly accused of stealing something, he will need to prove that he is anything but a thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lo9xcQevOdKhgDuUDrG0HTEQaQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151590'),
  ('907437411564521521', 'The Doors', 1991, 'Music, Drama, History', 'Oliver Stone, Robert Richardson, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Oliver Stone, Randall Jahnson', 'Val Kilmer, Meg Ryan, Kyle MacLachlan, Frank Whaley, Kevin Dillon, Michael Wincott, Michael Madsen, Josh Evans', 'R', 'The story of the famous and influential 1960s rock band and its lead singer and composer, Jim Morrison.', 'The story of the famous and influential 1960s rock band and its lead singer and composer, Jim Morrison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1LM3dzGuG6xOz0aT2e71o11vhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10537'),
  ('906972557089991177', 'The Doors: Feast of Friends', 1969, 'Documentary, Music', 'Paul Ferrara', 'Matt Friedman', 'Jim Morrison, Robby Krieger, Ray Manzarek, John Densmore, Pamela Courson', null, 'A cinematic look at The Doors on the road during their summer ''68 tour. Concert performances are intercut with fly-on-the-wall footage of the group in their natural habitat.', 'A cinematic look at The Doors on the road during their summer ''68 tour. Concert performances are intercut with fly-on-the-wall footage of the group in their natural habitat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ef5o54VYnnZd9f3ovfJbqvvJi16.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310985'),
  ('454452763844149223', 'The Doors: Live in Europe 1968', 1991, 'Music', 'Paul Justman, Ray Manzarek', 'Danny Sugerman, Stephanie Bennett', 'Jim Morrison, Robby Krieger, Ray Manzarek, John Densmore', null, 'Filmed during their 1968 European tour, The Doors are captured in performances in London, Stockholm, Frankfurt, and Amsterdam. Paul Kantner and Grace Slick of Jefferson Airplane, who shared the bill with The Doors on this tour, narrate this compilation.', 'Filmed during their 1968 European tour, The Doors are captured in performances in London, Stockholm, Frankfurt, and Amsterdam. Paul Kantner and Grace Slick of Jefferson Airplane, who shared the bill with The Doors on this tour, narrate this compilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAh6FM98hFFkHOIC4IHC4j1FmUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55716'),
  ('809535201975168046', 'The Doorway to Hell', 1930, 'Crime, Drama', 'Archie Mayo, Barney McGill, Erno Rapee', 'George Rosener', 'Lew Ayres, Dorothy Mathews, Leon Janney, Robert Elliott, James Cagney, Kenneth Thomson, Jerry Mandy, Noel Madison', 'NR', 'A vicious crime lord decides that he has had enough and much to the shock of his colleagues decides to give the business to his second in command and retire to Florida after marrying his moll. Unfortunately, he has no idea that she and the man are lovers.', 'A vicious crime lord decides that he has had enough and much to the shock of his colleagues decides to give the business to his second in command and retire to Florida after marrying his moll. Unfortunately, he has no idea that she and the man are lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZgIKq8CHrcy17Mdb4VMGMQNV3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26699'),
  ('323884380931961102', 'The Dope', 2003, 'Comedy', 'François Desagnat, Thomas Sorriaux, Vincent Mathias', 'Juliette Arnaud, François Desagnat, Guy Laurent', 'Michaël Youn, Vincent Desagnat, Zoé Félix, Kad Merad, Alex Descas, Ginette Garcin, Kool Shen, Lionel Abelanski', null, 'Alphonse Brown, who firmly believes he is the bastard son of James Brown, meets up with his best friend Scotch after Brown gets out of jail. On their way to Paris to begin careers as recording artists, the pair stumbles across a potent type of marijuana that was engineered by the Nazis. Their decision to begin selling the stuff leads to a variety of people chasing after them.', 'Alphonse Brown, who firmly believes he is the bastard son of James Brown, meets up with his best friend Scotch after Brown gets out of jail. On their way to Paris to begin careers as recording artists, the pair stumbles across a potent type of marijuana that was engineered by the Nazis. Their decision to begin selling the stuff leads to a variety of people chasing after them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glrZtjRcHQtZr19EFoaxGRhqwbQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49878'),
  ('1051947151714508263', 'The Dorm That Dripped Blood', 1982, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Stephen Carpenter, Jeffrey Obrow, Stephen Carpenter', 'Stephen Carpenter, Jeffrey Obrow, Stacey Giachino', 'Laurie Lapinski, Stephen Sachs, David Snow, Pamela Holland, Dennis Ely, Woody Roll, Daphne Zuniga, Jake Jones', 'R', 'A crazed killer stalks college students who gave up their vacation to clean a deserted dormitory.', 'A crazed killer stalks college students who gave up their vacation to clean a deserted dormitory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzZCWxroewVrcKPtz6Xi1x9SinU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54132'),
  ('737636397584628943', 'The Dose', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Martín Kraut, Gustavo Biazzi', 'Martín Kraut', 'Carlos Portaluppi, Ignacio Rogers, Lorena Vega, Germán de Silva, Alberto Suárez, Arturo Bonín, Ramiro Vayo, Maitina Di Marco', null, 'Marcos is an experienced nurse. He works in the night shift of a provincial private clinic. He is applied and professional but has a secret: in some extreme cases he applies euthanasia. He''ll soon meet someone that knows what he''s doing.', 'Marcos is an experienced nurse. He works in the night shift of a provincial private clinic. He is applied and professional but has a secret: in some extreme cases he applies euthanasia. He''ll soon meet someone that knows what he''s doing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZJnflaW1zMldvbRPixDeHiMCW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662345'),
  ('124565346288745745', 'The Dot and the Line: A Romance in Lower Mathematics', 1965, 'Animation, Family', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', 'Norton Juster', 'Robert Morley', 'NR', 'Animated work detailing the unrequited love that a line has for a dot, and the heartbreak that results due to the dot''s feelings for a lively squiggle.', 'Animated work detailing the unrequited love that a line has for a dot, and the heartbreak that results due to the dot''s feelings for a lively squiggle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2omBQEwNr1GrJkE4jeiqSHjSDdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84617'),
  ('988443245616599516', 'The Double', 1971, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Romolo Guerrieri, Cecilia Bigazzi, Carlo Carlini', 'Sandro Continenza, Sauro Scavolini', 'Ewa Aulin, Jean Sorel, Lucia Bosè, Silvano Tranquilli, Sergio Doria, Antonio Pierfederici, Bruno Boschetti, Giacomo Rossi Stuart', null, 'A man is shot in an underground car-park by a mysterious bearded man. As he dies he recollects the events that led him to this situation, including adulterous liaisons and jealous envy.', 'A man is shot in an underground car-park by a mysterious bearded man. As he dies he recollects the events that led him to this situation, including adulterous liaisons and jealous envy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMp9xeUNQsL7rVfYmZgXJWJLDyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85784'),
  ('325358201259563183', 'The Double', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Michael Brandt, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Paul Grinder', 'Derek Haas, Michael Brandt', 'Richard Gere, Topher Grace, Martin Sheen, Tamer Hassan, Stephen Moyer, Christopher Rodriguez Marquette, Odette Annable, Stana Katic', 'PG-13', 'The mysterious murder of a US senator bearing the distinctive trademark of the legendary Soviet assassin ''Cassius'', forces retired CIA operative, Paul Shepherson to team with rookie FBI agent, Ben Geary to solve the crime. Having spent his career chasing Cassius, Shepherdson is convinced his nemesis is long dead, but is pushed to take on the case by his former supervisor, Tom Highland. Geary, who wrote his Master''s thesis on Shepherdson''s pursuit of the Soviet killer, is certain that Cassius has resurfaced.', 'The mysterious murder of a US senator bearing the distinctive trademark of the legendary Soviet assassin ''Cassius'', forces retired CIA operative, Paul Shepherson to team with rookie FBI agent, Ben Geary to solve the crime. Having spent his career chasing Cassius, Shepherdson is convinced his nemesis is long dead, but is pushed to take on the case by his former supervisor, Tom Highland. Geary, who wrote his Master''s thesis on Shepherdson''s pursuit of the Soviet killer, is certain that Cassius has resurfaced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4W10sjJSDAWRUDn2Kb8DQKxiZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73499'),
  ('347281358172740023', 'The Double', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Richard Ayoade, Erik Wilson', 'Avi Korine, Richard Ayoade', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Mia Wasikowska, Wallace Shawn, Yasmin Paige, Noah Taylor, James Fox, Cathy Moriarty, Phyllis Somerville', 'R', 'An awkward office drone becomes increasingly unhinged after a charismatic and confident look-alike takes a job at his workplace and seduces the woman he desires.', 'An awkward office drone becomes increasingly unhinged after a charismatic and confident look-alike takes a job at his workplace and seduces the woman he desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kNcpmP1Pe9fWLKEbEOX5GEWueC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146015'),
  ('138191537870285263', 'The Double 0 Kid', 1992, 'Comedy, Action', 'Dee McLachlan, Adam Kane', 'Steven Paul', 'Corey Haim, Brigitte Nielsen, Wallace Shawn, Nicole Eggert, John Rhys-Davies, Karen Black, Seth Green, Anne Francis', 'PG-13', 'Teenage Lance dreams of being a secret agent when he''s suddenly in the middle of an hacker intrigue, which has its sights on an international environmental congress. Lance becomes in possession of a computer access card one of which the hackers are in urgent need of for their operation. Lance begins to play with the hackers, seeing his dream come true.', 'Teenage Lance dreams of being a secret agent when he''s suddenly in the middle of an hacker intrigue, which has its sights on an international environmental congress. Lance becomes in possession of a computer access card one of which the hackers are in urgent need of for their operation. Lance begins to play with the hackers, seeing his dream come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8oDIvqBWqIddOvLfKsmrzxYBzf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55325'),
  ('918832502121144519', 'The Double Hour', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Giuseppe Capotondi, Tat Radcliffe', 'Alessandro Fabbri, Ludovica Rampoldi, Stefano Sardo', 'Kseniya Rappoport, Filippo Timi, Antonia Truppo, Gaetano Bruno, Fausto Russo Alesi, Michele Di Mauro, Lorenzo Gioielli, Lidia Vitale', null, 'A chambermaid and a former cop meet at a speed dating event and a romance develops. But during a romantic getaway things suddenly take a turn for the worse when her mysterious past is revealed.', 'A chambermaid and a former cop meet at a speed dating event and a romance develops. But during a romantic getaway things suddenly take a turn for the worse when her mysterious past is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWDkXWafbvZ96FhhTp95fMYdmDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42571'),
  ('527847034136191892', 'The Double Life of Véronique', 1991, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Sławomir Idziak, Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Irène Jacob, Halina Gryglaszewska, Philippe Volter, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Kalina Jędrusik, Aleksander Bardini, Władysław Kowalski, Jerzy Gudejko', 'R', 'Véronique is a beautiful young French woman who aspires to be a renowned singer; Weronika lives in Poland, has a similar career goal and looks identical to Véronique, though the two are not related. The film follows both women as they contend with the ups and downs of their individual lives, with Véronique embarking on an unusual romance with Alexandre Fabbri, a puppeteer who may be able to help her with her existential issues.', 'Véronique is a beautiful young French woman who aspires to be a renowned singer; Weronika lives in Poland, has a similar career goal and looks identical to Véronique, though the two are not related. The film follows both women as they contend with the ups and downs of their individual lives, with Véronique embarking on an unusual romance with Alexandre Fabbri, a puppeteer who may be able to help her with her existential issues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqRyO9xrNBRaxqF9pCHHgLuaATx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1600'),
  ('615516283722620792', 'The Double Lottie', 1995, 'Family, Drama', 'Kiumars Pourahmad', 'Asghar Abdollahi, Kiumars Pourahmad', 'Khosro Shakibai, Afsaneh Bayegan, Parvindokht Yazdanian, Elahe Allahyari, Elham Allahyari, Ladan Tabatabaei, Parisa Goldoost', null, 'A young, inquisitive girl named Nargess encounters a girl from another school who could pass as her twin. Amazed by the strange coincidence, the two girls rush to their respective parents, but neither side has the time to hear them out. Nargess finds herself caught between her mother and father as she tries in vain to make herself heard, and when that fails, the two girls hatch a plan to swap places and see if their parents notice. While everything goes smoothly at first, it''s not long until they start encountering problems in this double-sided family drama.', 'A young, inquisitive girl named Nargess encounters a girl from another school who could pass as her twin. Amazed by the strange coincidence, the two girls rush to their respective parents, but neither side has the time to hear them out. Nargess finds herself caught between her mother and father as she tries in vain to make herself heard, and when that fails, the two girls hatch a plan to swap places and see if their parents notice. While everything goes smoothly at first, it''s not long until they start encountering problems in this double-sided family drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvudqIX0kM45CGPXQltfLVavQ18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392254'),
  ('146399798998451967', 'The Double Man', 1967, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Denys N. Coop, Franklin J. Schaffner, Robert Lennard', 'Frank Tarloff, Alfred Hayes', 'Yul Brynner, Britt Ekland, Clive Revill, Anton Diffring, Moira Lister, Lloyd Nolan, George Mikell, Brandon Brady', 'NR', 'In a complex piece of espionage the Russian secret service attempts to kidnap a high ranking officer in the CIA and replace him with a one of its own.', 'In a complex piece of espionage the Russian secret service attempts to kidnap a high ranking officer in the CIA and replace him with a one of its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2S35Net0RCwMKxwKeu3UQZ3yeHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105056'),
  ('113682850274678220', 'The Double McGuffin', 1979, 'Mystery', 'Joe Camp, Don Reddy', 'Joe Camp', 'Ernest Borgnine, George Kennedy, Elke Sommer, Lisa Whelchel, Vincent Spano, Lori Lively, Orson Welles, Ed Jones', 'PG', 'Some school kids stumble across a briefcase full of money, when they go back for it, they find a body instead. When they bring the police, neither is there, and the police refuses to believe them. Later they discover both were part of an assassination plot. Now they have to figure out how to stop the plot and put the bad guys in jail.', 'Some school kids stumble across a briefcase full of money, when they go back for it, they find a body instead. When they bring the police, neither is there, and the police refuses to believe them. Later they discover both were part of an assassination plot. Now they have to figure out how to stop the plot and put the bad guys in jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Abcx0t95RuCo4qETObrnPIjMBQt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79188'),
  ('639759522824792690', 'The Dove', 1968, 'Comedy', 'George Coe, Anthony Lover, Anthony Lover', 'Sidney Davis', 'David Zirlin, George Coe, Pamela Burrell, Peter Turgeon, Madeline Kahn, Tom Stone, Stan Rubinstein, Sidney Davis', null, 'De Düva is a 1968 Oscar-nominated American short film that parodies the films of Swedish director Ingmar Bergman, including Wild Strawberries and The Seventh Seal. The film borrows heavily from the plot lines of some of Bergman''s most famous films. The dialogue, seemingly in Swedish, is actually a Swedish-accented fictional language based on English, German, Latin, and Swedish, with most nouns ending in "ska." The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'De Düva is a 1968 Oscar-nominated American short film that parodies the films of Swedish director Ingmar Bergman, including Wild Strawberries and The Seventh Seal. The film borrows heavily from the plot lines of some of Bergman''s most famous films. The dialogue, seemingly in Swedish, is actually a Swedish-accented fictional language based on English, German, Latin, and Swedish, with most nouns ending in "ska." The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foO8P41bUt2p9C4PDFSdUOGTKLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148791'),
  ('127087304409367446', 'The Dove', 1974, 'Romance, Drama, Adventure', 'Sven Nykvist, Charles Jarrott', 'Peter S. Beagle, Adam Kennedy', 'Joseph Bottoms, Deborah Raffin, John McLiam, Dabney Coleman, John Anderson, Colby Chester, Ivor Barry, Setoki Ceinaturoga', 'PG', '16-year-old Robin Lee Graham aims to become the youngest person to sail around the world in a 23-foot sloop named "The Dove". On his journey, he meets and falls in love with Patti Ratteree, who is also traveling around the world. As Robin sails around the world to many beautiful locales, he grows from a boy to a man, finds himself, and finds the love of his life.', '16-year-old Robin Lee Graham aims to become the youngest person to sail around the world in a 23-foot sloop named "The Dove". On his journey, he meets and falls in love with Patti Ratteree, who is also traveling around the world. As Robin sails around the world to many beautiful locales, he grows from a boy to a man, finds himself, and finds the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EI2olzoUGhHUyAPM6YiQ8cdORB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184578'),
  ('823789539850349739', 'The Dove and the Wolf', 2019, 'Drama', 'Diego Tenorio, Carlos Lenin, Delia Luna', 'Carlos Lenin, Jorge Guerrero', 'Armando Hernández, Paloma Petra, Mónica del Carmen, Pablo Mendoza, Paloma Janeth Gómez López, Gabriela María Velarde Rocha, José Carlos Navarrete García, Rosa María Rojas Rodríguez', null, 'Displaced by the violence that swept their town, Paloma and Lobo survive trying to love each other. Through thirst, fear and nostalgia, Paloma wishes to go back home but Lobo lives tied to a memory that stops him from returning.', 'Displaced by the violence that swept their town, Paloma and Lobo survive trying to love each other. Through thirst, fear and nostalgia, Paloma wishes to go back home but Lobo lives tied to a memory that stops him from returning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fweF5bVlzwpXVEBMQj2NmEF4D4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616307'),
  ('1088822721188087438', 'The Dove''s Lost Necklace', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nacer Khemir, Georges Barsky', 'Nacer Khemir', 'Navin Chowdhry, Walid Arakji, Ninar Esber, Noureddine Kasbaoui, Jamil Joudi, Sonia Hochlaff, Chloé Réjon', null, 'The story revolves around Hassan, who is studying Arabic calligraphy from a grand master. Coming across a manuscript fragment, Hassan searches for the missing pieces, believing that once he finds them, he will learn the secrets of love.', 'The story revolves around Hassan, who is studying Arabic calligraphy from a grand master. Coming across a manuscript fragment, Hassan searches for the missing pieces, believing that once he finds them, he will learn the secrets of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87ymHmb1mkD60YXV2ZQAJGlUW0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50961'),
  ('763954552896121435', 'The Dover Boys at Pimento University or The Rivals of Roquefort Hall', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', 'Tedd Pierce', 'Mel Blanc, John McLeish, Tedd Pierce, Sara Berner', 'NR', 'Three fun-loving, morally upright brothers from Pimento University save their fiancée from their fiendish archenemy, Dan Backslide, in this spoof of the Rover Boys.', 'Three fun-loving, morally upright brothers from Pimento University save their fiancée from their fiendish archenemy, Dan Backslide, in this spoof of the Rover Boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNN7s5GA5rm2dQ8SYTMDCaui5yd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121171'),
  ('37706940786098665', 'The Down-in-the-Hole Gang', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Jean Tournier, Pierre Tchernia', 'René Goscinny, Pierre Tchernia', 'Michel Serrault, Philippe Noiret, Michel Galabru, Chantal Goya, Prudence Harrington, Charles Denner, Jean Carmet, Gérard Depardieu', null, 'Here we find a group of misfits who''ve given up on humanity and have decided to dwell below the pavement. The group has its own hierarchy, of course, and soon the conditions that drove them underground begin to manifest themselves without the influences of the Outside World.', 'Here we find a group of misfits who''ve given up on humanity and have decided to dwell below the pavement. The group has its own hierarchy, of course, and soon the conditions that drove them underground begin to manifest themselves without the influences of the Outside World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyQV7IOa8dBWyTZIX8MH0w6Q88k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4073'),
  ('127780351210657460', 'The Dracula Dynasty', 1980, 'Horror', 'Claudia Becker, Alfredo B. Crevenna, Xavier Cruz', 'Jorge Patiño', 'Fabián Aranza, Silvia Manríquez, Magda Guzmán, Rubén Rojo, Roberto Nelson, Erika Carlsson, Víctor Alcocer, José Nájera', null, 'In the 16th century, the Inquisition condemns Count Orloff, a vampire and sorcerer to death. In the 19th century, the vampire Madame Kostoff arrives in Mexico and buys the house where the vampire was buried and revives him.', 'In the 16th century, the Inquisition condemns Count Orloff, a vampire and sorcerer to death. In the 19th century, the vampire Madame Kostoff arrives in Mexico and buys the house where the vampire was buried and revives him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okG8ynNg6f6RLNczVwO8cYq6SsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29874'),
  ('825373207469090452', 'The Draft!', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Yusron Fuadi, Mandela Majid, Brillian Ravi', 'Yusron Fuadi, Anindita Suryarasmi, B.W. Purbanegara', 'Anastasia Herzigova, Winner Wijaya, Putri Anggie, Adhin Abdul Hakim, Ernanta Kusuma, Haydar Salishz, Hanung Bramantyo, Saka Gilap Asa', null, '5 student. An old villa. Old well. Forbidden room. Dark secret of the past. A seemingly omnipotent evil. Survival is the key. Let the battle of wits begins...', '5 student. An old villa. Old well. Forbidden room. Dark secret of the past. A seemingly omnipotent evil. Survival is the key. Let the battle of wits begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WEqtp38s1iW5VrcH78rOIi8a2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1066313'),
  ('772218281444271990', 'The Dragon Dentist', 2014, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Yoshimichi Kameda, Otaro Maijo, Kazuya Tsurumaki', 'Otaro Maijo', 'Koichi Yamadera, Megumi Hayashibara', null, 'A girl comes there to become a dentist of dragon. She is with other new freshman applicants, but there is no announcement from a senior as a guidance. They are confused and taken along with the senior. The only way is just to walk through freshman''s path, which is dark and strange. They do not know where they are. Not knowing what to do, she is approaching to the secret of dragon, but she does not realize yet. The adventure has already begun.', 'A girl comes there to become a dentist of dragon. She is with other new freshman applicants, but there is no announcement from a senior as a guidance. They are confused and taken along with the senior. The only way is just to walk through freshman''s path, which is dark and strange. They do not know where they are. Not knowing what to do, she is approaching to the secret of dragon, but she does not realize yet. The adventure has already begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OkDThEFDAHkMmZvSsYXQ9b1q2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367548'),
  ('126107688801498307', 'The Dragon from Russia', 1990, 'Action', 'Clarence Ford, Ray Wong Chi-Wai, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Ella Chan Bo-wa', 'Sam Hui, Maggie Cheung, Nina Li Chi, Carrie Ng Ka-Lai, Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Sun Xing, Dean Shek Tin, Richard Yuen Tak', null, 'A former member of a band of criminals known as the ''Eight-Hundred Dragons'' is living in fear in Manchuria as the clan does not allow people to leave alive. However, he is eventually tracked down, and kidnapped along with a young Manchurian, Yao - whose memory is erased so that he can be trained in martial arts. Yao''s work as an assassin becomes more complicated, however, when he sees his old lover again and his real memories come flooding back.', 'A former member of a band of criminals known as the ''Eight-Hundred Dragons'' is living in fear in Manchuria as the clan does not allow people to leave alive. However, he is eventually tracked down, and kidnapped along with a young Manchurian, Yao - whose memory is erased so that he can be trained in martial arts. Yao''s work as an assassin becomes more complicated, however, when he sees his old lover again and his real memories come flooding back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TNtBb01tFoMGwseL8cC4yLvUFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161611'),
  ('865748121664071428', 'The Dragon Lives Again', 1977, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy', 'Law Chi, Manny Hoh Ming', 'Ke Shek, Leung Wai', 'Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Shin Il-ryong, Tang Ching, Alexander Grand, Nick Cheung Lik, Fong Yau, Ka Wa, Wong Mei', null, 'Everyone''s favorite martial artist ""Bruce"" winds up fighting for his life and soul in hell against an evil Warlord intent on making him mincemeat - and he has recruited some of the 1970s most iconic B-movie characters to help dispatch the great one. But when that won''t do the trick, he uses monsters, mummies and beautiful women to get the little dragon at any cost.', 'Everyone''s favorite martial artist ""Bruce"" winds up fighting for his life and soul in hell against an evil Warlord intent on making him mincemeat - and he has recruited some of the 1970s most iconic B-movie characters to help dispatch the great one. But when that won''t do the trick, he uses monsters, mummies and beautiful women to get the little dragon at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEtx6bQv3UTk8SWTJCwX18AXBdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84275'),
  ('957198792409055402', 'The Dragon Maiden', 2016, 'Crime', 'Catalina Molina, Klemens Hufnagl', 'Stefan Hafner, Thomas Weingartner, Nikolaus Leytner', 'Manuel Rubey, Stefanie Reinsperger, Gerhard Greiner, Patricia Aulitzky, Eva Lanz, Harald Krassnitzer, Christine Ostermayer, Markus Hamele', null, 'The body of a teenage girl is found at the foot of a waterfall, a heart-shaped stone in her hand. The investigation leads the police on the trail of a local legend.', 'The body of a teenage girl is found at the foot of a waterfall, a heart-shaped stone in her hand. The investigation leads the police on the trail of a local legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ln4yXSDKRQEy1xByReRJoyDTk6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429555'),
  ('396077467800085892', 'The Dragon Missile', 1976, 'Action', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Cho Wai-Kei, Hung Ke', 'Ni Kuang', 'Lo Lieh, Tony Liu Tian-jue, Nancy Yen Nan-See, Ku Feng, Terry Lau Wai-Yue, Fan Mei-Sheng, Chiang Yang, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung', null, 'Lo Lieh stars as Sima Jun, a killer working for a corrupt lord whose orders are followed without question or hesitation. When the lord suffers from a life-threatening boil on his back, he is told by the Imperial doctor that an herb called "Longevity Rattan" offers the only cure and is grown in a remote village by an herbalist named Tan. Lo is sent on a mission to get the herb and bring it back before it''s too late.', 'Lo Lieh stars as Sima Jun, a killer working for a corrupt lord whose orders are followed without question or hesitation. When the lord suffers from a life-threatening boil on his back, he is told by the Imperial doctor that an herb called "Longevity Rattan" offers the only cure and is grown in a remote village by an herbalist named Tan. Lo is sent on a mission to get the herb and bring it back before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDNkPQPXArL3VNHVuN2ZXL4SafR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107828'),
  ('86904615812111128', 'The Dragon Murder Case', 1934, 'Mystery', 'H. Bruce Humberstone', 'Rian James', 'Warren William, Margaret Lindsay, Lyle Talbot, Eugene Pallette, Helen Lowell, Robert McWade, Robert Barrat, Dorothy Tree', 'NR', 'Wonderful idea to give a party with people who dislike each other. Late at night, everyone decides to go into the pool, except Stamm, who is drunk. Montague dives in as does Greeff and Leland, but only Greeff and Leland come out. Montague is no where to be found so Leland suspects foul play and calls the cops. Luckily, Philo is with the D.A. and comes along, but they do not find Montague. When they drain the pool the next day, they find nothing except what looks like dragon prints. Philo has his suspicions and tries to piece the clues together to find out what has happened.', 'Wonderful idea to give a party with people who dislike each other. Late at night, everyone decides to go into the pool, except Stamm, who is drunk. Montague dives in as does Greeff and Leland, but only Greeff and Leland come out. Montague is no where to be found so Leland suspects foul play and calls the cops. Luckily, Philo is with the D.A. and comes along, but they do not find Montague. When they drain the pool the next day, they find nothing except what looks like dragon prints. Philo has his suspicions and tries to piece the clues together to find out what has happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTuPo6R2d3KBtfHa1CLd0QWsgpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51565'),
  ('1064174526654314202', 'The Dragon Pearl', 2011, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Lanny Dong, Jacky Yeung, Bin Liao', 'Philip Dalkin', 'Sam Neill, Louis Corbett, Li Lin Jin, Ji Wang, Robert Mammone, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Chen Bao Yuan, Junkang Wang', null, 'Josh and Ling were expecting a boring vacation visiting each of their parents at an archaeological dig in China. But the new friends soon discover they''re right in the middle of an adventure when they find a Chinese Golden Dragon.', 'Josh and Ling were expecting a boring vacation visiting each of their parents at an archaeological dig in China. But the new friends soon discover they''re right in the middle of an adventure when they find a Chinese Golden Dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcTSD3eDxE5DCbB9O630VezdqPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59447'),
  ('867082109276103896', 'The Dragon Ring', 1994, 'Fantasy, Family, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Lamberto Bava, Romano Albani', 'Gianni Romoli', 'Anna Falchi, Sophie von Kessel, Stefania Sandrelli, Ute Christensen, Franco Nero, Joel Beeson, Billie Zöckler, Nikol Štíbrová', null, 'The Dragon Ring is an italian film of two parts. It''s about Desideria, the dragon king''s daughter and Selvaggia, her adopted and magical sister. To get the dragon ring after the death of her father, Desideria needs to marry, but she can''t find a husband, so Selvaggia sees her chance to get the ring with all its powers.', 'The Dragon Ring is an italian film of two parts. It''s about Desideria, the dragon king''s daughter and Selvaggia, her adopted and magical sister. To get the dragon ring after the death of her father, Desideria needs to marry, but she can''t find a husband, so Selvaggia sees her chance to get the ring with all its powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXHXNOoFlLgXMOXBz7r8fCZCBXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87689'),
  ('373815877330579234', 'The Dragon That Wasn''t (Or Was He?)', 1983, 'Animation', 'Harrie Geelen, Bjørn Frank Jensen, Bob Maxfield', 'Bert Kroon, Harrie Geelen, Bjørn Frank Jensen', 'Fred Benavente, Maya Bouma, Fred Emmer, Harrie Geelen, Trudy Libosan, Luc Lutz, Lo van Hensbergen, Joan Remmelts', null, 'Oliver B. Bumble finds an egg that, it turns out, has a cute little dragon in it. However, this dragon grows huge each time it gets excited or upset. As this causes a lot of problems, Bumble has to face a difficult dilemma.', 'Oliver B. Bumble finds an egg that, it turns out, has a cute little dragon in it. However, this dragon grows huge each time it gets excited or upset. As this causes a lot of problems, Bumble has to face a difficult dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fauu3Ve7BeBk614Jrshi9AneBMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21375'),
  ('136337981293952114', 'The Drama', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Kristoffer Borgli, Arseni Khachaturan, Ben Kahn', 'Kristoffer Borgli', 'Robert Pattinson, Zendaya, Alana Haim, Mamoudou Athie, Jordyn Curet, Hailey Benton Gates, Zoë Winters, Hannah Gross', 'R', 'A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.', 'A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1325734'),
  ('37009610614002987', 'The Draughtsman''s Contract', 1982, 'History, Mystery, Comedy', 'Peter Greenaway, Curtis Clark, Andy Powell', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Anthony Higgins, Janet Suzman, Dave Hill, Anne-Louise Lambert, Hugh Fraser, Neil Cunningham, David Meyer, Tony Meyer', 'R', 'R. Neville, a brash young draftsman, is hired to make a dozen landscape illustrations at the estate of Mr Herbert and his wife Virginia. Aside from monetary compensation, the arrangement includes a sexual liaison offered to Neville by Virginia while her estranged husband is away. But when the murdered body of Mr Herbert is discovered at the estate, mysterious clues found in Neville''s drawings point to the identity of the killer.', 'R. Neville, a brash young draftsman, is hired to make a dozen landscape illustrations at the estate of Mr Herbert and his wife Virginia. Aside from monetary compensation, the arrangement includes a sexual liaison offered to Neville by Virginia while her estranged husband is away. But when the murdered body of Mr Herbert is discovered at the estate, mysterious clues found in Neville''s drawings point to the identity of the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljeTWR2kowGXijMc8LMuy72ULM3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10831'),
  ('911580403895295449', 'The Drawing Lesson', 1903, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'In a corner of the garden we see an ornamental fountain. An old professor comes along, looking for a nice spot where he can teach his pupils. Finding the fountain to his liking he goes after his scholars. A mysterious person who has noticed the old man, by means of a balloon, a handkerchief and a coat, constructs a peculiar figure, doing a lot of tricks at the same time.', 'In a corner of the garden we see an ornamental fountain. An old professor comes along, looking for a nice spot where he can teach his pupils. Finding the fountain to his liking he goes after his scholars. A mysterious person who has noticed the old man, by means of a balloon, a handkerchief and a coat, constructs a peculiar figure, doing a lot of tricks at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9aXXl6IVnuoc9QQSb8XfceWKOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195954'),
  ('89506067087180852', 'The Drawn Together Movie: The Movie!', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', 'Greg Franklin, Mac Whiting', 'Dave Jeser, Matthew Silverstein', 'Adam Carolla, Abbey DiGregorio, Jess Harnell, Seth MacFarlane, Jack Plotnick, Tara Strong, Cree Summer, James Arnold Taylor', 'NR', 'When the mystery-solving musician Foxxy Love notices she and her fellow housemates can curse without being bleeped—something they''ve never been able to do before—she realizes their show has been canceled. Determined to get back on the air, the gang travels to Make-A-Point-Land in order to get a point (and get back on the air).', 'When the mystery-solving musician Foxxy Love notices she and her fellow housemates can curse without being bleeped—something they''ve never been able to do before—she realizes their show has been canceled. Determined to get back on the air, the gang travels to Make-A-Point-Land in order to get a point (and get back on the air).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVP2vh0HaJH6rhJc2I4rKmYgjed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36736'),
  ('1108398274882315465', 'The Dreadful', 2026, 'Horror', 'Natasha Kermani, Julia Swain', 'Natasha Kermani, Kaneto Shindō', 'Sophie Turner, Kit Harington, Marcia Gay Harden, Laurence O''Fuarain, Jonathan Howard, Catherine McDonough, Zachary Cohen, Isidro-Lucking Dylan', 'R', 'In medieval England, Anne and her domineering mother-in-law Morwen struggle to survive on the outskirts of society. But when a man from Anne''s past returns from war, a curse begins to take shape through a mysterious knight and threatens to destroy them all.', 'In medieval England, Anne and her domineering mother-in-law Morwen struggle to survive on the outskirts of society. But when a man from Anne''s past returns from war, a curse begins to take shape through a mysterious knight and threatens to destroy them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhhJkYau8nQMFgauvOudDjwj9vA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242937'),
  ('903104279410246269', 'The Dream Catcher', 1999, 'Drama', 'Terry Stacey, Ed Radtke', 'Ed Radtke, M.S. Nieson', 'Maurice Compte, Paddy Connor, Jeanne Heaton, Patrick Shining Elk, Larry John Meyers, David Reece, Joseph Arthur', null, 'An abandoned teen jumps a freight train in Philadelphia intent on reaching his uncle in Indiana, whom he believes will help him with financial difficulties including a pregnant girlfriend. In Ohio, he meets another homeless teen, who escorts him to his uncle. Finding his uncle equally broke, the duo head on to Oklahoma City to try to find the first teen''s long-gone ex-con father. A confrontation between father and son send the duo on into exploits in the west including getting beaten up, busting into an Indian reservation church, and hitch-hiking with a beautiful nurse.', 'An abandoned teen jumps a freight train in Philadelphia intent on reaching his uncle in Indiana, whom he believes will help him with financial difficulties including a pregnant girlfriend. In Ohio, he meets another homeless teen, who escorts him to his uncle. Finding his uncle equally broke, the duo head on to Oklahoma City to try to find the first teen''s long-gone ex-con father. A confrontation between father and son send the duo on into exploits in the west including getting beaten up, busting into an Indian reservation church, and hitch-hiking with a beautiful nurse.', null, 'tmdb:movie:6182'),
  ('181918913100327840', 'The Dream Factory', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Feng Xiaogang', 'Wang Gang', 'Ge You, Liu Bei, He Bing, Feng Xiaogang, Ying Da, Xu Fan, Yang Lixin, Li Qi', null, 'Four friends come up with an unusual idea to make some money and have fun doing it. For a small fee, they will impersonate and act out any character role for their customers. In the course of executing this novel service, they encounter a whole spectrum of people in society, finding ways to genuinely help them boost their morale and overcome their fears, while gaining unusual and new insights into the human condition.', 'Four friends come up with an unusual idea to make some money and have fun doing it. For a small fee, they will impersonate and act out any character role for their customers. In the course of executing this novel service, they encounter a whole spectrum of people in society, finding ways to genuinely help them boost their morale and overcome their fears, while gaining unusual and new insights into the human condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sezBfVtCtanUjwoodc0udW0dro4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79279'),
  ('518993267270992395', 'The Dream House', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Peter Dalle, Kerstin Sundberg, Esa Vuorinen', 'Peter Dalle, Bengt Palmers', 'Björn Skifs, Suzanne Reuter, Zara Zetterqvist, Mikael Håck, Lena Nyman, Pierre Lindstedt, Jan Malmsjö, Claes Månsson', null, 'Göran buys a house in a suburb. It is in need of some repairs, but Göran believes himself capable of repairing it himself with the help of some cheap craftsmen. However, the house is much worse than he thought. At the same time, a gang of crooks is searching for the dynamite they hid in the basement some time ago. Göran has to rescue both his wallet from greedy craftsmen as well as his marriage with Tina.', 'Göran buys a house in a suburb. It is in need of some repairs, but Göran believes himself capable of repairing it himself with the help of some cheap craftsmen. However, the house is much worse than he thought. At the same time, a gang of crooks is searching for the dynamite they hid in the basement some time ago. Göran has to rescue both his wallet from greedy craftsmen as well as his marriage with Tina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ac0GmgAdDQbqYutASvApA1ycpGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39749'),
  ('930041527950018766', 'The Dream Is Alive', 1985, 'Documentary', 'Graeme Ferguson, James Neihouse', 'Toni Myers', 'Walter Cronkite, David Leestma, George Nelson, Sally Ride, Kathy Sullivan, James Van Hoften', 'NR', 'The Dream Is Alive takes you into space alongside the astronauts on the space shuttle. Share with them the delights of zero gravity while working, eating and sleeping in orbit around the Earth. Float as never before over the towering Andes, the boot of Italy, Egypt and the Nile. Witness firsthand a tension-filled satellite capture and repair and the historic first spacewalk by an American woman.', 'The Dream Is Alive takes you into space alongside the astronauts on the space shuttle. Share with them the delights of zero gravity while working, eating and sleeping in orbit around the Earth. Float as never before over the towering Andes, the boot of Italy, Egypt and the Nile. Witness firsthand a tension-filled satellite capture and repair and the historic first spacewalk by an American woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77Lq53P1Fy7OtGCnQAAGxhmKvoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25568'),
  ('395055766947608828', 'The Dream of a Ridiculous Man', 1992, 'Animation, Drama', 'Aleksandr Petrov, Sergey Reshetnikov, Viktor Gerrat', 'Aleksandr Petrov', 'Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy', null, 'An animated short film based on the 1877 short story written by Fyodor Dostoyevsky. It chronicles the experiences of a man who decides that there is nothing to live for in the world, and is therefore determined to commit suicide. A chance encounter with a young girl changes his mind.', 'An animated short film based on the 1877 short story written by Fyodor Dostoyevsky. It chronicles the experiences of a man who decides that there is nothing to live for in the world, and is therefore determined to commit suicide. A chance encounter with a young girl changes his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6f7ufGatqyjbJwaLLo2qs3zhk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119855'),
  ('278875219961037012', 'The Dream of an Opium Fiend', 1908, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'The opium fiend is seen in a den, puffing on this terrible narcotic. He then falls fast asleep and dreams that he is at home with his wife. He asks for something to drink and he is given wine, which he does not care for, and he is finally given some bottled beer and a glass, but he complains that the glass is too small and he gets a very large sized glass receptacle, into which his wife and maid servant pour the contents of the bottle. As he is about to drink the glass passes from his hand mysteriously, sailing through the room and out of the window to the moon…', 'The opium fiend is seen in a den, puffing on this terrible narcotic. He then falls fast asleep and dreams that he is at home with his wife. He asks for something to drink and he is given wine, which he does not care for, and he is finally given some bottled beer and a glass, but he complains that the glass is too small and he gets a very large sized glass receptacle, into which his wife and maid servant pour the contents of the bottle. As he is about to drink the glass passes from his hand mysteriously, sailing through the room and out of the window to the moon…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eld6C6Fg6dNTNoXFAXBjJSHQKxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196605'),
  ('106063520751373451', 'The Dream of Ivan', 2011, 'Family, Comedy', 'Roberto Santiago, Angie Paul Risque', 'Roberto Santiago, Pablo Fernández Vázquez', 'Óscar Casas, Demián Bichir, Antonio Resines, Fernando Tejero, Ana Claudia Talancón, Carla Campra, Sebastián Rivera, David M. Antón', null, 'In "The Dream of Ivan" we will see for the first time in history a worldwide selection of soccer stars, a team that brings millions of people watching television, playing against a worldwide selection of ... children! Why? To raise funds to help victims of a terrible earthquake in Africa. This happens many times: that professional teams, or football stars, organize charity matches. What had never happened before is that the game is played by children. The proposal has been an initiative of UNICEF and FIFA.', 'In "The Dream of Ivan" we will see for the first time in history a worldwide selection of soccer stars, a team that brings millions of people watching television, playing against a worldwide selection of ... children! Why? To raise funds to help victims of a terrible earthquake in Africa. This happens many times: that professional teams, or football stars, organize charity matches. What had never happened before is that the game is played by children. The proposal has been an initiative of UNICEF and FIFA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7tZwM1TYkR1kmyl2qqtsmknkpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79752'),
  ('452659598366390646', 'The Dream of Lu', 2012, 'Drama, Family', 'Hari Sama, Emiliano Villanueva', null, 'Úrsula Pruneda, Hari Sama, Emilio Echevarría, María del Carmen Farias, Gerardo Trejoluna', null, 'Lucia must find new meaning in her life in order to move forward after a suicide attempt.Dealing with her grief over the death of her son,she establishes new ties and notices small miracles.An encounter and unexpected journey open up the space for her to understand that she can continue to live and to discover that eternity resides in a single instant.', 'Lucia must find new meaning in her life in order to move forward after a suicide attempt.Dealing with her grief over the death of her son,she establishes new ties and notices small miracles.An encounter and unexpected journey open up the space for her to understand that she can continue to live and to discover that eternity resides in a single instant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKWrGY8uPYK96UeG0zHjkBxwhab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167580'),
  ('320505098030591980', 'The Dream of Russia', 1992, 'Drama, History', 'Mutsuo Naganuma, Junya Satō', 'Tatsuo Nogami, Junya Satō, Fumio Kōnami', 'Ken Ogata, Toshiyuki Nishida, Takuzō Kawatani, Noboru Mitani, Hiroyuki Okita, Nozomibun Yoneyama, Tohru Emori, Marina Vlady', null, 'Sumptuous filming of the journey of a shipwrecked Japanese expedition from the Pacific Ocean across Siberia to the court of Catherine the Great of Russia. A Russo-Japanese co-production of a unique event in history which was the hit of Cannes and other film festivals but did not receive wide distribution despite its huge scope, high production values, and very human story of culture clash.', 'Sumptuous filming of the journey of a shipwrecked Japanese expedition from the Pacific Ocean across Siberia to the court of Catherine the Great of Russia. A Russo-Japanese co-production of a unique event in history which was the hit of Cannes and other film festivals but did not receive wide distribution despite its huge scope, high production values, and very human story of culture clash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agwm0m2P4WdTUiQf2aPU6Sam0zz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327756'),
  ('994711315624037602', 'The Dream of the Red Chamber', 1977, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Li Han-Hsiang, Lam Wah-Chiu', 'Li Han-Hsiang', 'Brigitte Lin, Sylvia Chang, Michelle Yim, Deborah Lee, Wang Lai, Ou-Yang Sha-Fei, Elliot Ngok Wah, Nau Nau', null, 'Pao-yu is in love with his cousin, Lin Tai-yu, but his family has other marital plans for him that will leave both broken-hearted.', 'Pao-yu is in love with his cousin, Lin Tai-yu, but his family has other marital plans for him that will leave both broken-hearted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8o5toTLgqUM7bngvpbnghYJSNo9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66016'),
  ('851620839661545651', 'The Dream Team', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Howard Zieff, Adam Holender', 'David Loucka, Jon Connolly', 'Michael Keaton, Christopher Lloyd, Peter Boyle, Stephen Furst, Dennis Boutsikaris, Lorraine Bracco, Milo O''Shea, Philip Bosco', 'PG-13', 'Four mental patients on a field trip in New York City must save their caring chaperone, who ends up being taken to a hospital in a coma after accidentally witnessing a murder, before the killers can find him and finish the job.', 'Four mental patients on a field trip in New York City must save their caring chaperone, who ends up being taken to a hospital in a coma after accidentally witnessing a murder, before the killers can find him and finish the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBVjTP8Cb66GBabUBQaBUtV6OqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14550'),
  ('206989316693327458', 'The Dream Team', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Olivier Dahan, Alex Lamarque', 'Marc de Chauveron, Philippe de Chauveron', 'José Garcia, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Franck Dubosc, Gad Elmaleh, JoeyStarr, Ramzy Bedia, Omar Sy, Sami Ameziane', null, 'A former footballer living in Brittany enlists his old teammates to help the local fisherman to win some games in order to raise money and save jobs.', 'A former footballer living in Brittany enlists his old teammates to help the local fisherman to win some games in order to raise money and save jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQ0tNcw1WYUh8WlzbeFsd8By90C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133469'),
  ('125726836302846927', 'The Dreamed Ones', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Ruth Beckermann, Johannes Hammel', 'Ruth Beckermann, Ina Hartwig', 'Anja Plaschg, Laurence Rupp', null, 'It’s not uncommon for a film to have a moving love story at its core. Yet this particular set-up is unusual. The lovers here are Ingeborg Bachmann and Paul Celan, both important representatives of post-war German-language poetry. The story of the relationship between the Austrian and the Jew from Czernowitz is told through their nearly 20-year correspondence (1948–1967). Or, more precisely, by a young woman and a young man reading from their letters in a studio in Vienna’s venerable Funkhaus.', 'It’s not uncommon for a film to have a moving love story at its core. Yet this particular set-up is unusual. The lovers here are Ingeborg Bachmann and Paul Celan, both important representatives of post-war German-language poetry. The story of the relationship between the Austrian and the Jew from Czernowitz is told through their nearly 20-year correspondence (1948–1967). Or, more precisely, by a young woman and a young man reading from their letters in a studio in Vienna’s venerable Funkhaus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSJaZIZruK8ppDcUHMJ5UgrkUnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383254'),
  ('454295889263955979', 'The Dreamed Path', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kerstin Liwayway Rexrodt, Stefan Nickel, Angela Schanelec', 'Angela Schanelec', 'Miriam Jakob, Thorbjörn Björnsson, Maren Eggert, Phil Hayes, Anaïa Zapp, Petra Trenkel, Benjamin Hassmann, Michel Drobnik', null, 'Theres and Kenneth are both young when they first meet whilst on holiday. They fall in love but are unable to prevent themselves from losing each other. Thirty years later, in another country, another couple: Ariane leaves her husband David because she no longer loves him. The paths they both take lead them to Kenneth and Theres.', 'Theres and Kenneth are both young when they first meet whilst on holiday. They fall in love but are unable to prevent themselves from losing each other. Thirty years later, in another country, another couple: Ariane leaves her husband David because she no longer loves him. The paths they both take lead them to Kenneth and Theres.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haUbo6nPIPApVkihMfVyQnpGoAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376312'),
  ('843989589489876474', 'The Dreamer', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anaïs Tellenne, Fanny Mazoyer, Lola Resch', 'Anaïs Tellenne', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Raphaël Thiéry, Marie-Christine Orry, Mireille Pitot, Cesare Capitani, Alexis Louis Lucas, Vincent Thomas, Zoran Boukherma', null, 'With his one-eyed eye, his imposing build and his almost sixty years of age, Raphael knows that he scares people. He lives with his mother in a pavilion located on the vast estate of the manor of which he is the guardian. Since the owners died, he leads a quiet existence. Everything changes the night when the heiress, Garance, returns to the family home.', 'With his one-eyed eye, his imposing build and his almost sixty years of age, Raphael knows that he scares people. He lives with his mother in a pavilion located on the vast estate of the manor of which he is the guardian. Since the owners died, he leads a quiet existence. Everything changes the night when the heiress, Garance, returns to the family home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysQrpBVpCgaqxlLk285j6rPj6fu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962318'),
  ('1054646339575893979', 'The Dreamlife of Angels', 1998, 'Drama', 'Erick Zonca, Agnès Godard, Dominique Le Rigoleur', 'Erick Zonca, Pierre Chosson, Roger Bohbot', 'Élodie Bouchez, Natacha Régnier, Grégoire Colin, Patrick Mercado, Jo Prestia, Francine Massenhave, Zivko Niklevski, Murielle Colvez', 'R', 'Isa and Marie bond while working in a French sweatshop and soon begin sharing an apartment that Marie is watching for a hospitalized mother and daughter. Marie, hoping to avoid a life of struggle and poverty, takes up with Chriss, a nightclub owner whose most attractive asset is his money. Isa recognizes the ultimate futility of the relationship and tries to keep Marie away from him, but her interference puts their friendship at risk.', 'Isa and Marie bond while working in a French sweatshop and soon begin sharing an apartment that Marie is watching for a hospitalized mother and daughter. Marie, hoping to avoid a life of struggle and poverty, takes up with Chriss, a nightclub owner whose most attractive asset is his money. Isa recognizes the ultimate futility of the relationship and tries to keep Marie away from him, but her interference puts their friendship at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yxr5KJHJk5aPCbapJaBS8Znx8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9840'),
  ('1048033431839380415', 'The Dreamseller', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jayme Monjardim, Nonato Estrela', 'L.G. Bayão', 'César Troncoso, Dan Stulbach, Thiago Mendonça, Leonardo Medeiros, Guilherme Prates, Kaik Pereira, Malu Valle, Nelson Baskerville', null, 'A disillusioned psychologist tries to commit suicide until he strikes up a friendship with an unlikely saviour who teaches him a new way of living.', 'A disillusioned psychologist tries to commit suicide until he strikes up a friendship with an unlikely saviour who teaches him a new way of living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cALiAXQG6QlnK99yPpbZH6n5Jk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418896'),
  ('1040332689586496278', 'The Dresden Sun', 2026, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Crime', 'Michael Ryan', 'Michael Ryan', 'Christina Ricci, Mena Suvari, Linus Roache, Steven Ogg, Leigh McCloskey', 'PG-13', 'A mercenary''s heist of "the sphere" from Peredor Corp goes wrong. C and Earth Corp chase otherworldly tech for a science project. A financial analyst flees deadly rivals amid corporate espionage.', 'A mercenary''s heist of "the sphere" from Peredor Corp goes wrong. C and Earth Corp chase otherworldly tech for a science project. A financial analyst flees deadly rivals amid corporate espionage.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fgracenote%2F44834491a20797421d4d425bc02ce3cd.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-dresden-sun'),
  ('757849686040456740', 'The Dress', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alex van Warmerdam, Marc Felperlaan', 'Alex van Warmerdam', 'Henri Garcin, Ingeborg Elzevier, Ricky Koole, Ariane Schluter, Khaldoun Elmecky, Margo Dames, Frans Vorstman, Peter Blok', null, 'The story of a summer dress and those who have to do with it, especially the train conductor (played by van Warmerdam, the director). The dress functions as catalyst for the whimsical events, which turns out to be either tragic or hilarious.', 'The story of a summer dress and those who have to do with it, especially the train conductor (played by van Warmerdam, the director). The dress functions as catalyst for the whimsical events, which turns out to be either tragic or hilarious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmAQ4eXd5GCvYFrmoI0fKLr1zuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5900'),
  ('876275401214609178', 'The Dress', 2020, 'Drama', 'Konrad Bloch, Tadeusz Łysiak', 'Tadeusz Łysiak', 'Anna Dzieduszycka, Dorota Pomykała, Szymon Piotr Warszawski, Andrzej Glazer, Lea Oleksiak, Michalina Robakiewicz, Maciej Robakiewicz, Ryszard Parol', 'R', 'A woman with limited hopes due to dwarfism toils in a rundown motel in rural Poland, as a maid. Will the repeated visits of an interesting man, a truck driver, change the loneliness of her situation?', 'A woman with limited hopes due to dwarfism toils in a rundown motel in rural Poland, as a maid. Will the repeated visits of an interesting man, a truck driver, change the loneliness of her situation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUrGOlSjAQps5w25H8uUwkKR6hV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737496'),
  ('827570036784349677', 'The Dresser', 1983, 'Drama', 'Peter Yates, Kelvin Pike', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Albert Finney, Tom Courtenay, Edward Fox, Zena Walker, Eileen Atkins, Michael Gough, Cathryn Harrison, Betty Marsden', 'PG', 'In a touring Shakespearean theater group, a backstage hand - the dresser - is devoted to the brilliant but tyrannical head of the company. He struggles to support the deteriorating star as the company struggles to carry on during the London Blitz. The pathos of his backstage efforts rival the pathos in the story of Lear and the Fool that is being presented on-stage, as the situation comes to a crisis.', 'In a touring Shakespearean theater group, a backstage hand - the dresser - is devoted to the brilliant but tyrannical head of the company. He struggles to support the deteriorating star as the company struggles to carry on during the London Blitz. The pathos of his backstage efforts rival the pathos in the story of Lear and the Fool that is being presented on-stage, as the situation comes to a crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPIeNAwdN2Ds77Bf7bfZAmDrzoh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42122'),
  ('297488308645348675', 'The Dresser', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Richard Eyre, Ben Smithard', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Ian McKellen, Anthony Hopkins, Emily Watson, Vanessa Kirby, Sarah Lancashire, Edward Fox, Tom Brooke, Matthew Cottle', 'R', 'One fateful night in a small English regional theatre during World War II a troupe of touring actors stage a production of Shakespeares King Lear. Bombs are falling, sirens are wailing, the curtain is up in an hour but the actor/manager Sir who is playing Lear is nowhere to be seen. His dresser Norman must scramble to keep the production alive but will Sir turn up in time and if he does will he be able to perform that night? The Dresser is a wickedly funny and deeply moving story of friendship and loyalty as Sir reflects on his lifelong accomplishments and seeks to reconcile his turbulent friendships with those in his employ before the final curtain.', 'One fateful night in a small English regional theatre during World War II a troupe of touring actors stage a production of Shakespeares King Lear. Bombs are falling, sirens are wailing, the curtain is up in an hour but the actor/manager Sir who is playing Lear is nowhere to be seen. His dresser Norman must scramble to keep the production alive but will Sir turn up in time and if he does will he be able to perform that night? The Dresser is a wickedly funny and deeply moving story of friendship and loyalty as Sir reflects on his lifelong accomplishments and seeks to reconcile his turbulent friendships with those in his employ before the final curtain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zu1RH6FJxRH3tavMrt1hSTSh6PP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364902'),
  ('593350780188936696', 'The Dressmaker', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Western', 'Jocelyn Moorhouse, Donald McAlpine, Nicholas Dare', 'Jocelyn Moorhouse, P.J. Hogan', 'Kate Winslet, Liam Hemsworth, Caroline Goodall, Judy Davis, Hayley Magnus, Hugo Weaving, Sarah Snook, Kerry Fox', null, 'In 1950s Australia, beautiful, talented dressmaker Tilly returns to her tiny hometown to right wrongs from her past. As she tries to reconcile with her mother, she starts to fall in love while transforming the fashion of the town.', 'In 1950s Australia, beautiful, talented dressmaker Tilly returns to her tiny hometown to right wrongs from her past. As she tries to reconcile with her mother, she starts to fall in love while transforming the fashion of the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Loofmo5GTt1Qe2Dz5ERLVlN98T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298382'),
  ('374402755249406826', 'The Dreyfus Affair', 1899, 'Drama', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'The first movie ever censored for political reasons. The title refers to the then contemporaneous Dreyfus affair in which a Jewish military officer was falsely convicted of treason, and it was alleged that he was framed due to anti-semitism.', 'The first movie ever censored for political reasons. The title refers to the then contemporaneous Dreyfus affair in which a Jewish military officer was falsely convicted of treason, and it was alleged that he was framed due to anti-semitism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joKR8Zv5IhnNl8Q43pEo0utgWwS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114128'),
  ('122950151130576078', 'The Dried Butterflies', 1978, 'Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Sergio Véjar, Miguel Garzón', 'Eduardo Luján, Sergio Véjar', 'Silvia Pinal, Ricardo Noriega, Ada Carrasco, Humberto Elizondo, Gonzalo Vega, Andrés León Becker, Martha Covarrubias', null, 'A disturbed middle aged writer becomes obsessed with a little boy who reminds her of a former lover.', 'A disturbed middle aged writer becomes obsessed with a little boy who reminds her of a former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE8dY4OPlXnsbt1bWVL4Yn1dNId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171998'),
  ('925645942107378957', 'The Drift', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Taavi Vartia, Nikos Karanikolas, Jyri Hakala, Laura Laintila', 'Taavi Vartia', 'Thea Sofie Loch Næss, Nikos Koukas, Mimi Roivainen, Jasmin Simonen, Marko Terävä', null, 'A survival drama about an ice skater stranded on an ice floe at the Arctic Sea. When the ice floe starts to float towards south and melt, the ice skater must use all means necessary to survive.', 'A survival drama about an ice skater stranded on an ice floe at the Arctic Sea. When the ice floe starts to float towards south and melt, the ice skater must use all means necessary to survive.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fgracenote%2F48423559a180fda60bac47fc121fb8ca.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-drift-2026'),
  ('839915340903268091', 'The Drifter in the Rain', 1968, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada', 'Carlos Enrique Taboada', 'Rodolfo de Anda, Ana Luisa Peluffo, Christa Linder, Norma Lazareno, Irlanda Mora, Eric del Castillo, Carlos Suárez, Carlos Hennings', null, 'After returning from a party, Angela finds herself locked in her house with two unknown women, while a homeless man lurks outside.', 'After returning from a party, Angela finds herself locked in her house with two unknown women, while a homeless man lurks outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uibo0HE76O0cFLrXCJ1sFAtnbPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188110'),
  ('993847410070090227', 'The Driftless Area', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Zachary Sluser, Daniel Voldheim', 'Tom Drury, Zachary Sluser', 'Zooey Deschanel, Aubrey Plaza, Anton Yelchin, Alia Shawkat, Ciarán Hinds, John Hawkes, Frank Langella, Benjamin Rogers', 'R', 'Pierre Hunter, a bartender with unyielding optimism, returns to his tiny hometown after his parents'' death. When he falls for the enigmatic Stella, Pierre is unknowingly pulled into a cat-and-mouse game that involves a duffel bag full of cash, a haphazard yet determined criminal, and a mystery that will determine all of their fates. A contemporary fable about the ways we struggle to control time and fate in a possibly predetermined universe.', 'Pierre Hunter, a bartender with unyielding optimism, returns to his tiny hometown after his parents'' death. When he falls for the enigmatic Stella, Pierre is unknowingly pulled into a cat-and-mouse game that involves a duffel bag full of cash, a haphazard yet determined criminal, and a mystery that will determine all of their fates. A contemporary fable about the ways we struggle to control time and fate in a possibly predetermined universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WjSZqhyyTIy5jEjUpgLwDE7bGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291189'),
  ('634572910880431085', 'The Driller Killer', 1979, 'Horror', 'Abel Ferrara, Louis Mascolo, Ken Kelsch', 'Nicholas St. John', 'Abel Ferrara, Carolyn Marz, Baybi Day, Harry Schultz, Alan Wynroth, Maria Helhoski, James O''Hara, Richard Howorth', null, 'An artist slowly goes insane while struggling to pay his bills, work on his paintings, and care for his two female roommates, which leads him taking to the streets of New York after dark and randomly killing derelicts with a power drill.', 'An artist slowly goes insane while struggling to pay his bills, work on his paintings, and care for his two female roommates, which leads him taking to the streets of New York after dark and randomly killing derelicts with a power drill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeFh14wpyxtmEZrpnPX1L4q5AJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13553'),
  ('177180995601947886', 'The Driver', 1978, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Walter Hill, Philip H. Lathrop, Lisa Hallas-Gottlieb', 'Walter Hill', 'Ryan O''Neal, Bruce Dern, Isabelle Adjani, Ronee Blakley, Matt Clark, Felice Orlandi, Joseph Walsh, Rudy Ramos', 'R', 'The Driver specializes in driving getaway cars for robberies. His exceptional talent has prevented him from being caught yet. After another successful flight from the police a self-assured detective makes it his primary goal to catch the Driver. He promises pardons to a gang if they help to convict him in a set-up robbery. The Driver seeks help from The Player to mislead the detective.', 'The Driver specializes in driving getaway cars for robberies. His exceptional talent has prevented him from being caught yet. After another successful flight from the police a self-assured detective makes it his primary goal to catch the Driver. He promises pardons to a gang if they help to convict him in a set-up robbery. The Driver seeks help from The Player to mislead the detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSpk2OH4MCgLGB06XDv4YUfBTv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2153'),
  ('825884175994888505', 'The Drop', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, null, null, 'A sailor is desperate for fresh water to drink while adrift on a raft in the sea.', 'A sailor is desperate for fresh water to drink while adrift on a raft in the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GpKZlqszB7c7FjOBwpIGK1cBvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85792'),
  ('753113078166540807', 'The Drop', 2014, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michaël R. Roskam, Nicolas Karakatsanis, Ryan Palmer', 'Dennis Lehane', 'Tom Hardy, Noomi Rapace, James Gandolfini, Matthias Schoenaerts, John Ortiz, Ann Dowd, Michael Aronov, James Frecheville', 'R', 'Bob Saginowski finds himself at the center of a robbery gone awry and entwined in an investigation that digs deep into the neighborhood''s past where friends, families, and foes all work together to make a living - no matter the cost.', 'Bob Saginowski finds himself at the center of a robbery gone awry and entwined in an investigation that digs deep into the neighborhood''s past where friends, families, and foes all work together to make a living - no matter the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olQInYvVCW2wycMSU1ogo9Jshml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154400'),
  ('494272627323021302', 'The Drop Box', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Brian Tetsuro Ivie', 'Brian Tetsuro Ivie', null, null, 'One winter, a pastor finds an abandoned infant on his church steps, and builds ''a drop box'' to rescue any future foundlings.', 'One winter, a pastor finds an abandoned infant on his church steps, and builds ''a drop box'' to rescue any future foundlings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/534T6zWm4EpZ6t5RVo15GGVlXCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319975'),
  ('489903179023912870', 'The Drover''s Wife: The Legend of Molly Johnson', 2022, 'Drama, Western, Thriller', 'Richard McGrath, Joshua Watkins, Xander Collier', 'Leah Purcell', 'Leah Purcell, Rob Collins, Sam Reid, Jessica De Gouw, Malachi Dower-Roberts, Benedict Hardie, Harry Greenwood, Nicholas Hope', null, 'In 1893, heavily pregnant Molly Johnson and her children struggle in isolation to survive the harsh Australian landscape after her husband left to go droving sheep in the high country. One day, she finds a shackled Aboriginal fugitive named Yakada wounded on her property. As an unlikely bond begins to form between them he reveals secrets about her true identity. Realizing Molly’s husband is actually missing, new town lawman Nate Clintoff starts being suspicious and sends his constable to investigate.', 'In 1893, heavily pregnant Molly Johnson and her children struggle in isolation to survive the harsh Australian landscape after her husband left to go droving sheep in the high country. One day, she finds a shackled Aboriginal fugitive named Yakada wounded on her property. As an unlikely bond begins to form between them he reveals secrets about her true identity. Realizing Molly’s husband is actually missing, new town lawman Nate Clintoff starts being suspicious and sends his constable to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvPHL0ADhbYGFBVpAaWiV0wOrOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722800'),
  ('834809391836094362', 'The Drowning', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bette Gordon', 'Stephen Molton, Frank Pugliese', 'Julia Stiles, Josh Charles, Avan Jogia, Tracie Thoms, Leo Fitzpatrick, John C. McGinley, Robert Clohessy, Jasper Newell', null, 'A psychiatrist faces his past, present and future when he finds himself involved in the treatment of a young man recently released from prison for a murder committed when the boy was just 11 years old.', 'A psychiatrist faces his past, present and future when he finds himself involved in the treatment of a young man recently released from prison for a murder committed when the boy was just 11 years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wBAtIPUvBK4FORbXXAocy2qxFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420260'),
  ('777837879251066609', 'The Drowning Pool', 1975, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Stuart Rosenberg, Gordon Willis, Hawk Koch', 'Walter Hill, Tracy Keenan Wynn, Lorenzo Semple Jr.', 'Paul Newman, Joanne Woodward, Anthony Franciosa, Murray Hamilton, Gail Strickland, Melanie Griffith, Linda Haynes, Richard Jaeckel', 'PG', 'Harper is brought to Louisiana to investigate an attempted blackmail scheme. He soon finds out that it involves an old flame of his and her daughter. He eventually finds himself caught in a power struggle between the matriarch of the family and a greedy oil baron, who wants their property. Poor Harper! Things are not as straight-forward as they initially appeared.', 'Harper is brought to Louisiana to investigate an attempted blackmail scheme. He soon finds out that it involves an old flame of his and her daughter. He eventually finds himself caught in a power struggle between the matriarch of the family and a greedy oil baron, who wants their property. Poor Harper! Things are not as straight-forward as they initially appeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOV256yJv56997QZJEdYdCTiL8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32620'),
  ('512869269722613832', 'The Drownsman', 2014, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Jeff Maher, Chad Archibald, Marc Forand', 'Chad Archibald, Cody Calahan', 'Michelle Mylett, Caroline Palmer, Gemma Bird Matheson, Sydney Kondruss, Clare Bastable, Ry Barrett, Katie Nicole Evans, JoAnn Nordstrom', null, 'After nearly drowning in a lake, a young girl develops an abnormal fear of water and is plagued by visions of a mysterious dark figure. A year later, in an attempt to cure her phobia and visions, her skeptical friends stage a séance and subject her to a bathtub experiment, unwittingly summoning the dark figure into the world.', 'After nearly drowning in a lake, a young girl develops an abnormal fear of water and is plagued by visions of a mysterious dark figure. A year later, in an attempt to cure her phobia and visions, her skeptical friends stage a séance and subject her to a bathtub experiment, unwittingly summoning the dark figure into the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knOFNsT08SGghtW7GcpyriOsHqn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263986'),
  ('874735537907528642', 'The Drudgery Train', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nobuhiro Yamashita, Yoshihiro Ikeuchi', 'Shinji Imaoka', 'Mirai Moriyama, Kengo Kora, Atsuko Maeda, Makita Sports, Tomorowo Taguchi, Miwako Wagatsuma, Hiroshi Sato, Mamiko Ito', null, 'In this offbeat coming-of-age tale, a charming, rebellious high school dropout named Kanta befriends the kind, provincial Shoji. The two bring out the best in each other, each gaining confidence from their friendship - especially regarding pursuit of the opposite sex. The working class Kanta becomes a sort of unruly anti-hero, maintaining his pride, defiance, and self-assurance even as his prospects seem increasingly grim.', 'In this offbeat coming-of-age tale, a charming, rebellious high school dropout named Kanta befriends the kind, provincial Shoji. The two bring out the best in each other, each gaining confidence from their friendship - especially regarding pursuit of the opposite sex. The working class Kanta becomes a sort of unruly anti-hero, maintaining his pride, defiance, and self-assurance even as his prospects seem increasingly grim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DCcNLIc9orSxok7Ug6CqQud9P9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139102'),
  ('587107631812772877', 'The Drug King', 2018, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Woo Min-ho, Go Rak-sun, Lee Seung-bin', 'Woo Min-ho, Lee Ji-min', 'Song Kang-ho, Cho Jung-seok, Bae Doona, Kim So-jin, Kim Dae-myung, Lee Sung-min, Lee Hee-jun, Jo Woo-jin', null, 'Busan, South Korea, 1970s. Lee Doo-sam is a small-time smuggler. After helping a drug gang to smuggle meth, he falls into the dark crime world. Quick-witted and full of ambition, he eventually takes over the drug underworld and starts to lead a double life: a good community leader during the day but an infamous drug lord during the night.', 'Busan, South Korea, 1970s. Lee Doo-sam is a small-time smuggler. After helping a drug gang to smuggle meth, he falls into the dark crime world. Quick-witted and full of ambition, he eventually takes over the drug underworld and starts to lead a double life: a good community leader during the day but an infamous drug lord during the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3n0mUGIqISBjke1hrGVkF7P6CZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497370'),
  ('690413361656718917', 'The Drum', 1938, 'Adventure, War', 'Zoltan Korda', 'A.E.W. Mason', 'Sabu, Raymond Massey, Valerie Hobson, Roger Livesey, David Tree, Desmond Tester, Francis L. Sullivan, Archibald Batty', null, 'Set in the India of the British Raj, the evil and untrustworthy Prince Guhl (Raymond Massey) plans to wipe out the British troops as they enjoy the hospitality of Guhl''s spacious palace. It''s up to the loyal young Prince Azim (Sabu) to warn the troops of Guhl''s treachery by tapping out a message on his drum.', 'Set in the India of the British Raj, the evil and untrustworthy Prince Guhl (Raymond Massey) plans to wipe out the British troops as they enjoy the hospitality of Guhl''s spacious palace. It''s up to the loyal young Prince Azim (Sabu) to warn the troops of Guhl''s treachery by tapping out a message on his drum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Opkwzeohwz2II4nMvYvbSqucFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43852'),
  ('651949702600377777', 'The Drummer', 2007, 'Drama, Action', 'Kenneth Bi', 'Kenneth Bi', 'Jaycee Chan, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Yumiko Cheng Hei-Yi, Josie Ho, Kenneth Tsang, Liu Ruo-Yu', null, 'When Sid insults a powerful triad boss, his father sends him to Taiwan for safety. Bored and restless, he discovers a community of Zen drummers high in the hills, and joins up - a decision inspired by a pretty face that soon becomes a challenge.', 'When Sid insults a powerful triad boss, his father sends him to Taiwan for safety. Bored and restless, he discovers a community of Zen drummers high in the hills, and joins up - a decision inspired by a pretty face that soon becomes a challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p98BrdNHdh4OyD3bQuVSqc1nL0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34216'),
  ('1094762629651333184', 'The Drummer of Ravel''s Boléro', 1992, 'Music, Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Patrice Leconte', 'Jacques Villeret, Laurent Petitgirard', null, 'Probably no one in the public listening to the orchestra''s rendition of Ravel''s Bolero notices him but the drummer is a regular hero. For, although his mind is assailed by loads of unsettling thoughts and worries, he tries to keep the rhythm at any cost. He knows all too well that he falls out of time only once all the magic of the piece will vanish.', 'Probably no one in the public listening to the orchestra''s rendition of Ravel''s Bolero notices him but the drummer is a regular hero. For, although his mind is assailed by loads of unsettling thoughts and worries, he tries to keep the rhythm at any cost. He knows all too well that he falls out of time only once all the magic of the piece will vanish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhwcfTlyl2ciwmri1y5nXkc62dl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111154'),
  ('573023780855497919', 'The Drums of Jeopardy', 1931, 'Horror, Drama', 'George B. Seitz, Arthur Reed', null, 'Warner Oland, June Collyer, Lloyd Hughes, Clara Blandick, Hale Hamilton, Wallace MacDonald, George Fawcett, Florence Lake', 'NR', 'A mad doctor is determined to take revenge on the family he believes is responsible for his daughter''s death.', 'A mad doctor is determined to take revenge on the family he believes is responsible for his daughter''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZhvBGDyYqpUD8wb6VWIVjufZ3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156344'),
