  ('277327796938301120', 'The Drunkard', 1950, 'Drama', 'Yorgos Tzavellas', 'Yorgos Tzavellas', 'Orestis Makris, Dimitris Horn, Billy Konstadopoulou, Athanasia Moustaka, Nikos Vlachopoulos, Maria Giannakopoulou, Katia Linda, Anna Kyriakou', null, 'After losing his son in WW2, a poor cobbler has become a drunkard and laughing stock of the whole neighborhood, besetting his daughter. When his daughter falls in love with a rich young man, he tries in vain to hide his passion from the young man''s family...', 'After losing his son in WW2, a poor cobbler has become a drunkard and laughing stock of the whole neighborhood, besetting his daughter. When his daughter falls in love with a rich young man, he tries in vain to hide his passion from the young man''s family...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2NQCFl4UogEgjNmdHJwQsyNmB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258800'),
