  ('1151096131493112764', 'The Dry', 2021, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Stefan Duscio, Phil Jones, Renata Blaich', 'Robert Connolly, Harry Cripps', 'Eric Bana, Genevieve O''Reilly, Keir O''Donnell, John Polson, Matt Nable, Eddie Baroo, Martin Dingle Wall, Julia Blake', 'R', 'Aaron Falk returns to his drought-stricken hometown to attend a tragic funeral. But his return opens a decades-old wound - the unsolved death of a teenage girl.', 'Aaron Falk returns to his drought-stricken hometown to attend a tragic funeral. But his return opens a decades-old wound - the unsolved death of a teenage girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zM12bfL2TEqVRXjiQIFUWUMLcCg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567797'),
