  ('872239757272802280', 'The Duck Doctor', 1952, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Red Coffey', 'NR', 'Tom is duck hunting, and he wings a little duckling that can''t quite keep up with the flock. Jerry gets to the fallen duck before Tom, bandages his wing, and shelters him from Tom as he keeps running out to join his flock.', 'Tom is duck hunting, and he wings a little duckling that can''t quite keep up with the flock. Jerry gets to the fallen duck before Tom, bandages his wing, and shelters him from Tom as he keeps running out to join his flock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDCx5KwgXmzyntRo23M39t0yvvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55533'),
