  ('310263945727399637', 'The Dude in Me', 2019, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Action', 'Kim Ryang-jin, Kang Hyo-jin, Son Sam-ung', 'Shin Han-sol, Kang Hyo-jin, Jo Joong-hoon', 'Jung Jin-young, Park Sung-woong, Ra Mi-ran, Lee Soo-min, Lee Pung-un, Kim Kwang-kyu, Lee Jun-hyeok, Yoon Song-ah', null, 'Dong-hyun is a high school student. One day, he falls from the rooftop and bumps into Pan-soo who is a passerby. Pan-soo is a member of a criminal organization. When the two men wake up in the hospital, they discover that they have switched bodies.', 'Dong-hyun is a high school student. One day, he falls from the rooftop and bumps into Pan-soo who is a passerby. Pan-soo is a member of a criminal organization. When the two men wake up in the hospital, they discover that they have switched bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3H97tUK5UmgOpjCh6Q7XZ4HW1cG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560527'),
