  ('211596578909474020', 'The Duel', 1971, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Chang Cheh, Lee Kwok-Keung, Ku Hsi', 'Chiu Kang-Chien', 'Ti Lung, Wang Ping, Yue Wai, David Chiang Da-Wei, Chuan Yuan, Yang Chi-Ching, Ku Feng, Cheng Kang-Yeh', 'R', 'After a gang massacre that resulted in the killing of his adopted father and gang leader, a martial artist goes into exile to take the blame. A year later, his gang is mysteriously trying to kill him, and he slowly discovers why.', 'After a gang massacre that resulted in the killing of his adopted father and gang leader, a martial artist goes into exile to take the blame. A year later, his gang is mysteriously trying to kill him, and he slowly discovers why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGpursnvPX7xSftaus14cFnCA0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139321'),
  ('435140900449919528', 'The Duel', 1973, 'Drama, History', 'Iosif Kheifits, Genrikh Marandzhyan, Yevgeni Tatarsky', 'Iosif Kheifits', 'Oleg Dal, Vladimir Vysotsky, Lyudmila Maksakova, Yuri Medvedev, Anatoliy Papanov, Georgiy Korolchuk, Anatoliy Azo, Ashot Melikjanyan', null, 'Dramatic story about two young men, two intellectuals of the 1890th. It is a story about a complex human character. Being tortured by ignorance and boredom of life, clerk Laevsky is longing to break the depraved circle of his existence. His moral antipode, naturalist Von Coren is sure that people like Laevsky are worth being destroyed. But regardless characters'' will and desires, providence deals with their lives in its own way...', 'Dramatic story about two young men, two intellectuals of the 1890th. It is a story about a complex human character. Being tortured by ignorance and boredom of life, clerk Laevsky is longing to break the depraved circle of his existence. His moral antipode, naturalist Von Coren is sure that people like Laevsky are worth being destroyed. But regardless characters'' will and desires, providence deals with their lives in its own way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6ymx5jzAP6ReOtgeruZbdVcDFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75383'),
  ('125900317555761985', 'The Duel', 1981, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Vintilă Corbul, Mircea Burada', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Jean Constantin, Colea Răutu, Ovidiu Iuliu Moldovan, George Mihăiță, Toma Dorel, Ion Rițiu, Marian Stoica', null, 'Officer Moldovan must solve the case of a robbery. Credit Central Bank was robbed fast and hard by a gang of professionals. Moldovan is trying to catch the man behind Rica Pasarin, the gang leader, by using his brother, who is a pickpocket thief.', 'Officer Moldovan must solve the case of a robbery. Credit Central Bank was robbed fast and hard by a gang of professionals. Moldovan is trying to catch the man behind Rica Pasarin, the gang leader, by using his brother, who is a pickpocket thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozBUbZWp72wxEW24t7LHDoaukgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224063'),
  ('373220041489678341', 'The Duel', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun, Wong Jing', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Vicky Zhao, Andy Lau, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Kristy Yang Rongru, Tien Hsin, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong', null, 'The sword saint requests a duel with god of sword at the apex of the forbidden city to determine the worlds best. As the date of the duel nears troubles befall the imperial town until everything is revealed at the climactic fight.', 'The sword saint requests a duel with god of sword at the apex of the forbidden city to determine the worlds best. As the date of the duel nears troubles befall the imperial town until everything is revealed at the climactic fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySAg2M0RbPvvuJldAviQuhp7GaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35117'),
  ('892216907553823873', 'The Duel', 2016, 'Western, Drama', 'Kieran Darcy-Smith, Jules O''Loughlin', 'Matt Cook', 'Woody Harrelson, Liam Hemsworth, Alice Braga, Emory Cohen, Felicity Price, José Zúñiga, William Sadler, Raphael Sbarge', 'PG-13', 'A Texas Ranger investigates a series of unexplained deaths in a town called Helena.', 'A Texas Ranger investigates a series of unexplained deaths in a town called Helena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qF7PKbM4KpjF7e6KOUoluoz78fl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333386'),
  ('5215438333435690', 'The Duel', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Federico Polleri, Augusto Tejada', 'Agustín Rolandelli, Luciano Leyrado', 'Eugenia Suárez, Joaquín Furriel, Juan Ignacio Cane, Maximiliano de la Cruz, Diego de Gregorio, Domingo Milesi, Cristina Inverrizzi, Diego Olazábal', null, 'Ernesto lives in depression and decides to hire a hit-man to end his own life. However, his plan takes an unexpected turn when he meets Rita, whose love gives him a new reason to live.', 'Ernesto lives in depression and decides to hire a hit-man to end his own life. However, his plan takes an unexpected turn when he meets Rita, whose love gives him a new reason to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFjcIyURaXrU4WWRN7obbipFQGy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189927'),
  ('838648725017749319', 'The Duel', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Luke Spencer Roberts, Justin Matthews', 'Luke Spencer Roberts, Justin Matthews', 'Dylan Sprouse, Callan McAuliffe, Patrick Warburton, Denny Love, Hart Denton, María Gabriela de Faría, Rachel Matthews, Christian McGaffney', 'R', 'When a friend group is torn apart by betrayal, they decide to settle their differences in the most old school of ways. Leaving their modern home of Los Angeles, they embark on a bizarre adventure that seemingly takes them back in time across an underground cave river. Cocaine. Existentialism. A four hundred and fifty pound pig. True love. Cosmic jokes. Mexico?', 'When a friend group is torn apart by betrayal, they decide to settle their differences in the most old school of ways. Leaving their modern home of Los Angeles, they embark on a bizarre adventure that seemingly takes them back in time across an underground cave river. Cocaine. Existentialism. A four hundred and fifty pound pig. True love. Cosmic jokes. Mexico?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwh0Z4sxzItQpNVoPeevQqqNTqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094605'),
  ('299404062399491831', 'The Duel at Silver Creek', 1952, 'Western', 'Don Siegel, Joseph Gershenson, Herbert S. Greene', 'Joseph Hoffman, Gerald Drayson Adams', 'Audie Murphy, Faith Domergue, Stephen McNally, Susan Cabot, Gerald Mohr, Eugene Iglesias, James Anderson, Walter Sande', 'NR', 'When a gang of ruthless claim jumpers brutally murders his miner father, a gunman known as the Silver Kid joins forces with the local marshal to free the tiny town of Silver City from the clutches of the dastardly villains.', 'When a gang of ruthless claim jumpers brutally murders his miner father, a gunman known as the Silver Kid joins forces with the local marshal to free the tiny town of Silver City from the clutches of the dastardly villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Qj29Mz2SehlVJxlmz9yLvktH8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60547'),
  ('1093980456528873338', 'The Duelist', 2016, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Olga Dubovitskaya, Rostislav Alimov, Aleksey Kosorotov', 'Aleksei Mizgiryov', 'Pyotr Fyodorov, Vladimir Mashkov, Franziska Petri, Martin Wuttke, Sergey Garmash, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Aleksandr Yatsenko, Yuriy Kuznetsov', 'R', 'Returning to Saint Petersburg after a long exile, the dashing Yakovlev, a retired army officer, makes a comfortable living by winning other people''s duels. An enigmatic, focused, and extremely skilled professional, he leaves a trail of dead bodies behind him as he swirls through polite society, frequently called upon to wield a pistol as a surrogate in duels at dawn. But when Yakovlev meets the naïve young Prince Tuchov and his beautiful sister, Princess Martha, the normally cold-hearted mercenary is surprised by hitherto undetected emotions. What transpires uncovers a series of revelations about his past and his present self.', 'Returning to Saint Petersburg after a long exile, the dashing Yakovlev, a retired army officer, makes a comfortable living by winning other people''s duels. An enigmatic, focused, and extremely skilled professional, he leaves a trail of dead bodies behind him as he swirls through polite society, frequently called upon to wield a pistol as a surrogate in duels at dawn. But when Yakovlev meets the naïve young Prince Tuchov and his beautiful sister, Princess Martha, the normally cold-hearted mercenary is surprised by hitherto undetected emotions. What transpires uncovers a series of revelations about his past and his present self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlVkUY2bBJ5XYTDiry16u70oayQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376565'),
  ('964688963005567808', 'The Duellists', 1977, 'Drama, War', 'Ridley Scott, Frank Tidy, Peter Kohn', 'Gerald Vaughan-Hughes', 'Keith Carradine, Harvey Keitel, Albert Finney, Edward Fox, Cristina Raines, Robert Stephens, Tom Conti, John McEnery', 'PG', 'In 1800, as Napoleon Bonaparte rises to power in France, a rivalry erupts between Armand and Gabriel, two lieutenants in the French Army, over a perceived insult. For over a decade, they engage in a series of duels amidst larger conflicts, including the failed French invasion of Russia in 1812, and shifts in the political and social systems of Europe.', 'In 1800, as Napoleon Bonaparte rises to power in France, a rivalry erupts between Armand and Gabriel, two lieutenants in the French Army, over a perceived insult. For over a decade, they engage in a series of duels amidst larger conflicts, including the failed French invasion of Russia in 1812, and shifts in the political and social systems of Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqjMYlUXnmmO8Jqucow4nj9alE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19067'),
  ('968517849769207448', 'The Duenna', 1979, 'Comedy, History, TV Movie', 'Mikhail Grigoryev', 'Mikhail Grigoryev', 'Irina Muravyova, Vladimir Zeldin, Evgeni Leonov, Tatyana Vasileva, Semyon Farada, Lyubov Polishchuk, Vladimir Soshalsky, Anatoliy Kubatskiy', null, 'A funny musical based on the comedy "The Duenna" by British dramatist Richard B. Sheridan.', 'A funny musical based on the comedy "The Duenna" by British dramatist Richard B. Sheridan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuFIkz7g80L2OV8i0IgoQaCtZYE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65100'),
  ('973339798700260376', 'The DUFF', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ari Sandel, David Hennings, Jason Blumenfeld', 'Josh A. Cagan', 'Mae Whitman, Robbie Amell, Bella Thorne, Skyler Samuels, Bianca A. Santos, Romany Malco, Nick Eversman, Chris Wylde', 'PG-13', 'Bianca''s universe turns upside down when she learns that her high school refers to her as a ‘DUFF'' (Designated Ugly Fat Friend). Hoping to erase that label, she enlists the help of a charming jock and her favorite teacher. Together they''ll face the school''s mean girl and remind everyone that we are all someone''s DUFF… and that''s totally fine.', 'Bianca''s universe turns upside down when she learns that her high school refers to her as a ‘DUFF'' (Designated Ugly Fat Friend). Hoping to erase that label, she enlists the help of a charming jock and her favorite teacher. Together they''ll face the school''s mean girl and remind everyone that we are all someone''s DUFF… and that''s totally fine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6ScveWmIPL9vSYyULD8ObqyHDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272693'),
  ('477055005075053303', 'The Duke', 1999, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Philip Spink', 'Robert Vince, Craig Detweiler, Anne Vince', 'John Neville, James Doohan, Courtnee Draper, Oliver Muirhead, Judy Geeson, Paxton Whitehead, Jeremy Maxwell, Sophie Uliano', 'G', 'When his nephew tries to wrest control of his estate from him, the Duke of Dingwall removes the boy from his will and leaves everything to his dog.', 'When his nephew tries to wrest control of his estate from him, the Duke of Dingwall removes the boy from his will and leaves everything to his dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTU1WgVGUWNJm2H19tHvZrwDN6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136984'),
  ('425384196013580947', 'The Duke', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Mike Eley, Simon Hedges, Adam Tomlinson', 'Richard Bean, Clive Coleman', 'Jim Broadbent, Helen Mirren, Fionn Whitehead, Anna Maxwell Martin, Matthew Goode, Jack Bandeira, Aimee Kelly, Charlotte Spencer', 'R', 'In 1961, a 60-year-old taxi driver stole Goya’s portrait of the Duke of Wellington from the National Gallery in London. It was the first (and remains the only) theft in the Gallery’s history. What happened next became the stuff of legend.', 'In 1961, a 60-year-old taxi driver stole Goya’s portrait of the Duke of Wellington from the National Gallery in London. It was the first (and remains the only) theft in the Gallery’s history. What happened next became the stuff of legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXlj7NgSWg0NbK2zfUh0nbGZVuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645689'),
  ('209893824018470623', 'The Duke of Burgundy', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Strickland, Nicholas D. Knowland, Judit Soltész', 'Peter Strickland', 'Sidse Babett Knudsen, Chiara D''Anna, Eugenia Caruso, Zita Kraszkó, Monica Swinn, Eszter Tompa, Fatma Mohamed, Bartsch Kata', null, 'Day in and day out, lovers Cynthia and Evelyn enact an elaborate sadomasochistic fantasy as mistress and maid. But as their ritual of domination and submission begins to turn stale, Cynthia yearns for something more conventional, while Evelyn tries to push their taboos even further.', 'Day in and day out, lovers Cynthia and Evelyn enact an elaborate sadomasochistic fantasy as mistress and maid. But as their ritual of domination and submission begins to turn stale, Cynthia yearns for something more conventional, while Evelyn tries to push their taboos even further.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUxyr5zfglwUE8Xod7yYiY1zNqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250225'),
  ('282199312390169073', 'The Dukes of Hazzard', 2005, 'Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Jay Chandrasekhar, Lawrence Sher, Artist W. Robinson', 'John O''Brien', 'Johnny Knoxville, Seann William Scott, Jessica Simpson, Willie Nelson, Burt Reynolds, M.C. Gainey, James Roday Rodriguez, David Koechner', 'PG-13', 'Cousins, Bo and Luke Duke, with the help of their eye-catching cousin, Daisy and moonshine-running Uncle Jesse, try and save the family farm from being destroyed by Hazzard County''s corrupt commissioner, Boss Hogg. Their efforts constantly find the ''Duke Boys'' eluding authorities in ''The General Lee'', their 1969 orange Dodge Charger that keeps them one step ahead of the dimwitted antics of the small southern town''s Sheriff, Roscoe P. Coltrane.', 'Cousins, Bo and Luke Duke, with the help of their eye-catching cousin, Daisy and moonshine-running Uncle Jesse, try and save the family farm from being destroyed by Hazzard County''s corrupt commissioner, Boss Hogg. Their efforts constantly find the ''Duke Boys'' eluding authorities in ''The General Lee'', their 1969 orange Dodge Charger that keeps them one step ahead of the dimwitted antics of the small southern town''s Sheriff, Roscoe P. Coltrane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZrNyYJEgE0VIqhelQPqFTR20xF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6519'),
  ('748679141800084521', 'The Dukes of Hazzard: Hazzard in Hollywood', 2000, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Bradford May, Nicole Burke', 'Gy Waldron, Bob Clark', 'John Schneider, Tom Wopat, Catherine Bach, James Best, Ben Jones, Sonny Shroyer, Anita Cochran, Patricia Manterola', 'PG', 'The Duke Boys and company travel to Hollywood to sell some musical recordings in order to raise money to build a new hospital in Hazzard County. However, when their recordings and money are stolen, they wind up on the run from mysterious hitmen, sleazy record producers, Russian gangsters, and vicious loan sharks.', 'The Duke Boys and company travel to Hollywood to sell some musical recordings in order to raise money to build a new hospital in Hazzard County. However, when their recordings and money are stolen, they wind up on the run from mysterious hitmen, sleazy record producers, Russian gangsters, and vicious loan sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sR31SZzBnu2gc7hHgKQMoWiRfI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111244'),
  ('1137169744158116897', 'The Dukes of Hazzard: Reunion!', 1997, 'TV Movie, Action, Adventure', 'Lewis Teague', 'Gy Waldron', 'Tom Wopat, John Schneider, Catherine Bach, Denver Pyle, James Best, Ben Jones, Sonny Shroyer, Rick Hurst', 'PG', 'Mama Josephine Max wants to build a theme park in Hazzard, right on the Duke family farm! To stop her, Bo and Luke have to win a cross-country moonshine race. Because that''s how things get settled in Hazzard.', 'Mama Josephine Max wants to build a theme park in Hazzard, right on the Duke family farm! To stop her, Bo and Luke have to win a cross-country moonshine race. Because that''s how things get settled in Hazzard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caaBvuhEGxtpgXyb4zpiQeAxXWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150329'),
  ('859117829219991028', 'The Dukes of Hazzard: The Beginning', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Roy H. Wagner, Robert Berlinger, Maximillian D. Day', 'Shane Morris', 'Jonathan Bennett, Randy Wayne, April Scott, Joel David Moore, Harland Williams, Sherilyn Fenn, Christopher McDonald, Willie Nelson', 'R', 'When mischievous teenaged cousins Bo and Luke Duke are arrested, both boys are paroled to the care of their Uncle Jesse in Hazzard, sentenced to a summer of hard work. It''s not long before the Duke boys learn of Boss Hogg''s plans to foreclose on Uncle Jesse''s farm. Together, with help from their cousin Daisy, Bo and Luke vow to save the family''s property and its storied history of producing the best moonshine in all of Hazzard.', 'When mischievous teenaged cousins Bo and Luke Duke are arrested, both boys are paroled to the care of their Uncle Jesse in Hazzard, sentenced to a summer of hard work. It''s not long before the Duke boys learn of Boss Hogg''s plans to foreclose on Uncle Jesse''s farm. Together, with help from their cousin Daisy, Bo and Luke vow to save the family''s property and its storied history of producing the best moonshine in all of Hazzard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kqpqfIhCvuPRqNuH0ox3T5MBHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19580'),
  ('200763594856152089', 'The Dull Sword', 1917, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jun''ichi Kōuchi', null, null, null, 'A samurai purchases a new sword only to find it is already dull. When he returns to the dull looking merchant to complain, something quite unexpected happens.', 'A samurai purchases a new sword only to find it is already dull. When he returns to the dull looking merchant to complain, something quite unexpected happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1CL2VJsa43Uo4BVzeBhO4Dm3hb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208624'),
  ('31679111155247984', 'The Dumbfounded King', 1991, 'History', 'Imanol Uribe', null, 'María Barranco, Joaquim de Almeida, Laura del Sol, Gabino Diego, Juan Diego, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Eusebio Poncela, Alejandra Grepi', null, 'Spain, under Philip IV (1621-1665). The film is based on a novel by Gonzalo Torrente Ballester. The King is stunned to see the naked body of Marfisa, the most beautiful prostitute of the town and Court. After that, he also wants to see the Queen naked. However, the King, despite the opposition and the scandal of the Church, will not stop until he reaches his wishes.', 'Spain, under Philip IV (1621-1665). The film is based on a novel by Gonzalo Torrente Ballester. The King is stunned to see the naked body of Marfisa, the most beautiful prostitute of the town and Court. After that, he also wants to see the Queen naked. However, the King, despite the opposition and the scandal of the Church, will not stop until he reaches his wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gQNC4FgrEBAGhfoMZTStEGriJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89308'),
  ('603775575206863020', 'The Dumpling Affair', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Stephan Schuh, Ed Herzog', 'Stefan Betz', 'Sebastian Bezzel, Simon Schwarz, Francis Fulton-Smith, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Nora Waldstätten, Enzi Fuchs, Eisi Gulp, Gerhard Wittmann', null, 'After a provincial policeman gets falsely accused of a crime that was committed with his pocket knife, he begins a turbulent hunt for the real murderer.', 'After a provincial policeman gets falsely accused of a crime that was committed with his pocket knife, he begins a turbulent hunt for the real murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8I9AqTEUrPiltwxgWg442YngqyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427027'),
  ('1089947321460169301', 'The Dumpling Queen', 2025, 'Drama', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Han Jianü, Mengchu Zhang, Theresa Tang Kit-Ming', 'Ma Li, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Zhu Yawen, Wong Cho-Lam, Fiona Sit Hoi-Kei, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Pan Binlong, Ben Yuen Foo-Wah', null, 'Based on the true story of Ms. Zang Jianhe, the founder of Wan Chai Ferry Terminal and known as the "Queen of Dumplings"; in the late 1970s, Ms. Zang Jianhe from Qingdao, Shandong Province was forced to flee to her husband with her two young daughters, but was forced to stay in Hong Kong, and in order to survive, she had to sell dumplings at the Wan Chai Ferry Terminal. How will she carry down the heavy difficulties of fate, step by step to reverse her life...', 'Based on the true story of Ms. Zang Jianhe, the founder of Wan Chai Ferry Terminal and known as the "Queen of Dumplings"; in the late 1970s, Ms. Zang Jianhe from Qingdao, Shandong Province was forced to flee to her husband with her two young daughters, but was forced to stay in Hong Kong, and in order to survive, she had to sell dumplings at the Wan Chai Ferry Terminal. How will she carry down the heavy difficulties of fate, step by step to reverse her life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xfohHcBHB1tkgG8wqUmvo7Qklp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241924'),
  ('1126058176772537350', 'The Dune', 2014, 'Drama', 'Yossi Aviram', 'Yossi Aviram', 'Niels Arestrup, Lior Ashkenazi, Guy Marchand, Emma de Caunes, Moni Moshonov, Jean-Quentin Châtelain, Dana Adini, Mathieu Amalric', null, 'Through the course of several accidents and chance encounters, Hanoch and Ruben will meet and each of them will have to face a page of his personal history, a page that they both need to turn for good.', 'Through the course of several accidents and chance encounters, Hanoch and Ruben will meet and each of them will have to face a page of his personal history, a page that they both need to turn for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNnFzvRyXk0FkHOGuxS4jWqj1vO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271683'),
  ('998070543378680369', 'The Dungeon of Harrow', 1964, 'Horror', 'Pat Boyette, James C. Houston', 'Pat Boyette, Henry Garcia', 'Russ Harvey, Helen Hogan, William McNulty, Michele Buquor, Maurice Harris, Eunice Grey, Lee Morgan, Henry Garcia', null, 'A man is shipwrecked on the island of a cruel Count and taken prisoner.', 'A man is shipwrecked on the island of a cruel Count and taken prisoner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdj6byfW2gTmompTeVOh8vvilM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37522'),
  ('828435156099603564', 'The Dungeonmaster', 1984, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Charles Band, David Allen, John Carl Buechler', 'Allen J. Actor, Rosemarie Turko, John Carl Buechler', 'Jeffrey Byron, Richard Moll, Leslie Wing, Blackie Lawless, Chris Holmes, Tony Richards, Randy Piper, Cleve Hall', 'PG-13', 'Paul, a computer whiz who spends more time with his machine than with his girlfriend, finds that he has been chosen as a worthy opponent for Mestema, an evil wizard who has spent centuries searching for a challenging foe. After having his computer changed into a wristband weapon, Paul does battle with a variety of monsters before finally coming face to face with the ultimate adversary.', 'Paul, a computer whiz who spends more time with his machine than with his girlfriend, finds that he has been chosen as a worthy opponent for Mestema, an evil wizard who has spent centuries searching for a challenging foe. After having his computer changed into a wristband weapon, Paul does battle with a variety of monsters before finally coming face to face with the ultimate adversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j30Tq1tWkVlVfkw2moVg4OtBe0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27244'),
  ('1036895651564337547', 'The Dunwich Horror', 1970, 'Horror', 'Daniel Haller, Richard C. Glouner, Lew Borzage', 'Curtis Hanson, Ronald Silkosky, Henry Rosenbaum', 'Sandra Dee, Dean Stockwell, Ed Begley, Lloyd Bochner, Sam Jaffe, Joanne Moore Jordan, Donna Baccala, Talia Shire', 'R', 'Dr. Henry Armitage, an expert in the occult, goes to the old Whateley manor in Dunwich looking for Nancy Wagner, a student who went missing the previous night. He is turned away by Wilbur, the family''s insidious heir, who has plans for the young girl. But Armitage won''t be deterred. Through conversations with the locals, he soon unearths the Whateleys'' darkest secret — as well as a great evil.', 'Dr. Henry Armitage, an expert in the occult, goes to the old Whateley manor in Dunwich looking for Nancy Wagner, a student who went missing the previous night. He is turned away by Wilbur, the family''s insidious heir, who has plans for the young girl. But Armitage won''t be deterred. Through conversations with the locals, he soon unearths the Whateleys'' darkest secret — as well as a great evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veoJRMZSk9RwTnDJmhhNj6WpJWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65891'),
  ('1040750605106772911', 'The Dunwich Horror', 2009, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Leigh Scott, Bill Posley, Steven Parker', 'Leigh Scott', 'Griff Furst, Sarah Lieving, Jeffrey Combs, Dean Stockwell, Natacha Itzel, Leigh Scott, Lauren Michele, Lacey Minchew', 'R', 'In Louisiana, in the wicked Whateley House, Lavina delivers two babies whose fate is written. Ten years later, three scholars of the occult discover that one page of the “Necronomicon,” the unspeakable book, is missing and the Black Brotherhood has summoned the ancient gate keeper to free legions of evil gods and monsters from the dimension of chaos.', 'In Louisiana, in the wicked Whateley House, Lavina delivers two babies whose fate is written. Ten years later, three scholars of the occult discover that one page of the “Necronomicon,” the unspeakable book, is missing and the Black Brotherhood has summoned the ancient gate keeper to free legions of evil gods and monsters from the dimension of chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHfF2sKfI6ssK6F2Y7CpLwffIsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45663'),
  ('663803240945717223', 'The Dupes', 1972, 'Drama', 'Tawfiq Saleh, Bahgat Heidar', 'Tawfiq Saleh', 'Mohamed Khair Halwany, Bassam Lotfy, Saleh Khalqy, Abdul Rahman Al-Rashi, Thanaa Dabssi, Najah Hafiez, Yoland Asmar, Qamar Mortada', null, 'The film follows three Palestinian refugees brought together by dispossession and hope for a better future. Hiding in the tank of a truck, the men attempt to make their way across the border into Kuwait, the "promised land."', 'The film follows three Palestinian refugees brought together by dispossession and hope for a better future. Hiding in the tank of a truck, the men attempt to make their way across the border into Kuwait, the "promised land."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTlH2e5htbqFkmYR2fgjD3gcVdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178535'),
  ('835008946393146435', 'The Dust Factory', 2004, 'Fantasy, Family, Adventure', 'Stephen M. Katz, Eric Small', 'Eric Small', 'Armin Mueller-Stahl, Hayden Panettiere, Ryan Kelley, Kim Myers, George De La Pena, Michael Angarano, Peter Horton, Kyle Hansen', 'PG', 'Ryan is a teenager who lacks the ability to speak. One day, Ryan falls off a bridge and he finds himself transported to a strange fantasy world where he encounters his Grandpa Randolph and a pretty girl named Melanie; together, Ryan and Melanie learn to help one another with their problems, and they both discover the wisdom they can gain from elders like Grandpa Randolph.', 'Ryan is a teenager who lacks the ability to speak. One day, Ryan falls off a bridge and he finds himself transported to a strange fantasy world where he encounters his Grandpa Randolph and a pretty girl named Melanie; together, Ryan and Melanie learn to help one another with their problems, and they both discover the wisdom they can gain from elders like Grandpa Randolph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbLyWQPdiGGBWWbxYvS3dMl5KGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2319'),
  ('410773643451778205', 'The Dust of Naples', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antonio Capuano, Pasquale Rachini', 'Paolo Sorrentino, Antonio Capuano', 'Silvio Orlando, Tonino Taiuti, Alan De Luca, Gigio Morra, Gianni Ferreri, Antonino Iuorio, Teresa Saponangelo, Lello Musella', null, 'The title deliberatly recalls the famous L''oro di Napoli (Napoli''s Gold) by Vittorio De Sica (1954). Alike De Sica''s film here Naples is the real protagonist: Naples and its dust, not its gold. Through five episodes expressing different aspects of Naples, we have a picture of the town that doesn''t belong to the postcard stereotypes...', 'The title deliberatly recalls the famous L''oro di Napoli (Napoli''s Gold) by Vittorio De Sica (1954). Alike De Sica''s film here Naples is the real protagonist: Naples and its dust, not its gold. Through five episodes expressing different aspects of Naples, we have a picture of the town that doesn''t belong to the postcard stereotypes...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aolceu24rWUvIdhRw1qZ3kjd4WL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146156'),
  ('629813677217395119', 'The Dust of Time', 2008, 'Drama', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Andreas Sinanos', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Petros Markaris, Tonino Guerra', 'Willem Dafoe, Bruno Ganz, Michel Piccoli, Irène Jacob, Christiane Paul, Kostas Apostolidis, Tiziana Pfiffner, Alexandros Mylonas', null, 'A, an American film director of Greek ancestry, is making a film that tells his story and the story of his parents. It is a tale that unfolds in Italy, Germany, Russia, Kazakhstan, Canada and the USA. The main character is Eleni, who is claimed and claims the absoluteness of love. At the same time the film is a long journey into the vast history and the events of the last fifty years that left their mark on the 20th century. The characters in the film move as though in a dream. The dust of time confuses memories. A searches for them and experiences them in the present.', 'A, an American film director of Greek ancestry, is making a film that tells his story and the story of his parents. It is a tale that unfolds in Italy, Germany, Russia, Kazakhstan, Canada and the USA. The main character is Eleni, who is claimed and claims the absoluteness of love. At the same time the film is a long journey into the vast history and the events of the last fifty years that left their mark on the 20th century. The characters in the film move as though in a dream. The dust of time confuses memories. A searches for them and experiences them in the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4hPLoXuABQf6uGEt7QPQirjcX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51735'),
  ('36623956178720108', 'The Dustwalker', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Sandra Sciberras, Louise Heesom Smith, Angela Heesom', 'Sandra Sciberras', 'Jolene Anderson, Stef Dawson, Talina Naviede, Harry Greenwood, Chloe Brown, Ben Mortley, Alexandra Nell, John Harvie Morris', null, 'An alien spaceship crash-lands in an isolated town in the middle of the Australian desert, releasing an insidious parasite that attacks the brain of all creatures including humans, making them disorientated, unnaturally strong and violent. Sargeant Jo Sharp, readying for a return to the big city beat, wakes to find the township, her family and friends falling victim to an evil that is spreading faster than it can be contained.', 'An alien spaceship crash-lands in an isolated town in the middle of the Australian desert, releasing an insidious parasite that attacks the brain of all creatures including humans, making them disorientated, unnaturally strong and violent. Sargeant Jo Sharp, readying for a return to the big city beat, wakes to find the township, her family and friends falling victim to an evil that is spreading faster than it can be contained.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkG0xsFoony3JhCPmP7V4JkN9hB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614869'),
  ('63715330901527199', 'The Dutch Master', 1993, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Susan Seidelman, H.H. Cooper, Charles Zalben', 'Jonathan Brett, Susan Seidelman', 'Mira Sorvino, Aida Turturro, Sharon Angela, Rick Pasqualone, Charles E. Gerber, Richard DeDomenico, Vincent Pastore, Lina Koutrakas', null, 'The Walter Mitty-esque tale of a Brooklyn dental hygienist who escapes into a painting by 17th-century Dutch master Peter de Hooc. The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'The Walter Mitty-esque tale of a Brooklyn dental hygienist who escapes into a painting by 17th-century Dutch master Peter de Hooc. The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2m3fDr0FBaf1AMi6YvTB8aMXqcW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244861'),
  ('875310131362299287', 'The Dutchman', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Frankie DeMarco, Andre Gaines, Kat Hess', 'Qasim Basir, Andre Gaines', 'André Holland, Kate Mara, Zazie Beetz, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Aldis Hodge, Lauren E. Banks, Tracy Wilder, Lenny Platt', null, 'A successful black businessman, haunted by his crumbling marriage and identity crisis, is drawn into a psychological game of cat and mouse with a mysterious white woman he encounters on a New York subway.', 'A successful black businessman, haunted by his crumbling marriage and identity crisis, is drawn into a psychological game of cat and mouse with a mysterious white woman he encounters on a New York subway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7CCosgX9LcSpt7bXmqw5OzTFTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180417'),
  ('839844351670124889', 'The Duxorcist', 1987, 'Animation, Horror, Family, Comedy', 'Terry Lennon, Greg Ford', 'Terry Lennon, Greg Ford', 'Mel Blanc, B.J. Ward', null, 'Daffy is a professional paranormal investigator come to help a possessed damsel in distress.', 'Daffy is a professional paranormal investigator come to help a possessed damsel in distress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHpZwp8LhwijSvCco5qEZCIrgIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84599'),
  ('357170339997653404', 'The Dwarf and the Giant', 1901, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A magician explores two halves of his self: The Dwarf and the Giant.', 'A magician explores two halves of his self: The Dwarf and the Giant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OaBSpq3v898MEGh9zSCCBUPjvA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107273'),
  ('780701055744273555', 'The Dyatlov Pass Incident', 2013, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Renny Harlin, Mary Ellen Woods, Mariya Korneva', 'Vikram Weet', 'Holly Goss, Matt Stokoe, Luke Albright, Ryan Hawley, Gemma Atkinson, Nikolay Butenin, Nelly Nielsen, Valeriya Fedorovich', 'R', 'In February of 1959, nine Russian hikers ventured into a remote area of the Ural Mountains. Two weeks later, all of them were found dead. What happened is a mystery that has baffled investigators and researchers for decades. It has become known as the Dyatlov Pass Incident. When five ambitious American college students are issued a grant to return to the site of the original events, they gear up with the belief that they can uncover and document the truth of what happened to the supposedly experienced hikers. But what they find is more shocking than anything they could have imagined. Retracing the steps of the Russians'' ill-fated journey, the students are plagued by strange and increasingly terrifying phenomena that suggest that in spite of the desolate surroundings, they are not alone. The forces at work in the Dyatlov Pass Incident have been waiting for them.', 'In February of 1959, nine Russian hikers ventured into a remote area of the Ural Mountains. Two weeks later, all of them were found dead. What happened is a mystery that has baffled investigators and researchers for decades. It has become known as the Dyatlov Pass Incident. When five ambitious American college students are issued a grant to return to the site of the original events, they gear up with the belief that they can uncover and document the truth of what happened to the supposedly experienced hikers. But what they find is more shocking than anything they could have imagined. Retracing the steps of the Russians'' ill-fated journey, the students are plagued by strange and increasingly terrifying phenomena that suggest that in spite of the desolate surroundings, they are not alone. The forces at work in the Dyatlov Pass Incident have been waiting for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hyvniwVeSvKbTNKrY44ndMsQht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169219'),
  ('815280180022023387', 'The Dybbuk', 1937, 'Drama, Fantasy, Music', 'Michał Waszyński, Albert Wywerka', 'Anatol Stern, S.A. Kacyzna, Andrzej Marek', 'Avrom Morewski, Ajzyk Samberg, Mojzesz Lipman, Lili Liliana, Leon Liebgold, Dina Halpern, Max Bozyk, M. Messinger', null, 'In a Polish shtetl, two young men who have grown up together betrothe their unborn children, ignoring the advice of a mysterious traveler not to pledge the lives of future generations. Soon after, one of them dies, and the wife of the other dies in childbirth. The children grow up in different towns, without ever knowing of the betrothal, but the power of the vow leads them to meet each other when they are marriageable. The young woman, Leah, is promised to another man, but Channon, the son of the father who died, is a practitioner of mysticism, and seeks to win his bride through sorcery.', 'In a Polish shtetl, two young men who have grown up together betrothe their unborn children, ignoring the advice of a mysterious traveler not to pledge the lives of future generations. Soon after, one of them dies, and the wife of the other dies in childbirth. The children grow up in different towns, without ever knowing of the betrothal, but the power of the vow leads them to meet each other when they are marriageable. The young woman, Leah, is promised to another man, but Channon, the son of the father who died, is a practitioner of mysticism, and seeks to win his bride through sorcery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nTRmV88wvdahTYUf6DxnONJcrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104748'),
  ('987980515537751778', 'The Dying Gaul', 2005, 'Drama', 'Craig Lucas, Bobby Bukowski, Mike Booke', 'Craig Lucas', 'Peter Sarsgaard, Patricia Clarkson, Campbell Scott, Ryan Miller, Faith Jefferies, Robin Bartlett, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Kelli O''Hara', null, 'A grief-stricken screenwriter unknowingly enters a three-way relationship with a woman and her film executive husband - to chilling results.', 'A grief-stricken screenwriter unknowingly enters a three-way relationship with a woman and her film executive husband - to chilling results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJscMaD5bwMj3f2r8qCy5NTqGs2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41189'),
  ('273855073329057896', 'The Dynamite Brothers', 1974, 'Action, Comedy', 'Al Adamson, R. Michael Stringer', 'John D''Amato', 'Timothy Brown, Alan Tang Kwong-Wing, Aldo Ray, James Hong, Donald Oliver, Peter Chan Lung, Carol Speed, Al Richardson', null, 'Young black man teams up with a Chinese kung-fu expert to fight a drug ring.', 'Young black man teams up with a Chinese kung-fu expert to fight a drug ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iamtePjZIt0G06GHzx9PMXZ5ZSb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81937'),
  ('1088038393581877379', 'The Eagle', 1925, 'Adventure, Romance, Comedy', 'Clarence Brown, George Barnes', 'Hanns Kräly', 'Rudolph Valentino, Vilma Banky, Louise Dresser, Albert Conti, James A. Marcus, George Nichols, Carrie Clark Ward, Spottiswoode Aitken', 'NR', 'Vladimir Dubrouvsky, a lieutenant in the Russian army, catches the eye of Czarina Catherine II. He spurns her advances and flees, and she puts out a warrant for his arrest, dead or alive. Vladimir learns that his father''s lands have been taken by the evil Kyrilla Troekouroff, and his father dies. He dons a black mask, and becomes the outlaw The Black Eagle. He enters the Troekouroff household disguised as a French instructor for Kyrilla''s daughter Mascha. He is after vengeance, but instead falls in love with Mascha.', 'Vladimir Dubrouvsky, a lieutenant in the Russian army, catches the eye of Czarina Catherine II. He spurns her advances and flees, and she puts out a warrant for his arrest, dead or alive. Vladimir learns that his father''s lands have been taken by the evil Kyrilla Troekouroff, and his father dies. He dons a black mask, and becomes the outlaw The Black Eagle. He enters the Troekouroff household disguised as a French instructor for Kyrilla''s daughter Mascha. He is after vengeance, but instead falls in love with Mascha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwF5S5Vbk2gZC3MPNxn9O5eBJSa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98477'),
  ('8833059586420442', 'The Eagle', 2011, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Kevin Macdonald, Nicki McCallum, Alexandra Miklos', 'Jeremy Brock', 'Channing Tatum, Mark Strong, Jamie Bell, Donald Sutherland, Denis O''Hare, Tahar Rahim, Dakin Matthews, Douglas Henshall', 'PG-13', 'In 140 AD, twenty years after the unexplained disappearance of the entire Ninth Legion in the mountains of Scotland, young centurion Marcus Aquila arrives from Rome to solve the mystery and restore the reputation of his father, the commander of the Ninth. Accompanied only by his British slave Esca, Marcus sets out across Hadrian''s Wall into the uncharted highlands of Caledonia - to confront its savage tribes, make peace with his father''s memory, and retrieve the lost legion''s golden emblem, the Eagle of the Ninth.', 'In 140 AD, twenty years after the unexplained disappearance of the entire Ninth Legion in the mountains of Scotland, young centurion Marcus Aquila arrives from Rome to solve the mystery and restore the reputation of his father, the commander of the Ninth. Accompanied only by his British slave Esca, Marcus sets out across Hadrian''s Wall into the uncharted highlands of Caledonia - to confront its savage tribes, make peace with his father''s memory, and retrieve the lost legion''s golden emblem, the Eagle of the Ninth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7rcJQWplGZWz57yGlP87rlPmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49494'),
  ('759093334442027257', 'The Eagle and the Hawk', 1933, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Stuart Walker, James Dugan, Harry Fischbeck', 'Seton I. Miller, Bogart Rogers', 'Fredric March, Cary Grant, Jack Oakie, Carole Lombard, Guy Standing, Forrester Harvey, Kenneth Howell, Leyland Hodgson', 'NR', 'The pilots of a Royal Air Force squadron in World War I face not only physical but mental dangers in their struggle to survive while fighting the enemy.', 'The pilots of a Royal Air Force squadron in World War I face not only physical but mental dangers in their struggle to survive while fighting the enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkg6lo4OvOTOqCQ2dkMJKuQ93BU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81110'),
  ('145256864077031384', 'The Eagle and the Lion: Hitler vs Churchill', 2017, 'Documentary, History, War, TV Movie', 'David Korn-Brzoza', 'François Kersaudy, David Korn-Brzoza', 'Stéphane Freiss, Adolf Hitler, Winston Churchill, Benito Mussolini, Franklin D. Roosevelt, Hermann Göring, Joseph Stalin, Neville Chamberlain', null, 'Winston Churchill, one of the most revered men of the twentieth century. Adolf Hitler, one of the most hated leaders in contemporary history. Between 1940 and 1945, these two enormously contradictory personalities faced each other in both politics and war. A clash of giants whose story begins in the trenches of the World War I and ends with the debacle of the World War II.', 'Winston Churchill, one of the most revered men of the twentieth century. Adolf Hitler, one of the most hated leaders in contemporary history. Between 1940 and 1945, these two enormously contradictory personalities faced each other in both politics and war. A clash of giants whose story begins in the trenches of the World War I and ends with the debacle of the World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXH3CQOkz2u0Zc41YMvSIFTIqT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512840'),
  ('71008671567895256', 'The Eagle Has Landed', 1976, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Thriller, War', 'John Sturges, Anthony B. Richmond, David C. Anderson', 'Tom Mankiewicz', 'Michael Caine, Donald Sutherland, Robert Duvall, Jenny Agutter, Donald Pleasence, Anthony Quayle, Jean Marsh, Sven-Bertil Taube', 'PG', 'When the Nazi high command learns in late 1943 that Winston Churchill will be spending time at a country estate in Norfolk, it hatches an audacious scheme to kidnap the prime minister and spirit him to Germany for enforced negotiations with Hitler.', 'When the Nazi high command learns in late 1943 that Winston Churchill will be spending time at a country estate in Norfolk, it hatches an audacious scheme to kidnap the prime minister and spirit him to Germany for enforced negotiations with Hitler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxLuj7VIv0ZRdvaIB6eY5fApONF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11372'),
  ('1033517145825735319', 'The Eagle Huntress', 2016, 'Family, Documentary, Adventure', 'Simon Niblett, Otto Bell', null, 'Daisy Ridley, Nurgaiv Aisholpan, Nurgaiv Rys, Alma Dalaykhan, Bosaga Rys', 'G', 'Follow Aisholpan, a 13-year-old girl, as she trains to become the first female in twelve generations of her Kazakh family to become an eagle hunter, and rise to the pinnacle of a tradition that has been typically been handed down from father to son for centuries.', 'Follow Aisholpan, a 13-year-old girl, as she trains to become the first female in twelve generations of her Kazakh family to become an eagle hunter, and rise to the pinnacle of a tradition that has been typically been handed down from father to son for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0dZQM1vmDmFrOa7JoRDOTdLb3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376530'),
  ('627072887573795711', 'The Eagle Shooting Heroes', 1993, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Peter Pau Tak-Hai', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Leslie Cheung, Brigitte Lin, Maggie Cheung, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Carina Lau, Joey Wong', null, 'A power struggle between the Queen''s treasonous lover and a princess occurs amid musical numbers, slapstick battles, and martial arts acrobatics.', 'A power struggle between the Queen''s treasonous lover and a princess occurs amid musical numbers, slapstick battles, and martial arts acrobatics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnlJkAlnw5AovZ0S5Zbp8m6YPjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55157'),
  ('781050026410448920', 'The Eagle with Two Heads', 1948, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean Cocteau, Hervé Bromberger', 'Jean Cocteau', 'Edwige Feuillère, Jean Marais, Silvia Monfort, Jean Debucourt, Jacques Varennes, Gilles Quéant, Maurice Nasil, Yvonne de Bray', null, 'Political intrigue and psychological drama run parallel. The queen is in seclusion, veiling her face for the ten years since her husband''s assassination, longing to join him in death. Stanislas, a poet whose pen name is Azrael, is a suicidal anarchist, his imagination haunted into hate by longing for this queen who''s drawn apart. He enters her private quarters intent on killing her then himself, but they fall in love, in part because he looks like the king. Stanislas wants her to regain political power by appearing to the public, and she tries to convince him to find hope and escape. All the while, the queen''s enemies plot to keep the lovers together but to thwart their plans.', 'Political intrigue and psychological drama run parallel. The queen is in seclusion, veiling her face for the ten years since her husband''s assassination, longing to join him in death. Stanislas, a poet whose pen name is Azrael, is a suicidal anarchist, his imagination haunted into hate by longing for this queen who''s drawn apart. He enters her private quarters intent on killing her then himself, but they fall in love, in part because he looks like the king. Stanislas wants her to regain political power by appearing to the public, and she tries to convince him to find hope and escape. All the while, the queen''s enemies plot to keep the lovers together but to thwart their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4tG7wVhN13h9KZOSkfcdCJcXv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185591'),
  ('690260314478693786', 'The Ear', 1970, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Karel Kachyňa, Milada Mikešová, Karel Brchel', 'Karel Kachyňa, Jan Procházka', 'Radoslav Brzobohatý, Jiřina Bohdalová, Jiří Císler, Miloslav Holub, Milica Kolofíková, Jaroslav Moučka, Ladislav Křiváček, Alois Mottl', null, 'Upon returning home from an official party, a Czech government official and his wife discover it bugged and surveilled by mysterious figures, driving them to paranoia and intensifying their discontents with one another.', 'Upon returning home from an official party, a Czech government official and his wife discover it bugged and surveilled by mysterious figures, driving them to paranoia and intensifying their discontents with one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvLMBdTZPxMvWoBis5Sel05lDB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88953'),
  ('1108710901498391067', 'The Early Bird', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Robert Asher', null, 'Norman Wisdom, Edward Chapman, Jerry Desmonde, Paddie O''Neil, Bryan Pringle, Richard Vernon, John Le Mesurier, Peter Jeffrey', null, 'Norman Pitkin is the assistant helping to run a small, old fashioned dairy which is threatened by a larger, modern organisation. Pitkin does his best to save the dairy (and his horse) and the usual chaos ensues', 'Norman Pitkin is the assistant helping to run a small, old fashioned dairy which is threatened by a larger, modern organisation. Pitkin does his best to save the dairy (and his horse) and the usual chaos ensues', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pad4nciJUrKUMNOGa5lLiClYjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38387'),
  ('690991251555786754', 'The Early Bird Catches the Worm', 2008, 'Drama', 'Francesco Patierno, Mauro Marchetti, Barbara Giordani', 'Francesco Patierno, Marco Baldini', 'Elio Germano, Laura Chiatti, Carlo Monni, Dario Vergassola, Corrado Fortuna, Antonio Buonomo, Edoardo Gabbriellini, Fiorenza Pieri', null, 'Marco Baldini is a young man determined to become the voice of a major radio; he alternates between his job at Radio Deejay and his gambling addiction, that slowly consumes his life, his relationship with his girlfriend and his work skills.', 'Marco Baldini is a young man determined to become the voice of a major radio; he alternates between his job at Radio Deejay and his gambling addiction, that slowly consumes his life, his relationship with his girlfriend and his work skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2g17Zgbuh91CUX1gHVS68h9HQ5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134500'),
  ('3378199147054351', 'The Early Bird Dood It!', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Frank Graham, Dick Nelson', null, 'The early worm barely escapes the bird, again. In search of a way to get rid of the bird, he enlists the help of a cat, but the bird is too smart for the cat.', 'The early worm barely escapes the bird, again. In search of a way to get rid of the bird, he enlists the help of a cat, but the bird is too smart for the cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMzzmPjMS6bagXCfuEDwKovM3Sd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87205'),
  ('301949132739777637', 'The Early Worm Gets the Bird', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, null, null, 'A determined bird goes out early to hunt for a worm and the bird gets into trouble.', 'A determined bird goes out early to hunt for a worm and the bird gets into trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RtjW2oYhaVQ8m19V6WQohjYs7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236459'),
  ('812272732755267731', 'The Earrings of Madame de...', 1953, 'Drama, Romance', 'Max Ophüls, Christian Matras, Alain Jessua', 'Annette Wademant', 'Charles Boyer, Danielle Darrieux, Vittorio De Sica, Jean Debucourt, Jean Galland, Mireille Perrey, Paul Azaïs, Jacques Josselin', null, 'In late 19th century France, the Countess Louise, wife of a wealthy general, sells the earrings her husband gave her on their wedding day to pay off her secret debts, then claims to have lost them. Her husband quickly learns of the deceit, which is the beginning of many tragic misunderstandings, all involving the earrings, the general, the countess, and her new lover, the Italian Baron Donati.', 'In late 19th century France, the Countess Louise, wife of a wealthy general, sells the earrings her husband gave her on their wedding day to pay off her secret debts, then claims to have lost them. Her husband quickly learns of the deceit, which is the beginning of many tragic misunderstandings, all involving the earrings, the general, the countess, and her new lover, the Italian Baron Donati.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eJIw86taD84NkpuZaORf5k2DsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27030'),
  ('699271445052511143', 'The Earth Dies Screaming', 1964, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Terence Fisher, Arthur Lavis, Gordon Gilbert', 'Harry Spalding', 'Willard Parker, Virginia Field, Dennis Price, Thorley Walters, Vanda Godsell, David Spenser, Anna Palk', null, 'A crack test pilot lands to find the planet has been devastated by unknown forces. There are a few survivors, so he organizes them in a plan to ward off control by a group of killer robots.', 'A crack test pilot lands to find the planet has been devastated by unknown forces. There are a few survivors, so he organizes them in a plan to ward off control by a group of killer robots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny4srEaGOmWZCL9jTkD2fPKRDwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77669'),
  ('1012248788038893816', 'The Earth Is a Sinful Song', 1973, 'Drama', 'Rauni Mollberg, Pirjo Honkasalo, Kari Sohlberg', 'Pirjo Honkasalo, Panu Rajala, Rauni Mollberg', 'Maritta Viitamäki, Pauli Jauhojärvi, Aimo Saukko, Milja Hiltunen, Sirkka Saarnio, Niiles-Jouni Aikio, Veikko Kotavuopio, Jouko Hiltunen', null, 'An earthy, naturalistically erotic and blood-soaked tale of young Martta''s ill-fated affair with Oula, a womanizing reindeer herdsman in the Finnish Lapland of the late 1940s. When the 19-year-old girl turns up pregnant, her alcoholic father is outraged and a series of tragic events follows', 'An earthy, naturalistically erotic and blood-soaked tale of young Martta''s ill-fated affair with Oula, a womanizing reindeer herdsman in the Finnish Lapland of the late 1940s. When the 19-year-old girl turns up pregnant, her alcoholic father is outraged and a series of tragic events follows', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veUh3lVZjWShY5hmplaVRu4klXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55418'),
  ('373235189854957771', 'The Earth''s Most Beloved Son', 1993, 'Drama', 'Șerban Marinescu', null, 'Ştefan Iordache, Gheorghe Dinică, Dorel Vișan, Maia Morgenstern, Tora Vasilescu, Mircea Albulescu, Valentin Uritescu, Emil Hossu', null, 'The life-story confession of a prisoner waiting for his trial. Victor Petrini, a promising intellectual in the 1950s and a lecturer in Philosophy is arrested by the repressive secret police, wrongly accused of espionage, and sentenced to prison and forced labor.', 'The life-story confession of a prisoner waiting for his trial. Victor Petrini, a promising intellectual in the 1950s and a lecturer in Philosophy is arrested by the repressive secret police, wrongly accused of espionage, and sentenced to prison and forced labor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yugtLLAX43uchzq4Ct5rRC0P4Hv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178923'),
  ('179942547848143510', 'The Earthling', 1980, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Peter Collinson, Donald McAlpine', 'Lanny Cotler', 'William Holden, Rick Schroder, Jack Thompson, Olivia Hamnett, Alwyn Kurts, Pat Evison, Redmond Phillips, Ray Barrett', null, 'Recently diagnosed with a terminal illness, a man returns home to Australia to die in the wilderness. His plans become complicated when he comes across a young boy whose parents have been killed and decides to take him under his wing.', 'Recently diagnosed with a terminal illness, a man returns home to Australia to die in the wilderness. His plans become complicated when he comes across a young boy whose parents have been killed and decides to take him under his wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwWgJilOBk3NdFY5pCKdQXqYIXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69716'),
  ('30854451799943810', 'The Earthquake', 2016, 'Drama', 'Yury Korobeynikov, Sarik Andreasyan', 'Arsen Danielyan', 'Konstantin Lavronenko, Mariya Mironova, Artyom Bystrov, Sabina Akhmedova, Arevik Martirosyan, Hrant Tokhatyan, Sebastien Sisak, Sos Janibekyan', null, 'After the devastating Spitak earthquake of December 7th, Konstantin Berezhnoy, a 50-year-old Russian, and Robert Melkonyan, a 28-year-old Armenian, work together to rescue the desperate survivors.', 'After the devastating Spitak earthquake of December 7th, Konstantin Berezhnoy, a 50-year-old Russian, and Robert Melkonyan, a 28-year-old Armenian, work together to rescue the desperate survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HlOFOPaR0gD5jNJubxB3hRRLSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413953'),
  ('506504028640933456', 'The Earthsong of the Cricket', 1999, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'This is a hand-painted work whose shapes are scratched on black leader filled with varieties of color: the resultant shapes tend to suggest insect-like movements, a rub of bent-lines together suggesting the electric hind legs of the cricket, whose movements engender (thru elaborate step-printing) quick pull-backs within frames of the film, so contrived as to create visual agitron lines within the zoom-like effect whose rhythm approximates a cricket''s repetitive sound. This effect is echoed ephemerally later in the film as it nears its end of muted pull-down shapes and approximations of the earth-clod-likenesses and/or autumnal leaf-likenesses which begin the film.', 'This is a hand-painted work whose shapes are scratched on black leader filled with varieties of color: the resultant shapes tend to suggest insect-like movements, a rub of bent-lines together suggesting the electric hind legs of the cricket, whose movements engender (thru elaborate step-printing) quick pull-backs within frames of the film, so contrived as to create visual agitron lines within the zoom-like effect whose rhythm approximates a cricket''s repetitive sound. This effect is echoed ephemerally later in the film as it nears its end of muted pull-down shapes and approximations of the earth-clod-likenesses and/or autumnal leaf-likenesses which begin the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwEB8IKbIMK7RKWxYAssB6pGI4r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547831'),
  ('240147183231992574', 'The Easiest Way', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jack Conway, Robert A. Golden, Al Shenberg', 'Edith Ellis', 'Constance Bennett, Adolphe Menjou, Robert Montgomery, Anita Page, Marjorie Rambeau, J. Farrell MacDonald, Clara Blandick, Clark Gable', 'NR', 'A virtuous and innocent young woman uneasily gives in to the lavish attentions of a "sugar daddy" but then finds true love with a newspaperman her own age. But when he disappears on a long assignment, she is unable to support herself in Depression-era New York and returns to her previous arrangement, placing her in a predicament when he returns.', 'A virtuous and innocent young woman uneasily gives in to the lavish attentions of a "sugar daddy" but then finds true love with a newspaperman her own age. But when he disappears on a long assignment, she is unable to support herself in Depression-era New York and returns to her previous arrangement, placing her in a predicament when he returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msXt5TfI2kWMLjRPfzankClIwl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156345'),
  ('950646268475564598', 'The East', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Zal Batmanglij, Roman Vasyanov, John McKeown', 'Brit Marling, Zal Batmanglij', 'Brit Marling, Alexander Skarsgård, Elliot Page, Toby Kebbell, Shiloh Fernandez, Aldis Hodge, Danielle Macdonald, Hillary Baack', 'PG-13', 'An operative for an elite private intelligence firm finds her priorities irrevocably changed after she is tasked with infiltrating an anarchist group known for executing covert attacks upon major corporations.', 'An operative for an elite private intelligence firm finds her priorities irrevocably changed after she is tasked with infiltrating an anarchist group known for executing covert attacks upon major corporations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGoFIX5WmthZZ3eLBd0QwDSkWNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87499'),
  ('61444422730109727', 'The East', 2021, 'War, Drama, Thriller, History', 'Mario Kartawinatta, Jim Taihuttu', 'Mustafa Duygulu, Jim Taihuttu', 'Martijn Lakemeier, Marwan Kenzari, Jonas Smulders, Jim Deddes, Abel van Gijlswijk, Coen Bril, Reinout Scholten van Aschat, Joes Brauers', null, 'A young Dutch soldier deployed to suppress post-WWII independence efforts in the Netherlands’ colony of Indonesia finds himself torn between duty and conscience when he joins an increasingly ruthless commander’s elite squad.', 'A young Dutch soldier deployed to suppress post-WWII independence efforts in the Netherlands’ colony of Indonesia finds himself torn between duty and conscience when he joins an increasingly ruthless commander’s elite squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcn9tfKLfvDGpZgUJw48eN0XCCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633503'),
  ('641093459159578011', 'The East Is Red', 1965, 'Music, Drama', 'Wang Ping, Enjie Li, Zhang Zhaobin', null, 'Wang Kun, Tseten Dolma, Hu Song Hua, Guo Lanying', null, 'Pre-Cultural Revolution propaganda at its most lavish, this model opera depicts the history and evolution of the Communist Party of China under Mao Zedong from its founding in July 1921 to the establishment of "New China" in 1949. Detailed in the musical are several key events in CPC history such as the Northern Expedition, the KMT-led Shanghai massacre of 1927, the Nanchang Uprising and formation of the People''s Liberation Army, the Long March and the founding of the PRC on October 1, 1949.', 'Pre-Cultural Revolution propaganda at its most lavish, this model opera depicts the history and evolution of the Communist Party of China under Mao Zedong from its founding in July 1921 to the establishment of "New China" in 1949. Detailed in the musical are several key events in CPC history such as the Northern Expedition, the KMT-led Shanghai massacre of 1927, the Nanchang Uprising and formation of the People''s Liberation Army, the Long March and the founding of the PRC on October 1, 1949.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5b2uHEq6BZKsgkaXCF8JbP3MS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185536'),
  ('293753682923238628', 'The Easter Bunny Is Comin'' to Town', 1977, 'Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction, Family, Comedy', 'Arthur Rankin, Jr., Jules Bass', 'Romeo Muller', 'Fred Astaire, Skip Hinnant, Bob McFadden, Ron Marshall, Meg Sargent, James Spies, Laura Dean, Allen Swift', null, 'The Mailman decides to stop another deluge of letters by answering questions about the Easter Bunny: Sunny, a baby rabbit found and adopted by Kidville (a town of only kids--even a kid mailman). And when Sunny goes delivering eggs to the nearby town (which he has to dye to fool Gadzooks, the mean bear on the mountain), he discovers that there are no kids in the town, and that the rightful (kid) ruler is being suppressed by his aunt. But the young king likes Sunny''s dyed eggs and jelly beans. So Kidsville, with the help of an old train engine, makes a few plans (and a decoy chocolate rabbit) to distribute them.', 'The Mailman decides to stop another deluge of letters by answering questions about the Easter Bunny: Sunny, a baby rabbit found and adopted by Kidville (a town of only kids--even a kid mailman). And when Sunny goes delivering eggs to the nearby town (which he has to dye to fool Gadzooks, the mean bear on the mountain), he discovers that there are no kids in the town, and that the rightful (kid) ruler is being suppressed by his aunt. But the young king likes Sunny''s dyed eggs and jelly beans. So Kidsville, with the help of an old train engine, makes a few plans (and a decoy chocolate rabbit) to distribute them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WTJhh13zm3pTImkEXUNZ1WRqBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24101'),
  ('729409906193765421', 'The Eastern Front', 2020, 'War', 'Rick Roberts', 'Cheryl Neve, Rick Roberts', 'Mhairi Calvey, Chris Wilson, Laura Jean Marsh, Justin Hayward, Tim Seyfert, Josh Harper, Neal Ward, Bethany Slater', null, 'A dwindling group of German soldiers battle to return to their lines on the harsh Eastern Front.', 'A dwindling group of German soldiers battle to return to their lines on the harsh Eastern Front.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qn36s5wdg0l7bJzYijeQlZRxYkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716145'),
  ('370994441271582652', 'The Easy Way', 2008, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Christophe Offenstein', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Benoît Graffin, Albert Spaggiari', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Alice Taglioni, Maxime Leroux, Patrick Bosso, Anne Marivin, Renan Carteaux, Jean-Philippe Puymartin, Gilles Lellouche', null, 'Albert Spaggiari is arrested in Nice and brought to a judge''s office for interrogation, but he escapes to South America where he meets a journalist who is investigating the event.', 'Albert Spaggiari is arrested in Nice and brought to a judge''s office for interrogation, but he escapes to South America where he meets a journalist who is investigating the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzEZbe3RKKFqovKRqUjratoTKNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13740'),
  ('1101258789323776864', 'The Easy Way Out', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Brice Cauvin, Marc Tévanian', 'Raphaëlle Desplechin, Brice Cauvin', 'Laurent Lafitte, Agnès Jaoui, Benjamin Biolay, Nicolas Bedos, Marie-Christine Barrault, Guy Marchand, Bruno Putzulu, Arthur Igual', null, 'Patrick, a travel agent in his early 30s, lives with Arthur, an immigration lawyer; but for a long time, Patrick has been sleeping on an air mattress on the floor of their bedroom. His younger brother, Tony, plans to marry his high school sweetheart but is having an affair that is far more satisfying than his relationship with his fiancee. Their older brother, Ryan, is divorced, living at home and working at his parents’ hopelessly unprofitable men’s clothing store. And McCauley soon makes achingly clear that the parents’ marriage is far from happy.', 'Patrick, a travel agent in his early 30s, lives with Arthur, an immigration lawyer; but for a long time, Patrick has been sleeping on an air mattress on the floor of their bedroom. His younger brother, Tony, plans to marry his high school sweetheart but is having an affair that is far more satisfying than his relationship with his fiancee. Their older brother, Ryan, is divorced, living at home and working at his parents’ hopelessly unprofitable men’s clothing store. And McCauley soon makes achingly clear that the parents’ marriage is far from happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XaP1ag5JEASgeOoCAiLuy7OahZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326874'),
  ('331571057039308481', 'The Eccentrics', 1974, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Eldar Shengelaia, Geno Chiradze', 'Revaz Gabriadze', 'Vasili Chkhaidze, Dato Jgenti, Ariadna Shengelaia, Boris Tsipuria, Abrek Pkhaladze, Merab Eliozishvili, Akaki Baqradze, Grigol Tkabladze', null, 'Ertaoz travels to the city with the intent to sell a chicken and pay off his father''s debts. Upon arrival, he falls for the beautiful Margalita and decides to help her dispose of her ex-lover''s body. However, at the cemetery, the lover–a policeman–unexpectedly regains consciousness and arrests Ertaoz and the chicken. Ertaoz is sentenced to ten years, while the bird receives seven. In prison, they meet an inventor who has built a flying machine that runs not on fuel but the power of love.', 'Ertaoz travels to the city with the intent to sell a chicken and pay off his father''s debts. Upon arrival, he falls for the beautiful Margalita and decides to help her dispose of her ex-lover''s body. However, at the cemetery, the lover–a policeman–unexpectedly regains consciousness and arrests Ertaoz and the chicken. Ertaoz is sentenced to ten years, while the bird receives seven. In prison, they meet an inventor who has built a flying machine that runs not on fuel but the power of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHFRNTvR1huocluSiEjK4pY5tkY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371486'),
  ('965028754191270380', 'The Echo', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Yam Laranas, Patrick Tidy, Sterling Thomas', 'Eric Bernt, Shintaro Shimosawa', 'Jesse Bradford, Amelia Warner, Carlos Leon, Iza Calzado, Kevin Durand, Louise Linton, Jamie Bloch, Pruitt Taylor Vince', null, 'An ex-prisoner moves to an old apartment, where one gets to see in the middle of a domestic problem between a police officer, his wife and his daughter. When he tries to intervene, he will be caught in a mysterious curse.', 'An ex-prisoner moves to an old apartment, where one gets to see in the middle of a domestic problem between a police officer, his wife and his daughter. When he tries to intervene, he will be caught in a mysterious curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1yCRk3MgXIfGRR7fTNAw9VAJsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25329'),
  ('605260163795652415', 'The Echo', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Tatiana Huezo, Ernesto Pardo', 'Tatiana Huezo', 'Montserrat Hernández Hernández, Luz María Vázquez González, Sarahí Rojas Hernández, María de los Ángeles Pacheco Tapia, William Antonio Vázquez González, Ramiro Hernández Hernández, Uriel Hernández Hernández, Andrea González Lima', null, 'In the remote village of El Echo that exists outside of time, the children care for the sheep and their elders. While the frost and drought punish the land, they learn to understand death, illness and love with each act, word and silence of their parents. A story about the echo of what clings to the soul, about the certainty of shelter provided by those around us, about rebellion and vertigo in the face of life. About growing up.', 'In the remote village of El Echo that exists outside of time, the children care for the sheep and their elders. While the frost and drought punish the land, they learn to understand death, illness and love with each act, word and silence of their parents. A story about the echo of what clings to the soul, about the certainty of shelter provided by those around us, about rebellion and vertigo in the face of life. About growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3lQ0g5gP7DklRzFgXdM3s5oryZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062526'),
  ('773424146085687215', 'The Eclipse', 2009, 'Drama, Horror', 'Conor McPherson, Ivan McCullough, Peter Nightingale', 'Billy Roche, Conor McPherson', 'Ciarán Hinds, Iben Hjejle, Aidan Quinn, Jim Norton, Éanna Hardwicke, Valerie Spelman, Billy Roche, Donncha Crowley', 'R', 'Michael is a widower who is struggling to adjust to his new role as the sole caretaker of his two children. Still reeling from the death of his wife, he has been plagued by terrifying apparitions. When he volunteers at a local literary festival, he finds himself drawn to Lena, an empathetic author of supernatural fiction. While Lena tries to help Michael with the mystery of his nightmarish visions, she must contend with problems of her own, as she’s being jealously pursued by self-obsessed novelist Nicholas, her one-time lover. As the festival progresses, the three adults’ lives converge and collide.', 'Michael is a widower who is struggling to adjust to his new role as the sole caretaker of his two children. Still reeling from the death of his wife, he has been plagued by terrifying apparitions. When he volunteers at a local literary festival, he finds himself drawn to Lena, an empathetic author of supernatural fiction. While Lena tries to help Michael with the mystery of his nightmarish visions, she must contend with problems of her own, as she’s being jealously pursued by self-obsessed novelist Nicholas, her one-time lover. As the festival progresses, the three adults’ lives converge and collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96ma6Hn8aW3FbHoaDzHiRflCHls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39563'),
  ('212508458059220739', 'The Eclipse: Courtship of the Sun and Moon', 1907, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Mademoiselle Bodson, Manuel', null, 'In this film, Méliès concocts a combination fairy- and morality tale about the foolishness of trying to look too deeply into the workings of an unstable and inscrutable universe. At a medieval school, an old astronomer begins to teach a class of young men, all armed with telescopes, about the art of scrutinising an imminent eclipse. When a mechanical clock strikes twelve, all the young men rush to the windows and fix their telescopes on the heavens.', 'In this film, Méliès concocts a combination fairy- and morality tale about the foolishness of trying to look too deeply into the workings of an unstable and inscrutable universe. At a medieval school, an old astronomer begins to teach a class of young men, all armed with telescopes, about the art of scrutinising an imminent eclipse. When a mechanical clock strikes twelve, all the young men rush to the windows and fix their telescopes on the heavens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nl4I4Adu7LWZ8RD12ktPyWhzICA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49278'),
  ('431745956361339779', 'The Ecstasies of Women', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis, Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis', 'Walter Camp, Bonnie Clark, Dee Howard, Sharon Matt, Antoinette Maynard, Jeanette Mills, Vincene Wallace, Harvey Shain', null, 'Harry''s friends throw him a night-long bachelor party, and he flashes back to his many female ''conquests'' with the go-go dancers who remind him of his array of past lovers.', 'Harry''s friends throw him a night-long bachelor party, and he flashes back to his many female ''conquests'' with the go-go dancers who remind him of his array of past lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK97VeA5qF8i4uIxxtcHJ937nO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158442'),
  ('1078470068603848073', 'The Eddy Duchin Story', 1956, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'George Sidney, Harry Stradling Sr., Seymour Friedman', 'Samuel A. Taylor', 'Tyrone Power, Kim Novak, James Whitmore, Victoria Shaw, Rex Thompson, Mickey Maga, Shepperd Strudwick, Frieda Inescort', 'NR', 'The life story of the famous pianist and band-leader of the 1930s and 1940s.', 'The life story of the famous pianist and band-leader of the 1930s and 1940s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FlLfoEosAXBN70GVL41vPUnoiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43199'),
  ('215398364714190533', 'The Edelweiss Pirates', 2004, 'Drama, History, War', 'Niko von Glasow', 'Kiki von Glasow, Niko von Glasow', 'Bela B., Ivan Stebunov, Simon Taal, Anna Thalbach, Jochen Nickel, Jan Decleir, Wolfgang Michael, Irina Sokolova', null, 'Cologne towards the end of the Second World War. The city is in ruins, everyone is afraid, many are dead. It is a time of great inhumanity. Cologne’s young Edelweiss Pirates refuse to submit to the pressure of the Nazi regime. They fight with the Hitler Youth and scrawl anti-war propaganda on walls. Karl is an Edelweiss Pirate; his younger brother, Peter, is in the Hitler Youth movement. The two young men have been alone ever since their mother’s death in a bombing raid; their father is serving at the front, and their older brother, Otto, has been killed in action. Otto’s financée, Cilly, is doing her best to survive the war with her children. Carl is trying to help her.', 'Cologne towards the end of the Second World War. The city is in ruins, everyone is afraid, many are dead. It is a time of great inhumanity. Cologne’s young Edelweiss Pirates refuse to submit to the pressure of the Nazi regime. They fight with the Hitler Youth and scrawl anti-war propaganda on walls. Karl is an Edelweiss Pirate; his younger brother, Peter, is in the Hitler Youth movement. The two young men have been alone ever since their mother’s death in a bombing raid; their father is serving at the front, and their older brother, Otto, has been killed in action. Otto’s financée, Cilly, is doing her best to survive the war with her children. Carl is trying to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50dRaaTF976XLyS7WIQjpLicb9r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59283'),
  ('1058008642373692080', 'The Edge', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Donald McAlpine, Lee Tamahori, Philip A. Patterson', 'David Mamet', 'Anthony Hopkins, Alec Baldwin, Elle Macpherson, Harold Perrineau, L.Q. Jones, Kathleen Wilhoite, Mark Kiely, Eli Gabay', 'R', 'The plane carrying wealthy Charles Morse crashes down in the Alaskan wilderness. Together with the two other passengers, photographer Robert and assistant Stephen, Charles devises a plan to help them reach civilization. However, his biggest obstacle might not be the elements, or even the Kodiak bear stalking them -- it could be Robert, whom Charles suspects is having an affair with his wife and would not mind seeing him dead.', 'The plane carrying wealthy Charles Morse crashes down in the Alaskan wilderness. Together with the two other passengers, photographer Robert and assistant Stephen, Charles devises a plan to help them reach civilization. However, his biggest obstacle might not be the elements, or even the Kodiak bear stalking them -- it could be Robert, whom Charles suspects is having an affair with his wife and would not mind seeing him dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zplJqfuUyqzW0D4jX3W1afl0d7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9433'),
  ('387300450326688866', 'The Edge', 2010, 'Drama', 'Yury Klimenko, Alexei Uchitel, Kirill Vasilenko', null, 'Vladimir Mashkov, Anjorka Strechel, Yulia Peresild, Sergey Garmash, Oleksiy Horbunov, Vyacheslav Krikunov, Aleksandr Bashirov, Evgeniy Tkachuk', 'PG-13', 'The action takes place shortly after the end of the Second World War in the Siberian hinterland, among Russians and Germans with damaged personal stories and a strange transformation: the victors seem to be crawling into the skins of the defeated, and vice versa. Ignat, is the embodiment of the larger-than-life image of the Soviet victorious warrior who, in fact, proves to be shell-shocked, sick and broken, although not completely destroyed. Trains become fetish for the heroes of the film, and speed becomes a mania; they virtually become one with their steam engines, while the machines take on human names. The heroes set up an almost fatal race in the Siberian forest, risking their own lives and those of others.', 'The action takes place shortly after the end of the Second World War in the Siberian hinterland, among Russians and Germans with damaged personal stories and a strange transformation: the victors seem to be crawling into the skins of the defeated, and vice versa. Ignat, is the embodiment of the larger-than-life image of the Soviet victorious warrior who, in fact, proves to be shell-shocked, sick and broken, although not completely destroyed. Trains become fetish for the heroes of the film, and speed becomes a mania; they virtually become one with their steam engines, while the machines take on human names. The heroes set up an almost fatal race in the Siberian forest, risking their own lives and those of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiu1eyrjXWql0Lll9rZf64Eeg9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47557'),
  ('1075677686921762760', 'The Edge of Democracy', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Petra Costa, João Atala, Mariana de Melo', 'Petra Costa, Carol Pires, David Barker', 'Dilma Rousseff, Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva, Michel Temer, Eduardo Cunha, Jair Bolsonaro, Sérgio Moro, Paulo Maluf, Jean Wyllys', null, 'A cautionary tale for these times of democracy in crisis—the personal and political fuse to explore one of the most dramatic periods in Brazilian history. With unprecedented access to Presidents Dilma Rousseff and Lula da Silva, we witness their rise and fall and the tragically polarized nation that remains.', 'A cautionary tale for these times of democracy in crisis—the personal and political fuse to explore one of the most dramatic periods in Brazilian history. With unprecedented access to Presidents Dilma Rousseff and Lula da Silva, we witness their rise and fall and the tragically polarized nation that remains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIbPkZelgguJMPOx9vvCb5oqMxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566221'),
  ('191971387558049244', 'The Edge of Heaven', 2007, 'Drama', 'Rainer Klausmann, Fatih Akin, Tijen Çelik', 'Fatih Akin', 'Nurgül Yeşilçay, Baki Davrak, Patrycia Ziolkowska, Tuncel Kurtiz, Nursel Köse, Hanna Schygulla, Erkan Can, Nejat İşler', null, 'The lives of six German-Turkish immigrants are drawn together by circumstance: An old man and a prostitute forging a partnership, a young scholar reconciling his past, two young women falling in love, and a mother putting the shattered pieces of her life back together.', 'The lives of six German-Turkish immigrants are drawn together by circumstance: An old man and a prostitute forging a partnership, a young scholar reconciling his past, two young women falling in love, and a mother putting the shattered pieces of her life back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqhVVpXFtOotSlK0npVaBHXUqxV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2014'),
  ('438593194810090417', 'The Edge of Love', 2008, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'John Maybury, Jonathan Freeman', 'Sharman Macdonald', 'Keira Knightley, Sienna Miller, Matthew Rhys, Cillian Murphy, Lisa Stansfield, Richard Dillane, Anne Lambton, Alastair Mackenzie', null, 'When the Welsh poet Dylan Thomas and his flirtatious wife Caitlin sweep into war-torn London, the last thing they expect is to bump into Dylan''s childhood sweetheart Vera. Despite her joy at seeing Dylan after so many years, Vera is swept off her feet by a dashing officer, William Killick, and finds herself torn between the open adoration of her new found beau and the wily charms of the exotic Welshman.', 'When the Welsh poet Dylan Thomas and his flirtatious wife Caitlin sweep into war-torn London, the last thing they expect is to bump into Dylan''s childhood sweetheart Vera. Despite her joy at seeing Dylan after so many years, Vera is swept off her feet by a dashing officer, William Killick, and finds herself torn between the open adoration of her new found beau and the wily charms of the exotic Welshman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uo7ZDvipL2OZu6G44hDP0sjDZ9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14061'),
  ('504403287688107729', 'The Edge of Seventeen', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kelly Fremon Craig, James Bitonti, Dan Mansfield', 'Kelly Fremon Craig', 'Hailee Steinfeld, Woody Harrelson, Haley Lu Richardson, Blake Jenner, Kyra Sedgwick, Hayden Szeto, Alexander Calvert, Eric Keenleyside', 'R', 'Two high school girls are best friends until one dates the other''s older brother, who is totally his sister''s nemesis.', 'Two high school girls are best friends until one dates the other''s older brother, who is totally his sister''s nemesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY5UEYuGxHfaYJ3vAUAWwFGMV7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376660'),
  ('755819429516444035', 'The Edge of the Blade', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Vincent Perez, James Canal, Stéphanie Seilhean', 'Karine Silla, Vincent Perez', 'Roschdy Zem, Doria Tillier, Vincent Perez, Guillaume Gallienne, Damien Bonnard, Noham Edje, Pepe Lorente, Myriem Akheddiou', null, 'In 1887, at a time when duels are in vogue in Paris, Clément Lacaze and Marie-Rose Astié meet. He''s a charismatic master of arms; she''s a feminist, far ahead of her time. Clément gets caught in a spiral of violence and decides to initiate Marie-Rose in the art of dueling. The two must work together to save face. How far will they go to defend their honor?', 'In 1887, at a time when duels are in vogue in Paris, Clément Lacaze and Marie-Rose Astié meet. He''s a charismatic master of arms; she''s a feminist, far ahead of her time. Clément gets caught in a spiral of violence and decides to initiate Marie-Rose in the art of dueling. The two must work together to save face. How far will they go to defend their honor?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cgk31QGJ5Z2oatbskPNDU8bbwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960044'),
  ('472281401993205972', 'The Edge of the World', 1937, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Powell, Monty Berman, Skeets Kelly', 'Michael Powell', 'John Laurie, Belle Chrystall, Eric Berry, Kitty Kirwan, Finlay Currie, Niall MacGinnis, Grant Sutherland, Campbell Robson', 'NR', 'A way of life is dying on a remote Scottish island, but some of the inhabitants resist evacuating to the mainland.', 'A way of life is dying on a remote Scottish island, but some of the inhabitants resist evacuating to the mainland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkf7e1CB1Bh9z3V05m1zZ1yC78t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44407'),
  ('178649185014252966', 'The Edge of Theocracy', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Rodrigo Van Der Put, Rodrigo Graciosa', 'Fábio Porchat', 'Fábio Porchat, Evelyn Castro, Gregório Duvivier, Rafael Infante, Antonio Tabet, Rafael Portugal, João Vicente de Castro, Thati Lopes', null, 'Jesus life and work goes through rumors, conspiracies, injuries, friendship and fanaticism. An emblematic figure of the 1st century, Jesus was a charismatic leader, but he faced many trials.', 'Jesus life and work goes through rumors, conspiracies, injuries, friendship and fanaticism. An emblematic figure of the 1st century, Jesus was a charismatic leader, but he faced many trials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMVCHi7ZiFN7YkLiLosEYb7Bq8m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774133'),
  ('898466808521290403', 'The Edifying and Joyous Story of Colinot', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Nina Companéez, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Nina Companéez', 'Francis Huster, Nathalie Delon, Brigitte Bardot, Bernadette Lafont, Ottavia Piccolo, Alice Sapritch, Francis Blanche, Jean-Claude Drouot', null, 'Colinot''s world is turned upside down when his fiancee is kidnapped.', 'Colinot''s world is turned upside down when his fiancee is kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5q2xxr9t50EyiFvXW1kbw8VqixQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259905'),
  ('1051407447318967597', 'The Editor', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Adam Brooks, Matthew Kennedy, Adam Brooks', 'Adam Brooks, Conor Sweeney, Matthew Kennedy', 'Paz de la Huerta, Samantha Hill, Laurence R. Harvey, Adam Brooks, Matthew Kennedy, Conor Sweeney, Tristan Risk, Dan Bern', null, 'A one-time (and now one-handed) master film editor toiling in the cinematic sweatshops of 1970s Italy becomes the prime suspect in a series of brutal murders.', 'A one-time (and now one-handed) master film editor toiling in the cinematic sweatshops of 1970s Italy becomes the prime suspect in a series of brutal murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFRFBJTmFJ4PMQvOv2VpRTbFdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285840'),
  ('667554802326675334', 'The Education of Charlie Banks', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fred Durst, Alex Nepomniaschy', 'Peter Elkoff', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Jason Ritter, Eva Amurri, Christopher Rodriguez Marquette, Sebastian Stan, Gloria Votsis, Danny A. Abeckaser, Declan Baldwin', null, 'College student Charlie Banks has to face old problems when the bully he had an unpleasant encounter with back in high school shows up on his campus.', 'College student Charlie Banks has to face old problems when the bully he had an unpleasant encounter with back in high school shows up on his campus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWU0c9QlGxx6sAX7ylToQIrx3br.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19587'),
  ('1035786506354947687', 'The Education of Fairies', 2006, 'Drama', 'José Luis Cuerda, Hans Burmann', 'José Luis Cuerda', 'Ricardo Darín, Irène Jacob, Víctor Valdivia, Bebe Rebolledo, Jordi Bosch, Albert Pérez, Miquel Gelabert, Harris Gordon', null, 'A man''s life is turned upside down after he is abandoned by the woman he loves.', 'A man''s life is turned upside down after he is abandoned by the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0zJvi2yRcBjnKfLX5PYc888Yu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65795'),
  ('91685023617459189', 'The Education of Little Tree', 1997, 'Drama, Family', 'Richard Friedenberg, Anastas N. Michos', 'Richard Friedenberg', 'James Cromwell, Tantoo Cardinal, Joseph Ashton, Mika Boorem, Christopher Heyerdahl, Christopher Fennell, Graham Greene, Leni Parker', 'PG', 'Little Tree is an 8-year-old Cherokee boy, who, during the time of the depression, loses his parents and starts to live with his Indian grandma and grandpa and learn the wisdom of the Cherokee way of life.', 'Little Tree is an 8-year-old Cherokee boy, who, during the time of the depression, loses his parents and starts to live with his Indian grandma and grandpa and learn the wisdom of the Cherokee way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBJCiV56y5i5kEWZw1vXf2QYuFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62394'),
  ('357928885465346948', 'The Edukators', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hans Weingartner, Matthias Schellenberg, Daniela Knapp', null, 'Daniel Brühl, Julia Jentsch, Stipe Erceg, Burghart Klaußner, Peer Martiny, Petra Zieser, Laura Schmidt, Sebastian Butz', 'R', 'Three activists cobble together a kidnapping plot after they encounter a businessman in his home.', 'Three activists cobble together a kidnapping plot after they encounter a businessman in his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpiXFtvBYemLbAktLPNx5xDGvJn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276'),
  ('535741500881957810', 'The Eel', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shōhei Imamura, Shigeru Komatsubara', 'Shōhei Imamura, Daisuke Tengan, Motofumi Tomikawa', 'Koji Yakusho, Misa Shimizu, Akira Emoto, Fujio Tokita, Mitsuko Baisho, Show Aikawa, Ken Kobayashi, Sabu Kawahara', null, 'A businessman kills his adulterous wife and is sent to prison. After his release, he opens a barbershop and meets new people, talking to almost no one except for an eel he befriended while in prison.', 'A businessman kills his adulterous wife and is sent to prison. After his release, he opens a barbershop and meets new people, talking to almost no one except for an eel he befriended while in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TEzcwdF3DPeO8uSPmCfBBUhgNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20506'),
  ('848517061681037212', 'The Effect of Gamma Rays on Man-in-the-Moon Marigolds', 1972, 'Drama', 'Alice H. Bell, John Nicolella, Paul Newman', 'Alvin Sargent', 'Joanne Woodward, Roberta Wallach, Judith Lowry, Nell Newman, David Spielberg, Richard Venture, Carolyn Coates, Will Hare', 'PG', 'Middle-aged widow Beatrice Hunsdorfer and her daughters Ruth and Matilda are struggling to survive in a society they barely understand. Beatrice dreams of opening an elegant tea room but does not have the wherewithal to achieve her lofty goal. Epileptic Ruth is a rebellious adolescent, while shy but highly intelligent and idealistic Matilda seeks solace in her pets and school projects, including one designed to show how small amounts of radium affect marigolds.', 'Middle-aged widow Beatrice Hunsdorfer and her daughters Ruth and Matilda are struggling to survive in a society they barely understand. Beatrice dreams of opening an elegant tea room but does not have the wherewithal to achieve her lofty goal. Epileptic Ruth is a rebellious adolescent, while shy but highly intelligent and idealistic Matilda seeks solace in her pets and school projects, including one designed to show how small amounts of radium affect marigolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFGpoV5hDewXyBvjd44ajO58Sxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88875'),
  ('496046652574040124', 'The Effect of Love', 2007, 'Drama', 'Eliseo Subiela, Marc Cuxart', 'Eliseo Subiela', 'Sofía Gala Castiglione, Guillermo Pfening, Romina Ricci, Julio Arrieta, Norma Argentina, Jorge D''Elía, Matías Marmorato, Fernando Roa', null, 'Mabel lives on a slum. Does work as a clown at children''s parties and as a prostitute. At 20 crosses paths with Martin, a lawyer just shy of 40. He has divorced his wife and left the law firm he was working on. Buys a trailer and goes to live in it. Advertising for a car wash dressed as a bird he meets Mabel and they fell in love. Later she finds out she''s living with HIV. From that moment on, Martin''s love will help Mabel fight her battles with death.', 'Mabel lives on a slum. Does work as a clown at children''s parties and as a prostitute. At 20 crosses paths with Martin, a lawyer just shy of 40. He has divorced his wife and left the law firm he was working on. Buys a trailer and goes to live in it. Advertising for a car wash dressed as a bird he meets Mabel and they fell in love. Later she finds out she''s living with HIV. From that moment on, Martin''s love will help Mabel fight her battles with death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNHbRhY0Z7fJTpeAF74ZBnE3b0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297677'),
  ('94875610870314413', 'The Egg and I', 1947, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Shaw, Jack Hively, Milton Krasner', 'Chester Erskine, Fred F. Finklehoffe', 'Claudette Colbert, Fred MacMurray, Marjorie Main, Louise Allbritton, Percy Kilbride, Richard Long, Billy House, Ida Moore', 'NR', 'World War II veteran Bob MacDonald surprises his new wife, Betty, by quitting his city job and moving them to a dilapidated farm in the country. While Betty gamely struggles with managing the crumbling house and holding off nosy neighbors and a recalcitrant pig, Bob makes plans for crops and livestock. The couple''s bliss is shaken by a visit from a beautiful farm owner, who seems to want more from Bob than just managing her property.', 'World War II veteran Bob MacDonald surprises his new wife, Betty, by quitting his city job and moving them to a dilapidated farm in the country. While Betty gamely struggles with managing the crumbling house and holding off nosy neighbors and a recalcitrant pig, Bob makes plans for crops and livestock. The couple''s bliss is shaken by a visit from a beautiful farm owner, who seems to want more from Bob than just managing her property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBQc0rPnQzbV6XbOlA6v3ETO2lU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42342'),
  ('139233479297503186', 'The Egg and Jerry', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Sara Berner', 'NR', 'A lost baby woodpecker, that believes Jerry is its mother, does everything it can to save the mouse from Tom, who is once again in pursuit. A CinemaScope remake of the 1949 Tom and Jerry cartoon Hatch Up Your Troubles.', 'A lost baby woodpecker, that believes Jerry is its mother, does everything it can to save the mouse from Tom, who is once again in pursuit. A CinemaScope remake of the 1949 Tom and Jerry cartoon Hatch Up Your Troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcsTzAnZcEKnVU5OiU6uLlWCKpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55559'),
  ('610094522166583047', 'The Egg and the Stone', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Ali Abdel-Khalek, Saeed Shimi', 'Mahmoud Abu Zaid', 'Ahmed Zaki, Maaly Zayed, Fouad Khalil, Mamdouh Wafi, Abd Allah Meshref, Hanem Mohamed, Abdel Ghani Naser, Sayed Sadek', null, 'A philosophy teacher finds himself and his ethics surrounded by a corrupt society, and as he''s mistaken for an exorcist and fortune-teller. He uses logic and psychological tricks to practice wizardry, until he masters it and controls people, meanwhile losing his ethics.', 'A philosophy teacher finds himself and his ethics surrounded by a corrupt society, and as he''s mistaken for an exorcist and fortune-teller. He uses logic and psychological tricks to practice wizardry, until he masters it and controls people, meanwhile losing his ethics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVfMxS6LBmpNTEwvzgdpcFP8wza.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320987'),
  ('795355229624198580', 'The Egyptian', 1954, 'History, Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Leon Shamroy', 'Casey Robinson, Philip Dunne', 'Edmund Purdom, Victor Mature, Peter Ustinov, Jean Simmons, Gene Tierney, Bella Darvi, Michael Wilding, Judith Evelyn', 'NR', 'In eighteenth-dynasty Egypt, Sinuhe, a poor orphan, becomes a brilliant physician and with his friend Horemheb is appointed to the service of the new Pharoah. Sinuhe''s personal triumphs and tragedies are played against the larger canvas of the turbulent events of the 18th dynasty. As Sinuhe is drawn into court intrigues he learns the answers to the questions he has sought since his birth.', 'In eighteenth-dynasty Egypt, Sinuhe, a poor orphan, becomes a brilliant physician and with his friend Horemheb is appointed to the service of the new Pharoah. Sinuhe''s personal triumphs and tragedies are played against the larger canvas of the turbulent events of the 18th dynasty. As Sinuhe is drawn into court intrigues he learns the answers to the questions he has sought since his birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYLY2YIGCWINPSzLg6tBiN6ub7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24973'),
  ('56617165660946699', 'The Egyptian Pyramids', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Olivier Lafay, Nicolas Mrikhi, Corentin Charron', 'Olivier Lafay, Nicolas Mrikhi, Corentin Charron', null, null, 'At an archaeological dig outside of Cairo, 1920, an amazing discovery is made, that could turn all previous knowledge of the pyramids on it''s head, all subject to a camel''s appetite.', 'At an archaeological dig outside of Cairo, 1920, an amazing discovery is made, that could turn all previous knowledge of the pyramids on it''s head, all subject to a camel''s appetite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PZoxBeAbybROmJoLHGvTWeTYuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442099'),
  ('541978732579462856', 'The Eichmann Show', 2015, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Carlos Catalán, Paul Andrew Williams', 'Simon Block', 'Anthony LaPaglia, Martin Freeman, Rebecca Front, Andy Nyman, Nicholas Woodeson, Ben Addis, Samuel West, Caroline Bartleet', null, 'The behind-the-scenes true life story of a groundbreaking producer, Milton Fruchtman, and blacklisted TV director Leo Hurwitz who, overcoming enormous obstacles, set out to capture the testimony of one of the war''s most notorious Nazis, Adolf Eichmann, who is accused of executing the ''final solution'' and organising the murder of 6 million Jews. This is the extraordinary story of how the trial came to be televised and the team that made it happen.', 'The behind-the-scenes true life story of a groundbreaking producer, Milton Fruchtman, and blacklisted TV director Leo Hurwitz who, overcoming enormous obstacles, set out to capture the testimony of one of the war''s most notorious Nazis, Adolf Eichmann, who is accused of executing the ''final solution'' and organising the murder of 6 million Jews. This is the extraordinary story of how the trial came to be televised and the team that made it happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cu8bEgtpX6ITxmI4JmiiCjU4OG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316715'),
  ('943291658760737741', 'The Eiffel Tower Mystery', 2015, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Léa Fazer, Philippe Guilbert', 'Elsa Marpeau, Mathieu Missoffe', 'Marie Denarnaud, Aïssa Maïga, Grégori Derangère, Bruno Debrandt, Quentin Baillot, Grégoire Bonnet, Camille Japy, Gunther Love', null, 'The daughter of one of the architects who built the Eiffel Tower gets framed for a murder that has taken place there, so she and her girlfriend embark on a quest across Paris to solve the mystery.', 'The daughter of one of the architects who built the Eiffel Tower gets framed for a murder that has taken place there, so she and her girlfriend embark on a quest across Paris to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/P9wQKQhsyCqOf5PjTyevXC8hEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430423'),
  ('1092434740253998305', 'The Eiger Sanction', 1975, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Clint Eastwood, Frank Stanley, James Fargo', 'Hal Dresner, Warren Murphy, Trevanian', 'Clint Eastwood, George Kennedy, Vonetta McGee, Jack Cassidy, Heidi Brühl, Thayer David, Reiner Schöne, Michael Grimm', 'R', 'A classical art professor and collector, who doubles as a professional assassin, is coerced out of retirement to avenge the murder of an old friend.', 'A classical art professor and collector, who doubles as a professional assassin, is coerced out of retirement to avenge the murder of an old friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8654SvWhTdWQZ84C4NlidPqMBTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20187'),
  ('426063630164864708', 'The Eight Hundred', 2020, 'War, History, Drama, Action', 'Yu Fei, Fu Xiaojie, Guan Hu', 'Zhao Ningyu, Zhang Xiaobei, Zhao Dongling', 'Wang Qianyuan, Zhang Yi, Huang Zhizhong, Jiang Wu, Ou Hao, Du Chun, Vision Wei, Tang Yixin', null, 'In 1937, eight hundred Chinese soldiers fight under siege from a warehouse in the middle of the Shanghai battlefield, completely surrounded by the Japanese army.', 'In 1937, eight hundred Chinese soldiers fight under siege from a warehouse in the middle of the Shanghai battlefield, completely surrounded by the Japanese army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWKYKGDLEMCSAyjQ1e0rpBSoRMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508935'),
  ('731746269999055390', 'The Eighteenth Angel', 1997, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'William Bindley, Thomas E. Ackerman', 'David Seltzer', 'Christopher McDonald, Rachael Leigh Cook, Maximilian Schell, Stanley Tucci, Wendy Crewson, Cosimo Fusco, Venantino Venantini, Ted Rusoff', null, 'Mythology and religious dogma are slowly revealed when an attractive young woman is approached by a modeling agency that pulls her into an underworld of priests that are not Christian but rather want to resurrect Satan by collecting the souls of 18 beautiful children.', 'Mythology and religious dogma are slowly revealed when an attractive young woman is approached by a modeling agency that pulls her into an underworld of priests that are not Christian but rather want to resurrect Satan by collecting the souls of 18 beautiful children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7t4aLbYvnw6ktvC50W6On5Iw9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33695'),
  ('803091912279343905', 'The Eighth Clause', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Koko Stambuk, Eduardo Flores Torres', 'Frank Ariza, Mario Tardón', 'Maite Perroni, Manuel Vega, Óscar Jaenada, Jessica Coch, Paulina Dávila, Christian Meier, Michel Duval, Mario Tardón', null, 'Kat and Borja appear to be a perfect couple, but as in every marriage they keep secrets, lies and infidelities that will come to light the night an unexpected visitor arrives.', 'Kat and Borja appear to be a perfect couple, but as in every marriage they keep secrets, lies and infidelities that will come to light the night an unexpected visitor arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CbVMeLvaGn87gx05waiIJ0JySr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841524'),
  ('202885009403427421', 'The Eighth Day', 1996, 'Drama', 'Jaco Van Dormael, Walther van den Ende, Renaud Alcalde', 'Jaco Van Dormael', 'Daniel Auteuil, Pascal Duquenne, Miou-Miou, Henri Garcin, Isabelle Sadoyan, Fabienne Loriaux, Juliette Van Dormael, Sabrina Leurquin', 'NR', 'Georges has Down syndrome, living at a mental-institution, Harry is a busy businessman, giving lectures for young aspiring salesmen. He is successful in his business life, but his social life is a disaster since his wife left him and took their two children with her. This weekend his children came by train to meet him, but Harry, working as always, forgot to pick them up. Neither his wife or his children want to see him again and he is driving around on the country roads, anguished and angry. He almost runs over Georges, on the run from the institution since everybody else went home with their parents except him, whose mother is dead. Harry tries to get rid of Georges but he won''t leave his new friend. Eventually a special friendship forms between the two of them, a friendship which makes Harry a different person.', 'Georges has Down syndrome, living at a mental-institution, Harry is a busy businessman, giving lectures for young aspiring salesmen. He is successful in his business life, but his social life is a disaster since his wife left him and took their two children with her. This weekend his children came by train to meet him, but Harry, working as always, forgot to pick them up. Neither his wife or his children want to see him again and he is driving around on the country roads, anguished and angry. He almost runs over Georges, on the run from the institution since everybody else went home with their parents except him, whose mother is dead. Harry tries to get rid of Georges but he won''t leave his new friend. Eventually a special friendship forms between the two of them, a friendship which makes Harry a different person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgpJTvFcd0NJyJRTKYaBoLMuqdW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36998'),
  ('694892429270601514', 'The Eighth Happiness', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Johnnie To, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Paul Chan', 'Philip Cheng Chung-Tai, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Edward Li Gui-Ming', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Chow Yun-Fat, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Petrina Fung Bo-Bo, Carol Cheng, Cherie Chung Cho-Hung, Fennie Yuen Kit-Ying, Wong Kwan-Yuen', null, 'Three oddball brothers go looking for love but unfortunately, their out-there personalities get in the way!', 'Three oddball brothers go looking for love but unfortunately, their out-there personalities get in the way!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JK6uTja6H73COk4MJkpKNsy6va.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93487'),
  ('698121990573684600', 'The Einstein of Sex: Life and Work of Dr. M. Hirschfeld', 2000, 'Drama, History', 'Rosa von Praunheim, Elfi Mikesch', 'Valentin Passoni, Chris Kraus', 'Friedel von Wangenheim, Kai Schumann, Ben Becker, Wolfgang Völz, Otto Sander, Meret Becker, Olaf Drauschke, Peter Ehrlich', null, 'The life story of Dr. Magnus Hirschfeld, a German Jew, who as a physician established the field of sexology, and fought militantly against German anti-sodomy laws in the late 19th century. The script reveals main characters in Hirschfeld''s life including impossible love interest Baron von Teschenberg, and Hirschfeld''s aids- young Karl Giese and guardian angel, the transvestite Dorchen, as they establish the First Institute of Sexual Sciences in Berlin in 1920, and follows their struggles to keep it open, up to the rise of the Third Reich in the mid 1930s.', 'The life story of Dr. Magnus Hirschfeld, a German Jew, who as a physician established the field of sexology, and fought militantly against German anti-sodomy laws in the late 19th century. The script reveals main characters in Hirschfeld''s life including impossible love interest Baron von Teschenberg, and Hirschfeld''s aids- young Karl Giese and guardian angel, the transvestite Dorchen, as they establish the First Institute of Sexual Sciences in Berlin in 1920, and follows their struggles to keep it open, up to the rise of the Third Reich in the mid 1930s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rThpyQVqqWpULcXpM7w4AWZcRsb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47589'),
  ('854503204153851964', 'The Elder Son', 1975, 'Drama', 'Vitaliy Melnikov, Yuriy Veksler, Konstantin Lashkov', 'Vitaliy Melnikov', 'Evgeni Leonov, Natalya Yegorova, Nikolai Karachentsov, Mikhail Boyarskiy, Svetlana Kryuchkova, Vladimir Izotov, Nikolai Nikolayev-Nikolsky', null, 'Two students are late for the last commuter train and have to spend a night in a strange town. They rack their brains about where to find shelter and quite by chance they overhear a talk between father and son. The son is an adolescent who is head over heels in love with a girl several years his senior. He is living through the first drama of his life though his love is just puppy love. Then, being resourceful fellows, they think of a plan to pass one of them for the elder son of this family. The reason they give for his unexpected arrival is that he is a child of the father''s long-forsaken love. They presume this cock-and-bull story will come off, and right they are!', 'Two students are late for the last commuter train and have to spend a night in a strange town. They rack their brains about where to find shelter and quite by chance they overhear a talk between father and son. The son is an adolescent who is head over heels in love with a girl several years his senior. He is living through the first drama of his life though his love is just puppy love. Then, being resourceful fellows, they think of a plan to pass one of them for the elder son of this family. The reason they give for his unexpected arrival is that he is a child of the father''s long-forsaken love. They presume this cock-and-bull story will come off, and right they are!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nigRHI7YOr50HXRQeG7VbR0YkAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65107'),
  ('910549727281727838', 'The Elder Son', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Maryus Vaysberg, Andrew Huebscher', 'Maryus Vaysberg, Scott Sturgeon', 'Shane West, Leelee Sobieski, Eric Balfour, Rade Šerbedžija, Reiley McClendon, Ivana Miličević, Regina Hall, Brian Geraghty', 'R', 'A thief on the run convinces a single father that he is his long-lost son. Complications ensue when he falls in love with his newfound "sister".', 'A thief on the run convinces a single father that he is his long-lost son. Complications ensue when he falls in love with his newfound "sister".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLOV35EhKh996Mjhy9YeACMRQ4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30367'),
  ('702966403157711305', 'The Elderly', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Fernando González Gómez, Raúl Cerezo', 'Rubén Sánchez Trigos, Javier Trigales, Raúl Cerezo', 'Irene Anula, Zorion Eguileor, Josele Román, Paula Gallego, Juan Acedo, Gustavo Salmerón, Carmen Ibeas', null, 'An octogenarian named Manuel falls into a state of dementia after the sudden suicide of his wife, sparking a series of paranormal events that will put his family’s lives at risk.', 'An octogenarian named Manuel falls into a state of dementia after the sudden suicide of his wife, sparking a series of paranormal events that will put his family’s lives at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrnpp4PwwOHUapDr1kwxH59k6Z6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994128'),
  ('691724765685640581', 'The Eleanor Roosevelt Story', 1965, 'Documentary', 'Richard Kaplan', null, null, null, 'An intimate and moving portrait of one of the most remarkable women in American history. It is the story of a lonely, unhappy child who became the most admired and respected woman in the world. Richard Kaplan''s lively documentary reveals the human face behind the American icon, beginning with the emotional deprivation suffered by this plain, awkward little girl born into a socially prominent and powerful family. Though she would eventually marry a man who would look beyond her awkwardness, Eleanor was not content to be the proper, silent wife to her husband Franklin''s extraordinary political career. Instead, she began a lifelong crusade to speak out about injustice and oppression in any form. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'An intimate and moving portrait of one of the most remarkable women in American history. It is the story of a lonely, unhappy child who became the most admired and respected woman in the world. Richard Kaplan''s lively documentary reveals the human face behind the American icon, beginning with the emotional deprivation suffered by this plain, awkward little girl born into a socially prominent and powerful family. Though she would eventually marry a man who would look beyond her awkwardness, Eleanor was not content to be the proper, silent wife to her husband Franklin''s extraordinary political career. Instead, she began a lifelong crusade to speak out about injustice and oppression in any form. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMO0xStAEaDe5QAJezwhrjrodxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114510'),
  ('472618894355005786', 'The Electric Horseman', 1979, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy, Western', 'Owen Roizman, Sydney Pollack, Bart Roe', 'Robert Garland', 'Robert Redford, Jane Fonda, Valerie Perrine, Willie Nelson, John Saxon, Nicolas Coster, Allan Arbus, Wilford Brimley', 'PG', 'A former champion rodeo rider is reduced to using his saddle skills to promote a breakfast cereal in a gaudy Las Vegas show. When he''s asked to perform with a $12 million horse, he discovers it is being doped to remain docile. He flees into the desert astride the beast in an act of defiance. A story-hungry female reporter gives chase.', 'A former champion rodeo rider is reduced to using his saddle skills to promote a breakfast cereal in a gaudy Las Vegas show. When he''s asked to perform with a $12 million horse, he discovers it is being doped to remain docile. He flees into the desert astride the beast in an act of defiance. A story-hungry female reporter gives chase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9wifiDa8q7oK4GIBpJnUjGVSww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11145'),
  ('659551191194327727', 'The Electric Hotel', 1908, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Segundo de Chomón', 'Segundo de Chomón, Julienne Mathieu', 'Segundo de Chomón, Julienne Mathieu', null, 'An enthusiastic young couple is astounded with modern technology''s giant leaps in the fascinating field of electricity.', 'An enthusiastic young couple is astounded with modern technology''s giant leaps in the fascinating field of electricity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDFG4dCpIkyBFU3oKuuA8tiSPcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143634'),
  ('158942646422920635', 'The Electric House', 1922, 'Comedy', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline', 'Buster Keaton, Virginia Fox, Joe Keaton, Louise Keaton, Myra Keaton, Steve Murphy, Joe Roberts', null, 'Botany major Buster mistakenly graduates in electrical engineering and is hired to wire a new home.', 'Botany major Buster mistakenly graduates in electrical engineering and is hired to wire a new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWD82Oq8FLH5VGpIpS2c3lwAwIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51366'),
  ('986628885110073986', 'The Electric State', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Stephen F. Windon, Joe Russo, Anthony Russo', 'Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely', 'Millie Bobby Brown, Chris Pratt, Ke Huy Quan, Jason Alexander, Woody Norman, Giancarlo Esposito, Stanley Tucci, Woody Harrelson', 'PG-13', 'An orphaned teen hits the road with a mysterious robot to find her long-lost brother, teaming up with a smuggler and his wisecracking sidekick.', 'An orphaned teen hits the road with a mysterious robot to find her long-lost brother, teaming up with a smuggler and his wisecracking sidekick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tn6gDIrQMwHSivF01igLfbggmYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777443'),
  ('233881799702479760', 'The Electrical Life of Louis Wain', 2021, 'Drama, History, Comedy', 'Erik Wilson, Caroline Barclay, Will Sharpe', 'Simon Stephenson, Will Sharpe', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Claire Foy, Andrea Riseborough, Toby Jones, Sharon Rooney, Aimee Lou Wood, Hayley Squires, Stacy Martin', 'PG-13', 'The extraordinary true story of eccentric British artist Louis Wain, whose playful, sometimes even psychedelic pictures helped to transform the public''s perception of cats forever.', 'The extraordinary true story of eccentric British artist Louis Wain, whose playful, sometimes even psychedelic pictures helped to transform the public''s perception of cats forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmlul0Y8KBXPqJ0LUcTfsCoRcoI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617762'),
  ('1025320311601071548', 'The Elegant Criminal', 1990, 'Drama', 'Francis Girod, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Georges Conchon, Francis Girod', 'Daniel Auteuil, Jean Poiret, Jacques Weber, François Périer, Geneviève Casile, Jean Davy, Jacques Duby, Paul Le Person', null, 'On 9 January 1836, Pierre Lacenaire goes to the guillotine, a murderer and a thief. He gives Allard, a police inspector, his life story, written while awaiting execution. He also asks Allard to care for Hermine, a lass to whom he has been guardian for more than ten years. In flashbacks, from the prison as Lacenaire writes, from Allard''s study as he and Hermine read, and from other readers'' memory after the book is published, we see Lacenaire''s childhood as he stands up to bullies, including priests, his youthful thieving, his first murder, his brief army career, his seduction of a princess, and his affair with Avril, a young man who dies beside him.', 'On 9 January 1836, Pierre Lacenaire goes to the guillotine, a murderer and a thief. He gives Allard, a police inspector, his life story, written while awaiting execution. He also asks Allard to care for Hermine, a lass to whom he has been guardian for more than ten years. In flashbacks, from the prison as Lacenaire writes, from Allard''s study as he and Hermine read, and from other readers'' memory after the book is published, we see Lacenaire''s childhood as he stands up to bullies, including priests, his youthful thieving, his first murder, his brief army career, his seduction of a princess, and his affair with Avril, a young man who dies beside him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdyPm1TaaB3EOttjtjj20rOjbHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70458'),
  ('175471382129044317', 'The Elegant Life of Mr. Everyman', 1963, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Hiroshi Murai, Michio Yamamoto', 'Toshiro Ide', 'Keiju Kobayashi, Michiyo Aratama, Eijirō Tōno, Jerry Itō, Tadao Nakamaru, Michino Yokoyama, Akihiko Hirata, Tatsuyoshi Ehara', null, 'A salaryman''s drunken ravings in public attract the attention of journalists who coerce him into telling them his life''s story.', 'A salaryman''s drunken ravings in public attract the attention of journalists who coerce him into telling them his life''s story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0Yn1D0eCvyI2y4sOm3q86KFML6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85016'),
  ('596463459966190278', 'The Element of Crime', 1984, 'Crime, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Lars von Trier, Tom Elling, Åke Sandgren', 'Lars von Trier, Niels Vørsel', 'Michael Elphick, Esmond Knight, Me Me Lai, Jerold Wells, Ahmed El Shenawi, Astrid Henning-Jensen, Janos Hersko, Stig Larsson', 'NR', 'Fisher, an ex-detective, decides to take one final case when a mysterious serial killer claims the lives of several young girls. Fisher, unable to find the culprit, turns to Osbourne, a writer who was once respected for his contributions to the field of criminology. Fisher begins to use Osbourne''s technique, which involves empathizing with serial killers; however, as the detective becomes increasingly engrossed in this method, things take a disturbing turn.', 'Fisher, an ex-detective, decides to take one final case when a mysterious serial killer claims the lives of several young girls. Fisher, unable to find the culprit, turns to Osbourne, a writer who was once respected for his contributions to the field of criminology. Fisher begins to use Osbourne''s technique, which involves empathizing with serial killers; however, as the detective becomes increasingly engrossed in this method, things take a disturbing turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfg5KUOdR4bfoPiDf63LVG7mlfw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9063'),
  ('1115195540336755815', 'The Elementary Particles', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carl-Friedrich Koschnick, Oskar Roehler', 'Oskar Roehler', 'Christian Ulmen, Moritz Bleibtreu, Martina Gedeck, Franka Potente, Nina Hoss, Corinna Harfouch, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Jasmin Tabatabai', null, 'Based on Michel Houellebecq''s controversial novel, Atomised (aka The Elementary Particles) focuses on Michael and Bruno, two very different half-brothers and their disturbed sexuality. After a chaotic childhood with a hippie mother only caring for her affairs, Michael, a molecular biologist, is more interested in genes than women, while Bruno is obsessed with his sexual desires, but mostly finds his satisfaction with prostitutes. But Bruno''s life changes when he gets to know the experienced Christiane. In the meantime, Michael meets Annabelle, the love of his youth, again.', 'Based on Michel Houellebecq''s controversial novel, Atomised (aka The Elementary Particles) focuses on Michael and Bruno, two very different half-brothers and their disturbed sexuality. After a chaotic childhood with a hippie mother only caring for her affairs, Michael, a molecular biologist, is more interested in genes than women, while Bruno is obsessed with his sexual desires, but mostly finds his satisfaction with prostitutes. But Bruno''s life changes when he gets to know the experienced Christiane. In the meantime, Michael meets Annabelle, the love of his youth, again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpGpR7GewyApPgqPvuWadBAfmFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86'),
  ('524870944773139169', 'The Elementary School', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jan Svěrák, F. A. Brabec, František Nejedlý', 'Zdeněk Svěrák', 'Václav Jakoubek, Radoslav Budáč, Jan Tříska, Zdeněk Svěrák, Libuše Šafránková, Rudolf Hrušínský, Marek Endal, Irena Pavlásková', null, 'The time is 1945-46. 10 year old Eda and his friend Tonda live in a small village outside Prague. In school, their class is so wild and indisciplined that their teacher quits and is replaced by the militant Igor Hnidzo. He is very strict – but also very fair. His weakness though, is his interest in young women.', 'The time is 1945-46. 10 year old Eda and his friend Tonda live in a small village outside Prague. In school, their class is so wild and indisciplined that their teacher quits and is replaced by the militant Igor Hnidzo. He is very strict – but also very fair. His weakness though, is his interest in young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zki69hEHaqyirdq7mn5Qq1FRVgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18141'),
  ('64983313305750361', 'The Elephant and the Butterfly', 2017, 'Drama, Family', 'Amélie van Elmbt, Éric Gautier', 'Amélie van Elmbt, Matthieu de Braconier', 'Lina Doillon, Thomas Blanchard, Judith Chemla, Alice de Lencquesaing, Isabelle Barth', null, 'When her babysitter doesn’t show, a single mother is forced to leave her precocious five-year-old daughter with the girl’s estranged father for a long weekend.', 'When her babysitter doesn’t show, a single mother is forced to leave her precocious five-year-old daughter with the girl’s estranged father for a long weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15ptRIWnTLPmRJbE1f84noUGAEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479813'),
  ('680028584509578500', 'The Elephant God', 1979, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Soumitra Chatterjee, Siddhartha Chatterjee, Santosh Dutta, Utpal Dutt, Parinita Banerjee, Satya Banerjee, Jit Bose, Bimal Chatterjee', null, 'Set in the holy city of Benares, this is the second film about the detective Feluda, who goes on a holiday with his cousin, Topshe, and his friend, Lalmohan Ganguly. But the theft of a priceless deity of Lord Ganesh (the Elephant God) from a local household forces him to investigate.', 'Set in the holy city of Benares, this is the second film about the detective Feluda, who goes on a holiday with his cousin, Topshe, and his friend, Lalmohan Ganguly. But the theft of a priceless deity of Lord Ganesh (the Elephant God) from a local household forces him to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZMp9DeEuZDsNS9rOE0QzBo39ZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165432'),
  ('1053266140375282585', 'The Elephant Queen', 2019, 'Documentary, Family', 'Mark Deeble, Victoria Stone', 'Mark Deeble', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor', 'PG', 'Embark on an epic journey of family, courage, and coming home in this feature-length documentary. Join Athena, the majestic matriarch, as she leads her elephant herd across an unforgiving African landscape filled with vibrant wildlife.', 'Embark on an epic journey of family, courage, and coming home in this feature-length documentary. Join Athena, the majestic matriarch, as she leads her elephant herd across an unforgiving African landscape filled with vibrant wildlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26hkYwRR6VsdjoelsOLpB5Cx1HD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541572'),
