  ('913055669464969642', 'The Elixir', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kimo Stamboel, Zahra Yuni Alda, Lisya Jasman', 'Kimo Stamboel, Agasyah Karim, Khalid Kashogi', 'Mikha Tambayong, Eva Celia, Marthino Lio, Dimas Anggara, Varen Arianda Calief, Ardit Erwandha, Claresta Taufan, Donny Damara', 'R', 'An elixir unleashes the undead in a village. A family at odds with one another must unite and fight to survive as their hometown collapses.', 'An elixir unleashes the undead in a village. A family at odds with one another must unite and fight to survive as their hometown collapses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6aJLPhtmin9ZTWC2h7dnrMHU4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1306525'),
