  ('720626582554164511', 'The Elm Chanted Forest', 1986, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Milan Blažeković', 'Sunčana Škrinjarić, Fred P. Sharkey', null, null, 'A painter falls asleep beneath a magical elm tree and awakens with magical powers that allow him to communicate with the creatures of the forest. In the limited time that he possesses these powers, he must help save the forest from the threat of the evil Cactus King.', 'A painter falls asleep beneath a magical elm tree and awakens with magical powers that allow him to communicate with the creatures of the forest. In the limited time that he possesses these powers, he must help save the forest from the threat of the evil Cactus King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CNba7hKs6wCkDyfGOH0wGfYAz2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38832'),
  ('983068064719640785', 'The Eloquent Peasant', 1970, 'History, Drama', 'Shadi Abdel Salam, Mustafa Imam', 'Shadi Abdel Salam', 'Ahmed Marei, Ahmad Anan, Ahmed Hegazi', null, 'Based on one of the major literary texts survived from the Middle Kingdom, the classical period of Egyptian literature, The Eloquent Peasant is a combination of a morality/folk tale and a poem. The events are set between 2160 and 2025 BC. When the peasant Khun-anup and his donkey stumble upon the lands of the noble Rensi, the peasant’s goods are confiscated and he’s unjustly accused of theft. The peasant petitions Rensi who is so taken by the peasant’s eloquence that he report his astonishing discovery to the king. The king realises the peasant has been wronged but delays judgement so as to he can hear more of his eloquence. The peasant makes a total of nine petitions until finally, his goods are returned.', 'Based on one of the major literary texts survived from the Middle Kingdom, the classical period of Egyptian literature, The Eloquent Peasant is a combination of a morality/folk tale and a poem. The events are set between 2160 and 2025 BC. When the peasant Khun-anup and his donkey stumble upon the lands of the noble Rensi, the peasant’s goods are confiscated and he’s unjustly accused of theft. The peasant petitions Rensi who is so taken by the peasant’s eloquence that he report his astonishing discovery to the king. The king realises the peasant has been wronged but delays judgement so as to he can hear more of his eloquence. The peasant makes a total of nine petitions until finally, his goods are returned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jzM9IOzPhPzTZk1S44nsyI9ln5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249621'),
  ('762586232512994112', 'The Elusive Corporal', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Jean Renoir, Georges Leclerc', 'Guy Lefranc, Jean Renoir', 'Jean-Pierre Cassel, Claude Brasseur, Claude Rich, Jacques Jouanneau, Mario David, Jean Carmet, Philippe Castelli, Guy Bedos', null, 'An upper-class corporal is captured by the Germans during their 1940 invasion of France. Assisted and accompanied by characters as diverse as a morose dairy farmer, a waiter, a myopic intellectual, a working-class Parisian, and a German dental assistant, the corporal tries to escape from prison camps, sometimes making it a few yards, sometimes reaching the border.', 'An upper-class corporal is captured by the Germans during their 1940 invasion of France. Assisted and accompanied by characters as diverse as a morose dairy farmer, a waiter, a myopic intellectual, a working-class Parisian, and a German dental assistant, the corporal tries to escape from prison camps, sometimes making it a few yards, sometimes reaching the border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32gR2wkvNQr7GoJpDiCfHFoNL72.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43000'),
  ('1128903193445868539', 'The Elusive Revengers', 1967, 'Action, Adventure, Family', 'Edmond Keosayan, Fyodor Dobronravov, German Shimkovich', 'Edmond Keosayan, Sergey Yermolinsky', 'Vasiliy Vasilev, Viktor Kosykh, Valentina Kurdyukova, Mikhail Metyolkin, Lev Sverdlin, Efim Kopelyan, Vladimir Belokurov, Vladimir Treshchalov', null, 'Danka''s and Ksanka''s childhood in the village brutally ends when their father is killed by a White Guard officer in front of their eyes. Seeking revenge, they join forces with Valerka, an intellectual from big city, and the gipsy Yashka, but before they can get close to their enemy they have to help their village and the advancing Red Army.', 'Danka''s and Ksanka''s childhood in the village brutally ends when their father is killed by a White Guard officer in front of their eyes. Seeking revenge, they join forces with Valerka, an intellectual from big city, and the gipsy Yashka, but before they can get close to their enemy they have to help their village and the advancing Red Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94rCowBW6NyvyWg3gI3S1nbZq1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41979'),
  ('1083513253276798605', 'The Elusive Summer of ''68', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Goran Paskaljević', 'Goran Paskaljević, Gordan Mihić', 'Slavko Štimac, Danilo ''Bata'' Stojković, Mira Banjac, Milosav ''Mija'' Aleksić, Neda Arnerić, Dragana Varagić, Sanja Vejnović, Ivana Mihić', null, 'For the young man who lives in Serbian province town, the maturing coincides with the turbulent political events of the year 1968.', 'For the young man who lives in Serbian province town, the maturing coincides with the turbulent political events of the year 1968.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9h6MIgZTPUzbwNLVTHgk57T3kT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148034'),
  ('959598417865456009', 'The Embalmer', 1965, 'Horror', 'Dino Tavella', 'Dino Tavella', 'Maureen Brown, Luigi Martocci, Luciano Gasper, Anita Todesco, Francesco Bagarin, Alba Brotto, William Caruso, Viki Castillo', null, 'A mad killer is loose in Venice''s catacombs. He attacks the beautiful women, releasing them into the underworld, kill them and then stop them and add them to his "collection".', 'A mad killer is loose in Venice''s catacombs. He attacks the beautiful women, releasing them into the underworld, kill them and then stop them and add them to his "collection".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rkbpphABFkmq2x68yeKgs69jtq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104921'),
  ('1012495921937387316', 'The Embalmer', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Matteo Garrone, Marco Onorato, Salvatore Sansone', 'Massimo Gaudioso, Ugo Chiti, Matteo Garrone', 'Ernesto Mahieux, Valerio Foglia Manzillo, Elisabetta Rocchetti, Lina Bernardi, Pietro Biondi, Marcella Granito, Beppe Arena, Bernardino Terracciano', null, 'Peppino, a diminutive taxidermist with a reputation for sleaziness, meets Valerio, a handsome if artless much younger man fascinated by the trade. Peppino offers him a large salary to be his assistant—the job burgeoning into a budding friendship he mistakes for something more. When Valerio gets a girlfriend, their fledgling romance will be threatened by an insanely jealous third wheel.', 'Peppino, a diminutive taxidermist with a reputation for sleaziness, meets Valerio, a handsome if artless much younger man fascinated by the trade. Peppino offers him a large salary to be his assistant—the job burgeoning into a budding friendship he mistakes for something more. When Valerio gets a girlfriend, their fledgling romance will be threatened by an insanely jealous third wheel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pT9Maaop1epDYWiXEO11NcuR25R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35265'),
  ('1102256129765420819', 'The Embassy', 1973, 'Drama', 'Chris Marker', 'Chris Marker', null, null, 'After a military coup d''état, political dissidents seek refuge in a foreign embassy. Over the next few days, they are joined by more and more people who are fleeing the military assault: teachers, students, intellectuals, artists, and politicians.', 'After a military coup d''état, political dissidents seek refuge in a foreign embassy. Over the next few days, they are joined by more and more people who are fleeing the military assault: teachers, students, intellectuals, artists, and politicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ao1JZAiDRpuOZ57BJOPtwqzycx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130872'),
  ('468970056675716912', 'The Embassy in the Building', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ahmad Al-Sayed, Amr Arafa, Wael Darwish', 'Youssef Maaty', 'Adel Emam, Dalia AlBehery, Lotfy Labib, Khaled Zaki, Ahmad Rateb, Maysara, Khaled Sarhan, Ezzat Abu Ouf', null, 'The film revolves around an engineer working for an oil company in Dubai. He had to return to Egypt after twenty years. He was surprised that the Israeli Embassy was next to his apartment and was trying hard to sell the apartment at first.', 'The film revolves around an engineer working for an oil company in Dubai. He had to return to Egypt after twenty years. He was surprised that the Israeli Embassy was next to his apartment and was trying hard to sell the apartment at first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmbzuPcfrL2fKQxbmuvPFubCW3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86911'),
  ('705029983517198234', 'The Embryo Hunts in Secret', 1966, 'Drama, Crime, Horror', 'Kōji Wakamatsu, Hideo Itō, Masao Adachi', 'Masao Adachi', 'Hatsuo Yamaya, Miharu Shima, Masao Adachi', null, 'A man keeps his girlfriend tied up in his small apartment and tortures her. She is undressed, subjected to various types of bondage, whipped, and tortured with a razor blade.', 'A man keeps his girlfriend tied up in his small apartment and tortures her. She is undressed, subjected to various types of bondage, whipped, and tortured with a razor blade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toZtX7MQy35fxMrfRo3KNLgB9An.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31319'),
  ('1145195948293791406', 'The Emerald Forest', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Philippe Rousselot, John Boorman', 'Rospo Pallenberg', 'Powers Boothe, Charley Boorman, Meg Foster, Estee Chandler, Dira Paes, Eduardo Conde, Ariel Coelho, Peter Marinker', 'R', 'For ten years, engineer Bill Markham has searched tirelessly for his son Tommy who disappeared from the edge of the Brazilian rainforest. Miraculously, he finds the boy living among the reclusive Amazon tribe who adopted him. And that''s when Bill''s adventure truly begins. For his son is now a grown tribesman who moves skillfully through this beautiful-but-dangerous terrain, fearful only of those who would exploit it. And as Bill attempts to "rescue" him from the savagery of the untamed jungle, Tommy challenges Bill''s idea of true civilization and his notions about who needs rescuing.', 'For ten years, engineer Bill Markham has searched tirelessly for his son Tommy who disappeared from the edge of the Brazilian rainforest. Miraculously, he finds the boy living among the reclusive Amazon tribe who adopted him. And that''s when Bill''s adventure truly begins. For his son is now a grown tribesman who moves skillfully through this beautiful-but-dangerous terrain, fearful only of those who would exploit it. And as Bill attempts to "rescue" him from the savagery of the untamed jungle, Tommy challenges Bill''s idea of true civilization and his notions about who needs rescuing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdRlqPnPFaPyQqS3KiBLJwWQPBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11532'),
  ('1150212783784092689', 'The Emergency Exit', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Roman Załuski', 'Andrzej Mularczyk', 'Bożena Dykiel, Jerzy Michotek, Maria Gładkowska, Andrzej Golejewski, Krzysztof Kowalewski, Ferdynand Matysik, Jadwiga Skupnik, Zbigniew Buczkowski', null, 'A provincial town in the early 1980s. Among its residents is the Kolęda family. Mrs. Kolęda is an energetic community leader, her husband, a gentle soul, takes care of raising ducks and cultivating flowers in "tunnels" at home. Their daughter, Dorota, is a pretty and unemployed young woman. The intrigue begins when the community leader finds out that she is going to become a grandmother. Fear of losing authority, scandal, and embarrassment inspires her to come up with a truly diabolical idea - they need to buy a fiancé for Dorota with a pre-arranged divorce.', 'A provincial town in the early 1980s. Among its residents is the Kolęda family. Mrs. Kolęda is an energetic community leader, her husband, a gentle soul, takes care of raising ducks and cultivating flowers in "tunnels" at home. Their daughter, Dorota, is a pretty and unemployed young woman. The intrigue begins when the community leader finds out that she is going to become a grandmother. Fear of losing authority, scandal, and embarrassment inspires her to come up with a truly diabolical idea - they need to buy a fiancé for Dorota with a pre-arranged divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z63ssucvU2wF9E1smuqOEk6WOFl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38869'),
  ('875755848150886751', 'The Emigrant', 1994, 'Drama, History', 'Youssef Chahine, Sameh El Sayed, Hesham Soliman', 'Youssef Chahine, Rafik El Saban, Khaled Youssef', 'Khaled El Nabawy, Yousra, Mahmoud Hemida, Ahmad Bedir, Safia ElEmary, Hanan Turk, Michel Piccoli, Seif Abdelrahman', null, 'The biblical tale of Joseph is told from an Egyptian perspective in this interesting character study. In this film, Joseph is called Ram. Ram, tired of his family''s backward superstitious life, and tired of being picked on by his brothers, wants to go to Egypt to study agriculture. His brothers travel with him across Sinai, but then suddenly sell him to Ozir, an Egyptian who works for a Theban military leader, Amihar. Amihar is impressed by Ram''s drive and personal charm and so grants Ram some desolate land outside the capital. Ram soon finds himself a pawn in the political and sexual games between Amihar and his wife Simihit, a high priestess of the Cult of Amun.', 'The biblical tale of Joseph is told from an Egyptian perspective in this interesting character study. In this film, Joseph is called Ram. Ram, tired of his family''s backward superstitious life, and tired of being picked on by his brothers, wants to go to Egypt to study agriculture. His brothers travel with him across Sinai, but then suddenly sell him to Ozir, an Egyptian who works for a Theban military leader, Amihar. Amihar is impressed by Ram''s drive and personal charm and so grants Ram some desolate land outside the capital. Ram soon finds himself a pawn in the political and sexual games between Amihar and his wife Simihit, a high priestess of the Cult of Amun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKndICPaIJpPUpwJXFZ6ly6xAt5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96428'),
  ('302020144546439623', 'The Emigrants', 1971, 'Drama, History, Western', 'Jan Troell, Jan Troell', 'Bengt Forslund, Jan Troell', 'Max von Sydow, Liv Ullmann, Eddie Axberg, Sven-Olof Bern, Aina Alfredsson, Allan Edwall, Monica Zetterlund, Pierre Lindstedt', 'PG', 'Karl and Kristina Nilsson work on a farm in a cold and desolate area of 19th century rural Sweden. Growing privations, combined with increasing social and religious persecution, motivate the Nilssons and many of their neighbors to strike out for the United States. Following a treacherous ocean crossing and an equally grueling land passage, the emigrants find themselves in seemingly idyllic Minnesota.', 'Karl and Kristina Nilsson work on a farm in a cold and desolate area of 19th century rural Sweden. Growing privations, combined with increasing social and religious persecution, motivate the Nilssons and many of their neighbors to strike out for the United States. Following a treacherous ocean crossing and an equally grueling land passage, the emigrants find themselves in seemingly idyllic Minnesota.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsYcKVArVbz7afITdTiOEAznDCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40732'),
  ('826888046420498973', 'The Emigrants', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Erik Poppe, John Christian Rosenlund, Alexandra Burca', 'Anna Bache-Wiig, Siv Rajendram Eliassen', 'Lisa Carlehed, Gustaf Skarsgård, Tove Lo, Lena Strömdahl, Sofia Helin, Nova Salmi-Wikander, Díana Bermudez, James Longshore', null, 'Sweden, 1849. A poverty-stricken family decides to move to America in the hope of finding a better and more prosperous life. Although they know the journey will be dangerous and the pressure of facing a new life in a strange and wild land is great, they are determined to succeed.', 'Sweden, 1849. A poverty-stricken family decides to move to America in the hope of finding a better and more prosperous life. Although they know the journey will be dangerous and the pressure of facing a new life in a strange and wild land is great, they are determined to succeed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMEg2ed0KZAA9kB2vDnfkU7Uduq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744733'),
  ('551948428800196805', 'The Eminence in Shadow: Lost Echoes', null, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kazuya Nakanishi', 'Kanichi Kato', 'Seiichiro Yamashita', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxrLc5uCK3s7qlb4aJU4aNTOJZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1220552'),
  ('195431465100173371', 'The Emoji Movie', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Tony Leondis', 'Tony Leondis, Eric Siegel, Mike White', 'T.J. Miller, James Corden, Anna Faris, Maya Rudolph, Steven Wright, Jennifer Coolidge, Jake T. Austin, Christina Aguilera', 'PG', 'Gene, a multi-expressional emoji, sets out on a journey to become a normal emoji.', 'Gene, a multi-expressional emoji, sets out on a journey to become a normal emoji.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60bTx5z9zL1AqCjZ0gmWoRMJ6Bb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378236'),
  ('345279532587210316', 'The Emperor and His Brother', 1981, 'Action, Drama', 'Chor Yuen, File Ip Kwok-Wing, Wong Chit', 'Ni Kuang', 'Ti Lung, Jason Pai Piao, Lo Lieh, Ku Feng, Candy Man, Teng Wei-Hao, JoJo Chan Kei-Kei, Eddie Koo Koon Chung', null, 'A young boy betrays his family who hides a refugee and tells the pursuer where the hiding-place is - just because he wants a valuable telescope for reward. His father decides to kill the boy in order to restore the honor of the family.', 'A young boy betrays his family who hides a refugee and tells the pursuer where the hiding-place is - just because he wants a valuable telescope for reward. His father decides to kill the boy in order to restore the honor of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylJCiBhBiWwXOGLefFmSd7NkfKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186882'),
  ('949536173735979993', 'The Emperor and the Assassin', 1998, 'History, Drama', 'Chen Kaige, Zhao Fei', 'Chen Kaige, Wang Peigong', 'Gong Li, Zhang Fengyi, Li Xuejian, Wang Zhiwen, Sun Zhou, Chen Kaige, Pan Changjiang, Zhao Benshan', 'R', 'In pre-unified China, the King of Qin sends his concubine to a rival kingdom to produce an assassin for a political plot, but as the king''s cruelty mounts she finds her loyalty faltering.', 'In pre-unified China, the King of Qin sends his concubine to a rival kingdom to produce an assassin for a political plot, but as the king''s cruelty mounts she finds her loyalty faltering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hroNcPp2cn6mMWcYpkEud2GY78f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10387'),
  ('8739045527303392', 'The Emperor and the Golem', 1952, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Martin Frič, Jan Stallich, Rudolf Jaroš', 'Jan Werich, Jiří Brdečka, Martin Frič', 'Jan Werich, Nataša Gollová, Jiří Plachý, František Černý, Marie Vášová, Bohuš Záhorský, Zdeněk Štěpánek, František Filipovský', null, 'The Emperor''s mismanagement of his country is provoking some in his court to plot to overthrow him. He feels successful, at least, when he discovers the legendary Golem, which he believes can protect him and even cure his imaginary illnesses but, when he disappears while on a bender, his kindly baker, who looks just like him, is mistaken for him, and begins to put things in order. However, the conspirators, not to be outdone, determine to bring the Golem back to life to do their bidding.', 'The Emperor''s mismanagement of his country is provoking some in his court to plot to overthrow him. He feels successful, at least, when he discovers the legendary Golem, which he believes can protect him and even cure his imaginary illnesses but, when he disappears while on a bender, his kindly baker, who looks just like him, is mistaken for him, and begins to put things in order. However, the conspirators, not to be outdone, determine to bring the Golem back to life to do their bidding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i6VoJXD5EMmNCN1f7DTvZMzJnJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36918'),
  ('560282429171249540', 'The Emperor in August', 2015, 'History, War, Drama', 'Masato Harada, Takahide Shibanushi', 'Masato Harada', 'Koji Yakusho, Masahiro Motoki, Tori Matsuzaka, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Kenichi Yajima, Ikuji Nakamura, Kazuhiro Yamaji', null, 'In July 1945, during the end of World War II, Japan is forced to accept the Potsdam Declaration. A cabinet meeting has continued through days and nights, but a decision cannot be made. The U.S. drops atomic bombs on the cities of Hiroshima and Nagasaki, Japan. General Korechika Anami is torn over making the proper decision and the Emperor of Japan worries about his people. Prime Minister Kantaro Suzuki leads the cabinet meeting, while Chief Secretary Hisatsune Sakomizu can''t do anything, but watch the meeting. At this time, Major Kenji Hatanaka and other young commissioned officers, who are against Japan surrendering, move to occupy the palace and a radio broadcasting station. The radio station is set to broadcast Emperor Hirohito reading out the Imperial Rescript on the Termination of the War.', 'In July 1945, during the end of World War II, Japan is forced to accept the Potsdam Declaration. A cabinet meeting has continued through days and nights, but a decision cannot be made. The U.S. drops atomic bombs on the cities of Hiroshima and Nagasaki, Japan. General Korechika Anami is torn over making the proper decision and the Emperor of Japan worries about his people. Prime Minister Kantaro Suzuki leads the cabinet meeting, while Chief Secretary Hisatsune Sakomizu can''t do anything, but watch the meeting. At this time, Major Kenji Hatanaka and other young commissioned officers, who are against Japan surrendering, move to occupy the palace and a radio broadcasting station. The radio station is set to broadcast Emperor Hirohito reading out the Imperial Rescript on the Termination of the War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3BaYqHvIVUGa35uDLigd77RxO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314837'),
  ('6816321211590438', 'The Emperor of Capri', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Comencini, Giuseppe Caracciolo, Galeazzo Benti', 'Marcello Marchesi, Vittorio Metz, Luigi Comencini', 'Totò, Gianni Appelius, Galeazzo Benti, Nerio Bernardi, Mario Castellani, Pina Gallini, Aldo Giuffrè, Laura Gore', null, 'Beautiful gold-digger Sonia mistakes Antonio, a waiter in a Neapolitan hotel, for Arab Prince Bey of Agapur and makes an appointment with him for the following day in Capri, and Antonio goes there behind the backs of his wife and mother-in-law. A lucky series of circumstances actually does transform him into the prince of the island.', 'Beautiful gold-digger Sonia mistakes Antonio, a waiter in a Neapolitan hotel, for Arab Prince Bey of Agapur and makes an appointment with him for the following day in Capri, and Antonio goes there behind the backs of his wife and mother-in-law. A lucky series of circumstances actually does transform him into the prince of the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yT9d6i4per6Q8K3oFYDWzi17krf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74242'),
  ('243226919167542985', 'The Emperor of Paris', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Jean-François Richet, Manuel Dacosse, Alain Carsoux', 'Éric Besnard', 'Vincent Cassel, Patrick Chesnais, August Diehl, Olga Kurylenko, Denis Lavant, Freya Mavor, Denis Ménochet, Jérôme Pouly', null, 'Paris, France, early 19th century. The legendary convict François Vidocq lives in disguise trying to escape from a tragic past that torments him. When, after an unfortunate event, he crosses paths with the police chief, he makes a bold decision that will turn the ruthless mastermind of the Parisian underworld against him.', 'Paris, France, early 19th century. The legendary convict François Vidocq lives in disguise trying to escape from a tragic past that torments him. When, after an unfortunate event, he crosses paths with the police chief, he makes a bold decision that will turn the ruthless mastermind of the Parisian underworld against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mZBfj3dFIzQgMVfkDwi9u4JBxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478820'),
  ('662002926797456435', 'The Emperor Waltz', 1948, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Billy Wilder, George Barnes', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder', 'Bing Crosby, Joan Fontaine, Roland Culver, Lucile Watson, Richard Haydn, Harold Vermilyea, Sig Ruman, Julia Dean', 'NR', 'A brash American gramophone salesman tries to get Emperor Franz Joseph''s endorsement in turn-of-the-century Austria.', 'A brash American gramophone salesman tries to get Emperor Franz Joseph''s endorsement in turn-of-the-century Austria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duJXRdPna0jWpsdcDOPpPqbTPsa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38804'),
  ('726113328265335721', 'The Emperor''s Club', 2002, 'Drama', 'Michael Hoffman, Lajos Koltai', 'Neil Tolkin', 'Kevin Kline, Emile Hirsch, Jesse Eisenberg, Rishi Mehta, Paul Dano, Rob Morrow, Embeth Davidtz, Edward Herrmann', 'PG-13', 'William Hundert is a passionate and principled Classics professor who finds his tightly-controlled world shaken and inexorably altered when a new student, Sedgewick Bell, walks into his classroom. What begins as a fierce battle of wills gives way to a close student-teacher relationship, but results in a life lesson for Hundert that will still haunt him a quarter of a century later.', 'William Hundert is a passionate and principled Classics professor who finds his tightly-controlled world shaken and inexorably altered when a new student, Sedgewick Bell, walks into his classroom. What begins as a fierce battle of wills gives way to a close student-teacher relationship, but results in a life lesson for Hundert that will still haunt him a quarter of a century later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7BRKAq0DNcXe8Bphm6Wd5KnvlF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17187'),
  ('885587663962806300', 'The Emperor''s Naked Army Marches On', 1987, 'Documentary', 'Kazuo Hara, Kôichi Omiya, Takaharu Yasuoka', null, 'Kenzo Okuzaki, Masao Koshimizu, Riichi Aikawa, Masaichi Hamaguchi, Toshio Hara, Shichiro Kojima, Taro Maruyama, Toshiya Nomura', null, 'Kenzo Okuzaki, a 62-year-old veteran of the New Guinea campaign in World War II, sets out to conduct interviews with survivors and relatives to find the truth behind atrocities committed by Japanese military, in particular the unexplained killing of two Japanese privates in his unit.', 'Kenzo Okuzaki, a 62-year-old veteran of the New Guinea campaign in World War II, sets out to conduct interviews with survivors and relatives to find the truth behind atrocities committed by Japanese military, in particular the unexplained killing of two Japanese privates in his unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMbMe2R8edL8SfioyjJqt1b1qZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51929'),
  ('504682786632651883', 'The Emperor''s New Clothes', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alan Taylor, Barbel Elizabet Krisel, Emanuela Minoli', 'Alan Taylor, Kevin Molony, Herbie Wave', 'Ian Holm, Iben Hjejle, Tim McInnerny, Nigel Terry, Eddie Marsan, Tom Watson, Hugh Bonneville, Murray Melvin', null, 'Napoleon, exiled, devises a plan to retake the throne. He''ll swap places with commoner Eugene Lenormand, sneak into Paris, then Lenormand will reveal himself and Napoleon will regain his throne. Things don''t go at all well; first, the journey proves more difficult than expected, but more disastrously, Lenormand enjoys himself too much to reveal the deception. Napoleon adjusts somewhat uneasily to the life of a commoner while waiting, while Lenormand gorges on rich food.', 'Napoleon, exiled, devises a plan to retake the throne. He''ll swap places with commoner Eugene Lenormand, sneak into Paris, then Lenormand will reveal himself and Napoleon will regain his throne. Things don''t go at all well; first, the journey proves more difficult than expected, but more disastrously, Lenormand enjoys himself too much to reveal the deception. Napoleon adjusts somewhat uneasily to the life of a commoner while waiting, while Lenormand gorges on rich food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTonTn91U4X1px7KXAHTFnIA4ud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52258'),
  ('315431554358574074', 'The Emperor''s New Groove', 2000, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Mark Dindal, Thomas Baker, Thomas Cardone', 'David Reynolds', 'David Spade, John Goodman, Eartha Kitt, Patrick Warburton, Wendie Malick, Kellyann Kelso, Eli Russell Linnetz, Stephen J. Anderson', 'G', 'Emperor Kuzco is turned into a llama by his ex-administrator Yzma, and must now regain his throne and his human form with the help of Pacha, a gentle llama herder.', 'Emperor Kuzco is turned into a llama by his ex-administrator Yzma, and must now regain his throne and his human form with the help of Pacha, a gentle llama herder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isA0acj3ONKBLp1pKadUNzxEPFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11688'),
  ('1018043649419319962', 'The Emperor''s Nightingale', 1949, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Jiří Trnka, Miloš Makovec, Ludvík Hájek', 'Vítězslav Nezval, Jiří Brdečka, Jiří Trnka', 'Helena Patočková, Jaromír Sobota, Boris Karloff', null, 'Adaptation of a fairy tale by Hans Christian Andersen, about an emperor who prefers the tinkling of a bejeweled mechanical bird to the song of a real nightingale. When the Emperor is near death, the nightingale''s song restores his health.', 'Adaptation of a fairy tale by Hans Christian Andersen, about an emperor who prefers the tinkling of a bejeweled mechanical bird to the song of a real nightingale. When the Emperor is near death, the nightingale''s song restores his health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xJG2OuNwpK1KgIV2wdbAuKoMpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79596'),
  ('1019325886947225784', 'The Emperor''s Shadow', 1996, 'Drama', 'Lu Gengxin, Zhou Xiaowen', 'Lu Wei', 'Ge You, Jiang Wen, Xu Qing, Ge Zhijun, Wang Qingxiang, Di Guoqiang, Wang Ning, Shu Yaoxuan', null, 'Epic drama about China''s first emperor (221 BC) who struggles to make his childhood best friend, now China''s greatest composer, succumb to his will and compose a grand anthem to his exploits.', 'Epic drama about China''s first emperor (221 BC) who struggles to make his childhood best friend, now China''s greatest composer, succumb to his will and compose a grand anthem to his exploits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pY3fYYTLOt5sOlVFOJ6q74b3wI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26784'),
  ('275739213622610547', 'The Empire', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Nathalie Japiot, Hugo Martins, David Chambille', 'Bruno Dumont', 'Lyna Khoudri, Anamaria Vartolomei, Camille Cottin, Fabrice Luchini, Brandon Vlieghe, Julien Manier, Bernard Pruvost, Philippe Jore', null, 'In a quiet fishing village on northern France''s Opal Coast, the birth of a peculiar child sparks a hidden war between extraterrestrial forces of good and evil.', 'In a quiet fishing village on northern France''s Opal Coast, the birth of a peculiar child sparks a hidden war between extraterrestrial forces of good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GQ5GMsx7Ri4gJsMDU2aDLbMg1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929831'),
  ('540187562194876289', 'The Empire of Corpses', 2015, 'Animation, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kumiko Kawana, Ryotaro Makihara, Shoji Hata', 'Koji Yamamoto, Hiroshi Seko, Midori Goto', 'Yoshimasa Hosoya, Ayumu Murase, Akio Otsuka, Takayuki Sugo, Taiten Kusunoki, Kana Hanazawa, Shin-ichiro Miki, Daiki Yamashita', null, 'The story takes place in 19th century Europe, and revolves around John Watson. He is scouted by the government to become a secret agent. However, Watson lives in a world where "Frankensteins"—human corpses that are re-purposed with a false soul in order to use them as laborers—are used to improve industrial development.', 'The story takes place in 19th century Europe, and revolves around John Watson. He is scouted by the government to become a secret agent. However, Watson lives in a world where "Frankensteins"—human corpses that are re-purposed with a false soul in order to use them as laborers—are used to improve industrial development.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtfQzn3lRnJ2P3CcE8yxOtXPHTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342588'),
  ('1005097964555255225', 'The Empire of Desire', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Carlos Reichenbach, Carlos Reichenbach, Carlos Shintomi', 'Carlos Reichenbach', 'Roberto Miranda, Benjamin Cattan, Meiry Vieira, Orlando Parolini, Aldine Müller, Nadia Destro, Márcia Fraga, Marta Anderson', null, 'A widow named Sandra is on a trip from the city to reclaim her remote beach house from squatters. She picks up a hippie couple along the way, eventually inviting them to become housesitters at her coastal getaway.', 'A widow named Sandra is on a trip from the city to reclaim her remote beach house from squatters. She picks up a hippie couple along the way, eventually inviting them to become housesitters at her coastal getaway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rEJizyfn0EhcRfBsYJtuHhABaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163252'),
  ('280795387896744064', 'The Empire Strikes Back', 1980, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Irvin Kershner, Peter Suschitzky, George Hull', 'Lawrence Kasdan, Leigh Brackett', 'Mark Hamill, Harrison Ford, Carrie Fisher, Billy Dee Williams, Anthony Daniels, David Prowse, Peter Mayhew, Kenny Baker', 'PG', 'The epic saga continues as Luke Skywalker, in hopes of defeating the evil Galactic Empire, learns the ways of the Jedi from aging master Yoda. But Darth Vader is more determined than ever to capture Luke. Meanwhile, rebel leader Princess Leia, cocky Han Solo, Chewbacca, and droids C-3PO and R2-D2 are thrown into various stages of capture, betrayal and despair.', 'The epic saga continues as Luke Skywalker, in hopes of defeating the evil Galactic Empire, learns the ways of the Jedi from aging master Yoda. But Darth Vader is more determined than ever to capture Luke. Meanwhile, rebel leader Princess Leia, cocky Han Solo, Chewbacca, and droids C-3PO and R2-D2 are thrown into various stages of capture, betrayal and despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNAeTmF4CtdSgMDplXTDPOpYzsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1891'),
  ('558454483770429286', 'The Employee', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Di Palma, Gianni Puccini, Elio Petri', 'Elio Petri, Tommaso Chiaretti, Nino Manfredi', 'Nino Manfredi, Eleonora Rossi Drago, Anna Maria Ferrero, Gianrico Tedeschi, Andrea Checchi, Anna Campori, Sergio Fantoni, Gianni Bonagura', null, 'Nando is dissatisfied with his repetitive and mortifying work. He manages to escape from daily mediocrity only at night, when he enters his fantasy world.', 'Nando is dissatisfied with his repetitive and mortifying work. He manages to escape from daily mediocrity only at night, when he enters his fantasy world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aas12Fb2xQUyXbb99nW5iHJoQkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195413'),
  ('573760261752292280', 'The Employer and the Employee', 2021, 'Drama', 'Arauco Hernández Holz, Manolo Nieto, Sergio de León', 'Manolo Nieto', 'Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Justina Bustos, Cristian Borges, Fátima Quintanilla, Jean Pierre Noher, Virginia Méndez, Carlos Lacuesta, Roberto Oliveira', null, 'The employer is a young man who apparently has everything going on for him except one pressing concern: his baby’s health. The employee is looking for a job to support his newborn too, so does not hesitate when the first decides to hire him to work in his lands. Both will meet their needs by helping each other. But one day an accident happens. This unexpected event will strain the ties between them, endangering the fate of the two families.', 'The employer is a young man who apparently has everything going on for him except one pressing concern: his baby’s health. The employee is looking for a job to support his newborn too, so does not hesitate when the first decides to hire him to work in his lands. Both will meet their needs by helping each other. But one day an accident happens. This unexpected event will strain the ties between them, endangering the fate of the two families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGYjgd0Ga3Yryd5P1RnnJqzzPa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764443'),
  ('340938081182404695', 'The Employment', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Santiago Bou Grasso, Patricio Plaza', 'Patricio Plaza', null, null, 'A man prepares and goes to work in a bizarre world, where the meaning of human workforce is taken to another level.', 'A man prepares and goes to work in a bizarre world, where the meaning of human workforce is taken to another level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6koGitPw8EsU0mo89e7hhxJy0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45336'),
  ('831169743997484045', 'The Empty Canvas', 1963, 'Drama', 'Damiano Damiani, Roberto Gerardi, Mino Giarda', 'Ugo Liberatore, Damiano Damiani, Tonino Guerra', 'Horst Buchholz, Catherine Spaak, Bette Davis, Luigi Giuliani, Isa Miranda, Georges Wilson, Lea Padovani, Leonida Repaci', null, 'An aspiring young artist breaks from his wealthy, possessive mother to live a bohemian existence in the artist''s section of Rome and falls in love with a beautiful model who wants an uncommitted relationship.', 'An aspiring young artist breaks from his wealthy, possessive mother to live a bohemian existence in the artist''s section of Rome and falls in love with a beautiful model who wants an uncommitted relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN3gV6vkyc2XmdP6qoPAZ1JFUKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85285'),
  ('478210738089493379', 'The Empty Hours', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Aarón Fernández Lesur, Javier Morón', 'Aarón Fernández Lesur', 'Kristyan Ferrer, Adriana Paz, Eliseo Lara Martínez, Amaranta Abril, Bartolo Campos, Fermín Martínez, Norma Pablo, Mayra Batalla', null, 'Stuck managing his uncle''s deserted motel on Veracruz''s lonely coast, 17-year-old Sebastian finds solace in unexpected company. Miranda, a beautiful yet seemingly forlorn guest, whiles away the hours waiting for her perpetually late lover. As conversations between them blossom into a connection neither anticipated, a forbidden spark ignites. Will they succumb to the fiery temptation of a fleeting passion, or will they cage their desires for a life dictated by circumstance?', 'Stuck managing his uncle''s deserted motel on Veracruz''s lonely coast, 17-year-old Sebastian finds solace in unexpected company. Miranda, a beautiful yet seemingly forlorn guest, whiles away the hours waiting for her perpetually late lover. As conversations between them blossom into a connection neither anticipated, a forbidden spark ignites. Will they succumb to the fiery temptation of a fleeting passion, or will they cage their desires for a life dictated by circumstance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhFFcbZleWNnaVfmT0YOkPQdgs6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209440'),
  ('779797034801787881', 'The Empty Man', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Shane Bunce, Shannon Stride, David Prior', 'David Prior', 'James Badge Dale, Marin Ireland, Sasha Frolova, Samantha Logan, Evan Jonigkeit, Virginia Kull, Robert Aramayo, Ron Canada', 'R', 'On the trail of a missing girl, an ex-cop comes across a secretive group attempting to summon a terrifying supernatural entity.', 'On the trail of a missing girl, an ex-cop comes across a secretive group attempting to summon a terrifying supernatural entity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8apzu9JFTUMtOpYkHk6LNPOs3pY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516632'),
  ('86943434819557781', 'The Enchanted Boy', 1955, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Vladimir Polkovnikov, Aleksandra Snezhko-Blotskaya, Mikhail Druyan', 'Mikhail Volpin', 'Valentina Sperantova, Erast Garin, Georgiy Vitsin, Sergei Martinson, Georgi Millyar, Anatoliy Kubatskiy, Aleksey Konsovskiy, Tatyana Strukova', null, 'An animated adaptation of the classic story of Nils Holgerson, a naughty boy who is transformed to a very little dwarf and goes through many adventures, flying with a band of wild geese.', 'An animated adaptation of the classic story of Nils Holgerson, a naughty boy who is transformed to a very little dwarf and goes through many adventures, flying with a band of wild geese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZA2rKDDbkQlwsskHvVio5gTVan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79846'),
  ('755007188986695518', 'The Enchanted Christmas Cake', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Vaughn, Radin Salehi-Kani, Justin Yaroski', 'Robert Vaughn, Linda Kupecek, Robin Dunne', 'Robin Dunne, Erica Durance, Brandon Ludwig, Arcade Riley, Sarah Abbott, Martin Roach, Kyana Teresa, Paulino Nunes', 'G', 'Gwen recently lose her grandmother and she is struggling to run their bakery and regain the Christmas spirit, and figure out her grandmother''s magical recipe for the town''s legendary Enchanted Christmas Cake.', 'Gwen recently lose her grandmother and she is struggling to run their bakery and regain the Christmas spirit, and figure out her grandmother''s magical recipe for the town''s legendary Enchanted Christmas Cake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKaJoJlrrxn1lTVoukWtysjyIjn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881853'),
  ('74461813771187864', 'The Enchanted Cottage', 1945, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'John Cromwell, Ted Tetzlaff, Fred Fleck', 'DeWitt Bodeen, Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Dorothy McGuire, Robert Young, Herbert Marshall, Mildred Natwick, Spring Byington, Hillary Brooke, Richard Gaines, Alec Englander', 'NR', 'A homely maid and a scarred ex-GI meet at the cottage where she works and where he was to spend his honeymoon prior to his accident. The two develop a bond and agree to marry, more out of loneliness than love. The romantic spirit of the cottage, however, overtakes them. They soon begin to look beautiful to each other, but no one else.', 'A homely maid and a scarred ex-GI meet at the cottage where she works and where he was to spend his honeymoon prior to his accident. The two develop a bond and agree to marry, more out of loneliness than love. The romantic spirit of the cottage, however, overtakes them. They soon begin to look beautiful to each other, but no one else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLDER6R4oIbi6WabLSvm1NedArP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43494'),
  ('351169092411123437', 'The Enchanted Desna', 1964, 'Drama, War, Fantasy', 'Yuliya Solntseva, Aleksei Temerin, Leonid Basov', null, 'Evgeniy Samoylov, Vova Goncharov, Yevhen Bondarenko, Zinaida Kirienko, Boris Andreyev, Ivan Pereverzev, Iya Marks, Grigori Zaslavets', null, 'Based on the novel of the same name by Oleksandr Dovzhenko. About the childhood of the famous Ukrainian film director Oleksandr Dovzhenko, who was born on the ancient lands of Chernihiv, along the banks the Desna. The film consists of two parts. The first is the world shown through the impressions of the six-year-old Sashko. The second is the recollections and reasoning of Sashko, now an elderly colonel who liberates his native village during the war.', 'Based on the novel of the same name by Oleksandr Dovzhenko. About the childhood of the famous Ukrainian film director Oleksandr Dovzhenko, who was born on the ancient lands of Chernihiv, along the banks the Desna. The film consists of two parts. The first is the world shown through the impressions of the six-year-old Sashko. The second is the recollections and reasoning of Sashko, now an elderly colonel who liberates his native village during the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoGe2p0BuQ4yJSU7eRdCYuQ17eo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283454'),
  ('618303076963651039', 'The Enchanted Dollar', 1986, 'Comedy, Crime', 'István Bujtor, László Baranyai, György Illés', 'István Bujtor', 'István Bujtor, András Kern, Zoltán Basilides, Ferenc Zenthe, István Avar', null, 'Tomboy accidentally found a fake dollar and gave it to detective Droplet. The operation is headed by Maj. Kardos. Now they have to investigate the crime in order to find and neutralize the counterfeiters.', 'Tomboy accidentally found a fake dollar and gave it to detective Droplet. The operation is headed by Maj. Kardos. Now they have to investigate the crime in order to find and neutralize the counterfeiters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezlJs7lOJA6KuL3o1OBmBpcgctE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79246'),
  ('710244402940643964', 'The Enchanted Drawing', 1900, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'J. Stuart Blackton', null, 'J. Stuart Blackton', null, 'A cartoonist defies reality when he draws objects that become three-dimensional after he lifts them off his sketch pad.', 'A cartoonist defies reality when he draws objects that become three-dimensional after he lifts them off his sketch pad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VM68zns50r5jpmv2PiX6bsJlBU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144432'),
  ('654652913128114186', 'The Enchanted Forest', 1987, 'Comedy', 'José Luis Cuerda, Javier Aguirresarobe, Walter Prieto', 'Rafael Azcona', 'Alfredo Landa, Tito Valverde, Alejandra Grepi, Encarna Paso, Miguel Rellán, Luma Gómez, Amparo Baró, Alicia Hermida', null, 'In Galicia, in northern Spain, Malvís, a frustrated day laborer who, fed up with his life, has become a clumsy bandit, tries to make a name for himself by robbing travelers passing through a forest inhabited by colorful characters.', 'In Galicia, in northern Spain, Malvís, a frustrated day laborer who, fed up with his life, has become a clumsy bandit, tries to make a name for himself by robbing travelers passing through a forest inhabited by colorful characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s15kGF76r78zPBsVelCt72kHnL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60311'),
  ('438160550789037557', 'The Enchanted Grove', 1980, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Gheorghe Naghi', 'Draga Olteanu Matei, Mihail Sadoveanu', 'Diana Muscă, Ernest Maftei, Elena Drăgoi, Florina Cercel, Matei Alexandru, Draga Olteanu Matei, Ileana Stana Ionescu, Cezara Dafinescu', null, 'Lizuca is only six years old, not much older than her pet dachshund Patrocle, when her mother dies and she is left to live with her grandparents on their farm. Before long, Lizuca''s father comes to take her away to live with him and his new bride, a vile woman who considers children the bane of all existence. Lizuca and the dachshund escape the wicked stepmother and spend the night in a hollow tree, a tree that changes into an enchanted land where Lizuca (like Alice through the Looking Glass) discovers a world of characters in the form of bees, frogs, the four seasons, Snow White, her dwarves, and other fairy tale creatures. This magic place is threatened by the evil stepmother''s plan to sell the grove that protects the secret land to developers -- a decision that puts the woman on trial before this perfidy can be realized.', 'Lizuca is only six years old, not much older than her pet dachshund Patrocle, when her mother dies and she is left to live with her grandparents on their farm. Before long, Lizuca''s father comes to take her away to live with him and his new bride, a vile woman who considers children the bane of all existence. Lizuca and the dachshund escape the wicked stepmother and spend the night in a hollow tree, a tree that changes into an enchanted land where Lizuca (like Alice through the Looking Glass) discovers a world of characters in the form of bees, frogs, the four seasons, Snow White, her dwarves, and other fairy tale creatures. This magic place is threatened by the evil stepmother''s plan to sell the grove that protects the secret land to developers -- a decision that puts the woman on trial before this perfidy can be realized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVn23IMILT0xOHltRVmIWhng1hO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91951'),
  ('743001902078770097', 'The Enchanted Island', 1973, 'Adventure', 'René Cardona Jr.', null, 'Vicente Lara, Victor Eberg, Ahui Camacho, Hugo Stiglitz, Carlos Agostí', null, 'Robinson Crusoe teaches children Viernes the principles of the white man''s culture and build a raft to leave the island to calling "of despair". Shortly before finishing rescue a white men and the father Friday when they will be slaughtered by cannibals. Then comes a ship taken by the foreman, who plans to leave the island to the loyal crew. Robinson helps the crew.', 'Robinson Crusoe teaches children Viernes the principles of the white man''s culture and build a raft to leave the island to calling "of despair". Shortly before finishing rescue a white men and the father Friday when they will be slaughtered by cannibals. Then comes a ship taken by the foreman, who plans to leave the island to the loyal crew. Robinson helps the crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihWXQeb6BuacdvgI41IGTiDcIov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178540'),
  ('629140758628820578', 'The Enchanted Sedan Chair', 1905, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A fine magician of the Royal Court materialises an elegant attire from a transparent glass container, and then, a refined dandy appears, as an ornate palanquin is summoned. Now, what does the illusionist have in mind?', 'A fine magician of the Royal Court materialises an elegant attire from a transparent glass container, and then, a refined dandy appears, as an ornate palanquin is summoned. Now, what does the illusionist have in mind?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQnb0hDaQFvBFnagBRaxCJ0cATk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44327'),
