  ('1143741406952232177', 'The Enchanting Shadow', 1960, 'Drama, Horror', 'Li Han-Hsiang, Ho Luk-Ying', 'Wang Yue-Ting', 'Betty Loh Ti, Zhao Lei, Tong Yeuk-Ching, Yang Chi-Ching, Su Hsiang, Li Kun, Li Kuo-Hua, Gam Tin-Chue', null, 'A young scholar spends the night in a creepy temple that is said to be haunted. He doesn''t believe in the rumors, but after running into a Taoist swordsman, he meets a beautiful lady ghost.', 'A young scholar spends the night in a creepy temple that is said to be haunted. He doesn''t believe in the rumors, but after running into a Taoist swordsman, he meets a beautiful lady ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wueqpJ0YwCrPXpPaNClZysEI8Cs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133531'),
  ('867754729770979339', 'The Encounter', 2010, 'Drama, Family', 'David A.R. White, Marc Davies, Thomas Zellen', 'Sean Paul Murphy, Timothy Ratajczak', 'Bruce Marchiano, Jaci Velasquez, Steve Borden, Madison Gibney, Danah Davis Williams, Jamie Nieto, Kass Connors, Jessica Belkin', null, 'When five strangers with nothing in common come together at a remote roadside eatery, they place their orders with the diner''s omniscient owner, who seems to know everything about them ... and is eerily reminiscent of Jesus Christ.', 'When five strangers with nothing in common come together at a remote roadside eatery, they place their orders with the diner''s omniscient owner, who seems to know everything about them ... and is eerily reminiscent of Jesus Christ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o40841LWnE4xhldkjqUaznZFIYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63348'),
  ('985539956355294863', 'The End', 1953, 'Drama', 'Christopher Maclaine, Jordan Belson', null, null, null, 'A short film which explores the last day in the lives of six different people.', 'A short film which explores the last day in the lives of six different people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSvEWzXzjsmzryXiNYo1OaHC4Lb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145990'),
  ('304712217401024142', 'The End', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Burt Reynolds, Bobby Byrne', 'Jerry Belson', 'Burt Reynolds, Dom DeLuise, Sally Field, Strother Martin, David Steinberg, Joanne Woodward, Norman Fell, Myrna Loy', 'R', 'Wendell Lawson has only six months to live. Not wanting to endure his last few months of life waiting for the end, he decides to take matters into his own hands and enlists the help of a delusional mental patient to help him commit suicide.', 'Wendell Lawson has only six months to live. Not wanting to endure his last few months of life waiting for the end, he decides to take matters into his own hands and enlists the help of a delusional mental patient to help him commit suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFbxahzgLzJz7i70zcCzzmydwwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35976'),
  ('245260824815372246', 'The End', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'José David Montero, Jorge Torregrossa', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría, Sergio G. Sánchez', 'Maribel Verdú, Daniel Grao, Clara Lago, Blanca Romero, Andrés Velencoso, Carmen Ruiz, Miquel Fernández, Antonio Garrido', null, 'One weekend, after years without seeing each other, several friends, over whom hangs the shadow of a murky episode of the past, meet in a house in the mountains. During the first night, a strange incident takes place that leaves them isolated.', 'One weekend, after years without seeing each other, several friends, over whom hangs the shadow of a murky episode of the past, meet in a house in the mountains. During the first night, a strange incident takes place that leaves them isolated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ae4qeZNsTFV7qh3rzFygdremczz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111443'),
  ('269953271790308023', 'The End', 2016, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Christophe Offenstein', 'Guillaume Nicloux', 'Gérard Depardieu, Audrey Bonnet, Swann Arlaud', null, 'Depardieu plays an unnamed hunter and we join him and his dog as they depart for a nearby forest to snare some rabbits - or perhaps he''s hunting for something far more elusive? His excursion soon progresses from carefree meandering to a palpable sense of placelessness and it doesn''t take long before the hunter''s dog disappears and he finds himself lost.', 'Depardieu plays an unnamed hunter and we join him and his dog as they depart for a nearby forest to snare some rabbits - or perhaps he''s hunting for something far more elusive? His excursion soon progresses from carefree meandering to a palpable sense of placelessness and it doesn''t take long before the hunter''s dog disappears and he finds himself lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heYWVI5MXJxVKq3GVOYGieW2Bbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382811'),
  ('540508163668619884', 'The End', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Joshua Oppenheimer, Mikhail Krichman, Nenazoma McNamee', 'Rasmus Heisterberg, Joshua Oppenheimer', 'Tilda Swinton, George MacKay, Moses Ingram, Michael Shannon, Bronagh Gallagher, Tim McInnerny, Lennie James, Danielle Ryan', 'R', 'Twenty-five years after environmental collapse left the Earth uninhabitable, Mother, Father and Son are confined to their palatial bunker, where they struggle to maintain hope and a sense of normalcy by clinging to the rituals of daily life—until the arrival of a stranger, Girl, upends their happy routine. As tensions rise, their seemingly idyllic existence starts to crumble.', 'Twenty-five years after environmental collapse left the Earth uninhabitable, Mother, Father and Son are confined to their palatial bunker, where they struggle to maintain hope and a sense of normalcy by clinging to the rituals of daily life—until the arrival of a stranger, Girl, upends their happy routine. As tensions rise, their seemingly idyllic existence starts to crumble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYMLpw3DQjQjp2jzNrg3KvNFIr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881366'),
  ('843146060678403494', 'The End Is My Beginning', 2010, 'Drama', 'Jo Baier, Judith Kaufmann', 'Ulrich Limmer, Folco Terzani', 'Bruno Ganz, Elio Germano, Erika Pluhar, Andrea Osvárt, Nicolò Fitz-William Lay', null, 'When an extraordinary man who has lived through all is approaching his end, he decides to call his son to join him for the last time at his home in Tuscany. His intention is to share some valuable conversations about his life as a press correspondent in Southeast Asia, about the political and social changes which he has seen, and about the spiritual transformation he has experienced in recent years. But for him the most important is to show his son how he is preparing for the last great adventure of a lifetime.', 'When an extraordinary man who has lived through all is approaching his end, he decides to call his son to join him for the last time at his home in Tuscany. His intention is to share some valuable conversations about his life as a press correspondent in Southeast Asia, about the political and social changes which he has seen, and about the spiritual transformation he has experienced in recent years. But for him the most important is to show his son how he is preparing for the last great adventure of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hea180orZ56MXapvOq59uea9h7B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51969'),
  ('325474674703510562', 'The End of Agent W4C', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Václav Vorlíček, Jan Kratochvíl, Alena Mikeťuková', 'Václav Vorlíček, Oldřich Daněk', 'Jiří Sovák, Jan Kačer, Květa Fialová, Jan Libíček, Jiří Pleskot, Jiří Lír, Jaroslav Kepka, Václav Kotva', null, 'The invincible agent Cyril Juan Borguette alias W4C has been assigned a mission to go to a hotel in Prague, get hold of a saltcellar with a plan for the military exploitation of Venus hidden in it, and hand it over to the beautiful agent Alice. He will have to compete for the saltcellar with other agents working for the world''s various greater and smaller powers. The head of the Prague counter-intelligence unit gets news of agent W4C''s mission. Deficient in personnel, he nominates accountant Foustka as agent 13B. Mr Foustka takes his dog Pajda with him and the two head for the airport. Pajda helps him track down agent W4C in a classy hotel that becomes the battleground for the interests and plans of the secret agents from different countries, each trying to get hold of the precious saltcellar.', 'The invincible agent Cyril Juan Borguette alias W4C has been assigned a mission to go to a hotel in Prague, get hold of a saltcellar with a plan for the military exploitation of Venus hidden in it, and hand it over to the beautiful agent Alice. He will have to compete for the saltcellar with other agents working for the world''s various greater and smaller powers. The head of the Prague counter-intelligence unit gets news of agent W4C''s mission. Deficient in personnel, he nominates accountant Foustka as agent 13B. Mr Foustka takes his dog Pajda with him and the two head for the airport. Pajda helps him track down agent W4C in a classy hotel that becomes the battleground for the interests and plans of the secret agents from different countries, each trying to get hold of the precious saltcellar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90IxV5ShdBXkwoXWjg0gAxKux86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65687'),
  ('754063169755923459', 'The End of April', 2017, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Kim Kwang-bok', null, 'Park Ji-soo, Lee Bit-na, Jang So-yeon, Jo Kyung-sook, Hong Wan-pyo, Yeon Song-ha', null, 'Hyun-jin, moved into a worn-down apartment in a small town, has trouble sleeping at night due to the noise from her next-door neighbor.', 'Hyun-jin, moved into a worn-down apartment in a small town, has trouble sleeping at night due to the noise from her next-door neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgaj4ZRvbqgt7lPvNeS32crXCYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464900'),
  ('1062882902700191986', 'The End of August at the Hotel Ozone', 1967, 'Science Fiction', 'Jan Schmidt, Milan Jonáš, Zdena Švarcová', 'Jan Schmidt, Pavel Juráček', 'Ondrej Jariabek, Alžbeta Poničanová, Magda Seidlerová, Hana Vítková, Jana Nováková, Vanda Kalinová, Natálie Maslovová, Irena Lžičařová', null, 'A troupe of young women on post-apocalyptic earth are lead around by a mistress born before the war, eventually stumbling into the company of a lonely old man.', 'A troupe of young women on post-apocalyptic earth are lead around by a mistress born before the war, eventually stumbling into the company of a lonely old man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqd6ABfQ1vv5A3rPVJC7CNBgwp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86451'),
  ('127194920843159166', 'The End of Eternity', 1987, 'Science Fiction', 'Andrei Yermash, Naum Ardashnikov', 'Andrei Yermash, Budimir Metalnikov', 'Oleg Vavilov, Vera Sotnikova, Georgi Zhzhyonov, Sergei Yursky, Gediminas Girdvainis, Boris Ivanov, Boris Klyuev, Mikk Mikiver', null, 'Directed by Andrei Yermash, and written by Isaac Asimov, Budimir Metalnikov, and Andrei Yermash, «Konets vechnosti» is a 1987 Science Fiction film, starring Oleg Vavilov, Vera Sotnikova, Georgi Zhzhyonov, Sergei Yursky, Gediminas Girdvainis and Boris Ivanov.', 'Directed by Andrei Yermash, and written by Isaac Asimov, Budimir Metalnikov, and Andrei Yermash, «Konets vechnosti» is a 1987 Science Fiction film, starring Oleg Vavilov, Vera Sotnikova, Georgi Zhzhyonov, Sergei Yursky, Gediminas Girdvainis and Boris Ivanov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUCv9knNr6baEfpZtA2dgBWpu3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83005'),
  ('537705587374257885', 'The End of Love', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Keren Ben Rafael, Damien Dufresne', 'Élise Benroubi, Keren Ben Rafael', 'Judith Chemla, Arieh Worthalter, Noémie Lvovsky, Vassili Schneider, Lenny Dahan, Bastien Bouillon, Joy Rieger', null, 'At first, they make love even if they are not in the same country. She''s in Paris, he''s in Tel Aviv. Time passes and over-communication kills their privacy. In the end, they fall in love for the first time.', 'At first, they make love even if they are not in the same country. She''s in Paris, he''s in Tel Aviv. Time passes and over-communication kills their privacy. In the end, they fall in love for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHKkGTCIvhf8rPXeRL7NHurcuzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618206'),
  ('555220559067395860', 'The End of Man', 1971, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy, Fantasy', 'José Mojica Marins, Giorgio Attili', 'José Mojica Marins, Rubens Francisco Lucchetti', 'José Mojica Marins, Teresinha Sodré, Roque Rodrigues, Mario Lima, Andreia Bryan, Carlão, Graveto, Cláudia Tucci', null, 'A naked stranger emerges from the sea to perform miracles in a nearby town and become a modern messiah whose deeds will affect the whole world.', 'A naked stranger emerges from the sea to perform miracles in a nearby town and become a modern messiah whose deeds will affect the whole world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdv5Qu6AFyxwevJJNlwNzvT3tab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51733'),
  ('253408375204983043', 'The End of Meat', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Jeff Wirth, Marc Pierschel, Marc Pierschel', null, null, 'NR', 'Although evidence of meat consumption''s negative impact on the planet and on human health continue stacking up as animal welfare is on the decline, humanity''s love affair with hamburgers, steaks, nuggets and chops just doesn''t end. In The End of Meat, filmmaker Marc Pierschel embarks on a journey to discover what effect a post-meat world would have on the environment, the animals and ourselves. He meets Esther the Wonder Pig, who became an internet phenomenon; talks to pioneers leading the vegan movement in Germany; visits the first fully vegetarian city in India; witnesses rescued farm animals enjoying their newly found freedom; observes the future food innovators making meat and dairy without the animals, even harvesting "bacon" from the ocean and much more. The End of Meat reveals the hidden impact of meat consumption; explores the opportunities and benefits of a shift to a more compassionate diet; and raises critical questions about the future role of animals in our society.', 'Although evidence of meat consumption''s negative impact on the planet and on human health continue stacking up as animal welfare is on the decline, humanity''s love affair with hamburgers, steaks, nuggets and chops just doesn''t end. In The End of Meat, filmmaker Marc Pierschel embarks on a journey to discover what effect a post-meat world would have on the environment, the animals and ourselves. He meets Esther the Wonder Pig, who became an internet phenomenon; talks to pioneers leading the vegan movement in Germany; visits the first fully vegetarian city in India; witnesses rescued farm animals enjoying their newly found freedom; observes the future food innovators making meat and dairy without the animals, even harvesting "bacon" from the ocean and much more. The End of Meat reveals the hidden impact of meat consumption; explores the opportunities and benefits of a shift to a more compassionate diet; and raises critical questions about the future role of animals in our society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFDHfO1c2XTqDgW9iXxUVwbbLgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474062'),
  ('1114706555267091515', 'The End of Oak Street', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'David Robert Mitchell, Mike Gioulakis, Riley Flanagan', 'David Robert Mitchell', 'Anne Hathaway, Ewan McGregor, Christian Convery, Maisy Stella, Jordan Alexa Davis, P.J. Byrne, Chris Coy', null, 'After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, a family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.', 'After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, a family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9jha7bkttIrc5RO1TWeSn7QVyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1101383'),
  ('423399711775305947', 'The End of Old Times', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Jiří Menzel, Jaromír Šofr, Jan Prokop', 'Jiří Blažek, Jiří Menzel', 'Josef Abrhám, Marián Labuda, Jaromír Hanzlík, Rudolf Hrušínský, Jan Hartl, Jan Hrušínský, Jiří Adamíra, Josef Somr', null, 'Czechoslovakia 1918. The newly formed National Assembly has made Stoklasa the administrator of the Kratochvile Castle. Although with no aristocratic background, he is a man of fortune and is trying to buy the castle. To impress his neighbors and the local politicians he invites them to a great hunting party. Uninvited comes a man who claims to be Duke Alexej. Stoklasa believes him to be a hustler. This hustler, however, manages to charm all the women before he leaves.', 'Czechoslovakia 1918. The newly formed National Assembly has made Stoklasa the administrator of the Kratochvile Castle. Although with no aristocratic background, he is a man of fortune and is trying to buy the castle. To impress his neighbors and the local politicians he invites them to a great hunting party. Uninvited comes a man who claims to be Duke Alexej. Stoklasa believes him to be a hustler. This hustler, however, manages to charm all the women before he leaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VvpevUqPPiwaD5LrdGXBRsAFFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79009'),
  ('703070832867527872', 'The End of One', 1970, null, 'Paul Kocela', null, null, null, 'A camera records the last moments in the life of a seagull on a polluted beach.', 'A camera records the last moments in the life of a seagull on a polluted beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWwxGPjkDY3VyuXNrE8QfmnLJVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327395'),
  ('367055707758499783', 'The End of Sex', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Sean Garrity', 'Jonas Chernick', 'Emily Hampshire, Jonas Chernick, Gray Powell, Lily Gao, Melanie Scrofano, Eden Cupid, Emily Watt, Maya Misaljevic', 'R', 'A young couple, feeling the pressures of parenting and adulthood, sends their kids to camp for the first time and embark on a series of sexual adventures to reinvigorate their relationship.', 'A young couple, feeling the pressures of parenting and adulthood, sends their kids to camp for the first time and embark on a series of sexual adventures to reinvigorate their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6shiIHV2XjDK5yErHhoeMphwpwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933092'),
  ('416996617087778577', 'The End of St. Petersburg', 1927, 'Drama', 'Vsevolod Pudovkin, Mikhail Doller, Anatoli Golovnya', 'Natan Zarkhi', 'Aleksandr Chistyakov, Vera Baranovskaya, Ivan Chuvelyov, V. Obelensky, Alexandr Gromov, Sergei Komarov, Maks Tereshkovich, V. Chuvelyov', null, 'Shortly before the outbreak of WWI, a peasant from rural Russia arrives in St. Petersburg to find work.', 'Shortly before the outbreak of WWI, a peasant from rural Russia arrives in St. Petersburg to find work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKLkiMq76do71f1TcHqXbvkiXOp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106254'),
  ('820340606700688932', 'The End of Suburbia: Oil Depletion and the Collapse of the American Dream', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Gregory Greene', 'Gregory Greene', 'Barrie Zwicker, James Howard Kunstler, Peter Calthorpe, Michael Klare, Richard Heinberg, Matthew Simmons', 'PG-13', 'Since World War II North Americans have invested much of their newfound wealth in suburbia. It has promised a sense of space, affordability, family life and upward mobility. As the population of suburban sprawl has exploded in the past 50 years Suburbia, and all it promises, has become the American Dream. But as we enter the 21st century, serious questions are beginning to emerge...', 'Since World War II North Americans have invested much of their newfound wealth in suburbia. It has promised a sense of space, affordability, family life and upward mobility. As the population of suburban sprawl has exploded in the past 50 years Suburbia, and all it promises, has become the American Dream. But as we enter the 21st century, serious questions are beginning to emerge...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu7EEyGKJkhBHErTWJkCB2wwGan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19112'),
  ('811079848526925539', 'The End of Summer', 1961, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Asakazu Nakai', 'Kōgo Noda, Yasujirō Ozu', 'Setsuko Hara, Yōko Tsukasa, Michiyo Aratama, Keiju Kobayashi, Masahiko Shimazu, Hisaya Morishige, Chieko Naniwa, Reiko Dan', null, 'The family of an older man who runs a small sake brewery become concerned with his finances and his health after they discover him visiting an old mistress from his youth.', 'The family of an older man who runs a small sake brewery become concerned with his finances and his health after they discover him visiting an old mistress from his youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2WujZqrW6dP900VDnOJWQ2xhaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28273'),
  ('90501248038270484', 'The End of Summer', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kazuyoshi Kumakiri, Takashi Matsuo, Ryuto Kondo', 'Takashi Ujita', 'Hikari Mitsushima, Kaoru Kobayashi, Go Ayano, Yura Akanuma, Satoko Abe, Mantaro Koichi', null, 'The story, set in the heady post-war 50s into the early 60s , revolves around a love triangle between Tomoko, long playing the mistress to married older writer Shitto and the new stud who comes into her life, Ryota Kinoshita. Tomoko is sick and tired of her relationship with writer Shingo, who is married and has children. Shingo is a talented writer, but has yet to be recognized by the public. Tomoko then enters into a sexual relationship with younger man Ryota Kinoshita, but Tomoko is not satisfied.', 'The story, set in the heady post-war 50s into the early 60s , revolves around a love triangle between Tomoko, long playing the mistress to married older writer Shitto and the new stud who comes into her life, Ryota Kinoshita. Tomoko is sick and tired of her relationship with writer Shingo, who is married and has children. Shingo is a talented writer, but has yet to be recognized by the public. Tomoko then enters into a sexual relationship with younger man Ryota Kinoshita, but Tomoko is not satisfied.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozftCZWagTzyBpshWe08w3rCTSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220003'),
  ('335212889959252318', 'The End of the Affair', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edward Dmytryk, Wilkie Cooper, Chris Noble', 'Lenore J. Coffee', 'Deborah Kerr, Van Johnson, John Mills, Peter Cushing, Michael Goodliffe, Stephen Murray, Charles Goldner, Nora Swinburne', 'NR', 'During the 1940s, Maurice Bendrix, a writer recently discharged from the armed service, falls in love with Sarah Miles, whom he interviews for a book. Sarah is married, but she and Maurice eventually give in to their mutual attraction, leading to an affair that lasts several months. Maurice''s jealousy, along with the bombing of London by the Germans, seemingly leads to the end of their relationship. However, the reasons are later revealed to be more complex.', 'During the 1940s, Maurice Bendrix, a writer recently discharged from the armed service, falls in love with Sarah Miles, whom he interviews for a book. Sarah is married, but she and Maurice eventually give in to their mutual attraction, leading to an affair that lasts several months. Maurice''s jealousy, along with the bombing of London by the Germans, seemingly leads to the end of their relationship. However, the reasons are later revealed to be more complex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDCUvA3xMcLbPP4iJvTTLjAl6Uz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78256'),
  ('772920781727200670', 'The End of the Affair', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'Neil Jordan, Chris Seagers, Roger Pratt', 'Neil Jordan', 'Ralph Fiennes, Julianne Moore, Stephen Rea, James Bolam, Ian Hart, Jason Isaacs, Deborah Findlay, Sam Bould', 'R', 'On a rainy London night in 1946, novelist Maurice Bendrix has a chance meeting with Henry Miles, husband of his ex-mistress Sarah, who abruptly ended their affair two years before. Bendrix''s obsession with Sarah is rekindled; he succumbs to his own jealousy and arranges to have her followed.', 'On a rainy London night in 1946, novelist Maurice Bendrix has a chance meeting with Henry Miles, husband of his ex-mistress Sarah, who abruptly ended their affair two years before. Bendrix''s obsession with Sarah is rekindled; he succumbs to his own jealousy and arranges to have her followed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTp5cyp6qG0YTdI4AEz4ytjODOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20024'),
  ('1074722689270786692', 'The End of the Day', 1939, 'Drama', 'Julien Duvivier', 'Julien Duvivier, Charles Spaak', 'Louis Jouvet, Michel Simon, Madeleine Ozeray, Sylvie, Madame Lherbay, Gabrielle Fontan, Odette Talazac, Victor Francen', null, 'Aged penniless actors are living in a old people''s home. They always talk about their past glory or failures. One day Raphael Saint-Clair comes; he has been a famous actor and had a lot of love affairs. Passions come back, and jealousies... A bitter film about aging, failure and the entertainment.', 'Aged penniless actors are living in a old people''s home. They always talk about their past glory or failures. One day Raphael Saint-Clair comes; he has been a famous actor and had a lot of love affairs. Passions come back, and jealousies... A bitter film about aging, failure and the entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZLX8Cm39OMwJCTAfljssADYD6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92254'),
  ('574936516638915259', 'The End of the Tour', 2015, 'Drama', 'James Ponsoldt, Jakob Ihre', 'Donald Margulies', 'Jason Segel, Jesse Eisenberg, Mamie Gummer, Mickey Sumner, Johnny Otto, Anna Chlumsky, Joan Cusack, Becky Ann Baker', 'R', 'The story of the five-day interview between Rolling Stone reporter David Lipsky and acclaimed novelist David Foster Wallace, which took place right after the 1996 publication of Wallace''s groundbreaking epic novel, ''Infinite Jest.''', 'The story of the five-day interview between Rolling Stone reporter David Lipsky and acclaimed novelist David Foster Wallace, which took place right after the 1996 publication of Wallace''s groundbreaking epic novel, ''Infinite Jest.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fEuVd8Xorwtk5kFVvyiNlOtcIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249688'),
  ('735972564605394507', 'The End of the World', 1931, 'Science Fiction', 'Roger Hubert, Jules Kruger, Abel Gance', 'Jean Boyer, H.S. Kraft, Abel Gance', 'Abel Gance, Colette Darfeuil, Jeanne Brindeau, Samson Fainsilber, Georges Colin, Victor Francen, Jean d''Yd, Sylvie Gance', null, 'The plot concerns a comet hurling toward Earth on a collision course and the different reactions to people on the impending disaster.', 'The plot concerns a comet hurling toward Earth on a collision course and the different reactions to people on the impending disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybNDUGrdrMDufSLED3QDSVzhEK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3029'),
  ('586540370150066183', 'The End of Violence', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Wim Wenders, Pascal Rabaud', 'Nicholas Klein', 'Bill Pullman, Andie MacDowell, Gabriel Byrne, Loren Dean, Traci Lind, Daniel Benzali, K. Todd Freeman, John Diehl', 'R', 'In Hollywood, the lives of a successful film producer, his wife, a police detective and a surveillance agent intersect after a botched abduction.', 'In Hollywood, the lives of a successful film producer, his wife, a police detective and a surveillance agent intersect after a botched abduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ejIzekqpeC2XnSdOrpCw9KYXxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46625'),
  ('180086279680626043', 'The End We Start From', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mahalia Belo, Suzie Lavelle, Louise Griffin', 'Alice Birch', 'Jodie Comer, Katherine Waterston, Joel Fry, Mark Strong, Gina McKee, Nina Sosanya, Benedict Cumberbatch, Alexandria Riley', 'R', 'As London is submerged below floodwaters, a woman gives birth to her first child. Days later, she and her baby are forced to leave their home in search of safety. They head north through a newly dangerous country seeking refuge from place to place.', 'As London is submerged below floodwaters, a woman gives birth to her first child. Days later, she and her baby are forced to leave their home in search of safety. They head north through a newly dangerous country seeking refuge from place to place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/S9U0axheNakD9LQusEpFijDgSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973778'),
  ('709963054207226686', 'The End?', 2017, 'Horror', 'Cristiano Ciccotti, Angelo Sorrentino, Daniele Misischia', 'Cristiano Ciccotti, Daniele Misischia', 'Alessandro Roja, Claudio Camilli, Euridice Axén, Bianca Friscelli, Benedetta Cimatti, Giada Caruso, Roberto Scotto Pagliara, Carolina Crescentini', null, 'A businessman gets stuck in his office elevator, but this nuisance soon turns into a nightmare, for in the outside world a zombie apocalypse has taken place...', 'A businessman gets stuck in his office elevator, but this nuisance soon turns into a nightmare, for in the outside world a zombie apocalypse has taken place...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CkfgStUa71puqG2S5NTRqArbf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464737'),
  ('131379647295794600', 'The End.', 1995, 'Animation', 'Chris Landreth', 'Robin Bargar, Chris Landreth', 'Jeffrey Hirschfield, Gina Clayton, Hannah Kravitz, Vivian Chelette, Ami Choi, Wynn Fricke, Bob Zehrer', null, 'An animator finds himself trying to explain his (lack of) artistic vision to his creations, who just aren''t impressed.', 'An animator finds himself trying to explain his (lack of) artistic vision to his creations, who just aren''t impressed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16irnIKTfgGc0FT2bK26bkqB5xB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214159'),
  ('385352799185010317', 'The Endless', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'Aaron Moorhead, Justin Benson, Aaron Moorhead', 'Justin Benson', 'Aaron Moorhead, Justin Benson, Callie Hernandez, Tate Ellington, Shane Brady, Lew Temple, Kira Powell, David Lawson Jr.', 'NR', 'Two brothers return to the cult they fled from years ago to discover that the group''s beliefs may be more sane than they once thought.', 'Two brothers return to the cult they fled from years ago to discover that the group''s beliefs may be more sane than they once thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVHPBTLb6Sj1Eso9HzyBAOMRheM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430231'),
  ('490374343437507921', 'The Endless Film', 2018, 'Documentary, Fantasy', 'Leandro Listorti', 'Leandro Listorti', 'Julia Elena Dávalos, Osvaldo De la Vega, Ángel Magaña, Romualdo Quiroga, Alba Mugica, Jorge de la Riestra, Isabel Sarli, Pepe Soriano', null, 'Based on the remains of never-completed Argentine features from the archives of the film museum in Buenos Aires. The film is, as it were, a parallel film history: an essay like a cinematographic Frankenstein, that blows new life into images that once seemed unsuccessful and pointless.', 'Based on the remains of never-completed Argentine features from the archives of the film museum in Buenos Aires. The film is, as it were, a parallel film history: an essay like a cinematographic Frankenstein, that blows new life into images that once seemed unsuccessful and pointless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLjNpu7PMou1aD62IREKZ4rzY63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499469'),
  ('940541614278094916', 'The Endless Night', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Will Tremper, Hans Jura', 'Will Tremper', 'Harald Leipnitz, Karin Hübner, Louise Martini, Hannelore Elsner, Bruce Low, Alexandra Stewart, Walter Buschhoff, Paul Esser', null, 'Anthology film about a night at airport Berlin-Tempelhof. Due to fog passengers can''t leave Berlin by plane and struggle to find other ways out of Berlin.', 'Anthology film about a night at airport Berlin-Tempelhof. Due to fog passengers can''t leave Berlin by plane and struggle to find other ways out of Berlin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unK6UnADQt8rsSdQ5jKaWPwgZ9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220271'),
  ('285289762650524471', 'The Endless Summer', 1966, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Brown, Bruce Brown', null, 'Michael Hynson, Robert August, Lord James Blears, Bruce Brown, Chip Fitzwater, Chuck Gardner, Wayne Miyata', 'PG', 'Bruce Brown''s The Endless Summer is one of the first and most influential surf movies of all time. The film documents American surfers Mike Hynson and Robert August as they travel the world during California’s winter (which, back in 1965 was off-season for surfing) in search of the perfect wave and ultimately, an endless summer.', 'Bruce Brown''s The Endless Summer is one of the first and most influential surf movies of all time. The film documents American surfers Mike Hynson and Robert August as they travel the world during California’s winter (which, back in 1965 was off-season for surfing) in search of the perfect wave and ultimately, an endless summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDdntrv2j64KB0Zpr63cko4Mebt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21'),
  ('774499026734324231', 'The Endless Summer II', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Brown', 'Bruce Brown, Dana Brown', 'Robert ''Wingnut'' Weaver, Patrick O''Connell, Bruce Brown', 'PG', 'Bruce Brown, king of surfing documentaries, returns after nearly thirty years to trace the steps of two young surfers to top surfing spots around the world. Along the way we see many of the people and locales Bruce visited during the filming of Endless Summer (1966).', 'Bruce Brown, king of surfing documentaries, returns after nearly thirty years to trace the steps of two young surfers to top surfing spots around the world. Along the way we see many of the people and locales Bruce visited during the filming of Endless Summer (1966).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89y5faI7wXFghUcsMtwfcVS6JBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24257'),
  ('978313641874608009', 'The Endless Trench', 2019, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Aitor Arregi, Jose Mari Goenaga, Jon Garaño', 'Luiso Berdejo, Jose Mari Goenaga', 'Antonio de la Torre, Belén Cuesta, Vicente Vergara, José Manuel Poga, Emilio Palacios, Adrián Fernández, Nacho Fortes, Marco Cáceres', null, 'A small village in Huelva, Andalusia, Spain, 1936. Higinio and Rosa have been married only for a few months when the Civil War breaks out. Higinio, being afraid of possible reprisals from the rebel faction, decides to use a hole dug in his own house as a temporary hideout.', 'A small village in Huelva, Andalusia, Spain, 1936. Higinio and Rosa have been married only for a few months when the Civil War breaks out. Higinio, being afraid of possible reprisals from the rebel faction, decides to use a hole dug in his own house as a temporary hideout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgS3e3sTUHeVgKzKmFhIJcl9tVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542928'),
  ('28662051304203982', 'The Endurance', 2000, 'Documentary, History', 'George Butler', null, 'Liam Neeson, David Cale, Brian d''Arcy James, Julian Ayer', 'G', 'Documentary on the Shackleton Antartic expedition. A retelling of Sir Ernest Shackleton''s ill-fated expedition to Antarctica in and the crew of his vessel ''The Endurance'', which was trapped in the ice floes and frigid open ocean of the Antarctic in 1914. Shackleton decided, with many of his crew injured and weak from exposure and starvation, to take a team of his fittest men and attempt to find help. Setting out in appalling conditions with hopelessly inadequate equipment, they endured all weather and terrain and finally reached safety. Persuading a local team of his confidence that the abandoned team would still be alive, he set out again to find them. After almost 2 years trapped on the ice, all members of the crew were finally rescued.', 'Documentary on the Shackleton Antartic expedition. A retelling of Sir Ernest Shackleton''s ill-fated expedition to Antarctica in and the crew of his vessel ''The Endurance'', which was trapped in the ice floes and frigid open ocean of the Antarctic in 1914. Shackleton decided, with many of his crew injured and weak from exposure and starvation, to take a team of his fittest men and attempt to find help. Setting out in appalling conditions with hopelessly inadequate equipment, they endured all weather and terrain and finally reached safety. Persuading a local team of his confidence that the abandoned team would still be alive, he set out again to find them. After almost 2 years trapped on the ice, all members of the crew were finally rescued.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zWvRlfnDTbmcGw8F28PEx7KX2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32567'),
  ('311824044695997846', 'The Enemies of Reason', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Russell Barnes', 'Richard Dawkins', 'Richard Dawkins, Derren Brown, Deepak Chopra, Chris French', 'G', 'Documentary written and presented by scientist Richard Dawkins, in which he seeks to expose "those areas of belief that exist without scientific proof, yet manage to hold the nation under their spell", including mediumship, psychokinesis, acupuncture, and other forms of alternative medicine.', 'Documentary written and presented by scientist Richard Dawkins, in which he seeks to expose "those areas of belief that exist without scientific proof, yet manage to hold the nation under their spell", including mediumship, psychokinesis, acupuncture, and other forms of alternative medicine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avzcYIGZte6FcaVrVEGcz6Dpdsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24506'),
  ('510830958336971154', 'The Enemy', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Stephan Streker, Léo Lefèvre', 'Stephan Streker', 'Jérémie Renier, Alma Jodorowsky, Emmanuelle Bercot, Félix Maritaud, Zacharie Chasseriaud, Sam Louwyck, Peter van den Begin, Bruno Vanden Broecke', null, 'Prominent politician Louis Durieux is accused of having murdered his wife, found dead in their hotel room. The case blows up into an intense media storm. Is he guilty or innocent? Nobody knows. Perhaps not even him...', 'Prominent politician Louis Durieux is accused of having murdered his wife, found dead in their hotel room. The case blows up into an intense media storm. Is he guilty or innocent? Nobody knows. Perhaps not even him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CNTYTmNNU9sO8IZfs5LBfCm79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745625'),
  ('725746420193972875', 'The Enemy Below', 1957, 'War', 'Dick Powell, Harold Rosson, Arthur Lueker', 'Wendell Mayes', 'Robert Mitchum, Curd Jürgens, David Hedison, Theodore Bikel, Russell Collins, Kurt Kreuger, Frank Albertson, Biff Elliot', 'NR', 'The crew of the American destroyer escort, the USS Haynes, detects a German U-Boat—resulting in a prolonged, deadly battle of wits.', 'The crew of the American destroyer escort, the USS Haynes, detects a German U-Boat—resulting in a prolonged, deadly battle of wits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IUUCfrEEkq92sCLznzSAjDPusk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15876'),
  ('1130529253188873014', 'The Enemy Blood', 1971, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Rogelio A. González, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Luis Spota', 'David Reynoso, Mercedes Carreño, Juan Miranda, Magda Guzmán, Carlos Ancira, Emilio Fernández, Eric del Castillo, David Povall', null, 'A group of people suffering from mental retardation, blindness and physical malformations work in a traveling circus.', 'A group of people suffering from mental retardation, blindness and physical malformations work in a traveling circus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieknAan3StFSXkzGplSi06Q6p7c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372095'),
  ('504225829726212299', 'The Enemy Within', 1994, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Darby, Ruth A. Redfern, Kees Van Oostrum', 'Rod Serling', 'Forest Whitaker, Sam Waterston, Dana Delany, Jason Robards, Josef Sommer, George Dzundza, Isabel Glasser, Dakin Matthews', 'NR', 'A officer with the Joint Chiefs of Staff uncovers a planned military coup of the U.S. government and has only one week to prevent the takeover.', 'A officer with the Joint Chiefs of Staff uncovers a planned military coup of the U.S. government and has only one week to prevent the takeover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qEjb22Lg6xYRumlKc3crq6e3qp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59121'),
  ('231284658211746066', 'The Enforcer', 1951, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bretaigne Windust, Robert Burks, Raoul Walsh', 'Martin Rackin', 'Humphrey Bogart, Zero Mostel, Ted de Corsia, Everett Sloane, Roy Roberts, Michael Tolan, King Donovan, Bob Steele', 'NR', 'After years of investigation, Assistant District Attorney Martin Ferguson has managed to build a solid case against an elusive gangster whose top lieutenant is about to testify.', 'After years of investigation, Assistant District Attorney Martin Ferguson has managed to build a solid case against an elusive gangster whose top lieutenant is about to testify.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7FAq6mmLfsC6htX6f5zKwbw8LF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26712'),
  ('288543660288509453', 'The Enforcer', 1976, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'James Fargo, Billy Ray Smith, Joseph C. Cavalier', 'Stirling Silliphant, Dean Riesner', 'Clint Eastwood, Tyne Daly, Harry Guardino, Bradford Dillman, John Mitchum, DeVeren Bookwalter, John Crawford, Samantha Doane', 'R', 'Dirty Harry Callahan returns again, this time saddled with a rookie female partner. Together, they must stop a terrorist group consisting of angry Vietnam veterans.', 'Dirty Harry Callahan returns again, this time saddled with a rookie female partner. Together, they must stop a terrorist group consisting of angry Vietnam veterans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0W85fpnsfnpLSSF3D6bKKlH1dD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10649'),
  ('96575007013066785', 'The Enforcer', 1995, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Tom Lau Moon-Tong, Corey Yuen, Rosanna Ng Wai-San', 'Sandy Shaw Lai-King, Wong Jing', 'Jet Li, Xie Miao, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Blackie Ko Sau-Leung, Yu Rongguang, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Collin Chou, Bonnie Fu Yuk-Jing', null, 'An undercover cop struggling to provide for his son and ailing wife, must infiltrate a ruthless gang. But things turn sour when another cop blows his cover and he quickly finds himself battling for his life and the lives of his family.', 'An undercover cop struggling to provide for his son and ailing wife, must infiltrate a ruthless gang. But things turn sour when another cop blows his cover and he quickly finds himself battling for his life and the lives of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVySxFxeaUvT6COQ4Rx7znwh9C4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18725'),
  ('369209027174680891', 'The Enforcer', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Richard Hughes, Callan Green, Despina Saroglou', 'W. Peter Iliff', 'Antonio Banderas, Kate Bosworth, Mojean Aria, Alexis Ren, Zolee Griggs, 2 Chainz, Aaron Cohen, Natalie Burn', 'R', 'A noir thriller set in Miami, the film follows an enforcer who discovers his femme fatale boss has branched out into cyber sex trafficking, putting a young runaway he’s befriended at risk. He sacrifices everything to save the young girl from the deadly organization he’s spent his life building.', 'A noir thriller set in Miami, the film follows an enforcer who discovers his femme fatale boss has branched out into cyber sex trafficking, putting a young runaway he’s befriended at risk. He sacrifices everything to save the young girl from the deadly organization he’s spent his life building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72V1r1G8S87ELagVxjqAUdChMCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846433'),
  ('94350582360753611', 'The Engagement Plot', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Jeffrey R. Clark, Brandon Clark', 'Taylor Bird', 'Trevor Donovan, Rachel Boston, Tedd Taskey, Amie MacKenzie, Audrey Walters, Jacklyn Collier, Barbara Gehring, Walter Anaruk', 'PG', 'After getting her heart broken on The Price of Love, a wildly popular dating reality show that matches 20-something female contestants with a young, financially successful bachelor, teacher Hanna Knight has returned to her small-town Colorado life and moved on to better things.', 'After getting her heart broken on The Price of Love, a wildly popular dating reality show that matches 20-something female contestants with a young, financially successful bachelor, teacher Hanna Knight has returned to her small-town Colorado life and moved on to better things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EUHAa5edUrGkx8qO9v0f35ANje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920878'),
  ('978040772715540883', 'The Engineer', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Danny A. Abeckaser, Barry Markowitz, Todd Turner', 'Kosta Kondilopoulos', 'Emile Hirsch, Robert Davi, Stefanie Yunger, Tsahi Halevi, Danny A. Abeckaser, Angel Bonanni, Yarden Toussia-Cohen, Dan Mor', 'R', 'As Israel is rocked by a series of terrorist bombings, a US senator''s daughter is killed in one bloody explosion. Now, ex-Mossad agent Etan must lead an elite, covert team of agents and mercenaries to find the man responsible—the elusive “Engineer.” Can they find and destroy the madman before more innocent lives are lost?', 'As Israel is rocked by a series of terrorist bombings, a US senator''s daughter is killed in one bloody explosion. Now, ex-Mossad agent Etan must lead an elite, covert team of agents and mercenaries to find the man responsible—the elusive “Engineer.” Can they find and destroy the madman before more innocent lives are lost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxAy5QZlB70HWJUeI6JaPpzNj3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156255'),
  ('478246980860318353', 'The English Patient', 1996, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Anthony Minghella, John Seale, Franco Fumagalli', 'Anthony Minghella', 'Ralph Fiennes, Juliette Binoche, Willem Dafoe, Kristin Scott Thomas, Naveen Andrews, Colin Firth, Julian Wadham, Torri Higginson', 'R', 'In the 1930s, Count Almásy is a Hungarian map maker employed by the Royal Geographical Society to chart the vast expanses of the Sahara Desert along with several other prominent explorers. As World War II unfolds, Almásy enters into a world of love, betrayal, and politics.', 'In the 1930s, Count Almásy is a Hungarian map maker employed by the Royal Geographical Society to chart the vast expanses of the Sahara Desert along with several other prominent explorers. As World War II unfolds, Almásy enters into a world of love, betrayal, and politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eHHqMg8qEYtVw8LQLygsHXSR2q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409'),
  ('367549500763916956', 'The English Teacher', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Craig Zisk, Vanja Černjul', 'Stacy Chariton', 'Julianne Moore, Michael Angarano, Greg Kinnear, Lily Collins, Fiona Shaw, Norbert Leo Butz, Jessica Hecht, Charlie Saxton', 'R', 'Small-town Pennsylvania schoolteacher Linda Sinclair balances her staid home life with an incredible passion for her subject. Then a former star pupil reenters her life after failing as a playwright in New York City. Seeing in his script the inspiration that she has always longed to instill in her students, this dyed-in-the-wool romantic enlists the help of long-suffering drama teacher Carl to mount the work as the high school’s next and riskiest production.', 'Small-town Pennsylvania schoolteacher Linda Sinclair balances her staid home life with an incredible passion for her subject. Then a former star pupil reenters her life after failing as a playwright in New York City. Seeing in his script the inspiration that she has always longed to instill in her students, this dyed-in-the-wool romantic enlists the help of long-suffering drama teacher Carl to mount the work as the high school’s next and riskiest production.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mF14chZNzgDRZffs8Wk8lPwdNQA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174321'),
  ('670795928825649087', 'The Englishman Who Went Up a Hill But Came Down a Mountain', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Christopher Monger, Vernon Layton, Tina Jones', 'Christopher Monger', 'Hugh Grant, Tara Fitzgerald, Colm Meaney, Ian McNeice, Ian Hart, Kenneth Griffith, Tudor Vaughan, Hugh Vaughan', 'PG', 'When an English cartographer arrives in Wales to tell the residents of the Welsh village of Ffynnon Garw that their ''mountain'' is only a hill, the offended community sets out to remedy the situation.', 'When an English cartographer arrives in Wales to tell the residents of the Welsh village of Ffynnon Garw that their ''mountain'' is only a hill, the offended community sets out to remedy the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s96XNz6eBsYDK3A9nVyEuHdv7BG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10612'),
  ('79158904136928160', 'The Enigma of Kaspar Hauser', 1974, 'Drama, History', 'Werner Herzog, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein, Benedikt Kuby', 'Werner Herzog', 'Bruno S., Walter Ladengast, Brigitte Mira, Willy Semmelrogge, Kidlat Tahimik, Hans Musäus, Michael Kroecher, Henry van Lyck', null, 'The film follows Kaspar Hauser, who lived the first seventeen years of his life chained in a tiny cellar with only a toy horse to occupy his time, devoid of all human contact except for a man who wears a black overcoat and top hat who feeds him.', 'The film follows Kaspar Hauser, who lived the first seventeen years of his life chained in a tiny cellar with only a toy horse to occupy his time, devoid of all human contact except for a man who wears a black overcoat and top hat who feeds him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1rBBE8NWociDQClr8y6Onv1X62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11710'),
  ('1135219421072779091', 'The Enshrined Saint', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mohamed Gamal Al Adl, Sameh Selim', 'Ibrahim Issa', 'Asser Yassin, Yousra, Amina Khalil, Bayoumi Fouad, Reham Abdelghafour, Mahmoud Abdel Moghny, Hala Fakher, Ibrahim Nasr', null, 'When a young businessman goes through a crisis, he finds that his only hope is a holy woman who starts to help him.', 'When a young businessman goes through a crisis, he finds that his only hope is a holy woman who starts to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfP0iuT254VfIFdkMt9CikWDo4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727997'),
  ('295903517441394137', 'The Entertainer', 1960, 'Drama', 'Tony Richardson, Oswald Morris, Peter Yates', 'John Osborne, Nigel Kneale', 'Laurence Olivier, Brenda De Banzie, Roger Livesey, Joan Plowright, Alan Bates, Daniel Massey, Albert Finney, Shirley Anne Field', null, 'Archie Rice, an old-time British vaudeville performer sinking into final defeat, schemes to stay in show business.', 'Archie Rice, an old-time British vaudeville performer sinking into final defeat, schemes to stay in show business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s549IYn0XDUlFHJpOLIrWE1uYXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18929'),
  ('938937716573889169', 'The Entitled', 2011, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Aaron Woodley, David Greene', 'William Morrissey', 'Ray Liotta, Kevin Zegers, Victor Garber, Laura Vandervoort, Dustin Milligan, Devon Bostick, Stephen McHattie, Tatiana Maslany', 'R', 'Without the security of the job he wants or the future he dreamed of, Paul Dynan plans the perfect crime to help his struggling family – abduct the socialite children of three wealthy men and collect a ransom of $3-million dollars. Over the course of one long night, Paul and his accomplices hold the rich kids hostage awaiting the ransom with little idea of the secrets that will surface between the fathers when they are forced to choose between their children and their money.', 'Without the security of the job he wants or the future he dreamed of, Paul Dynan plans the perfect crime to help his struggling family – abduct the socialite children of three wealthy men and collect a ransom of $3-million dollars. Over the course of one long night, Paul and his accomplices hold the rich kids hostage awaiting the ransom with little idea of the secrets that will surface between the fathers when they are forced to choose between their children and their money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJMru27zbwolphYGEvzqYkMmm0e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73818'),
  ('738097502069138630', 'The Entity', 1982, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sidney J. Furie, William Cosentino, Stephen H. Burum', 'Frank De Felitta', 'Barbara Hershey, Ron Silver, David Labiosa, George Coe, Margaret Blye, Jacqueline Brookes, Richard Brestoff, Michael Alldredge', 'R', 'A single mom is raped by an invisible force. Her psychiatrist believes the experience stems from childhood trauma, while she knows something supernatural is at play.', 'A single mom is raped by an invisible force. Her psychiatrist believes the experience stems from childhood trauma, while she knows something supernatural is at play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6fsd6zSJDPaFP4xWAtMkHJOkXU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24740'),
  ('579338038854100566', 'The Entity', 2015, 'Horror', 'Eduardo Schuldt', 'Eduardo Schuldt, Sandro Ventura', 'Rodrigo Falla, Daniella Mendoza, Carlos Casella, Mario Gaviria, Analú Polanco', null, 'THE RING goes ‘found footage’ Peruvian in a terrific example of the continually igniting South American new horror wave. A group of media students embark on a documentary project covering ‘Reaction Videos’ - filming people watching intense shock footage online to monitor their psychological effect. And they find one example so terrifying the viewers have all died in mysterious circumstances. But what exactly is on this gruesome Internet footage? Their search leads to an obscure corner of cyberspace known as the Dark Web, a Quechua curse dating from the Spanish Inquisition and a demonic power they cannot escape from.', 'THE RING goes ‘found footage’ Peruvian in a terrific example of the continually igniting South American new horror wave. A group of media students embark on a documentary project covering ‘Reaction Videos’ - filming people watching intense shock footage online to monitor their psychological effect. And they find one example so terrifying the viewers have all died in mysterious circumstances. But what exactly is on this gruesome Internet footage? Their search leads to an obscure corner of cyberspace known as the Dark Web, a Quechua curse dating from the Spanish Inquisition and a demonic power they cannot escape from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2PI16PXks6ZFTYBm8Bb0uGJmh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347767'),
  ('499994828943474412', 'The Entrepreneur', 2011, 'Drama', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Vera Pescarolo, Inti Carboni', 'Andrea Purgatori, Giuliano Montaldo', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Carolina Crescentini, Eduard Gabia, Elena Di Cioccio, Elisabetta Piccolomini, Andrea Tidona, Mauro Pirovano, Giovanni Bissaca', null, 'A small industrialist from Turin, who inherited the business from his father, finds himself facing a serious economic crisis with unease. This crisis is echoed by personal crises: misunderstandings with his wife and intemperance towards those around him.', 'A small industrialist from Turin, who inherited the business from his father, finds himself facing a serious economic crisis with unease. This crisis is echoed by personal crises: misunderstandings with his wife and intemperance towards those around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2G2rffWhjgMSbRQJUp5gFfbCHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82662'),
  ('1034513310907213217', 'The Epic of Everest', 1924, 'Documentary', 'J.B.L. Noel', null, 'Andrew Irvine, George Mallory', null, 'The official record of Mallory and Irvine''s 1924 expedition. When George Mallory and Sandy Irvine attempted to reach the summit of Everest in 1924 they came closer than any previous attempt. Inspired by the work of Herbert Ponting (The Great White Silence) Captain Noel filmed in the harshest of conditions, with specially adapted equipment, to capture the drama of the fateful expedition.', 'The official record of Mallory and Irvine''s 1924 expedition. When George Mallory and Sandy Irvine attempted to reach the summit of Everest in 1924 they came closer than any previous attempt. Inspired by the work of Herbert Ponting (The Great White Silence) Captain Noel filmed in the harshest of conditions, with specially adapted equipment, to capture the drama of the fateful expedition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSm4T9KgiOFflAKKHq76mZbCdxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217268'),
  ('330989948320202192', 'The Equalizer', 2014, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Antoine Fuqua, Mauro Fiore, Lukasz Jogalla', 'Richard Wenk', 'Denzel Washington, Marton Csokas, Chloë Grace Moretz, David Harbour, Haley Bennett, Bill Pullman, Melissa Leo, David Meunier', 'R', 'McCall believes he has put his mysterious past behind him and dedicated himself to beginning a new, quiet life. But when he meets Teri, a young girl under the control of ultra-violent Russian gangsters, he can’t stand idly by – he has to help her. Armed with hidden skills that allow him to serve vengeance against anyone who would brutalize the helpless, McCall comes out of his self-imposed retirement and finds his desire for justice reawakened. If someone has a problem, if the odds are stacked against them, if they have nowhere else to turn, McCall will help. He is The Equalizer.', 'McCall believes he has put his mysterious past behind him and dedicated himself to beginning a new, quiet life. But when he meets Teri, a young girl under the control of ultra-violent Russian gangsters, he can’t stand idly by – he has to help her. Armed with hidden skills that allow him to serve vengeance against anyone who would brutalize the helpless, McCall comes out of his self-imposed retirement and finds his desire for justice reawakened. If someone has a problem, if the odds are stacked against them, if they have nowhere else to turn, McCall will help. He is The Equalizer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9u4yW7yPA0BQ2pv9XwiNzItwvp8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156022'),
  ('413028063383414901', 'The Equalizer 2', 2018, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Maz Makhani, Antoine Fuqua, Donald Sparks', 'Richard Wenk', 'Denzel Washington, Pedro Pascal, Ashton Sanders, Orson Bean, Bill Pullman, Melissa Leo, Jonathan Scarfe, Sakina Jaffrey', 'R', 'Robert McCall, who serves an unflinching justice for the exploited and oppressed, embarks on a relentless, globe-trotting quest for vengeance when his former partner is murdered.', 'Robert McCall, who serves an unflinching justice for the exploited and oppressed, embarks on a relentless, globe-trotting quest for vengeance when his former partner is murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQvc9N6JiMVKqol3wcYrGshsIdZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345887'),
  ('450121648033684037', 'The Equalizer 3', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Antoine Fuqua, Robert Richardson, Stewart Hamilton', 'Richard Wenk', 'Denzel Washington, Dakota Fanning, Eugenio Mastrandrea, David Denman, Gaia Scodellaro, Remo Girone, Andrea Scarduzio, Andrea Dodero', 'R', 'Robert McCall finds himself at home in Southern Italy but he discovers his friends are under the control of local crime bosses. As events turn deadly, McCall knows what he has to do: become his friends'' protector by taking on the mafia.', 'Robert McCall finds himself at home in Southern Italy but he discovers his friends are under the control of local crime bosses. As events turn deadly, McCall knows what he has to do: become his friends'' protector by taking on the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0Ej6fnXAP8fK75hlyi2jKqdhHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926393'),
  ('219727259948646902', 'The Equation of Love and Death', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Cao Baoping, Yang Shu', 'Cao Baoping', 'Zhou Xun, Deng Chao, Zhang Hanyu, Wang Baoqiang, Wang Yanhui, Jing Boran, Linda Dong, Baoan Hu', null, 'When a mysterious death occurs, the lives of five unexpected strangers are suddenly intertwined together. A drug trafficking crime is unveiled, and through the twist and turns of the investigation, their stories unravel, and a bizarre connection is gradually discovered between them.', 'When a mysterious death occurs, the lives of five unexpected strangers are suddenly intertwined together. A drug trafficking crime is unveiled, and through the twist and turns of the investigation, their stories unravel, and a bizarre connection is gradually discovered between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrue2NK4puLbppDVURmoKu4aPDF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75677'),
  ('622952190704569458', 'The Erection of Toribio Bardelli', 2023, 'Drama', 'Adrián Saba', 'Adrián Saba', 'Gustavo Bueno, Gisela Ponce de León, Rodrigo Sánchez-Patiño, Lucélia Santos, Michele Abascal, Coco Chiarella, Lizet Chavez, Beto Benitez', null, 'After the loss of their mother, a dysfunctional family is pressed to re-examine their lives. As father and children come to terms with their own existence, this journey turns into a tender and subtle meditation on grief.', 'After the loss of their mother, a dysfunctional family is pressed to re-examine their lives. As father and children come to terms with their own existence, this journey turns into a tender and subtle meditation on grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pH0WBVsX3vTa9FJpjgGuSlTcVJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1144647'),
  ('228994584526857428', 'The Erl-King', 2024, 'Drama', 'Goran Radovanović, Vladislav Opelyants', 'Goran Radovanović', 'Jakša Prpić, Sara Klimoska, Miloš Biković, Vojin Ćetković, Davor Janjić, Kalina Kovačević, Branka Šelić, Anđelija Filipović', null, 'Sava, her mother and little brother live in a skyscraper in Belgrade. That normal life is interrupted by the bombing of Serbia. A shelter becomes his new home and Milica, the daughter of the priest he is in love with, leaves the country.', 'Sava, her mother and little brother live in a skyscraper in Belgrade. That normal life is interrupted by the bombing of Serbia. A shelter becomes his new home and Milica, the daughter of the priest he is in love with, leaves the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsjwFk85jfNIRtffxUKE5e5xsR6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160614'),
  ('821001850931047500', 'The Erotic Dreams of Cleopatra', 1985, 'Romance', 'Rino Di Silvestro', 'Marcel Albertini, Rino Di Silvestro', 'Marcella Petrelli, Rita Silva, Jacques Stany, Andrea Coppola, Venantino Venantini, Mónica Zanchi, Maurizio Faraoni, Paul Branco', null, 'Caesar brings the Egyptian queen Cleopatra to Rome, but their intense passion for each other has started to cool. As others prepare seek to bring about a conspiracy against Caesar and Cleopatra, every night Cleopatra begins to dream the same dream: her former lover is killed by his close associates. Her high priest states that the dream is one of prophecy, and no action can stop the march of events. Despite this, the Egyptian queen sends her messengers to Caesar, seeking to warn him that the fatal wounds will be inflicted by Brutus.', 'Caesar brings the Egyptian queen Cleopatra to Rome, but their intense passion for each other has started to cool. As others prepare seek to bring about a conspiracy against Caesar and Cleopatra, every night Cleopatra begins to dream the same dream: her former lover is killed by his close associates. Her high priest states that the dream is one of prophecy, and no action can stop the march of events. Despite this, the Egyptian queen sends her messengers to Caesar, seeking to warn him that the fatal wounds will be inflicted by Brutus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swwyoIy0E2CvdenLfRMmglPQAxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326088'),
  ('909315681636264941', 'The Erotic Rites of Frankenstein', 1973, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Raúl Artigot, José Antonio Arévalo', 'Jesús Franco', 'Alberto Dalbés, Dennis Price, Howard Vernon, Beatriz Savón, Carmen Yazalde, Anne Libert, Fernando Bilbao, Luis Barboo', null, 'After the death of Victor Frankenstein, two figures vie for control of his monster and the radical technology that created him: the scientist''s daughter, and an immortal wizard assisted by a blind bird-woman with an unquenchable thirst for blood.', 'After the death of Victor Frankenstein, two figures vie for control of his monster and the radical technology that created him: the scientist''s daughter, and an immortal wizard assisted by a blind bird-woman with an unquenchable thirst for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xruhuGc2XGG19hxrxEj1b6xa4WO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3163'),
  ('257995899177336101', 'The Eroticist', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Giorgio Gentili, Sergio D''Offizi', 'Lucio Fulci, Sandro Continenza, Ottavio Jemma', 'Lando Buzzanca, Lionel Stander, Laura Antonelli, Renzo Palmer, Corrado Gaipa, Agostina Belli, Anita Strindberg, Feodor Chaliapin Jr.', null, 'Senator Pupis feels a strong and uncontrollable urge to grab women''s bottoms, a habit than can lead to embarrassment, especially if the woman in question is head of another state and the occasion a state visit. In his desperation Pupis turns to the clergy for spiritual and psychological help.', 'Senator Pupis feels a strong and uncontrollable urge to grab women''s bottoms, a habit than can lead to embarrassment, especially if the woman in question is head of another state and the occasion a state visit. In his desperation Pupis turns to the clergy for spiritual and psychological help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2zteqonZtoJllhVuxR6iTFnJxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30552'),
  ('1107194550644221022', 'The Errand Boy', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Lewis, Ralph Axness, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Jerry Lewis, Bill Richmond', 'Jerry Lewis, Brian Donlevy, Howard McNear, Dick Wesson, Kathleen Freeman, Robert Ivers, Pat Dahl, Renée Taylor', 'NR', 'Paramutual Pictures wants to know where all the money is going so they hire Morty to be their spy. Morty works for Mr. Sneak and gets a job in the mail room so that he can have access to the lot. But all that Morty ever finds is that he can cause havoc no matter what he does.', 'Paramutual Pictures wants to know where all the money is going so they hire Morty to be their spy. Morty works for Mr. Sneak and gets a job in the mail room so that he can have access to the lot. But all that Morty ever finds is that he can cause havoc no matter what he does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htJbw1ztW0m7bdJytMMOXWhgHgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35189'),
  ('124161631586863600', 'The Escape', 1991, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Atef El-Tayeb, Amaly Bahnasy, Tariq Al Shemi', 'Bashir El Deek, Mostafa Moharram', 'Ahmed Zaki, Abdelaziz Makhyoun, Hala Sedki, Mohamed Wafiq, Abu Bakr Ezzat, Hassan Hosny, Zouzou Nabil, Mahmoud El-Bezzawy', null, 'Ahmed Zaki plays a peasant, Mountasir, who gets involved in a criminal racket run by his friend Midhat. Mountasir is betrayed by Midhat and goes to jail. Upon discovering that his wife was forced into prostitution by Midhat, he swears to extract revenge when he leaves jail.', 'Ahmed Zaki plays a peasant, Mountasir, who gets involved in a criminal racket run by his friend Midhat. Mountasir is betrayed by Midhat and goes to jail. Upon discovering that his wife was forced into prostitution by Midhat, he swears to extract revenge when he leaves jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k96z9r7LwJgwGGO3hzzp8HtbhRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396867'),
  ('692084928517000407', 'The Escape', 2001, null, 'Eduardo Mignogna', 'Eduardo Mignogna, Jorge Goldenberg, Graciela Maglie', 'Miguel Ángel Solá, Ricardo Darín, Gerardo Romano, Patricio Contreras, Inés Estévez, Norma Aleandro, Arturo Maly, Alejandro Awada', null, 'In the summer of 1928, several inmates from the National Penitentiary in Buenos Aires managed to escape. The film narrates the fate of each of these runaways in search of their destiny - tough men with their own ethical codes and ready to do anything not to return to prison. Some of them will suffer violent deaths, while others manage de disappear. Sordid and moving stories, not excluding tenderness and love, mercy or horror sealed with a pact of prison love that will remain in the heart of Buenos Aires, as witness of the yearned-for freedom.', 'In the summer of 1928, several inmates from the National Penitentiary in Buenos Aires managed to escape. The film narrates the fate of each of these runaways in search of their destiny - tough men with their own ethical codes and ready to do anything not to return to prison. Some of them will suffer violent deaths, while others manage de disappear. Sordid and moving stories, not excluding tenderness and love, mercy or horror sealed with a pact of prison love that will remain in the heart of Buenos Aires, as witness of the yearned-for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGquF8qdPrbrXvVJCtkayK048AP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86154'),
  ('127518579991830896', 'The Escape', 2016, 'Drama', 'Kenan Kavut', 'Kenan Kavut', 'Ali Suliman, Jale Arıkan, Mustafa Avkıran, Muhammed Cangören, Burak Çimen, Burak Türker, Yusuf Demircioğlu, Hakan Tuna', null, 'Cabir believes he killed a man while fleeing the police in the Turkish-Greek-Bulgarian border area. His feelings of guilt pursue him like a ghost. But is his victim actually the husband of Aliyes, the woman Cabir takes in, hiding, protecting him? Atmospherically dense, Turkish love drama about a refugee from Syria.', 'Cabir believes he killed a man while fleeing the police in the Turkish-Greek-Bulgarian border area. His feelings of guilt pursue him like a ghost. But is his victim actually the husband of Aliyes, the woman Cabir takes in, hiding, protecting him? Atmospherically dense, Turkish love drama about a refugee from Syria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8u3rINQNS3oxYNn8skUbrSfVa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528741'),
  ('658835246189354736', 'The Escape', 2018, 'Drama', 'Dominic Savage, Jessica Hurles-Laws, Laurie Rose', 'Dominic Savage', 'Gemma Arterton, Dominic Cooper, Frances Barber, Marthe Keller, Montserrat Lombard, Jalil Lespert, Laura Donoughue', null, 'An ordinary woman makes an extraordinary decision which will change her life forever.', 'An ordinary woman makes an extraordinary decision which will change her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e31ZIcE0vIyhc3BzRng7HMZKlnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475007'),
  ('223799174304201232', 'The Escape Artist', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Caleb Deschanel, Andy Anderson, Michael Haley', 'Stephen Zito, Melissa Mathison', 'Raúl Juliá, Griffin O''Neal, Desi Arnaz, Teri Garr, Joan Hackett, Gabriel Dell, John P. Ryan, E. G. Daily', 'PG', 'The young and self-confident Danny bluffs at the local police-station that he will escape from prison within an hour. What follows is a flashback showing his childhood with his uncle and aunt, who are ''vaudeville''-artists themselves.', 'The young and self-confident Danny bluffs at the local police-station that he will escape from prison within an hour. What follows is a flashback showing his childhood with his uncle and aunt, who are ''vaudeville''-artists themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJ7tk6rEjbS6XV9eYpplnKkGytc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57725'),
  ('1025896438708038398', 'The Escapees', 1981, 'Drama, Crime', 'Claude Bécognée, Jean Rollin, Natalie Perrey', 'Jean Rollin', 'Laurence Dubas, Christiane Coppé, Marianne Valiot, Patrick Perrot, Louise D''hour, Brigitte Lahaie, Jean-Louis Fortuit, Natalie Perrey', null, 'On the run from an asylum for the insane, two girls embark on a surreal journey with a group of traveling erotic dancers.', 'On the run from an asylum for the insane, two girls embark on a surreal journey with a group of traveling erotic dancers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dysHurihMATQ8gxfscWBNkRlGCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29566'),
  ('12330904575886954', 'The Escapist', 2002, 'Action, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Gillies MacKinnon, Nigel Willoughby, Neil Stevens', 'Nick Perry', 'Jonny Lee Miller, Gary Lewis, Jodhi May, Andy Serkis, Paloma Baeza, Vas Blackwood, Philip Barantini, Allen Leech', null, 'Denis Hopkins, a pilot, lives with his pregnant wife Valerie and has a comfortable lifestyle. When a gang of criminals led by the sadistic Ricky Barnes breaks into his home, he offers whatever the criminals want to protect his wife and unborn child, but the evil Ricky kills Valerie anyway. Their baby is saved, and later Barnes is arrested and sentenced to life in the maximum security prison, Sullen Voe. Denis fakes his own suicide, then assaults a police car in order to get himself arrested and sent to prison with the intention of tracking down and killing Ricky Barnes. He does not reveal his true name and is called John "What" by the prisoners and guards. Denis escapes from successive prisons, forcing his eventual transfer to Sullen Voe. When he reaches his objective, Ricky Barnes schedules a confrontation, but things do not quite turn out the way Denis had expected.', 'Denis Hopkins, a pilot, lives with his pregnant wife Valerie and has a comfortable lifestyle. When a gang of criminals led by the sadistic Ricky Barnes breaks into his home, he offers whatever the criminals want to protect his wife and unborn child, but the evil Ricky kills Valerie anyway. Their baby is saved, and later Barnes is arrested and sentenced to life in the maximum security prison, Sullen Voe. Denis fakes his own suicide, then assaults a police car in order to get himself arrested and sent to prison with the intention of tracking down and killing Ricky Barnes. He does not reveal his true name and is called John "What" by the prisoners and guards. Denis escapes from successive prisons, forcing his eventual transfer to Sullen Voe. When he reaches his objective, Ricky Barnes schedules a confrontation, but things do not quite turn out the way Denis had expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mmtzUN9VLQiB3aEIr7x96AXC4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49814'),
  ('513816531640153930', 'The Escapist', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Rupert Wyatt, Philipp Blaubach', 'Daniel Hardy, Rupert Wyatt', 'Brian Cox, Damian Lewis, Joseph Fiennes, Seu Jorge, Liam Cunningham, Dominic Cooper, Stephen Farrelly, Steven Mackintosh', 'NR', 'Frank Perry is an institutionalized convict twelve years into a life sentence without parole. When his estranged daughter falls ill, he is determined to make peace with her before it''s too late. He develops an ingenious escape plan, and recruits a dysfunctional band of escapists - misfits with a mutual dislike for one other but united by their desire to escape their hell hole of an existence.', 'Frank Perry is an institutionalized convict twelve years into a life sentence without parole. When his estranged daughter falls ill, he is determined to make peace with her before it''s too late. He develops an ingenious escape plan, and recruits a dysfunctional band of escapists - misfits with a mutual dislike for one other but united by their desire to escape their hell hole of an existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eyKD0mvE0ZSbuxPzmm5wvQaNRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14851'),
  ('774585885748191282', 'The Escort', 1993, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Ricky Tognazzi, Alessio Gelsini Torresi', 'Graziano Diana, Simona Izzo', 'Claudio Amendola, Enrico Lo Verso, Carlo Cecchi, Ricky Memphis, Leo Gullotta, Santo Bellina, Benedetto Raneli, Tony Sperandeo', 'NR', 'The film shows the difficulties of an honest, imperiled judge and his bodyguard of four men, trying to clean up a Sicilian town. Corrupt local politicians, working hand-in-hand with the Mafia, will stop at nothing to prevent exposure of their rackets.', 'The film shows the difficulties of an honest, imperiled judge and his bodyguard of four men, trying to clean up a Sicilian town. Corrupt local politicians, working hand-in-hand with the Mafia, will stop at nothing to prevent exposure of their rackets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhUUl8DosoGRDiGuSGu5GXDdGzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68806'),
