  ('581214306411527325', 'The Escort', 1999, 'Drama', 'Michel Blanc, Barry Ackroyd', 'Michel Blanc, Hanif Kureishi', 'Daniel Auteuil, Stuart Townsend, Liza Walker, Noah Taylor, Frances Barber, Claire Skinner, Keith Allen, Ben Whishaw', null, 'Fleeing from his wife in France to London, 45-year-old Pierre is barely able to support himself. He meets friendly Tom, who offers to help him make ends meet by working as a male escort.', 'Fleeing from his wife in France to London, 45-year-old Pierre is barely able to support himself. He meets friendly Tom, who offers to help him make ends meet by working as a male escort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0c8ZxdtUS7SZsLyI8UM7GK3xjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71632'),
