  ('482603048482015708', 'The Estate', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Darin Moran, Dean Craig', 'Dean Craig', 'Toni Collette, Anna Faris, David Duchovny, Rosemarie DeWitt, Kathleen Turner, Ron Livingston, Keyla Monterroso Mejia, Danny Vinson', 'R', 'Down-on-her-luck divorcee Macey and her fickle sister Savanna attempt to win over their terminally ill, difficult-to-please Aunt Hilda in hopes of becoming the beneficiaries of her wealthy estate, only to find the rest of their greedy family members have the same idea.', 'Down-on-her-luck divorcee Macey and her fickle sister Savanna attempt to win over their terminally ill, difficult-to-please Aunt Hilda in hopes of becoming the beneficiaries of her wealthy estate, only to find the rest of their greedy family members have the same idea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYgS4djsVj61kzEpX43LklGUfgK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910858'),
  ('352716770224504528', 'The Eternal', 1998, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Michael Almereyda, Jim Denault', 'Michael Almereyda', 'Alison Elliott, Jared Harris, Christopher Walken, Jason Miller, Lois Smith, Paula Malcomson, David Geary, Rachel O''Rourke', 'R', 'An alcoholic American couple travel to Ireland with their son so he can meet his grandmother but they walk in on their crazed uncle who is in the midst of reviving a centuries-old Druid witch.', 'An alcoholic American couple travel to Ireland with their son so he can meet his grandmother but they walk in on their crazed uncle who is in the midst of reviving a centuries-old Druid witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6wLlv6gS39T2jVniHJ7ORsBegt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55066'),
  ('947410536084937915', 'The Eternal Daughter', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ed Rutherford, Paolo Guglielmotti, Tony Boffey', 'Joanna Hogg', 'Tilda Swinton, Carly-Sophia Davies, Joseph Mydell, Crispin Buxton, Louis, August Joshi, Alfie Sankey-Green, Zinnia Davies-Cooke', 'PG-13', 'An artist and her elderly mother confront long-buried secrets when they return to a former family home, now a hotel haunted by its mysterious past.', 'An artist and her elderly mother confront long-buried secrets when they return to a former family home, now a hotel haunted by its mysterious past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyv8tPXx3mKchYzVmA3VckKoJDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790867'),
  ('806281973031561453', 'The Eternal Evil of Asia', 1995, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei, Cheung Siu-Kin, Tony Miu Kin-Fai', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Power Chan Kwok-Pong, Ellen Chan Nga-Lun, Ben Ng Ngai-Cheung, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Lily Chung Suk-Wai, Bobby Au-Yeung Tsan-Wah, Keith Ng Shui-Ting, Chin Gwan', null, 'A fun-filled trip to Thailand turns out to be a deadly one for four best friends when they accidentally killed the sister of a local sorcerer. When one of them mysteriously died upon returning the remaining trio discovers that a curse has been cast upon them. They must turn to a Thai magician for help.', 'A fun-filled trip to Thailand turns out to be a deadly one for four best friends when they accidentally killed the sister of a local sorcerer. When one of them mysteriously died upon returning the remaining trio discovers that a curse has been cast upon them. They must turn to a Thai magician for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TOtVUmSUzXEpweCJzMxOKXMKYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83960'),
  ('982400490942135979', 'The Eternal Feminine', 2017, 'Drama', 'Dariela Ludlow Deloya, Natalia Beristáin', 'Javier Peñalosa', 'Karina Gidi, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Tessa Ía, Pedro de Tavira, María Evoli, Luis Eduardo Yee, Danae Reynaud, Ari Albarran', null, 'Rosario Castellanos is an introverted university student who doesn''t seem to belong to her time. In the early 1950s in Mexico City, she is fighting to have voice heard in a society run by men. She is about to become one of the biggest female writers in Mexican literature, but her tumultuous love story with Ricardo Guerra will manifest her fragility and contradictions. At the peak of her career and her marriage, she will ignite a discussion that will mark a turning point in her life.', 'Rosario Castellanos is an introverted university student who doesn''t seem to belong to her time. In the early 1950s in Mexico City, she is fighting to have voice heard in a society run by men. She is about to become one of the biggest female writers in Mexican literature, but her tumultuous love story with Ricardo Guerra will manifest her fragility and contradictions. At the peak of her career and her marriage, she will ignite a discussion that will mark a turning point in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qn2uUo3MXOIEL6uVtOgtRCeQ8VG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480488'),
  ('1117827945616235713', 'The Eternal Jew', 1940, 'Documentary', 'Fritz Hippler, A. Endrejat, Anton Haffner', null, 'Mona Maris, Curt Bois, Fritz Kortner, Peter Lorre, Ernst Lubitsch, Rosa Luxemburg, Charlie Chaplin, Kurt Gerron', null, 'A Nazi propaganda film made to promote anti-Semitism among the German people. Newly-shot footage of Jewish neighborhoods in recently-conquered Poland is combined with preexisting film clips and stills to defame the religion and advance Hitler''s slurs that its adherents were plotting to undermine European civilization.', 'A Nazi propaganda film made to promote anti-Semitism among the German people. Newly-shot footage of Jewish neighborhoods in recently-conquered Poland is combined with preexisting film clips and stills to defame the religion and advance Hitler''s slurs that its adherents were plotting to undermine European civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EMlshXsRmE9LJJd84V6Rh2Rhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38668'),
  ('113505219250866009', 'The Eternal Memory', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Maite Alberdi, Pablo Valdés', 'Maite Alberdi', 'Paulina Urrutia, Augusto Góngora', 'NR', 'Augusto and Paulina have been together for 25 years. Eight years ago, he was diagnosed with Alzheimer''s disease. Both fear the day he no longer recognizes her.', 'Augusto and Paulina have been together for 25 years. Eight years ago, he was diagnosed with Alzheimer''s disease. Both fear the day he no longer recognizes her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKIcHpK6EtKocvE2PHVfmkYtrdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032760'),
