  ('517084609309837836', 'The Eternal Zero', 2013, 'War, Drama, Action, Mystery', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Kiyoko Shibuya, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Tamio Hayashi', 'Junichi Okada, Haruma Miura, Mao Inoue, Isao Natsuyagi, Jun Fubuki, Kazue Fukiishi, Hirofumi Arai, Gaku Hamada', null, 'A brother and sister learn their biological grandfather was a kamikaze pilot who died during World War II. During their research into his life, they get conflicting accounts from his former comrades about his character and how he joined his squadron.', 'A brother and sister learn their biological grandfather was a kamikaze pilot who died during World War II. During their research into his life, they get conflicting accounts from his former comrades about his character and how he joined his squadron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jw4aoqckCNARJqtWyvRlH7cQkWE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248087'),
  ('1075989666235697484', 'The Etruscan Smile', 2018, 'Drama', 'Javier Aguirresarobe, Alice Walker, Jerremy Stewart', 'Sarah Bellwood, Michael McGowan, Michal Lali Kagan', 'Brian Cox, Rosanna Arquette, JJ Feild, Thora Birch, Peter Coyote, Tim Matheson, Josh Stamberg, Treat Williams', 'R', 'Rory MacNeil, a rugged old Scotsman, reluctantly leaves his beloved isolated Hebridean island and travels to San Francisco to seek medical treatment. Moving in with his estranged son, Rory sees his life transformed through a newly found bond with his baby grandson.', 'Rory MacNeil, a rugged old Scotsman, reluctantly leaves his beloved isolated Hebridean island and travels to San Francisco to seek medical treatment. Moving in with his estranged son, Rory sees his life transformed through a newly found bond with his baby grandson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGKJxR3hkFDxBwefTDXPseaBv6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513243'),
  ('581407569277717523', 'The Europeans', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Ivory, Christine Fox, James Maniolas', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Lee Remick, Robin Ellis, Wesley Addy, Tim Choate, Lisa Eichhorn, Kristin Griffith, Nancy New, Norman Snow', 'PG', 'An adaptation of Henry James'' novel about the Countess Eugenia Münster and her brother Robert, expatriate Americans who have grown up in Europe. Returning to prosperous relatives in New England, Eugenia hopes to make an advantageous marriage with a wealthy cousin. While Eugenia encounters obstacles, Robert finds his suit bearing fruit.', 'An adaptation of Henry James'' novel about the Countess Eugenia Münster and her brother Robert, expatriate Americans who have grown up in Europe. Returning to prosperous relatives in New England, Eugenia hopes to make an advantageous marriage with a wealthy cousin. While Eugenia encounters obstacles, Robert finds his suit bearing fruit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3STrqQkZaDSXPhWCPKC462yUj76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42175'),
  ('1136477958590084876', 'The Eve of Ivan Kupalo', 1968, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Emilya Illienko, Georgi Djulgerov, Yurii Illienko', 'Yurii Illienko', 'Larysa Kadochnykova, Boris Khmelnitsky, Oleksandr Sergienko, Davyd Yanover, Dmytro Franko, Yevgeni Fridman, Gemma Firsova, Konstantin Ershov', null, 'Petro is a modest farmhand living in an impoverished village in some unspecified long-ago era. He wants to marry the lovely Pidorka, but her stern father won''t hear of it. The mischievous demon Basavriuk, offers a deal, enticing Petro into crime for the sake of fortune. Based on Nikolai Gogol’s short story “The Eve of Ivan Kupala” (“St John’s Eve”) and Ukrainian folk tales.', 'Petro is a modest farmhand living in an impoverished village in some unspecified long-ago era. He wants to marry the lovely Pidorka, but her stern father won''t hear of it. The mischievous demon Basavriuk, offers a deal, enticing Petro into crime for the sake of fortune. Based on Nikolai Gogol’s short story “The Eve of Ivan Kupala” (“St John’s Eve”) and Ukrainian folk tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlqtwZIjcmMoDJGI95ScAs7bkl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266229'),
  ('246648058084316539', 'The Eve of St. Mark', 1944, 'War, Drama', 'John M. Stahl, Joseph LaShelle', 'George Seaton, Maxwell Anderson', 'Anne Baxter, William Eythe, Michael O''Shea, Vincent Price, Ruth Nelson, Ray Collins, Stanley Prager, Harry Morgan', 'NR', 'Quizz West is conscripted into the United States Army in late 1940. Prior to being shipped out first to San Francisco, then the Philippines, Quizz and his hometown girlfriend Janet discuss their future plans.', 'Quizz West is conscripted into the United States Army in late 1940. Prior to being shipped out first to San Francisco, then the Philippines, Quizz and his hometown girlfriend Janet discuss their future plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4FBuIDQ6YfdPzOx6yqOUNjcr7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264573'),
  ('1138536758384752984', 'The Even Stevens Movie', 2003, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family', 'Sean McNamara, Christian Sebaldt, Ross Novie', 'Dennis Rinsler, Marc Warren', 'Shia LaBeouf, Christy Carlson Romano, Donna Pescow, Tom Virtue, Nick Spano, Tim Meadows, Steven Anthony Lawrence, A.J. Trauth', 'G', 'The Stevens think that they''ve won an all-expenses-paid trip to an island halfway around the world. When their house is destroyed, their food stolen, and their bacon eaten, the Stevens family crumbles, unaware that their family vacation is in fact a hidden camera reality show!', 'The Stevens think that they''ve won an all-expenses-paid trip to an island halfway around the world. When their house is destroyed, their food stolen, and their bacon eaten, the Stevens family crumbles, unaware that their family vacation is in fact a hidden camera reality show!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFDvO48Gq7putBBJmvjZAXARHQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50794'),
  ('291109864844950833', 'The Evening Dress', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Myriam Aziza, Benoît Chamaillard', 'Myriam Aziza, Sophie Bredier', 'Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Lio, Sophie Mounicot, Léo Legrand, Bernard Blancan, Barthélémy Guillemard, Lucie Bourdeu, Armand Chidlin', null, 'Like many of her classmates, 12 year old tomboy Juliette has a crush on Mrs. Solenska, a teacher distinguished by stylish attire and an uninhibited, provocative classroom demeanor. Juliette''s fascination turns into all-consuming obsession, forcing revelations from both the girl and her teacher.', 'Like many of her classmates, 12 year old tomboy Juliette has a crush on Mrs. Solenska, a teacher distinguished by stylish attire and an uninhibited, provocative classroom demeanor. Juliette''s fascination turns into all-consuming obsession, forcing revelations from both the girl and her teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RpMp3dKxKOfGeaXbPYLmb8mlkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66077'),
  ('306540976914849733', 'The Evening Star', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Harling, Don Burgess', 'Robert Harling', 'Shirley MacLaine, Bill Paxton, Juliette Lewis, Miranda Richardson, Ben Johnson, Scott Wolf, George Newbern, Marion Ross', 'PG-13', 'Continuing the story of Aurora Greenway in her latter years. After the death of her daughter, Aurora struggled to keep her family together, but has one grandson in jail, a rebellious granddaughter, and another grandson living just above the poverty line.', 'Continuing the story of Aurora Greenway in her latter years. After the death of her daughter, Aurora struggled to keep her family together, but has one grandson in jail, a rebellious granddaughter, and another grandson living just above the poverty line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aui9QvDLqUyWMxChd5KVyAoYQSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30285'),
  ('1145354036252075332', 'The Everlasting Secret Family', 1988, 'Drama', 'Michael Thornhill', 'Frank Moorhouse', 'Arthur Dignam, Mark Lee, Heather Mitchell, Dennis Miller, John Meillon, Beth Child, Paul Goddard, Bogdan Koca', 'NR', 'A beautiful, if ambitious and amoral, youth is tapped to become the lover of a powerful senator. The young man quickly realizes that he can hold this place, with all its perks, only as long as he is young. He has no other function than being young. With the help of an aged judge, the young man, referred to only as The Lover, contrives a plan to make a change in the way of the world, a plan that will take him years to realize. To succeed, he must manipulate, in subtle and not-so-subtle ways, the senator, his wife, the family chauffeur (who was, when young, a lover), and, by implication, the entire well-planned and controlling everlasting secret family.', 'A beautiful, if ambitious and amoral, youth is tapped to become the lover of a powerful senator. The young man quickly realizes that he can hold this place, with all its perks, only as long as he is young. He has no other function than being young. With the help of an aged judge, the young man, referred to only as The Lover, contrives a plan to make a change in the way of the world, a plan that will take him years to realize. To succeed, he must manipulate, in subtle and not-so-subtle ways, the senator, his wife, the family chauffeur (who was, when young, a lover), and, by implication, the entire well-planned and controlling everlasting secret family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWOaiXSHnBsLfK0hEYZYtrCEUbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148812'),
  ('236480020522382661', 'The Everlasting Story', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Ivan Gudkov, Andrey Kolpin', 'Evgeny Golovin, Maria Parfenova, Anton Lanshakov', 'Nikita Volkov, Daniil Eldarov, Irina Starshenbaum, Arseny Perel, Irina Medvedeva, Yuriy Galtsev, Vladislav Vetrov, Pavel Barshak', null, 'It’s a magical story about the incredible adventures of the young warrior called Koshi. There is only one goal in his life – to defeat the White Shadow, a monster who made him an outcast. But everything changes when Koshi meets a young dryad and circus actress May. By chance the destiny of all fairy creatures ends up in their hands, and now they have to make a tough choice between their own lives and saving the world from Ancient Evil.', 'It’s a magical story about the incredible adventures of the young warrior called Koshi. There is only one goal in his life – to defeat the White Shadow, a monster who made him an outcast. But everything changes when Koshi meets a young dryad and circus actress May. By chance the destiny of all fairy creatures ends up in their hands, and now they have to make a tough choice between their own lives and saving the world from Ancient Evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEJk5L1FHdWSyw7JBAtvslvwPnA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586380'),
