  ('559661766342271269', 'The Evil of Frankenstein', 1964, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Freddie Francis, John Wilcox, William P. Cartlidge', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Peter Cushing, Peter Woodthorpe, Duncan Lamont, Sandor Elès, Katy Wild, David Hutcheson, James Maxwell, Howard Goorney', null, 'Once hounded from his castle by outraged villagers for creating a monstrous living being, Baron Frankenstein returns to Karlstaad. High in the mountains they stumble on the body of the creature, perfectly preserved in the ice. He is brought back to life with the help of the hypnotist Zoltan who now controls the creature. Can Frankenstein break Zoltan''s hypnotic spell that incites the monster to commit these horrific murders or will Zoltan induce the creature to destroy its creator?', 'Once hounded from his castle by outraged villagers for creating a monstrous living being, Baron Frankenstein returns to Karlstaad. High in the mountains they stumble on the body of the creature, perfectly preserved in the ice. He is brought back to life with the help of the hypnotist Zoltan who now controls the creature. Can Frankenstein break Zoltan''s hypnotic spell that incites the monster to commit these horrific murders or will Zoltan induce the creature to destroy its creator?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJBzyHZ6m9fOisiAtrtUjNidZ1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3124'),
  ('474731420793527435', 'The Evil Spirit of Yambuy', 1977, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Boris Buneev, Anatoly Grishko, Aleksandr Garibyan', 'Boris Buneev', 'Olga Yenzak, Rodna Yeshonov, Yuri Zabarovsky, Filimon Sergeyev, Vladimir Zimin, Vladimir Kruglov, Aleksandr Kavalerov, Zinaida Pikunova', null, 'The action takes place in the late 1940s. A large-scale land-surveying research is underway in a remote area of Eastern Siberia. The work had almost been concluded when a wire arrives with the news of people disappearing in the locality of Yambuy. The expedition’s chief and radioman decide to go in search of the lost ones. The local Evenk hunters come to their aid. Many dangerous adventures lie in store for these daring people before they find the culprit – a man-eating bear.', 'The action takes place in the late 1940s. A large-scale land-surveying research is underway in a remote area of Eastern Siberia. The work had almost been concluded when a wire arrives with the news of people disappearing in the locality of Yambuy. The expedition’s chief and radioman decide to go in search of the lost ones. The local Evenk hunters come to their aid. Many dangerous adventures lie in store for these daring people before they find the culprit – a man-eating bear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9z7fGvuxjjfV75IFJ1ZcmZ3tach.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148604'),
  ('886055046681955367', 'The Evil That Binds Us', 2026, 'Drama', 'Nicolás Postiglione', 'Nicolás Postiglione, Paola Campos, Bernardita Olmedo, Alejandro Sieveking', 'Fernanda Finsterbusch, Catrin Striebeck, Tilo Werner', null, 'In 1950s rural Chile, a German family''s calm shatters when a city relative visits. A teen''s connection with a farmhand''s daughter exposes family racism and violent past, triggering his anger despite attempts to hide it.', 'In 1950s rural Chile, a German family''s calm shatters when a city relative visits. A teen''s connection with a farmhand''s daughter exposes family racism and violent past, triggering his anger despite attempts to hide it.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8X6QeTM91X3lg5pyDytUYClG4mr.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-evil-that-binds-us'),
