  ('487724263092531248', 'The Evil Twin', 2007, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Kim Ji-Hwan, Sohn Won-ho', 'Kim Ji-Hwan, Ahn Min-Jung', 'Park Shin-hye, Jae Hee, Park Myung-shin, Ahn Mi-na, Yang Geum-seok, Yang Jin-woo, Kim Bo-ra, Kim Hwa-yeong', null, 'In coma for a decade, the twin So Yeon wakes finally up. But she can''t recall many things. Her other twin sister, Hyo Jin, died in the accident that led to So Yeon''s coma. Now that So Yeon has gained her consciousness back, strange things start to happen.', 'In coma for a decade, the twin So Yeon wakes finally up. But she can''t recall many things. Her other twin sister, Hyo Jin, died in the accident that led to So Yeon''s coma. Now that So Yeon has gained her consciousness back, strange things start to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sj8QXcUWlTcZbNK15TMaw3ytTMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213153'),
  ('607553021353044112', 'The Evil Within', 2017, 'Horror', 'Jim Simone, Stephen Sheridan, Andrew Getty', 'Andrew Getty', 'Frederick Koehler, Sean Patrick Flanery, Brianna Brown, Dina Meyer, Michael Berryman, Francis Guinan, Kim Darby, Tim Bagley', null, 'The sadistic tale of a lonely, mentally handicapped boy who befriends his reflection in an antique mirror. This demonic creature orders him to go on a murderous rampage to kill the people he loves most.', 'The sadistic tale of a lonely, mentally handicapped boy who befriends his reflection in an antique mirror. This demonic creature orders him to go on a murderous rampage to kill the people he loves most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PTfanA2YsdKUgbw27mtZ2E98QW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444193'),
