  ('804158197444978247', 'The Ex', 1996, 'Drama', 'Mark L. Lester, Kevin Parks, Kevin Speckmaier', 'John Lutz, Larry Cohen', 'Yancy Butler, Nick Mancuso, Suzy Amis, Hamish Tildesley, Babs Chula, Claire Riley, Barry W. Levy, Roger Barnes', 'R', 'In order to get her husband back, an architect''s psycho ex-wife kills everybody she can get her hands on.', 'In order to get her husband back, an architect''s psycho ex-wife kills everybody she can get her hands on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEuV2TvUfoA4fbzbzHooJFLIDyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240681'),
  ('993042721242240211', 'The Ex', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jesse Peretz, Tom Richmond, Jeanne McCarthy', 'Michael Handelman, David Guion', 'Zach Braff, Amanda Peet, Jason Bateman, Charles Grodin, Mia Farrow, Lucian Maisel, Donal Logue, Amy Poehler', 'PG-13', 'When his lawyer wife, Sofia, becomes pregnant, chronic underachiever Tom Reilly must take a job at his father-in-law''s advertising firm. Tom has to adjust to the demands of a very high-powered job, and he finds himself in an increasingly hostile office rivalry with Chip, Sofia''s paraplegic former lover.', 'When his lawyer wife, Sofia, becomes pregnant, chronic underachiever Tom Reilly must take a job at his father-in-law''s advertising firm. Tom has to adjust to the demands of a very high-powered job, and he finds himself in an increasingly hostile office rivalry with Chip, Sofia''s paraplegic former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpWQMCkLK8ocyUCKUibUfy6yFaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13171'),
  ('770284339431342318', 'The Ex', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Evgeny Puzyrevsky, Denis Alarkon-Ramires', 'Pyotr Tochilin, Veronika Voznyak, Vladimir Batrameev', 'Konstantin Beloshapka, Vera Kincheva, Sergey Dvoynikov, Yekaterina Shumakova, Elena Morozova, Vladimir Seleznyov, Pavel Golubev, Анна Осипова', null, 'The story of how social networks and instant messengers are changing the life of a modern person. It has been several years since a 16-year-old teenager posted a photo of his girlfriend in the general chat, hoping to boast to friends. Now he has a happy adult life: work, friends, fiance Katya, who is about to become his wife. But the Internet makes you remember teenage love, after which a chain of inexplicable mystical events occurs with the future wife of a young man. The girl receives mysterious messages from her fiance''s past. Because of them, her life turns into a nightmare.', 'The story of how social networks and instant messengers are changing the life of a modern person. It has been several years since a 16-year-old teenager posted a photo of his girlfriend in the general chat, hoping to boast to friends. Now he has a happy adult life: work, friends, fiance Katya, who is about to become his wife. But the Internet makes you remember teenage love, after which a chain of inexplicable mystical events occurs with the future wife of a young man. The girl receives mysterious messages from her fiance''s past. Because of them, her life turns into a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBJ7WdniAiplF4lR4czWPh900AA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599025'),
  ('855219582897637449', 'The Ex-File 3: The Return of the Exes', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Tian Yusheng', 'You Fei', 'Han Geng, Ryan Zheng, Kelly Yu, Zeng Mengxue, Luo Mi, Wang Zhipeng, Han Wenliang, Ye Ke''er', null, 'Buddies Meng Yun and Yu Fei break up with their girlfriends and indulge themselves in living the bachelor lifestyle again. However, as their ex-girlfriends reemerge in their lives, their “Single Plan” starts to unravel!', 'Buddies Meng Yun and Yu Fei break up with their girlfriends and indulge themselves in living the bachelor lifestyle again. However, as their ex-girlfriends reemerge in their lives, their “Single Plan” starts to unravel!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8seLBhGNEhi8holphHVfv2K0dm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494900'),
  ('1014492806615402785', 'The Ex-Files 4: Marriage Plan', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Tian Yusheng', 'Da Kuan, Da Guang, Tian Yusheng', 'Han Geng, Ryan Zheng, Kelly Yu, Liu Yase, Zeng Mengxue, Zhang Tian''ai, Zhu Yanmanzi, Luo Mi', null, 'Two friends stumble their way through marriage. Feeling exhausted, they start to question if getting married must be the ultimate goal of relationships.', 'Two friends stumble their way through marriage. Feeling exhausted, they start to question if getting married must be the ultimate goal of relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rKSKRtdCgW7TeZQF7eE4MQKVbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1173883'),
