  ('785114529278462541', 'The Exception', 2017, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Baudouin du Bois, Talina Casier, Maria Nita', 'Simon Burke', 'Lily James, Jai Courtney, Eddie Marsan, Christopher Plummer, Janet McTeer, Daisy Boulton, Ben Daniels, Stéphane Auberghen', 'R', 'Nothing is as it seems in this riveting World War 2 thriller as a wary soldier goes to investigate a mysterious German monarch at his secluded mansion, leading him into a web of deceit and a dangerous love affair with a local Jewish woman.', 'Nothing is as it seems in this riveting World War 2 thriller as a wary soldier goes to investigate a mysterious German monarch at his secluded mansion, leading him into a web of deceit and a dangerous love affair with a local Jewish woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwGzAuzkpw1YXcdqloxK1p71zxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339987'),
  ('579854974618246751', 'The Exchange', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Ignacio Nacho, Antonio Sanz', 'Ignacio Nacho', 'Pepón Nieto, Natalia Roig, Paco Tous, Rossy de Palma, Hugo Silva, Salva Reina, Mara Guil', null, 'They are on their way and Eva is still insecure. Her deep love and devotion for Jaime has led her to accept a special offer: swinging in order to arouse their marriage after fifteen years. Jaime seems doubly confident: a curvy 19-year-old Brazilian is waiting for him, while Eva has to resign herself to an uninspiring and unattractive partner. What looked like a night of playing, liberation and revitalization for this husband and wife becomes a mess inside four walls when Jaime discovers that their partners for the evening are not who they said they were.', 'They are on their way and Eva is still insecure. Her deep love and devotion for Jaime has led her to accept a special offer: swinging in order to arouse their marriage after fifteen years. Jaime seems doubly confident: a curvy 19-year-old Brazilian is waiting for him, while Eva has to resign herself to an uninspiring and unattractive partner. What looked like a night of playing, liberation and revitalization for this husband and wife becomes a mess inside four walls when Jaime discovers that their partners for the evening are not who they said they were.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmCqqRNjcx31Ze8SNUR8P4V0PaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437026'),
  ('904513723733940981', 'The Exchange Student', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Grignon, Jean Girault', 'Jacques Vilfrid, Jean Girault', 'Louis de Funès, Ferdy Mayne, Martine Kelly, François Leccia, Olivier de Funès, Claude Gensac, Maurice Risch, Jacques Dynam', null, 'Monsieur Bosquier, the owner of a private school, is far from pleased when his eldest son, Philippe, fails his end of year exams. He decides to send his wayward offspring to England to improve his English. In exchange, Philippe’s host, a wealthy whisky distiller, Mac Farrel, will send his daughter, Shirley, to live with the Bosquiers in France. However, Philippe has already decided to spend the summer holidays on a yacht with his friends, so he sends a fellow student, Michonnet, to England in his place. The deception is soon discovered but things go from bad to worse when Philippe and Shirley fall in love and fly to Scotland to get married...', 'Monsieur Bosquier, the owner of a private school, is far from pleased when his eldest son, Philippe, fails his end of year exams. He decides to send his wayward offspring to England to improve his English. In exchange, Philippe’s host, a wealthy whisky distiller, Mac Farrel, will send his daughter, Shirley, to live with the Bosquiers in France. However, Philippe has already decided to spend the summer holidays on a yacht with his friends, so he sends a fellow student, Michonnet, to England in his place. The deception is soon discovered but things go from bad to worse when Philippe and Shirley fall in love and fly to Scotland to get married...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73lKodrSbIqVfoeApFgLUf2SeWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11696'),
  ('616493791846501228', 'The Exchange Student', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Jim Ben Soussan, Philip van Volsem', 'Marie-Pauline Denial, Stanislas Marsh', 'Jimmy Labeeu, Sophie Mousel, Charles Berling, Sylvie Testud, Léon Plazol, Inez Desclin, Sonia Nini, Jeanne Abraham', null, 'Malo and Stéphane are two students who are kind of losers and have just started high school. Their plan to become popular: to host a German exchange student with a lot of style. Too bad for Malo, who gets stuck with a Goth who will make his life hell.', 'Malo and Stéphane are two students who are kind of losers and have just started high school. Their plan to become popular: to host a German exchange student with a lot of style. Too bad for Malo, who gets stuck with a Goth who will make his life hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EcQRiXEczZfbB7JkLdVcrq9UgP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407250'),
  ('1036062079670616003', 'The Exclusive: Beat the Devil''s Tattoo', 2015, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Roh Deok, Kim Hye-young, Choi Chul-su', 'Roh Deok', 'Cho Jung-seok, Lee Ha-na, Lee Mi-sook, Kim Dae-myung, Kim Eui-sung, Bae Sung-woo, Tae In-ho, Bek Hyun-jin', null, 'An unsuccessful journalist becomes a star after he writes an article about the memo of an unknown serial killer. But when he learns that the memo was just part of a novel, he decides to cover up everything.', 'An unsuccessful journalist becomes a star after he writes an article about the memo of an unknown serial killer. But when he learns that the memo was just part of a novel, he decides to cover up everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbxKHtw1O1C2cg9B106MOX0VthH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362974'),
