  ('1068687690020740276', 'The Executioner', 1974, 'Action', 'Teruo Ishii, Yoshikazu Yamasawa, Shinichi Hashimoto', 'Teruo Ishii', 'Sonny Chiba, Makoto Satō, Shōzō Saijō, Yutaka Nakajima, Masahiko Tsugawa, Eiji Gō, Michitarō Mizushima, Hiroshi Nawa', 'R', 'Three men, the skilled ninja Ryuichi Koga, the deadly assassin and former drug detective Takeshi Hayato, and the criminal mastermind Ichiro Sakura work together to take out an infamous drug dealer.', 'Three men, the skilled ninja Ryuichi Koga, the deadly assassin and former drug detective Takeshi Hayato, and the criminal mastermind Ichiro Sakura work together to take out an infamous drug dealer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8z04kflOIbiXdGMYKfhVajqZhIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20508'),
  ('997778304487432394', 'The Executioner', 2009, 'Drama', 'Jin Ho Choi, Kim Tae-sung', 'Young Ok Kim', 'Cho Jae-hyun, Yoon Kye-sang, Park In-hwan, Cha Soo-yeon, Jeon Mi-seon, Heo Tae-hee, Chang-ju Lee, Son Hee-soon', null, 'An execution scheduled to be carried out in 12 years creates a hostile and stifling atmosphere among guards in one jail. This has profound effects on the dehumanization of Jae-kyoung, a young, newly appointed guard who nonetheless happens to find that a cold-blooded colleague of his, Jong-ho, has some humane traits. Written by Pusan International Film Festival winning screenwriter Young Ok Kim.', 'An execution scheduled to be carried out in 12 years creates a hostile and stifling atmosphere among guards in one jail. This has profound effects on the dehumanization of Jae-kyoung, a young, newly appointed guard who nonetheless happens to find that a cold-blooded colleague of his, Jong-ho, has some humane traits. Written by Pusan International Film Festival winning screenwriter Young Ok Kim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shZ9nUzZYB0aC1unqvXDrYocMSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155781'),
  ('644611502517635970', 'The Executioner II: Karate Inferno', 1974, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Teruo Ishii, Tetsuya Desaki, Shinichi Hashimoto', 'Shinichi Hashimoto, Teruo Ishii', 'Sonny Chiba, Etsuko Shihomi, Yutaka Nakajima, Makoto Satō, Shingo Yamashiro, Eiji Gō, Ryōji Hayama, Hiroshi Nawa', null, 'When both a priceless jewel and the daughter of a rich heiress are stolen by a master criminal, Koga and his gang are hired to retrieve both. But a double-cross leads to a risky high-security bank heist and loads of martial arts mayhem.', 'When both a priceless jewel and the daughter of a rich heiress are stolen by a master criminal, Koga and his gang are hired to retrieve both. But a double-cross leads to a risky high-security bank heist and loads of martial arts mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PefAwtI9trMTXV0OuCxbusrelt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100460'),
