  ('691100961404531948', 'The Exorcism', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Simon Duggan, Joshua John Miller', 'Joshua John Miller, M.A. Fortin', 'Russell Crowe, Ryan Simpkins, Sam Worthington, Chloe Bailey, Adam Goldberg, Adrian Pasdar, David Hyde Pierce, Tracey Bonner', 'R', 'A troubled actor begins to unravel while shooting a supernatural horror film, leading his estranged daughter to wonder if he''s slipping back into his past addictions or if there''s something more sinister at play.', 'A troubled actor begins to unravel while shooting a supernatural horror film, leading his estranged daughter to wonder if he''s slipping back into his past addictions or if there''s something more sinister at play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ar2h87jlTfMlrDZefR3VFz1SfgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646683'),
