  ('1062834128158213588', 'The Exorcism of Emily Rose', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Tom Stern, Scott Derrickson, Kendelle Elliott', 'Paul Harris Boardman, Scott Derrickson', 'Laura Linney, Tom Wilkinson, Campbell Scott, Jennifer Carpenter, Kenneth Welsh, Mary Beth Hurt, Colm Feore, Henry Czerny', 'PG-13', 'When a younger girl called Emily Rose dies, everyone puts blame on the exorcism which was performed on her by Father Moore prior to her death. The priest is arrested on suspicion of murder. The trial begins with lawyer Erin Bruner representing Moore, but it is not going to be easy, as no one wants to believe what Father Moore says is true.', 'When a younger girl called Emily Rose dies, everyone puts blame on the exorcism which was performed on her by Father Moore prior to her death. The priest is arrested on suspicion of murder. The trial begins with lawyer Erin Bruner representing Moore, but it is not going to be easy, as no one wants to believe what Father Moore says is true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMN0HIP34f736kkQcfvTfmL9TP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8643'),
  ('152219443735937337', 'The Exorcism of God', 2022, 'Horror, Crime, Drama, Fantasy', 'Alejandro Hidalgo, Gerard Uzcategui', 'Santiago Fernández Calvete, Alejandro Hidalgo', 'Will Beinbrink, María Gabriela de Faría, Irán Castillo, Joseph Marcell, Hector Kotsifakis, Juan Ignacio Aranda, Evelia Di Gennaro, Raquel Rojas', 'R', 'An American priest working in Mexico is considered a saint by many local parishioners. However, due to a botched exorcism, he carries a secret that’s eating him alive until he gets an opportunity to face his demon one final time.', 'An American priest working in Mexico is considered a saint by many local parishioners. However, due to a botched exorcism, he carries a secret that’s eating him alive until he gets an opportunity to face his demon one final time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hangTmbxpSV4gpHG7MgSlCWSSFa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836225'),
  ('217327151784234543', 'The Exorcism of Hannah Stevenson', 2022, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Jason Parker, Isabel Greenslade', 'Jason Parker', 'Hannah Rose, Tom Hogan, Edward Gist, Joshua Davey, Charlie Downes, Howard Lewis Morgan', null, 'Hannah and Matt, a young couple on their first holiday together, quickly discover that they may not see eye-to-eye. Feeling as though she let her boyfriend down, Hannah enlists the help of a mysterious gypsy woman, in the hope that the couple''s troubles can be overcome. However, when Matt wakes to find his girlfriend has disappeared, the gypsy woman''s sinister intentions become all too clear.', 'Hannah and Matt, a young couple on their first holiday together, quickly discover that they may not see eye-to-eye. Feeling as though she let her boyfriend down, Hannah enlists the help of a mysterious gypsy woman, in the hope that the couple''s troubles can be overcome. However, when Matt wakes to find his girlfriend has disappeared, the gypsy woman''s sinister intentions become all too clear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/so05qY0sDY0348bRg0tK9tSnnEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949567'),
  ('361164587436304096', 'The Exorcism of Molly Hartley', 2015, 'Horror', 'Jonathon Cliff, Steven R. Monroe', 'Matt Venne', 'Sarah Lind, Devon Sawa, Gina Holden, Peter MacNeill, Tom McLaren, Daina Leitold, Julia Arkos, Bradley Sawatzky', null, 'Accused of murder and confined to a mental institution, Molly Hartley falls under the possession of a powerful demonic force. As she undergoes a monstrous transformation, a defrocked priest is her only hope of salvation.', 'Accused of murder and confined to a mental institution, Molly Hartley falls under the possession of a powerful demonic force. As she undergoes a monstrous transformation, a defrocked priest is her only hope of salvation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dtUJLQv5h3otMcstpeEUu394Ao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353345'),
  ('72447765477538642', 'The Exorcist', 1973, 'Horror, Drama', 'William Friedkin, Owen Roizman, Terence A. Donnelly', 'William Peter Blatty', 'Ellen Burstyn, Linda Blair, Jason Miller, Max von Sydow, Lee J. Cobb, William O''Malley, Kitty Winn, Barton Heyman', 'R', 'When a mysterious entity possesses a young girl, her mother seeks the help of two Catholic priests to save her life.', 'When a mysterious entity possesses a young girl, her mother seeks the help of two Catholic priests to save her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5x0CeVHJI8tcDx8tUUwYHQSNILq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9552'),
  ('24148141835581861', 'The Exorcist', 2022, 'Horror', 'Adrián García Bogliano', null, 'María Evoli, Diana Bracho, Tina Romero, Norma Lazareno, Salvador Sánchez, Roberto Duarte, Pilar Santacruz, Julio Bracho', null, 'Ophelia, a young nun recently arriving in the town of San Ramon, is forced to perform an exorcism on a pregnant woman in danger of dying. Just when she thinks her possession has ended, she discovers that the evil presence hasn''t disappeared yet. The director of the award-winning Here Comes the Devil and Late Phases adds a new twist to possession movies in one of this year''s Latin American horror surprises.', 'Ophelia, a young nun recently arriving in the town of San Ramon, is forced to perform an exorcism on a pregnant woman in danger of dying. Just when she thinks her possession has ended, she discovers that the evil presence hasn''t disappeared yet. The director of the award-winning Here Comes the Devil and Late Phases adds a new twist to possession movies in one of this year''s Latin American horror surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d07xtqwq1uriQ1hda6qeu8Skt5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1023313'),
  ('29931741246228151', 'The Exorcist III', 1990, 'Horror, Mystery', 'William Peter Blatty, Gerry Fisher, Sharon Gerhard', 'William Peter Blatty', 'George C. Scott, Ed Flanders, Brad Dourif, Jason Miller, Nicol Williamson, Scott Wilson, Nancy Fish, George DiCenzo', 'R', 'On the fifteenth anniversary of the exorcism that claimed Father Damien Karras'' life, Police Lieutenant Kinderman''s world is once again shattered when a boy is found decapitated and savagely crucified.', 'On the fifteenth anniversary of the exorcism that claimed Father Damien Karras'' life, Police Lieutenant Kinderman''s world is once again shattered when a boy is found decapitated and savagely crucified.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhSftgj3vwpIDSP8v67N8KEubmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11587'),
  ('201625318006138794', 'The Exorcist: Believer', 2023, 'Horror', 'David Gordon Green, Scottie Gissel, Nate Meyer', 'David Gordon Green, Peter Sattler', 'Leslie Odom Jr., Lidya Jewett, Olivia O''Neill, Ann Dowd, Jennifer Nettles, Norbert Leo Butz, Okwui Okpokwasili, Raphael Sbarge', 'R', 'Since his wife''s death, Victor has raised his daughter Angela alone. After she and her friend return from a three-day disappearance with missing memories, they begin displaying frightening behavior reminiscent of the MacNeil possession fifty years prior.', 'Since his wife''s death, Victor has raised his daughter Angela alone. After she and her friend return from a three-day disappearance with missing memories, they begin displaying frightening behavior reminiscent of the MacNeil possession fifty years prior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFXkAlMH2iQrNknv4eq7LGTkcti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807172'),
  ('997114311921390586', 'The Exorcists', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jose Prendes, Brendan Petrizzo, James Mahoney', 'Jose Prendes', 'Doug Bradley, Kate Hodge, Michelle Bauer, Denice Duff, Kayla Fields, Robert Donavan, Katie Silverman, Luke Speakman', 'NR', 'When his child is possessed by an unrelenting evil, a father hires three expert exorcists to purge the demon and save his family. But this demon is merely the gatekeeper to a true hellion that will be unleashed on earth if the trio of exorcists fail.', 'When his child is possessed by an unrelenting evil, a father hires three expert exorcists to purge the demon and save his family. But this demon is merely the gatekeeper to a true hellion that will be unleashed on earth if the trio of exorcists fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zddK1YMeZrVKAEd33YdDUrTzZ4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181568'),
  ('171655242648994409', 'The Exotic House of Wax', 1997, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Cybil Richards, Jimmy West, Rochelle Fox', 'Cybil Richards', 'Blake Pickett, Jacqueline Lovell, Everett Rodd, Eric Acsell, Elizabeth Kaitan, Kurt Sinclair, Lisa Comshaw, Rob Lee', 'R', 'In this erotic fantasy, when a naive young woman inherits a wax museum, she''s shocked to discover that her family legacy is no ordinary tourist trap. Statues from all periods of history come alive -- and come together -- when supernatural sexual amulets are placed around their necks. The action heats up when the world''s most memorable mythical figures engage in a love-fest that''s truly one for the ages.', 'In this erotic fantasy, when a naive young woman inherits a wax museum, she''s shocked to discover that her family legacy is no ordinary tourist trap. Statues from all periods of history come alive -- and come together -- when supernatural sexual amulets are placed around their necks. The action heats up when the world''s most memorable mythical figures engage in a love-fest that''s truly one for the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDs8m9LHQnuM9Ujuz3cVy2N4Lxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65160'),
  ('175621066549924277', 'The Exotic Time Machine', 1998, 'Science Fiction', 'Felicia Sinclair, Howard Wexler, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Don Pascual', 'Gabriella Hall, Nikki Fritz, Tiffany Gonzáles, Karina Martinez, Stacey Marie Clawson, Jennifer Conalty, Pamela Marie, Taylor St. Claire', null, 'A time machine transports two curious pleasure seekers to the deepest reaches of the erotic past, where they enjoy historical adventures beyond imagination.', 'A time machine transports two curious pleasure seekers to the deepest reaches of the erotic past, where they enjoy historical adventures beyond imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPqMYlrDf5MDiA5SLREjPym9eVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126736'),
