  ('412369617454900041', 'The Expendables', 2010, 'Thriller, Adventure, Action', 'Sylvester Stallone, Jeffrey L. Kimball, Simeon Asenov', 'David Callaham, Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Jason Statham, Jet Li, Dolph Lundgren, Eric Roberts, Randy Couture, Steve Austin, David Zayas', 'R', 'Barney Ross leads a band of highly skilled mercenaries including knife enthusiast Lee Christmas, a martial arts expert Yin Yang, heavy weapons specialist Hale Caesar, demolitionist Toll Road, and a loose-cannon sniper Gunner Jensen. When the group is commissioned by the mysterious Mr. Church to assassinate the dictator of a small South American island, Barney and Lee visit the remote locale to scout out their opposition and discover the true nature of the conflict engulfing the city.', 'Barney Ross leads a band of highly skilled mercenaries including knife enthusiast Lee Christmas, a martial arts expert Yin Yang, heavy weapons specialist Hale Caesar, demolitionist Toll Road, and a loose-cannon sniper Gunner Jensen. When the group is commissioned by the mysterious Mr. Church to assassinate the dictator of a small South American island, Barney and Lee visit the remote locale to scout out their opposition and discover the true nature of the conflict engulfing the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j09ZkH6R4JWVylBcDai1laCmGw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27578'),
  ('1103551757355854614', 'The Expendables 2', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Simon West, Shelly Johnson, Simeon Asenov', 'Sylvester Stallone, Richard Wenk', 'Sylvester Stallone, Jason Statham, Jet Li, Dolph Lundgren, Chuck Norris, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Bruce Willis, Arnold Schwarzenegger', 'R', 'Mr. Church reunites the Expendables for what should be an easy paycheck, but when one of their men is murdered on the job, their quest for revenge puts them deep in enemy territory and up against an unexpected threat.', 'Mr. Church reunites the Expendables for what should be an easy paycheck, but when one of their men is murdered on the job, their quest for revenge puts them deep in enemy territory and up against an unexpected threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74rTIGyGoIu5KSxDVMdr8H3MtMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76163'),
  ('472226442021536639', 'The Expendables 3', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Patrick Hughes, Dan Bradley, Peter Menzies Jr.', 'Katrin Benedikt, Creighton Rothenberger, Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Jason Statham, Harrison Ford, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Mel Gibson, Wesley Snipes, Dolph Lundgren, Randy Couture', 'PG-13', 'Barney, Christmas and the rest of the team comes face-to-face with Conrad Stonebanks, who years ago co-founded The Expendables with Barney. Stonebanks subsequently became a ruthless arms trader and someone who Barney was forced to kill… or so he thought. Stonebanks, who eluded death once before, now is making it his mission to end The Expendables -- but Barney has other plans. Barney decides that he has to fight old blood with new blood, and brings in a new era of Expendables team members, recruiting individuals who are younger, faster and more tech-savvy. The latest mission becomes a clash of classic old-school style versus high-tech expertise in the Expendables’ most personal battle yet.', 'Barney, Christmas and the rest of the team comes face-to-face with Conrad Stonebanks, who years ago co-founded The Expendables with Barney. Stonebanks subsequently became a ruthless arms trader and someone who Barney was forced to kill… or so he thought. Stonebanks, who eluded death once before, now is making it his mission to end The Expendables -- but Barney has other plans. Barney decides that he has to fight old blood with new blood, and brings in a new era of Expendables team members, recruiting individuals who are younger, faster and more tech-savvy. The latest mission becomes a clash of classic old-school style versus high-tech expertise in the Expendables’ most personal battle yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utS5euWHlEdKBNnEFwjpZ2oGuhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138103'),
  ('366606414951614754', 'The Experience', 1973, 'Drama', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Ali Reza Zarrindast', 'Amir Naderi, Abbas Kiarostami', 'Parviz Naderi, Hossein Yarmohammadi, Andre Govalovish, Firoozeh Habibi', null, 'The hard daily life of a kid working in a photo shop while trying to get closer to the girl he likes.', 'The hard daily life of a kid working in a photo shop while trying to get closer to the girl he likes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PBCpaoOphrgPl7KqKfKnPDViKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129942'),
  ('455064257169482116', 'The Experiencer', 1977, 'Fantasy, Mystery', 'Michael Kohler, Michael Kohler, Brian Helweg-Larsen', null, 'Brian Helweg-Larsen, Chris Rachlin, Sean Dennien, Noel Witheford, Toby, Mike Connolly, Penni Allen, Kitson Smith', null, 'After taking a wrong turn, a young man somehow falls into a mysterious cave and becomes hopelessly lost. As he searches for a way out, the journey he experiences forces him to confront the deepest parts of himself.', 'After taking a wrong turn, a young man somehow falls into a mysterious cave and becomes hopelessly lost. As he searches for a way out, the journey he experiences forces him to confront the deepest parts of himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7d3MIKUsUA5p2X8xx3Ad8Kenh6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856632'),
  ('739211751067526918', 'The Experiment', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Oliver Hirschbiegel, Rainer Klausmann, Isabel Kleefeld', 'Mario Giordano, Don Bohlinger, Christoph Darnstädt', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Christian Berkel, Justus von Dohnányi, Maren Eggert, Edgar Selge, Andrea Sawatzki, Oliver Stokowski, Wotan Wilke Möhring', null, '20 volunteers agree to take part in a seemingly well-paid experiment advertised by the university. It is supposed to be about aggressive behavior in an artificial prison situation. A journalist senses a story behind the ad and smuggles himself in among the test subjects. They are randomly divided into prisoners and guards. What seems like a game at the beginning soon turns into bloody seriousness.', '20 volunteers agree to take part in a seemingly well-paid experiment advertised by the university. It is supposed to be about aggressive behavior in an artificial prison situation. A journalist senses a story behind the ad and smuggles himself in among the test subjects. They are randomly divided into prisoners and guards. What seems like a game at the beginning soon turns into bloody seriousness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfxXel8k2UWkgJ4MIsvVBsqnvFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575'),
  ('911303319160644025', 'The Experiment', 2010, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Paul T. Scheuring, Amy Vincent, J.J. Perry', 'Paul T. Scheuring, Mario Giordano', 'Adrien Brody, Cam Gigandet, Forest Whitaker, Maggie Grace, Clifton Collins Jr., Fisher Stevens, Damien Leake, Ethan Cohn', 'R', '20 men are chosen to participate in the roles of guards and prisoners in a psychological study that ultimately spirals out of control.', '20 men are chosen to participate in the roles of guards and prisoners in a psychological study that ultimately spirals out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zy6hJYii2PJfMRoUBlULhfuLsgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43549'),
  ('886779890482584334', 'The Expert', 1995, 'Action', 'Levie Isaacks, William Lustig, Rick Avery', 'Larry Cohen', 'Jeff Speakman, James Brolin, Michael Shaner, Alex Datcher, Wolfgang Bodison, Jim Varney, Red West, Ramon Estevez', null, 'It was a brutal murder that sent deranged psychopath Martin Kagan to prison. It was a naive deputy warden that granted him a stay of execution. Now, the police department''s tactical defence instructor, John Lomax, wants revenge for his beloved sister''s death.', 'It was a brutal murder that sent deranged psychopath Martin Kagan to prison. It was a naive deputy warden that granted him a stay of execution. Now, the police department''s tactical defence instructor, John Lomax, wants revenge for his beloved sister''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1E6MbiCNVE5Aq3YuwyrKRF7p240.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53061'),
  ('935736309169916886', 'The Experts', 1989, 'Action, Comedy', 'Dave Thomas, Ronnie Taylor', 'Nick Thiel, Eric Alter, Steven Greene', 'John Travolta, Arye Gross, Kelly Preston, Deborah Foreman, James Keach, Jan Rubeš, Brian Doyle-Murray, Charles Martin Smith', 'PG-13', 'Travis and Wendell are two down-on-their-luck New Yorkers who think they''re relocating to a small town in Nebraska to open a nightclub. What they don''t know is they''ve actually been abducted by a KGB operative and flown to the Soviet Union, where they''ll unwittingly serve as "experts" on all things cool in America. The town, created expressly for KGB spies-in-training, is meant to serve as a training ground for Soviet agents. What can these two hapless Americans possibly teach the Soviet spies, and will they ever learn they are not actually in Nebraska?', 'Travis and Wendell are two down-on-their-luck New Yorkers who think they''re relocating to a small town in Nebraska to open a nightclub. What they don''t know is they''ve actually been abducted by a KGB operative and flown to the Soviet Union, where they''ll unwittingly serve as "experts" on all things cool in America. The town, created expressly for KGB spies-in-training, is meant to serve as a training ground for Soviet agents. What can these two hapless Americans possibly teach the Soviet spies, and will they ever learn they are not actually in Nebraska?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coMo2Tv7ul6TNJpA151GOaOVrMX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55699'),
  ('775953306059803586', 'The Explosive Generation', 1961, 'Drama', 'Buzz Kulik', 'Joseph Landon', 'William Shatner, Patty McCormack, Lee Kinsolving, Virginia Field, Edward Platt, Beau Bridges, Jocelyn Brando, Phillip Terry', null, 'Peter Gifford is a likable, dedicated schoolteacher that teaches a senior life skills class. When student Janet Sommers brings up the topic of sex and dating, he asks students to write questions on the topic, and will cover them in the next class. The parents get wind of what Gifford is about to do, notify the principal, and he warns Peter not to read the questions in class. Gifford decides to go against this and is suspended. The whole student body protests, and the administration gets worried on what to do.', 'Peter Gifford is a likable, dedicated schoolteacher that teaches a senior life skills class. When student Janet Sommers brings up the topic of sex and dating, he asks students to write questions on the topic, and will cover them in the next class. The parents get wind of what Gifford is about to do, notify the principal, and he warns Peter not to read the questions in class. Gifford decides to go against this and is suspended. The whole student body protests, and the administration gets worried on what to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1zfr4SRn4abGIx1Fu5olLVoXzp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119536'),
