  ('712517162375325359', 'The Extraordinary Voyage', 2011, 'Documentary, History', 'Serge Bromberg, Eric Lange, Fatma Tarhouni', 'Serge Bromberg', 'Serge Bromberg, Costa-Gavras, Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Michel Gondry, Michel Hazanavicius, Nicolas Ricordel, Eric Lange, Tom Burton', 'NR', 'An account of the extraordinary life of film pioneer Georges Méliès (1861-1938) and the amazing story of the copy in color of his masterpiece A Trip to the Moon (1902), unexpectedly found in Spain and restored thanks to the heroic efforts of a group of true cinema lovers.', 'An account of the extraordinary life of film pioneer Georges Méliès (1861-1938) and the amazing story of the copy in color of his masterpiece A Trip to the Moon (1902), unexpectedly found in Spain and restored thanks to the heroic efforts of a group of true cinema lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37dXuUl9Jv6NXFihaLsWbiYVBdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87061'),
  ('449784174777942003', 'The Extreme Tragic Story of Celal Tan and His Family', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Selçuk Yöntem, Ezgi Mola, Bülent Emin Yarar, Güler Ökten, Tansu Biçer, Türkü Turan, Cengiz Bozkurt, Köksal Engür', null, 'Celal Tan is a well-respected constitutional law professor who lives in a provincial city has two children from his first marriage. Many years after the death of his first wife, he married a woman much younger than him, a university student, whose life he has saved in some way. In the third year of their marriage, the extremely tragic story of Celal Tan and his family begins after a big crisis happened in front of the whole family. While trying to hide the secret, the family falls into absurd and tragicomic positions. Regardless of all happenings, Celal Tan tries to keep the family together.', 'Celal Tan is a well-respected constitutional law professor who lives in a provincial city has two children from his first marriage. Many years after the death of his first wife, he married a woman much younger than him, a university student, whose life he has saved in some way. In the third year of their marriage, the extremely tragic story of Celal Tan and his family begins after a big crisis happened in front of the whole family. While trying to hide the secret, the family falls into absurd and tragicomic positions. Regardless of all happenings, Celal Tan tries to keep the family together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t59t7dYdcgqTtpkOoF2VBVoh3oS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79212'),
  ('806543756656294692', 'The Eye', 2002, 'Horror', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Decha Srimantra, Danny Pang Phat', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Danny Pang Phat, Jojo Hui Yuet-Chun', 'Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Lawrence Chou Chun-Wai, Candy Lo Hau-Yam, Edmund Chen, Yut Lai So, Chadatirud Lertaveesin, Yin Ping Ko, Florence Wu Wing-Han', 'R', 'A blind concert violinist gets a cornea transplant allowing her to see again. However, she gets more than she bargained for when she realizes her new eye can see ghosts. She sets out to find the origins of the cornea and discover the fate of its former host.', 'A blind concert violinist gets a cornea transplant allowing her to see again. However, she gets more than she bargained for when she realizes her new eye can see ghosts. She sets out to find the origins of the cornea and discover the fate of its former host.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ux5xsVRBwusVrmOTlhV9zRhu93d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10389'),
  ('1138651951500896020', 'The Eye', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Jeffrey Jur, David Moreau, Xavier Palud', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Danny Pang Phat, Jojo Hui Yuet-Chun', 'Jessica Alba, Alessandro Nivola, Parker Posey, Chloë Grace Moretz, Rade Šerbedžija, Mia Stallard, Obba Babatundé, Danny Mora', 'PG-13', 'Violinist Sydney Wells was accidentally blinded by her sister Helen when she was five years old. She submits to a cornea transplantation, and while recovering from the operation, she realizes that she is seeing dead people.', 'Violinist Sydney Wells was accidentally blinded by her sister Helen when she was five years old. She submits to a cornea transplantation, and while recovering from the operation, she realizes that she is seeing dead people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9N3znJ8sHH2EQjARCrUpxMj3hWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9030'),
  ('275988726435728054', 'The Eye 2', 2004, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Danny Pang Phat, Oxide Pang Chun, Decha Srimantra', null, 'Shu Qi, Eugenia Yuan, Jesdaporn Pholdee, Supasawat Buranavech, Kwai Ying Cheung, Yiu Kwai Cheung, Lawrence Chou Chun-Wai, Phillip Kwok Chui', 'R', 'Pregnant Joey teeters on the brink of madness after several fruitless suicide attempts. She''s the unwilling recipient of an influx of shadowy images that haunt her pervasively. In an attempt to quell this disturbing phenomenon, she looks up with her secretive ex-lover Sam, who may be able to shed some light upon the mysterious twilight world descending upon Joey.', 'Pregnant Joey teeters on the brink of madness after several fruitless suicide attempts. She''s the unwilling recipient of an influx of shadowy images that haunt her pervasively. In an attempt to quell this disturbing phenomenon, she looks up with her secretive ex-lover Sam, who may be able to shed some light upon the mysterious twilight world descending upon Joey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLzGWnLYBTdCVqaXooertbagQgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24674'),
  ('723590196807655695', 'The Eye 3: Infinity', 2005, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Danny Pang Phat, Cub Chin Kong-Hon', 'Mark Woo Yiu-Fai', 'Chen Bolin, Kate Yeung, Ray MacDonald, Isabella Leong Lok-Sze, Kris Gu, Bongkoj Khongmalai, Ng Wing-Chuen, Tanyapan Jansiw', 'PG-13', 'Ted, his cousin May, her best friend April and April''s boyfriend, Kofei take a vacation to Thailand to visit their Thai buddy, Chongkwai, who shows them a book of ten ways to see ghosts. And the game begins.', 'Ted, his cousin May, her best friend April and April''s boyfriend, Kofei take a vacation to Thailand to visit their Thai buddy, Chongkwai, who shows them a book of ten ways to see ghosts. And the game begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyGFZeCOMylgpEC4LelxAL86Eeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33723'),
  ('474847744412005590', 'The Eye Creatures', 1967, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Larry Buchanan, Ralph K. Johnson, Joreta C. Cherry', 'Larry Buchanan, Robert J. Gurney Jr., Al Martin', 'John Ashley, Cynthia Hull, Warren Hammack, Chet Davis, Bill Peck, Ethan Allen, Charles McLine, Nathan Wyle', null, 'A teenager and his girlfriend must save the world from "eye" aliens after their attempts to convince authorities of an invasion fall on deaf ears.', 'A teenager and his girlfriend must save the world from "eye" aliens after their attempts to convince authorities of an invasion fall on deaf ears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vqyB8KcgafSzJXzi7fKDTKOHs0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63088'),
  ('519061382185770041', 'The Eye of the Monocle', 1962, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Georges Lautner', 'Georges Lautner, Jacques Robert, Colonel Rémy', 'Paul Meurisse, Elga Andersen, Gaia Germani, Charles Millot, Robert Dalban, Maurice Biraud, Georges Lautner, Raymond Meunier', null, 'In 1943, a German commando conceals a large quantity of gold in an undersea cave on the coast of Corsica. Years later, Schlumpf, the sole survivor of the commando, returns to Corsica to recuperate the treasure -- with British and Soviet spies on his heels, and closely monitored by Dromard, from the French intelligence services. The monocled Dromard is convinced that he can outfox his opponents, but difficulties accumulate: despite his plump appearance, Herr Schlumpf is a sly fellow; Corsica is teeming with treasure hunters from various nationalities; and all parties readily resort to unnatural alliances, brazen treachery, and strong-arm tactics. Who will get the treasure?', 'In 1943, a German commando conceals a large quantity of gold in an undersea cave on the coast of Corsica. Years later, Schlumpf, the sole survivor of the commando, returns to Corsica to recuperate the treasure -- with British and Soviet spies on his heels, and closely monitored by Dromard, from the French intelligence services. The monocled Dromard is convinced that he can outfox his opponents, but difficulties accumulate: despite his plump appearance, Herr Schlumpf is a sly fellow; Corsica is teeming with treasure hunters from various nationalities; and all parties readily resort to unnatural alliances, brazen treachery, and strong-arm tactics. Who will get the treasure?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUHMy314gHIoxQH2VmxCdBZTiMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66800'),
  ('1075207275923771695', 'The Eyes Have It', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig, Florence Gill', 'NR', 'Donald receives a mail order hypnosis kit complete with hypnotic goggles and decides to test it on Pluto. Using the goggles, he convinces Pluto he is a mouse, a turtle, and a chicken. Each "transformation" Pluto undergoes Donald finds extremely funny so he keeps at it until he notices chicken Pluto getting into a fight with a rooster. Donald helps Pluto win the fight by making him think he''s a lion but, unfortunately, the goggles break and Donald is chased about by Pluto until he regains his senses after a fall.', 'Donald receives a mail order hypnosis kit complete with hypnotic goggles and decides to test it on Pluto. Using the goggles, he convinces Pluto he is a mouse, a turtle, and a chicken. Each "transformation" Pluto undergoes Donald finds extremely funny so he keeps at it until he notices chicken Pluto getting into a fight with a rooster. Donald helps Pluto win the fight by making him think he''s a lion but, unfortunately, the goggles break and Donald is chased about by Pluto until he regains his senses after a fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBiFBgSlnhmJkFfEmm2FEP15xVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56631'),
  ('127422534616811310', 'The Eyes of My Mother', 2016, 'Drama, Horror', 'Nicolas Pesce, Zach Kuperstein', 'Nicolas Pesce', 'Kika Magalhães, Diana Agostini, Will Brill, Clara Wong, Olivia Bond, Joey Curtis-Green, Flora Diaz, Paul Nazak', 'R', 'A young, lonely woman is consumed by her deepest and darkest desires after tragedy strikes her quiet country life.', 'A young, lonely woman is consumed by her deepest and darkest desires after tragedy strikes her quiet country life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoR1TAxIkO1rRHu3F7cWzKZqxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371560'),
  ('1008225472644867912', 'The Eyes of Tammy Faye', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Michael Showalter, Mike Gioulakis, Rob Burgess', 'Abe Sylvia', 'Jessica Chastain, Andrew Garfield, Cherry Jones, Vincent D''Onofrio, Mark Wystrach, Sam Jaeger, Louis Cancelmi, Gabriel Olds', 'PG-13', 'From the 1960s to the 1980s, evangelist Jim Baker and his ambitious wife, Tammy Faye, rose from humble beginnings to build an empire based on big-time evangelical Christianity--only for the couple to fall from grace because of some all-too-human sins.', 'From the 1960s to the 1980s, evangelist Jim Baker and his ambitious wife, Tammy Faye, rose from humble beginnings to build an empire based on big-time evangelical Christianity--only for the couple to fall from grace because of some all-too-human sins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yL3IAfOxUH7h1Og9kxG3czxa4XV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601470'),
  ('1086753733539762786', 'The Eyes of the Mummy', 1918, 'Drama, Horror, Adventure', 'Alfred Hansen, Ernst Lubitsch', 'Hanns Kräly, Emil Rameau', 'Pola Negri, Emil Jannings, Harry Liedtke, Max Laurence', 'NR', 'Egyptians Radu and Ma milk British tourists out of their money by offering phony tours of a mummy''s tomb-- Radu has the girl lend her eyes to the "mummy" from inside an empty sarcophagus. When adventurer Wendland comes to visit the tomb, Ma is rescued and falls in love with him, leaving Radu in the dust. Needless to say, her former employer / captor follows them abroad in order to exact his revenge.', 'Egyptians Radu and Ma milk British tourists out of their money by offering phony tours of a mummy''s tomb-- Radu has the girl lend her eyes to the "mummy" from inside an empty sarcophagus. When adventurer Wendland comes to visit the tomb, Ma is rescued and falls in love with him, leaving Radu in the dust. Needless to say, her former employer / captor follows them abroad in order to exact his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2timSoyq2mACa43Ge2XUqVP18nX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28197'),
  ('1029940289328002664', 'The Eyes, the Mouth', 1982, 'Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio, Giuseppe Lanci, Cesare Bastelli', 'Vincenzo Cerami, Catherine Breillat', 'Lou Castel, Ángela Molina, Emmanuelle Riva, Michel Piccoli, Antonio Piovanelli, Viviana Toniolo, Antonio Petrocelli, Gianpaolo Saccarola', null, 'A rich Italian''s shocking suicide means different things to his twin brother, mother and pregnant lover.', 'A rich Italian''s shocking suicide means different things to his twin brother, mother and pregnant lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOu3bFZwdmLjguHe87iY9UsMSzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186551'),
  ('610493947909384691', 'The F-Word', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Olia Sosnovskaya, A.Z.H.', null, null, null, 'The video refers to the current protests in Belarus, political struggle and state violence through the discourse of fascism. The topic of fascism and victory over it has for a long time been central to the state ideology of Belarus.', 'The video refers to the current protests in Belarus, political struggle and state violence through the discourse of fascism. The topic of fascism and victory over it has for a long time been central to the state ideology of Belarus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRYyqHgDb2ZhlOoWYcBom2vnnDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861396'),
  ('919226801955484347', 'The F**k-It List', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Hamilton, Michael Duggan', 'Michael Duggan, Dan McDermott', 'Eli Brown, Madison Iseman, Marcus Scribner, Jerry O''Connell, Natalie Zea, Callan Mulvey, Camryn Manheim, Karan Brar', 'R', 'After a prank blows up a studious high school senior''s life, he shares a list of certain things he wishes he''d done differently — and maybe still can.', 'After a prank blows up a studious high school senior''s life, he shares a list of certain things he wishes he''d done differently — and maybe still can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ba4AWzu7Kh5q7GnGWzFsiLk5HU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598133'),
  ('78906730485218374', 'The Fabelmans', 2022, 'Drama', 'David Stickler, Josh McLaglen, Chris Cook', 'Tony Kushner, Steven Spielberg', 'Michelle Williams, Paul Dano, Seth Rogen, Gabriel LaBelle, Mateo Zoryan Francis-DeFord, Keeley Karsten, Alina Brace, Julia Butters', 'PG-13', 'Growing up in post-World War II era Arizona, young Sammy Fabelman aspires to become a filmmaker as he reaches adolescence, but soon discovers a shattering family secret and explores how the power of films can help him see the truth.', 'Growing up in post-World War II era Arizona, young Sammy Fabelman aspires to become a filmmaker as he reaches adolescence, but soon discovers a shattering family secret and explores how the power of films can help him see the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7llKkqkkJtJrTOaDLuVeUYDQ7I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804095'),
  ('418687351557734102', 'The Fable', 2019, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Kan Eguchi', 'Yusuke Watanabe', 'Junichi Okada, Fumino Kimura, Koichi Sato, Mizuki Yamamoto, Ken Yasuda, Yuya Yagira, Osamu Mukai, Sota Fukushi', null, 'The Fable is a legendary yakuza hitman equal to none—but his boss orders him and his sultry associate to lay low and learn how to live a "normal life" in Osaka.', 'The Fable is a legendary yakuza hitman equal to none—but his boss orders him and his sultry associate to lay low and learn how to live a "normal life" in Osaka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zILJ5Dzx1NTu2ATalKQrZgTi2mS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532267'),
  ('206771329954130054', 'The Fable: The Killer Who Doesn''t Kill', 2021, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Hayato Kawai, Kan Eguchi, Makoto Yokoyama', null, 'Junichi Okada, Fumino Kimura, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Yurina Hirate, Masanobu Ando, Mizuki Yamamoto, Jiro Sato, Kai Inowaki', null, 'Akira is the legendary killer known as the Fable. Following the order of his boss and due to being overworked, he lives peacefully with his partner, Yoko, as ordinary siblings. Akira still works part-time at design company Octopus with CEO Takoda and employee Misaki. CEO Takoda and Misaki are unaware of Akira''s background as an assassin. Meanwhile, Utsubo is a representative for an NPO. But, Utsubo works with contract killer Suzuki to set people up for extortion purposes. They target someone at design company Octopus.', 'Akira is the legendary killer known as the Fable. Following the order of his boss and due to being overworked, he lives peacefully with his partner, Yoko, as ordinary siblings. Akira still works part-time at design company Octopus with CEO Takoda and employee Misaki. CEO Takoda and Misaki are unaware of Akira''s background as an assassin. Meanwhile, Utsubo is a representative for an NPO. But, Utsubo works with contract killer Suzuki to set people up for extortion purposes. They target someone at design company Octopus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZgnxaT3BKkKU3RIJnR024ZjP9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734519'),
  ('1080857824340825183', 'The Fabulous Adventures of the Legendary Baron Munchausen', 1979, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Jean Image', 'France Image', 'Dominique Paturel, Michel Elias, Francine Lainé, Michel Modo, Jacques Marin, Maurice Chevit, Alexandre Rignault, Olivier Hussenot', null, 'The Fabulous Adventures of the legendary Baron Munchausen is a French animated feature from Jean Image of 1978, inspired by the adventures of Baron Munchausen. Baron Munchausen is wont to bring his friends to tell them about his imaginary exploits.', 'The Fabulous Adventures of the legendary Baron Munchausen is a French animated feature from Jean Image of 1978, inspired by the adventures of Baron Munchausen. Baron Munchausen is wont to bring his friends to tell them about his imaginary exploits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgUlWPxCFMvhy3Jtbw5gjImUSmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118266'),
  ('976895481901289570', 'The Fabulous Baker Boys', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Steve Kloves, Michael Ballhaus, Wallis Nicita', 'Steve Kloves', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, Jeff Bridges, Beau Bridges, Ellie Raab, Jennifer Tilly, Xander Berkeley, Terri Treas, Dakin Matthews', 'R', 'The lives of two struggling musicians, who happen to be brothers, inevitably change when they team up with a beautiful, up-and-coming singer.', 'The lives of two struggling musicians, who happen to be brothers, inevitably change when they team up with a beautiful, up-and-coming singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nS8AxnoYE2Y1ANMpVKZnm8iLxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10875'),
  ('994231920502804454', 'The Fabulous Baron Munchausen', 1962, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Karel Zeman, Jiří Tarantík, Zdeněk Rozkopal', 'Karel Zeman, Jiří Brdečka', 'Miloš Kopecký, Jana Brejchová, Rudolf Jelínek, Karel Höger, Jan Werich, Rudolf Hrušínský, Eduard Kohout, Bohuš Záhorský', null, 'A 20th century man lands on the Moon and discovers that Baron Munchausen has beaten him to it, accompanied by Cyrano de Bergerac and the characters from Jules Verne''s novels about the conquest of the satellite.', 'A 20th century man lands on the Moon and discovers that Baron Munchausen has beaten him to it, accompanied by Cyrano de Bergerac and the characters from Jules Verne''s novels about the conquest of the satellite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azAhyBd8netxD18VdYo7C4oUvbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41213'),
  ('879851930420809899', 'The Fabulous Dorseys', 1947, 'Music, Romance', 'Alfred E. Green, James Van Trees', 'Curtis Kenyon, Richard English, Art Arthur', 'Tommy Dorsey, Jimmy Dorsey, Janet Blair, Paul Whiteman, William Lundigan, Sara Allgood, Dave Willock, Arthur Shields', 'NR', 'The story of Tommy and Jimmy Dorsey from their boyhood in Pennsylvania through their rise, their breakup, and their personal reunion.', 'The story of Tommy and Jimmy Dorsey from their boyhood in Pennsylvania through their rise, their breakup, and their personal reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGi0L75IRvtB9KN0uts0EtihFZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43465'),
  ('660209133538319869', 'The Fabulous Four', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jocelyn Moorhouse, Roberto Schaefer', 'Jenna Milly, Ann Marie Allison', 'Susan Sarandon, Bette Midler, Megan Mullally, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Timothy V. Murphy, Bruce Greenwood, Kadan Well Bennett, Renika Williams', 'R', 'Three lifelong friends travel to Key West, Florida to be bridesmaids in the surprise wedding of their college girlfriend Marilyn. Once there, sisterhoods are rekindled, the past rises up again in all its glory, and there’s enough sparks, drinks, and romance to change all their lives in ways they never expected.', 'Three lifelong friends travel to Key West, Florida to be bridesmaids in the surprise wedding of their college girlfriend Marilyn. Once there, sisterhoods are rekindled, the past rises up again in all its glory, and there’s enough sparks, drinks, and romance to change all their lives in ways they never expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7kZFm81LBr2wf34MAdKexkZ0NH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974613'),
  ('197052253278049625', 'The Fabulous Ones', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Roberta Torre, Stefano Salemme', 'Roberta Torre, Cristian Ceresoli, Nico Morabito', 'Porpora Marcasciano, Nicole De Leo, Sofia Mehiel, Veet Sandeh, Mizia Ciulini, Massimina Lizzeri, Antonia Iaia, Mina Serrano', null, 'It often happens that at the moment of death, transgender individuals are shorn of their identity. Their families are ashamed, the funeral takes place in secret, and on the tomb appears the name the deceased had before their transition, in one stroke nullifying the entire life path they had chosen. The same thing happened to Antonia. Her girlfriends gather to honor her memory and give her back her identity denied. In telling her story, the film’s stars, all drawn from the variegated transgender world, interweave the narrative with tales of their own lives, experiences, and memories.', 'It often happens that at the moment of death, transgender individuals are shorn of their identity. Their families are ashamed, the funeral takes place in secret, and on the tomb appears the name the deceased had before their transition, in one stroke nullifying the entire life path they had chosen. The same thing happened to Antonia. Her girlfriends gather to honor her memory and give her back her identity denied. In telling her story, the film’s stars, all drawn from the variegated transgender world, interweave the narrative with tales of their own lives, experiences, and memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8YQB0PkRrse47TMpG1C5toaALc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970229'),
  ('636801219191064671', 'The Fabulous Patars', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Reine, Renaud Chassaing', 'Gladys Marciano, Sophie Reine', 'Gustave Kervern, Camille Cottin, Fanie Zanini, Héloïse Dugas, Mathieu Métral, François Bureloup, Thomas Guy, Édith Le Merdy', null, 'Denis struggles to raise his boisterous daughters Janine and Mercredi on his own while holding down two jobs. Everything goes sour when Denis forgets Mercredi one too many times at the school gates. Séverine, a cheerful social worker, is appointed to scrutinize the family’s daily lives.', 'Denis struggles to raise his boisterous daughters Janine and Mercredi on his own while holding down two jobs. Everything goes sour when Denis forgets Mercredi one too many times at the school gates. Séverine, a cheerful social worker, is appointed to scrutinize the family’s daily lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpjQjfcg5hufZ27AMzeYyAwWSnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415032'),
  ('918591929057511376', 'The Fabulous World of Jules Verne', 1958, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Karel Zeman, Milan Vácha, Zdeněk Rozkopal', 'František Hrubín, Jiří Brdečka, Karel Zeman', 'Lubor Tokoš, Jana Zatloukalová, Arnošt Navrátil, Miloslav Holub, František Šlégr, Otto Šimánek, Václav Kyzlink, František Řehák', null, 'As the world progresses into the industrial age, a professor studying the "nature of pure matter" is spirited away by a would-be dictator and connived into building a super-bomb, as a young reporter and a girl rescued from the sea attempt to warn him of their mutual kidnapper''s intentions to dominate the world with a new and more-deadly-yet weapon.', 'As the world progresses into the industrial age, a professor studying the "nature of pure matter" is spirited away by a would-be dictator and connived into building a super-bomb, as a young reporter and a girl rescued from the sea attempt to warn him of their mutual kidnapper''s intentions to dominate the world with a new and more-deadly-yet weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJ9GqbghpkPJ4siOycoCXEdVC1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19759'),
  ('150875134232416571', 'The Face at the Window', 1939, 'Drama, Horror', 'George King, Hone Glendinning, Hal Mason', 'A.R. Rawlinson', 'Tod Slaughter, Marjorie Taylor, John Warwick, Aubrey Mallalieu, Robert Adair, Wallace Evennett, Leonard Henry, Kay Lewis', 'NR', 'In 1880, the criminal called The Wolf is responsible for a murderous rampage in France. When the Brisson Bank is robbed in Paris and the employee Michelle is murdered, the wealthy Chevalier Lucio del Gardo is the only chance to save the bank. Chevalier proposes to the owner M. de Brisson to deposit a large amount of gold, but in return he would like to marry his daughter Cecile. However, Cecile is in love with the efficient clerk Lucien Cortier that belongs to the lower classes and refuses the engagement. In order to get rid off the rival, Chevalier uses evidences to incriminate Lucien, manipulating the incompetent Parisian chief of police.', 'In 1880, the criminal called The Wolf is responsible for a murderous rampage in France. When the Brisson Bank is robbed in Paris and the employee Michelle is murdered, the wealthy Chevalier Lucio del Gardo is the only chance to save the bank. Chevalier proposes to the owner M. de Brisson to deposit a large amount of gold, but in return he would like to marry his daughter Cecile. However, Cecile is in love with the efficient clerk Lucien Cortier that belongs to the lower classes and refuses the engagement. In order to get rid off the rival, Chevalier uses evidences to incriminate Lucien, manipulating the incompetent Parisian chief of police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6Nq42o8CKrAvIkJ0eEZ2wjK20Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41022'),
  ('1036087686961948834', 'The Face Behind the Mask', 1941, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Robert Florey, Franz Planer, Morris Stoloff', 'Paul Jarrico, Allen Vincent', 'Peter Lorre, Evelyn Keyes, Don Beddoe, George E. Stone, John Tyrrell, Cy Schindell, Stanley Brown, James Seay', 'NR', 'A kindly, enthusiastic, newly-arrived American immigrant from Hungary is forced to turn to a life of crime after his face is badly disfigured in a hotel fire.', 'A kindly, enthusiastic, newly-arrived American immigrant from Hungary is forced to turn to a life of crime after his face is badly disfigured in a hotel fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9r2dwKDYIGiEhN2iUEQ8wDUFx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34943'),
  ('550326133339604125', 'The Face of an Angel', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Winterbottom, Hubert Taczanowski', 'Paul Viragh', 'Daniel Brühl, Kate Beckinsale, Cara Delevingne, Ava Acres, Corrado Invernizzi, Genevieve Gaunt, Sai Bennett, Valerio Mastandrea', 'PG-13', 'Both a journalist and a documentary filmmaker chase the story of a murder and its prime suspect.', 'Both a journalist and a documentary filmmaker chase the story of a murder and its prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/100pHE252kgwxwVNbiflYV9j1yi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254024'),
  ('725814075917713057', 'The Face of Another', 1966, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Hiroshi Teshigahara, Mitsuo Kume, Hiroshi Segawa', 'Kōbō Abe', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Mikijiro Hira, Machiko Kyō, Kyôko Kishida, Eiji Okada, Miki Irie, Kakuya Saeki, Minoru Chiaki', 'NR', 'A businessman with a disfigured face obtains a lifelike mask from his new doctor, but the mask starts altering his personality and causing him to question his identity.', 'A businessman with a disfigured face obtains a lifelike mask from his new doctor, but the mask starts altering his personality and causing him to question his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUnFdf1Mf1b8AD3ChMPOCUfTBDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29452'),
  ('851763131756516066', 'The Face Of Another', 2013, 'Drama', 'Italo Petriccione, Pappi Corsicato, Alice Marchitelli', 'Monica Rametta, Pappi Corsicato, Gianni Romoli', 'Laura Chiatti, Alessandro Preziosi, Lino Guanciale, Iaia Forte, Angela Goodwin, Fabrizio Contri, Giancarlo Cauteruccio, Arnaldo Ninchi', null, 'Bella is the host of a popular television program about plastic surgery. Her husband René is a surgeon who performs operations on guests during the same show. Then Bella is fired, due to a drop in the ratings. She storms out of the TV studio and has a terrible car accident on the way home, leaving her disfigured. Yet what might well seem to be the coup de grace for Bella’s career turns out to be the perfect occasion to relaunch her own image...', 'Bella is the host of a popular television program about plastic surgery. Her husband René is a surgeon who performs operations on guests during the same show. Then Bella is fired, due to a drop in the ratings. She storms out of the TV studio and has a terrible car accident on the way home, leaving her disfigured. Yet what might well seem to be the coup de grace for Bella’s career turns out to be the perfect occasion to relaunch her own image...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4RpZ7CD0CgP34yOot3KJRVVebz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180861'),
