  ('1068427940735659540', 'The Face of Marble', 1946, 'Horror', 'William Beaudine, Harry Neumann', 'Michael Jacoby', 'John Carradine, Claudia Drake, Robert Shayne, Maris Wrixon, Willie Best, Thomas E. Jackson, Rosa Rey, Neal Burns', 'NR', 'The story of Dr. Charles Randolph, a scientist dedicated to deciphering the secrets of life and death. Aided by assistant David Cochran, Charles conducts experiments that have horrifying side effects. Charles''s lonely wife, Elaine, is frightened by his work, and in order to protect her, housekeeper Maria unleashes a torrent of voodoo that wrecks havoc.', 'The story of Dr. Charles Randolph, a scientist dedicated to deciphering the secrets of life and death. Aided by assistant David Cochran, Charles conducts experiments that have horrifying side effects. Charles''s lonely wife, Elaine, is frightened by his work, and in order to protect her, housekeeper Maria unleashes a torrent of voodoo that wrecks havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AroKPWkIjaKWdHpp9jwWf5Q5a4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86901'),
  ('97971114688601381', 'The Face on the Milk Carton', 1995, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Waris Hussein, Robert Steadman, Donald P.H. Eaton', null, 'Kellie Martin, Sharon Lawrence, Richard Masur, Jill Clayburgh, Edward Herrmann, Johnny Green, Kristoffer Ryan Winters, Caroline Perreyclear', null, 'Based on the book by Caroline B. Cooney, a girl happens to look down at a milk carton one day and she sees herself on the back! Could her parents really have kidnapped her?', 'Based on the book by Caroline B. Cooney, a girl happens to look down at a milk carton one day and she sees herself on the back! Could her parents really have kidnapped her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nn6tIfJIzkPupZnAfG4arU1dcF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108227'),
