  ('580468864323156003', 'The Face You Deserve', 2005, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Miguel Gomes, Rui Poças', 'Manuel Mozos, Telmo Churro, Miguel Gomes', 'José Airosa, Gracinda Nave, Sara Graça, Miguel Barroso, João Nicolau, Ricardo Gross, Rui Catalão, António Pedro Figueiredo', null, 'Francisco, behave! I Know it''s your birthday, you are thirty now, it''s carnival, you''ve dressed as a cowboy for the school party and you are surrounded by kids you hate. But that''s no reason to be so annoying... Francisco, repeat after me: "Up to your 30s you have the face God has given you. After that, you get the face you deserve".', 'Francisco, behave! I Know it''s your birthday, you are thirty now, it''s carnival, you''ve dressed as a cowboy for the school party and you are surrounded by kids you hate. But that''s no reason to be so annoying... Francisco, repeat after me: "Up to your 30s you have the face God has given you. After that, you get the face you deserve".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mwIlPME54QoFbOntDDUg3yc2Hf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130184'),
