  ('858956594431479710', 'The Fairfield County Four', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, Documentary, Indie', 'Joshua Brucker', 'Joshua Brucker', 'Noah J. Welter, Erica Fett, Celeste Blandon, Jake Kopronica, John Bloom', null, 'Four young adults disappear while investigating reports of a large, wolf-like creature. Though no trace of the four was found, their camera was eventually located. This would be the last known footage of The Fairfield County Four.', 'Four young adults disappear while investigating reports of a large, wolf-like creature. Though no trace of the four was found, their camera was eventually located. This would be the last known footage of The Fairfield County Four.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FrgCVAdvyciFfOFdTHXuzpiPxTx5.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-fairfield-county-four'),
  ('303838820518526560', 'The Fairly OddParents: Channel Chasers', 2004, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Butch Hartman', 'Steve Marmel, Butch Hartman', 'Tara Strong, Daran Norris, Susanne Blakeslee, Grey DeLisle, Carlos Alazraqui, Jason Marsden, Gary LeRoi Gray, Dee Bradley Baker', null, 'After being punished with no more television for the rest of his life, Timmy wishes himself into the world of television in order to escape the harsh reality of his life and his parents. Unfortunately for him, his carelessness with magic results in Vicky taking over the world in the future. It''s all up to Timmy to stop her in attempts to prevent her from destroying Dimmsdale, while escaping a mysterious masked man that is trying to track him down.', 'After being punished with no more television for the rest of his life, Timmy wishes himself into the world of television in order to escape the harsh reality of his life and his parents. Unfortunately for him, his carelessness with magic results in Vicky taking over the world in the future. It''s all up to Timmy to stop her in attempts to prevent her from destroying Dimmsdale, while escaping a mysterious masked man that is trying to track him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJcC7gsQ7oEIDRd0e0fsVEhcSPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375273'),
