  ('363138872146213637', 'The Falcon in Danger', 1943, 'Crime, Mystery, War', 'William Clemens, Frank Redman, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Fred Niblo Jr., Craig Rice', 'Tom Conway, Jean Brooks, Elaine Shepard, Amelita Ward, Cliff Clark, Edward Gargan, Clarence Kolb, Felix Basch', 'NR', 'Two industrialists disappear from an airplane while the plane is in the air. Also missing is $100,000. The Falcon investigates and discovers a plot against the government.', 'Two industrialists disappear from an airplane while the plane is in the air. Also missing is $100,000. The Falcon investigates and discovers a plot against the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYO1a5ZXLNosJ1iN0W84kSMn1Hg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44169'),
  ('313583879825759220', 'The Falcon in Hollywood', 1944, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Gordon Douglas, Nicholas Musuraca, James E. Casey', 'Gerald Geraghty', 'Tom Conway, Barbara Hale, Veda Ann Borg, John Abbott, Sheldon Leonard, Konstantin Shayne, Emory Parnell, Frank Jenks', 'NR', 'Suave amateur detective Tom Lawrence--aka Michael Arlen''s literary hero The Falcon--arrives in Hollywood for some rest and relaxation, only to find himself involved in the murder of a movie actor. There''s no shortage of suspects: the costume designer to whom he was married, a tyrannical director, a beautiful young French starlet, a Shakespeare-quoting producer, even a New York gangster. Helping The Falcon solve the crime is a cute, wise-cracking cab driver and a pair of bumbling cops.', 'Suave amateur detective Tom Lawrence--aka Michael Arlen''s literary hero The Falcon--arrives in Hollywood for some rest and relaxation, only to find himself involved in the murder of a movie actor. There''s no shortage of suspects: the costume designer to whom he was married, a tyrannical director, a beautiful young French starlet, a Shakespeare-quoting producer, even a New York gangster. Helping The Falcon solve the crime is a cute, wise-cracking cab driver and a pair of bumbling cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pdDEiJDpq1VVLyI1apFc9tgdrl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44170'),
  ('1100004913472547083', 'The Falcon in San Francisco', 1945, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Joseph H. Lewis, Virgil Miller, William A. Sickner', 'Ben Markson, Robert E. Kent', 'Tom Conway, Rita Corday, Edward Brophy, Sharyn Moffett, Fay Helm, Robert Armstrong, Carl Kent, George Holmes', 'NR', 'While on vacation, the Falcon is arrested for kidnapping after striking up a friendship with a girl whose nurse has been recently murdered.', 'While on vacation, the Falcon is arrested for kidnapping after striking up a friendship with a girl whose nurse has been recently murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1nQcivSZXIBxiyBo44xAC0Vk37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46682'),
  ('38677150906928146', 'The Falcon Out West', 1944, 'Crime, Mystery, Western', 'William Clemens, Harry J. Wild, James E. Casey', 'Billy Jones, Morton Grant', 'Tom Conway, Carole Gallagher, Barbara Hale, Joan Barclay, Cliff Clark, Edward Gargan, Minor Watson, Donald Douglas', 'NR', 'When a Texas playboy is murdered in a New York City nightclub the Falcon investigates. When he learns that the victim was slipped rattlesnake venom, the trail leads to Texas, his own kidnapping and near death.', 'When a Texas playboy is murdered in a New York City nightclub the Falcon investigates. When he learns that the victim was slipped rattlesnake venom, the trail leads to Texas, his own kidnapping and near death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLMXHkcZhFzvlZCyvK1vi5Hcxm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44171'),
  ('1069794155824284950', 'The Falcon Strikes Back', 1943, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Edward Dmytryk, Jack MacKenzie, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Edward Dein, Gerald Geraghty', 'Tom Conway, Harriet Nelson, Jane Randolph, Edgar Kennedy, Cliff Edwards, Rita Corday, Erford Gage, Wynne Gibson', 'NR', 'The Falcon is framed for the murder of a banker and the theft of war bonds. He makes his escape into the mountains where he hides out in a rustic lodge. From here he uncovers a phony war bond operation.', 'The Falcon is framed for the murder of a banker and the theft of war bonds. He makes his escape into the mountains where he hides out in a rustic lodge. From here he uncovers a phony war bond operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5BvvyCq1FoHnl2Yz22bnd3vE4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44172'),
  ('769619248039659082', 'The Falcon Takes Over', 1942, 'Crime, Mystery', 'George Robinson, Irving Reis, Ruby Rosenberg', 'Frank Fenton, Lynn Root', 'George Sanders, Lynn Bari, James Gleason, Allen Jenkins, Helen Gilbert, Ward Bond, Anne Revere, Turhan Bey', 'NR', 'While an escaped convict, Moose Malloy, goes in search of his ex-girlfriend Velma, police inspector Michael O''Hara attempts to track him assuming him to be a prime suspect for a number of mishaps.', 'While an escaped convict, Moose Malloy, goes in search of his ex-girlfriend Velma, police inspector Michael O''Hara attempts to track him assuming him to be a prime suspect for a number of mishaps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0QJ2GYYQKn6ukbyDiudnj1SSfN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44173'),
  ('1067988342384256120', 'The Falcon''s Alibi', 1946, 'Adventure, Crime, Mystery', 'Frank Redman, Ray McCarey, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Paul Yawitz', 'Tom Conway, Rita Corday, Vince Barnett, Jane Greer, Elisha Cook Jr., Emory Parnell, Al Bridge, Esther Howard', 'NR', 'A society sleuth sets out on the trail of a society matron''s lost jewels.', 'A society sleuth sets out on the trail of a society matron''s lost jewels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qN6Q2ZuwOo252KGgs1skPKwCVUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47314'),
  ('580575352813079565', 'The Falcon''s Brother', 1942, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Stanley Logan, Russell Metty, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Stuart Palmer, Craig Rice', 'George Sanders, Tom Conway, Jane Randolph, Don Barclay, Cliff Clark, Edward Gargan, Eddie Dunn, Charlotte Wynters', 'NR', 'A gentlemanly detective known as The Falcon calls on his brother to help him stop the Nazis from assassinating a key diplomat.', 'A gentlemanly detective known as The Falcon calls on his brother to help him stop the Nazis from assassinating a key diplomat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaIc5vV9BbT8iGU8UW8BLoja8ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44174'),
  ('472065170280138010', 'The Fall', 2006, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Tarsem Singh, Colin Watkinson, Marcelo Durst', 'Valeri Petrov', 'Lee Pace, Justine Waddell, Daniel Caltagirone, Leo Bill, Sean Gilder, Julian Bleach, Marcus Wesley, Robin Smith', 'R', 'In a hospital on the outskirts of 1920s Los Angeles, an injured stuntman begins to tell a fellow patient, a little girl with a broken arm, a fantastic story about 5 mythical heroes. Thanks to his fractured state of mind and her vivid imagination, the line between fiction and reality starts to blur as the tale advances.', 'In a hospital on the outskirts of 1920s Los Angeles, an injured stuntman begins to tell a fellow patient, a little girl with a broken arm, a fantastic story about 5 mythical heroes. Thanks to his fractured state of mind and her vivid imagination, the line between fiction and reality starts to blur as the tale advances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIU6fiyTWa56OXK9nwxK9tDVR6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14784'),
  ('484411585926904944', 'The Fall', 2019, 'Horror', 'Andrew Vanneck, Graham Leighton, Rosie Rickman', 'Jonathan Glazer', 'James Adams, Stuart Anderson, McKinley Bex, Susanne Brown, Lee Byford, Fionn Cox-Davies, Andrius Davidenas, Chris Jupe', 'PG-13', 'A mob''s punishment of a lone man proves cruel and unusual.', 'A mob''s punishment of a lone man proves cruel and unusual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltZj6zkzsTjKOA6XK1mlW0bxGrs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643065'),
  ('1030802613034856342', 'The Fall Guy', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Max Nadilo, Jonathan Sela, Chris O''Hara', 'Drew Pearce', 'Ryan Gosling, Emily Blunt, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Hannah Waddingham, Teresa Palmer, Stephanie Hsu, Winston Duke, Ben Knight', 'PG-13', 'Fresh off an almost career-ending accident, stuntman Colt Seavers has to track down a missing movie star, solve a conspiracy and try to win back the love of his life while still doing his day job.', 'Fresh off an almost career-ending accident, stuntman Colt Seavers has to track down a missing movie star, solve a conspiracy and try to win back the love of his life while still doing his day job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7olqFmzcIX5c23kX4zSmLPJi8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746036'),
  ('868369236693676121', 'The Fall of Ako Castle', 1978, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Yoshio Miyajima, Hanjirō Nakazawa', 'Kōji Takada', 'Kinnosuke Nakamura, Sonny Chiba, Tsunehiko Watase, Teruhiko Saigō, Kyōko Enami, Masaomi Kondo, Shinsuke Mikimoto, Hiroki Matsukata', null, 'This is the story of "The Forty-Seven Ronin." Based on historical events in 1701-2, the movie tells the tale of the Asano clan''s downfall and the revenge of its former samurai on the perpetrator of the catastrophe. Lord Asano was goaded, or tricked, into drawing his sword inside the Shogun''s palace -- a crime which carried the death penalty. The newly installed Shogun was furious at Asano and ordered all his clan''s assets seized, meaning some 20,000 samurai and commoners were unemployed and landless at a stroke. Forty-seven of these ronin (masterless samurai) banded together to take attempt revenge on Lord Kira, who had goaded Asano into drawing his sword.', 'This is the story of "The Forty-Seven Ronin." Based on historical events in 1701-2, the movie tells the tale of the Asano clan''s downfall and the revenge of its former samurai on the perpetrator of the catastrophe. Lord Asano was goaded, or tricked, into drawing his sword inside the Shogun''s palace -- a crime which carried the death penalty. The newly installed Shogun was furious at Asano and ordered all his clan''s assets seized, meaning some 20,000 samurai and commoners were unemployed and landless at a stroke. Forty-seven of these ronin (masterless samurai) banded together to take attempt revenge on Lord Kira, who had goaded Asano into drawing his sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doBE70EgjYVMq2ylTZjQOzRzrJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70959'),
  ('338910967159031895', 'The Fall of Berlin', 1945, 'Documentary, War', 'Yuli Raizman, Elizaveta Svilova, Mykola Shpykovskyi', 'Mykola Shpykovskyi', 'Leonid Khmara, Rudolf Boettger, Vasiliy Chuikov, Hermann Göring, Adolf Hitler, Wilhelm Keitel, Benito Mussolini, Carl Spaatz', null, 'A Soviet documentary chronicling the final assault on Nazi Germany’s capital. More than forty frontline cameramen from the 1st Belorussian and 1st Ukrainian Fronts captured the battle and its aftermath, supplemented with seized German footage. The film records the destruction of Berlin and the symbolic collapse of Hitler’s regime, standing as both a historical chronicle and a work of Soviet wartime cinema.', 'A Soviet documentary chronicling the final assault on Nazi Germany’s capital. More than forty frontline cameramen from the 1st Belorussian and 1st Ukrainian Fronts captured the battle and its aftermath, supplemented with seized German footage. The film records the destruction of Berlin and the symbolic collapse of Hitler’s regime, standing as both a historical chronicle and a work of Soviet wartime cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2BmRQpTuoWaOiBzKJpokTOcEeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273125'),
  ('652358915907167622', 'The Fall of Berlin', 1950, 'Drama, War', 'Leonid Kosmatov, Mikheil Chiaureli, Meri Andzhaparidze', 'Pyotr Pavlenko, Mikheil Chiaureli', 'Mikheil Gelovani, Aleksei Gribov, Maksim Shtraukh, Nikolai Bogolyubov, Sofiya Giatsintova, Boris Tenin, Boris Livanov, Sergei Blinnikov', null, 'Surrounded by a few party officials, Alexei Ivanov, a stakhanovist smelter, is decorated by Stalin. The "Little Father of the Peoples" takes this opportunity to invoke threats of war.... One day, war indeed breaks out. Bombs fall on the field where Alexei finds himself in the company of the schoolmistress Natacha, his fiancée. Alexei joins the Red Army and soon becomes a sergeant. Fighting rages and German troops advance. Natacha is arrested and deported. But the tide turns decisively with the German defeat at Stalingrad. Now the major offensive against Hitler can begin.', 'Surrounded by a few party officials, Alexei Ivanov, a stakhanovist smelter, is decorated by Stalin. The "Little Father of the Peoples" takes this opportunity to invoke threats of war.... One day, war indeed breaks out. Bombs fall on the field where Alexei finds himself in the company of the schoolmistress Natacha, his fiancée. Alexei joins the Red Army and soon becomes a sergeant. Fighting rages and German troops advance. Natacha is arrested and deported. But the tide turns decisively with the German defeat at Stalingrad. Now the major offensive against Hitler can begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OdQHObUSvbJ0pOGPJ34P6F89lU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106259'),
  ('333618587598195741', 'The Fall of Otrar', 1991, 'War, Drama, History', 'Ardak Amirkulov, Sapar Koichumanov', 'Aleksei German, Svetlana Karmalita', 'Dokhturbek Kydyraliev, Tungyshbai Zhamankulov, Bolot Beyshenaliev, Abdurashid Maksudov, Zaur Zekhov, Kasym Zhakibayev, Sabira Ataeva, Petr Morozov', null, 'A staggering historical epic about the intrigue and turmoil of the East Asian civilization of Otrar, before its systematic destruction at the hands of Genghis Khan.', 'A staggering historical epic about the intrigue and turmoil of the East Asian civilization of Otrar, before its systematic destruction at the hands of Genghis Khan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7aHbXx82RT911Uig7egMMXNSWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48683'),
  ('978786002481681771', 'The Fall of Rock and Roll', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Goran Gajić, Vladimir Slavica, Zoran Pezo', 'Branko Vukojević, Biljana Maksić, Aleksandar Barišić', 'Dušan Kojić ''Koja'', Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Velimir Živojinović, Sonja Savić, Branimir Brstina, Anica Dobra, Nebojša Bakočević, Branko Đurić', null, 'Omnibus film, consisting of three independent parts: in the first story, Koma, a failed rocker, wants to prove to his producer father that newly composed music could be better than his. He becomes a mysterious masked folk singer-known as Ninja. In the second, Dracula is killed... again. This time he does not dies oby way of a wooden stake, a silver bullet, or a cross. A blonde woman manages to deprive him of eternal life without the help of sunrise. The last story is about Eve and Djuro. She is creator, he is a musician. They live in a harmonious relationship, but a love letter brings division among them.', 'Omnibus film, consisting of three independent parts: in the first story, Koma, a failed rocker, wants to prove to his producer father that newly composed music could be better than his. He becomes a mysterious masked folk singer-known as Ninja. In the second, Dracula is killed... again. This time he does not dies oby way of a wooden stake, a silver bullet, or a cross. A blonde woman manages to deprive him of eternal life without the help of sunrise. The last story is about Eve and Djuro. She is creator, he is a musician. They live in a harmonious relationship, but a love letter brings division among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YOyKgDR5OTC6W8hY3IEn0CYffo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33587'),
  ('944855954933843100', 'The Fall of Sir Douglas Weatherford', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sean Dunn, David Gallego, Jessie Frost', 'Sean Dunn', 'Peter Mullan, Gayle Rankin, Jakob Oftebro, Oliver Maltman, Saskia Ashdown', null, 'Kenneth, fixated on ancestor Douglas Weatherford, descends into madness as a fantasy TV show invades his town, disregarding traditions. His obsession with the show''s lead actor fuels a tragic downward spiral witnessed by daughter Anna.', 'Kenneth, fixated on ancestor Douglas Weatherford, descends into madness as a fantasy TV show invades his town, disregarding traditions. His obsession with the show''s lead actor fuels a tragic downward spiral witnessed by daughter Anna.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkIBfjBkXPw2XfpTzB3f67vfRGnY.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-fall-of-sir-douglas-weatherford-2026'),
  ('330220683904382966', 'The Fall of Sparta', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniel Villeneuve, Tristan DuBois, Nathalie Boutrie', 'Biz, Tristan DuBois', 'Lévi Doré, Jonathan St-Armand, Lili-Ann De Francesco, Karl Walcott, Simon Duchesne, Marianne Farley, Gabriel Sabourin, Devon O''Connor', null, 'When we are young, we sometimes feel that the world is stacked against us. This is the case for 16 year-old Steeve Simard (Lévi Doré), who is entering his last year at Gaston-Miron High School in St-Lambert. A cynical intellectual with a critical view of himself and the world, he struggles to establish bonds with his parents and peers. He only has one friend: Virgil (Jonathan St-Armand). In order to evade his loneliness and fill a void in his imagination, he seeks refuge in his books and music. However, an incident with the star of the Spartans football team, will force Steeve to come out of his shell and face his destiny…', 'When we are young, we sometimes feel that the world is stacked against us. This is the case for 16 year-old Steeve Simard (Lévi Doré), who is entering his last year at Gaston-Miron High School in St-Lambert. A cynical intellectual with a critical view of himself and the world, he struggles to establish bonds with his parents and peers. He only has one friend: Virgil (Jonathan St-Armand). In order to evade his loneliness and fill a void in his imagination, he seeks refuge in his books and music. However, an incident with the star of the Spartans football team, will force Steeve to come out of his shell and face his destiny…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKJvUz6kQpnacYKkjmp0Ijoqz5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516592'),
  ('788559387972184978', 'The Fall of the American Empire', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Denys Arcand, Van Royko, Anne Sirois', 'Denys Arcand', 'Alexandre Landry, Maripier Morin, Rémy Girard, Louis Morissette, Maxim Roy, Pierre Curzi, Vincent Leclerc, Patrick Abellard', null, 'A shy and insecure delivery driver arrives on the scene of a robbery-gone-wrong and picks up two bags of cash and hides them in his truck. He is interrogated by two tough police detectives and manages to evade suspicion but he is warned that whoever owns the money will be looking for it. Only the help of a prostitute and a former biker recently released from jail might get him out of trouble.', 'A shy and insecure delivery driver arrives on the scene of a robbery-gone-wrong and picks up two bags of cash and hides them in his truck. He is interrogated by two tough police detectives and manages to evade suspicion but he is warned that whoever owns the money will be looking for it. Only the help of a prostitute and a former biker recently released from jail might get him out of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mStaOzKKMOODJGhiQsrhCvIOPmt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515047'),
  ('853612515467301777', 'The Fall of the House of Usher', 1928, 'Horror', 'Jean Epstein, Georges Lucas, Jean Lucas', 'Jean Epstein, Luis Buñuel', 'Jean Debucourt, Marguerite Gance, Charles Lamy, Fournez-Goffard, Luc Dartagnan, Abel Gance, Halma, Pierre Hot', null, 'Convinced that his family is tainted by generations of evil, Roderick Usher is hellbent on stopping his sister Madeline’s wedding to prevent the cursed Usher bloodline from expanding. When her fiancé Allan arrives at the crumbling estate to claim his bride, Roderick goes to ruthless—even deadly—lengths to keep them apart.', 'Convinced that his family is tainted by generations of evil, Roderick Usher is hellbent on stopping his sister Madeline’s wedding to prevent the cursed Usher bloodline from expanding. When her fiancé Allan arrives at the crumbling estate to claim his bride, Roderick goes to ruthless—even deadly—lengths to keep them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWpTehQgkkpMfxdCkr5CwU8vONR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28189'),
  ('218553339017002852', 'The Fall of the House of Usher', 1950, 'Horror', 'Ivan Barnett', 'Kenneth Thompson, Dorothy Catt', 'Gwen Watford, Kaye Tendeter, Irving Steen, Vernon Charles, Connie Goodwin, Lucy Pavey, Robert Woollard, Keith Lorraine', null, 'A traveler arrives at the Usher mansion to visit his old friend, Roderick Usher. Upon arriving, however, he discovers that Roderick and his sister, Madeline, have been afflicted with a mysterious malady: Roderick''s senses have become painfully acute, while Madeline has become nearly catatonic. That evening, Roderick tells his guest of an old Usher family curse: any time there has been more than one Usher child, all of the siblings have gone insane and died horrible deaths. As the days wear on, the effects of the curse reach their terrifying climax.', 'A traveler arrives at the Usher mansion to visit his old friend, Roderick Usher. Upon arriving, however, he discovers that Roderick and his sister, Madeline, have been afflicted with a mysterious malady: Roderick''s senses have become painfully acute, while Madeline has become nearly catatonic. That evening, Roderick tells his guest of an old Usher family curse: any time there has been more than one Usher child, all of the siblings have gone insane and died horrible deaths. As the days wear on, the effects of the curse reach their terrifying climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMCsfgQU37XbPiC14OoLvFigcp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140680'),
  ('934747710983586760', 'The Fall of the House of Usher', 1982, 'Mystery, Animation, Horror', 'Jan Švankmajer, Miloslav Špála', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Petr Čepek', null, 'In this animated version of Edgar Allan Poe''s story, a traveller arrives at the Usher mansion to find that the sibling inhabitants are living under a mysterious family curse. The brother''s senses have become painfully acute, while his sister has become nearly catatonic.', 'In this animated version of Edgar Allan Poe''s story, a traveller arrives at the Usher mansion to find that the sibling inhabitants are living under a mysterious family curse. The brother''s senses have become painfully acute, while his sister has become nearly catatonic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAV3Mt64zYrl0gE9CFLK5WwOzvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19034'),
  ('1118627245329244103', 'The Fall of the Roman Empire', 1964, 'Drama, History, War', 'Anthony Mann, Andrew Marton, Mauro Sacripanti', 'Philip Yordan, Ben Barzman, Basilio Franchina', 'Sophia Loren, Stephen Boyd, Alec Guinness, James Mason, Christopher Plummer, Anthony Quayle, John Ireland, Omar Sharif', 'NR', 'In the year 180 A.D. Germanic tribes are about to invade the Roman empire from the north. In the midst of this crisis ailing emperor Marcus Aurelius has to make a decision about his successor between his son Commodus, who is obsessed by power, and the loyal general Gaius Livius.', 'In the year 180 A.D. Germanic tribes are about to invade the Roman empire from the north. In the midst of this crisis ailing emperor Marcus Aurelius has to make a decision about his successor between his son Commodus, who is obsessed by power, and the loyal general Gaius Livius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggrPUKNYFZ6ogs896ZiT0lQG9Tr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17277'),
  ('55505029760867768', 'The Fall of the Romanov Dynasty', 1927, 'Documentary, History', 'Esfir Shub, T. Kuvshinchikova', 'Esfir Shub', 'Mikhail Alekseyev, Alexei Brusilov, Nikolai Chkheidze, Emperor Franz Josef, Vera Figner, Grand Duchess Anastasia, Grand Duchess Marie, Grand Duchess Olga', null, 'A compilation of newsreels shot between 1913 and 1917 - the years leading up to the Russian Revolution.', 'A compilation of newsreels shot between 1913 and 1917 - the years leading up to the Russian Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJpj6EOhXqsKRsea8Mbkz7jSMeg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189828'),
  ('972483719593851317', 'The Fall of Troy', 1911, 'Drama, History, War', 'Luigi Romano Borgnetto, Giovanni Pastrone', 'Giovanni Pastrone', 'Luigi Romano Borgnetto, Giovanni Casaleggio, Madame Davesnes, Emilio Gallo, Olga Giannini Novelli, Giulio Vinà', null, 'Menelaus is the king of Sparta and temporarily departs from his residence, leaving Helen, the queen of Sparta, without him. When Paris of Troy, ambassador and son of the king, arrives in Sparta, he kidnaps Helen and brings her to Troy where the two fall in love. The Greeks attempt to siege the city walls of Troy, but fail. The Greeks then place a huge wooden Trojan horse with Greek warriors hidden inside under the walls of Troy, pretending to be dedicated to the gods and ending the war. Falling for the trap, the Trojans break down the city walls to bring the wooden horse inside.', 'Menelaus is the king of Sparta and temporarily departs from his residence, leaving Helen, the queen of Sparta, without him. When Paris of Troy, ambassador and son of the king, arrives in Sparta, he kidnaps Helen and brings her to Troy where the two fall in love. The Greeks attempt to siege the city walls of Troy, but fail. The Greeks then place a huge wooden Trojan horse with Greek warriors hidden inside under the walls of Troy, pretending to be dedicated to the gods and ending the war. Falling for the trap, the Trojans break down the city walls to bring the wooden horse inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEuvTxFG8P2eMNj9cXfyb5v4BCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193009'),
  ('503290734218324203', 'The Fallen Bridge', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Li Yu, Zeng Jian', 'Fang Li, Li Yu', 'Ma Sichun, Karry Wang, Fan Wei, Chloe Maayan, Li Xiaochuan, Zhao Runnan, Gong Beibi, Huang Lu', null, 'A bridge collapses in broad daylight.From the wrecks investigators discover a human skeleton and a whistleblowing letter revealing the corruption behind this flawed construction. The daughter of the deceased gets approached by a young fugitive who claims to have witnessed the murder.They secretly investigate and the ugly truth unearthed deeply infuriates her.She takes vengeance into her own hands.', 'A bridge collapses in broad daylight.From the wrecks investigators discover a human skeleton and a whistleblowing letter revealing the corruption behind this flawed construction. The daughter of the deceased gets approached by a young fugitive who claims to have witnessed the murder.They secretly investigate and the ugly truth unearthed deeply infuriates her.She takes vengeance into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tZe7CLyjcvsEdKjw2GfVfj914O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974772'),
  ('664590383906444159', 'The Fallen Idol', 1948, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Carol Reed, Georges Périnal, Guy Hamilton', 'Graham Greene', 'Ralph Richardson, Michèle Morgan, Sonia Dresdel, Bobby Henrey, Denis O''Dea, Jack Hawkins, Walter Fitzgerald, Dandy Nichols', null, 'Phillipe, the son of an ambassador in London, hero-worships his father''s butler Baines. His perception of the man changes when he accidentally discovers the secret that Baines keeps and witnesses the consequences that adults'' lies can cause.', 'Phillipe, the son of an ambassador in London, hero-worships his father''s butler Baines. His perception of the man changes when he accidentally discovers the secret that Baines keeps and witnesses the consequences that adults'' lies can cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCcjmsYVgh0urTbLqQgEeskkmPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21631'),
  ('82011312253279893', 'The Fallen Ones', 2005, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Kevin VanHook', 'Kevin VanHook', 'Casper Van Dien, Kristen Miller, Geoffrey Lewis, Navid Negahban, Scott Whyte, Tom Bosley, Robert Wagner, Saginaw Grant', null, 'An archaeologist finds the mummified remains of a giant--the offspring of a Fallen Angel and a human woman. Now he has to stop the terror he has unleashed.', 'An archaeologist finds the mummified remains of a giant--the offspring of a Fallen Angel and a human woman. Now he has to stop the terror he has unleashed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJYzaHV9jRzg6jM51kGjwgU2vaA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41540'),
  ('419299138775203421', 'The Fallen Sparrow', 1943, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Richard Wallace, Nicholas Musuraca, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Warren Duff', 'John Garfield, Maureen O''Hara, Walter Slezak, Patricia Morison, Martha O''Driscoll, Bruce Edwards, John Banner, John Miljan', 'NR', 'Imprisoned during the Spanish Civil War, John "Kit" McKittrick is released when a New York City policeman pulls some strings. Upon returning to America, McKittrick hears that a friend has committed suicide, and he begins to smell a rat. During his investigation, McKittrick questions three beautiful women, one of whom has a tie to his refugee past. Pursued by Nazi operatives, McKittrick learns of the death of another friend, and begins to suspect the dark Dr. Skaas.', 'Imprisoned during the Spanish Civil War, John "Kit" McKittrick is released when a New York City policeman pulls some strings. Upon returning to America, McKittrick hears that a friend has committed suicide, and he begins to smell a rat. During his investigation, McKittrick questions three beautiful women, one of whom has a tie to his refugee past. Pursued by Nazi operatives, McKittrick learns of the death of another friend, and begins to suspect the dark Dr. Skaas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OhbU7Mfr9gsewp1BtW36tWCcj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26533'),
  ('407897387206630356', 'The Falling', 1986, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Deran Sarafian, Yousaf Bokhari, Lionel Wingram', 'Noah Bloch', 'Dennis Christopher, Martin Hewitt, Lynn-Holly Johnson, J.O. Bosso, Yousaf Bokhari, Yolanda Palomo, Christina Augustin, Luis Prendes', 'R', 'Three young friends who are on vacation in Spain and a NASA scientist must join forces to save themselves and the rest of the world from an alien menace.', 'Three young friends who are on vacation in Spain and a NASA scientist must join forces to save themselves and the rest of the world from an alien menace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHIP3l6p0lOdoQm2RQfMPySWQZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52318'),
  ('789034018581121042', 'The Falling', 2015, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Agnès Godard, Carol Morley, Tracey Warren', 'Carol Morley', 'Maisie Williams, Maxine Peake, Greta Scacchi, Monica Dolan, Mathew Baynton, Florence Pugh, Joe Cole, Morfydd Clark', null, 'England, 1969. The fascinating Abbie and the troubled Lydia are great friends. After an unexpected tragedy occurs in the strict girls'' school they attend, a mysterious epidemic of fainting breaks out that threatens the mental sanity and beliefs of the tormented people involved, both teachers and students.', 'England, 1969. The fascinating Abbie and the troubled Lydia are great friends. After an unexpected tragedy occurs in the strict girls'' school they attend, a mysterious epidemic of fainting breaks out that threatens the mental sanity and beliefs of the tormented people involved, both teachers and students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjlU6vSDD5fdJenWhUKE5l672rb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294741'),
  ('830151699648690727', 'The Falling Star', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Dominique Abel, Fiona Gordon, Patrick Armisen', 'Dominique Abel, Fiona Gordon', 'Dominique Abel, Fiona Gordon, Kaori Ito, Philippe Martz, Bruno Romy, Bruce Ellison, Céline Laurentie', null, 'The former activist’s past finally catches up with him when a mysterious stranger appears at the bar, armed and wanting revenge. The appearance of a double, the depressed and solitary Dom, provides Boris’ cunning partner Kayoko and their faithful friend Tim with the perfect escape plan. But they haven’t accounted for Dom’s ex-wife, Fiona, a suspicious detective on their trail.', 'The former activist’s past finally catches up with him when a mysterious stranger appears at the bar, armed and wanting revenge. The appearance of a double, the depressed and solitary Dom, provides Boris’ cunning partner Kayoko and their faithful friend Tim with the perfect escape plan. But they haven’t accounted for Dom’s ex-wife, Fiona, a suspicious detective on their trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FgPlmfrZkBCi01o0E1RQmhUQ8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995808'),
  ('546422129129717268', 'The Fallout', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jeff Shiffman, Kristen Correll, Megan Park', 'Megan Park', 'Jenna Ortega, Maddie Ziegler, Niles Fitch, Will Ropp, Lumi Pollack, John Ortiz, Julie Bowen, Shailene Woodley', 'R', 'In the wake of a school tragedy, Vada, Mia and Quinton form a unique and dynamic bond as they navigate the never linear, often confusing journey to heal in a world that feels forever changed.', 'In the wake of a school tragedy, Vada, Mia and Quinton form a unique and dynamic bond as they navigate the never linear, often confusing journey to heal in a world that feels forever changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ByHl9XRKR2iXbvF0ZilMRD1RcL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795514'),
  ('1003218243358114000', 'The Falls', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Peter Greenaway, Mike Coles, John Rosenberg', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Colin Cantlie, Stephen Quay, Timothy Quay, Adam Leys, Sheila Canfield, Monica Hyde, Keith Pendlebury, Marcia Pendlebury', null, 'Told in the form of a mock documentary in 92 short parts, nineteen million people are left obsessed with birds and flight following a strange occurrence. A documentarian analyses the lives of all the survivors whose surnames begin with FALL to uncover the truth behind the event.', 'Told in the form of a mock documentary in 92 short parts, nineteen million people are left obsessed with birds and flight following a strange occurrence. A documentarian analyses the lives of all the survivors whose surnames begin with FALL to uncover the truth behind the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioEVXwJTUTwu9gtEUoGC1r8IZn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33356'),
  ('664235380621279800', 'The Falls', 2012, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jon García, Christopher J. Stephenson, Jena Bodell', 'Jon García', 'Nick Ferrucci, Benjamin Farmer, Brian Allard, Harold Phillips, Quinn Allan, Justin Koleszar, Paulo Angelo, Emily Gleason', null, 'RJ and Chris were both born and raised in the Mormon Church. Both have pretty girlfriends, were Eagle Scouts at a young age and have perfect academic records. Now, it’s their turn to serve a mission and experience the Mormon rite of passage. Unknown to them, serving a mission will not only open the doors to strangers’ households – where they preach the Gospel – but it will open up secrets in their own lives — and feelings that they’ve long kept buried.', 'RJ and Chris were both born and raised in the Mormon Church. Both have pretty girlfriends, were Eagle Scouts at a young age and have perfect academic records. Now, it’s their turn to serve a mission and experience the Mormon rite of passage. Unknown to them, serving a mission will not only open the doors to strangers’ households – where they preach the Gospel – but it will open up secrets in their own lives — and feelings that they’ve long kept buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sBdnCtXIU1j7vNvM2iRGffQabR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158848'),
  ('1074663389886744019', 'The Falls', 2021, 'Drama', 'Chung Mong-hong, Chung Mong-hong', 'Chung Mong-hong, Chang Yao-sheng', 'Alyssa Chia, Gingle Wang, Chen Yi-wen, Lee Lee-zen, Liang-Tso Liu, Yang Li-yin, Sung Shau-ching, Waa Wei', null, 'After having to quarantine together during COVID-19, a mother and daughter are forced to confront their personal obstacles and relationship tensions.', 'After having to quarantine together during COVID-19, a mother and daughter are forced to confront their personal obstacles and relationship tensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTZVRNFrztdBKxO2tP1wvMfWxeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852355'),
  ('960721679680856150', 'The False Servant', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Benoît Jacquot, Romain Winding', null, 'Isabelle Huppert, Sandrine Kiberlain, Pierre Arditi, Mathieu Amalric, Alexandre Soulié, Philippe Vieux', null, 'A young woman disguises herself as a knight to expose a gold-digging man divided between her and a Countess.', 'A young woman disguises herself as a knight to expose a gold-digging man divided between her and a Countess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngKXY9ykpwMhwl7AgZdOdZH94JH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77939'),
  ('258058752819988347', 'The Fam', 2022, 'Drama', 'Fred Baillif, Joseph Areddy', 'Fred Baillif', 'Claudia Grob, Charlie Areddy, Kassia Da Costa, Amandine Golay, Joyce Esther Ndayisenga, Amelie Tonsi, Sara Tulu, Anais Uldry', null, 'Told episodically and bordering between the fictional and the documental, the film intimately interweaves the life stories of young women who no longer have a real home with their own families. They are given refuge in a temporary youth home, where they and their carers bond to form a new family. La Mif is a safe haven for wounded protagonists who do not spare themselves or others.', 'Told episodically and bordering between the fictional and the documental, the film intimately interweaves the life stories of young women who no longer have a real home with their own families. They are given refuge in a temporary youth home, where they and their carers bond to form a new family. La Mif is a safe haven for wounded protagonists who do not spare themselves or others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZHD6kDccFnwcrTvvyGitJkfSAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794782'),
  ('91952453400272752', 'The Family', 1987, 'Drama', 'Ettore Scola, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Graziano Diana', 'Vittorio Gassman, Fanny Ardant, Stefania Sandrelli, Andrea Occhipinti, Emanuele Lamaro, Cecilia Dazzi, Jo Champa, Joska Versari', null, '"The Family," an album with a velvet cover, is meant to touch the extended family of man. Formal portraits, bookends in this 80-year saga, enclose the central story, which opens with the baptism of Carlo, a baby in his grandfather''s lap, and ends with Carlo as a grandfather with a baby in his arms. And never once do we get out of the house, whose rooms provide the film''s structure. Comfort or passion? Carlo couldn''t really decide until it was too late.', '"The Family," an album with a velvet cover, is meant to touch the extended family of man. Formal portraits, bookends in this 80-year saga, enclose the central story, which opens with the baptism of Carlo, a baby in his grandfather''s lap, and ends with Carlo as a grandfather with a baby in his arms. And never once do we get out of the house, whose rooms provide the film''s structure. Comfort or passion? Carlo couldn''t really decide until it was too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kq7CCOOWAEedCf2OpZ2kO6qBumq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42008'),
  ('273294265635265740', 'The Family', 2013, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Luc Besson, Thierry Arbogast, Ludovic Bernard', 'Luc Besson, Michael Caleo', 'Robert De Niro, Michelle Pfeiffer, Tommy Lee Jones, Dianna Agron, John D''Leo, Jon Freda, David Belle, Domenick Lombardozzi', 'R', 'After ratting out his Mafia cohorts, Giovanni Manzoni and his family enter the Witness Protection Program and relocate to a sleepy town in France. Despite the best efforts of their handler to keep them in line, Giovanni (now called Fred Blake), his wife and children can''t help but resort to doing things the "family" way. However, their dependence on such old habits places everyone in danger from vengeful mobsters.', 'After ratting out his Mafia cohorts, Giovanni Manzoni and his family enter the Witness Protection Program and relocate to a sleepy town in France. Despite the best efforts of their handler to keep them in line, Giovanni (now called Fred Blake), his wife and children can''t help but resort to doing things the "family" way. However, their dependence on such old habits places everyone in danger from vengeful mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2arN02JFsZcDKmBb0SIjG8Smc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112205'),
  ('1079405919126395111', 'The Family', 2017, 'Drama', 'Gustavo Rondón Córdova, Marcos Salaverría, Luis Armando Arteaga', 'Gustavo Rondón Córdova', 'Giovanni García, Reggie Reyes, Kirvin Barrios, Ninoska Silva, Indira Jiménez, Luis Abraham Bandres, Vicente Quintero, Mariú Ayard', null, 'Andrés and his son Pedro live in a working district of Caracas and hardly ever see each other. While Andrés fills his time doing different jobs, Pedro wanders the streets playing with friends and learning from the violent atmosphere around him.', 'Andrés and his son Pedro live in a working district of Caracas and hardly ever see each other. While Andrés fills his time doing different jobs, Pedro wanders the streets playing with friends and learning from the violent atmosphere around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JJUADieNB4dyPY6KecYtQ9StkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417432'),
  ('400332947560163765', 'The Family', 2022, 'Drama', 'Victoire Gounod, Hugo Fié, Fabien Gorgeart', 'Fabien Gorgeart', 'Mélanie Thierry, Lyes Salem, Félix Moati, Gabriel Pavie, Idris Laurentin-Khelifi, Basile Violette, Jean Wilhelm, Florence Muller', null, 'Anna happily lives with her husband, their two boys, and Simon, 6 years-old, who was placed with her by the Social Care services when he was only 18 months. When Simon’s father decides that he is ready to take his son back with him, the family’s balance is at stake. Anna is torn apart: how could she possibly let go a of child who has always called her ‘Mom’?', 'Anna happily lives with her husband, their two boys, and Simon, 6 years-old, who was placed with her by the Social Care services when he was only 18 months. When Simon’s father decides that he is ready to take his son back with him, the family’s balance is at stake. Anna is torn apart: how could she possibly let go a of child who has always called her ‘Mom’?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3Z8tPyWskU3Dyj7lbYwCU5yZl4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860700'),
  ('166534738879088118', 'The Family and One More', 1965, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Fernando Palacios, Juan Mariné', 'Vicente Coello, Pedro Masó, Antonio Vich', 'Alberto Closas, Julia Gutiérrez Caba, José Luis López Vázquez, Soledad Miranda, Carlos Piñar, Margot Cottens, Rosanna Yanni, Elena María Tejeiro', null, 'The life of the family inordinate surveyor Carlos Alonso has undergone several changes over the course of the years: the birth of child number 16, little Maria, coincided with the death of the mother, who left behind a hollow refillable. The grandfather also died. The Godfather pastry married, and the boys have been growing rapidly ...', 'The life of the family inordinate surveyor Carlos Alonso has undergone several changes over the course of the years: the birth of child number 16, little Maria, coincided with the death of the mother, who left behind a hollow refillable. The grandfather also died. The Godfather pastry married, and the boys have been growing rapidly ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ylWpVK4qNWFzDwKJA5Uns9PVpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201003'),
  ('495257106222866025', 'The Family Business', 2026, 'Horror', 'Joe Hollow, Wolfgang Meyer', 'Joe Hollow', 'Mark Hanson, Joe Hollow, Tony Todd', null, 'The Family Business is a Dark, Dramatic, Horror, Thriller where tensions rise among a twisted family of psychopaths who set out to create a very unique snuff film of epic proportions.', 'The Family Business is a Dark, Dramatic, Horror, Thriller where tensions rise among a twisted family of psychopaths who set out to create a very unique snuff film of epic proportions.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlWVwxfExOheSNVIoJk51RgEyJVi.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-family-business-2026'),
  ('16928588011394415', 'The Family Fang', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Jason Bateman, Ken Seng, Justin Bischoff', 'David Lindsay-Abaire', 'Jason Bateman, Nicole Kidman, Christopher Walken, Maryann Plunkett, Marin Ireland, Kathryn Hahn, Jason Butler Harner, Ali Wentworth', 'R', 'A brother and sister return to their family home in search of their world famous parents who have disappeared.', 'A brother and sister return to their family home in search of their world famous parents who have disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVLOpMH3p8PpnbGa1UOGDr78xSS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291264'),
  ('123776236788486902', 'The Family Friend', 2006, 'Drama', 'Paolo Sorrentino', 'Paolo Sorrentino', 'Giacomo Rizzo, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Laura Chiatti, Gigi Angelillo, Clara Bindi, Barbara Valmorin, Antonella Salvucci, Marco Giallini', null, 'Geremia, an aging tailor/money lender, is a repulsive, mean, stingy man who lives alone in his shabby house with his scornful, bedridden mother. He has a morbid, obsessive relationship with money and he uses it to insinuate himself into other people''s affairs, pretending to be the "family friend". One day he is asked by a man to lend him money for the wedding of Rosalba, his daughter. Geremia falls in love at first sight with the bewitching creature and and soon indulges in a "beauty and the beast" relationship...', 'Geremia, an aging tailor/money lender, is a repulsive, mean, stingy man who lives alone in his shabby house with his scornful, bedridden mother. He has a morbid, obsessive relationship with money and he uses it to insinuate himself into other people''s affairs, pretending to be the "family friend". One day he is asked by a man to lend him money for the wedding of Rosalba, his daughter. Geremia falls in love at first sight with the bewitching creature and and soon indulges in a "beauty and the beast" relationship...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GErGIgZuhRbwMH9fYSQcZTeShT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53486'),
  ('693973688326520559', 'The Family Game', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yoshimitsu Morita, Shusuke Kaneko', 'Yoshimitsu Morita', 'Yūsaku Matsuda, Jūzō Itami, Yuki Saori, Ichirôta Miyakawa, Junichi Tsujita, Jun Togawa, Yoko Aki, Kôichirô Doi', null, 'A sendup of the stereotypical Japanese family: dad is a salaryman jerk, unable to relate to anyone; mom is a hopeless housewife; the older son is a moderate academic success; but the younger son is a rebellious goof-off for whom a tutor must be hired. The tutor, played by the prototypical bad boy actor Matsuda Yusaku, proceeds to blow the entire family apart.', 'A sendup of the stereotypical Japanese family: dad is a salaryman jerk, unable to relate to anyone; mom is a hopeless housewife; the older son is a moderate academic success; but the younger son is a rebellious goof-off for whom a tutor must be hired. The tutor, played by the prototypical bad boy actor Matsuda Yusaku, proceeds to blow the entire family apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9znuGejLUDldMZNM2F0wSEu4zQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117129'),
  ('471442577091898479', 'The Family Holiday', 2007, 'Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Craig Clyde', 'Craig Clyde, James Hennessy', 'Dave Coulier, Alexa Fischer, William Schultz, Abigail Schornick, Christina Pickles', null, 'A selfish con-man must show that he can be a family man to inherit his uncle''s estate. As he tries to set up his scam family, he realizes that he really wants to have a one.', 'A selfish con-man must show that he can be a family man to inherit his uncle''s estate. As he tries to set up his scam family, he realizes that he really wants to have a one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaiNVXioQwNaGP73CBbMnYfGW6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70809'),
  ('163369460163934233', 'The Family Jewels', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Lewis, Ralph Axness, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Jerry Lewis, Bill Richmond', 'Jerry Lewis, Donna Butterworth, Sebastian Cabot, Neil Hamilton, Jay Adler, Anne Baxter, Robert Strauss, Jesslyn Fax', 'NR', 'A young heiress must choose between six uncles, one of which is up to no good and out to harm the girl''s beloved bodyguard who practically raised her.', 'A young heiress must choose between six uncles, one of which is up to no good and out to harm the girl''s beloved bodyguard who practically raised her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Ar6Aq75Ro35XTqjDr3KgJFRobP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52122'),
  ('1036893605759523204', 'The Family Jewels', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Schwentke, Florian Ballhaus', 'Robert Schwentke', 'Wotan Wilke Möhring, Julia Hummer, Antoine Monot Jr., Alexander Beyer, Janek Rieke, Doris Schretzmayer, Götz Schubert, Fatih Cevikkollu', null, 'Martin is the ambitious one in the family. He is poised to start on his doctorate, when he is diagnosed with testicular cancer and all his future plans begin to unravel. The removal of one testicle reduces the most immediate threat, but the cancer has already spread and Martin''s doctor argues for an operation that would save him, but could also castrate him.', 'Martin is the ambitious one in the family. He is poised to start on his doctorate, when he is diagnosed with testicular cancer and all his future plans begin to unravel. The removal of one testicle reduces the most immediate threat, but the cancer has already spread and Martin''s doctor argues for an operation that would save him, but could also castrate him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOjkoAMOXOq4hKuPiX10QSU48aw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72413'),
  ('860610565562579238', 'The Family Jumble', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Beppe Gallo, Marcello de Archangelis, Andrea Martino De Carles', 'Max Nardari, Fausto Petronzio', 'Marco Cocci, Bianca Nappi, Gabriele Caprio, Elisabetta Pellini, Elisa Di Eusanio, Roberto Carrubba, Luis Molteni, Raniero Monaco Di Lapio', null, 'A kid tries splitting his boring parents to join the group of his schoolmates who are all children of divorced mums and dads', 'A kid tries splitting his boring parents to join the group of his schoolmates who are all children of divorced mums and dads', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/N31zGHb1OdgyG9HQUvUYUoUESn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447444'),
  ('951971915751555486', 'The Family Man', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Brett Ratner, Dante Spinotti, David Cass Jr.', 'David Diamond, David Weissman', 'Nicolas Cage, Téa Leoni, Don Cheadle, Jeremy Piven, Saul Rubinek, Josef Sommer, Makenzie Vega, Jake Milkovich', 'PG-13', 'Jack''s lavish, fast-paced lifestyle changes one Christmas night when he stumbles into a grocery store holdup and disarms the gunman. The next morning he wakes up in bed lying next to Kate, his college sweetheart he left in order to pursue his career, and to the horrifying discovery that his former life no longer exists. As he stumbles through this alternate suburban universe, Jack finds himself at a crossroad where he must choose between his high-power career and the woman he loves.', 'Jack''s lavish, fast-paced lifestyle changes one Christmas night when he stumbles into a grocery store holdup and disarms the gunman. The next morning he wakes up in bed lying next to Kate, his college sweetheart he left in order to pursue his career, and to the horrifying discovery that his former life no longer exists. As he stumbles through this alternate suburban universe, Jack finds himself at a crossroad where he must choose between his high-power career and the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wToOVsKuf0XeKhlauzCa3D8Gui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5994'),
  ('456702542649003000', 'The Family McMullen', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Edward Burns, William Rexer, Maribeth Fox', 'Edward Burns', 'Connie Britton, Edward Burns, Halston Sage, Michael McGlone, Tracee Ellis Ross, Shari Albert, Juliana Canfield, Pico Alexander', 'R', '30 years after the events of The Brothers McMullen, romantic entanglements plague a now fiftysomething Barry McMullen and his twentysomething kids, as well as his brother Patrick and widowed sister-in-law Molly, who are also facing similar unexpected hurdles.', '30 years after the events of The Brothers McMullen, romantic entanglements plague a now fiftysomething Barry McMullen and his twentysomething kids, as well as his brother Patrick and widowed sister-in-law Molly, who are also facing similar unexpected hurdles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foNIl77csO9GmsvCvTZ6ixt0fZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1548017'),
  ('319184309898827768', 'The Family Plan', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Simon Cellan Jones, Cameron Beasley, Rafael Sanz', 'David Coggeshall', 'Mark Wahlberg, Michelle Monaghan, Maggie Q, Zoe Colletti, Van Crosby, Ciarán Hinds, Kellen Boyle, Saïd Taghmaoui', 'PG-13', 'Dan Morgan is many things: a devoted husband, a loving father, a celebrated car salesman. He''s also a former assassin. And when his past catches up to his present, he''s forced to take his unsuspecting family on a road trip unlike any other.', 'Dan Morgan is many things: a devoted husband, a loving father, a celebrated car salesman. He''s also a former assassin. And when his past catches up to his present, he''s forced to take his unsuspecting family on a road trip unlike any other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLLtx3nTRSLGPAKl4RoIv1FbEBr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029575'),
  ('791858265494618009', 'The Family Plan 2', 2025, 'Action, Comedy', 'Simon Cellan Jones, Michael Burgess, Tim Wooster', 'David Coggeshall', 'Mark Wahlberg, Michelle Monaghan, Kit Harington, Zoe Colletti, Van Crosby, Theodore Lindsey, Peter Lindsey, Reda Elazouar', 'PG-13', 'Now that Dan''s assassin days are behind him, all he wants for Christmas is quality time with his kids. But when he learns his daughter has her own plans, he books a family trip to London—putting them all in the crosshairs of an unexpected enemy.', 'Now that Dan''s assassin days are behind him, all he wants for Christmas is quality time with his kids. But when he learns his daughter has her own plans, he books a family trip to London—putting them all in the crosshairs of an unexpected enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/semFxuYx6HcrkZzslgAkBqfJvZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1363123'),
  ('329270812784859495', 'The Family Road', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Dacourt, Nabil AitakkaouaIi, Mounir Atta', 'Nabil Aitakkaouali, Hakim Zouhani', 'Redouane Bougheraba, Caroline Anglade, Farida Ouchani, Anouar Akerrouach, Laura Petrone, Jean-Stan du Pac', null, 'Ready to go on vacation, Kamel finds himself forced to change his plans at the last minute and hit the road to Bled with his mother. Aboard the old Renault 21, Kamel and his family embark on a long journey to Morocco. On the road to his past, memories and resentments resurface, revealing the beauty of the bonds that unite them.', 'Ready to go on vacation, Kamel finds himself forced to change his plans at the last minute and hit the road to Bled with his mother. Aboard the old Renault 21, Kamel and his family embark on a long journey to Morocco. On the road to his past, memories and resentments resurface, revealing the beauty of the bonds that unite them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RRQYglknVvm1nVv5e8DzCsSHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1389410'),
