  ('714047589267757066', 'The Fan', 1996, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Tony Scott, Dariusz Wolski, John Wildermuth', 'Phoef Sutton', 'Robert De Niro, Wesley Snipes, Ellen Barkin, John Leguizamo, Benicio del Toro, Patti D''Arbanville, Chris Mulkey, Andrew J. Ferchland', 'R', 'When the San Francisco Giants pay center-fielder, Bobby Rayburn $40 million to lead their team to the World Series, no one is happier or more supportive than #1 fan, Gil Renard. When Rayburn becomes mired in the worst slump of his career, the obsessed Renard decides to stop at nothing to help his idol regain his former glory—not even murder.', 'When the San Francisco Giants pay center-fielder, Bobby Rayburn $40 million to lead their team to the World Series, no one is happier or more supportive than #1 fan, Gil Renard. When Rayburn becomes mired in the worst slump of his career, the obsessed Renard decides to stop at nothing to help his idol regain his former glory—not even murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu7CjP8YES5dJMCFg5O9o9jCkjl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9566'),
  ('731884279976452762', 'The Fan, the Referee and the Footballer', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Pier Francesco Pingitore, Federico Zanni, Tersicore Kolosoff', 'Pier Francesco Pingitore', 'Pippo Franco, Alvaro Vitali, Enzo Cannavale, Mario Carotenuto, Marisa Merlini, Carmen Russo, Gigi Reder, Daniela Poggi', null, 'Two soccer stories: Alvaro Presutti is a referee who seems to be the last to know about his wife having an affair with a German soccer star. Amedeo Amedei has to please both his father, a die hard Roma supporter and his future father in law, who supports Lazio.', 'Two soccer stories: Alvaro Presutti is a referee who seems to be the last to know about his wife having an affair with a German soccer star. Amedeo Amedei has to please both his father, a die hard Roma supporter and his future father in law, who supports Lazio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjGsQbbFuYmcBbVnFtkYnu2k3c3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121510'),
