  ('296137464524571839', 'The Fantastic 4: First Steps', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Matt Shakman, Jess Hall, Tim Wooster', 'Josh Friedman, Eric Pearson, Jeff Kaplan', 'Pedro Pascal, Vanessa Kirby, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Joseph Quinn, Ralph Ineson, Julia Garner, Paul Walter Hauser, Natasha Lyonne', 'PG-13', 'Against the vibrant backdrop of a 1960s-inspired, retro-futuristic world, Marvel''s First Family is forced to balance their roles as heroes with the strength of their family bond, while defending Earth from a ravenous space god called Galactus and his enigmatic Herald, Silver Surfer.', 'Against the vibrant backdrop of a 1960s-inspired, retro-futuristic world, Marvel''s First Family is forced to balance their roles as heroes with the strength of their family bond, while defending Earth from a ravenous space god called Galactus and his enigmatic Herald, Silver Surfer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nf5qaSEvyYSNeFH0YhSs5EsBLX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617126'),
  ('874263571591131182', 'The Fantastic Adventures of Unico', 1981, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Osamu Tezuka, Toshio Hirata', 'Masaki Tsuji', 'Katsue Miwa, Kazuko Sugiyama, Junko Hori, Chieko Baisho, Makio Inoue, Ryoko Kinomiya, Ichiro Nagai, Joji Yanami', null, 'When Unico, a young unicorn, is banished from his family by a pantheon of manipulative gods, his powers of joy and happiness are tested as he explores the lands with his friends Beezle and Katy.', 'When Unico, a young unicorn, is banished from his family by a pantheon of manipulative gods, his powers of joy and happiness are tested as he explores the lands with his friends Beezle and Katy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhyLXBFBEXKoidJvSYcajGfWBG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38563'),
