  ('486002968463271780', 'The Fantastic Four', 1994, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Oley Sassone, Mark Parry, Larry Litton', 'Craig J. Nevius, Kevin Rock', 'Alex Hyde-White, Jay Underwood, Rebecca Staab, Michael Bailey Smith, Ian Trigger, Joseph Culp, George Gaynes, Kat Green', 'PG', 'When dosed with cosmic rays, four intrepid astronauts are given incredible powers. They decide to form a superhero group called the Fantastic Four to fight their arch-enemy, Dr. Doom.', 'When dosed with cosmic rays, four intrepid astronauts are given incredible powers. They decide to form a superhero group called the Fantastic Four to fight their arch-enemy, Dr. Doom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avJpIDOjyfdoOLINYficKvW9dEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22059'),
  ('796078709924052623', 'The Fantastic Golem Affairs', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Juan González, Nando Martínez, Natalia Rodríguez', 'Nando Martínez, Juan González', 'Brays Efe, David Menéndez, Luis Tosar, Bruna Cusí, Aimar Vega, Clara Sans, Ricardo Lacámara, Luis E. Parés', null, 'Follows two friends, Juan and David, they will find themselves on a rooftop terrace after an intense party in Madrid. Juan witnesses David falling to the void, and his body disintegrating into ceramic pieces after hitting a car.', 'Follows two friends, Juan and David, they will find themselves on a rooftop terrace after an intense party in Madrid. Juan witnesses David falling to the void, and his body disintegrating into ceramic pieces after hitting a car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQgacnjmMGcbT7gaDy39ggUNA8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053596'),
  ('1152885816638969666', 'The Fantastic Journey of Margot & Marguerite', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Agostini, Lara Schneider, Hugo Marchand', 'Pierre Coré, Alexandre Coffre', 'Alice Pol, Clovis Cornillac, Lila Gueneau, Anaëlle Othenin-Girard, Frédéric Deleersnyder, Grégori Derangère, Wladimir Yordanoff, Niseema Theillaud', null, 'Margot and Marguerite are 12-year-old girls who seem no different from any other youngsters with the usual family and peer problems. While they appear to have similar faces and body shapes, they wear different clothes and hairstyles, but the biggest difference between them is that one lives in 1942 and the other in 2020. When the girls crawled into a wooden chest they were magically sent into each other’s timeline, and because the girls look so similar their family and friends do not notice the swap.', 'Margot and Marguerite are 12-year-old girls who seem no different from any other youngsters with the usual family and peer problems. While they appear to have similar faces and body shapes, they wear different clothes and hairstyles, but the biggest difference between them is that one lives in 1942 and the other in 2020. When the girls crawled into a wooden chest they were magically sent into each other’s timeline, and because the girls look so similar their family and friends do not notice the swap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NoyPj2ZoSkMXwqJwUm93EQIyBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671041'),
  ('338360963295912053', 'The Fantastic Three', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michaël Dichter, Maxime Cointe, Anne-Claire Créancier', 'Michaël Dichter, Mathias Gavarry', 'Diego Murgia, Emmanuelle Bercot, Raphaël Quenard, Jean Devie, Benjamin Tellier, Maxime Bailleul, Pauline Cher, Cyprian Oudin', null, 'Max, a witty and brave 12-year-old, feels like he has two families instead of one. In and after school, he spends all his time with his two best friends Tom and Vivian, who are always there to make life easier for each other. Together, they are The Fantastic Three. His real family on the other hand, is messy, with a depressed single mother and a brother in jail.', 'Max, a witty and brave 12-year-old, feels like he has two families instead of one. In and after school, he spends all his time with his two best friends Tom and Vivian, who are always there to make life easier for each other. Together, they are The Fantastic Three. His real family on the other hand, is messy, with a depressed single mother and a brother in jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUxeABYTbuXoUywe1Eh7HhkHeNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983012'),
  ('765957939674866045', 'The Fantasticks', 2000, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Michael Ritchie, Fred Murphy', 'Tom Jones, Harvey Schmidt', 'Joel Grey, Brad Sullivan, Joey McIntyre, Jean Louisa Kelly, Barnard Hughes, Jonathon Morris, Teller, Arturo Gil', 'PG', 'Widowers Amos and Ben plot to romantically unite Amos'' daughter Luisa and Ben''s son Matt by pretending to feud and forbidding the teens to associate, knowing they will resist their fathers'' interference. As the youngsters fall in love, the fathers plot to end the ''feud'' by hiring a travelling showman to fake an abduction and allow Matt to ''rescue'' Luisa.', 'Widowers Amos and Ben plot to romantically unite Amos'' daughter Luisa and Ben''s son Matt by pretending to feud and forbidding the teens to associate, knowing they will resist their fathers'' interference. As the youngsters fall in love, the fathers plot to end the ''feud'' by hiring a travelling showman to fake an abduction and allow Matt to ''rescue'' Luisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfO64mXz3DgUxkBVU7no2UWRP7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62127'),
  ('113077918834342368', 'The Far Country', 1954, 'Western', 'William H. Daniels, Anthony Mann, Terence Nelson', 'Borden Chase', 'James Stewart, Ruth Roman, Corinne Calvet, Walter Brennan, John McIntire, Jay C. Flippen, Harry Morgan, Steve Brodie', 'NR', 'During the Klondike Gold Rush, a misanthropic cattle driver and his talkative elderly partner run afoul of the law in Alaska and are forced to work for a saloon owner to take her supplies into a newly booming but lawless Candian town.', 'During the Klondike Gold Rush, a misanthropic cattle driver and his talkative elderly partner run afoul of the law in Alaska and are forced to work for a saloon owner to take her supplies into a newly booming but lawless Candian town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clia72SGMEDdkNqlrDneigfJrlQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18721'),
