  ('995086136462338380', 'The Fast and the Furious: Tokyo Drift', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Justin Lin, Stephen F. Windon, Terry Leonard', 'Chris Morgan', 'Lucas Black, Nathalie Kelley, Sung Kang, Shad Moss, Brian Tee, Leonardo Nam, Brian Goodman, Zachery Ty Bryan', 'PG-13', 'In order to avoid a jail sentence, Sean Boswell heads to Tokyo to live with his military father. In a low-rent section of the city, Sean gets caught up in the underground world of drift racing', 'In order to avoid a jail sentence, Sean Boswell heads to Tokyo to live with his military father. In a low-rent section of the city, Sean gets caught up in the underground world of drift racing', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46xqGOwHbh2TH2avWSw3SMXph4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9615'),
