  ('1042698075801290870', 'The Fear of God: 25 Years of The Exorcist', 1998, 'Documentary, TV Movie, Horror', 'Nick Freand Jones', 'Mark Kermode', 'Mark Kermode, Ellen Burstyn, William O''Malley, William Friedkin, Max von Sydow, Linda Blair, William Peter Blatty, Thomas Bermingham', null, 'A behind-the-scenes retrospective made for the twenty-fifth anniversary of the classic horror film, The Exorcist. Includes interviews with Linda Blair and the other stars of the film, along with commentary from the director and writer on some of the deeper meanings behind the elements they used to terrify their audiences, and previously unreleased footage including make-up tests and deleted scenes.', 'A behind-the-scenes retrospective made for the twenty-fifth anniversary of the classic horror film, The Exorcist. Includes interviews with Linda Blair and the other stars of the film, along with commentary from the director and writer on some of the deeper meanings behind the elements they used to terrify their audiences, and previously unreleased footage including make-up tests and deleted scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEWDfJWhFuR77jlntpFGKssKLeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104846'),
  ('850994745204795513', 'The Fear: Resurrection', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Chris Angel, Brian Pearson, Mike Rohl', 'Kevin Richards', 'Gordon Currie, Stacy Grant, Phillip Rhys, MYC Agnew, Emmanuelle Vaugier, Kelly Benson, Brendan Beiser, Rachel Hayward', 'R', 'It''s death-by-fear (aka scared-to-death) in this deceptively psychological thriller. The hero, Mike brings his friends to his grandparents'' house for a Halloween party wherein they will all dress up as their innermost fears. Mike''s fear is that he''s inherited a homicidal legacy from his father. Mike''s father was a serial killer who murdered his mother right in front of him when Mike was five before committing suicide. Mike''s fear manifests itself in his inability to commit to his girlfriend of 4 1/2 years, Peg for fear that he will kill her too. Everything gets rolling when an ancient Indian totem wooden figure named Morty comes to life and starts killing off Mike''s friends by making their worst fears come true. The ultimate confrontation comes when Mike has to face his greatest fear - his own father.', 'It''s death-by-fear (aka scared-to-death) in this deceptively psychological thriller. The hero, Mike brings his friends to his grandparents'' house for a Halloween party wherein they will all dress up as their innermost fears. Mike''s fear is that he''s inherited a homicidal legacy from his father. Mike''s father was a serial killer who murdered his mother right in front of him when Mike was five before committing suicide. Mike''s fear manifests itself in his inability to commit to his girlfriend of 4 1/2 years, Peg for fear that he will kill her too. Everything gets rolling when an ancient Indian totem wooden figure named Morty comes to life and starts killing off Mike''s friends by making their worst fears come true. The ultimate confrontation comes when Mike has to face his greatest fear - his own father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ly1qssb1wwtaMVCx8pxwk3GFqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111074'),
  ('887209319356593107', 'The Fearless Four', 1997, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Eberhard Junkersdorf, Jürgen Richter, Michael Coldewey', 'Dagmar Kekulé, Georg Reichel, Bert Henry', 'Bernd Schramm, Hartmut Engler, Sandra Calderon, Mario Adorf, Joachim Kemmer, Peer Augustinski, Hans-Werner Bussinger, Klaus Sonnenschein', 'G', 'Four aging animals, a dog, a cat, a donkey and a rooster escape from their former homes because they weren''t as productive and useful for their owners as they used to be. To avoid death, they all move out on a musical journey to Bremen to find a better life.', 'Four aging animals, a dog, a cat, a donkey and a rooster escape from their former homes because they weren''t as productive and useful for their owners as they used to be. To avoid death, they all move out on a musical journey to Bremen to find a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOUDNnSx9T6zSKmCaU0WXfWv3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78694'),
