  ('267567348869081393', 'The Field', 1990, 'Drama', 'Jim Sheridan, Jack Conroy', 'Jim Sheridan', 'Richard Harris, John Hurt, Sean Bean, Frances Tomelty, Brenda Fricker, Ruth McCabe, Brendan Gleeson, Tom Berenger', 'PG-13', '"Bull" McCabe''s family has farmed a field for generations, sacrificing much in the name of the land. When the widow who owns the field decides to sell it in a public auction, McCabe knows that he must own it. While no local dare bid against him, a wealthy American decides he requires the field to build a highway. "Bull" and his son decide they must try to convince the American to let go of his ambition and return home, but the consequences of their plot prove sinister.', '"Bull" McCabe''s family has farmed a field for generations, sacrificing much in the name of the land. When the widow who owns the field decides to sell it in a public auction, McCabe knows that he must own it. While no local dare bid against him, a wealthy American decides he requires the field to build a highway. "Bull" and his son decide they must try to convince the American to let go of his ambition and return home, but the consequences of their plot prove sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppF5pUheNoL0EPuGRIEnHz1ewp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31651'),
  ('685906762635787680', 'The Field Guide to Evil', 2019, 'Horror', 'Agnieszka Smoczyńska, Can Evrenol, Peter Strickland', 'Elif Domanic', 'Marlene Hauser, Luzia Oppermann, Birgit Minichmayr, Naz Sayıner, Andrzej Konopka, Jilon VanOver, Sarah Navratil, Paul J. Ford', null, 'A feature-length anthology film. They are known as myths, lore, and folktales. Created to give logic to mankind’s darkest fears, these stories laid the foundation for what we now know as the horror genre.', 'A feature-length anthology film. They are known as myths, lore, and folktales. Created to give logic to mankind’s darkest fears, these stories laid the foundation for what we now know as the horror genre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWAniWWeBf2qGAYuCPvnvYGs7pM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436549'),
  ('1005742136194244117', 'The Fiend', 1972, 'Horror', 'Desmond Dickinson, Robert Hartford-Davis, Brian Lawrence', 'Brian Comport', 'Ann Todd, Patrick Magee, Tony Beckley, Percy Herbert, Suzanna Leigh, David Lodge, Ronald Allen, Madeleine Hinde', 'R', 'Led by a sinister minister, a controlling religious sect called the Brethren has taken control of widow Birdy Wemys, sending her unstable son, Kenny, into a spiraling descent into madness and murder. No woman is safe when Kenny''s religious mania overpowers him and leads to a rampage of carnage and chaos!', 'Led by a sinister minister, a controlling religious sect called the Brethren has taken control of widow Birdy Wemys, sending her unstable son, Kenny, into a spiraling descent into madness and murder. No woman is safe when Kenny''s religious mania overpowers him and leads to a rampage of carnage and chaos!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxZU88xhuBgq2EK7QqBoUe0cXNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191740'),
  ('586492868128279443', 'The Fiend', 1977, 'Thriller', 'Luigi Zampa, Mario Vulpiani, Stefano Rolla', 'Sergio Donati', 'Johnny Dorelli, Sydne Rome, Renzo Palmer, Yves Beneyton, Enzo Santaniello, Henning Schlüter, Renato Scarpa, Gianrico Tedeschi', null, 'A low rank journalist at Tribuna Sera newspaper receives a letter one day. His correspondence contains a serial killer''s letters, which he exploits.', 'A low rank journalist at Tribuna Sera newspaper receives a letter one day. His correspondence contains a serial killer''s letters, which he exploits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTHqHMdPN5U1rpxJKB39N7O27jO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99543'),
  ('697868007096498441', 'The Fiendish Plot of Dr. Fu Manchu', 1980, 'Comedy, Horror, Crime', 'Piers Haggard, Jean Tournier', 'Rudy Dochtermann, Jim Moloney', 'Peter Sellers, Helen Mirren, David Tomlinson, Sid Caesar, Simon Williams, Steve Franken, Stratford Johns, John Le Mesurier', 'PG', 'Fu Manchu''s 168th birthday celebration is dampened when a hapless flunky spills Fu''s age-regressing elixir vitae. Fu sends his lackeys to round up ingredients for a new batch of elixir, starting with the Star of Leningrad diamond, nabbed from a Soviet exhibition in Washington. The FBI sends agents Capone and Williams to England to confer with Nayland Smith, an expert on Fu.', 'Fu Manchu''s 168th birthday celebration is dampened when a hapless flunky spills Fu''s age-regressing elixir vitae. Fu sends his lackeys to round up ingredients for a new batch of elixir, starting with the Star of Leningrad diamond, nabbed from a Soviet exhibition in Washington. The FBI sends agents Capone and Williams to England to confer with Nayland Smith, an expert on Fu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ftvbsm0xjQDOluJfgnNJ2G5B35.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3486'),
  ('377405092664940932', 'The Fifth Commandment', 2008, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Jesse V. Johnson, Robert Hayes', 'Rick Yune', 'Rick Yune, Keith David, Bokeem Woodbine, Dania Ramirez, Roger Yuan, Booboo Stewart, Tokolize Robbins, Owen Williams', null, 'In Bangkok, an assassin who turns down a job that hits too close to home finds himself targeted by the elite members of his profession', 'In Bangkok, an assassin who turns down a job that hits too close to home finds himself targeted by the elite members of his profession', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTGr7lGtLIpnXM2JZkx3EUyzFIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14075'),
  ('53228629204012479', 'The Fifth Commandment', 2012, 'Thriller', 'Rafael Lara Ruiz', 'Rafael Lara Ruiz', 'Ilean Almaguer, Angélica Aragón, Tomás Goros, Alberto Guerra, Jimena Guerra, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Guillermo Iván, Carlos Padilla', null, 'Víctor, a psychopath, loves carving crosses onto women post-mortem, blames paedophile priest and mother-in-denial for his behaviour, falls in love with one of his intended victims and decides to give up his adopted lifestyle. An alcoholic detective (he’s mourning his sister’s passing), eventually tracks down Víctor, and manages to break his habit with the bottle.', 'Víctor, a psychopath, loves carving crosses onto women post-mortem, blames paedophile priest and mother-in-denial for his behaviour, falls in love with one of his intended victims and decides to give up his adopted lifestyle. An alcoholic detective (he’s mourning his sister’s passing), eventually tracks down Víctor, and manages to break his habit with the bottle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8slpe7NAWTKCayQNFYv9dx5VGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99262'),
  ('837257860277730547', 'The Fifth Cord', 1971, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Luigi Bazzoni, Luciano Marin, Vittorio Storaro', 'Luigi Bazzoni, Mario Fanelli, Mario Di Nardo', 'Franco Nero, Silvia Monti, Wolfgang Preiss, Edmund Purdom, Rossella Falk, Renato Romano, Guido Alberti, Luciano Bartoli', null, 'A journalist finds himself on the trail of a murderer who''s been targeting people around him, while the police are considering him a suspect in their investigation.', 'A journalist finds himself on the trail of a murderer who''s been targeting people around him, while the police are considering him a suspect in their investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUFHw7bz0uoSR7zCku7yiHOAfDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42676'),
  ('563360270904093310', 'The Fifth Day of Peace', 1970, 'Drama, War', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Silvano Ippoliti, Stefano Rolla', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Ottavio Jemma, Lucio Battistrada', 'Franco Nero, Richard Johnson, Larry Aubrey, Helmuth Schneider, Bud Spencer, Michael Goodliffe, Relja Bašić, Emilio Delle Piane', null, 'Based on a true story. Near the end of World War II, two German deserters are put in an Allied POW camp. When a rigid and militaristic German colonel learns about their desertion, he wants them court-martialed, even if the war is over. The uninterested Allied officers oblige him, and the two men face the firing squad on "the fifth day of peace".', 'Based on a true story. Near the end of World War II, two German deserters are put in an Allied POW camp. When a rigid and militaristic German colonel learns about their desertion, he wants them court-martialed, even if the war is over. The uninterested Allied officers oblige him, and the two men face the firing squad on "the fifth day of peace".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xc0CVpp4Bkk0NY1XSMn7he6t1AS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54154'),
  ('55915054017860367', 'The Fifth Element', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Luc Besson, Thierry Arbogast, Paul Kirby', 'Robert Mark Kamen, Luc Besson', 'Bruce Willis, Milla Jovovich, Gary Oldman, Ian Holm, Chris Tucker, Luke Perry, Brion James, Tommy Lister Jr.', 'PG-13', 'In 2257, a taxi driver is unintentionally given the task of saving a young girl who is part of the key that will ensure the survival of humanity.', 'In 2257, a taxi driver is unintentionally given the task of saving a young girl who is part of the key that will ensure the survival of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPtlCO1yQtnoLHOwKtWz7db6RGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18'),
  ('293156078977036761', 'The Fifth Estate', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bill Condon, Tobias A. Schliessler, Denis Schnegg', 'Josh Singer', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Daniel Brühl, Anthony Mackie, David Thewlis, Alicia Vikander, Dan Stevens, Stanley Tucci, Laura Linney', 'R', 'A look at the relationship between WikiLeaks founder Julian Assange and his early supporter and eventual colleague Daniel Domscheit-Berg, and how the website''s growth and influence led to an irreparable rift between the two friends.', 'A look at the relationship between WikiLeaks founder Julian Assange and his early supporter and eventual colleague Daniel Domscheit-Berg, and how the website''s growth and influence led to an irreparable rift between the two friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUrL2eacUjAxkOS403DaOyXpgAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162903'),
  ('1003276980471023285', 'The Fifth Floor', 1978, 'Horror', 'Howard Avedis, Michael Bennett, Alice West', 'Meyer Dolinsky', 'Bo Hopkins, Dianne Hull, Patti D''Arbanville, Sharon Farrell, Robert Englund, Anthony James, Julie Adams, Mel Ferrer', 'R', 'A young woman collapses on the disco dance floor of what''s revealed to be strychnine poisoning. Assuming that this is an attempt at suicide, her boyfriend and doctor have her committed to the Fifth Floor, an asylum with obviously crazy inmates and a predatory orderly. The problem is, she''s still sane!', 'A young woman collapses on the disco dance floor of what''s revealed to be strychnine poisoning. Assuming that this is an attempt at suicide, her boyfriend and doctor have her committed to the Fifth Floor, an asylum with obviously crazy inmates and a predatory orderly. The problem is, she''s still sane!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogKiGaW6KA8t4ErEMg7b2dRnwEm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84183'),
  ('657219991462230087', 'The Fifth Horseman Is Fear', 1965, 'Drama, War', 'Ota Koval, Anna Lackovičová, Josef Krameš', 'Hana Bělohradská, Zbyněk Brynych', 'Miroslav Macháček, Olga Scheinpflugová, Jiří Adamíra, Zdenka Procházková, Josef Vinklář, Ilja Prachař, Jana Prachařová, Jiří Vršťala', null, 'In Nazi-occupied Czechoslovakia, a doctor-turned-warehouse employee reluctantly agrees to treat a gravely wounded political fugitive, putting himself and everyone living in his building complex in danger.', 'In Nazi-occupied Czechoslovakia, a doctor-turned-warehouse employee reluctantly agrees to treat a gravely wounded political fugitive, putting himself and everyone living in his building complex in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGm8RUpyscsYHFtG9lgTnr4IsHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109380'),
  ('868075527379363648', 'The Fifth Musketeer', 1979, 'Action, History', 'Ken Annakin, Jack Cardiff', 'David Ambrose', 'Beau Bridges, Sylvia Kristel, Ursula Andress, Olivia de Havilland, Ian McShane, Cornel Wilde, Rex Harrison, José Ferrer', null, 'King Louis XIV has without his knowledge a twin brother, Philippe, but when he is told, he immediately locks up his brother in the Bastille. The king wants to increase his popularity and stages an assassination against himself where Philippe is dressed as king Louis. But Philippe manages to escape the assassination and everybody believes him to be the real king...', 'King Louis XIV has without his knowledge a twin brother, Philippe, but when he is told, he immediately locks up his brother in the Bastille. The king wants to increase his popularity and stages an assassination against himself where Philippe is dressed as king Louis. But Philippe manages to escape the assassination and everybody believes him to be the real king...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHYyGTBO9pFOFzLYdc9R5GiJGXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4201'),
  ('54951669288812198', 'The Fifth One', 1965, 'Animation', 'Pavao Štalter', 'Pavao Štalter', null, null, 'A persistent trumpeter tries to join a string quartet that doesn''t want him.', 'A persistent trumpeter tries to join a string quartet that doesn''t want him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3wJCzPcQFWTG9dqy3Gwy4gJiDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281663'),
  ('316956504642415040', 'The Fifth Seal', 1976, 'Drama, War', 'Zoltán Fábri, György Illés', 'Zoltán Fábri', 'Lajos Őze, László Márkus, Ferenc Bencze, Sándor Horváth, István Dégi, Gábor Nagy, György Bánffy, Zoltán Latinovits', null, 'In 1944 Budapest, one of a group of four friends poses a hypothetical moral question to the others, an act that will unexpectedly alter their lives forever.', 'In 1944 Budapest, one of a group of four friends poses a hypothetical moral question to the others, an act that will unexpectedly alter their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXF5QK4pB1Nqklqq1zxQUaNC522.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77660'),
  ('130316051140409037', 'The Fifth Season', 2012, 'Drama', 'Peter Brosens, Jessica Hope Woodworth, Hans Bruch Jr.', 'Peter Brosens, Jessica Hope Woodworth', 'Sam Louwyck, Aurélia Poirier, Django Schrevens, Gill Vancompernolle, Peter van den Begin, Bruno Georis, Nathalie Laroche, Véronique Tappert', null, 'Villagers find their situation growing increasingly desperate when their community becomes engulfed in an endless winter.', 'Villagers find their situation growing increasingly desperate when their community becomes engulfed in an endless winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwFrOzPC43J8mDJ3RSzQ9bVz330.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123366'),
  ('201881119956973203', 'The Fifth Wheel', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Fabio Cianchetti, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Filippo Bologna, Ugo Chiti, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Elio Germano, Ricky Memphis, Alessandra Mastronardi, Virginia Raffaele, Ubaldo Pantani, Massimo Wertmüller, Maurizio Battista, Francesca Antonelli', null, 'The life of a working-class boy in Rome through the ''70s and ''80s, choosing his own path with his friends and family.', 'The life of a working-class boy in Rome through the ''70s and ''80s, choosing his own path with his friends and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zItWIwjckMhh5Mb1gAbUXMvr6qN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234356'),
  ('695398699904016043', 'The Fight', 2018, 'Drama', 'Marco Bellocchio, Daniele Ciprì', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Fabrizio Falco, Barbara Ronchi, Ione Bertola', null, 'It is a sunny day on the river Trebbia. In the distance a patrol of German soldiers is approaching : they are nazis, guns blazing. It seems like they are chasing somebody. Tonino is the fugitive, a partisan with nothing left to do but dive into the river. This river will bring him to his real life.', 'It is a sunny day on the river Trebbia. In the distance a patrol of German soldiers is approaching : they are nazis, guns blazing. It seems like they are chasing somebody. Tonino is the fugitive, a partisan with nothing left to do but dive into the river. This river will bring him to his real life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Up4Kb4qMgf8cpgxcinoSwetvRH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519133'),
  ('860209684940470329', 'The Fight Between the Snipe and the Clam', 1984, 'Animation', 'Hu Jinqing', 'Hanchang Gu, Mo Du', null, null, 'Fierce battle between a hungry heron and a crafty clam.', 'Fierce battle between a hungry heron and a crafty clam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxvRNpMkNFfc4yB6K1kBr8EvG84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347361'),
  ('1149981135916598695', 'The Fight of Reporters', 1899, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'During an interval in the proceedings of the court martial, the journalists enter into an animated discussion, resulting in a dispute between Arthur Meyer of the ''Gaulois'', and Mme. Severine of the ''Fronde'', resulting in a fight between Dreyfusards and Anti-Dreyfusards, in which canes and chairs are brought down upon the heads of many. The room is finally cleared by the gendarmes.', 'During an interval in the proceedings of the court martial, the journalists enter into an animated discussion, resulting in a dispute between Arthur Meyer of the ''Gaulois'', and Mme. Severine of the ''Fronde'', resulting in a fight between Dreyfusards and Anti-Dreyfusards, in which canes and chairs are brought down upon the heads of many. The room is finally cleared by the gendarmes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6AuHhctTqQPV5miYfQ97SEadC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105335'),
  ('134628112835922055', 'The Fight with the Panther', 1975, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Américo Fernández, Alberto Bojórquez Patrón', 'Alberto Bojórquez Patrón', 'Rocío Brambila, Marissa Maynez, Mildred Hernández, Gregorio Casal, Roberto Dumont, Enrique Novi, Juan José Martínez Casado, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez', null, 'Three nymphets struggle to have a beneficial youth: Ana is suicidal, Mercedes is attracted to her brother William, and Patricia desires to be sexually abused.', 'Three nymphets struggle to have a beneficial youth: Ana is suicidal, Mercedes is attracted to her brother William, and Patricia desires to be sexually abused.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryORH2GYklzVOcGmTHrITE0uGqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371531'),
  ('353574531433593603', 'The Fighter', 1983, 'Crime, Drama', 'Alain Delon, Robin Davis, Jean Tournier', 'Alain Delon, Christopher Frank', 'Alain Delon, François Périer, Anne Parillaud, Andréa Ferréol, Marie-Christine Descouard, Michel Beaune, Gérard Hérold, Jean-François Garreaud', null, 'Jacques Darnay has served 8 years for robbing a jeweller. Now he is out of prison and looking for his loot worth 6 million francs.', 'Jacques Darnay has served 8 years for robbing a jeweller. Now he is out of prison and looking for his loot worth 6 million francs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqjSPW1ExVcVNj95ugRqJcPv8ai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146877'),
  ('144365961157456498', 'The Fighter', 2010, 'Drama', 'David O. Russell, Hoyte van Hoytema, Michele Ziegler', 'Paul Tamasy, Scott Silver, Eric Johnson', 'Mark Wahlberg, Christian Bale, Amy Adams, Melissa Leo, Mickey O''Keefe, Jack McGee, Melissa McMeekin, Bianca Hunter', 'R', 'Boxer "Irish" Micky Ward''s unlikely road to the world light welterweight title. His Rocky-like rise was shepherded by half-brother Dicky, a boxer-turned-trainer who rebounded in life after nearly being KO''d by drugs and crime.', 'Boxer "Irish" Micky Ward''s unlikely road to the world light welterweight title. His Rocky-like rise was shepherded by half-brother Dicky, a boxer-turned-trainer who rebounded in life after nearly being KO''d by drugs and crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfsFerGhO1h6rLk8vwLgMyQ8WVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45317'),
  ('1004052439315176434', 'The Fighting 69½th', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Kent Rogers', null, 'Battalions of red and black ants go to war over an unattended picnic blanket full of food.', 'Battalions of red and black ants go to war over an unattended picnic blanket full of food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTTCYd3iauQpHNzZ061t3GmZuLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190138'),
  ('676438812688667283', 'The Fighting 69th', 1940, 'Action, Drama, War', 'William Keighley, Frank Heath, Tony Gaudio', 'Fred Niblo Jr., Norman Reilly Raine, Dean Riesner', 'James Cagney, Pat O''Brien, George Brent, Jeffrey Lynn, Alan Hale, Frank McHugh, Dennis Morgan, Dick Foran', 'NR', 'Although loudmouthed braggart Jerry Plunkett alienates his comrades and officers, Father Duffy, the regimental chaplain, has faith that he''ll prove himself in the end.', 'Although loudmouthed braggart Jerry Plunkett alienates his comrades and officers, Father Duffy, the regimental chaplain, has faith that he''ll prove himself in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GeoiU8nO01Cgr20Ls8DbJUoWIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72638'),
  ('777707185389826204', 'The Fighting Fists of Shanghai Joe', 1973, 'Western, Action', 'Mario Caiano, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Fabrizio Trifone Trecca, Mario Caiano', 'Chen Lee, Klaus Kinski, Gordon Mitchell, Claudio Undari, Carla Mancini, Carla Romanelli, Katsutoshi Mikuriya, Giacomo Rossi Stuart', null, 'A Chinese immigrant, recently arrived in America, fights to free Mexican slaves from their cruel master.', 'A Chinese immigrant, recently arrived in America, fights to free Mexican slaves from their cruel master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Lu77IdYLD7jsyCHZzxaCeLNRTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30489'),
  ('650347038510339159', 'The Fighting Generation', 1944, 'War', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Gregg Toland', 'Stephen Longstreet', 'Jennifer Jones, Eddie Bracken', 'NR', 'A 1944 propaganda short film produced for the U.S. Treasury Department and intended to boost war bond sales, directed by an uncredited Alfred Hitchcock and starring Jennifer Jones as a nurse''s aide. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive, from the Academy War Film Collection, in 2008.', 'A 1944 propaganda short film produced for the U.S. Treasury Department and intended to boost war bond sales, directed by an uncredited Alfred Hitchcock and starring Jennifer Jones as a nurse''s aide. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive, from the Academy War Film Collection, in 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCHg0oMC9uw24QeBQczgp1hkSZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414019'),
  ('854084509466036899', 'The Fighting Kentuckian', 1949, 'Western, Romance', 'George Waggner, Lee Garmes', 'George Waggner', 'John Wayne, Vera Ralston, Philip Dorn, Oliver Hardy, Marie Windsor, John Howard, Hugo Haas, Grant Withers', 'PG', 'John Breen (John Wayne), a Kentucky militiaman falls in love with French exile Fleurette De Marchand (Vera Ralston). He discovers a plot to steal the land that Fleurette''s exiles plan to settle on and aims to foil it.', 'John Breen (John Wayne), a Kentucky militiaman falls in love with French exile Fleurette De Marchand (Vera Ralston). He discovers a plot to steal the land that Fleurette''s exiles plan to settle on and aims to foil it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gld2vaQ7Q1DVvjgYzsZW1sg8BLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15266'),
  ('1080497683862579584', 'The Fighting Lady', 1944, 'War, Documentary', 'Edward Steichen, William Wyler', 'Eugene Ling, John S. Martin', 'Charles Boyer, Robert Taylor, John S. McCain, Joesph J. Clark, Dixie Kiefer', null, 'Oscar winner William Wyler directed this 1944 "newsdrama," narrated by Lieut. Robert Taylor, USNR (Bataan), and photographed in zones of combat by the U.S. Navy. The film follows one of the many new aircraft carriers built since Pearl Harbor, known as THE FIGHTING LADY in honor of all American carriers, as it goes into action against the Japanese in the Pacific Ocean in 1943. See the ship and its pilots undergo their baptism of fire, attacking the Japanese base on Marcus Island. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation.', 'Oscar winner William Wyler directed this 1944 "newsdrama," narrated by Lieut. Robert Taylor, USNR (Bataan), and photographed in zones of combat by the U.S. Navy. The film follows one of the many new aircraft carriers built since Pearl Harbor, known as THE FIGHTING LADY in honor of all American carriers, as it goes into action against the Japanese in the Pacific Ocean in 1943. See the ship and its pilots undergo their baptism of fire, attacking the Japanese base on Marcus Island. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abZ2OKji9kOXQgSUHXUxh1YNX53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86120'),
  ('71329269762988338', 'The Fighting Musketeers', 1961, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'Bernard Borderie', 'Bernard Borderie', 'Gérard Barray, Mylène Demongeot, Perrette Pradier, Georges Descrières, Guy Tréjan, Jean Carmet, Françoise Christophe, Daniel Sorano', null, 'D''Artagnan is back from England with a message for the queen. Buckingham has declared that he was ready to attack France to deliver Anne of Austria. D''Artagnan ends up arrested and thrown into prison. Musketeers wonder how to rescue their friend.', 'D''Artagnan is back from England with a message for the queen. Buckingham has declared that he was ready to attack France to deliver Anne of Austria. D''Artagnan ends up arrested and thrown into prison. Musketeers wonder how to rescue their friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkErHHSGeLAVsVVlGl2VGRpuxdM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105596'),
  ('391950220430515632', 'The Fighting Prince of Donegal', 1966, 'Action, Adventure', 'Michael O''Herlihy', 'Robert Westerby', 'Peter McEnery, Susan Hampshire, Gordon Jackson, Norman Wooland, Richard Leech, Tom Adams, Peter Jeffrey, Marie Kean', null, 'Ireland 1587. Hugh O''Donnell inherits the title of The O''Donnell, the prince of Donegal, and tries to unite Ireland to make war on England. But then Hugh is kidnapped and imprisoned by the Viceroy of Ireland and held ransom for the Clans'' good behavior. Hugh must escape prison and the Viceroy''s villainous henchman, Captain Leeds, before he can fight.', 'Ireland 1587. Hugh O''Donnell inherits the title of The O''Donnell, the prince of Donegal, and tries to unite Ireland to make war on England. But then Hugh is kidnapped and imprisoned by the Viceroy of Ireland and held ransom for the Clans'' good behavior. Hugh must escape prison and the Viceroy''s villainous henchman, Captain Leeds, before he can fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqPcWf4YXObkLB5LERd4a2n6eKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64875'),
  ('162807786131250808', 'The Fighting Seabees', 1944, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Edward Ludwig, William Bradford', 'Æneas MacKenzie, Borden Chase', 'John Wayne, Susan Hayward, Dennis O''Keefe, William Frawley, Leonid Kinskey, J.M. Kerrigan, Grant Withers, Paul Fix', 'NR', 'Construction workers in World War II in the Pacific are needed to build military sites, but the work is dangerous and they doubt the ability of the Navy to protect them. After a series of attacks by the Japanese, something new is tried, Construction Battalions (CBs=Seabees). The new CBs have to both build and be ready to fight.', 'Construction workers in World War II in the Pacific are needed to build military sites, but the work is dangerous and they doubt the ability of the Navy to protect them. After a series of attacks by the Japanese, something new is tried, Construction Battalions (CBs=Seabees). The new CBs have to both build and be ready to fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfqahIjSJ8XkU1Pta2z9M9PuIJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22994'),
  ('44113803243866305', 'The Fighting Sullivans', 1944, 'Drama, History, War', 'Lloyd Bacon, Lucien N. Andriot, Alfred Newman', 'Mary C. McCall, Jr.', 'Anne Baxter, Thomas Mitchell, Selena Royle, Edward Ryan, Trudy Marshall, John Campbell, James Cardwell, John Alvin', 'NR', 'The lives of a close-knit group of brothers growing up in Iowa during the days of the Great Depression and of World War II and their eventual deaths in action in the Pacific theater are chronicled in this film based on a true story.', 'The lives of a close-knit group of brothers growing up in Iowa during the days of the Great Depression and of World War II and their eventual deaths in action in the Pacific theater are chronicled in this film based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyYw2dk1dowEc4NlPFFtsDBihTm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43504'),
  ('393135865216796289', 'The Fighting Temptations', 2003, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Jonathan Lynn, Affonso Beato', 'Elizabeth Hunter', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Beyoncé, Mike Epps, Faith Evans, Steve Harvey, Wendell Pierce, LaTanya Richardson Jackson, Dave Sheridan', 'PG-13', 'Darrin Hill, a slick-talking but down-on- his-luck NYC advertising exec, returns to his hometown in Georgia to claim the inheritance his aunt left him. But before Darrin can collect the money, he must fulfill his aunt''s final wish -- to create a local choir.', 'Darrin Hill, a slick-talking but down-on- his-luck NYC advertising exec, returns to his hometown in Georgia to claim the inheritance his aunt left him. But before Darrin can collect the money, he must fulfill his aunt''s final wish -- to create a local choir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Dd8TBA6G0n1x2N8KpJvIefy2sB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22309'),
  ('78789468357002972', 'The Fighting Westerner', 1935, 'Mystery, Western', 'Charles Barton, Archie Stout', 'Ethel Doherty', 'Randolph Scott, Charles ''Chic'' Sale, Mrs. Leslie Carter, George F. Marion, Ann Sheridan, Florence Roberts, Kathleen Burke, Willie Fung', 'NR', 'A mining engineer teams up with a crusty deputy sheriff to solve the mystery killings at an old mine where the owner''s family waits for him to die, and where a valuable radium strike may have been made.', 'A mining engineer teams up with a crusty deputy sheriff to solve the mystery killings at an old mine where the owner''s family waits for him to die, and where a valuable radium strike may have been made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/J9o1zwnb3WaTUfGOCBh0n68dk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68261'),
  ('1089808305025810541', 'The Figo Affair: The Transfer That Changed Football', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Ben Nicholas, David Tryhorn, Andrew White', null, 'Luís Figo, Pep Guardiola, Roberto Carlos, Fernando Hierro, José Ramón de la Morena, Jorge Valdano, Paulo Futre, José Veiga', null, 'This documentary spotlights one of the most contentious deals in football history and the extraordinary player at the center of the storm: Luís Figo.', 'This documentary spotlights one of the most contentious deals in football history and the extraordinary player at the center of the storm: Luís Figo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmUmwFRrgQguSPPut2SYzwNEQEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014779'),
  ('857082843182071675', 'The File of the Golden Goose', 1969, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Sam Wanamaker, Ken Hodges, Ray Frift', 'John C. Higgins', 'Yul Brynner, Charles Gray, Edward Woodward, John Barrie, Adrienne Corri, Graham Crowden, Walter Gotell, Anthony Jacobs', 'PG-13', 'U.S. Secret Service agent Peter Novak goes undercover with Scotland Yard officer Thompson to halt a murderous gang of counterfeiters known as the Golden Goose. Although Peter is unsure about John''s loyalties, the two infiltrate the gang and win the trust of thug Nick "The Owl" Harrison before enduring a series of double-crosses.', 'U.S. Secret Service agent Peter Novak goes undercover with Scotland Yard officer Thompson to halt a murderous gang of counterfeiters known as the Golden Goose. Although Peter is unsure about John''s loyalties, the two infiltrate the gang and win the trust of thug Nick "The Owl" Harrison before enduring a series of double-crosses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byRKDcKZzdUiLI9Okwk33zpCKsi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70428'),
  ('309393762491812238', 'The File on Thelma Jordon', 1949, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Robert Siodmak, George Barnes, Francisco Day', 'Ketti Frings', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Wendell Corey, Paul Kelly, Joan Tetzel, Stanley Ridges, Richard Rober, Minor Watson, Barry Kelley', 'NR', 'Cleve Marshall, an assistant district attorney, falls for Thelma Jordon, a mysterious woman with a troubled past. When Thelma becomes a suspect in her aunt''s murder, Cleve tries to clear her name.', 'Cleve Marshall, an assistant district attorney, falls for Thelma Jordon, a mysterious woman with a troubled past. When Thelma becomes a suspect in her aunt''s murder, Cleve tries to clear her name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPGWc8F0IolxlpfSuOJ8AcvKQLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35404'),
  ('801068131879628424', 'The Film', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Ömer Böler, Haris Şerif Bahadır', 'Haris Şerif Bahadır', 'Haris Şerif Bahadır, Ömer Akhmadov, Ömer Böler, Kerem Umay', null, 'The film follows The Director, a young and talented storyteller who starts to hear sounds from a reality that is not his own.', 'The film follows The Director, a young and talented storyteller who starts to hear sounds from a reality that is not his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoKycNwWL1elMO87loyinszXC4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976862'),
  ('111940300275765449', 'The Film Critic', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hernán Guerschuny', 'Hernán Guerschuny', 'Rafael Spregelburd, Dolores Fonzi, Blanca Lewin, Ignacio Rogers, Telma Crisanti, Ana Katz, Daniel Kargieman, Eduardo Iacono', 'NR', 'Víctor Tellez is an intellectual, world-weary film critic who prefers to think in French and eschew the clichés of romantic movies...until he finds himself living a sappy, feel-good love story of his own.', 'Víctor Tellez is an intellectual, world-weary film critic who prefers to think in French and eschew the clichés of romantic movies...until he finds himself living a sappy, feel-good love story of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAlElHCIIFkF99f5xUjkYQIHGoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268297'),
  ('712713899924369706', 'The Film Fan', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Western', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher, Robert C. Bruce', null, 'Porky Pig is on his way to the store to pick up some groceries for his mother when he walks by a sign saying that the local movie theater is having a "kids admitted free" day. The excited Porky rushes in and views a series of spoofs of newsreels, movie trailers, feature films, and even the Lone Ranger!', 'Porky Pig is on his way to the store to pick up some groceries for his mother when he walks by a sign saying that the local movie theater is having a "kids admitted free" day. The excited Porky rushes in and views a series of spoofs of newsreels, movie trailers, feature films, and even the Lone Ranger!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIkrzEyNdsLceY0lbPZIATHKDsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100368'),
  ('1018564345328655971', 'The Film That Rises to the Surface of Clarified Butter', 1968, 'Animation', 'Owen Land', null, null, null, 'Two artists create grotesque characters; Two-dimensional drawings which somehow have a life of their own, that exist in the same space as real objects. The film seems to ask, "Isn''t every filmmaking venture a series of repeated, once-negative images displayed alongside the real world?"', 'Two artists create grotesque characters; Two-dimensional drawings which somehow have a life of their own, that exist in the same space as real objects. The film seems to ask, "Isn''t every filmmaking venture a series of repeated, once-negative images displayed alongside the real world?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc20xOLkD9m1IXxSQRYG8Iqkq10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233180'),
  ('300827343217159478', 'The Film to Come', 1997, null, 'Raúl Ruiz, Jacques Bouquin', 'Raúl Ruiz', null, null, 'If any single piece can act as a key to Ruiz, it may be the 1997 short Le Film à Venir (The Film to Come). The titular film is a holy fragment of celluloid that can only be seen by a secret society known as the Philokinetes. They watch it on a loop, somnambulating through a life that is unreal by comparison. It is the belief of the Philokinetes that film has an existence “independent from humans. Cinema, they said, is the primeval soup of a new life form. There from were to emerge pure screening creatures. Which is to say, non-topical beings.” - n+1', 'If any single piece can act as a key to Ruiz, it may be the 1997 short Le Film à Venir (The Film to Come). The titular film is a holy fragment of celluloid that can only be seen by a secret society known as the Philokinetes. They watch it on a loop, somnambulating through a life that is unreal by comparison. It is the belief of the Philokinetes that film has an existence “independent from humans. Cinema, they said, is the primeval soup of a new life form. There from were to emerge pure screening creatures. Which is to say, non-topical beings.” - n+1', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaQ52uuSRGAthwMLiRytZguaHJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239428'),
  ('76367480930564268', 'The Filth and the Fury', 2000, 'Documentary, Music', 'Julien Temple', 'Julien Temple', 'John Lydon, Steve Jones, Paul Cook, Glen Matlock, Sid Vicious, Malcolm McLaren, David Bowie, Alice Cooper', 'R', 'Julien Temple''s second documentary profiling punk rock pioneers the Sex Pistols is an enlightening, entertaining trip back to a time when the punk movement was just discovering itself. Featuring archival footage, never-before-seen performances, rehearsals, and recording sessions as well as interviews with group members who lived to tell the tale--including the one and only John Lydon (aka Johnny Rotten).', 'Julien Temple''s second documentary profiling punk rock pioneers the Sex Pistols is an enlightening, entertaining trip back to a time when the punk movement was just discovering itself. Featuring archival footage, never-before-seen performances, rehearsals, and recording sessions as well as interviews with group members who lived to tell the tale--including the one and only John Lydon (aka Johnny Rotten).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdNkiqmMeJfaD8ybjiV6bVOrcQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27745'),
  ('252862942503623227', 'The Final', 2010, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Joey Stewart, Noreen Dimster-Denk, David McFarland', 'Jason Kabolati', 'Marc Donato, Jascha Washington, Whitney Hoy, Justin Arnold, Lindsay Seidel, Laura Ashley Samuels, Travis Tedford, Eric Isenhower', 'R', 'A group of high school outcasts get revenge on the students that torment them.', 'A group of high school outcasts get revenge on the students that torment them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ff7UI8q51sOArKafaaAOQnnfpne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34583'),
  ('534939866740132816', 'The Final Comedown', 1972, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Oscar Williams, William B. Kaplan', 'Jimmy Garrett, Oscar Williams', 'Billy Dee Williams, D''Urville Martin, Celia Milius, Ed Cambridge, Billy Durkin, Morris D. Erby, Pamela Jones, R.G. Armstrong', 'R', 'Prejudice transforms a young black man into an armed militant leader, who believes the only answer to racism is violent revolution.', 'Prejudice transforms a young black man into an armed militant leader, who believes the only answer to racism is violent revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLpiC4ZWKbhbrtqbhPD99VGzQFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92307'),
  ('1054692714761622150', 'The Final Conflict', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Dusty Symonds, Christopher Newman, Kieron Phipps', 'Andrew Birkin', 'Sam Neill, Rossano Brazzi, Don Gordon, Lisa Harrow, Barnaby Holm, Mason Adams, Robert Arden, Leueen Willoughby', 'R', 'Damien Thorn has helped rescue the world from a recession, appearing to be a benign corporate benefactor. When he then becomes U.S. Ambassador to the United Kingdom, Damien fulfills a terrifying biblical prophecy. He also faces his own potential demise as an astronomical event brings about the second coming of Christ.', 'Damien Thorn has helped rescue the world from a recession, appearing to be a benign corporate benefactor. When he then becomes U.S. Ambassador to the United Kingdom, Damien fulfills a terrifying biblical prophecy. He also faces his own potential demise as an astronomical event brings about the second coming of Christ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDW2C77QNMQe6Lp2jeqAQXe2uaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10768'),
  ('981641961024604448', 'The Final Countdown', 1980, 'War, Action, Science Fiction', 'Don Taylor, Victor J. Kemper, Dale Koeppe', 'David Ambrose, Gerry Davis, Thomas Hunter', 'Kirk Douglas, Martin Sheen, Katharine Ross, James Farentino, Ron O''Neal, Charles Durning, Victor Mohica, James Coleman', 'PG', 'During routine manoeuvres near Hawaii in 1980, the aircraft-carrier USS Nimitz is caught in a strange vortex-like storm, throwing the ship back in time to 1941—mere hours before the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor.', 'During routine manoeuvres near Hawaii in 1980, the aircraft-carrier USS Nimitz is caught in a strange vortex-like storm, throwing the ship back in time to 1941—mere hours before the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJmWPdreWnbdjMpmXB5rnJMvsK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8738'),
  ('1122784532739623359', 'The Final Cut', 1995, 'Action', 'Roger Christian, Mike Southon, Kelsey T. Howard', 'Raul Sanchez Inglis', 'Sam Elliott, Charles Martin Smith, Kelly Benson, Anne Ramsay, Lloyd Berry, Matt Craven, Ray Baker, Frank Cassini', null, 'A former bomb squad leader comes out of retirement to investigate a series of bombings plaguing Seattle.', 'A former bomb squad leader comes out of retirement to investigate a series of bombings plaguing Seattle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a68zeNwSvt1PZtuJRz0QRSSVx1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2442'),
  ('878680400480976321', 'The Final Cut', 2004, 'Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Omar Naim, Tak Fujimoto', 'Omar Naim', 'Robin Williams, Mira Sorvino, Jim Caviezel, Mimi Kuzyk, Stephanie Romanov, Genevieve Buechner, Brendan Fletcher, Vincent Gale', 'PG-13', 'Set in a world with memory implants, Alan Hakman is a ''cutter''—someone with the power of final edit over people''s recorded histories—but his latest assignment puts him in great danger.', 'Set in a world with memory implants, Alan Hakman is a ''cutter''—someone with the power of final edit over people''s recorded histories—but his latest assignment puts him in great danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZ1G1uuZ1etwEhogwMDkXQRGWAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11099'),
  ('276580211433396038', 'The Final Destination', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery', 'David R. Ellis, Glen MacPherson, Eric A. Pot', 'Eric Bress', 'Bobby Campo, Shantel VanSanten, Nick Zano, Haley Webb, Mykelti Williamson, Krista Allen, Andrew Fiscella, Justin Welborn', 'R', 'A horrifying premonition saves a young man and his friends from death during a racetrack accident but terrible fates await them nonetheless.', 'A horrifying premonition saves a young man and his friends from death during a racetrack accident but terrible fates await them nonetheless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vxXrr1MqGsT4NNeRITpfDnl4Rq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19912'),
  ('794363250286501536', 'The Final Executioner', 1984, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Romolo Guerrieri, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Roberto Leoni', 'William Mang, Marina Costa, Harrison Muller Jr., Woody Strode, Margit Evelyn Newton, Stefano Davanzati, Renato Miracco, Maria Romano', null, 'After a nuclear holocaust, as the rest of society regresses to primitivism, a small, "elite" group that has managed to escape radioactive contamination takes it upon itself to exterminate those it sees as "unfit", including certain members of its own group.', 'After a nuclear holocaust, as the rest of society regresses to primitivism, a small, "elite" group that has managed to escape radioactive contamination takes it upon itself to exterminate those it sees as "unfit", including certain members of its own group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suoGDT9xKfMcCBFjhPCfKVCk9gU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89791'),
  ('894864850326441865', 'The Final Game', 2022, 'Drama', 'Alex Murrull, Dani de la Orden, Pau Castejón Ubeda', 'Carlos Franco', 'Jaime Lorente, Álvaro Cervantes, Roger Casamajor, Àlex Maruny, Marc Bonnin, Tarik Filipović, Cristian Valencia, Pep Ambròs', null, 'A few months before the ’92 Barcelona Olympic Games, it looks like the Spanish water polo team will hardly make a splash during their home field Olympics. The national team is a battleground under attack on two fronts: the harsh techniques of their new coach, which threaten to incapacitate more than one player, and the infighting between leaders Manel Estiarte and Pedro Aguado. Can the team stay united and overcome their personal differences? Will reaching sporting glory be possible in the face of such adversity?', 'A few months before the ’92 Barcelona Olympic Games, it looks like the Spanish water polo team will hardly make a splash during their home field Olympics. The national team is a battleground under attack on two fronts: the harsh techniques of their new coach, which threaten to incapacitate more than one player, and the infighting between leaders Manel Estiarte and Pedro Aguado. Can the team stay united and overcome their personal differences? Will reaching sporting glory be possible in the face of such adversity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1a5m7wCEeLqAVZ1TpUynmh9rj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913988'),
  ('82036337626886516', 'The Final Girl', 2014, 'Drama', 'Todd Verow', 'Todd Verow', 'Wendy Delorme, Brenda Velez, Judy Minx, Émilie Jouvet, Véronique Lindenberg, Pascale Ourbih', null, 'Three Parisian women discover that their lives are delicately interconnected to a mysterious fourth woman, who remains tantalizingly out of reach.', 'Three Parisian women discover that their lives are delicately interconnected to a mysterious fourth woman, who remains tantalizingly out of reach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1fNjxqKehpzKGcMEd9O42ccpRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185207'),
  ('417917625723354966', 'The Final Girls', 2015, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Todd Strauss-Schulson, Elie Smolkin, Rod Smith', 'M.A. Fortin, Joshua John Miller', 'Taissa Farmiga, Malin Åkerman, Nina Dobrev, Alexander Ludwig, Adam Devine, Thomas Middleditch, Alia Shawkat, Chloe Bridges', 'PG-13', 'A young woman grieving the loss of her mother, a famous scream queen from the 1980s, finds herself pulled into the world of her mom''s most famous movie. Reunited, the women must fight off the film''s maniacal killer.', 'A young woman grieving the loss of her mother, a famous scream queen from the 1980s, finds herself pulled into the world of her mom''s most famous movie. Reunited, the women must fight off the film''s maniacal killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQYKSRVo5iZACFOY6x50RblI6rx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293970'),
  ('625883025496457966', 'The Final Inquiry', 2007, 'Drama, History', 'Giulio Base, Raffaele Androsiglio, Francesco Sperandeo', 'Valerio Massimo Manfredi', 'Daniele Liotti, Dolph Lundgren, Mónica Cruz, Hristo Shopov, Christo Jivkov, Max von Sydow, Vincenzo Bocciarelli, Fernando Guillén Cuervo', null, 'In 35 A.D., a Roman tribune is sent to Palestine to investigate the death and possible resurrection of a certain Jesus from Nazareth.', 'In 35 A.D., a Roman tribune is sent to Palestine to investigate the death and possible resurrection of a certain Jesus from Nazareth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYNu0pjYxQTDkIfrMW79SnM98KR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24365'),
  ('352920028989769991', 'The Final Journey', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nick Baker-Monteys, Eeva Fleig, Chris Tromboukis', 'Nick Baker-Monteys', 'Jürgen Prochnow, Petra Schmidt-Schaller, Tambet Tuisk, Suzanne von Borsody, Artjom Gilz, Kathrin Angerer, Kai Ivo Baulitz, Andreas Patton', null, 'A former German Army officer, accompanied by his granddaughter, journeys to Ukraine to find the woman he once loved.', 'A former German Army officer, accompanied by his granddaughter, journeys to Ukraine to find the woman he once loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytne3RyFwSa5uOUuLMirkt0HX6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454883'),
  ('322309454811437047', 'The Final Lesson', 2015, 'Drama, Family', 'Pascale Pouzadoux', null, 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Marthe Villalonga, Antoine Duléry, Gilles Cohen, Emmanuelle Galabru, Sabine Pakora, Grégoire Montana-Haroche, Sevane Lepoureau', null, 'At 92 years old, Madeleine decides to set the date and conditions of her death. By telling her daughter Diane and her son Pierre, she hopes to prepare them as gently as possible but it comes as a shock, and their minds are set ablaze. Until the end, Madeleine will keep her dignity, wits, and passion for life as a course of conduct, so she can give them all, and in particular Diane, a touching “final lesson”.', 'At 92 years old, Madeleine decides to set the date and conditions of her death. By telling her daughter Diane and her son Pierre, she hopes to prepare them as gently as possible but it comes as a shock, and their minds are set ablaze. Until the end, Madeleine will keep her dignity, wits, and passion for life as a course of conduct, so she can give them all, and in particular Diane, a touching “final lesson”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWsbf0OpTwn0deCYpTH7hGj6Dfg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364136'),
  ('949757996082123760', 'The Final Master', 2015, 'Action, Drama', 'Wang Tianlin, Xu Haofeng', 'Xu Haofeng', 'Liao Fan, Song Jia, Song Yang, Jiang Wenli, King Shih-chieh, Huang Jue, Ma Jun, Madina Memet', 'NR', 'Determined to pass down his art, the Final Master of Wing Chun is caught in a power struggle with malicious local officials and ultimately must choose between personal honor and his master’s dying wish.', 'Determined to pass down his art, the Final Master of Wing Chun is caught in a power struggle with malicious local officials and ultimately must choose between personal honor and his master’s dying wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjPavx5RipvydpVrca1MzwWkJxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377823'),
  ('612032837139966313', 'The Final Phase', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Gabriel Díaz, Cristian Bidone', 'Gabriel Díaz', 'Sol Masid, Claudio Santorelli, Claudio Martin, Natalia Toscani, Maximiliano Zurraco, Sebastian Olivera, Alejandro Alvariño, Alex Acosta', null, 'Laura Pereira begins a desperate search to find her father who disappeared. While trying to find answers, something is following her. The disappearance of her father and the strange events, could have an explanation related to the UFO phenomenon her father was investigating. Laura embarks on a quest that will put their lives in danger, that will change the destiny of humanity.', 'Laura Pereira begins a desperate search to find her father who disappeared. While trying to find answers, something is following her. The disappearance of her father and the strange events, could have an explanation related to the UFO phenomenon her father was investigating. Laura embarks on a quest that will put their lives in danger, that will change the destiny of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkpNvpobDVfvV0bee7Zk1tVWptX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:707431'),
  ('977440263267934359', 'The Final Problem', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Leena Koppe, Karl Markovics', 'Daniel Kehlmann', 'Karl Markovics, Stefan Pohl, Maria Fliri, Max Moor, Sunnyi Melles, Julia Koch, Laura Bilgeri, Marc Hosemann', null, 'A snowed-in holiday hotel. A dead body in a room locked from the inside. The hotel manager wants to cover it up, but in the blink of an eye the whole hotel knows about it. Among the guests is an inspector - or at least he convincingly claims to be - who, together with his assistant who has travelled with him, undertakes extensive investigations. Then even a second murder takes place!', 'A snowed-in holiday hotel. A dead body in a room locked from the inside. The hotel manager wants to cover it up, but in the blink of an eye the whole hotel knows about it. Among the guests is an inspector - or at least he convincingly claims to be - who, together with his assistant who has travelled with him, undertakes extensive investigations. Then even a second murder takes place!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5O7dyNBVqYub4nCbimp1QDTQhkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661419'),
  ('224318344624891553', 'The Final Programme', 1973, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Robert Fuest', 'Robert Fuest', 'Jon Finch, Jenny Runacre, Sterling Hayden, Harry Andrews, Hugh Griffith, Julie Ege, Patrick Magee, Sarah Douglas', 'R', 'Returning from Lapland, where he buried his father, a renowned scientist, Jerry Cornelius comes back to London with the firm intention of taking revenge on his brother Frank and snatching his beloved sister Catherine from his clutches. Since the recent gigantic global conflagration, things have changed considerably. If he wanted to, Jerry could easily get hold of napalm to blow up Frank''s hideout. But he prefers to join forces with the disturbing Mrs Brunner, who, with the help of three scientists, Smiles, Lucas and Powys, is trying to recover a mysterious microfilm left to Frank by his father...', 'Returning from Lapland, where he buried his father, a renowned scientist, Jerry Cornelius comes back to London with the firm intention of taking revenge on his brother Frank and snatching his beloved sister Catherine from his clutches. Since the recent gigantic global conflagration, things have changed considerably. If he wanted to, Jerry could easily get hold of napalm to blow up Frank''s hideout. But he prefers to join forces with the disturbing Mrs Brunner, who, with the help of three scientists, Smiles, Lucas and Powys, is trying to recover a mysterious microfilm left to Frank by his father...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxznSp0sBbGIzuvcf09pqDtpdst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42471'),
  ('890742229552349033', 'The Final Sacrifice', 1990, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'Tjardus Greidanus, Jim Stacy', 'Tjardus Greidanus', 'Bruce J. Mitchell, Christian Malcolm, Shane Marceau, Ron Anderson, Bharbara Egan, Randy Vasseur, Bryan C. Knight', null, 'Fleeing from the cult that murdered his father, a teen is aided in his quest to find the lost city of the fabled Ziox by a secretive drifter.', 'Fleeing from the cult that murdered his father, a teen is aided in his quest to find the lost city of the fabled Ziox by a secretive drifter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0ZOrVBuMMZekWeiLgbGSM4eLW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31129'),
  ('248980419832638197', 'The Final Sanction', 1990, 'Adventure, Action', 'David A. Prior, Andrew Parke', 'David A. Prior', 'Ted Prior, Robert Z''Dar, Renée Cline, William Smith, David Fawcett, Graham Timbes', null, 'After war breaks out between the U.S. and Russia, the two countries decide to settle the conflict by putting its two best warriors into an arena in a fight to the death.', 'After war breaks out between the U.S. and Russia, the two countries decide to settle the conflict by putting its two best warriors into an arena in a fight to the death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fT3pyLa23g5M8yNeP8FtJgmvJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84595'),
  ('332250073512512385', 'The Final Season', 2007, 'Drama', 'David Mickey Evans, Dan Stoloff', 'Art D''Alessandro, James Grayford, Art D''Alessandro', 'Sean Astin, Michael Angarano, Powers Boothe, Rachael Leigh Cook, Tom Arnold, Larry Miller, Mackenzie Astin, Jesse Henecke', 'PG', 'True story of Kent Stock, who in the early ''90s gives up a job and ditches his wedding plans to take over as head coach of the Norway High School baseball team. Kent must win over his players and convince them and himself that he can fill their former coach''s shoes and that they can go out winners. In the summer of 1991 Norway High''s baseball tradition ended on a triumphant but sombre note.', 'True story of Kent Stock, who in the early ''90s gives up a job and ditches his wedding plans to take over as head coach of the Norway High School baseball team. Kent must win over his players and convince them and himself that he can fill their former coach''s shoes and that they can go out winners. In the summer of 1991 Norway High''s baseball tradition ended on a triumphant but sombre note.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jW0IQOUE3YN9WOxn3yUdLhL6bgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15669'),
  ('38543276423733637', 'The Final Storm', 2010, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann', null, 'Lauren Holly, Luke Perry, Steve Bacic, Cole Heppell, Blu Mankuma, Michael Eklund, Bob Bottieri, Dan Clarke', 'R', 'A stranger named Silas flees from a devastating storm and finds refuge with Tom and Gillian on their farm. While struggling with the Storm, Silas seems to be the only one who can help Tom and Gillian to find their son but there are other more dangerous forces out there, that are waiting for the three.', 'A stranger named Silas flees from a devastating storm and finds refuge with Tom and Gillian on their farm. While struggling with the Storm, Silas seems to be the only one who can help Tom and Gillian to find their son but there are other more dangerous forces out there, that are waiting for the three.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qud4ItaA6VWqtoVtOIJpGMNhI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45527'),
  ('890566717064865960', 'The Final Terror', 1983, 'Horror, Thriller', 'A. Davidescu, Andrew Davis, Randall Robinson', 'Ronald Shusett', 'John Friedrich, Adrian Zmed, Daryl Hannah, Ernest Harden Jr., Lewis Smith, Rachel Ward, Akosua Busia, Joe Pantoliano', 'R', 'A group of friends head out for what is expected to be a vacation of hiking, camping and a good time, but when a backwoods mama finds them on her turf, it becomes anything but a vacation.', 'A group of friends head out for what is expected to be a vacation of hiking, camping and a good time, but when a backwoods mama finds them on her turf, it becomes anything but a vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQaY8o8LtdkSDUYzeyJ1CcHhh1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4288'),
  ('985996242983662453', 'The Final Wish', 2019, 'Horror', 'Tim Gagliardo, Zebulun Huling, John J. Tierney', 'Jeffrey Reddick, Jonathan Doyle, William Halfon', 'Lin Shaye, Michael Welch, Melissa Bolona, Spencer Locke, Tony Todd, Kaiwi Lyman, Jonathan Daniel Brown, Jean Elie', 'R', 'Following the passing of his father, Aaron Hammond returns to his hometown to help his devastated mother and to confront his past demons. Sifting through his father’s belongings, Aaron comes upon a mysterious item that is far more than it seems.', 'Following the passing of his father, Aaron Hammond returns to his hometown to help his devastated mother and to confront his past demons. Sifting through his father’s belongings, Aaron comes upon a mysterious item that is far more than it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/181zwXeXcRrBWkF5OFt3d1GhDpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554739'),
  ('826697242018429276', 'The Final: Attack on Wembley', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Robert Miller, Kwabena Oppong', null, 'Gareth Southgate, Harry Kane, Luciano Spalletti, Leonardo Bonucci, Emma Saunders, Liam Boylan, Chris Bryant, Carolyn Downs', 'R', 'As England reach the final of the Euros at last, 6,000 ticketless football fans storm Wembley stadium, leaving destruction in their wake.', 'As England reach the final of the Euros at last, 6,000 ticketless football fans storm Wembley stadium, leaving destruction in their wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XQ1WAbqhBMrEB1UAEiB8Hpy5Ge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1263766'),
  ('139379687790885422', 'The Finances of the Grand Duke', 1924, 'Comedy, Drama', 'F. W. Murnau, Karl Freund, Franz Planer', 'Thea von Harbou, Fritz Wendhausen', 'Harry Liedtke, Adolphe Engers, Ilka Grüning, Hugo Block, Guido Herzfeld, Hermann Vallentin, Georg August Koch, Max Schreck', null, 'The likeable and carefree Grand Duke of Abacco is in dire straits. There is no money left to service the State''s debt; the main creditor is looking forward to expropriating the entire Duchy. The marriage with Olga, Grand Duchess of Russia, would solve everything, but a crucial letter of hers about the engagement has been stolen. Besides, a bunch of revolutionaries and a dubious businessman have other plans regarding the Grand Duke. With the intrusion of adventurer Philipp Collins into the Grand Duke''s affairs, a series of frantic chases, plots and counter-plots begins.', 'The likeable and carefree Grand Duke of Abacco is in dire straits. There is no money left to service the State''s debt; the main creditor is looking forward to expropriating the entire Duchy. The marriage with Olga, Grand Duchess of Russia, would solve everything, but a crucial letter of hers about the engagement has been stolen. Besides, a bunch of revolutionaries and a dubious businessman have other plans regarding the Grand Duke. With the intrusion of adventurer Philipp Collins into the Grand Duke''s affairs, a series of frantic chases, plots and counter-plots begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UTOxZ5fthWGYPXmNtCYbNNbCJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55536'),
  ('482914764419503480', 'The Fine Art of Love: Mine Ha-Ha', 2005, 'Mystery, Drama', 'John Irvin, Fabio Zamarion', 'Ottavio Jemma, Alberto Lattuada', 'Jacqueline Bisset, Hannah Taylor-Gordon, Natalia Tena, Anna Maguire, Mary Nighy, Anya Lahiri, Emily Pimm, Urbano Barberini', null, 'A group of young girls are brought up in a college within dark forests and gloomy lakes. Young Hidalla and her friends Irene, Vera, Blanka, Melusine and Rain are brought up in an isolated world: the girls don''t know anything about live outside the college''s high walls. At the age of 16, some of them start asking questions about their origins, their parents and the true purposes of the Headmistresses strict rules. When two of them disappear mysteriously, the initial fairytale atmosphere grows more and more eerie...', 'A group of young girls are brought up in a college within dark forests and gloomy lakes. Young Hidalla and her friends Irene, Vera, Blanka, Melusine and Rain are brought up in an isolated world: the girls don''t know anything about live outside the college''s high walls. At the age of 16, some of them start asking questions about their origins, their parents and the true purposes of the Headmistresses strict rules. When two of them disappear mysteriously, the initial fairytale atmosphere grows more and more eerie...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ks5PovbKHXukfaUNGSNmGNKorRo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61950'),
  ('665641986058540042', 'The Fine Art of Separating People from Their Money', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Hermann Vaske, Tom Batoy', 'Hermann Vaske', 'Dennis Hopper, David Lynch, Spike Lee, Ridley Scott, Alan Parker, Harvey Keitel, Dave Stewart, David Bowie', null, 'An examination of the evolution of commercials as an artistic medium, featuring interviews with media luminaries who relate how the in-your-face stylistic conventions of commercials have influenced feature films and the visual arts. A documentary film talking about art and advertising divided in three parts: 1. Crossing Over - from cinema to ads from ads to cinema 2. Humour - How humour affects us in advertising 3. Shock - The way shock is used to sell', 'An examination of the evolution of commercials as an artistic medium, featuring interviews with media luminaries who relate how the in-your-face stylistic conventions of commercials have influenced feature films and the visual arts. A documentary film talking about art and advertising divided in three parts: 1. Crossing Over - from cinema to ads from ads to cinema 2. Humour - How humour affects us in advertising 3. Shock - The way shock is used to sell', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbXPmZuzn5efRme8NSjrap36Gj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198595'),
  ('398006354483133136', 'The Finest Hour', 1992, 'War, Drama', 'Shimon Dotan, Dov Maoz, Yael Golan', 'Shimon Dotan, Stuart Schoffman', 'Rob Lowe, Gale Hansen, Tracy Griffith, Eb Lottimer, Baruch Dror, Daniel Dieker, Michael Fountain, Evyatar Lazar', null, 'Macho Lawrence ''Larry'' Hammer and frailer Dean Mazzoli initially rival as U.S. Navy SEAL trainees, but become buddies in instructor chief petty officer Bosco''s merciless training class. The friends date two girls, but both love Barbara, who chooses to marry Larry, as ideal father for her pre-teen son. After graduation from Basic UDT/SEAL training, they choose opposite oceans for further training. However Sadam Husein''s invasion of Kuwait gets both mobilized in the same unit, with Bosco, who gets captured and tortured. Dean learns Barbara has left adulterer Larry. They mount a rescue together, taking risks even on their own side.', 'Macho Lawrence ''Larry'' Hammer and frailer Dean Mazzoli initially rival as U.S. Navy SEAL trainees, but become buddies in instructor chief petty officer Bosco''s merciless training class. The friends date two girls, but both love Barbara, who chooses to marry Larry, as ideal father for her pre-teen son. After graduation from Basic UDT/SEAL training, they choose opposite oceans for further training. However Sadam Husein''s invasion of Kuwait gets both mobilized in the same unit, with Bosco, who gets captured and tortured. Dean learns Barbara has left adulterer Larry. They mount a rescue together, taking risks even on their own side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zClDsI2CkwcFcpArA3iiljQH5L0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134390'),
  ('1144453466173176427', 'The Finest Hours', 2016, 'Action, Drama, History, Thriller', 'Craig Gillespie, Javier Aguirresarobe, William Ladd Skinner', 'Paul Tamasy, Scott Silver, Eric Johnson', 'Chris Pine, Casey Affleck, Ben Foster, Eric Bana, Holliday Grainger, John Ortiz, Kyle Gallner, John Magaro', 'PG-13', 'The Coast Guard makes a daring rescue attempt off the coast of Cape Cod after a pair of oil tankers are destroyed during a blizzard in 1952.', 'The Coast Guard makes a daring rescue attempt off the coast of Cape Cod after a pair of oil tankers are destroyed during a blizzard in 1952.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UG91TJ4DKI6FGdqXZfDBeRZHX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300673'),
  ('12420600757777387', 'The Finishers', 2013, 'Drama', 'Laurent Machuel, Nils Tavernier', 'Nils Tavernier, Laurent Bertoni, Pierre Leyssieux', 'Jacques Gamblin, Alexandra Lamy, Fabien Héraud, Sophie de Fürst, Pablo Pauly, Xavier Mathieu, Christelle Cornil, Fred Epaud', null, 'Julien, 17, is wheelchair-bound due to cerebral palsy. Despite their love for him, his family is gradually falling apart under the strain of dealing with his disability. In a bid to bond with his father, Julien challenges him to participate with him in the Ironman race in Nice (French Riviera), a triathlon in which his father has previously competed.', 'Julien, 17, is wheelchair-bound due to cerebral palsy. Despite their love for him, his family is gradually falling apart under the strain of dealing with his disability. In a bid to bond with his father, Julien challenges him to participate with him in the Ironman race in Nice (French Riviera), a triathlon in which his father has previously competed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceImwYVJiVoQ2XevNaYHlavzX0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214087'),
  ('178295010685965457', 'The Finishing Touch', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Clyde Bruckman, Leo McCarey', 'H.M. Walker, Stan Laurel', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Dorothy Coburn, Edgar Kennedy, Sam Lufkin', null, 'Stan and Ollie are hired to build a house in just one day. When they are done, a bird lands on the house and it collapses. Naturally, the owner wants his money back.', 'Stan and Ollie are hired to build a house in just one day. When they are done, a bird lands on the house and it collapses. Naturally, the owner wants his money back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1PWLL0fYzWyGKizHxJ43AQIOns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48816'),
  ('211640260403865502', 'The Finnish Line', 2024, 'TV Movie, Romance, Adventure', 'Dustin Rikert, Tómas Örn Tómasson', 'John Bellina, Nicole Drespel, Talia Gonzalez', 'Kim Matula, Beau Mirchoff, Nichole Sakura, Benedikt Gröndal, Páll Sigþór Pálsson, Hinrik Ólafsson, Arnar Dan Kristjánsson, Hjörtur Jóhann Jónsson', null, 'Anya follows her father''s footsteps in sled dog racing. In Finland, she enters his last race but her lead dog is injured. Teaming with Cole''s dog, she battles her father''s rival Monty while learning to trust her new canine partner to win.', 'Anya follows her father''s footsteps in sled dog racing. In Finland, she enters his last race but her lead dog is injured. Teaming with Cole''s dog, she battles her father''s rival Monty while learning to trust her new canine partner to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lerMQaQX5nnotesTyNggH53ATU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1325917'),
  ('343749052114370576', 'The Fire', 1916, 'Drama', 'Giovanni Pastrone, Segundo de Chomón', 'Giovanni Pastrone', 'Pina Menichelli, Febo Mari, Felice Minotti', null, 'A film based on Gabriele D''Annunzio''s novel The Flame. Pina Menichelli plays a vamp who ruins a painter''s life just for the fun of it.', 'A film based on Gabriele D''Annunzio''s novel The Flame. Pina Menichelli plays a vamp who ruins a painter''s life just for the fun of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsSJUaJFLadDrlMS2CIeu4vZe5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141926'),
  ('276143151019288441', 'The Fire', 2015, 'Drama', 'Juan Schnitman, Soledad Rodríguez', 'Agustina Liendo', 'Pilar Gamboa, Juan Barberini, Marcelo D''Andrea, Luciano Suardi, Martín Tchira, Roberto Cowal, Luis Biassotto, Mariano Sayavedra', null, 'A couple must hold on to $100,000 for 24 hours as they wait to buy a house. As the time ticks by, the true nature of their love unravels.', 'A couple must hold on to $100,000 for 24 hours as they wait to buy a house. As the time ticks by, the true nature of their love unravels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAcsVFz04Kgfzs0WNFnMYcJSdYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316828'),
  ('835690132619916933', 'The Fire Engine That Disappeared', 1993, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Hajo Gies, Achim Poulheim, Jimmy Karlsson', 'Rainer Berg, Beate Langmaack', 'Gösta Ekman, Kjell Bergqvist, Rolf Lassgård, Niklas Hjulström, Daniela Ziegler, Holger Kunkel, Maria Heiskanen, Bernt Ström', null, 'A routine mission ends up in a flaming inferno when a house suddenly explodes. It looks like a spectacular suicide attempt but the technical investigation reveals unexpected evidence. Beck and his men are soon on the tracks of a narcotic syndicate...', 'A routine mission ends up in a flaming inferno when a house suddenly explodes. It looks like a spectacular suicide attempt but the technical investigation reveals unexpected evidence. Beck and his men are soon on the tracks of a narcotic syndicate...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZDggSVoQiTtmKvaNmZCilLAFvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44581'),
  ('225391210767901324', 'The Fire Fighters', 1930, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', null, 'Mickey and others are firemen; they slide down an ostrich''s neck when the alarm sounds. A squealing cat whose tail Mickey pulls acts as the siren. The nearest hydrant isn''t working too well, so Horace Horsecollar takes drinks from a pond and uses that water to put out the fire. Minnie is trapped on an upper floor; Mickey climbs the neighboring building fire escape and uses a clothesline to cross to Minnie''s building.', 'Mickey and others are firemen; they slide down an ostrich''s neck when the alarm sounds. A squealing cat whose tail Mickey pulls acts as the siren. The nearest hydrant isn''t working too well, so Horace Horsecollar takes drinks from a pond and uses that water to put out the fire. Minnie is trapped on an upper floor; Mickey climbs the neighboring building fire escape and uses a clothesline to cross to Minnie''s building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAVh6yei36Km97H8uHFhOEuuPoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162794'),
  ('1045274222489215705', 'The Fire Inside', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Trevor Smale, David Lewington, Rina Yang', 'Barry Jenkins', 'Ryan Destiny, Brian Tyree Henry, Oluniké Adeliyi, Kylee D. Allen, Emmanuel Igboke, Lanette Ware, Amanda Barker, De''Adre Aziza', 'PG-13', 'Claressa Shields, a high school junior from Flint, Michigan, aided by her tough-love coach, Jason Crutchfield, pushes past all limitations to become the first American woman to win an Olympic gold medal in boxing. But even at the pinnacle of success, Claressa has to reckon with the fact that not all dreams are created equal, and the real fight has only just begun.', 'Claressa Shields, a high school junior from Flint, Michigan, aided by her tough-love coach, Jason Crutchfield, pushes past all limitations to become the first American woman to win an Olympic gold medal in boxing. But even at the pinnacle of success, Claressa has to reckon with the fact that not all dreams are created equal, and the real fight has only just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMorkoCdZJ1xmKv0VAXcpUax6Ar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610219'),
  ('604383574351538050', 'The Fire That Burns', 1997, 'Drama', 'Christophe Malavoy, Bernard Lutic', 'Didier Decoin', 'Christophe Malavoy, Michel Aumont, Naël Marandin, Clément Van Den Bergh, Pierre-Arnaud Juin, Pierre-Alexis Hollenbeck, Michel Dussauze, Luc Levy', null, 'Two boys in their early teens in a strictly-run pre-WWII Catholic School form a firm friendship which is troubled by an abbot who is obsessed with the younger of the students.', 'Two boys in their early teens in a strictly-run pre-WWII Catholic School form a firm friendship which is troubled by an abbot who is obsessed with the younger of the students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioNfR1XwRhF30d1mcDQv7PEtWGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83963'),
  ('159769623105479941', 'The Fire Within', 1963, 'Drama', 'Ghislain Cloquet, Louis Malle, Volker Schlöndorff', 'Louis Malle', 'Maurice Ronet, Léna Skerla, Yvonne Clech, Hubert Deschamps, Jean-Paul Moulinot, Mona Dol, Pierre Moncorbier, René Dupuy', null, 'Depressed Alain Leroy leaves the clinic where he was detoxified. He meets friends, acquaintances and women, trying to find a reason to continue living.', 'Depressed Alain Leroy leaves the clinic where he was detoxified. He meets friends, acquaintances and women, trying to find a reason to continue living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iHsReoh2VuHihDmNXgLXCi18rR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2593'),
  ('453065844739399317', 'The Fire Within: A Requiem for Katia and Maurice Krafft', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Henning Brümmer', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Maurice Krafft, Katia Krafft', null, 'Filmmaker Werner Herzog combs through the film archives of volcanologists Katia and Maurice Krafft to create a film that celebrates their legacy.', 'Filmmaker Werner Herzog combs through the film archives of volcanologists Katia and Maurice Krafft to create a film that celebrates their legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1LgOPrUq40dvCVo5oWX0XNqoQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977341'),
  ('888524447025147496', 'The Fireball', 1950, 'Drama', 'Tay Garnett, Lester White, Charles Kerr', 'Horace McCoy, Tay Garnett', 'Mickey Rooney, Pat O''Brien, Beverly Tyler, James Brown, Ralph Dumke, Milburn Stone, Bert Begley, Marilyn Monroe', 'NR', 'Johnny Casar runs away from the orphanage to start a successful career as a roller skater and after setbacks learns to curb his ruthlessness and ambition.', 'Johnny Casar runs away from the orphanage to start a successful career as a roller skater and after setbacks learns to curb his ruthlessness and ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gY60TMCk7XLfFxGIEzvfI0XoWI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59821'),
