  ('110786013100737696', 'The Fireflies Are Gone', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sébastien Pilote, Michel La Veaux', 'Sébastien Pilote', 'Karelle Tremblay, Pierre-Luc Brillant, François Papineau, Luc Picard, Marie-France Marcotte, Marie Jasmina, Michel Laperrière, Manon Lussier', null, 'The sleepy town where Léo lives doesn’t offer her much chance of self-fulfilment. Extricating herself from her mother’s influence and her constricting environment isn’t easy for the frustrated young woman, yet happiness might be close at hand. A stylistically precise, pop-impressionistic film about a girl’s quest to find out who she really is, featuring the captivating Karelle Tremblay in the lead role.', 'The sleepy town where Léo lives doesn’t offer her much chance of self-fulfilment. Extricating herself from her mother’s influence and her constricting environment isn’t easy for the frustrated young woman, yet happiness might be close at hand. A stylistically precise, pop-impressionistic film about a girl’s quest to find out who she really is, featuring the captivating Karelle Tremblay in the lead role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOyBlxJAKNaibsESGeVzXtmlgqn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534062'),
  ('694989860960931742', 'The Firefly', 2013, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Ana Maria Hermida, Alonso Homs', 'Ana Maria Hermida', 'Carolina Guerra, Olga Segura-Gall, Manuel José Chaves, María Helena Doehring, Pedro Falla, Luis Fernando Orozco, Andrés Aramburo', null, 'After her estranged brother''s sudden death, young wife Lucia bonds with his fiancée through their shared grief and finds herself falling in love.', 'After her estranged brother''s sudden death, young wife Lucia bonds with his fiancée through their shared grief and finds herself falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaqFiSCXH7tebF0SekdKX6RY9Tj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434552'),
  ('924342767989371006', 'The Fireman', 1916, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Vincent Bryan, Maverick Terrell, Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Lloyd Bacon, Eric Campbell, Leo White, Charlotte Mineau, Albert Austin, Frank J. Coleman', null, 'Firefighter Charlie Chaplin is tricked into letting a house burn by an owner who wants to collect on the insurance.', 'Firefighter Charlie Chaplin is tricked into letting a house burn by an owner who wants to collect on the insurance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcLltY8vvd0Yi5g1njNC0C4cGdw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53417'),
  ('1152319260915550160', 'The Fireman of the Folies-Bergere', 1928, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Josephine Baker', null, 'After a lengthy period of watching the dancers at the Folies Bergères, a fireman stops in for a drink. As he becomes intoxicated, his thoughts return to the dancers, and he begins to see images of nude dancers all around him. Whether he goes into the subway, rides on a streetcar, or returns to the fire station, he continues to see the same imaginary sights.', 'After a lengthy period of watching the dancers at the Folies Bergères, a fireman stops in for a drink. As he becomes intoxicated, his thoughts return to the dancers, and he begins to see images of nude dancers all around him. Whether he goes into the subway, rides on a streetcar, or returns to the fire station, he continues to see the same imaginary sights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFFoB2C7mLidAJodrMoIvuy1i0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166514'),
  ('600938177624817211', 'The Firemen of Viggiù', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Leo Catozzo, Aldo Tonti', 'Steno, Marcello Marchesi', 'Nino Taranto, Totò, Vanda Osiris, Carlo Dapporto, Harry Feist, Isa Barzizza, Mario Castellani, Ricky Denver', null, 'In the village of Viggiù, the firemen organize various skits and performances in their theater, inviting all the celebrities known at that time.', 'In the village of Viggiù, the firemen organize various skits and performances in their theater, inviting all the celebrities known at that time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSkjOpi7MC3FXWJFKzoGH9Vzc2p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75551'),
  ('269310295423258418', 'The Firemen''s Ball', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Miloš Forman, Jaroslav Papoušek, Miroslav Ondříček', 'Miloš Forman, Ivan Passer, Jaroslav Papoušek', 'Jan Vostrčil, Josef Šebánek, František Debelka, Josef Valnoha, Ladislav Adam, Vratislav Čermák, Václav Novotný, František Paska', null, 'The firemen of a provincial Czechoslovakian town throw a ball in honor of the old chief''s retirement. There will be music and dancing, a beauty pageant and a raffle. The whole town will be in attendance. However, the proceedings are dogged by difficulty at every step. Workplace injuries, stolen prizes, a shortage of pretty girls... and fire.', 'The firemen of a provincial Czechoslovakian town throw a ball in honor of the old chief''s retirement. There will be music and dancing, a beauty pageant and a raffle. The whole town will be in attendance. However, the proceedings are dogged by difficulty at every step. Workplace injuries, stolen prizes, a shortage of pretty girls... and fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yylEjPttmTDar0o92StlrO5ghmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38442'),
  ('686513578223636399', 'The Firing Line', 1988, 'Action', 'Jun Gallardo, Carl Sommers', 'Sonny Sanders', 'Reb Brown, Shannon Tweed, Kahlena Marie, Mel Davidson, Carl Terry, Tony Carreon, Jerry Beyer, Andy Jacobson', null, 'An American military advisor becomes disillusioned by the brutality and corruption of the Central American government which hired him. When his shift in sympathies becomes known, he''s arrested and tortured but soon escapes, along with a beautiful American woman, in order to join the rebels.', 'An American military advisor becomes disillusioned by the brutality and corruption of the Central American government which hired him. When his shift in sympathies becomes known, he''s arrested and tortured but soon escapes, along with a beautiful American woman, in order to join the rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5tqn4mA6qzVpFY5J7CJN3pwzRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71101'),
  ('248473612573564411', 'The Firm', 1989, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alan Clarke, Ben Philpott, Richard Philpott', 'Al Hunter Ashton', 'Gary Oldman, Lesley Manville, Phil Davis, Andrew Wilde, William Vanderpuye, Charles Lawson, Jay Simpson, Patrick Murray', null, 'A seemingly respectable estate agent leads a double life as the head of a vicious, well-organised gang of football hooligans.', 'A seemingly respectable estate agent leads a double life as the head of a vicious, well-organised gang of football hooligans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nmD4YYgnfgdbidq0wwKJ151poM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17300'),
  ('1090570363651086830', 'The Firm', 1993, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sydney Pollack, David McGiffert, Carla Corwin', 'Robert Towne, David Rabe, David Rayfiel', 'Tom Cruise, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Gene Hackman, Hal Holbrook, Terry Kinney, Wilford Brimley, Ed Harris, Holly Hunter', 'R', 'Mitch McDeere is a young man with a promising future in Law. About to sit his Bar exam, he is approached by ''The Firm'' and made an offer he doesn''t refuse. Seduced by the money and gifts showered on him, he is totally oblivious to the more sinister side of his company. Then, two Associates are murdered. The FBI contact him, asking him for information and suddenly his life is ruined. He has a choice - work with the FBI, or stay with the Firm. Either way he will lose his life as he knows it. Mitch figures the only way out is to follow his own plan...', 'Mitch McDeere is a young man with a promising future in Law. About to sit his Bar exam, he is approached by ''The Firm'' and made an offer he doesn''t refuse. Seduced by the money and gifts showered on him, he is totally oblivious to the more sinister side of his company. Then, two Associates are murdered. The FBI contact him, asking him for information and suddenly his life is ruined. He has a choice - work with the FBI, or stay with the Firm. Either way he will lose his life as he knows it. Mitch figures the only way out is to follow his own plan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFexXCzidkm4LwlgZqxsJsDQB5v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37233'),
  ('544364007681932129', 'The Firm', 2009, 'Drama', 'Nick Love, Matt Gray', 'Al Hunter Ashton', 'Paul Anderson, Calum MacNab, Daniel Mays, Doug Allen, Joe Jackson, Richie Campbell, Jaf Ibrahim, Eddie Webber', 'NR', 'Set in the 1980s, Dom is a teenager who finds himself drawn into the charismatic world of football ''casuals,influenced by the firm''s top boy, Bex. Accepted by the gang for his fast mouth and sense of humor, Dom soon becomes one the boys. But as Bex and his gang clash with rival firms across the country and the violence spirals out of control, Dom realizes he wants out - until he learns it''s not that easy to simply walk away.', 'Set in the 1980s, Dom is a teenager who finds himself drawn into the charismatic world of football ''casuals,influenced by the firm''s top boy, Bex. Accepted by the gang for his fast mouth and sense of humor, Dom soon becomes one the boys. But as Bex and his gang clash with rival firms across the country and the violence spirals out of control, Dom realizes he wants out - until he learns it''s not that easy to simply walk away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fuJJrud26pZ5zoNvkTbV4DOgpQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31218'),
  ('766359889656532188', 'The First $20 Million Is Always the Hardest', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Mick Jackson, Ronald Víctor García', 'Jon Favreau, Gary Tieche', 'Adam Garcia, Rosario Dawson, Jake Busey, Enrico Colantoni, Ethan Suplee, Anjul Nigam, Gregory Jbara, Dan Butler', 'PG-13', 'Andy, a successful marketing guy quits his job, gets a new job at a research facility, makes a powerful enemy who makes him volunteer for a nearly impossible project: The $99 PC. The only available guys at the lab, three sociopaths, together they compile a revolutionary PC for $99, then they become the victims of a venture capitalist and Andy''s old foe, can he find a way to overcome the problems?', 'Andy, a successful marketing guy quits his job, gets a new job at a research facility, makes a powerful enemy who makes him volunteer for a nearly impossible project: The $99 PC. The only available guys at the lab, three sociopaths, together they compile a revolutionary PC for $99, then they become the victims of a venture capitalist and Andy''s old foe, can he find a way to overcome the problems?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPW9AdDakbPKSPv0emzw64Jence.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23855'),
  ('111986999773953309', 'The First 9½ Weeks', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alex Wright, John P. Tarver', 'Alex Wright', 'Paul Mercurio, Clara Bellar, Malcolm McDowell, Frederic Forrest, Veena Bidasha, Neena Bidasha, Victoria Mahoney', 'R', 'An investment banker travels to Louisiana to snag the account of an eccentric millionaire but gets involved with his lusty wife, Mardi Gras, and (possibly) a satanic cult. The events in and around New Orleans change him forever and give a new slant on The American Dream.', 'An investment banker travels to Louisiana to snag the account of an eccentric millionaire but gets involved with his lusty wife, Mardi Gras, and (possibly) a satanic cult. The events in and around New Orleans change him forever and give a new slant on The American Dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ALHtJK5YbwfWIm3WBIZh45Nxh9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74023'),
  ('966229678343714609', 'The First After God', 2005, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Vasily Chiginsky, Archil Akhvlediani, Igor Terekhov', 'Ilya Avramenko, Igor Evsukov', 'Mikheil Gomiashvili, Dmitriy Orlov, Elizaveta Boyarskaya, Vladimir Gostyukhin, Irina Björklund, Sergey Gorobchenko, Yuri Stepanov, Viktor Sukhorukov', null, 'The film is based on the true story of Captain Marinesku and set in 1944 during WWII at the Russian Navy Base. Young and beautiful Tanka is in love with Aleksandr Marinin, the brave Captain of the Russian submarine. He is under the KGB surveillance, and his life is at risk. He takes his boat to fight the Nazi fleet, and he cannot come back home without a victory.', 'The film is based on the true story of Captain Marinesku and set in 1944 during WWII at the Russian Navy Base. Young and beautiful Tanka is in love with Aleksandr Marinin, the brave Captain of the Russian submarine. He is under the KGB surveillance, and his life is at risk. He takes his boat to fight the Nazi fleet, and he cannot come back home without a victory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWtvU9Z1HUyKNSiW1OBv5VKUdwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54698'),
  ('598374247818557278', 'The First Bad Man', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Western', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Tex Ritter, Tex Avery, June Foray', 'NR', 'The first Texas bad man come running into town a million years B.C.', 'The first Texas bad man come running into town a million years B.C.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLzqFOt8u8kXem7QI085BeLePsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87206'),
  ('967612973359443151', 'The First Beautiful Thing', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paolo Virzì, Elisabetta Boni, Dario Ceruti', 'Francesco Bruni, Francesco Piccolo, Paolo Virzì', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Micaela Ramazzotti, Stefania Sandrelli, Claudia Pandolfi, Marco Messeri, Fabrizia Sacchi, Aurora Frasca, Giacomo Bibbiani', null, 'The film tells the story of the Michelucci family, from the nineteen-seventies to the present day: the central character is the stunningly beautiful Anna, the lively, frivolous and sometimes embarrassing mother of Bruno and Valeria. Everything begins in the Summer of 1971, at the annual Summer beauty pageant held at Livorno’s most popular bathing establishment. Anna is unexpectedly crowned “Most Beautiful Mother”, unwittingly stirring the violent jealousy of her husband. From then on, chaos strikes the family and for Anna, Bruno and his sister Valeria, it is the start of an adventure that will only end thirty years later.', 'The film tells the story of the Michelucci family, from the nineteen-seventies to the present day: the central character is the stunningly beautiful Anna, the lively, frivolous and sometimes embarrassing mother of Bruno and Valeria. Everything begins in the Summer of 1971, at the annual Summer beauty pageant held at Livorno’s most popular bathing establishment. Anna is unexpectedly crowned “Most Beautiful Mother”, unwittingly stirring the violent jealousy of her husband. From then on, chaos strikes the family and for Anna, Bruno and his sister Valeria, it is the start of an adventure that will only end thirty years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7h4BbIGigxaECJFQWEaQ9ih3INp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36940'),
  ('742473174319667472', 'The First Charge of the Machete', 1969, 'Drama', 'Manuel Octavio Gómez, Jorge Herrero', 'Alfredo L. Del Cueto, Manuel Octavio Gómez, Julio García Espinosa', 'Idalia Anreus, Adolfo Llauradó, Eslinda Núñez, Raúl Pomares, José Rodríguez, Pablito Milanés', null, 'Cuban peasants wield machetes in a violent uprising against Spanish authorities in the late 19th century.', 'Cuban peasants wield machetes in a violent uprising against Spanish authorities in the late 19th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcAognU6k4fXRKTooZ2B0OtuVqK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264972'),
  ('54451285202485087', 'The First Christmas: The Story of the First Christmas Snow', 1975, 'Animation', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Jules Bass', 'Angela Lansbury, Cyril Ritchard, David Kelley, Dina Lynn, Iris Rainer, Joan Gardner, Don Messick, Greg Thomas', null, 'A young shepherd, Lucas, is blinded by lightening, and some kindly nuns at a nearby abbey take him in. Sister Catherine describes snow to Lucas, who has never seen it. Lucas gets chosen to play an angel in the abbey''s Christmas pageant, and the Christmas snow that falls during the pageant works a small miracle.', 'A young shepherd, Lucas, is blinded by lightening, and some kindly nuns at a nearby abbey take him in. Sister Catherine describes snow to Lucas, who has never seen it. Lucas gets chosen to play an angel in the abbey''s Christmas pageant, and the Christmas snow that falls during the pageant works a small miracle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80EHZIxm0ljhL7DZB2Q2HTEYJFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80529'),
  ('827661562164274382', 'The First Day of My Life', 2023, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Barbara Giordani, Paolo Genovese, Fabrizio Lucci', 'Paolo Genovese, Paolo Costella, Rolando Ravello', 'Toni Servillo, Margherita Buy, Valerio Mastandrea, Sara Serraiocco, Gabriele Cristini, Vittoria Puccini, Lino Guanciale, Giorgio Tirabassi', null, 'In the exact moment they hit rock bottom, four strangers are visited by a mysterious man who gifts them a week to see how the world would be without them.', 'In the exact moment they hit rock bottom, four strangers are visited by a mysterious man who gifts them a week to see how the world would be without them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AY8sq3hy9ezjY1t7GekJGZXbN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:700819'),
  ('884467057818817024', 'The First Day of the Rest of Your Life', 2008, 'Drama', 'Rémi Bezançon, Antoine Monod, Antoine Kin', 'Rémi Bezançon', 'Jacques Gamblin, Zabou Breitman, Déborah François, Marc-André Grondin, Pio Marmaï, Roger Dumas, Cécile Cassel, Stanley Weber', null, 'A sprawling drama centered on five key days in a family''s life.', 'A sprawling drama centered on five key days in a family''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsB93OKgO3HjsYfYuKoDbHy7FCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12169'),
  ('244840395231428555', 'The First Deadly Sin', 1980, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Brian G. Hutton, Jack Priestley', 'Mann Rubin', 'Frank Sinatra, Faye Dunaway, David Dukes, George Coe, Brenda Vaccaro, Martin Gabel, James Whitmore, Anthony Zerbe', 'R', 'A serial killer is stalking New York. Inspector Edward X. Delaney is an NYPD detective, nearing retirement, who is trying to put together the pieces of the case. Are the victims somehow linked? What does the brutal method of death signify?', 'A serial killer is stalking New York. Inspector Edward X. Delaney is an NYPD detective, nearing retirement, who is trying to put together the pieces of the case. Are the victims somehow linked? What does the brutal method of death signify?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAP2EaHPLTaSuLtyYuDJ8DE4sr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28614'),
  ('509598530575926276', 'The First Easter Rabbit', 1976, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Arthur Rankin, Jr., Jules Bass, Ikko Kobayashi', 'Jules Bass', 'Burl Ives, Robert Morse, Stan Freberg, Paul Frees, Don Messick, Joan Gardner, Dina Lynn, Christine Winter', 'G', 'A beloved toy stuffed rabbit is rescued by a fairy to be the first Easter Rabbit.', 'A beloved toy stuffed rabbit is rescued by a fairy to be the first Easter Rabbit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNJGnRjeohjLrp4yBBolx8YwA1h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62183'),
  ('340327856607447229', 'The First Echelon', 1955, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Mikhail Kalatozov, Sergei Urusevsky, Yuri Yekelchik', 'Nikolay Pogodin', 'Vsevolod Sanayev, Sergei Romodanov, Nikolai Annenkov, Oleg Efremov, Izolda Izvitskaya, Eduard Bredun, Aleksey Kozhevnikov, Nina Doroshina', null, 'In one of the steppe regions of Kazakhstan arrives on Komsomol youth squad. Severe frosts, spring mud flows, exhausting work than their specialty - the development of virgin land does not come easy. But the young are young - they work, enjoy life, fall in love. In the center of the story - the touching romance secretary of the Komsomol organization and tractor driver Anne.', 'In one of the steppe regions of Kazakhstan arrives on Komsomol youth squad. Severe frosts, spring mud flows, exhausting work than their specialty - the development of virgin land does not come easy. But the young are young - they work, enjoy life, fall in love. In the center of the story - the touching romance secretary of the Komsomol organization and tractor driver Anne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2NtO7jBsTYcrlUXjZwLOhXk9Rz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92825'),
  ('20273394937358871', 'The First Forgotten', 2019, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Christophe Lamotte', 'Johanne Rigoulot, Cyril Massarotto, Nagar Djavadi', 'Muriel Robin, M. Pokora, Francis Renaud, Camille Aguilar, Grégoire Champion, Flore Bonaventura, Yoli Fuller, Michel Vivier', null, 'For years, Axel has cut off ties with his family, devastated by a tragedy for which he was made to bear responsibility. When the freighter on which he was cook stopped in his hometown, he decided to visit his mother, Françoise. It''s a shock: she no longer recognizes him. Having Alzheimer''s disease, Françoise now forgets whole sections of her life. Axel is the first of the siblings to disappear from his memory. Why him? What is he hiding behind this oversight? And while Ivan and Lucie have agreed to have her admitted in the center, Axel opposes it frontally and delays her departure to take care of her, despite the tensions. Between the mother and the son opens the face-to-face so long feared and yet necessary.', 'For years, Axel has cut off ties with his family, devastated by a tragedy for which he was made to bear responsibility. When the freighter on which he was cook stopped in his hometown, he decided to visit his mother, Françoise. It''s a shock: she no longer recognizes him. Having Alzheimer''s disease, Françoise now forgets whole sections of her life. Axel is the first of the siblings to disappear from his memory. Why him? What is he hiding behind this oversight? And while Ivan and Lucie have agreed to have her admitted in the center, Axel opposes it frontally and delays her departure to take care of her, despite the tensions. Between the mother and the son opens the face-to-face so long feared and yet necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZzHjSA1vhI37tYE5VemxbsHz9M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631737'),
  ('979739362091294078', 'The First Grader', 2010, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Justin Chadwick, David ''Tosh'' Gitonga, Rob Hardy', 'Ann Peacock', 'Naomie Harris, Tony Kgoroge, Nick Reding, Oliver Litondo, Alfred Munyua, Kamau Mbaya', 'PG-13', 'The true story of an 84 year-old Kenyan villager and ex Mau Mau freedom fighter who fights for his right to go to school for the first time to get the education he could never afford.', 'The true story of an 84 year-old Kenyan villager and ex Mau Mau freedom fighter who fights for his right to go to school for the first time to get the education he could never afford.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jstfYxEYMFfSO6tQaYL6O0AMUol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47559'),
  ('62398555512958820', 'The First Great Train Robbery', 1978, 'Thriller, Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Geoffrey Unsworth, Michael Crichton, Dick Ziker', 'Michael Crichton', 'Sean Connery, Donald Sutherland, Lesley-Anne Down, Susan Hallinan, Alan Webb, Malcolm Terris, Robert Lang, Wayne Sleep', 'PG', 'In Victorian England, a master criminal makes elaborate plans to steal a shipment of gold from a moving train.', 'In Victorian England, a master criminal makes elaborate plans to steal a shipment of gold from a moving train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LqLUNoCwoPQNmrRuDZa0zC3hT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11583'),
  ('167694359764320818', 'The First King', 2019, 'History, Drama', 'Francesco Capone, Lyda Patitucci, Matteo Rovere', 'Matteo Rovere, Francesca Manieri, Filippo Gravino', 'Alessandro Borghi, Alessio Lapice, Fabrizio Rongione, Massimiliano Rossi, Tania Garribba, Lorenzo Gleijeses, Vincenzo Crea, Max Malatesta', null, 'Romulus and Remus, two shepherds and loyal brothers, end up taking part to a journey that will lead one of them to be the founder of the greatest nation ever seen. However, the fate of the chosen one will pass from killing his own brother.', 'Romulus and Remus, two shepherds and loyal brothers, end up taking part to a journey that will lead one of them to be the founder of the greatest nation ever seen. However, the fate of the chosen one will pass from killing his own brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqBU63M3cKy7pfVsmhrbgY5X8iv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565179'),
  ('628403271652493330', 'The First Lad', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sergei Parajanov, Sergey Revenko', 'Viktor Bezorudko, Pyotr Lubenskiy', 'Lyudmyla Sosyura, Yuri Satarov, Grigori Karpov, Varvara Chaika, Boris Matveyev, Mykola Yakovchenko, Mykola Shutko', null, 'A gem from Paradjanov''s early oeuvre is a musical agitation film or a romantic comedy, made by the young director under the guidance of Alexander Dovzhenko and set in the immense fields of the collectivised Ukraine. The social realism is replaced by colourful, convivial and dancing shots of the “Pabieda” (Victory) kolkhoz, where peasant women sing in the fields, and boys march with banners glorifying revolution. Against this backdrop, intense romantic feelings have reached a climactic stage; tailor Sidor Sidorovich, farmer Jushka and soldier Danila Petrovich all dote on the fair-haired Odarka. It is Jushka and Danila who engage in overt hostility; the initial “gentlemen’s” contest turns into an outright confrontation, resulting in miserable Jushka being increasingly more desperate and scorned by the villagers.', 'A gem from Paradjanov''s early oeuvre is a musical agitation film or a romantic comedy, made by the young director under the guidance of Alexander Dovzhenko and set in the immense fields of the collectivised Ukraine. The social realism is replaced by colourful, convivial and dancing shots of the “Pabieda” (Victory) kolkhoz, where peasant women sing in the fields, and boys march with banners glorifying revolution. Against this backdrop, intense romantic feelings have reached a climactic stage; tailor Sidor Sidorovich, farmer Jushka and soldier Danila Petrovich all dote on the fair-haired Odarka. It is Jushka and Danila who engage in overt hostility; the initial “gentlemen’s” contest turns into an outright confrontation, resulting in miserable Jushka being increasingly more desperate and scorned by the villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4WW9V0T5r80LQnMhVORd3yEi5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131458'),
  ('840377249472409744', 'The First Lap', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kim Dae-hwan', 'Jang Woo-jin, Kim Dae-hwan', 'Kim Sae-byuk, Cho Hyun-chul, Jo Kyung-sook, Ki Joo-bong, Jeong Do-won, Moon Chang-gil, Kil Hae-yeon, Woo Yong-hee', null, 'Between reproaches over past problems that were never resolved and the uncertainty of a future that is relentlessly coming closer, a young couple takes a trip that will leave them at the beginning of a new life.', 'Between reproaches over past problems that were never resolved and the uncertainty of a future that is relentlessly coming closer, a young couple takes a trip that will leave them at the beginning of a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2Q8YwYxsX8SJ88dTBDLWVpBEkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466872'),
  ('750991750688871272', 'The First Man', 2011, 'Drama', 'Gianni Amelio, Yves Cape', 'Gianni Amelio', 'Jacques Gamblin, Maya Sansa, Catherine Sola, Denis Podalydès, Ulla Baugué, Nicolas Giraud, Nino Jouglet, Abdelkarim Benhabouccha', null, 'Based on a novel that Albert Camus was working on when he died, we follow Jacques Comery as he travels back to Algeria in 1957, a place full of childhood memories. The country is split between those wanting to remain a part of France, and those demanding independence. Reminiscences of his mother, his stern grandmother and a young Arab boy come flooding back.', 'Based on a novel that Albert Camus was working on when he died, we follow Jacques Comery as he travels back to Algeria in 1957, a place full of childhood memories. The country is split between those wanting to remain a part of France, and those demanding independence. Reminiscences of his mother, his stern grandmother and a young Arab boy come flooding back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGpGNedBVCXI3TCf2REoIeEOLj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85547'),
  ('660688660775640283', 'The First Night', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Alejandro Gamboa', 'Benjamín Cann', 'Mariana Ávila, Amara Villafuerte, Marta Aura, Xavier Massimi, Margarita Magaña, Guillermo Iván, Julio Casado, Patricio Castillo', null, 'In the middle of a city facing a new century, a group of friends between the ages of 15 and 18 live out the adventures, deceptions and anxiety of "The First Night."', 'In the middle of a city facing a new century, a group of friends between the ages of 15 and 18 live out the adventures, deceptions and anxiety of "The First Night."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyFmzik6AxthKYfNGGACfNZuI5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91763'),
  ('986704457444007202', 'The First Nudie Musical', 1976, 'Music, Comedy', 'Bruce Kimmel, Mark Haggard, Douglas Knapp', 'Bruce Kimmel', 'Stephen Nathan, Cindy Williams, Bruce Kimmel, Leslie Ackerman, Alan Abelew, Diana Canova, Alexandra Morgan, Frank Doubleday', 'R', 'The heir to a bankrupt studio decides to make a daring musical to avoid demolition, agreeing to finish it in two weeks or lose ownership.', 'The heir to a bankrupt studio decides to make a daring musical to avoid demolition, agreeing to finish it in two weeks or lose ownership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27g9TaYrFFZSylbkTPYg28FJeb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42244'),
  ('1094366241711773379', 'The First of the Few', 1942, 'War, Drama', 'Leslie Howard, Georges Périnal, George Pollock', 'Anatole de Grunwald, Miles Malleson', 'Leslie Howard, David Niven, Rosamund John, Roland Culver, Anne Firth, David Horne, J.H. Roberts, Derrick De Marney', 'G', 'This 1942 fictionalized biopic chronicles the true story of how two of the most remarkable men in aviation history - visionary Spitfire designer R.J. Mitchell and his test pilot Geoffrey Crisp - designed a streamlined monoplane that led to the development of the Spitfire.', 'This 1942 fictionalized biopic chronicles the true story of how two of the most remarkable men in aviation history - visionary Spitfire designer R.J. Mitchell and his test pilot Geoffrey Crisp - designed a streamlined monoplane that led to the development of the Spitfire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rp7tjjcANAcUknUDYw1DGu4YyD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16444'),
  ('852180213164038459', 'The First Omen', 2024, 'Horror', 'Arkasha Stevenson, Aaron Morton, Sabina Angeloni', 'Arkasha Stevenson, Tim Smith, Keith Thomas', 'Nell Tiger Free, Ralph Ineson, Sonia Braga, Tawfeek Barhom, María Caballero, Charles Dance, Bill Nighy, Nicole Sorace', 'R', 'When a young American woman is sent to Rome to begin a life of service to the church, she encounters a darkness that causes her to question her own faith and uncovers a terrifying conspiracy that hopes to bring about the birth of evil incarnate.', 'When a young American woman is sent to Rome to begin a life of service to the church, she encounters a darkness that causes her to question her own faith and uncovers a terrifying conspiracy that hopes to bring about the birth of evil incarnate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnsDyNNkOxYUyjD8CNJoAla6YvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437342'),
  ('59392901389575018', 'The First on the List', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roan Johnson, Tommaso Borgstrom', 'Roan Johnson, Davide Lantieri', 'Claudio Santamaria, Francesco Turbanti, Fabrizio Brandi, Paolo Cioni, Sergio Pierattini, Daniela Morozzi', null, 'It’s June 1st, 1970, and Pisa is the epicenter of the movement Lotta Continua. There are rumors of an imminent coup d’état, and the most visible exponents fear being arrested before dawn. One of them is Pino Masi, a singer-songwriter who wrote the hit “La ballata del Pinelli.” He invites two high school students, Renzo Lulli and Fabio Gismondi, to flee Italy with him, and the three set off. A series of misunderstandings ensues, starting with an unnerving encounter with soldiers on their way to Rome for the national holiday the next day.', 'It’s June 1st, 1970, and Pisa is the epicenter of the movement Lotta Continua. There are rumors of an imminent coup d’état, and the most visible exponents fear being arrested before dawn. One of them is Pino Masi, a singer-songwriter who wrote the hit “La ballata del Pinelli.” He invites two high school students, Renzo Lulli and Fabio Gismondi, to flee Italy with him, and the three set off. A series of misunderstandings ensues, starting with an unnerving encounter with soldiers on their way to Rome for the national holiday the next day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNiklDxGIULTSPBWhDwuSS4yFSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78855'),
  ('546583602239908080', 'The First Power', 1990, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Robert Resnikoff, Theo van de Sande', 'Robert Resnikoff', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, Tracy Griffith, Jeff Kober, Mykelti Williamson, Dennis Lipscomb, Carmen Argenziano, Clayton Landey, David Gale', 'R', 'A dedicated L.A. police detective and a female psychic must stop a demonic serial killer who was given the powers of resurrection, teleportation and possession.', 'A dedicated L.A. police detective and a female psychic must stop a demonic serial killer who was given the powers of resurrection, teleportation and possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0uOKtHiMOPPVHlEXW622Rr2VsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41374'),
  ('540881900680599067', 'The First Purge', 2018, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Brigitte Altenhaus, Cyndi Martin, Cory Johnson', 'James DeMonaco', 'Y''lan Noel, Lex Scott Davis, Joivan Wade, Steve Harris, Mugga, Patch Darragh, Marisa Tomei, Luna Lauren Vélez', 'R', 'To push the crime rate below one percent for the rest of the year, the New Founding Fathers of America test a sociological theory that vents aggression for one night in one isolated community. But when the violence of oppressors meets the rage of the others, the contagion will explode from the trial-city borders and spread across the nation.', 'To push the crime rate below one percent for the rest of the year, the New Founding Fathers of America test a sociological theory that vents aggression for one night in one isolated community. But when the violence of oppressors meets the rage of the others, the contagion will explode from the trial-city borders and spread across the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/litjsBoiydO6JlO70uOX4N3WnNL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442249'),
  ('678753360892405218', 'The First Ride', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure', 'Nam Dae-joong, Nam Dong-geun', 'Nam Dae-joong', 'Kang Ha-neul, Kim Young-kwang, Cha Eun-woo, Kang Young-suk, Han Seon-hwa, Kim Kang-hyun, Choi Gwi-hwa', null, 'Four lifelong friends—Tae-jeong, Do-jin, Yeon-min, and Geum-bok—dreamed of an epic trip abroad, but life got in the way. Years later, older but not necessarily wiser, they finally embark on their long-overdue journey. Planned as a carefree getaway, however, the trip derails into a whirlwind of unexpected chaos, hilariously absurd detours, and buried emotions resurfacing. As they stumble through misadventures, their first ride together turns into a spectacular journey—one for the ages.', 'Four lifelong friends—Tae-jeong, Do-jin, Yeon-min, and Geum-bok—dreamed of an epic trip abroad, but life got in the way. Years later, older but not necessarily wiser, they finally embark on their long-overdue journey. Planned as a carefree getaway, however, the trip derails into a whirlwind of unexpected chaos, hilariously absurd detours, and buried emotions resurfacing. As they stumble through misadventures, their first ride together turns into a spectacular journey—one for the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmjot8Wc2lKQaZFhUKbfUyy7rDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290183'),
  ('945568551179242655', 'The First Seven Years', 1930, 'Comedy', 'Robert F. McGowan, Art Lloyd', null, 'Norman Chaney, Jackie Cooper, Allen ''Farina'' Hoskins, Bobby ''Wheezer'' Hutchins, Mary Ann Jackson, Pete the Dog, Otto Fries, Donald Haines', null, 'Jackie gets in a duel over the affections of Mary Ann.', 'Jackie gets in a duel over the affections of Mary Ann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nG5RBIDatk2jXz6sArBqd3Fq1w7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166581'),
  ('268864563822109578', 'The First Snow of Fraggle Rock', 2025, 'Family, Comedy, Music', 'Jonathan A. Rosenbaum, Gavin Smith, Johanna Posthuma', 'Matt Fusfeld, Alex Cuthbertson', 'John Tartaglia, Karen Prell, Donna Kimball, Jordan Lockhart, Dave Goelz, Frank Meschkuleit, Lilli Cooper, Lele Pons', 'G', 'When the holidays are filled with unexpected adventures and challenges, the Fraggles learn to appreciate each day for being unique and special, like a snowflake.', 'When the holidays are filled with unexpected adventures and challenges, the Fraggles learn to appreciate each day for being unique and special, like a snowflake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyxAOTToALUkeFS9x5V6MOv8YWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1566269'),
  ('433464253793139278', 'The First Snow of Winter', 1998, 'Animation, Family', 'Graham Ralph', 'Graham Ralph', 'Dermot Morgan, Miriam Margolyes, Sorcha Cusack, Neil McCaul, Kate Sachs', null, 'Sean is a little duck with a big problem. Due to a mishap with a jet aircraft Sean misses the annual migration South and has to face the winter alone. However, he is befriended by a water vole, and with Vole''s help, Sean learns the lessons of survival, and most importantly, the value of friendship.', 'Sean is a little duck with a big problem. Due to a mishap with a jet aircraft Sean misses the annual migration South and has to face the winter alone. However, he is befriended by a water vole, and with Vole''s help, Sean learns the lessons of survival, and most importantly, the value of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LHWo3hp6B2NAQiQXq26CFxq2R0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79419'),
  ('1059099380782744822', 'The First Star', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Myriam Vinocour', 'Marie-Castille Mention-Schaar, Lucien Jean-Baptiste', 'Firmine Richard, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Jimmy Woha Woha, Anne Consigny, Àstrid Bergès-Frisbey, Michel Jonasz, Édouard Montoute, Gilles Benizio', null, 'A married father of three, lives in Créteil doing odd jobs and spends his time at the local PMU bar. One day, to please his daughter, he promises a little too quick to take the whole family on vacation to ski. The only problem: if he breaks his promise, his wife will divorce him.', 'A married father of three, lives in Créteil doing odd jobs and spends his time at the local PMU bar. One day, to please his daughter, he promises a little too quick to take the whole family on vacation to ski. The only problem: if he breaks his promise, his wife will divorce him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYwiHAshgJbE6gzqjKYNoX0BnOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15713'),
  ('841357893805552031', 'The First Teacher', 1965, 'Drama', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Georgi Rerberg, Yevgeni Kashkevich', 'Andrei Tarkovsky', 'Bolot Beyshenaliev, Natalya Arinbasarova, Idris Nogajbayev, Darkul Kuyukova, Kirey Zharkimbayev, Klara Yusupzhanova, Asanbek Kydyrnazarov, Sovetbek Dzhumadylov', null, 'Dyuishen is assigned to the mountainous Kirghiz region of Central Asia by the Young Communist League after he is discharged from the Red Army. It is 1923 and the Civil war has ended. The former soldier becomes a teacher, bringing the Leninist doctrine to the remote Moslem area where elders did not allow children to go to school. He falls in love with one of his students, but the young woman is sold by her father to a wealthy chieftain.', 'Dyuishen is assigned to the mountainous Kirghiz region of Central Asia by the Young Communist League after he is discharged from the Red Army. It is 1923 and the Civil war has ended. The former soldier becomes a teacher, bringing the Leninist doctrine to the remote Moslem area where elders did not allow children to go to school. He falls in love with one of his students, but the young woman is sold by her father to a wealthy chieftain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNUTDXlmOVdT0gJYC26E7rB4Hwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48676'),
  ('267203635355411192', 'The First Temptation of Christ', 2019, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Rodrigo Van Der Put, Rodrigo Graciosa', 'Gabriel Esteves', 'Gregório Duvivier, Fábio Porchat, Antonio Tabet, Evelyn Castro, Rafael Portugal, Karina Ramil, Sura Berditchevsky, João Vicente de Castro', null, 'Jesus, who''s hitting the big 3-0, brings a surprise guest to meet the family. A Christmas special so wrong it must be from comedians Porta dos Fundos.', 'Jesus, who''s hitting the big 3-0, brings a surprise guest to meet the family. A Christmas special so wrong it must be from comedians Porta dos Fundos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdNCaVDTK7a5KKCU7baLwY2gavx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652020'),
  ('150994955894003430', 'The First Time', 1969, 'Comedy', 'James Neilson, Ernest Laszlo', 'Roger Smith, Jo Heims', 'Jacqueline Bisset, Wes Stern, Ricky Kelman, Wink Roberts, Gerard Parkes, Cosette Lee, Sharon Acker, Trudy Young', 'PG-13', 'With the coming of summer, three high school buddies--Kenny Leeds, Mike Decker, and Tommy Kingsley--anticipate their initiation into the pleasures of manhood. But Kenny is separated from his friends and sent to stay with his grandparents in Buffalo while his father, a widowed salesman, leaves on a business trip with his secretary-fiancée. Bored and alone in a strange city, Kenny writes his two friends letters about his adventures at "Rosie''s," a fictitious brothel across the Canadian border in Niagara Falls. His lie quickly backfires.', 'With the coming of summer, three high school buddies--Kenny Leeds, Mike Decker, and Tommy Kingsley--anticipate their initiation into the pleasures of manhood. But Kenny is separated from his friends and sent to stay with his grandparents in Buffalo while his father, a widowed salesman, leaves on a business trip with his secretary-fiancée. Bored and alone in a strange city, Kenny writes his two friends letters about his adventures at "Rosie''s," a fictitious brothel across the Canadian border in Niagara Falls. His lie quickly backfires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xWaCHJxxcJnYE2khi5yuPvvvT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86767'),
  ('307789305827087884', 'The First Time', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Trapenberg, Gavin Kleintop, Jon Kasdan', 'Jon Kasdan', 'Dylan O''Brien, Britt Robertson, Craig Roberts, James Frecheville, Victoria Justice, Maggie Elizabeth Jones, Halston Sage, Lamarcus Tinker', 'PG-13', 'A spark of attraction smolders, then ignites, between two teens from different high schools who meet by chance at a party.', 'A spark of attraction smolders, then ignites, between two teens from different high schools who meet by chance at a party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tG6jUndWd9FRuvI4j5Z2bhTuq0V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84199'),
  ('125400441166517899', 'The First Time 2', 2019, 'Drama', 'Kim Tae-soo', null, 'Kim Ji-ah, Yoo Jung, Min Do-yoon', null, 'Choong-heon, who is about to leave for the army soon, drinks away his sorrows with Geon-woo. On the way home, he finds Jeong-in, who is sleeping on the street, and takes her back to his house. The next day, she thanks Choong-heon and buys him breakfast. Then she tells him what happened. Apparently, she passed out after drinking out of anger for her friends teasing her that she''s a virgin, and she asks Choong-heon to be her first experience after all he''s done for her.', 'Choong-heon, who is about to leave for the army soon, drinks away his sorrows with Geon-woo. On the way home, he finds Jeong-in, who is sleeping on the street, and takes her back to his house. The next day, she thanks Choong-heon and buys him breakfast. Then she tells him what happened. Apparently, she passed out after drinking out of anger for her friends teasing her that she''s a virgin, and she asks Choong-heon to be her first experience after all he''s done for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaI8vVyyVfXiXFGchO0OTWCfQ7G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629792'),
  ('500750025156852897', 'The First Time I Turned Twenty', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Lorraine Lévy, Emmanuel Soyer', 'Lorraine Lévy', 'Marilou Berry, Catherine Jacob, Serge Riaboukine, Stéphanie Pasterkamp, Myriam Moraly, Pierre Arditi, Michel Vuillermoz, Catherine Arditi', null, 'In 1960s France, 16-year-old Hannah Goldman is experiencing a painful adolescence. Her Jewish background and plain appearance make her an object of ridicule, but she has a talent for music and is determined to fulfil her ambition to play in the school jazz band.', 'In 1960s France, 16-year-old Hannah Goldman is experiencing a painful adolescence. Her Jewish background and plain appearance make her an object of ridicule, but she has a talent for music and is determined to fulfil her ambition to play in the school jazz band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lig5mfP2ZJ0jl1ihS5mRR6tMJU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40851'),
  ('716198794553212347', 'The First Traveling Saleslady', 1956, 'Comedy, Western', 'Arthur Lubin, William E. Snyder, Richard Maybery', 'Devery Freeman, Stephen Longstreet', 'Ginger Rogers, Barry Nelson, Carol Channing, David Brian, James Arness, Clint Eastwood, Robert F. Simon, Frank Wilcox', null, 'At the turn of the century Rose and ex-showbiz friend Molly get involved in selling steel. When they come unstuck with corsets they embark on the even more hazardous project of selling barbed wire to highly suspicious Texas cowboys.', 'At the turn of the century Rose and ex-showbiz friend Molly get involved in selling steel. When they come unstuck with corsets they embark on the even more hazardous project of selling barbed wire to highly suspicious Texas cowboys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkEdVnVK8YYWkr4R7xxUYzRZjbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187534'),
  ('238869138853864', 'The First Turn-On!!', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Michael Herz', 'Stuart Strutin', 'Georgia Harrell, Michael Sanville, Googy Gress, Sheila Kennedy, Vincent D''Onofrio, Mitchell Whitfield, Ted Henning, Mark Torgl', 'R', 'A group of teenage summer campers and one counselor share the stories of their first sexual experiences when an avalanche traps them in a cave...', 'A group of teenage summer campers and one counselor share the stories of their first sexual experiences when an avalanche traps them in a cave...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kawqcJlqySyxqrhWmUVpn6DoQHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93215'),
  ('358879472026010306', 'The First Wave', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Matthew Heineman, Matthew Heineman, Thorsten Thielow', null, 'Nathalie Dougé, Alexis Ellis, Kellie Wunsch, Brussels Jabon, Naph Jabon, Athens Garrote, Andrew Cuomo, Michael Dowling', 'R', 'When Covid-19 hit New York City in 2020, filmmaker Matthew Heineman gained unique access to one of New York’s hardest-hit hospital systems. The resulting film focuses on the doctors, nurses, and patients on the frontlines during the “first wave” from March to June 2020. Their distinct storylines each serve as a microcosm to understand how the city persevered through the worst pandemic in a century', 'When Covid-19 hit New York City in 2020, filmmaker Matthew Heineman gained unique access to one of New York’s hardest-hit hospital systems. The resulting film focuses on the doctors, nurses, and patients on the frontlines during the “first wave” from March to June 2020. Their distinct storylines each serve as a microcosm to understand how the city persevered through the worst pandemic in a century', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLUeiYTLwLiwY0wreEeoU4qaU89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811769'),
  ('9912679080378324', 'The First Wives Club', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Hugh Wilson, Donald E. Thorin, Julie A. Bloom', 'Robert Harling', 'Goldie Hawn, Bette Midler, Diane Keaton, Maggie Smith, Sarah Jessica Parker, Dan Hedaya, Stockard Channing, Victor Garber', 'PG', 'After years of helping their hubbies climb the ladder of success, three mid-life Manhattanites have been dumped for a newer, curvier model. But the trio is determined to turn their pain into gain. They come up with a cleverly devious plan to hit their exes where it really hurts - in the wallet!', 'After years of helping their hubbies climb the ladder of success, three mid-life Manhattanites have been dumped for a newer, curvier model. But the trio is determined to turn their pain into gain. They come up with a cleverly devious plan to hit their exes where it really hurts - in the wallet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ApifgYnfdJUSmCKzTBrWOYYWsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2925'),
  ('839843931990418563', 'The First, the Last', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Bouli Lanners', 'Bouli Lanners', 'Albert Dupontel, Bouli Lanners, Suzanne Clément, Michael Lonsdale, David Murgia, Aurore Broutin, Philippe Rebbot, Serge Riaboukine', null, 'Apocalyptic neo-western about two gangsters, a town full of crazy people and Jesus...', 'Apocalyptic neo-western about two gangsters, a town full of crazy people and Jesus...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tppfmEYGHzLHD9CyOlZogTzu6rH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377853'),
  ('538714237936286380', 'The Fish Child', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Lucía Puenzo, Rolo Pulpeiro, Fabiana Tiscornia', 'Lucía Puenzo', 'Inés Efrón, Mariela Vitale, Pep Munné, Diego Velázquez, Carlos Bardem, Arnaldo André, Ailín Salas, Sandra Guida', null, 'A desperate love story between two young girls of extremely different social backgrounds who, unable to find a place for their love in the world they live in, are pushed to commit a crime.', 'A desperate love story between two young girls of extremely different social backgrounds who, unable to find a place for their love in the world they live in, are pushed to commit a crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BSSYgo7r9FZcKxSlGPSuikCZko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26864'),
  ('514812370950491348', 'The Fish Tale', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shuichi Okita, Yasuyuki Sasaki, Kyouhei Tamazawa', 'Shuichi Okita, Shiro Maeda', 'Non, Yuya Yagira, Kaho, Hayato Isomura, Amane Okayama, Hiroki Miyake, Haruka Igawa, Sakana-kun', null, 'A young child is obsessed with learning about and drawing fish. The child seems a little odd, but if you are understanding and supportive you will be cheering in the end.', 'A young child is obsessed with learning about and drawing fish. The child seems a little odd, but if you are understanding and supportive you will be cheering in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3VejLH7ub2meFDYZUHbHOeU0up.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:952438'),
  ('1116238452518381533', 'The Fish That Saved Pittsburgh', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Gilbert Moses, Frank Stanley', 'Jaison Starkes, Edmond Stevens', 'Julius Erving, Jonathan Winters, Meadowlark Lemon, Jack Kehoe, Kareem Abdul-Jabbar, Margaret Avery, James Bond III, Michael V. Gazzo', 'PG', 'The Pittsburgh basketball team is hopeless. Maybe with the aid of an astrologer, and some new astrologically compatible players, they can become winners.', 'The Pittsburgh basketball team is hopeless. Maybe with the aid of an astrologer, and some new astrologically compatible players, they can become winners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heDHvyI0ICaG4MogaIQNawdhsJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67627'),
  ('940795359187901250', 'The Fish with the Eyes of Gold', 1974, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Pedro Luis Ramírez, Antonio L. Ballesteros Jr.', 'Juan Gallardo Muñoz', 'Wal Davis, Ricardo Vázquez, Ada Tauler, Rex Martín, Norma Kastel, Barta Barri, Montserrat Prous, Víctor Israel', null, 'Derek, a handsome young Englishman, begins seducing the local women of a Spanish seaside town, only for a murderer to start picking them off one by one.', 'Derek, a handsome young Englishman, begins seducing the local women of a Spanish seaside town, only for a murderer to start picking them off one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fBy8B4NaCqxfAuOhA4sNGrnNQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105234'),
  ('349947347697506340', 'The Fishbowl', 2023, 'Drama', 'Glorimar Marrero Sánchez', 'Glorimar Marrero Sánchez', 'Isel Rodriguez, Modesto Lacen, Magali Carrasquillo, Maximiliano Rivas, Georgina Borri, Anamín Santiago, Idenisse Salamán, Carola García', null, 'As her cancer spreads, Noelia''s ultimate decision is to return to her native Vieques, Puerto Rico, and claim her freedom to decide her own fate. She reunites with her friends and family, who are still dealing with the contamination of the U.S. Navy after 60 years of military practices.', 'As her cancer spreads, Noelia''s ultimate decision is to return to her native Vieques, Puerto Rico, and claim her freedom to decide her own fate. She reunites with her friends and family, who are still dealing with the contamination of the U.S. Navy after 60 years of military practices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAqMJ7UrctVPqP9vKq92qwByc8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960853'),
  ('623007538846319679', 'The Fisher King', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roger Pratt, Terry Gilliam, David McGiffert', 'Richard LaGravenese', 'Robin Williams, Jeff Bridges, Amanda Plummer, Mercedes Ruehl, Michael Jeter, William Jay Marshall, Chris Howell, Adam Bryant', 'R', 'Two troubled men face their terrible destinies and events of their past as they join together on a mission to find the Holy Grail and thus to save themselves.', 'Two troubled men face their terrible destinies and events of their past as they join together on a mission to find the Holy Grail and thus to save themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwIYw22HmAUMobV4zsX69MgfVUz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177'),
  ('417758382418659855', 'The Fisherman and His Wife', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Doris Dörrie', null, 'Alexandra Maria Lara, Christian Ulmen, Simon Verhoeven, Young-Shin Kim, Eva Christian, Valentin Plătăreanu, Ulrike Kriener, Elmar Wepper', null, 'Otto and Leo are two men from Germany who have launched a successful business in which they import koi, the beautiful Japanese fish, for collectors in their native land. While on a business trip to Japan, Otto and Leo meet Ida, a German tourist who is studying fashion design. Ida begins traveling with the two men, and surprisingly develops an infatuation with the rumpled Otto instead of the handsome Leo. When Ida discovers she''s pregnant with Otto''s child, the two marry, and upon their return to Germany, Ida attempts to join in the business by creating a line of scarves decorated with koi patterns. However, the honeymoon proves short-lived, and Ida''s presence creates a rift between Otto and Leo, as the latter sets up his own concern, raising koi with his new bride, Yoko.', 'Otto and Leo are two men from Germany who have launched a successful business in which they import koi, the beautiful Japanese fish, for collectors in their native land. While on a business trip to Japan, Otto and Leo meet Ida, a German tourist who is studying fashion design. Ida begins traveling with the two men, and surprisingly develops an infatuation with the rumpled Otto instead of the handsome Leo. When Ida discovers she''s pregnant with Otto''s child, the two marry, and upon their return to Germany, Ida attempts to join in the business by creating a line of scarves decorated with koi patterns. However, the honeymoon proves short-lived, and Ida''s presence creates a rift between Otto and Leo, as the latter sets up his own concern, raising koi with his new bride, Yoko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEKdfkpfmENodpdXLT0ApnqJHdc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5235'),
  ('699107573352741021', 'The Fisherman at the Stream', 1897, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A boy is fishing in a stream when some others see an opportunity for mischief.', 'A boy is fishing in a stream when some others see an opportunity for mischief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zojtac5A8azd70O0y31R4dSYQZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119948'),
  ('274481182854302390', 'The Fisherman''s Diary', 2020, 'Drama', 'Enah Johnscott', 'Enah Johnscott', 'Faith Fidel, Kang Quintus, Ramsey Nouah, Cosson Chinopoh, Onyama Laura, Prince Sube Mayorchu, Godwill Neba, Daphne Njie', null, 'A 12-year old girl - Ekah is inspired by the story of the youngest Noble Peace Prize Winner - Malala Yousafzai''s. She is determined to go to school in a village of fisherman where the education of a girl child is considered to be a taboo. Her burning drive and determination to break this old adage gets her embroiled with her father''s - Solomon past experience with girl child education.', 'A 12-year old girl - Ekah is inspired by the story of the youngest Noble Peace Prize Winner - Malala Yousafzai''s. She is determined to go to school in a village of fisherman where the education of a girl child is considered to be a taboo. Her burning drive and determination to break this old adage gets her embroiled with her father''s - Solomon past experience with girl child education.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHFXpTGgI9EdD3cL0WQSHo7YD7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784607'),
  ('946486819710277932', 'The Fisherman''s Wife', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Daisuke Yamanouchi, Masato Nakao, Dai Ejiri', 'Daisuke Yamanouchi', 'Ririko Kinoshita, Aya Ueha, Shoko Kudo, Emi Nishino, Manzo Shinra, Masamitsu Kani, Hirokio Andô, Setsuhiko Kobayashi', null, 'In a small fishing village in northern Kanto, Nami stands at the edge of the dock, waiting for her husband’s boat to return. While waiting, Nami lives with her father-in-law, Gengoro, who uses her nightly as he pleases. One day, a man named Kaneda washes up at the port, in hiding after committing a heinous sex crime, and begins to work for a fisherman named Kunio. While Kaneda is doing his best to reform his life, all hell breaks loose when he crosses paths with Nami, and his natural urges kick back in.', 'In a small fishing village in northern Kanto, Nami stands at the edge of the dock, waiting for her husband’s boat to return. While waiting, Nami lives with her father-in-law, Gengoro, who uses her nightly as he pleases. One day, a man named Kaneda washes up at the port, in hiding after committing a heinous sex crime, and begins to work for a fisherman named Kunio. While Kaneda is doing his best to reform his life, all hell breaks loose when he crosses paths with Nami, and his natural urges kick back in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiDRraqlOOxSEeqXSaM0OHJ8kN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1394195'),
  ('614799217765237552', 'The Fits', 2016, 'Drama', 'Anna Rose Holmer, Jack Grimmett, Annalise Lockhart', 'Anna Rose Holmer, Saela Davis, Lisa Kjerulff', 'Royalty Hightower, Alexis Neblett, Makyla Burnam, Da''Sean Minor, Inayah Rodgers, Antonio A.B. Grant Jr., Lauren Gibson, Shonte Jackson', 'NR', 'While training at the gym, 11-year-old tomboy Toni becomes entranced with a dance troupe. As she struggles to fit in, she finds herself caught up in danger as the group begins to suffer from fainting spells and other violent fits.', 'While training at the gym, 11-year-old tomboy Toni becomes entranced with a dance troupe. As she struggles to fit in, she finds herself caught up in danger as the group begins to suffer from fainting spells and other violent fits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujK85shn2lY3yJrleXa8wThgVrI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358807'),
  ('656832541054028558', 'The Five', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jeong Yeon-shik, Lee Ho-hyun, Kim Hyung-koo', 'Jeong Yeon-shik', 'Kim Seon-a, On Ju-wan, Don Lee, Shin Jung-keun, Jeong In-gi, Lee Chung-ah, Park Hyo-ju, Cho Han-cheul', null, 'Eun-a, who was living a happy life with her family, loses everything to a psychopath serial killer. After the tragic incident, she gathers four people with different talents who are in need of organ transplants to achieve her revenge.', 'Eun-a, who was living a happy life with her family, loses everything to a psychopath serial killer. After the tragic incident, she gathers four people with different talents who are in need of organ transplants to achieve her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bG9ktvoMOESnTGxKIb6gkEfa6Eg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236242'),
  ('1075782408486860451', 'The Five', 2023, 'Western', 'Travis Mills, Troy Bakewell', 'Travis Mills', 'John Marrs, Todd South, Tom Dragt, Michael P. Walker, Cat Roberts, Paul Bloom, William Horton', 'NR', 'A scorned woman enlists the help of five strangers to execute a bank robbery. Tensions rise as the men anxiously await her arrival with the money, leaving the crew to wonder if they have been betrayed.', 'A scorned woman enlists the help of five strangers to execute a bank robbery. Tensions rise as the men anxiously await her arrival with the money, leaving the crew to wonder if they have been betrayed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xckDPGprPVDpuzhSyo9E7SZJ2wa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1079394'),
  ('275521374071940850', 'The Five Days', 1973, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Dario Argento, Luigi Kuveiller, Franco Conti', 'Franco Catalano', 'Adriano Celentano, Enzo Cerusico, Marilù Tolo, Luisa De Santis, Glauco Onorato, Fulvio Mingozzi, Carla Tatò, Sergio Graziani', null, 'In 1848 Milan, a thief and a baker witness the chaotic final days of the Italian Revolution.', 'In 1848 Milan, a thief and a baker witness the chaotic final days of the Italian Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhsFbVE9w2vPOv5Rnn4KADsdaFl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48853'),
  ('754420927799053898', 'The Five Devils', 2022, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Paul Guilhaume, Léa Mysius, Laura Caselli', 'Léa Mysius, Paul Guilhaume', 'Adèle Exarchopoulos, Sally Dramé, Swala Emati, Moustapha Mbengue, Daphné Patakia, Patrick Bouchitey, Hugo Dillon, Antonia Buresi', 'NR', '8-year-old Vicky has a mysterious gift: she can recreate any scent she comes across, even that of her beloved mother Joanne. When her estranged aunt Julia suddenly returns to town, the invocation of her fragrance plunges the young girl back in time to unravel a past replete with family secrets.', '8-year-old Vicky has a mysterious gift: she can recreate any scent she comes across, even that of her beloved mother Joanne. When her estranged aunt Julia suddenly returns to town, the invocation of her fragrance plunges the young girl back in time to unravel a past replete with family secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KZJZ3PlgqfCFMvn7D6yCyIRXAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820697'),
  ('1016343973464062157', 'The Five Heartbeats', 1991, 'Drama, Music', 'Robert Townsend, Bill Dill', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Robert Townsend', 'Robert Townsend, Michael Wright, Leon, Harry Lennix, Tico Wells, Diahann Carroll, Harold Nicholas, John Canada Terrell', 'R', 'In the early 1960s, a quintet of hopeful, young African-American men form an amateur vocal group called The Five Heartbeats. After an initially rocky start, the group improves, turns pro, and rises to become a top flight music sensation. Along the way, however, the guys learn many hard lessons about the reality of the music industry.', 'In the early 1960s, a quintet of hopeful, young African-American men form an amateur vocal group called The Five Heartbeats. After an initially rocky start, the group improves, turns pro, and rises to become a top flight music sensation. Along the way, however, the guys learn many hard lessons about the reality of the music industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmNKtRPFVfyUKCe8e89pGkeBlRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29475'),
  ('1027399411392603777', 'The Five Obstructions', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Jørgen Leth, Lars von Trier, Dan Holmberg', 'Lars von Trier, Asger Leth, Jørgen Leth', 'Jørgen Leth, Lars von Trier, Claus Nissen, Majken Algren Nielsen, Daniel Hernandez Rodriguez, Jacqueline Arenal, Vivian Rosa, Patrick Bauchau', null, 'In 1967, experimental filmmaker Jorgen Leth created a striking short film, The Perfect Human, starring a man and women sitting in a box while a narrator poses questions about their relationship and humanity. Years later, Danish director Lars von Trier made a deal with Leth to remake his film five times, each under a different set of circumstances and with von Trier''s strictly prescribed rules. As Leth completes each challenge, von Trier creates increasingly further elaborate stipulations.', 'In 1967, experimental filmmaker Jorgen Leth created a striking short film, The Perfect Human, starring a man and women sitting in a box while a narrator poses questions about their relationship and humanity. Years later, Danish director Lars von Trier made a deal with Leth to remake his film five times, each under a different set of circumstances and with von Trier''s strictly prescribed rules. As Leth completes each challenge, von Trier creates increasingly further elaborate stipulations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMcCmIdos88yd44xqCXj4NUWph3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12456'),
  ('369366457465925101', 'The Five of Us', 2004, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ghyslaine Côté, Alexis Durand-Brault', 'Chantal Cadieux, Ghyslaine Côté', 'Jacinthe Laguë, Julie Deslauriers, Ingrid Falaise, Brigitte Lafleur, Noémie Yelle, Peter Miller, Sylvain Carrier, Robert Lalonde', null, 'In Montreal, the teenagers Manon, Anne, Isa, Claudie and Sophie are friends since their childhood. While spending a couple of days in the cottage of Sophie''s parents nearby a lake, the girls decide to give a party, and Manon and Sophie hitch for a ride to the town in a jeep to buy some beers and supplies and they invite the driver to the party. On the return, the same driver stops the car and later Sophie is found stabbed, raped and covered of blood. Fifteen years later, Manon sees the guy in a car-wash and she invites her former friends to return to the house nearby the lake, where wounds of their traumatic loss are disclosed.', 'In Montreal, the teenagers Manon, Anne, Isa, Claudie and Sophie are friends since their childhood. While spending a couple of days in the cottage of Sophie''s parents nearby a lake, the girls decide to give a party, and Manon and Sophie hitch for a ride to the town in a jeep to buy some beers and supplies and they invite the driver to the party. On the return, the same driver stops the car and later Sophie is found stabbed, raped and covered of blood. Fifteen years later, Manon sees the guy in a car-wash and she invites her former friends to return to the house nearby the lake, where wounds of their traumatic loss are disclosed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wicLmyRbwvJUDNo1g6ydoAwGdfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49737'),
  ('962337168348545012', 'The Five Pennies', 1959, 'Drama, Music', 'Melville Shavelson, W. Wallace Kelley, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Jack Rose, Melville Shavelson', 'Danny Kaye, Barbara Bel Geddes, Louis Armstrong, Harry Guardino, Bob Crosby, Bobby Troup, Susan Gordon, Tuesday Weld', 'NR', 'Dixieland cornetist Red Nichols runs into opposition to his sound, but breaks through to success. He marries a warm, patient woman and even finds time to raise a family. Then tragedy strikes when their daughter contracts polio.', 'Dixieland cornetist Red Nichols runs into opposition to his sound, but breaks through to success. He marries a warm, patient woman and even finds time to raise a family. Then tragedy strikes when their daughter contracts polio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vECa5z1DgEQ2Tn5OGRa8YTPOTcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17677'),
  ('687703604808279715', 'The Five People You Meet In Heaven', 2004, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Lloyd Kramer, Kramer Morgenthau', 'Mitch Albom', 'Jon Voight, Ellen Burstyn, Jeff Daniels, Michael Imperioli, Dagmara Dominczyk, Steven Grayhm, Matt Visser, Callum Keith Rennie', 'NR', 'On his 83rd birthday, Eddie, a war vet and a maintenance worker at the Ruby Pier amusement park, dies while trying to save a girl who is sitting under a falling ride. When he awakens in the afterlife, he encounters five people with ties to his corporeal existence who help him understand the meaning of his life.', 'On his 83rd birthday, Eddie, a war vet and a maintenance worker at the Ruby Pier amusement park, dies while trying to save a girl who is sitting under a falling ride. When he awakens in the afterlife, he encounters five people with ties to his corporeal existence who help him understand the meaning of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fvMz3gy4YuqPDC5LotTWofFFcx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30698'),
  ('860244151911404998', 'The Five Senses', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jeremy Podeswa, Gregory Middleton', 'Jeremy Podeswa', 'Mary-Louise Parker, Pascale Bussières, Richard Clarkin, Brendan Fletcher, Marco Leonardi, Nadia Litz, Daniel MacIvor, Molly Parker', 'R', 'Interconnected stories examine situations involving the five senses. Touch is represented by a massage therapist who is treating a woman, while her daughter accidentally loses the woman''s pre-school daughter in the park. The older daughter meets a voyeur (vision), a professional house-cleaner has an acute sense of smell, a cake maker has lost her sense of taste, and an older man is losing his hearing.', 'Interconnected stories examine situations involving the five senses. Touch is represented by a massage therapist who is treating a woman, while her daughter accidentally loses the woman''s pre-school daughter in the park. The older daughter meets a voyeur (vision), a professional house-cleaner has an acute sense of smell, a cake maker has lost her sense of taste, and an older man is losing his hearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4UjdQJYxQEhenI7DFIM301Df7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47585'),
  ('820375128503243356', 'The Five Star Stories', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Action, Animation, Drama', 'Kazuo Yamazaki, Nobuteru Yuuki', 'Akinori Endo', 'Ryo Horikawa, Maria Kawamura, Kazuhiko Inoue, Norio Wakamoto, Hideyuki Tanaka, Ichiro Nagai, Rei Sakuma, Aruno Tahara', null, 'Among the 5 star systems known as the Joker Systems, there are many kingdoms. There are knights within the kingdoms and these knights who control giant robots, Mortar Heads, are called Headliners. Bound to the knights are fatimas. Human in appearance and mind, the fatimas (mostly female) possess expanded physical capabilities and make it possible for a Headliner to control a Mortar Head. Fatimas cannot reproduce. All this is overseen by Emperor Amaterasu and his Mirage Knights.', 'Among the 5 star systems known as the Joker Systems, there are many kingdoms. There are knights within the kingdoms and these knights who control giant robots, Mortar Heads, are called Headliners. Bound to the knights are fatimas. Human in appearance and mind, the fatimas (mostly female) possess expanded physical capabilities and make it possible for a Headliner to control a Mortar Head. Fatimas cannot reproduce. All this is overseen by Emperor Amaterasu and his Mirage Knights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/177p2PI6UXwNbtF1MraNzHevKiQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34375'),
  ('153671488103795462', 'The Five Venoms', 1978, 'Action, Drama, Mystery', 'Chang Cheh, Chan Yau-Man, Chiang Sheng', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Chiang Sheng, Phillip Kwok Chui, Sun Chien, Lu Feng, Lo Meng, Wai Pak, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Dick Wei', 'R', 'A dying master sends his last student to check up on five former pupils, who each know a special style of kung-fu.', 'A dying master sends his last student to check up on five former pupils, who each know a special style of kung-fu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z446TqbbOb7emtN1S8iOrwTHz7Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13481'),
  ('633385998047762873', 'The Five-Year Engagement', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nicholas Stoller, Javier Aguirresarobe, Michael J. Moore', 'Jason Segel, Nicholas Stoller', 'Jason Segel, Emily Blunt, Rhys Ifans, Chris Pratt, Alison Brie, Jacki Weaver, Jim Piddock, David Paymer', 'R', 'Exactly one year after Tom meets Violet, he surprises her with a wedding ring. By all accounts, Tom and Violet are destined for their happily ever after. However, this engaged couple just keep getting tripped up on the long walk down the aisle.', 'Exactly one year after Tom meets Violet, he surprises her with a wedding ring. By all accounts, Tom and Violet are destined for their happily ever after. However, this engaged couple just keep getting tripped up on the long walk down the aisle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drsY910CSoSkROYypNVwUxI875T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72207'),
  ('642686764200678163', 'The Five(ish) Doctors Reboot', 2013, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Peter Davison, James DeHaviland, Jennie Fava', 'Peter Davison', 'Peter Davison, Colin Baker, Sylvester McCoy, Steven Moffat, Paul McGann, Sean Pertwee, Olivia Colman, Louis Davison', null, 'With the 50th anniversary of Doctor Who about to film, the "classic" Doctors Peter Davison, Colin Baker and Sylvester McCoy are keen to be involved. But do they manage it?', 'With the 50th anniversary of Doctor Who about to film, the "classic" Doctors Peter Davison, Colin Baker and Sylvester McCoy are keen to be involved. But do they manage it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oX9IR6VzhbIBzsiH247qztFbMru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246202'),
  ('520594062263055612', 'The Fix', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Kelsey Egan', 'Kelsey Egan', 'Grace Van Dien, Terri Lane, Daniel Sharman, Nicole Fortuin, Caleb Payne, Keenan Arrison, Ryan Kruger, Dan Hirst', null, 'When a troubled model takes a new drug at a party, she suffers a shocking transformation. Pursued by authorities and a dangerous gang, she hunts for a fix to reverse these effects, only to discover her mutations could save the human race.', 'When a troubled model takes a new drug at a party, she suffers a shocking transformation. Pursued by authorities and a dangerous gang, she hunts for a fix to reverse these effects, only to discover her mutations could save the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vY7bY2xZymoIOti4WM5K29OMzCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931940'),
  ('94551884079328700', 'The Fixer', 1968, 'Drama', 'John Frankenheimer, Marcel Grignon', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Alan Bates, Dirk Bogarde, Georgia Brown, Ian Holm, David Warner, Hugh Griffith, Elizabeth Hartman, Murray Melvin', null, 'Set in tsarist Russia around the turn of the century and based on a true story of a Russian Jewish peasant Yakov Bog who was wrongly imprisoned for a most unlikely crime - the “ritual murder” of a Gentile child in Kyiv. We witness the unrelenting detail of the peasant handyman''s life in prison and see him gain in dignity as the efforts to humiliate him and make him confess fail.', 'Set in tsarist Russia around the turn of the century and based on a true story of a Russian Jewish peasant Yakov Bog who was wrongly imprisoned for a most unlikely crime - the “ritual murder” of a Gentile child in Kyiv. We witness the unrelenting detail of the peasant handyman''s life in prison and see him gain in dignity as the efforts to humiliate him and make him confess fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLcke8F7THAxtEHtN8Tg6IaZ9if.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87267'),
  ('1147006258073262764', 'The Fixer', 1998, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Charles Robert Carner', null, 'Jon Voight, Brenda Bakke, J.J. Johnston, Miguel Sandoval, Jack Wallace, J. Winston Carroll, Martin Roach, Brent Jennings', null, 'Jack Killoran is a lawyer who can ''fix'' any situation for his wealthy clients, usually by bribing or blackmailing corrupt officials. Killoran runs afoul of some of his clients when he has a crisis of conscience after miraculously surviving a riding accident.', 'Jack Killoran is a lawyer who can ''fix'' any situation for his wealthy clients, usually by bribing or blackmailing corrupt officials. Killoran runs afoul of some of his clients when he has a crisis of conscience after miraculously surviving a riding accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JP68f46jiHlT0ePwOsikcGTsqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269339'),
  ('970800762848710499', 'The Fixer Uppers', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Charley Rogers', 'Frank Tashlin', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Mae Busch, Charles Middleton, Arthur Housman', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie are greeting card salesmen who agree to help a woman put a spark in her loveless marriage by making her husband jealous.', 'Stan and Ollie are greeting card salesmen who agree to help a woman put a spark in her loveless marriage by making her husband jealous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTBnsch1tZeNBKm1ugmNveWhS3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48817'),
  ('98410563717197632', 'The Fixies: Top Secret', 2017, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Ivan Pshonkin, Andrey Kolpin, Vasiko Bedoshvili', 'Jeffrey Hylton', 'Alexander Pushnoy, Dmitri Nazarov, Larisa Brokhman, Prokhor Chekhovskoy, Varvara Obidor, Stanislav Yevsin, Felix Golovnin, Daria Kolbaseeva', 'PG', 'The Fixies are little creatures that, unseen by humans, help them maintain their appliances – and generally make sure things don’t fall apart… Until an unexpected occurrence of gargantuan proportions threatens to reveal the Fixies’ existence!', 'The Fixies are little creatures that, unseen by humans, help them maintain their appliances – and generally make sure things don’t fall apart… Until an unexpected occurrence of gargantuan proportions threatens to reveal the Fixies’ existence!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1H4TNfrLYYzSFd4CICyoFIjx1vn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483165'),
  ('671430334578790866', 'The FJ Holden', 1977, 'Drama', 'Michael Thornhill, David Gribble', 'Terry Larsen', 'Eva Dickinson, Paul Couzens, Sigrid Thornton, Gary Waddell, Carl Stever, Karlene Rogerson, Roy Corbett, Beryl Marshall', 'NR', 'Suburban Australia in the late 70s. It was the era of the drive-in movie, the Chico Roll girl and the beloved FJ Holden. Boasting drunken fist fights, back seat sex, illegal drag racing, a classic Oz rock soundtrack (featuring Ol''55, Skyhooks and Renee Geyer) and the screen debut of future star Sigrid Thornton. THE FJ HOLDEN forged a strong connection with 70s mainstream youth audiences and today', 'Suburban Australia in the late 70s. It was the era of the drive-in movie, the Chico Roll girl and the beloved FJ Holden. Boasting drunken fist fights, back seat sex, illegal drag racing, a classic Oz rock soundtrack (featuring Ol''55, Skyhooks and Renee Geyer) and the screen debut of future star Sigrid Thornton. THE FJ HOLDEN forged a strong connection with 70s mainstream youth audiences and today', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GMKZEYnajnS7tZyxUPwb7UcbyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33261'),
  ('959746515181927656', 'The Flag of Iron', 1980, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Chiang Sheng, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Phillip Kwok Chui, Chiang Sheng, Lu Feng, Lung Tien-hsiang, Chan Shen, Wong Lik, Yu Tai-Ping, Lam Sau-Kwan', null, 'Loyal gang member Iron Panther takes the heat for his boss after a dustup with their rivals, only to end up betrayed in this vintage kung fu yarn.', 'Loyal gang member Iron Panther takes the heat for his boss after a dustup with their rivals, only to end up betrayed in this vintage kung fu yarn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EqcT8lXRBk2gy3kloPoBzE8cks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60415'),
  ('684531140500231479', 'The Flame', 1947, 'Drama, Crime', 'Reggie Lanning, John H. Auer', 'Lawrence Kimble', 'John Carroll, Vera Ralston, Robert Paige, Broderick Crawford, Henry Travers, Blanche Yurka, Constance Dowling, Hattie McDaniel', 'NR', 'George McAllister, the black sheep of a wealthy family who has squandered his share of the family inheritance, lives in constant jealousy, hatred and resentment of his half-brother Barry, who has been supporting him. George gets his girlfriend, Carlotta Duval, a job as Barry''s nurse, with the idea being to marry him, kill him, and inherit his money—and marrying George.', 'George McAllister, the black sheep of a wealthy family who has squandered his share of the family inheritance, lives in constant jealousy, hatred and resentment of his half-brother Barry, who has been supporting him. George gets his girlfriend, Carlotta Duval, a job as Barry''s nurse, with the idea being to marry him, kill him, and inherit his money—and marrying George.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGCMAfEIjvGrZKUroJcy3knw20n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65018'),
  ('967688464142142623', 'The Flame and the Arrow', 1950, 'Adventure, History', 'Jacques Tourneur, Ernest Haller', 'Waldo Salt', 'Burt Lancaster, Virginia Mayo, Robert Douglas, Aline MacMahon, Frank Allenby, Nick Cravat, Lynn Baggett, Gordon Gebert', 'NR', 'Dardo, a Robin Hood-like figure, and his loyal followers use a Roman ruin in Medieval Lombardy as their headquarters as they conduct an insurgency against their Hessian conquerors.', 'Dardo, a Robin Hood-like figure, and his loyal followers use a Roman ruin in Medieval Lombardy as their headquarters as they conduct an insurgency against their Hessian conquerors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30edZxvbt7W8p8y5OsMX9XSWSwK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32563'),
  ('1006701506199219743', 'The Flame of New Orleans', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance', 'René Clair, Phil Karlson', 'Norman Krasna, René Clair', 'Marlene Dietrich, Bruce Cabot, Roland Young, Theresa Harris, Mischa Auer, Andy Devine, Frank Jenks, Eddie Quillan', null, 'In old New Orleans, a beautiful adventuress juggles the attentions of a rich banker and a dashing sea captain.', 'In old New Orleans, a beautiful adventuress juggles the attentions of a rich banker and a dashing sea captain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWpX53eaQo1IMj51jZkqu9984wN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61109'),
  ('912051300663621011', 'The Flamenco Guitar of Yerai Cortés', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'Antón Álvarez, Uri Barcelona, Álvar Riu', 'Antón Álvarez', 'Yerai Cortés, Antón Álvarez, La Tania, Remedios Amaya, Farruquito, María Merino, Israel Fernández, La Tana', null, 'A thoughtful exploration of gypsy culture, an intimate portrait of flamenco guitar player Yerai Cortés and a healing family exorcism through music. Antón Álvarez (aka C. Tangana) makes his filmmaking debut with this documentary.', 'A thoughtful exploration of gypsy culture, an intimate portrait of flamenco guitar player Yerai Cortés and a healing family exorcism through music. Antón Álvarez (aka C. Tangana) makes his filmmaking debut with this documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCkUmnzlbxpMhHieiQAGQwo50hQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317099'),
  ('658033532792587400', 'The Flamingo Kid', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Garry Marshall, James A. Contner', 'Garry Marshall, Neal Marshall', 'Matt Dillon, Héctor Elizondo, Molly McCarthy, Martha Gehman, Richard Crenna, Jessica Walter, Carole Davis, Janet Jones', 'PG-13', 'Brooklyn teenager Jeffrey Willis, thoroughly unhappy with his modest homestead, embraces the other-world aspects of his summer job at the posh Flamingo Club. He spurns his father in favor of the patronage of smooth-talking Phil Brody and is seduced by the ample bikini charms of club member Carla Samson. But thanks to a couple of late-summer hard lessons, the teen eventually realizes that family should always come first.', 'Brooklyn teenager Jeffrey Willis, thoroughly unhappy with his modest homestead, embraces the other-world aspects of his summer job at the posh Flamingo Club. He spurns his father in favor of the patronage of smooth-talking Phil Brody and is seduced by the ample bikini charms of club member Carla Samson. But thanks to a couple of late-summer hard lessons, the teen eventually realizes that family should always come first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNCYkAXB9WIQBABXTV6Vs9kFrLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25010'),
  ('1034657547822922127', 'The Flanagan Boy', 1953, 'Crime', 'Reginald Le Borg, Walter J. Harvey, Jimmy Sangster', 'Guy Elmes, Richard H. Landau', 'Barbara Payton, Frederick Valk, John Slater, Sidney James, Tony Wright, Marie Burke, Selma Vaz Dias, Enzo Coticchia', null, 'Johnny Flanagan did not have the privileges of a good education or wealthy background but the streets developed his natural talent to be a great fighter. His enormous potential to reach the top is born out of a string of spectacular successes. All of which is brought to a halt when he develops a physical relationship with his manager''s wife, the beautiful but manipulative Lorna. His naive temperament is no match for her callous, dispassionate scheming and he unwittingly becomes a pawn in Lorna''s ultimate plan... .to murder her husband.', 'Johnny Flanagan did not have the privileges of a good education or wealthy background but the streets developed his natural talent to be a great fighter. His enormous potential to reach the top is born out of a string of spectacular successes. All of which is brought to a halt when he develops a physical relationship with his manager''s wife, the beautiful but manipulative Lorna. His naive temperament is no match for her callous, dispassionate scheming and he unwittingly becomes a pawn in Lorna''s ultimate plan... .to murder her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h19Mso5ntUu5Roszzh5bOkOmlKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31024'),
  ('1142437422242012112', 'The Flapper', 1920, 'Comedy', 'Alan Crosland, John W. Brown', 'Frances Marion', 'Olive Thomas, William P. Carleton, Theodore Westman Jr., Warren Cook, Katherine Johnston, Arthur Housman, Louise Lindroth, Marcia Harris', null, 'A Southern teen at a ritzy boarding school gets into mischief while acting the sophisticated grownup to impress a suave gentleman and match wits with a pair of jewel thieves.', 'A Southern teen at a ritzy boarding school gets into mischief while acting the sophisticated grownup to impress a suave gentleman and match wits with a pair of jewel thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAp8ph46CVJIFUeN3SnB8di5iuI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32683'),
  ('1028629271633519382', 'The Flash', 2023, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Henry Braham, Jason Knox-Johnston, Dominique Law', 'Christina Hodson', 'Ezra Miller, Sasha Calle, Michael Keaton, Michael Shannon, Ron Livingston, Maribel Verdú, Kiersey Clemons, Antje Traue', 'PG-13', 'When his attempt to save his family inadvertently alters the future, Barry Allen becomes trapped in a reality in which General Zod has returned and there are no Super Heroes to turn to. In order to save the world that he is in and return to the future that he knows, Barry''s only hope is to race for his life. But will making the ultimate sacrifice be enough to reset the universe?', 'When his attempt to save his family inadvertently alters the future, Barry Allen becomes trapped in a reality in which General Zod has returned and there are no Super Heroes to turn to. In order to save the world that he is in and return to the future that he knows, Barry''s only hope is to race for his life. But will making the ultimate sacrifice be enough to reset the universe?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rktDFPbfHfUbArZ6OOOKsXcv0Bm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298618'),
  ('694393202518071515', 'The Flat', 1968, 'Animation, Horror', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Ivan Kraus, Juraj Herz', null, 'A man is trapped in a sinister flat, where nothing seems to obey the laws of nature.', 'A man is trapped in a sinister flat, where nothing seems to obey the laws of nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKsqN59YT7alBtqLNWg6PkRxilG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19006'),
  ('357111461007008932', 'The Flavor of Corn', 1989, 'Drama', 'Gianni Da Campo', 'Gianni Da Campo', 'Lorenzo Lena, Marco Mestriner, Alba Mottura, Egidio Termine, Marina Vlady, Mattia Pinoli, Paolo Garlato, Elisabetta Barbini', null, 'Lorenzo, a handsome first-year professor in an isolated Italian village, falls under the spell of his most beguiling pupil, a dark-haired, starry-eyed 12-year-old named Duilio. As Lorenzo''s relationship with his heartless girlfriend deteriorates, he finds himself walking the fields with his loving student. When their idyllic friendship is questioned by Duilio''s suspicious stepmother, Lorenzo is brought to a crisis of conscience.', 'Lorenzo, a handsome first-year professor in an isolated Italian village, falls under the spell of his most beguiling pupil, a dark-haired, starry-eyed 12-year-old named Duilio. As Lorenzo''s relationship with his heartless girlfriend deteriorates, he finds himself walking the fields with his loving student. When their idyllic friendship is questioned by Duilio''s suspicious stepmother, Lorenzo is brought to a crisis of conscience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HupPkoHYRhOTCCoVR96DKrbk6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178195'),
  ('80474706803733388', 'The Flavor of Green Tea Over Rice', 1952, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Yûharu Atsuta, Shōhei Imamura', 'Kōgo Noda, Yasujirō Ozu', 'Shin Saburi, Michiyo Kogure, Koji Tsuruta, Chikage Awashima, Keiko Tsushima, Eijirō Yanagi, Kuniko Miyake, Kōji Shitara', null, 'The arranged marriage between a capricious woman from Tokyo high society and a quiet and rustic man is tested by a marital crisis.', 'The arranged marriage between a capricious woman from Tokyo high society and a quiet and rustic man is tested by a marital crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCXg9AfQlcwCR7E7vJCI96n4nLv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55197'),
  ('4829868380067564', 'The Flaying', 2012, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Nicolás Amelio-Ortiz, Nicolás Amelio-Ortiz, Lautaro Zubiri', 'Tomás González Montalvo, Nicolás Amelio-Ortiz', 'Olivia Tykocki, Juan Sebastian Alvarez Windey, Celeste Subatin, Emilio Martin', null, 'Four teenage friends go on a road trip through Argentina. On their way, they find a castle left abandoned in the middle of a forest. They decide to investigate further, only to discover it''s gruesome secrets and former residents.', 'Four teenage friends go on a road trip through Argentina. On their way, they find a castle left abandoned in the middle of a forest. They decide to investigate further, only to discover it''s gruesome secrets and former residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnH2efYsKvx5JPEFMVtdX5TlJlY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235373'),
  ('480048717780133242', 'The Flea Circus', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Francoise Brun-Cottan, Daws Butler, Bill Thompson', 'NR', 'In this animated comedic short, the entire entourage of a flea circus runs away to join a dog.', 'In this animated comedic short, the entire entourage of a flea circus runs away to join a dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQ59KKDY88ai9Jv2wgTQVwqcyGi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87209'),
  ('972884509495940101', 'The Flesh', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marco Ferreri, Ennio Guarnieri, Paolo Costella', 'Massimo Bucchi, Paolo Costella, Liliana Betti', 'Sergio Castellitto, Francesca Dellera, Philippe Léotard, Farid Chopel, Petra Reinhardt, Gudrun Gundlach, Nicoletta Boris, Alessandro De Santis', null, 'A piano player meets and falls in love with a beautiful and voluptuous woman who, by some strange procedure, leaves the man unable to move but with a permanent priapism. After some time he becomes sick of it and she relieves his paralysis. Eventually she gets bored and decides to leave, but he can''t take it because he loves her…', 'A piano player meets and falls in love with a beautiful and voluptuous woman who, by some strange procedure, leaves the man unable to move but with a permanent priapism. After some time he becomes sick of it and she relieves his paralysis. Eventually she gets bored and decides to leave, but he can''t take it because he loves her…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5s9UarEgQWXHtZbm8fakXQnveRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72808'),
  ('99230686168609947', 'The Flesh and Blood Show', 1972, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pete Walker, Peter Jessop, Brian Lawrence', 'Alfred Shaughnessy', 'Jenny Hanley, Ray Brooks, Luan Peters, Candace Glendenning, Robin Askwith, Tristan Rogers, Judy Matheson, David Howey', 'R', 'Actors rehearsing a show at a mysterious seaside theater are being killed off by an unknown maniac.', 'Actors rehearsing a show at a mysterious seaside theater are being killed off by an unknown maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KNjXNOxareROutLC8WH9fMz2W1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36600'),
  ('27829479762350777', 'The Flesh and the Fiends', 1960, 'Horror', 'John Gilling, Monty Berman', 'John Gilling, Leon Griffiths', 'Peter Cushing, Donald Pleasence, George Rose, June Laverick, Renée Houston, Dermot Walsh, Billie Whitelaw, John Cairney', 'NR', 'Edinburgh surgeon Dr. Robert Knox requires cadavers for his research into the functioning of the human body; local ne''er-do-wells Burke and Hare find ways to provide him with fresh specimens...', 'Edinburgh surgeon Dr. Robert Knox requires cadavers for his research into the functioning of the human body; local ne''er-do-wells Burke and Hare find ways to provide him with fresh specimens...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fCGyjHUtf7gqZToP9kYM7AFcOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52203'),
  ('675507555778365883', 'The Flesh Eaters', 1964, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jack Curtis, Carson Davidson', 'Arnold Drake', 'Martin Kosleck, Byron Sanders, Barbara Wilkin, Rita Morley, Ray Tudor, Barbara Wilson, Ira Lewis, Jack Curtis', null, 'An alcoholic actress, her personal assistant, and their pilot are downed on a secluded isle by bad weather, where a renegade Nazi scientist is using ocean life to develop a solvent for human flesh. The tiny flesh-eating sea critters that result certainly give our heroes a run for their money - and lives.', 'An alcoholic actress, her personal assistant, and their pilot are downed on a secluded isle by bad weather, where a renegade Nazi scientist is using ocean life to develop a solvent for human flesh. The tiny flesh-eating sea critters that result certainly give our heroes a run for their money - and lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpN9HG19LFOJDH0Agdfl95v7Sth.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42793'),
  ('735405083714763445', 'The Flicker', 1966, null, 'Tony Conrad', null, null, null, 'A film consisting of alternating black and white frames.', 'A film consisting of alternating black and white frames.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN2m5GkYltGJI1CZj4rilhTmsV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153180'),
  ('859950370689502964', 'The Flight', 1971, 'Drama, History, War', 'Aleksandr Alov, Vladimir Naumov', 'Aleksandr Alov, Vladimir Naumov', 'Aleksey Batalov, Ludmila Savelyeva, Mikhail Ulyanov, Tatyana Tkach, Vladislav Dvorzhetsky, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Roman Khomyatov, Vladimir Zamanskiy', null, 'The film is about a group of people who in other times wouldn''t have anything in common, some of them innocent bystanders, some moral criminals. But nothing is straightforward and simple. From Russia "the run" continues to Constantinople, to Paris, back to Russia. Some of them have understood that they can''t live outside Russia and go back maybe to be happy, maybe not, some go back to face sure death for their crimes, some don''t go back and know that are going to miss homeland forever, some are comfortably well off (are they?) in exile. Sentimental without syrup, tragic and comical at the same time.', 'The film is about a group of people who in other times wouldn''t have anything in common, some of them innocent bystanders, some moral criminals. But nothing is straightforward and simple. From Russia "the run" continues to Constantinople, to Paris, back to Russia. Some of them have understood that they can''t live outside Russia and go back maybe to be happy, maybe not, some go back to face sure death for their crimes, some don''t go back and know that are going to miss homeland forever, some are comfortably well off (are they?) in exile. Sentimental without syrup, tragic and comical at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1z4IB5rKCNlFcnPhAiSf4ODpqLv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95431'),
  ('906925740007645727', 'The Flight Before Christmas', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Kari Juusonen, Michael Hegner, Mikko Pitkänen', 'Hannu Tuomainen, Marteinn Thorisson', 'Olli Jantunen, Hannu-Pekka Björkman, Vuokko Hovatta, Vesa Vierikko, Jussi Lampi, Risto Kaskilahti, Minttu Mustakallio, Juha Veijonen', null, 'A young reindeer named Niko dreams about flying like his father, whom he has never met. Despite constant teasing from others, he sneaks out of his home valley to take flying lessons from Julius, a flying squirrel.', 'A young reindeer named Niko dreams about flying like his father, whom he has never met. Despite constant teasing from others, he sneaks out of his home valley to take flying lessons from Julius, a flying squirrel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsss4pc3vs4UjsNo2KrNTiELJNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25741'),
  ('945098536358379879', 'The Flight Before Christmas', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Peter Sullivan, Stuart Brereton, James W. Arrington', 'Jennifer Notas Shapiro', 'Mayim Bialik, Ryan McPartlin, Jo Marie Payton, Reginald VelJohnson, Trilby Glover, Candice Azzara, Brian Doyle-Murray, Roxana Ortega', null, 'Two strangers who both happen to be in marketing, share a room at a bed-and-breakfast when a snowstorm strands their flight in Montana on Christmas Eve.', 'Two strangers who both happen to be in marketing, share a room at a bed-and-breakfast when a snowstorm strands their flight in Montana on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3tED3aXQvHA5kK3hkyQsNOUT6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367538'),
  ('521625727091495496', 'The Flight of Dragons', 1982, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Adventure', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr., Fumihiko Takayama', 'Romeo Muller', 'Harry Morgan, James Gregory, John Ritter, Bob McFadden, Alexandra Stoddart, James Earl Jones, Paul Frees, Don Messick', null, 'The realm of magic is being threatened by the realm of logic, so the green wizard, Carolinus, decides to shield it for all time. Ommadon, the evil red wizard, stands in his way. Carolinus then calls for a quest that is to be led by a man named Peter Dickinson, who is the first man of both the realms of science and magic. It is Peter''s job to defeat Ommadon.', 'The realm of magic is being threatened by the realm of logic, so the green wizard, Carolinus, decides to shield it for all time. Ommadon, the evil red wizard, stands in his way. Carolinus then calls for a quest that is to be led by a man named Peter Dickinson, who is the first man of both the realms of science and magic. It is Peter''s job to defeat Ommadon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ta5lQEOBSxyuoOvgLs6CNQMTN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27273'),
  ('964392899642284804', 'The Flight of Mr. McKinley', 1975, 'Science Fiction', 'Fyodor Khitruk, Mikhail Shveitser, Sofiya Milkina', 'Leonid Leonov', 'Donatas Banionis, Zhanna Bolotova, Angelina Stepanova, Boris Babochkin, Alla Demidova, Vladimir Vysotsky, Aleksandr Vokach, Sofya Garrel', null, 'A man decides to escape into the future by the way of hibernation. When he wakes up, feeling lucky that the experiment worked out well, the staff of the hibernation company politely walks him to the outside were he finds a post atomic war desert… He wakes up! Thank God it was just a dream! Or was it?', 'A man decides to escape into the future by the way of hibernation. When he wakes up, feeling lucky that the experiment worked out well, the staff of the hibernation company politely walks him to the outside were he finds a post atomic war desert… He wakes up! Thank God it was just a dream! Or was it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A84t5Y3VW94KTdD18xI3nlfGEZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344798'),
  ('597026015547760354', 'The Flight of the Eagle', 1982, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Jan Troell, Jan Troell, Gunilla Algsjö', 'Ian Rakoff, Klaus Rifbjerg, Jan Troell', 'Max von Sydow, Göran Stangertz, Sverre Anker Ousdal, Clément Harari, Eva von Hanno, Charlotta Larsson, Jan-Olof Strandberg, Henric Holmberg', null, 'The Swedish 19th century engineer Salomon August Andrée sets out to become the first man on the north pole. His idea is to launch a polar expedition using a hydrogen balloon, together with two friends. The balloon, "The Eagle", takes off from Svalbard in 1897, but the three men are never heard from again.', 'The Swedish 19th century engineer Salomon August Andrée sets out to become the first man on the north pole. His idea is to launch a polar expedition using a hydrogen balloon, together with two friends. The balloon, "The Eagle", takes off from Svalbard in 1897, but the three men are never heard from again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azCz5nVSHUuHt3HQ99cZSNf2heA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72785'),
  ('307931559255641682', 'The Flight of the Gossamer Condor', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Ben Shedd', null, null, null, 'The Flight of the Gossamer Condor tells the inspiring true story of history''s first successful human-powered flight. Renowned inventor Dr. Paul MacCready and his team were filmed creating the world-famous pedal-powered airplane as it happened. Producing this film, which documents the development of a man''s dream into a scientific and historic achievement was, in itself, an extraordinary effort. There was an immense risk involved in making a commitment to film a scientist''s effort at achieving something which had never done before successfully. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', 'The Flight of the Gossamer Condor tells the inspiring true story of history''s first successful human-powered flight. Renowned inventor Dr. Paul MacCready and his team were filmed creating the world-famous pedal-powered airplane as it happened. Producing this film, which documents the development of a man''s dream into a scientific and historic achievement was, in itself, an extraordinary effort. There was an immense risk involved in making a commitment to film a scientist''s effort at achieving something which had never done before successfully. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4j10MFbjGFgJissZKrwrzGnYV49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243623'),
  ('69875421628042578', 'The Flight of the Phoenix', 1965, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Robert Aldrich, Joseph F. Biroc, Alan Callow', 'Lukas Heller', 'James Stewart, Richard Attenborough, Peter Finch, Hardy Krüger, Ernest Borgnine, Ian Bannen, Ronald Fraser, Christian Marquand', 'NR', 'A cargo aircraft crashes in a sandstorm in the Sahara with less than a dozen men on board. One of the passengers is an airplane designer who comes up with the idea of ripping off the undamaged wing and using it as the basis for a replacement aircraft they need to build before their food and water run out.', 'A cargo aircraft crashes in a sandstorm in the Sahara with less than a dozen men on board. One of the passengers is an airplane designer who comes up with the idea of ripping off the undamaged wing and using it as the basis for a replacement aircraft they need to build before their food and water run out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrzLl7NWdjwGhVE7bqpOAxMVtF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10243'),
  ('133251599831732336', 'The Flight of the Stork', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julián Pastor', 'Julián Pastor', 'Pedro Armendáriz Jr., José Alonso, Gloria Marín, Guillermo Orea, Fernando Balzaretti, Rosalía Valdés, Elizabeth Aguilar, Lily Garza', null, 'An erotic model has three lovers, one of them is the father of her child. Which of the three will be?', 'An erotic model has three lovers, one of them is the father of her child. Which of the three will be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9KVypyJVyMXkIf7zt5QIkUZdcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340948'),
  ('67400075858507803', 'The Flight That Disappeared', 1961, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ralph Butler, Reginald Le Borg, Gilbert Warrenton', 'Orville H. Hampton, Judith Hart, Ralph Hart', 'Craig Hill, Paula Raymond, Dayton Lummis, John Bryant, Bernadette Hale, Nancy Hale, Brad Trumbull, Jerry James', null, 'A cross-country airliner, whose passengers include a nuclear physicist, a rocket expert, and a mathematical genius, is drawn beyond radar range by an unknown, unbreakable force.', 'A cross-country airliner, whose passengers include a nuclear physicist, a rocket expert, and a mathematical genius, is drawn beyond radar range by an unknown, unbreakable force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9K7TGSErMS8RCTlxCR5G9kFEarI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171861'),
  ('981645328619080265', 'The Flim-Flam Man', 1967, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Irvin Kershner, Charles Lang', 'William Rose', 'George C. Scott, Michael Sarrazin, Sue Lyon, Jack Albertson, Alice Ghostley, Albert Salmi, Slim Pickens, Harry Morgan', 'NR', 'Mordecai Jones, a silver-tongued swindler and self-proclaimed “M.B.S., C.S., D.D.—Master of Back-Stabbing, Cork-Screwing and Double-Dealing,” has made a career out of charming and cheating his way through life. Played with devilish charm by George C. Scott, Jones takes on a new protégé in Curley, a wide-eyed Army deserter eager for direction. Together, they crisscross the backroads of the rural South, pulling off a string of homespun cons while staying one step ahead of a relentless local sheriff. Along the way, Curley falls for Bonnie Lee Packard, a rebellious heiress who joins their misadventures. But as the scams grow riskier, Curley begins to wonder whether a life of flimflam is worth the price. With its colorful characters, offbeat humor, and standout performance by Scott, The Flim-Flam Man is a rollicking Southern caper about cons, conscience, and unlikely camaraderie.', 'Mordecai Jones, a silver-tongued swindler and self-proclaimed “M.B.S., C.S., D.D.—Master of Back-Stabbing, Cork-Screwing and Double-Dealing,” has made a career out of charming and cheating his way through life. Played with devilish charm by George C. Scott, Jones takes on a new protégé in Curley, a wide-eyed Army deserter eager for direction. Together, they crisscross the backroads of the rural South, pulling off a string of homespun cons while staying one step ahead of a relentless local sheriff. Along the way, Curley falls for Bonnie Lee Packard, a rebellious heiress who joins their misadventures. But as the scams grow riskier, Curley begins to wonder whether a life of flimflam is worth the price. With its colorful characters, offbeat humor, and standout performance by Scott, The Flim-Flam Man is a rollicking Southern caper about cons, conscience, and unlikely camaraderie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNKLe9v0ioYM6foZ3hGFaPTcQYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42407'),
  ('1101836171162461892', 'The Flintstone Kids'' "Just Say No" Special', 1988, 'Animation', 'Ray Patterson, Carl Urbano', 'Laren Bright, Lane Raichert', 'Scott Menville, Elizabeth Lyn Fraser, Hamilton Camp, B.J. Ward, Bumper Robinson, Dana Hill, Shuko Akune, David Markus', null, 'A special that shows the young Flintstones trying to raise money so they can go to a concert. The story takes a turn when older kids try to push drugs on them.', 'A special that shows the young Flintstones trying to raise money so they can go to a concert. The story takes a turn when older kids try to push drugs on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDZaGLI8Hvs9pIAPgSOzvEoXJLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655025'),
  ('765841815307056306', 'The Flintstones', 1994, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Brian Levant, Bill Getty, Richard Olso', 'Michael J. Wilson', 'John Goodman, Elizabeth Perkins, Rick Moranis, Rosie O''Donnell, Kyle MacLachlan, Halle Berry, Elizabeth Taylor, Dann Florek', 'PG', 'Modern Stone Age family the Flintstones hit the big screen in this live-action version of the classic cartoon. Fred helps Barney adopt a child. Barney sees an opportunity to repay him when Slate Mining tests its employees to find a new executive. But no good deed goes unpunished.', 'Modern Stone Age family the Flintstones hit the big screen in this live-action version of the classic cartoon. Fred helps Barney adopt a child. Barney sees an opportunity to repay him when Slate Mining tests its employees to find a new executive. But no good deed goes unpunished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7gkf5Wa8YZ9iyEOylBMfw9pnkp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888'),
  ('892728657332288335', 'The Flintstones and WWE: Stone Age SmackDown!', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure, Action', 'Tony Cervone, Spike Brandt', 'Jed Elinoff, Scott Thomas', 'Jeff Bergman, Kevin Michael Richardson, Tress MacNeille, Grey DeLisle, Eric Bauza, John O''Hurley, Russi Taylor, John Cena', 'NR', 'The WWE comes to town in the new animated film teaming the Flintstones with Bedrock-ready versions of John Cena, Daniel Bryan and more.', 'The WWE comes to town in the new animated film teaming the Flintstones with Bedrock-ready versions of John Cena, Daniel Bryan and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEC1hwyG7pJaUazMtiroc31e3gK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308447'),
  ('608721805675179922', 'The Flintstones in Viva Rock Vegas', 2000, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Brian Levant, Jamie Anderson, Eric Heffron', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', 'Mark Addy, Stephen Baldwin, Kristen Johnston, Jane Krakowski, Joan Collins, Thomas Gibson, Alan Cumming, Harvey Korman', 'PG', 'The Flintstones are at it again. The Flintstones and the Rubbles head for Rock Vegas with Fred hoping to court the lovely Wilma. Nothing will stand in the way of love, except for the conniving Chip Rockefeller who is the playboy born in Baysville but who has made it in the cutthroat town of Rock Vegas. Will Fred win Wilma''s love?', 'The Flintstones are at it again. The Flintstones and the Rubbles head for Rock Vegas with Fred hoping to court the lovely Wilma. Nothing will stand in the way of love, except for the conniving Chip Rockefeller who is the playboy born in Baysville but who has made it in the cutthroat town of Rock Vegas. Will Fred win Wilma''s love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTcf60dqziF7xU2amxIIsvrnkTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889'),
  ('491686549752713632', 'The Flintstones Meet Rockula and Frankenstone', 1979, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Ray Patterson', null, 'Henry Corden, Jean Vander Pyl, Mel Blanc, Gay Autterson, Casey Kasem, Ted Cassidy, John Stephenson, Don Messick', null, 'The Flintstones and the Rubbles win a trip on "Make a Deal or Don''t" to Count Rockula''s castle in Rocksylvania, where they have an unpleasant meeting with the Count and his servant, Frankenstone.', 'The Flintstones and the Rubbles win a trip on "Make a Deal or Don''t" to Count Rockula''s castle in Rocksylvania, where they have an unpleasant meeting with the Count and his servant, Frankenstone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndNmc7aQVzalas9Kb6cn3g4pYSb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99306'),
