  ('177884190795646435', 'The Flintstones: Hollyrock a Bye Baby', 1993, 'Family, Animation', 'William Hanna, Kris Zimmerman', 'Mark Seidenberg, Rich Fogel', 'Henry Corden, Jean Vander Pyl, Frank Welker, Kath Soucie, Jerry Houser, Russi Taylor, B.J. Ward, Don Messick', null, 'Newlyweds Pebbles Flintstone and Bamm Bamm Rubble are expecting a newborn, so Fred and Wilma head for Hollyrock to help them cope.', 'Newlyweds Pebbles Flintstone and Bamm Bamm Rubble are expecting a newborn, so Fred and Wilma head for Hollyrock to help them cope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7f4BP4Vnd8LK8iCNtMxRCAePLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342708'),
  ('1064263163616195308', 'The Flintstones: Little Big League', 1978, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Chris Cuddington', 'Jameson Brewer', 'Henry Corden, Mel Blanc, Jean Vander Pyl, Gay Autterson, Frank Welker, John Stephenson, Ted Cassidy, Herb Vigran', null, 'Fred manages a little league baseball team that seems absolutely hopeless, except for a player that he blindly refuses to recognize.', 'Fred manages a little league baseball team that seems absolutely hopeless, except for a player that he blindly refuses to recognize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48dUNhfkHJuMFmz1ITNu5mhyyti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98634'),
  ('243318945694560086', 'The Flintstones: Wind-Up Wilma', 1981, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chris Cuddington, Carl Urbano', 'Len Janson', 'Henry Corden, Mel Blanc, Jean Vander Pyl, Gay Autterson, John Stephenson, Julie McWhirter, Don Messick, Joe Baker', null, 'Wilma is a celebrity when she gets a shot at the big leagues and becomes a pitcher for the Bedrock Dodgers after nailing a couple of robbers with a melon at the grocery store; however, she and Fred argue over her ambition to pitch for the team because Fred thinks a woman''s place is in the home.', 'Wilma is a celebrity when she gets a shot at the big leagues and becomes a pitcher for the Bedrock Dodgers after nailing a couple of robbers with a melon at the grocery store; however, she and Fred argue over her ambition to pitch for the team because Fred thinks a woman''s place is in the home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16ldn3fyeGPxmx6ZDHZYZq4uH6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442375'),
  ('187933572469345302', 'The Flintstones'' New Neighbors', 1980, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Horror, TV Movie', 'Carl Urbano', 'Willie Gilbert', 'Henry Corden, Mel Blanc, Gay Autterson, Jean Vander Pyl, Don Messick, John Stephenson, Patricia Parris, Jim MacGeorge', 'PG', 'Fred is annoyed when an eerie new house is built next door, inhabited by the Frankenstone family.', 'Fred is annoyed when an eerie new house is built next door, inhabited by the Frankenstone family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnSwWN719PgK9Lszg1lJjiabidA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268979'),
  ('66764157457831527', 'The Flirtation of Girls', 1949, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Anwar Wagdi, Mounir Mourad, Abdel Halim Nasr', 'Naguib ElRihani, Anwar Wagdi, Badie'' Khayri', 'Naguib ElRihani, Leila Mourad, Anwar Wagdi, Mahmoud El Meligy, Soliman Naguib, Abdel Warith Assir, Youssef Wahby, Stephan Rosti', null, 'Hamam is a poor Arabic language teacher who gets sacked from a girls'' elementary school for not being able to control mischievous students. He feels pessimistic about everything in life,but his freind,an employee working for a pasha finds him a job as a private teacher for his only daughter Laila in order to help her pass an exam. Laila treats Hamam like a friend and helps him to appreciate life and enjoy its qualities,and the man soon is drawn to her.', 'Hamam is a poor Arabic language teacher who gets sacked from a girls'' elementary school for not being able to control mischievous students. He feels pessimistic about everything in life,but his freind,an employee working for a pasha finds him a job as a private teacher for his only daughter Laila in order to help her pass an exam. Laila treats Hamam like a friend and helps him to appreciate life and enjoy its qualities,and the man soon is drawn to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdDV6k23csveAXNaQVqxv3g7Hm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193412'),
  ('741967630639044776', 'The Floating Castle', 2012, 'History, Comedy, Drama', 'Shinji Higuchi, Isshin Inudo, Motonobu Kiyoku', 'Ryo Wada', 'Mansai Nomura, Nana Eikura, Hiroki Narimiya, Tomomitsu Yamaguchi, Koichi Sato, Masachika Ichimura, Takehiro Hira, Takayuki Yamada', null, 'In the year 1590, the mighty warlord Toyotomi Hideyoshi is close to fulfilling his ambition of unifying all of Japan under his banner when he comes across unexpected resistance in the form of a floating fortress known as Oshi Castle. Narita Nagachika, a frivolous hedonistic fellow and unlikely candidate for the position of rebel general, finds himself in charge of defending the castle. His odds? An army of 500 men to combat Toyotomi Hideyoshi''s army of 20,000.', 'In the year 1590, the mighty warlord Toyotomi Hideyoshi is close to fulfilling his ambition of unifying all of Japan under his banner when he comes across unexpected resistance in the form of a floating fortress known as Oshi Castle. Narita Nagachika, a frivolous hedonistic fellow and unlikely candidate for the position of rebel general, finds himself in charge of defending the castle. His odds? An army of 500 men to combat Toyotomi Hideyoshi''s army of 20,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpZOUmSR7Kq29efyWLYKkylsPoB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209032'),
  ('777310114855319092', 'The Flock', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Enrique Chediak, Philip Seeger', 'Hans Bauer, Craig Mitchell', 'Richard Gere, Claire Danes, KaDee Strickland, Ray Wise, Russell Sams, Avril Lavigne, Kristina Romero, Dwayne L. Barnes', 'R', 'Erroll Babbage has spent his career tracking sex offenders and his unorthodox methods are nearly as brutal as the criminals he monitors. When he links one of his deranged parolees to the disappearance of a local girl, he and his new partner must scour the S&M underground to find her before it''s too late.', 'Erroll Babbage has spent his career tracking sex offenders and his unorthodox methods are nearly as brutal as the criminals he monitors. When he links one of his deranged parolees to the disappearance of a local girl, he and his new partner must scour the S&M underground to find her before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baGgc6giS6kMBnsNbwH6WuybXn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14148'),
  ('784937612496052479', 'The Flood', 2023, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Wendy Wallace, Gavin Peretti, Brandon Slagle', 'Josh Ridgway, Chad Law', 'Casper Van Dien, Nicky Whelan, Louis Mandylor, Kim DeLonghi, Devanny Pinn, Ryan Francis, Eoin O''Brien, Randall J. Bacon', 'R', 'A horde of giant hungry alligators is unleashed on a group of in-transit prisoners and their guards after a massive hurricane floods Louisiana.', 'A horde of giant hungry alligators is unleashed on a group of in-transit prisoners and their guards after a massive hurricane floods Louisiana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvjqqklMpHwOxc40rn7dMhGT0Fc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006462'),
  ('129161281550245331', 'The Flood', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Mathilde Snodgrass, Rose Aste, Natalia Fago', 'Gianluca Jodice, Filippo Gravino', 'Guillaume Canet, Mélanie Laurent, Aurore Broutin, Hugo Dillon, Roxane Duran, Anouk Darwin Homewood, Vidal Arzoni, Fabrizio Rongione', null, '1792. Louis XVI, his wife Marie Antoinette, and their children have been arrested and imprisoned in the Tour du Temple, a sinister chateau in Paris, awaiting their trial. Far from the splendour of Versailles, they are isolated and vulnerable for the first time in their lives.', '1792. Louis XVI, his wife Marie Antoinette, and their children have been arrested and imprisoned in the Tour du Temple, a sinister chateau in Paris, awaiting their trial. Far from the splendour of Versailles, they are isolated and vulnerable for the first time in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSmtF1eGhqPy1x4sO42pqSmHnCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1091275'),
  ('396120549144496754', 'The Flood: Who Will Save Our Children?', 1993, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Chris Thomson, Barry M. Wilson', null, 'Joe Spano, David Lascher, Michael A. Goorjian, Amy Van Nostrand, Norm Skaggs, Renée O''Connor, Scott Michael Campbell, Blayne Weaver', null, 'In rural Comfort, Texas, the strict protestant Horizon Bible church community holds its annual, pretty strictly supervised summer camp, with mandatory prayer sessions, for fraternizing teens from all over the States. The day before their departure, storm weather is announced, the busses even ride early to keep ahead, but the wind makes a river rise too fast: the busses are caught, everybody must run on foot. As TV reporters see from their helicopter, the rising water is too fast for one bus after choosing the wrong way, children and staff must climb in trees but can''t cling on very long.', 'In rural Comfort, Texas, the strict protestant Horizon Bible church community holds its annual, pretty strictly supervised summer camp, with mandatory prayer sessions, for fraternizing teens from all over the States. The day before their departure, storm weather is announced, the busses even ride early to keep ahead, but the wind makes a river rise too fast: the busses are caught, everybody must run on foot. As TV reporters see from their helicopter, the rising water is too fast for one bus after choosing the wrong way, children and staff must climb in trees but can''t cling on very long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwRbDCmMeo0z5mshjUrMXxRxLRs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244123'),
  ('939014122205978243', 'The Floorwalker', 1916, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, Roland Totheroh, Frank D. Williams', 'Vincent Bryan, Maverick Terrell, Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Eric Campbell, Edna Purviance, Lloyd Bacon, Charlotte Mineau, Albert Austin, Leo White, Frank J. Coleman', null, 'An impecunious customer creates chaos in a department store while the manager and his assistant plot to steal the money kept in the establishment''s safe.', 'An impecunious customer creates chaos in a department store while the manager and his assistant plot to steal the money kept in the establishment''s safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8sb9XlE0U3Ox8KIX2iGbTMKk5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53416'),
  ('438214478541332293', 'The Florentine', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nick Stagliano, Mikki Ziska, Michael Barrett', 'Tom Benson, Damien Gray', 'Michael Madsen, Chris Penn, Virginia Madsen, Jeremy Davies, Luke Perry, Tom Sizemore, Hal Holbrook, Jim Belushi', 'R', 'A slice-of-life story unfolds inside The Florentine, a bar in a Pennsylvania steel town whose brightest days are behind it, leaving behind many of life''s disillusioned "losers." Its owner, Whitey, is deep in debt to the town''s loan shark, Joe McCollough, and desperate for a path forward which won''t cost him the bar. His sister, Molly, is days away from her long-awaited nuptials, and then her former fiancé, Teddy, shows up in town for the first time since leaving her at the altar years before. Ne''er-do-well Billy Belasco runs a con on Frankie to steal the money for the wedding caterer, while long-time regular Bobby becomes a patron-cum-inhabitant as he hides from his fast-crumbling marriage to Vikki. Every plot in this multi-layered story seems to be at its nadir just as a pair of unlikely heroes emerge out of the backdrop to turn everything around.', 'A slice-of-life story unfolds inside The Florentine, a bar in a Pennsylvania steel town whose brightest days are behind it, leaving behind many of life''s disillusioned "losers." Its owner, Whitey, is deep in debt to the town''s loan shark, Joe McCollough, and desperate for a path forward which won''t cost him the bar. His sister, Molly, is days away from her long-awaited nuptials, and then her former fiancé, Teddy, shows up in town for the first time since leaving her at the altar years before. Ne''er-do-well Billy Belasco runs a con on Frankie to steal the money for the wedding caterer, while long-time regular Bobby becomes a patron-cum-inhabitant as he hides from his fast-crumbling marriage to Vikki. Every plot in this multi-layered story seems to be at its nadir just as a pair of unlikely heroes emerge out of the backdrop to turn everything around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sErgwOIFeP4cvg93HotWEyDMGhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123455'),
  ('1042706376064781826', 'The Florida Project', 2017, 'Drama', 'Sean Baker, Marten W. Piccinini, Alexis Zabé', 'Sean Baker, Chris Bergoch', 'Brooklynn Prince, Bria Vinaite, Willem Dafoe, Christopher Rivera, Valeria Cotto, Mela Murder, Josie Olivo, Caleb Landry Jones', 'R', 'The story of a precocious six year-old and her ragtag group of friends whose summer break is filled with childhood wonder, possibility and a sense of adventure while the adults around them struggle with hard times.', 'The story of a precocious six year-old and her ragtag group of friends whose summer break is filled with childhood wonder, possibility and a sense of adventure while the adults around them struggle with hard times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QnDxdJg1fi6uMSkSi4x8tHsltm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394117'),
  ('306117058255796898', 'The Flower in Hell', 1958, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lee Gye-chang, Shin Sang-ok, Kang Beom-gu', 'Lee Jeong-seon', 'Choi Eun-hee, Kim Hak, Jo Hae-won, Gang Seon-hui, Nam Chun-yeok, Jo Seok-geun, Beak Song', null, 'In post-Korean War Seoul, a young man from the countryside discovers that his older brother has become romantically involved in a prostitute and has no intentions of returning home.', 'In post-Korean War Seoul, a young man from the countryside discovers that his older brother has become romantically involved in a prostitute and has no intentions of returning home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iEtHj4oPyuVXEb0nPGiqBINNJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84660'),
  ('833418415028020603', 'The Flower in His Mouth', 1975, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Luigi Zampa, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Piero De Bernardi, Luigi Zampa, Leonardo Benvenuti', 'Jennifer O''Neill, Franco Nero, James Mason, Aldo Giuffrè, Franco Fabrizi, Orazio Orlando, Claudio Gora, Luigi Bonos', null, 'A female school teacher is implicated in a murder in a Sicilian town only hours after her arrival. The dead man insulted her on the bus on the way into town. As the mystery unfolds, it becomes clear that the town is hiding some very sinister secrets.', 'A female school teacher is implicated in a murder in a Sicilian town only hours after her arrival. The dead man insulted her on the bus on the way into town. As the mystery unfolds, it becomes clear that the town is hiding some very sinister secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryumI43JCKfYlGytDMjQpz8dR66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101231'),
  ('1064233601019049410', 'The Flower of Evil', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Claude Chabrol, Eduardo Serra, Cécile Maistre-Chabrol', 'Claude Chabrol, Caroline Eliacheff, Louise L. Lambrichs', 'Nathalie Baye, Benoît Magimel, Suzanne Flon, Bernard Le Coq, Thomas Chabrol, Mélanie Doutey, Henri Attal, Kevin Ahyi', null, 'Three generations of a wealthy Bordeaux family are caught in the crossfire when Anne decides to run for mayor, thanks to a political pamphlet that revives an old murder scandal.', 'Three generations of a wealthy Bordeaux family are caught in the crossfire when Anne decides to run for mayor, thanks to a political pamphlet that revives an old murder scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbOV3t9rQMkLaARTkb4DumTdJdw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10930'),
  ('977862779945414113', 'The Flower of My Secret', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pedro Almodóvar, Covadonga R. Gamboa, Ana Muñoz', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Marisa Paredes, Juan Echanove, Carme Elias, Rossy de Palma, Chus Lampreave, Kiti Mánver, Joaquín Cortés, Manuela Vargas', 'R', 'Middle-aged romance author Leo writes under a pseudonym, since she despises her own work. At home, her husband, who works overseas, is distant both physically and emotionally. As she reevaluates her life and writing, Leo is led to an unexpected relationship with Ángel, a sensitive newspaper editor.', 'Middle-aged romance author Leo writes under a pseudonym, since she despises her own work. At home, her husband, who works overseas, is distant both physically and emotionally. As she reevaluates her life and writing, Leo is led to an unexpected relationship with Ángel, a sensitive newspaper editor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u172NHV9SvqgVDSyRayJIPK2Brl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4307'),
  ('1111162159253911439', 'The Flower with Seven Colours', 1948, 'Animation', 'Mikhail Tsekhanovskiy', 'Mikhail Volpin, Valentin Kataev', null, null, 'A little girl is walking around the city with a bunch of bagels. All the bagels are eaten by a dog that follows her while the little girl was looking around. The girl is upset, but she is comforted by her grandmother, who gives her a magic flower that grants wishes...', 'A little girl is walking around the city with a bunch of bagels. All the bagels are eaten by a dog that follows her while the little girl was looking around. The girl is upset, but she is comforted by her grandmother, who gives her a magic flower that grants wishes...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utzu2LELeILfSdkXrHWxWArLSq2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419946'),
  ('396589616295557423', 'The Flowers of Evil', 2019, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Shin Hayasaka, Noboru Iguchi, Chûkon Minami', 'Mari Okada', 'Kentaro Ito, Tina Tamashiro, Shiori Akita, Marie Iitoyo, Miho Kitagawa, Takara Sakumoto, Taketo Tanaka, Wakana Matsumoto', null, 'A high school student steals the panties of a girl he likes but is witnessed, which sets off a chain of events that send his life and the lives of others around him out of control.', 'A high school student steals the panties of a girl he likes but is witnessed, which sets off a chain of events that send his life and the lives of others around him out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RnkLCr7pVyhDPSuTz0dFVerwU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572628'),
  ('358969941237223552', 'The Flowers of St. Francis', 1950, 'Drama, History', 'Brunello Rondi, Marcello Caracciolo Di Laurino, Roberto Rossellini', 'Brunello Rondi, Félix Morlión, Federico Fellini', 'Aldo Fabrizi, Gianfranco Bellini, Peparuolo, Severino Pisacane, Roberto Sorrentino, Nazario Gerardi, Arabella Lemaitre, Renzo Rossellini', 'NR', 'In a series of simple and joyous vignettes, director Roberto Rossellini and co-writer Federico Fellini lovingly convey the universal teachings of the People’s Saint: humility, compassion, faith, and sacrifice. Gorgeously photographed to evoke the medieval paintings of Saint Francis’s time, and cast with monks from the Nocera Inferiore Monastery, The Flowers of St. Francis is a timeless and moving portrait of the search for spiritual enlightenment.', 'In a series of simple and joyous vignettes, director Roberto Rossellini and co-writer Federico Fellini lovingly convey the universal teachings of the People’s Saint: humility, compassion, faith, and sacrifice. Gorgeously photographed to evoke the medieval paintings of Saint Francis’s time, and cast with monks from the Nocera Inferiore Monastery, The Flowers of St. Francis is a timeless and moving portrait of the search for spiritual enlightenment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4db6zjmJK4D5gEzQ0V5JTkRo0X5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56518'),
  ('1021161077284839853', 'The Flowers of War', 2011, 'Drama, History, War', 'Zhang Yimou, Zhao Xiaoding, Zhang Mo', 'Liu Heng', 'Christian Bale, Ni Ni, Tong Dawei, Zhang Xinyi, Shigeo Kobayashi, Atsuro Watabe, Shawn Dou, Paul Schneider', 'R', 'A Westerner finds refuge with a group of women in a church during Japan''s rape of Nanking in 1937. Posing as a priest, he attempts to lead the women to safety.', 'A Westerner finds refuge with a group of women in a church during Japan''s rape of Nanking in 1937. Posing as a priest, he attempts to lead the women to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NVgVX663tdareijAiv0eLiLn6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76758'),
  ('898831792836287407', 'The Flu', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kim Sung-soo, Kim Min-beom, Lee Seong-hwan', 'Kim Sung-soo, Lee Young-jong', 'Jang Hyuk, Soo Ae, Park Min-ha, Yoo Hai-jin, Don Lee, Lee Hee-jun, Lee Sang-yeob, Cha In-pyo', 'R', 'A case of the flu quickly morphs into a pandemic. As the death toll mounts and the living panic, the government plans extreme measures to contain it.', 'A case of the flu quickly morphs into a pandemic. As the death toll mounts and the living panic, the government plans extreme measures to contain it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvTXhTddHIZbOU9pmrcPODI1kRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200085'),
  ('915826848491929192', 'The Fluffer', 2001, 'Drama', 'Richard Glatzer, Wash Westmoreland, Mark Putnam', 'Wash Westmoreland', 'Scott Gurney, Michael Cunio, Roxanne Day, Taylor Negron, Debbie Harry, Penn Badgley, Adina Porter, Richard Riehle', 'R', 'Self-effacing, boyish Sean moves to LA to pursue a career in movies but finds it tougher than he imagined. He stumbles onto porn star Johnny Rebel - a handsome, muscled dream of men and women alike - who awakens Sean’s deep obsession.', 'Self-effacing, boyish Sean moves to LA to pursue a career in movies but finds it tougher than he imagined. He stumbles onto porn star Johnny Rebel - a handsome, muscled dream of men and women alike - who awakens Sean’s deep obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9WPBJnSwb9vhGfOXeH10mXQpO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17731'),
  ('450910436609276358', 'The Fluffy Movie', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Manny Rodriguez, Larry Blanford, Jay Lavender', 'Gabriel Iglesias', 'Gabriel Iglesias, Jacqueline Obradors, Gina Brillon, Alfred Robles, Armando Cosio, Rick Gutierrez, Eddie ''Piolin'' Sotelo, Jeremy Ray Valdez', 'PG-13', 'Stand-up comic Gabriel Iglesias delights audiences during his sold-out "Unity Through Laughter" tour, which spans more than 400 cities in 23 countries. During his set, Iglesias -- nicknamed "Fluffy" -- pounces on topics like communicating with his teenage son, struggling with his weight, performing his concert tour across India, and handling the reappearance of his father after a 30-year absence.', 'Stand-up comic Gabriel Iglesias delights audiences during his sold-out "Unity Through Laughter" tour, which spans more than 400 cities in 23 countries. During his set, Iglesias -- nicknamed "Fluffy" -- pounces on topics like communicating with his teenage son, struggling with his weight, performing his concert tour across India, and handling the reappearance of his father after a 30-year absence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nD2B6gdFhmDdLeS2KjoM3vyJMBy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256273'),
  ('438071388388125518', 'The Flute and the Arrow', 1957, 'Drama, Documentary, Adventure', 'Arne Sucksdorff', 'Arne Sucksdorff', 'Chendru, Tengru-Shikari, Ginjo, Riga, Martin Held', null, 'Arne Sucksdorff’s ethnographic feature documents the life and rituals of the Muria people in the Bastar jungle of central India, focusing on their traditions, music, and relationship to the natural environment. Presented with Sucksdorff’s lyrical visual style, the film was selected for the 1958 Cannes Film Festival.', 'Arne Sucksdorff’s ethnographic feature documents the life and rituals of the Muria people in the Bastar jungle of central India, focusing on their traditions, music, and relationship to the natural environment. Presented with Sucksdorff’s lyrical visual style, the film was selected for the 1958 Cannes Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rz98qOP5rBzYFOsPjWKL1iZE0U5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199183'),
  ('716443679247997391', 'The Fly', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Drama', 'Kurt Neumann, Karl Struss, Jack Gertsman', 'James Clavell', 'David Hedison, Patricia Owens, Vincent Price, Herbert Marshall, Kathleen Freeman, Betty Lou Gerson, Charles Herbert, Eugene Borden', null, 'Industrialist François Delambre is called late at night by his sister-in-law, Helene, who tells him that she has just killed her husband. Reluctant at first, she eventually explains to the police that he invented a matter transportation apparatus and, while experimenting on himself, a fly entered the chamber.', 'Industrialist François Delambre is called late at night by his sister-in-law, Helene, who tells him that she has just killed her husband. Reluctant at first, she eventually explains to the police that he invented a matter transportation apparatus and, while experimenting on himself, a fly entered the chamber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXdBcDh2EbgSIf4Oo1dxKapZM2f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11815'),
  ('1107163146250126292', 'The Fly', 1967, 'Animation', 'Aleksandar Marks, Vladimir Jutriša', 'Aleksandar Marks, Vatroslav Mimica', null, null, 'A man is standing in the scene when a fly arrives and begins to irritate him. He tries to swat the fly, but it keeps growing bigger to the point where it shatters the scene. Eventually, the man and the fly decide to negotiate.', 'A man is standing in the scene when a fly arrives and begins to irritate him. He tries to swat the fly, but it keeps growing bigger to the point where it shatters the scene. Eventually, the man and the fly decide to negotiate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zj4AX0t3LOFvE6IVEV6hnc31DR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147975'),
  ('1010764351662283568', 'The Fly', 1980, 'Animation', 'Zoltán Bacsó, Ferenc Rófusz', 'Ferenc Rófusz', null, null, 'A fine day in the life of a fly presented completely from the fly''s point of view. A fine day until something dreary happens, that is.', 'A fine day in the life of a fly presented completely from the fly''s point of view. A fine day until something dreary happens, that is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6JKhmA8Jbf6ka4UUzNUlb5jVsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47466'),
  ('1064812167977813366', 'The Fly', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Cronenberg, Mark Irwin, John Board', 'Charles Edward Pogue, David Cronenberg', 'Jeff Goldblum, Geena Davis, John Getz, Joy Boushel, Leslie Carlson, George Chuvalo, Michael Copeman, David Cronenberg', 'R', 'When Seth Brundle makes a huge scientific and technological breakthrough in teleportation, he decides to test it on himself. Unbeknownst to him, a common housefly manages to get inside the device and the two become one.', 'When Seth Brundle makes a huge scientific and technological breakthrough in teleportation, he decides to test it on himself. Unbeknownst to him, a common housefly manages to get inside the device and the two become one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gZWMhJHRvaXdXsNhERtqNHYpH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9426'),
  ('619982687566777730', 'The Fly II', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Chris Walas, Robin Vidgeon, Glen W. Pearson', 'Jim Wheat, Ken Wheat, Frank Darabont', 'Eric Stoltz, Daphne Zuniga, Lee Richardson, John Getz, Frank C. Turner, Ann Marie Lee, Garry Chalk, Saffron Henderson', 'R', 'Martin Brundle, born of the human/fly, is adopted by his father''s place of employment (Bartok Inc.) while the employees simply wait for his mutant chromosomes to come out of their dormant state.', 'Martin Brundle, born of the human/fly, is adopted by his father''s place of employment (Bartok Inc.) while the employees simply wait for his mutant chromosomes to come out of their dormant state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gORksEPahEgO409HYJOZlNVyEpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10344'),
  ('725542514560121065', 'The Flyboys', 2008, 'Adventure, Action, Crime', 'Rocco DeVilliers, Jim Orr, Craig L. Steiner', 'Jason DeVilliers, Richard Dutcher, Rocco DeVilliers', 'Jesse James, Reiley McClendon, Stephen Baldwin, Tom Sizemore, J. Todd Adams, Dallen Gettling, Jennifer Slimko, Robert Costanzo', 'PG-13', 'Two boys from a small town find their courage tested when they accidentally stow away aboard an airplane owned by the mob...', 'Two boys from a small town find their courage tested when they accidentally stow away aboard an airplane owned by the mob...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQoxndesKFNyG3895L0yiVcVJUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20789'),
  ('772371470268233789', 'The Flying Ace', 1926, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Richard E. Norman', 'Richard E. Norman', 'Laurence Criner, Kathryn Boyd, Boise De Legge, Harold Platts, Lions Daniels, George Colvin, Sam Jordan, R.L. Brown', null, 'A veteran World War I fighter pilot returns home a war hero and immediately regains his former job as a railroad company detective. His first case: recover a stolen satchel filled with $25,000 of company payroll, locate a missing employee, and capture a gang of railroad thieves.', 'A veteran World War I fighter pilot returns home a war hero and immediately regains his former job as a railroad company detective. His first case: recover a stolen satchel filled with $25,000 of company payroll, locate a missing employee, and capture a gang of railroad thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCHQHQ3lymWn2KYDdLacH4kUCG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329662'),
  ('685247299140563982', 'The Flying Car', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Dawn Bridgewater, Scott Mosier, Kevin Smith', 'Kevin Smith', 'Jeff Anderson, Brian O''Halloran', 'NR', 'Stuck in a traffic jam, Dante and Randal discuss the prospect of a flying car.', 'Stuck in a traffic jam, Dante and Randal discuss the prospect of a flying car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGozrLfHjefLlPvG8P5g4A84fCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87233'),
  ('789600525460822373', 'The Flying Cat', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, null, 'NR', 'When Jerry befriends a canary, Tom finds it necessary to construct a makeshift pair of wings.', 'When Jerry befriends a canary, Tom finds it necessary to construct a makeshift pair of wings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkLOdlJl7M8UieXlpuxBQF8pDlu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69116'),
  ('331847594673018908', 'The Flying Classroom', 1954, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Kurt Hoffmann, Friedl Behn-Grund', 'Erich Kästner', 'Paul Dahlke, Heliane Bei, Paul Klinger, Peter Vogel, Peter Tost, Bert Brandt, Knut Mahlke, Herbert Kroll', null, 'The third form of a boarding school and the students of a neighboring school do not get along. Each side dreams up the craziest pranks to defeat the other. And when one day the high school students go as far as stealing the Gymnasium students’ essays and even burning them, daily school life really gets out of hand.', 'The third form of a boarding school and the students of a neighboring school do not get along. Each side dreams up the craziest pranks to defeat the other. And when one day the high school students go as far as stealing the Gymnasium students’ essays and even burning them, daily school life really gets out of hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKD76ErMbDJYtH6xemaBXksIcIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12781'),
  ('455403386474845992', 'The Flying Classroom', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Werner Jacobs, Wolfgang Treu', 'Franz Seitz Junior', 'Joachim Fuchsberger, Heinz Reincke, Diana Körner, Bernd Herzsprung, Tilo von Berlepsch, Robert Jarczyk, Alois Mittermaier, Otto Bolesch', null, 'A boy who was once a perpetual outcast finds friends in a new boarding school, united with his new peers gets involved in a heated rivalry with a group of students from a neighboring school.', 'A boy who was once a perpetual outcast finds friends in a new boarding school, united with his new peers gets involved in a heated rivalry with a group of students from a neighboring school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfwOlnkpfMI1h4bDtKkvKg7ilnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11642'),
  ('31938611509967880', 'The Flying Classroom', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Peter von Haller, Tomy Wigand', 'Hermine Kunka', 'Ulrich Noethen, Sebastian Koch, Piet Klocke, Anja Kling, Frederick Lau, François Goeske, Hauke Diekamp, Philipp Peters-Arnolds', null, 'A boy who was once a perpetual outcast finds friends in a new boarding school. United with his new peers, he gets involved in a heated rivalry with a group of students from a neighboring school.', 'A boy who was once a perpetual outcast finds friends in a new boarding school. United with his new peers, he gets involved in a heated rivalry with a group of students from a neighboring school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jI28MbNtjz9WV1NY9W7qARPNSfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10519'),
  ('338912409320546079', 'The Flying Classroom', 2023, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Moritz Anton, Nina Haun, Andrea Picht', 'Gerrit Hermans', 'Leni Deschner, Lovena Börschmann Ziegler, Morten Völlger, Wanja Valentin Kube, Jördis Triebel, Tom Schilling, Hannah Herzsprung, Trystan Pütter', null, 'When young Martina takes up a scholarship at the Johann-Sigismund Gymnasium boarding school, she finds herself caught in the rivalry between the boarders and the "externals" from the local village.', 'When young Martina takes up a scholarship at the Johann-Sigismund Gymnasium boarding school, she finds herself caught in the rivalry between the boarders and the "externals" from the local village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0v39CbaD6RGHK1HCx9zQHrcaZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1124368'),
  ('1023741220870143089', 'The Flying Dagger', 1969, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Kuang Han-Lu, Hsiung Ting-Wu', 'Chang Cheh, Lee Chi-Sin', 'Cheng Pei-Pei, Lo Lieh, Cheng Lui, Yang Chi-Ching, Ching Miao, Lam Kau, Chui Chung-Hok, Lee Ho', null, 'The Yu family earn the ire of the Green Dragon clan when the daughter kills the clan chief''s son. The Green Dragon chief wounds family head Yu Yuan with his flying daggers, and kills many others who try to protect the noble family. Wandering swordsman Ying Qing saves the family in a fight, using his own flying dagger skills, but his allegiances and motives are unclear.', 'The Yu family earn the ire of the Green Dragon clan when the daughter kills the clan chief''s son. The Green Dragon chief wounds family head Yu Yuan with his flying daggers, and kills many others who try to protect the noble family. Wandering swordsman Ying Qing saves the family in a fight, using his own flying dagger skills, but his allegiances and motives are unclear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8QYbOA53pwV8e0UBG7poOEjZp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156007'),
  ('566486863462005621', 'The Flying Deuces', 1939, 'Comedy, War', 'A. Edward Sutherland, Robert Stillman, Art Lloyd', 'Ralph Spence, Charley Rogers, Fred Schiller', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Jean Parker, Reginald Gardiner, Charles Middleton, Jean Del Val, Crane Whitley, James Finlayson', 'NR', 'Ollie falls in love with a woman. When he discovers she''s already married, he unsuccessfully attempts suicide but he and Stan then decide to join the Foreign Legion to get away from their troubles. When they’re arrested for soon trying to desert the Legion—they escape a firing squad by stealing an aircraft.', 'Ollie falls in love with a woman. When he discovers she''s already married, he unsuccessfully attempts suicide but he and Stan then decide to join the Foreign Legion to get away from their troubles. When they’re arrested for soon trying to desert the Legion—they escape a firing squad by stealing an aircraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXXA3s9tzRV7tgiFqhm7Nvu9W8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22999'),
  ('828765443253369770', 'The Flying Guillotine', 1975, 'Action', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Hung Hak, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Ni Kuang', 'Chen Kuan-Tai, Ku Feng, Wai Wang, Chiang Yang, Liu Wu-Chi, Ai Ti, Wong Yu, Lam Wai-Tiu', null, 'The Emperor''s armies have developed a new weapon: a thrown blade that can remove someone''s head from long distance. As the paranoid Emperor begins decapitating anyone he fears might be a threat, his guard Mau Tang becomes disillusioned with the excesses of his master. He leaves his post and takes up the quiet life of farming and raising a family. Eventually, though, his past catches up with him, and he must find a way to fight the flying guillotine if he is to save his head.', 'The Emperor''s armies have developed a new weapon: a thrown blade that can remove someone''s head from long distance. As the paranoid Emperor begins decapitating anyone he fears might be a threat, his guard Mau Tang becomes disillusioned with the excesses of his master. He leaves his post and takes up the quiet life of farming and raising a family. Eventually, though, his past catches up with him, and he must find a way to fight the flying guillotine if he is to save his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MYFhMjC4AdjLrtzlWD1HLgzhPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62071'),
  ('931574879360700620', 'The Flying Jalopy', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dick Lundy', null, 'Clarence Nash, Nestor Paiva', 'NR', 'Donald Duck buys a rattletrap used airplane from devious proprietor Ben Buzzard, who tricks the unsuspecting duck into making Ben the beneficiary in case of an accident. Ben then leads Donald on a reckless flight, trying to make the plane crash so that he collect a fortune from Donald''s misfortune.', 'Donald Duck buys a rattletrap used airplane from devious proprietor Ben Buzzard, who tricks the unsuspecting duck into making Ben the beneficiary in case of an accident. Ben then leads Donald on a reckless flight, trying to make the plane crash so that he collect a fortune from Donald''s misfortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCFmOs9rCTuP17TwCWWCtfp3MCR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57199'),
  ('561378511087640795', 'The Flying Koffer', 1921, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Lotte Reiniger, Carl Koch', 'Lotte Reiniger', null, null, 'Lotte Reiniger''s earliest preserved fairytale film based on a fairy tale by Hans Christian Andersen.', 'Lotte Reiniger''s earliest preserved fairytale film based on a fairy tale by Hans Christian Andersen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flHw67PIoe6Cq76j2slCtcllTw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175601'),
  ('475086357773707015', 'The Flying Liftboy', 1998, 'Adventure', 'Ben Sombogaart', 'Annie M.G. Schmidt', 'Victor Löw, Elleke Vervat, Roxanne Stam, Afroditi-Piteni Bijker, Taina Moreno, Nicole Sanchez, Soraya Smith, Rick van Gastel', null, 'Pupil Abel is the victim of Laura''s nasty prank, yet gets accidentally blamed and overreacts. His ma withdraws him from school and gets him a job as lift-boy. But its'' a special lift: when he pushes the forbidden green button, it takes him, Laura, Jozias Tump and Maria Klaterhoen to Manhattan. There he''s mistaken by a rich woman who looks like his mother for her long missing son Johnny. When a police helicopter comes to tow the lift cabin, the Dutchmen get back in. It takes them to a Latin American country, Perugona. The new revolutionary leader realizes presidents live about one year, so he gives the job to Mr. Tump, who saved his life. The news coverage attracts Abel''s and Johnny''s family, in time for an even weirder finale.', 'Pupil Abel is the victim of Laura''s nasty prank, yet gets accidentally blamed and overreacts. His ma withdraws him from school and gets him a job as lift-boy. But its'' a special lift: when he pushes the forbidden green button, it takes him, Laura, Jozias Tump and Maria Klaterhoen to Manhattan. There he''s mistaken by a rich woman who looks like his mother for her long missing son Johnny. When a police helicopter comes to tow the lift cabin, the Dutchmen get back in. It takes them to a Latin American country, Perugona. The new revolutionary leader realizes presidents live about one year, so he gives the job to Mr. Tump, who saved his life. The news coverage attracts Abel''s and Johnny''s family, in time for an even weirder finale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEse3rAT4qUq1H7lfEcZ1Syld1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21872'),
  ('88245031457841639', 'The Flying Luna Clipper', 1987, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Ikko Ohno', 'Ikko Ohno', 'Anne Lambert, Ina Krantz, Mark Hagan, Zev Asher', null, 'A trip on a chartered plane with a number of other thrill-seekers (most of whom are anthropomorphic fruits and vegetables) and hop from island to island, each of which offer their own unique visual delights.', 'A trip on a chartered plane with a number of other thrill-seekers (most of whom are anthropomorphic fruits and vegetables) and hop from island to island, each of which offer their own unique visual delights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjjJOpxy9J44UWMSOOQvY2VSlc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366934'),
  ('473633026440309468', 'The Flying Man', 1962, 'Comedy, Animation', 'George Dunning', 'Stan Hayward', null, null, 'A man undresses and takes to flight, while another man and his dog witness him.', 'A man undresses and takes to flight, while another man and his dog witness him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwQGNTcDW4Z9f1H48gpYX8sTjIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134752'),
  ('8127890593917872', 'The Flying Mouse', 1934, 'Animation', 'David Hand', null, 'Dorothy Compton, Purv Pullen, Pinto Colvig, Clarence Nash, Gertrude Lawrence', 'NR', 'To the tune "I Would Like to Be a Bird," a young mouse fashions wings from a pair of leaves, to the great amusement of his brothers when his attempts to use them fail. When the butterfly he rescues from a spider proves to be a fairy, he wishes for wings. But his bat-like appearance doesn''t fit in with either the birds or the other mice, and he finds himself friendless; even the bats make fun of him. Written by Jon Reeves', 'To the tune "I Would Like to Be a Bird," a young mouse fashions wings from a pair of leaves, to the great amusement of his brothers when his attempts to use them fail. When the butterfly he rescues from a spider proves to be a fairy, he wishes for wings. But his bat-like appearance doesn''t fit in with either the birds or the other mice, and he finds himself friendless; even the bats make fun of him. Written by Jon Reeves', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yPLIuPJ0cm5svud6C1ds9dpyZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54509'),
  ('883067856601501493', 'The Flying Sailor', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, History', 'Amanda Forbis, Wendy Tilby', 'Amanda Forbis, Wendy Tilby', null, null, 'The Flying Sailor is based on the Halifax Explosion of 1917 when two ships collided in the Halifax Harbour causing the largest accidental explosion in history. Among the tragic stories of the disaster is the remarkable account of a sailor who, blown skyward from the deck of a British cargo steamer, flew over 2 km before landing completely unharmed, but naked except for his boots.', 'The Flying Sailor is based on the Halifax Explosion of 1917 when two ships collided in the Halifax Harbour causing the largest accidental explosion in history. Among the tragic stories of the disaster is the remarkable account of a sailor who, blown skyward from the deck of a British cargo steamer, flew over 2 km before landing completely unharmed, but naked except for his boots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pumyKicAZvivWihNcWDX8IBj4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:742872'),
  ('586039149295884656', 'The Flying Saucer', 1950, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Mikel Conrad, Philip Tannura', 'Howard Irving Young', 'Mikel Conrad, Pat Garrison, Hantz von Teuffen, Earle Lyon, Lester Sharpe, Russell Hicks, Frank Darien, Denver Pyle', 'NR', 'The CIA sends playboy Mike Trent to Alaska with agent Vee Langley, posing as his "nurse," to investigate flying saucer sightings. At first, installed in a hunting lodge, the two play in the wilderness. But then they sight a saucer. Investigating, our heroes clash with an inept gang of Soviet spies, also after the saucer secret.', 'The CIA sends playboy Mike Trent to Alaska with agent Vee Langley, posing as his "nurse," to investigate flying saucer sightings. At first, installed in a hunting lodge, the two play in the wilderness. But then they sight a saucer. Investigating, our heroes clash with an inept gang of Soviet spies, also after the saucer secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3S1TfqMb2dfJtUPWYoLkufFr53W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43391'),
  ('957411039366559123', 'The Flying Saucer', 1964, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Tinto Brass, Carla Cipriani, Gianni Nerattini', 'Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Monica Vitti, Eleonora Rossi Drago, Silvana Mangano, Guido Celano, Alberto Fogliani, Liana Del Balzo, Albino Principe', null, 'An exasperated police inspector receives different eyewitness accounts surrounding a downed saucer and its female occupant.', 'An exasperated police inspector receives different eyewitness accounts surrounding a downed saucer and its female occupant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oJgE18nOpyJkzchDo3hH1Uw1z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111232'),
  ('62688161224717160', 'The Flying Scot', 1957, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Compton Bennett, Peter Hennessy', 'Norman Hudis', 'Lee Patterson, Kay Callard, Alan Gifford, Margaret Withers, Mark Baker, Jeremy Bodkin, Gerald Case, Margaret Gordon', null, 'A gang of four would-be robbers plans to steal a fortune in currency hidden aboard the "Flying Scotsman" in a railroad stateroom by cutting through the wall of the adjacent stateroom, but find themselves up against numerous unexpected drawbacks, including interference by their fellow passengers.', 'A gang of four would-be robbers plans to steal a fortune in currency hidden aboard the "Flying Scotsman" in a railroad stateroom by cutting through the wall of the adjacent stateroom, but find themselves up against numerous unexpected drawbacks, including interference by their fellow passengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocqeN88h8e2NLCMBJHrbJx7hJ1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257016'),
  ('506040581282184853', 'The Flying Scotsman', 2006, 'Drama', 'Douglas Mackinnon, Gavin Finney', 'John Brown, Simon Rose, Declan Hughes', 'Jonny Lee Miller, Sean Brown, Joseph Carney, Billy Boyd, Laura Fraser, Brian Cox, Ron Donachie, Morven Christie', 'PG-13', 'Based on the incredible true story of amateur cyclist Graeme Obree, who breaks the world one-hour record on a bike he made out of washing machine parts.', 'Based on the incredible true story of amateur cyclist Graeme Obree, who breaks the world one-hour record on a bike he made out of washing machine parts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ARffaR8ujlrxsGQrcpuPXwPaUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15008'),
  ('744768404182145350', 'The Flying Serpent', 1946, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sam Newfield, Jack Greenhalgh, Leo Erdody', 'John T. Neville', 'George Zucco, Hope Kramer, Ralph Lewis, Eddie Acuff, Wheaton Chambers, James Metcalf, Henry Hall, Milton Kibbee', 'NR', 'A demented archaeologist discovers a living, breathing serpent creature known to the Aztecs as Quetzalcoatl and accidentally kills his wife by giving her one of the beast''s feathers, causing the creature to track her down and slaughter her. Using this knowledge he exacts revenge upon his enemies by placing one of the feathers on his intended victim and letting the beast loose to wreak havoc.', 'A demented archaeologist discovers a living, breathing serpent creature known to the Aztecs as Quetzalcoatl and accidentally kills his wife by giving her one of the beast''s feathers, causing the creature to track her down and slaughter her. Using this knowledge he exacts revenge upon his enemies by placing one of the feathers on his intended victim and letting the beast loose to wreak havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSmJYbZHVXtCnmMxteEieMbeHcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29474'),
  ('667933505921548400', 'The Flying Ship', 1979, 'Animation', 'Garri Bardin, Kabul Rasulov, Boris Filchikov', 'Aleksey Simukov', 'Tatyana Shabelnikova, Mikhail Boyarskiy, Garri Bardin, Rogvold Sukhoverko, Anatoliy Papanov', null, 'Poor chimney sweep Ivan and Princess Zabava fall in love with each other. They dream of their future happy life, but the difference in their social status and the treacherous Polkan, who dreams of marrying a royal daughter and becoming a ruler, stand in their way. To avoid marriage with the royal adviser, Zabava informs that she will marry only the one who can build a flying ship. Now Ivan has to solve this problem by all means.', 'Poor chimney sweep Ivan and Princess Zabava fall in love with each other. They dream of their future happy life, but the difference in their social status and the treacherous Polkan, who dreams of marrying a royal daughter and becoming a ruler, stand in their way. To avoid marriage with the royal adviser, Zabava informs that she will marry only the one who can build a flying ship. Now Ivan has to solve this problem by all means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8288F5qz16IoGz5O1RFH3onAMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72204'),
  ('886223928915812110', 'The Flying Sorceress', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'June Foray', 'NR', 'After Tom''s mistress orders him to clean up the mess he made while chasing Jerry, Tom spies an ad for a cat needed as companion to an old lady. Tom leaves his current home for what he anticipates will be a better life, only to discover the old lady is a witch.', 'After Tom''s mistress orders him to clean up the mess he made while chasing Jerry, Tom spies an ad for a cat needed as companion to an old lady. Tom leaves his current home for what he anticipates will be a better life, only to discover the old lady is a witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKyua12iwhdZDtK8ZTEFVVXvcn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57200'),
  ('1099392398229965049', 'The Flying Squirrel', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald is pushing his peanut cart through the park when a flying squirrel drops in. Donald gets him to help tie his sign to a tree by promising a peanut, but when it turns out to be a bad nut, Donald won''t make good, and the battle with the squirrel is on.', 'Donald is pushing his peanut cart through the park when a flying squirrel drops in. Donald gets him to help tie his sign to a tree by promising a peanut, but when it turns out to be a bad nut, Donald won''t make good, and the battle with the squirrel is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9jVZRbqpr567LPQLA87rDysxCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57217'),
  ('3980044573867848', 'The Flying Train', 1902, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The Flying Train depicts a ride on a suspended railway. The footage is almost as impressive as the feat of engineering it captures. For many years our curators believed our Mutoscope rolls were slightly shrunken 70mm film, but they were actually shot on Biograph’s proprietary 68mm stock. Formats like Biograph’s 68mm and Fox’s 70mm Grandeur are of particular interest to researchers visiting the Film Study Center because the large image area affords stunning visual clarity and quality, especially compared to the more standard 35mm or 16mm stocks.', 'The Flying Train depicts a ride on a suspended railway. The footage is almost as impressive as the feat of engineering it captures. For many years our curators believed our Mutoscope rolls were slightly shrunken 70mm film, but they were actually shot on Biograph’s proprietary 68mm stock. Formats like Biograph’s 68mm and Fox’s 70mm Grandeur are of particular interest to researchers visiting the Film Study Center because the large image area affords stunning visual clarity and quality, especially compared to the more standard 35mm or 16mm stocks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVvkzpirgel2EwEJ46oKvnOprKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730536'),
  ('188458840539555743', 'The Fog', 1980, 'Horror', 'Dean Cundey, John Carpenter, Jim Van Wyck', 'Debra Hill, John Carpenter', 'Adrienne Barbeau, Tom Atkins, Jamie Lee Curtis, Hal Holbrook, Janet Leigh, Nancy Kyes, Ty Mitchell, John Houseman', 'R', 'Strange things begin to occur as a tiny California coastal town prepares to commemorate its centenary. Inanimate objects spring eerily to life; Rev. Malone stumbles upon a dark secret about the town''s founding; radio announcer Stevie witnesses a mystical fire; and hitchhiker Elizabeth discovers the mutilated corpse of a fisherman. Then a mysterious iridescent fog descends upon the village, and more people start to die.', 'Strange things begin to occur as a tiny California coastal town prepares to commemorate its centenary. Inanimate objects spring eerily to life; Rev. Malone stumbles upon a dark secret about the town''s founding; radio announcer Stevie witnesses a mystical fire; and hitchhiker Elizabeth discovers the mutilated corpse of a fisherman. Then a mysterious iridescent fog descends upon the village, and more people start to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12EeSboRofP3CI4SPmMFNNXCbtY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790'),
  ('1080458731322833109', 'The Fog', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Nathan Hope, Rupert Wainwright, David Klohn', 'John Carpenter, Debra Hill', 'Tom Welling, Maggie Grace, Selma Blair, DeRay Davis, Kenneth Welsh, Adrian Hough, Sara Botsford, Cole Heppell', 'PG-13', 'Trapped within an eerie mist, the residents of Antonio Bay have become the unwitting victims of a horrifying vengeance. One hundred years earlier, a ship carrying lepers was purposely lured onto the rocky coastline and sank, drowning all aboard. Now they''re back – long-dead mariners who''ve waited a century for their revenge.', 'Trapped within an eerie mist, the residents of Antonio Bay have become the unwitting victims of a horrifying vengeance. One hundred years earlier, a ship carrying lepers was purposely lured onto the rocky coastline and sank, drowning all aboard. Now they''re back – long-dead mariners who''ve waited a century for their revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9vt49PUDJGkrMVjhb3yiYo7H4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791'),
  ('867497041583315851', 'The Fog of War', 2003, 'Documentary, TV Movie, History, War', 'Errol Morris, Robert Chappell, Peter Donahue', null, 'Robert McNamara, Errol Morris, Fidel Castro, Barry Goldwater, John F. Kennedy, Nikita Khrushchev, Curtis LeMay, Richard Nixon', 'PG-13', 'Using archival footage, cabinet conversation recordings, and an interview of the 85-year-old Robert McNamara, The Fog of War depicts his life, from working as a WWII whiz-kid military officer, to being the Ford Motor Company''s president, to managing the Vietnam War as defense secretary for presidents Kennedy and Johnson.', 'Using archival footage, cabinet conversation recordings, and an interview of the 85-year-old Robert McNamara, The Fog of War depicts his life, from working as a WWII whiz-kid military officer, to being the Ford Motor Company''s president, to managing the Vietnam War as defense secretary for presidents Kennedy and Johnson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1dEnkrdJGBSLeAyJepuGrU9sNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12698'),
  ('298109860591995534', 'The Foghorn Leghorn', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Little Henery the Chicken Hawk wants to prove he''s big enough to hunt chickens, but he doesn''t know what a chicken is. He labels Foghorn Leghorn a loud-mouthed shnook and dismisses him, prompting Foggy to indignantly try to prove he''s a chicken and therefore fit to be Henery''s prey.', 'Little Henery the Chicken Hawk wants to prove he''s big enough to hunt chickens, but he doesn''t know what a chicken is. He labels Foghorn Leghorn a loud-mouthed shnook and dismisses him, prompting Foggy to indignantly try to prove he''s a chicken and therefore fit to be Henery''s prey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOLph1YIulhLxpPblq6jdatAJyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100364'),
  ('535482768382954812', 'The Follies', 2025, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo García, Igor Jadue-Lillo', 'Rodrigo García', 'Cassandra Ciangherotti, Alfredo Castro, Ángeles Cruz, Natalia Solián, Ilse Salas, Naian González Norvind, Raúl Briones, Vicky Araico', null, 'Six women share a common ''friend'': madness. It visits us all, pushes us to decide reality, to make daring decisions and to transform our lives.', 'Six women share a common ''friend'': madness. It visits us all, pushes us to decide reality, to make daring decisions and to transform our lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVGV5fXrG1NSZvhzhPCxxRk9ap9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1548092'),
  ('339952642340320392', 'The Follow', 2001, 'Action, Mystery, Romance', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Harris Savides', 'Andrew Kevin Walker', 'Clive Owen, Mickey Rourke, Adriana Lima, Forest Whitaker', null, 'The Driver is hired by a nervous movie manager to spy on a paranoid actor''s wife. During his tailing of the wife, the Driver describes the right way to tail someone. As he follows her he begins to fear what he might learn of her apparently tragic life. He discovers the wife is fleeing the country and returning to her mother''s, and that she''s been given a black eye, likely by her husband. He returns the money for the job, refusing to tell where the wife is, and drives off telling the manager never to call him again.', 'The Driver is hired by a nervous movie manager to spy on a paranoid actor''s wife. During his tailing of the wife, the Driver describes the right way to tail someone. As he follows her he begins to fear what he might learn of her apparently tragic life. He discovers the wife is fleeing the country and returning to her mother''s, and that she''s been given a black eye, likely by her husband. He returns the money for the job, refusing to tell where the wife is, and drives off telling the manager never to call him again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAVZSrnlRQsNDrmwqIatzXLDjsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38189'),
  ('794852732395622160', 'The Following Statement Came To Us', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ahmed Nader Galal, Saeed Hamed, Sameh Hussein', 'Mohamed Amin', 'Mohamed Henedi, Hanan Turk, Lotfy Labib, Nehal Anbar, Ahmed Khalil, Mohamed Youssef, Talaat Zakaria, Salwa Mohamed Ali', null, 'Nader saif eldeen and Afet elsherbiny are two competing Egyptians newspaper reporters who expose the truth but the Channel Manager rejects that for fear of government.', 'Nader saif eldeen and Afet elsherbiny are two competing Egyptians newspaper reporters who expose the truth but the Channel Manager rejects that for fear of government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6rA8VqfTlo8USJr0vnWwI83g6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407215'),
  ('147250596077597193', 'The Food of the Gods', 1976, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bert I. Gordon, Reginald H. Morris, Gavin B. Craig', 'Bert I. Gordon', 'Marjoe Gortner, Pamela Franklin, Ralph Meeker, Jon Cypher, Ida Lupino, John McLiam, Belinda Balaski, Tom Stovall', 'PG', 'Morgan and his friends are on a hunting trip on a remote Canadian island when they are attacked by a swarm of giant wasps. Looking for help, Morgan stumbles across a barn inhabited by an enormous killer chicken. After doing some exploring, they discover the entire island is crawling with animals that have somehow grown to giant size. The most dangerous of all of these, however, are the rats, who are mobilizing to do battle with the human intruders.', 'Morgan and his friends are on a hunting trip on a remote Canadian island when they are attacked by a swarm of giant wasps. Looking for help, Morgan stumbles across a barn inhabited by an enormous killer chicken. After doing some exploring, they discover the entire island is crawling with animals that have somehow grown to giant size. The most dangerous of all of these, however, are the rats, who are mobilizing to do battle with the human intruders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aalvl6E6Ruz9S4B9UOPONytqyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42245'),
  ('566143520470620443', 'The Fool', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Jalil Lespert, Pierre-Yves Bastard', 'Fadette Drouard, Guillaume Gallienne, Jalil Lespert', 'Dany Boon, Alice Pol, Guillaume Gallienne, Ahmed Sylla, Laure Calamy, Camille Lellouche, Henri Guybet, Éric De Staercke', null, 'Pontagnac, a married man, tries to seduce Victoire, the wife of his good friend. Little does he know, Victoire has plans of her own to punish her cheating husband. The would-be fling ignites a dizzying spell of complications as characters arrange trysts, attempt to expose each other’s deceits, and are ultimately forced to come clean.', 'Pontagnac, a married man, tries to seduce Victoire, the wife of his good friend. Little does he know, Victoire has plans of her own to punish her cheating husband. The would-be fling ignites a dizzying spell of complications as characters arrange trysts, attempt to expose each other’s deceits, and are ultimately forced to come clean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37kQzvMECFkUJzZLTAKiTkwZDmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590017'),
  ('939182187844505876', 'The Fool Killer', 1965, 'Mystery, Drama, Adventure', 'Servando González, Álex Phillips Jr., Francisco Day', 'David Friedkin, Morton S. Fine', 'Anthony Perkins, Edward Albert, Dana Elcar, Henry Hull, Salome Jens, Yvonne Gilbert, Charlotte Jones, Arnold Moss', 'NR', 'After the Civil War, a southern boy, aged 12, runs away from his foster home, wanders the countryside, and meets various odd characters along the way, including Milo, a mysterious drifter who may or may not be the vengeful "Fool Killer" of folklore.', 'After the Civil War, a southern boy, aged 12, runs away from his foster home, wanders the countryside, and meets various odd characters along the way, including Milo, a mysterious drifter who may or may not be the vengeful "Fool Killer" of folklore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4WkKwdNq8RIJgMcrWM0aF4runl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28179'),
  ('735650940278719698', 'The Fool of the World and the Flying Ship', 1990, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Francis Vose', null, 'Jimmy Hibbert, David Suchet, Miriam Margolyes, John Woodvine, Martin Jarvis, Barbara Wilshere, Maurice Denham, Robin Bailey', null, 'Based on a Russian folk tale. A proclamation went out through all the land that whosoever could build a flying ship would win the hand of the Tsar''s daughter. The youngest son of a simple peasant shows up to claim her, and the dumbfounded Tsar quickly has second thoughts, setting several ''impossible" tasks for ''The Fool of the World'' and his remarkable friends.', 'Based on a Russian folk tale. A proclamation went out through all the land that whosoever could build a flying ship would win the hand of the Tsar''s daughter. The youngest son of a simple peasant shows up to claim her, and the dumbfounded Tsar quickly has second thoughts, setting several ''impossible" tasks for ''The Fool of the World'' and his remarkable friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0uct54P3xQwTsodc9ob5Sy6NhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73094'),
  ('340138561708068768', 'The Foot Fist Way', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Jody Hill, Brian Mandle', 'Danny McBride, Ben Best, Jody Hill', 'Danny McBride, Ben Best, Mary Jane Bostic, Jody Hill, Collette Wolfe, Spencer Moreno, Carlos Lopez', 'R', 'An inept taekwondo instructor struggles with marital troubles and an unhealthy obsession with fellow taekwondo enthusiast Chuck "The Truck" Williams.', 'An inept taekwondo instructor struggles with marital troubles and an unhealthy obsession with fellow taekwondo enthusiast Chuck "The Truck" Williams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyrlFaRWrjf3FUfLDzS9JpNGHzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13484'),
  ('951434808762894971', 'The Foot Shooting Party', 1994, 'Drama', 'Karl Kases, Annette Haywood-Carter, Alberto Gieco', 'Ken Carter', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Jake Busey, Bradley Gregg, Darin Heames, Michael Rapaport, Merle Kennedy, Sarah Lassez, Robin Swid', null, 'The lead singer of a band gets drafted for war in Vietnam. So as not to break up the band, he decides to shoot his own foot.', 'The lead singer of a band gets drafted for war in Vietnam. So as not to break up the band, he decides to shoot his own foot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlVjDlanLv4s2SP4m9rXSK5zuBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329216'),
  ('561391346159077738', 'The Football Factory', 2004, 'Drama', 'Nick Love, Damian Bromley, Jamie Macdermott', 'Nick Love', 'Danny Dyer, Neil Maskell, Frank Harper, Tamer Hassan, Roland Manookian, Calum MacNab, Dudley Sutton, John Junkin', 'R', 'The Football Factory is more than just a study of the English obsession with football violence, it''s about men looking for armies to join, wars to fight and places to belong. A forgotten culture of Anglo Saxon males fed up with being told they''re not good enough and using their fists as a drug they describe as being more potent than sex and drugs put together.', 'The Football Factory is more than just a study of the English obsession with football violence, it''s about men looking for armies to join, wars to fight and places to belong. A forgotten culture of Anglo Saxon males fed up with being told they''re not good enough and using their fists as a drug they describe as being more potent than sex and drugs put together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja76eLRw7XSc1VdlNXEb8ufTIoW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10296'),
  ('100891215123786803', 'The Footballest', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Miguel Ángel Lamata, Teo Delgado', 'Pablo Fernández Vázquez, Miguel Ángel Lamata, Roberto Santiago', 'Julio Bohigas-Couto, Milene Mayer, Carmen Ruiz, Jorge Usón, Toni Acosta, Joaquín Reyes, Jordi Aguilar, Norma Ruiz', null, 'Francisco and his closest friends play on a soccer team that has reached its lowest point. They’ve got to win one of the next three games to keep the school from cutting their team altogether. A series of strange events take place in the first two games. Coincidence? Conspiracy? Francisco and his friends decide to create The Footballest, an investigative team that will get them into all kinds of adventures, where their ingenuity and their friendships will be put to the test.', 'Francisco and his closest friends play on a soccer team that has reached its lowest point. They’ve got to win one of the next three games to keep the school from cutting their team altogether. A series of strange events take place in the first two games. Coincidence? Conspiracy? Francisco and his friends decide to create The Footballest, an investigative team that will get them into all kinds of adventures, where their ingenuity and their friendships will be put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEPYb9Ojedu9WNs8YecqMGEU2ar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517317'),
  ('993365134581031654', 'The Forbidden', 1978, 'Horror', 'Clive Barker', 'Clive Barker', 'Peter Atkins, Clive Barker, Doug Bradley, Phil Rimmer, Lyn Darnell, Julia Blake', null, 'An early experimental short film based on Faust.', 'An early experimental short film based on Faust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NLE98qd7YcnIyP0O4MIqPv4Ouq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143109'),
  ('869861029105453132', 'The Forbidden Christ', 1951, 'Drama', 'Curzio Malaparte, Gábor Pogány', 'Curzio Malaparte', 'Raf Vallone, Alain Cuny, Gino Cervi, Rina Morelli, Anna Maria Ferrero, Elena Varzi, Ernesta Rosmino, Philippe Lemaire', null, 'Freshly released from a Russian POW camp, Italian soldier Bruno Baldi tries to discover who betrayed his brother to the Nazis.', 'Freshly released from a Russian POW camp, Italian soldier Bruno Baldi tries to discover who betrayed his brother to the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ww4V5J7af1GW5htXecIL5h0mrw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199512'),
  ('882650657923570900', 'The Forbidden City', 2025, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Paolo Carnera, Gabriele Mainetti, Tiziano Grasso', 'Stefano Bises, Davide Serino, Gabriele Mainetti', 'Liu Yaxi, Enrico Borello, Marco Giallini, Sabrina Ferilli, Chunyu Shanshan, Luca Zingaretti, Tomal Islam, Miki Yeung Oi-Gan', 'NR', 'The son of an indebted restaurant owner joins a foreign girl in search of her sister. Together, they’ll have to fight side by side against the most ruthless members of the Roman criminal underworld.', 'The son of an indebted restaurant owner joins a foreign girl in search of her sister. Together, they’ll have to fight side by side against the most ruthless members of the Roman criminal underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSwDbpNHm19QVfX2Da6jdvaPWTh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127674'),
  ('135148199667543289', 'The Forbidden Dance', 1990, 'Romance, Drama', 'Greydon Clark, R. Michael Stringer, Ted Warren', 'Roy Langsdon, John Platt', 'Laura Harring, Jeff James, Ángela Moya, Sid Haig, Barbra Brighton, Richard Lynch, Pilar Del Rey, Ruben Moreno', null, 'A princess in the Amazon rain forests tries to fight a conglomerate threatening the forests by going to Los Angeles. There she links up with a rich kid who tells her that she must get on television to succeed with her mission. Quick as a wink, the two come up with the idea of winning a lambada dance contest.', 'A princess in the Amazon rain forests tries to fight a conglomerate threatening the forests by going to Los Angeles. There she links up with a rich kid who tells her that she must get on television to succeed with her mission. Quick as a wink, the two come up with the idea of winning a lambada dance contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qdAXHzx1VLmBsS3TvPbHg4RnO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118430'),
  ('1000952890067184175', 'The Forbidden Door', 2009, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Joko Anwar, Ipung Rachmat Syaiful, Rieviena Yulietta', 'Joko Anwar', 'Fachry Albar, Marsha Timothy, Ario Bayu, Otto Djauhari, Tio Pakusadewo, Verdi Solaiman, Henidar Amroe, Atiqah Hasiholan', null, 'A successful sculptor''s life is turned upside down when he starts to receive mysterious messages from someone asking for his help. As he digs deeper, he discovers a boy is being abused and has to choose between saving the boy or losing everything.', 'A successful sculptor''s life is turned upside down when he starts to receive mysterious messages from someone asking for his help. As he digs deeper, he discovers a boy is being abused and has to choose between saving the boy or losing everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7iKj7aQyKIb6XAWk0m7jPjR9CJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39024'),
  ('540306227249843193', 'The Forbidden Education', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Octavio Alonso, Julieta Canicoba, Sandra Grossi', 'Germán Doin, Verónica Guzzo, Julieta Canicoba', 'Santiago Magariños, Amira Adre, Nicolás Valenzuela, Gastón Pauls, Alejandra Figueroa, Jimena del Pozo, Jota David Ojeda, Eliana Grosso', null, 'An analysis of the logics of modern schooling and the way of understanding education, while showing different, non-conventional educational experiences that raise the need for a new educational paradigm.', 'An analysis of the logics of modern schooling and the way of understanding education, while showing different, non-conventional educational experiences that raise the need for a new educational paradigm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMbbealvZJRYJa4WAZMz5W38Kfl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125619'),
  ('745731219078262675', 'The Forbidden Kingdom', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Rob Minkoff, Kenneth Siao Wai-Keung', 'John Fusco', 'Jackie Chan, Jet Li, Michael Angarano, Liu Yifei, Li Bingbing, Collin Chou, Morgan Benoit, Jack Posobiec', 'PG-13', 'An American teenager who is obsessed with Hong Kong cinema and kung-fu classics makes an extraordinary discovery in a Chinatown pawnshop: the legendary stick weapon of the Chinese sage and warrior, the Monkey King. With the lost relic in hand, the teenager unexpectedly finds himself travelling back to ancient China to join a crew of warriors from martial arts lore on a dangerous quest to free the imprisoned Monkey King.', 'An American teenager who is obsessed with Hong Kong cinema and kung-fu classics makes an extraordinary discovery in a Chinatown pawnshop: the legendary stick weapon of the Chinese sage and warrior, the Monkey King. With the lost relic in hand, the teenager unexpectedly finds himself travelling back to ancient China to join a crew of warriors from martial arts lore on a dangerous quest to free the imprisoned Monkey King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8chF1Z7hyuSVqLYTgElkQZh2VB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1729'),
  ('725498382761035799', 'The Forbidden Legend: Sex & Chopsticks', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Oscar Lam Wai-Kin, Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Hikaru Wakana, Kaera Uehara, Serina Hayakawa, Minami Matsuzaka, Winnie Leung Man-Yee, Samuel Leung Cheuk-Moon', 'R', 'Simon is a scion of a wealthy family who struggles to have a stable relationship because of his womanizing ways. When he finds a wife, Moon, he spots another woman and conspires to marry her.', 'Simon is a scion of a wealthy family who struggles to have a stable relationship because of his womanizing ways. When he finds a wife, Moon, he spots another woman and conspires to marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sc9LlvsdofSmImbodqrgmK774EA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35102'),
  ('252174775870760100', 'The Forbidden Legend: Sex & Chopsticks 2', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Oscar Lam Wai-Kin, Serina Hayakawa, Kaera Uehara, Winnie Leung Man-Yee, Hikaru Wakana, Lee Kin-Yan, Tam Kon-Chung, Samuel Leung Cheuk-Moon', 'R', 'Rich and powerful Simon Qing has been schooled in the ways of sex by his virile father, but is still a virgin. That is, until he meets his first love Violetta who has fun with him all over his father’s estate. Their love does not last, so Simon embarks on a journey. Along the way he meets the comely nun Moon whom Simon deflowers and then marries. He then becomes enamored of Golden Lotus but she is married to dwarf Wu Da-Lang.', 'Rich and powerful Simon Qing has been schooled in the ways of sex by his virile father, but is still a virgin. That is, until he meets his first love Violetta who has fun with him all over his father’s estate. Their love does not last, so Simon embarks on a journey. Along the way he meets the comely nun Moon whom Simon deflowers and then marries. He then becomes enamored of Golden Lotus but she is married to dwarf Wu Da-Lang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1yymig7S0FTWv9cTtOwdI1cH5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32516'),
  ('997029071230274780', 'The Forbidden Photos of a Lady Above Suspicion', 1970, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Luciano Ercoli, Alejandro Ulloa', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Mahnahén Velasco', 'Dagmar Lassander, Pier Paolo Capponi, Simón Andreu, Osvaldo Genazzani, Salvador Huguet, Nieves Navarro', null, 'The wife of a financially struggling businessman is blackmailed by a mysterious man into having a sadistic relationship with him, or he will release damning evidence that suggests that her husband is a murderer.', 'The wife of a financially struggling businessman is blackmailed by a mysterious man into having a sadistic relationship with him, or he will release damning evidence that suggests that her husband is a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bhC6HDdUeQmknrONYAM8jB8ZTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92233'),
  ('89671523831489277', 'The Forbidden Play', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Hideo Nakata, Jun Yokoishi, Takahiro Imai', 'Noriaki Sugihara', 'Kanna Hashimoto, Daiki Shigeoka, Mayu Hotta, Shinobu Hasegawa, Kenta Izuka, Minato Shougaki, MEGUMI, Yuki Kura', null, 'A boy, after tragically losing his mother in an accident, performs a resurrection spell in the hope of reviving her. However, he ends up awakening something evil.', 'A boy, after tragically losing his mother in an accident, performs a resurrection spell in the hope of reviving her. However, he ends up awakening something evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urrvbbIquQI3riQfz5k7Rf9XdIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145291'),
  ('1015170818772219169', 'The Forbidden Room', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Guy Maddin, Evan Johnson, Benjamin Kasulke', 'Guy Maddin, Bob Kotyk, Evan Johnson', 'Roy Dupuis, Clara Furey, Louis Negin, Udo Kier, Gregory Hlady, Mathieu Amalric, Noel Burton, Geraldine Chaplin', 'NR', 'A submarine crew, a feared pack of forest bandits, a famous surgeon, and a battalion of child soldiers all get more than they bargained for as they wend their way toward progressive ideas on life and love.', 'A submarine crew, a feared pack of forest bandits, a famous surgeon, and a battalion of child soldiers all get more than they bargained for as they wend their way toward progressive ideas on life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apISTiqipiBxL47lQKYV4CJrBO2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315855'),
  ('753996515423751152', 'The Forbidden Woman', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Philippe Harel, Gilles Henry', 'Philippe Harel, Eric Assous', 'Isabelle Carré, Philippe Harel, Nathalie Conio, Sophie Niedergang, Julien Niedergang, Zinedine Soualem', null, 'François is 39, Muriel is 22... He is married, with a child, and lives comfortably. She is single and unattached. They meet by chance... He wants her... She resists... Gives in... Latches on to him... There is a name for it: adultery. Adultery in all its fleeting joys, rare moments, creeping jealousy, open conflicts, stolen pleasures, tears held back, tears shed.', 'François is 39, Muriel is 22... He is married, with a child, and lives comfortably. She is single and unattached. They meet by chance... He wants her... She resists... Gives in... Latches on to him... There is a name for it: adultery. Adultery in all its fleeting joys, rare moments, creeping jealousy, open conflicts, stolen pleasures, tears held back, tears shed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lllbjY8mv3z9SqaJXIYAwycqhbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70270'),
  ('448543904810102953', 'The Foreign Duck, the Native Duck and God in a Coin Locker', 2007, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Katsutoshi Hirabayashi, Takashi Komatsu', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Kenichi Suzuki', 'Gaku Hamada, Eita Nagayama, Megumi Seki, Nene Otsuka, Ryuhei Matsuda, Kei Tamura, Midoriko Kimura, Masaki Okada', null, 'A university student finds himself wrapped up in the bizarre world of his next door neighbor, learning about his history and relationship with a girl who changed his life.', 'A university student finds himself wrapped up in the bizarre world of his next door neighbor, learning about his history and relationship with a girl who changed his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MIMynVQy07MsKAl3UdxpvSe1Xb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140509'),
  ('215281919148266237', 'The Foreigner', 2003, 'Action, Thriller', 'Michael Oblowitz, Michael Slovis', 'Darren O. Campbell, Darren Campbell', 'Steven Seagal, Jeffrey Pierce, Max Ryan, Harry Van Gorkum, Anna-Louise Plowman, Kate Fischer, Sherman Augustus, Gary Raymond', 'R', 'This story is about a freelance agent who is the courier of a package from France to Germany. He soon finds that many people want to get their hands on it.', 'This story is about a freelance agent who is the courier of a package from France to Germany. He soon finds that many people want to get their hands on it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esfi6vzwvq5M6H5OisFvG58mSvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18248'),
  ('573160491555934320', 'The Foreigner', 2017, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Martin Campbell, Tom Browne, Dan John', 'David Marconi', 'Pierce Brosnan, Jackie Chan, Rory Fleck-Byrne, Ray Fearon, Charlie Murphy, Orla Brady, Michael McElhatton, Lia Williams', 'R', 'Quan is a humble London businessman whose long-buried past erupts in a revenge-fueled vendetta when the only person left for him to love – his teenage daughter – dies in an Irish Republican Army car bombing. His relentless search to find the terrorists leads to a cat-and-mouse conflict with a British government official whose own past may hold the clues to the identities of the elusive killers.', 'Quan is a humble London businessman whose long-buried past erupts in a revenge-fueled vendetta when the only person left for him to love – his teenage daughter – dies in an Irish Republican Army car bombing. His relentless search to find the terrorists leads to a cat-and-mouse conflict with a British government official whose own past may hold the clues to the identities of the elusive killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwM4hzrmc5HiWfQD9ls9DL4QgGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379149'),
  ('263073655936904828', 'The Foreman Went to France', 1942, 'War, Drama', 'Charles Frend, Ernest Irving, Wilkie Cooper', 'Leslie Arliss, Angus MacPhail, John Dighton', 'Clifford Evans, Constance Cummings, Tommy Trinder, Gordon Jackson, Robert Morley, Owen Reynolds, Bill Blewitt, Charles Victor', null, 'Based on the true story of Melbourne Johns, an aircraft factory foreman sent to France to prevent the Nazis getting hold of some vital equipment.', 'Based on the true story of Melbourne Johns, an aircraft factory foreman sent to France to prevent the Nazis getting hold of some vital equipment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RSS33i3wfFJ6FxKMm5mxIz1wz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123370'),
