  ('969209635109995795', 'The Forger', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Christian Stangassinger, Maggie Peren', 'Maggie Peren', 'Louis Hofmann, Jonathan Berlin, Luna Wedler, Nina Gummich, Marc Limpach, André Jung, Yotam Ishay, Luc Feit', null, 'Jewish aesthete Cioma, 21, does not let anyone take away his joy of life, especially not the Nazis. In 1942, he has to find new ways to make his living in Berlin and escape deportation. In the process he discovers his talent for forgery: not only with passports, but also his own identity.', 'Jewish aesthete Cioma, 21, does not let anyone take away his joy of life, especially not the Nazis. In 1942, he has to find new ways to make his living in Berlin and escape deportation. In the process he discovers his talent for forgery: not only with passports, but also his own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJmVqG9y156lRObOEIAOnAEnAnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916386'),
  ('1006208553134592758', 'The Forger of London', 1961, 'Crime', 'Harald Reinl, Karl Löb', 'Johannes Kai', 'Karin Dor, Hellmut Lange, Siegfried Lowitz, Mady Rahl, Walter Rilla, Robert Graf, Joseph Offenbach, Ulrich Beiger', null, 'A ring of counterfeiters is flooding the country with phony money, and suspicion falls upon a wealthy playboy who may--or may not--have amnesia.', 'A ring of counterfeiters is flooding the country with phony money, and suspicion falls upon a wealthy playboy who may--or may not--have amnesia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzuVmJTEjlTRB1DEmndiP2yIvby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5632'),
