  ('929520745903785633', 'The Forgotten', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ali Idris, Sherif Arafa, Mohsen Nasr', 'Wahid Hamid', 'Adel Emam, Yousra, Karam Metawea, Ahmed Adam, Ahmad Rateb, Salah Abdallah, Mustafa Metwalli, Nahed Jabr', null, 'Yusuf Al-Mansi a worker in the railways. During his night shift and near his workplace, a millionaire named Asaad Yakout is hosting a big party to make a deal with a VIP and wants to have his secretary Ghada as condition to get the deal done. Yusuf Al-Mansi finds Ghada entering the booth and asks for his protection from the men her boss sent to bring her back to the party.', 'Yusuf Al-Mansi a worker in the railways. During his night shift and near his workplace, a millionaire named Asaad Yakout is hosting a big party to make a deal with a VIP and wants to have his secretary Ghada as condition to get the deal done. Yusuf Al-Mansi finds Ghada entering the booth and asks for his protection from the men her boss sent to bring her back to the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IYee3gHbiIyX6qO2tWPSCqJ2jz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332077'),
  ('412800456464892016', 'The Forgotten', 2004, 'Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Anastas N. Michos, Joseph Ruben, David M. Dunlap', 'Gerald Di Pego', 'Julianne Moore, Dominic West, Gary Sinise, Anthony Edwards, Alfre Woodard, Linus Roache, Robert Wisdom, Jessica Hecht', 'PG-13', 'Telly Paretta is a grieving mother struggling to cope with the loss of her 9-year-old son. She is stunned when her psychiatrist reveals that she has created nine years of memories about a son she never had. But when she remembers a man who had a similar experience, Telly embarks on a search to prove her son''s existence, and her sanity.', 'Telly Paretta is a grieving mother struggling to cope with the loss of her 9-year-old son. She is stunned when her psychiatrist reveals that she has created nine years of memories about a son she never had. But when she remembers a man who had a similar experience, Telly embarks on a search to prove her son''s existence, and her sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gANKh0Vm00CTE1Hf2aTh2IIXn8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10145'),
  ('38721728670038140', 'The Forgotten Battle', 2021, 'Action, War, Adventure, History, Drama', 'Alain de Levita, Terence Schreurs, Evert van Setten', 'Reinier Smit, Pauline van Mantgem, Matthijs van Heijningen Jr.', 'Gijs Blom, Jamie Flatters, Susan Radder, Theo Barklem-Biggs, Jan Bijvoet, Marthe Schneider, Ronald Kalter, Scott Reid', 'R', 'During WWII''s crucial Battle of the Scheldt, the lives of a glider pilot, a Nazi soldier and a reluctant Resistance recruit tragically intersect.', 'During WWII''s crucial Battle of the Scheldt, the lives of a glider pilot, a Nazi soldier and a reluctant Resistance recruit tragically intersect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wU8ijITXE2ZgoXJexTQByJiHCbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633515'),
  ('263953091014457581', 'The Forgotten Faces', 1961, 'History, War, Drama', 'Peter Watkins', 'Peter Watkins', 'Frank Hickey, Michael Roy, John Newing, Stan Mercer, Irene Mallaid', null, '“The Forgotten Faces (1961), a film reconstruction of the Hungarian revolution of 1956, won Watkins another amateur Oscar, and to this day, the film is praised in England as "one of the most memorable amateur films ever made".', '“The Forgotten Faces (1961), a film reconstruction of the Hungarian revolution of 1956, won Watkins another amateur Oscar, and to this day, the film is praised in England as "one of the most memorable amateur films ever made".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uFNKPIs8BRO0RG9HAHcvZodAEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155130'),
  ('436024179313690275', 'The Forgotten Ones', 2008, 'Horror, Action', 'Jörg Ihle, Christopher Popp', 'Jörg Ihle', 'Jewel Staite, Justin Baldoni, Kellan Lutz, Marc Bacher, Nikki Griffin, Helena Barrett, Mohit Ramchandani, Terry Notary', 'R', 'When a devastating boat crash shipwrecks a group of friends in the jungles of an uncharted island, they are savagely picked off one-by-one by a cannibalistic enemy that evolution forgot.', 'When a devastating boat crash shipwrecks a group of friends in the jungles of an uncharted island, they are savagely picked off one-by-one by a cannibalistic enemy that evolution forgot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jDqmXahTll0KZnMf0yjhPlSvvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20432'),
