  ('1078863959791207445', 'The Formula', 1980, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'John G. Avildsen, James Crabe', 'Steve Shagan', 'George C. Scott, Marlon Brando, Marthe Keller, John Gielgud, G.D. Spradlin, Beatrice Straight, Richard Lynch, John van Dreelen', 'R', 'While investigating the death of a friend and fellow cop, Los Angeles police officer Barney Caine stumbles across evidence that Nazis created a synthetic alternative to gasoline during World War II. This revelation has the potential to end the established global oil industry, making the formula a very valuable and dangerous piece of information. Eventually, Caine must contend with oil tycoon Adam Steiffel, who clearly has his own agenda regarding the formula.', 'While investigating the death of a friend and fellow cop, Los Angeles police officer Barney Caine stumbles across evidence that Nazis created a synthetic alternative to gasoline during World War II. This revelation has the potential to end the established global oil industry, making the formula a very valuable and dangerous piece of information. Eventually, Caine must contend with oil tycoon Adam Steiffel, who clearly has his own agenda regarding the formula.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnPDLq35sRuaJsjPmwFMjrqqXGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31603'),
  ('1101481386816636972', 'The Forsaken', 2001, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steven Bernstein, J.S. Cardone, Michael Cardone', 'J.S. Cardone', 'Kerr Smith, Brendan Fehr, Izabella Miko, Johnathon Schaech, Phina Oruche, Simon Rex, Carrie Snodgress, Alexis Thorpe', 'R', 'A young man is in a race against time as he searches for a cure after becoming infected with a virus that will eventually turn him into a blood-sucking vampire.', 'A young man is in a race against time as he searches for a cure after becoming infected with a virus that will eventually turn him into a blood-sucking vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RN5EKSHawgUMoPzjzyyXCXckYk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12484'),
