  ('733188782531594185', 'The Fortress', 2017, 'War, Drama, History, Action', 'Park Sin-woong, Hwang Dong-hyuk, Kim Ji-yong', 'Hwang Dong-hyuk', 'Lee Byung-hun, Kim Yun-seok, Park Hae-il, Go Soo, Park Hee-soon, Song Young-chang, Jo Woo-jin, David Lee', 'NR', 'Ancient Korea, 17th century. The powerful Khan of the Jurchen tribe of Manchuria, who fights the Ming dinasty to gain China, becomes the first ruler of the Qing dinasty and demands from King In-jo of Joseon to bow before him; but he refuses, being loyal to the Mings. On December 14th, 1636, the Qing horde invades Joseon, so King In-jo and his court shelter in the mountain fortress of Namhan and prepare to defend the kingdom.', 'Ancient Korea, 17th century. The powerful Khan of the Jurchen tribe of Manchuria, who fights the Ming dinasty to gain China, becomes the first ruler of the Qing dinasty and demands from King In-jo of Joseon to bow before him; but he refuses, being loyal to the Mings. On December 14th, 1636, the Qing horde invades Joseon, so King In-jo and his court shelter in the mountain fortress of Namhan and prepare to defend the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ww0h7mVg9AdPEMjRJKAic1w3ELa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437081'),
  ('602416087952629938', 'The Fortune', 1975, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'John A. Alonzo, Mike Nichols, Peter Bogart', 'Carole Eastman', 'Stockard Channing, Jack Nicholson, Warren Beatty, Florence Stanley, Ian Wolfe, Rose Michtom, Brian Avery, Dub Taylor', 'PG', 'A couple of bumbling 1920s hustlers attempt to obtain the fortune of an heiress. Nothing will stop them, not even murder.', 'A couple of bumbling 1920s hustlers attempt to obtain the fortune of an heiress. Nothing will stop them, not even murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdx9noBCQcKDf6Ieci5BbqTjJ6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70259'),
  ('542475965495370254', 'The Fortune Cookie', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Joseph LaShelle, Billy Wilder', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Jack Lemmon, Walter Matthau, Ron Rich, Judi West, Cliff Osmond, Lurene Tuttle, Harry Holcombe, Les Tremayne', 'NR', 'TV cameraman Harry Hinkle is injured while filming a football game. Seeing big dollar signs, his unscrupulous ambulance-chasing lawyer brother-in-law Willie Gingrich enters the picture, and convinces Harry to overstate his injuries and claim $1 million in pain and suffering. Harry''s similarly-minded ex-wife suddenly reappears in an attempt to rekindle their relationship.', 'TV cameraman Harry Hinkle is injured while filming a football game. Seeing big dollar signs, his unscrupulous ambulance-chasing lawyer brother-in-law Willie Gingrich enters the picture, and convinces Harry to overstate his injuries and claim $1 million in pain and suffering. Harry''s similarly-minded ex-wife suddenly reappears in an attempt to rekindle their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGZc0sRoXgGzRDhHaCRmqxNSKVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1888'),
  ('411699587279817178', 'The Fortunes and Misfortunes of Moll Flanders', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'David Attwood', 'Andrew Davies', 'Alex Kingston, James Bowers, Geoffrey Beevers, Lucy Evans, Anthony Bessick, Struan Rodger, Peter Jonfield, Neville Phillips', 'NR', 'After being born in prison, Moll Flanders wends her way through the top and bottom of 18th-century English society, has five husbands and many male and female lovers, travels to America and back again, and in general discovers all that is cruel and sweet in life.', 'After being born in prison, Moll Flanders wends her way through the top and bottom of 18th-century English society, has five husbands and many male and female lovers, travels to America and back again, and in general discovers all that is cruel and sweet in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjzQhNnc8OZDnyFjLsuX62XmjtB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174271'),
  ('454868441008432359', 'The Forty-First', 1927, 'War', 'Yakov Protazanov, Pyotr Yermolov, Yuli Raizman', 'Boris Leonidov', 'Ada Vojtsik, Ivan Koval-Samborskyi, Ivan Shtraukh', null, 'A young woman sharpshooter fighting with the Reds in Turkestan misses her forty-first victim, a handsome White lieutenant, and ends up escorting him, by boat, into captivity across the Aral Sea. A storm strands the two on an island.', 'A young woman sharpshooter fighting with the Reds in Turkestan misses her forty-first victim, a handsome White lieutenant, and ends up escorting him, by boat, into captivity across the Aral Sea. A storm strands the two on an island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zA5JEZ49UY2kOUf6Ejt0wndgU5Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262806'),
  ('554333989839812566', 'The Forty-First', 1956, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Grigoriy Chukhray, Sergei Urusevsky, Leonid Bulgakov', 'Grigoriy Koltunov', 'Izolda Izvitskaya, Oleg Strizhenov, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Nikolay Dupak, Georgi Shapovalov, Pyotr Lyubeshkin, Lev Kovylin, Yuriy Romanov', null, 'An unexpected romance occurs for a female Red Army sniper and a White Army officer.', 'An unexpected romance occurs for a female Red Army sniper and a White Army officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xckVzPkiC09803rRrQD9mA63Hfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46741'),
  ('627459069074447228', 'The Forty-Year-Old Version', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Radha Blank, Michael L. Walker, Eric Branco', 'Radha Blank', 'Radha Blank, Peter Y. Kim, Oswin Benjamin, Reed Birney, Imani Lewis, T.J. Atoms, Welker White, Jacob Ming-Trent', 'R', 'Desperate for a breakthrough as she nears the big 4-0, struggling New York City playwright Radha finds inspiration by reinventing herself as a rapper.', 'Desperate for a breakthrough as she nears the big 4-0, struggling New York City playwright Radha finds inspiration by reinventing herself as a rapper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilMExVn5xyfIWAnqngqAB0OFsE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620897'),
  ('1150832554010394921', 'The Fossil', 1975, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Masaki Kobayashi, Kōzō Okazaki', 'Takeshi Yoshida, Shun Inagaki', 'Shin Saburi, Keiko Kishi, Gō Katō, Hisashi Igawa, Mayumi Ogawa, Komaki Kurihara, Kei Yamamoto, Orie Satō', 'NR', 'An industrialist is diagnosed with terminal cancer. He is abroad in Europe at the time, and a glimpse of a Japanese woman in that setting causes him to imagine her as the personification of his impending fate. As his dialogue with his imagined mortality continues, he meets the living woman, the template for his fantasy, and together, they tour rural churches. Gradually, he comes to some kind of peace about the diagnosis. When he returns to Japan, he is met with a series of challenges that profoundly test the lessons he has learned.', 'An industrialist is diagnosed with terminal cancer. He is abroad in Europe at the time, and a glimpse of a Japanese woman in that setting causes him to imagine her as the personification of his impending fate. As his dialogue with his imagined mortality continues, he meets the living woman, the template for his fantasy, and together, they tour rural churches. Gradually, he comes to some kind of peace about the diagnosis. When he returns to Japan, he is met with a series of challenges that profoundly test the lessons he has learned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w69H3MUB2dSANJvCZX6VwNoJGtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277261'),
  ('138908523563761474', 'The Foster Boy', 2011, 'Drama', 'Markus Imboden, Peter von Haller', 'Plinio Bachmann', 'Katja Riemann, Stefan Kurt, Maximilian Simonischek, Max Hubacher, Lisa Brand, Miriam Stein, Andreas Matti, Heidy Forster', null, 'Switzerland, 1955. The young orphan Max is sent as a foster child and contracted to work for the Bösiger family who lives on a farm. His foster parents treat him like a workhorse while their son seizes every opportunity to humiliate him. Playing the accordion is the one thing that is entirely his. But when the new teacher stands up for Max, it only makes a bad situation much worse. The only thing preserving his will to survive is his friendship with Berteli, who was also taken on to work at the farm. Max dreams of Argentina with her: a fantasy world, where allegedly even hayforks are made of silver.', 'Switzerland, 1955. The young orphan Max is sent as a foster child and contracted to work for the Bösiger family who lives on a farm. His foster parents treat him like a workhorse while their son seizes every opportunity to humiliate him. Playing the accordion is the one thing that is entirely his. But when the new teacher stands up for Max, it only makes a bad situation much worse. The only thing preserving his will to survive is his friendship with Berteli, who was also taken on to work at the farm. Max dreams of Argentina with her: a fantasy world, where allegedly even hayforks are made of silver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuhHf1r5FgAVzdy6LnQoOVRn6Db.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81556'),
  ('860588337786652632', 'The Foster Brothers', 1976, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ertem Eğilmez, Kriton İlyadis', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Kemal Sunal, Halit Akçatepe, Adile Naşit, Şener Şen, Ayşen Gruda, Hale Soygazi, Ergin Orbey, Jale Altuğ', null, 'Saban, Ramazan and Bayram are sailors in an Ottoman Navy and Hüsamettin is their commander. Hüsamettin''s aide Ramazan, Saban who is foster son of Hüsamettin''s sister and Bayram who is married to Hüsamettin''s niece stays at Hüsamettin''s family residence. Hüsamettin''s sister thinks Ramazan is her foster son Saban when she realizes her mistake she introduces Ramazan to her brother as her son in law Bayram since she was afraid of Hüsamettin''s short-tempered character. Things get complicated when real Saban and Bayram come to the residence. Now Saban has to be Ramazan and Bayram has to be Saban. Meanwhile, a gulyabani (a ghoul from Turkish folklore) haunts the residence.', 'Saban, Ramazan and Bayram are sailors in an Ottoman Navy and Hüsamettin is their commander. Hüsamettin''s aide Ramazan, Saban who is foster son of Hüsamettin''s sister and Bayram who is married to Hüsamettin''s niece stays at Hüsamettin''s family residence. Hüsamettin''s sister thinks Ramazan is her foster son Saban when she realizes her mistake she introduces Ramazan to her brother as her son in law Bayram since she was afraid of Hüsamettin''s short-tempered character. Things get complicated when real Saban and Bayram come to the residence. Now Saban has to be Ramazan and Bayram has to be Saban. Meanwhile, a gulyabani (a ghoul from Turkish folklore) haunts the residence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGW4S5CBTiIdkFE0nX6wljMDLjo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31405'),
  ('611774129042087779', 'The Foul King', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee In-Seop, Kim Jee-woon, Hong Kyung-pyo', 'Kim Dae-woo, Kim Jee-woon', 'Song Kang-ho, Jang Jin-young, Park Sang-myeon, Jung Woong-in, Song Young-chang, Jang Hang-seon, Kim Soo-ro, Lee Won-jong', null, 'A timid and extravagant bank clerk, Dae-ho is considered inefficient at his workplace. As he tries to be recognized by his superior, his efforts only cause more bad situations. But he has an explosive energy that nobody knows about. One day, after yet another day of suffering at work, he goes to a wrestling gym to persuade its owner to become his bank’s client. And, by accident, he starts to learn how to wrestle. From then, he starts to live a new life. And his personality starts to change…', 'A timid and extravagant bank clerk, Dae-ho is considered inefficient at his workplace. As he tries to be recognized by his superior, his efforts only cause more bad situations. But he has an explosive energy that nobody knows about. One day, after yet another day of suffering at work, he goes to a wrestling gym to persuade its owner to become his bank’s client. And, by accident, he starts to learn how to wrestle. From then, he starts to live a new life. And his personality starts to change…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mKT6y7dvKkc0bR0YMzCbPo8uED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52663'),
  ('876548829135369079', 'The Founder', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Amir R. Khan, Phil Hardage, John Lee Hancock', 'Robert D. Siegel', 'Michael Keaton, Nick Offerman, John Carroll Lynch, Linda Cardellini, B. J. Novak, Laura Dern, Justin Randell Brooke, Kate Kneeland', 'PG-13', 'The true story of how Ray Kroc, a salesman from Illinois, met Mac and Dick McDonald, who were running a burger operation in 1950s Southern California. Kroc was impressed by the brothers’ speedy system of making the food and saw franchise potential. He maneuvered himself into a position to be able to pull the company from the brothers and create a billion-dollar empire.', 'The true story of how Ray Kroc, a salesman from Illinois, met Mac and Dick McDonald, who were running a burger operation in 1950s Southern California. Kroc was impressed by the brothers’ speedy system of making the food and saw franchise potential. He maneuvered himself into a position to be able to pull the company from the brothers and create a billion-dollar empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gLIksu5ggdfBL1UbeTeonHquxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310307'),
  ('292206813117355800', 'The Founding of a Republic', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Huang Jianxin, Han Sanping, Zhao Xiaoshi', 'Wang Xing-Dong, Chen Bao-Guang', 'Tang Guoqiang, Liu Jin, Wang Wufu, Liu Sha, Zhang Guoli, Andy Lau, Donnie Yen, Xu Qing', null, 'The tale of one man who fought against the tyranny of a ruler and led his people in battle in the ultimate sacrifice for his country.', 'The tale of one man who fought against the tyranny of a ruler and led his people in battle in the ultimate sacrifice for his country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqLl0KQzj74yx1QQ1gyrpqjOhJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25626'),
  ('1141572319268014421', 'The Founding of an Army', 2017, 'History, War, Action', 'Edmond Fung Yuen-Man, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Han Sanping, Huang Jianxin, Zhao Ningyu', 'Liu Ye, Zhu Yawen, Huang Zhizhong, Chen Xiao, Wang Jingchun, Ou Hao, Liu Haoran, Ma Tianyu', null, 'The Founding of an Army is a 2017 Chinese film commissioned by China''s government to commemorate the 90th anniversary of the founding of the People''s Liberation Army.', 'The Founding of an Army is a 2017 Chinese film commissioned by China''s government to commemorate the 90th anniversary of the founding of the People''s Liberation Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3XywoT22tQqM2oEvb53V32ookf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468892'),
  ('595697369174918510', 'The Foundling', 1939, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tatyana Lukashevich, Semyon Sheynin, Vyacheslav Leshchyov', 'Rina Zelyonaya, Agniya Barto', 'Veronika Lebedeva, Faina Ranevskaya, Pyotr Repnin, Rostislav Plyatt, Rina Zelyonaya, Olga Zhizneva, Viktor Boyko, Viktor Gromov', null, 'A little girl is lost in Moscow and hits the road making fun (not intentionally) of everybody she meets. She''ll be back home soon but she will change the life of at least one man forever...', 'A little girl is lost in Moscow and hits the road making fun (not intentionally) of everybody she meets. She''ll be back home soon but she will change the life of at least one man forever...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vT6DuStaqPvEYIn6gmjyO2lEevT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83435'),
  ('687350620521336636', 'The Fountain', 2006, 'Drama, Adventure, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Darren Aronofsky, Matthew Libatique, Myron Hoffert', 'Darren Aronofsky', 'Hugh Jackman, Rachel Weisz, Ellen Burstyn, Mark Margolis, Stephen McHattie, Fernando Hernández, Cliff Curtis, Sean Patrick Thomas', 'PG-13', 'Spanning over one thousand years, and three parallel stories, The Fountain is a story of love, death, spirituality, and the fragility of our existence in this world.', 'Spanning over one thousand years, and three parallel stories, The Fountain is a story of love, death, spirituality, and the fragility of our existence in this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XTf8GuCVLWolubANaKkpk62YPq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1381'),
  ('398999295500795422', 'The Fountain for Suzanne', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Dušan Rapoš, Vladimír Ješina, Katalin Jánosy', 'Karol Hlávka', 'Eva Vejmělková, Jiří Bábek, Katarína Šugárová, Miloslav Holub, Jana Svobodová-Mařasová, Marek Bezoušek, Ondřej Malý, Sylvia Turbová', null, 'A story about the life and troubles of young people living in the city. The teenagers have to face real life, make their first major decisions, and learn that romance sometimes brings disappointment.', 'A story about the life and troubles of young people living in the city. The teenagers have to face real life, make their first major decisions, and learn that romance sometimes brings disappointment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2thV99ruCS3X4RZ6FEFSNzgaNgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50235'),
  ('914620289481667474', 'The Fountain of Youth', 1958, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Orson Welles, Sidney Hickox', 'Orson Welles, John Collier', 'Marjorie Bennett, Madge Blake, Billy House, Rick Jason, Nancy Kulp, Joi Lansing, Dan Tobin, Orson Welles', null, 'A darkly comic fable about vanity and desire, "The Fountain of Youth" follows a newly married couple whose relationship is destabilized by the arrival of a potion that promises centuries of youth and beauty—but in a quantity sufficient for only one person. As temptation and resentment grow, the gift becomes a catalyst for moral and emotional collapse. Written, directed, and narrated by Orson Welles and based on John Collier’s short story “Youth from Vienna,” the film uses stylized narration and experimental visual techniques to construct a compact essay on human vanity. (Note: Originally produced in 1956 as a television pilot and broadcast once in 1958 as part of NBC’s Colgate Theatre anthology series (S1E5); it later achieved independent archival and cultural status, including a 1958 Peabody Award.)', 'A darkly comic fable about vanity and desire, "The Fountain of Youth" follows a newly married couple whose relationship is destabilized by the arrival of a potion that promises centuries of youth and beauty—but in a quantity sufficient for only one person. As temptation and resentment grow, the gift becomes a catalyst for moral and emotional collapse. Written, directed, and narrated by Orson Welles and based on John Collier’s short story “Youth from Vienna,” the film uses stylized narration and experimental visual techniques to construct a compact essay on human vanity. (Note: Originally produced in 1956 as a television pilot and broadcast once in 1958 as part of NBC’s Colgate Theatre anthology series (S1E5); it later achieved independent archival and cultural status, including a 1958 Peabody Award.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPEeC7TgWLD96UZDWIYU8BGbA9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140032'),
  ('209551935306429212', 'The Fountainhead', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Robert Burks', 'Ayn Rand', 'Gary Cooper, Patricia Neal, Raymond Massey, Kent Smith, Robert Douglas, Henry Hull, Ray Collins, Moroni Olsen', 'NR', 'An uncompromising, visionary architect struggles to maintain his integrity and individualism despite personal, professional and economic pressures to conform to popular standards.', 'An uncompromising, visionary architect struggles to maintain his integrity and individualism despite personal, professional and economic pressures to conform to popular standards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uo8tfSwzrDeRS5YpmLVSXHSjOl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24650'),
  ('356021900866330222', 'The Four', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Fantasy', 'Gordon Chan, Janet Chun Siu-Chun, Kong Lingping', 'Frankie Tam Gong-Yuen, Gordon Chan, Maria Wong Si-Man', 'Deng Chao, Liu Yifei, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Collin Chou, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Wu Xiubo, Cheng Taishen, Jiang Yiyan', null, 'An undercover agent is assigned by his corrupt chief to infiltrate a rival department and sabotage their investigation of counterfeit currency. What he discovers is the counterfeiter''s real plan. To overthrow the capital. Not by flooding it with funny money, but with an army of undead.', 'An undercover agent is assigned by his corrupt chief to infiltrate a rival department and sabotage their investigation of counterfeit currency. What he discovers is the counterfeiter''s real plan. To overthrow the capital. Not by flooding it with funny money, but with an army of undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FN7JBHUN0aIGls5nxlwDAiQpIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120143'),
  ('55551188268169665', 'The Four 2', 2013, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Gordon Chan, Kong Lingping, Yang Zhenyu', 'Gordon Chan', 'Deng Chao, Liu Yifei, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Collin Chou, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Jiang Yiyan, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Cheng Taishen', 'PG-13', 'The four constables Emotionless, Iron Hands , Life Snatcher and ColdBlood are specially skilled in their own individual super powers. When the four constables of the Divine Constabulary investigate a murder in the suburbs, they unexpectedly stumble on clues to the murder of Emotionless''s family 15 years ago.', 'The four constables Emotionless, Iron Hands , Life Snatcher and ColdBlood are specially skilled in their own individual super powers. When the four constables of the Divine Constabulary investigate a murder in the suburbs, they unexpectedly stumble on clues to the murder of Emotionless''s family 15 years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keINQqFnbovPS5NuYFhgeE1i5Rv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251749'),
  ('776738367671336587', 'The Four 3', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Fantasy', 'Janet Chun Siu-Chun, Gordon Chan, Kong Lingping', 'Maria Wong Si-Man, Gordon Chan, Lui Koon-Nam', 'Deng Chao, Liu Yifei, Collin Chou, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Emma Wu, Wu Xiubo, Jiang Yiyan', null, 'The reputation of the Four constables survives, but since Emotionless’s departure, there have been changes at the Divine Constabulary. The four Coldblood, Iron Hands, Life Snatcher, rescue Zhuge Zhengwo from An Yunshan’s mountain fortress, then with the Emperor and Di armies, they attack. But An Yunshan absorbs their power, which means the constables and their allies now face their most lethal opponent yet, a nearly invincible kung fu master who won’t stop until he has absolute power...', 'The reputation of the Four constables survives, but since Emotionless’s departure, there have been changes at the Divine Constabulary. The four Coldblood, Iron Hands, Life Snatcher, rescue Zhuge Zhengwo from An Yunshan’s mountain fortress, then with the Emperor and Di armies, they attack. But An Yunshan absorbs their power, which means the constables and their allies now face their most lethal opponent yet, a nearly invincible kung fu master who won’t stop until he has absolute power...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXeEs2NCtw6IGoHxkxcsYQskpRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299738'),
  ('95286170617220647', 'The Four Assassins', 1975, 'Action, Adventure', 'Chang Cheh, Kung Mu-To, Wu Yueh-ling', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Alexander Fu Sheng, Chi Kuan-Chun, Bruce Tong Yim-Chaan, Phillip Kwok Chui, Richard Harrison, Shih Szu, Ting Wa-Chung, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui', null, 'Set at the time of Italian explorer Marco Polo''s historic expedition to China ,during the reign of Monogol ruler Kublai Khan, it stars American actor Richard Harrison as Polo. Taking considerable liberties with the historic record, the film has Polo turning up as an Imperial Inspector assigned to root out Chinese rebles in the south, but eventually being won over to their cause.', 'Set at the time of Italian explorer Marco Polo''s historic expedition to China ,during the reign of Monogol ruler Kublai Khan, it stars American actor Richard Harrison as Polo. Taking considerable liberties with the historic record, the film has Polo turning up as an Imperial Inspector assigned to root out Chinese rebles in the south, but eventually being won over to their cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rivnMDgUQAlU1K6gZjURv17pYiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56671'),
  ('941455003778577469', 'The Four Charlots Musketeers', 1974, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'André Hunebelle', 'Jean Halain', 'Gérard Rinaldi, Gérard Filipelli, Jean Sarrus, Jean-Guy Fechner, Josephine Chaplin, Daniel Ceccaldi, Paul Préboist, Bernard Haller', null, 'This French slapstick comedy stars the musician/comedian foursome Les Charlots, as valets to the Four Musketeers. One of the film''s highlights is a mutual kicking session between Cardinal Richelieu, the King, and a monk. This comedy foursome was enormously popular in 1970s France, and they made a huge number of films during that period.', 'This French slapstick comedy stars the musician/comedian foursome Les Charlots, as valets to the Four Musketeers. One of the film''s highlights is a mutual kicking session between Cardinal Richelieu, the King, and a monk. This comedy foursome was enormously popular in 1970s France, and they made a huge number of films during that period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxYRZinZzhgEkOnLmxx7Mls2NnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47157'),
  ('1005619103680470454', 'The Four Charlots Musketeers 2', 1974, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'André Hunebelle', 'Jean Halain', 'Gérard Rinaldi, Gérard Filipelli, Jean Sarrus, Jean-Guy Fechner, Jean Valmont, Yvan Tanguy, Gib Grossac, Georges Mansart', null, 'This French slapstick comedy stars the musician/comedian foursome Les Charlots, as valets to the Four Musketeers. One of the film''s highlights is a mutual kicking session between Cardinal Richelieu, the King, and a monk. This comedy foursome was enormously popular in 1970s France, and they made a huge number of films during that period.', 'This French slapstick comedy stars the musician/comedian foursome Les Charlots, as valets to the Four Musketeers. One of the film''s highlights is a mutual kicking session between Cardinal Richelieu, the King, and a monk. This comedy foursome was enormously popular in 1970s France, and they made a huge number of films during that period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Em8VOfmR19DK7qxM9I3b1upkbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62659'),
  ('478859790796899865', 'The Four Days of Naples', 1962, 'Drama, War', 'Nanni Loy, Marcello Gatti, Carlo Lastricati', 'Nanni Loy, Carlo Bernari, Massimo Franciosa', 'Lea Massari, Gian Maria Volonté, Aldo Giuffrè, Jean Sorel, Domenico Formato, Regina Bianchi, Raffaele Barbato, Pupella Maggio', null, 'September 1943. After Italy surrenders to the Allies, people in Naples believe the war is finally over, but soon they realize Germans are still in control — and as ruthless as ever. Armed with makeshift weapons, civilians rise up en masse against the invaders — and overwhelming odds.', 'September 1943. After Italy surrenders to the Allies, people in Naples believe the war is finally over, but soon they realize Germans are still in control — and as ruthless as ever. Armed with makeshift weapons, civilians rise up en masse against the invaders — and overwhelming odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTaSb8eTHl0rIHuLrH6G45DGPXL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65048'),
  ('896006948028211707', 'The Four Feathers', 1939, 'Adventure, Drama, War, History', 'Zoltan Korda, Georges Périnal', 'R.C. Sherriff', 'John Clements, Ralph Richardson, C. Aubrey Smith, June Duprez, Allan Jeayes, Jack Allen, Donald Gray, Frederick Culley', 'NR', 'A disgraced officer risks his life to help his childhood friends in battle.', 'A disgraced officer risks his life to help his childhood friends in battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GMbILAAjMdoVCba5fWjhz2ONuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10568'),
  ('667710726096793910', 'The Four Feathers', 1978, 'Adventure, Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Don Sharp, John Coquillon, Barry Langley', null, 'Beau Bridges, Robert Powell, Simon Ward, Jane Seymour, Harry Andrews, Richard Johnson, David Robb, Richard Beale', null, 'The fifth filming of the adventure classic about a British soldier in the 1880s who fights to regain his honor after being given four white feathers, symbols of cowardice.', 'The fifth filming of the adventure classic about a British soldier in the 1880s who fights to regain his honor after being given four white feathers, symbols of cowardice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qd7vyd3pGQ4UXMhKEHODkM5Zq9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197489'),
  ('62909321272889400', 'The Four Feathers', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance, War', 'Robert Richardson, Shekhar Kapur, Keith Pain', 'Michael Schiffer, Hossein Amini', 'Heath Ledger, Wes Bentley, Kate Hudson, Djimon Hounsou, Alex Jennings, Michael Sheen, Lucy Gordon, James Cosmo', 'PG-13', 'A young British officer resigns his post when he learns of his regiment''s plan to ship out to the Sudan for the conflict with the Mahdi. His friends and fiancée send him four white feathers as symbols of what they view as his cowardice. To redeem his honor, he disguises himself as an Arab and secretly saves their lives.', 'A young British officer resigns his post when he learns of his regiment''s plan to ship out to the Sudan for the conflict with the Mahdi. His friends and fiancée send him four white feathers as symbols of what they view as his cowardice. To redeem his honor, he disguises himself as an Arab and secretly saves their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfmpeRr9LTXzBC2dpC89FE5uavK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9093'),
  ('43332990188134087', 'The Four Gates of Death', 2026, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Zsolt Bernáth, Lajos Kiss', 'Zsolt Bernáth, G.V. Cooper, Damina Dávid', 'András Boda, Laszlo Turi, Zsolt Juhasz, Bernáth Fanni', null, 'A graveyard rendezvous that isn’t just about love, but about fulfilling a promise – and facing its consequences. A family weekend that digs up buried secrets – secrets that perhaps should have stayed underground forever. A legendary VHS tape, worth killing for – or maybe someone already has. And a childhood tale that proves, years later: sometimes the scariest things are the ones we believed were true as kids. From Horrorszkóp and Cruel World Team comes four dark and unsettling stories in this chilling horror anthology. Each one steeped in the shadow of death, human weakness, and the grim truth that the ending is never what you expect. Four stories. Four secrets. Four inevitable ends.', 'A graveyard rendezvous that isn’t just about love, but about fulfilling a promise – and facing its consequences. A family weekend that digs up buried secrets – secrets that perhaps should have stayed underground forever. A legendary VHS tape, worth killing for – or maybe someone already has. And a childhood tale that proves, years later: sometimes the scariest things are the ones we believed were true as kids. From Horrorszkóp and Cruel World Team comes four dark and unsettling stories in this chilling horror anthology. Each one steeped in the shadow of death, human weakness, and the grim truth that the ending is never what you expect. Four stories. Four secrets. Four inevitable ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLw6aWlLr0cDWpqQjOjnFIOeHEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1614492'),
  ('219823390388025648', 'The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse', 1921, 'War, Romance, Drama', 'Rex Ingram, John F. Seitz', 'June Mathis', 'Rudolph Valentino, Josef Swickard, Alice Terry, Alan Hale, Pomeroy Cannon, Bridgetta Clark, Virginia Warwick, Mabel Van Buren', null, 'Set in the years before and during World War I, this epic tale tells the story of a rich Argentine family, one of its two descending branches being half of French heritage, the other being half German. Following the death of the family patriarch, the man''s two daughters and their families resettle to France and Germany, respectively. In time the Great War breaks out, putting members of the family on opposing sides.', 'Set in the years before and during World War I, this epic tale tells the story of a rich Argentine family, one of its two descending branches being half of French heritage, the other being half German. Following the death of the family patriarch, the man''s two daughters and their families resettle to France and Germany, respectively. In time the Great War breaks out, putting members of the family on opposing sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/262nYFe45BxX22M9TPhB4BwEqby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31432'),
  ('1011299952503106577', 'The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse', 1962, 'Drama, War', 'Vincente Minnelli, Milton Krasner, Erich von Stroheim Jr.', 'John Gay, Robert Ardrey', 'Glenn Ford, Ingrid Thulin, Charles Boyer, Lee J. Cobb, Paul Lukas, Yvette Mimieux, Karlheinz Böhm, Paul Henreid', null, 'In Argentina, one daughter of patriarch Madariaga is married to a Frenchman while the other is married to a German thus leading to a crisis when Nazi Germany occupies France and some Madariaga family members fight on opposite sides.', 'In Argentina, one daughter of patriarch Madariaga is married to a Frenchman while the other is married to a German thus leading to a crisis when Nazi Germany occupies France and some Madariaga family members fight on opposite sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHVVqS0tpm6JI4sWr94u5vzZOvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50474'),
  ('404454592306479310', 'The Four Musicians of Bremen', 1922, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Four animal musicians consisting of a Horse, Cat, Dog, &amp; Rooster set out on their own quest to try to find some fame by playing their own music. Unfortunitly every where they go, trouble always occurs whether they are being chased by town folk, a sword fish, or being attacked by an army.', 'Four animal musicians consisting of a Horse, Cat, Dog, &amp; Rooster set out on their own quest to try to find some fame by playing their own music. Unfortunitly every where they go, trouble always occurs whether they are being chased by town folk, a sword fish, or being attacked by an army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3Gx6puG1mG3JwPKgiPUxkc9LT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154482'),
  ('53829387938272498', 'The Four Musketeers', 1974, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Lester, David Watkin, Patricio Beltran Aparicio', 'George MacDonald Fraser', 'Michael York, Oliver Reed, Richard Chamberlain, Frank Finlay, Faye Dunaway, Christopher Lee, Raquel Welch, Geraldine Chaplin', 'PG', 'The Four Musketeers defend the queen and her dressmaker from Cardinal Richelieu and Milady de Winter.', 'The Four Musketeers defend the queen and her dressmaker from Cardinal Richelieu and Milady de Winter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dm0ArEYWrrfyOkMUbKOE8ZnCc92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12310'),
  ('751294424076717468', 'The Four of Us', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Florian Gottschick, Christof Wahl, Lukas Steinbach', 'Florian von Bornstädt', 'Nilam Farooq, Jonas Nay, Paula Kalenberg, Louis Nitsche, Tim Oliver Schultz, Janina Elkin, Paula Paul', null, 'After their partner swap experiment takes a turn, four friends arrive at a remote beach hut to face the fallout and purge themselves of deeper truths.', 'After their partner swap experiment takes a turn, four friends arrive at a remote beach hut to face the fallout and purge themselves of deeper truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAlmGXeAtc7ejp2G1V3qT4mATlb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874965'),
  ('282857001399919531', 'The Four Poster', 1952, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Irving Reis, Hal Mohr', 'Allan Scott, Jan de Hartog', 'Rex Harrison, Lilli Palmer', null, 'In turn-of-the-century New York, the marriage of John and Abby Edwards unfolds over the years.', 'In turn-of-the-century New York, the marriage of John and Abby Edwards unfolds over the years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOEt54CiY9Ba7q7z6FRvzAGabnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204294'),
  ('348892377655214566', 'The Four Seasons', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alan Alda, Victor J. Kemper, Joan Van Horn', 'Alan Alda', 'Alan Alda, Carol Burnett, Len Cariou, Sandy Dennis, Rita Moreno, Jack Weston, Bess Armstrong, Elizabeth Alda', null, 'Three middle-aged wealthy couples take vacations together in Spring, Summer, Autumn and Winter. Along the way we are treated to mid-life, marital, parental and other crises.', 'Three middle-aged wealthy couples take vacations together in Spring, Summer, Autumn and Winter. Along the way we are treated to mid-life, marital, parental and other crises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xKPkL7kHdgq3YI08tXISCQwRJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25113'),
  ('551913331409208523', 'The Four Skulls of Jonathan Drake', 1959, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Herbert S. Greene, Maury Gertsman, Edward L. Cahn', 'Orville H. Hampton', 'Henry Daniell, Valerie French, Grant Richards, Paul Wexler, Eduard Franz, Frank Gerstle, Lumsden Hare, Howard Wendell', null, 'Jonathan Drake, while attending his brother''s funeral, is shocked to find the head of the deceased is missing. When his brother''s skull shows up later in a locked cabinet, Drake realizes an ancient curse placed upon his grandfather by a tribe of South American Jivaro Indians is still in effect and that he himself is the probable next victim.', 'Jonathan Drake, while attending his brother''s funeral, is shocked to find the head of the deceased is missing. When his brother''s skull shows up later in a locked cabinet, Drake realizes an ancient curse placed upon his grandfather by a tribe of South American Jivaro Indians is still in effect and that he himself is the probable next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkFhFmuH7BnZBDMNUncOiwmbmoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86191'),
  ('586341408590167479', 'The Four Times', 2010, 'Drama', 'Michelangelo Frammartino, Andrea Locatelli, Franco Monopoli', 'Michelangelo Frammartino', 'Giuseppe Fuda, Nazareno Timpano, Bruno Timpano, Artemio Vallone, Domenico Cavallo, Santo Cavallo, Peppe Cavallo, Isidoro Chiera', 'NR', 'An old shepherd lives his last days in a quiet medieval village perched high on the hills of Calabria, at the southernmost tip of Italy. He herds goats under skies that most villagers have deserted long ago. He is sick, and believes to find his medicine in the dust he collects on the church floor, which he drinks in his water every day.', 'An old shepherd lives his last days in a quiet medieval village perched high on the hills of Calabria, at the southernmost tip of Italy. He herds goats under skies that most villagers have deserted long ago. He is sick, and believes to find his medicine in the dust he collects on the church floor, which he drinks in his water every day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCgtAYG53uRdvET4O482paUGMuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57389'),
  ('695862260303306600', 'The Four Troublesome Heads', 1898, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'One of the greatest of black art pictures. The conjurer appears before the audience, with his head in its proper place. He then removes his head, and throwing it in the air, it appears on the table opposite another head, and both detached heads sing in unison. The conjurer then removes it a third time. You then see all three of his heads, which are exact duplicates, upon the table at one time, while the conjurer again stands before the audience with his head perfectly intact, singing in unison with the three heads upon the table. He closes the picture by bowing himself from the stage.', 'One of the greatest of black art pictures. The conjurer appears before the audience, with his head in its proper place. He then removes his head, and throwing it in the air, it appears on the table opposite another head, and both detached heads sing in unison. The conjurer then removes it a third time. You then see all three of his heads, which are exact duplicates, upon the table at one time, while the conjurer again stands before the audience with his head perfectly intact, singing in unison with the three heads upon the table. He closes the picture by bowing himself from the stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epFT2yQn189iHMqRTf9oZAyIg31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49296'),
  ('790262861724536651', 'The Four Truths', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Hervé Bromberger, Alessandro Blasetti, René Clair', 'Rafael Azcona, Frédéric Grendel, René Clair', 'Leslie Caron, Charles Aznavour, Michel Serrault, Jean Poiret, Anna Karina, Hubert Deschamps, Monica Vitti, Sylva Koscina', null, '"Les quatre vérités" aka "The Four Truths" is a movie anthology that consists of four segments, all loosely parodying fables from the 17th-century French poet Jean de la Fontaine. The US cut usually features only 3 segments.', '"Les quatre vérités" aka "The Four Truths" is a movie anthology that consists of four segments, all loosely parodying fables from the 17th-century French poet Jean de la Fontaine. The US cut usually features only 3 segments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJt8rxop3QGSxSVQiBSC3tUOy4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139609'),
  ('595325858571613784', 'The Four-Faced Liar', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jacob Chase, Danny Grunes', 'Marja-Lewis Ryan', 'Marja-Lewis Ryan, Emily Peck, Todd Kubrak, Liz Osborn, Daniel Carlisle, Gil Zabarsky', 'NR', 'A story of love and lies for four twenty-somethings looking to find themselves in New York City. A pair of best friends and a seemingly perfect couple meet at a local Irish pub tucked in the winding streets of the West Village. Through their chance meeting, the four bond and over time all of their relationships with one another morph into love, betrayal and heartbreak for all.', 'A story of love and lies for four twenty-somethings looking to find themselves in New York City. A pair of best friends and a seemingly perfect couple meet at a local Irish pub tucked in the winding streets of the West Village. Through their chance meeting, the four bond and over time all of their relationships with one another morph into love, betrayal and heartbreak for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81Poo7kSBjYGjA7ytdHtu4fhaGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44991'),
  ('896013113438250333', 'The Fourth Angel', 2001, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'John Irvin, Mike Molloy', 'Allan Scott, Robin Hunter', 'Jeremy Irons, Forest Whitaker, Jason Priestley, Briony Glassco, Charlotte Rampling, Lois Maxwell, Timothy West, Joel Pitts', 'R', 'Workaholic reporter, Jack Elgin takes his family on a working trip to India, but their aircraft is hijacked in Cyprus by a previously-unknown terrorist movement, and his wife and daughter are among the slaughtered. With western governments suppressing key facts and unwilling to go after the terrorists, Jack uses his contacts and snooping skill to seek the truth himself.', 'Workaholic reporter, Jack Elgin takes his family on a working trip to India, but their aircraft is hijacked in Cyprus by a previously-unknown terrorist movement, and his wife and daughter are among the slaughtered. With western governments suppressing key facts and unwilling to go after the terrorists, Jack uses his contacts and snooping skill to seek the truth himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4IndiS7IfUDjobyIENlFaba6b9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57047'),
  ('539458288926641320', 'The Fourth Dimension', 1936, null, 'Jean Painlevé, Achille-Pierre Dufour', null, null, null, 'The film begins with methodical descriptions of one-dimensional, two-dimensional, and three-dimensional space. It then looks at a two-dimensional world inhabited by flat mice. It imagines how a human, from the third dimension could interact with that world. It then suggests how beings from a fourth dimension might interact with us. Next the film posits time as a fourth dimension, with scenes to aid comprehension. An off-screen narrator, graphs, and clever photography provide explanations and illustrations. The film asks viewers to use their imaginations.', 'The film begins with methodical descriptions of one-dimensional, two-dimensional, and three-dimensional space. It then looks at a two-dimensional world inhabited by flat mice. It imagines how a human, from the third dimension could interact with that world. It then suggests how beings from a fourth dimension might interact with us. Next the film posits time as a fourth dimension, with scenes to aid comprehension. An off-screen narrator, graphs, and clever photography provide explanations and illustrations. The film asks viewers to use their imaginations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyo5EkYSuGPr0gRAG1YZoUxzBJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147254'),
  ('476177210631034550', 'The Fourth Dimension', 1988, 'Animation, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Zbigniew Rybczyński', 'Zbigniew Rybczyński', 'Mark Beard, Jacqueline Ramel', null, 'Shows a couple (Adam and Eve) and various objects, simultaneously, in time, space and movement.', 'Shows a couple (Adam and Eve) and various objects, simultaneously, in time, space and movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nb1CIBaquiSDQirZswMQJkzOGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331504'),
  ('810096242621717473', 'The Fourth Kind', 2009, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Lorenzo Senatore, Olatunde Osunsanmi', 'Olatunde Osunsanmi', 'Milla Jovovich, Elias Koteas, Will Patton, Hakeem Kae-Kazim, Corey Johnson, Enzo Cilenti, Eric Loren, Mia McKenna-Bruce', 'PG-13', 'Since the 1960s, a disproportionate number of the population in and around Nome, Alaska, have gone missing. Despite FBI investigations, the disappearances remain a mystery. Dr. Abigail Tyler, a psychologist, may be on the verge of blowing the unsolved cases wide open when, during the course of treating her patients, she finds evidence of alien abductions.', 'Since the 1960s, a disproportionate number of the population in and around Nome, Alaska, have gone missing. Despite FBI investigations, the disappearances remain a mystery. Dr. Abigail Tyler, a psychologist, may be on the verge of blowing the unsolved cases wide open when, during the course of treating her patients, she finds evidence of alien abductions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfnsGUwurUQqlpvArBvUVc9rYXa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22824'),
  ('778809845551961897', 'The Fourth King', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Stefano Reali, Giovanni Mammolotti', 'Enzo De Caro, Jurij Markovič Nagibin, Enrico Medioli', 'Raoul Bova, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Daniel Ceccaldi, Joachim Fuchsberger, Billy Dee Williams, Bruno Bilotta, Anja Kruse, Giorgio Tirabassi', null, 'Alazar, a simple farmer who is also a beekeeper, meets the Three Wise Men Caspar, Melchior and Balthazar, who have set off to celebrate the arrival on earth of the Messiah. Alazar''s magic bees become magically transformed into the tail of the bright comet which leads the four of them to the manger. At first, the brave young farmer''s son is on the point of leaving the Wise Men to their fate because he has been forced against his will by their magic powers to leave his pregnant wife Izirah behind. He only very reluctantly agrees to the Kings'' request to accompany them. Although the Three Wise Men make it very clear to him how important the Messiah''s arrival on earth is, the relationship between the four men remains very tense. Nevertheless, despite all disagreements, our travelling companions soon become firm friends -and after several exciting adventures they finally succeed in locating the manger. The Three Kings then allow Alazar to return home to his loving wife.', 'Alazar, a simple farmer who is also a beekeeper, meets the Three Wise Men Caspar, Melchior and Balthazar, who have set off to celebrate the arrival on earth of the Messiah. Alazar''s magic bees become magically transformed into the tail of the bright comet which leads the four of them to the manger. At first, the brave young farmer''s son is on the point of leaving the Wise Men to their fate because he has been forced against his will by their magic powers to leave his pregnant wife Izirah behind. He only very reluctantly agrees to the Kings'' request to accompany them. Although the Three Wise Men make it very clear to him how important the Messiah''s arrival on earth is, the relationship between the four men remains very tense. Nevertheless, despite all disagreements, our travelling companions soon become firm friends -and after several exciting adventures they finally succeed in locating the manger. The Three Kings then allow Alazar to return home to his loving wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsmAGUHsYQto7UkW9PQF2mLDcfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311532'),
  ('597247412387021696', 'The Fourth Man', 2007, 'Mystery, Action, Thriller', 'Dejan Zečević, Goran Volarević', 'Dejan Zečević', 'Nikola Kojo, Dragan Petrović ''Pele'', Marija Karan, Bogdan Diklić, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Miodrag ''Miki'' Krstović, Boris Milivojević, Radoslav ''Rale'' Milenković', null, 'A man awakens from a two-month-long coma. Total amnesia. A bullet fired point blank. He doesn''t remember anything. He''s told that he had a wife and a son. They''ve been killed. He''s revealed his past identity by the Colonel, who insists they are best friends. He''s a Major of the Military Security Agency. An inspector from the State Security Agency appears affirming that he has information on people responsible for the massacre of his family. The Major is discharged from the hospital. He tries to patch together a normal life but is confronted with emptiness and despair. His only chance of discovering his identity and the assassin of his family is to accept the game that the Inspector has set up for him with the Businessman, the Mafioso and the Politician. He agrees... Discovers that he was a war criminal... Realizes who took a shot at him... Finds out who killed his family... Discovers the Fourth Man!', 'A man awakens from a two-month-long coma. Total amnesia. A bullet fired point blank. He doesn''t remember anything. He''s told that he had a wife and a son. They''ve been killed. He''s revealed his past identity by the Colonel, who insists they are best friends. He''s a Major of the Military Security Agency. An inspector from the State Security Agency appears affirming that he has information on people responsible for the massacre of his family. The Major is discharged from the hospital. He tries to patch together a normal life but is confronted with emptiness and despair. His only chance of discovering his identity and the assassin of his family is to accept the game that the Inspector has set up for him with the Businessman, the Mafioso and the Politician. He agrees... Discovers that he was a war criminal... Realizes who took a shot at him... Finds out who killed his family... Discovers the Fourth Man!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gVdjv2UWIL8xtivrSOyPFLf7Si.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26836'),
  ('157448843319082703', 'The Fourth Portrait', 2010, 'Drama', 'Chung Mong-hong', 'Tu Hsiang-Wen, Chung Mong-hong', 'Pi Shiao-hai, King Shih-chieh, Hao Lei, Leon Dai, Na-Do, Terri Kwan, Lo Pei-an, Vincent Liang', null, 'Ten year-old Xiang faces a lonely future after his father dies. Just when he thinks he''s going to spend his life in the orphanage, his estranged mother shows up. And his life changes forever... A loveless mother, a hateful stepfather, a chilly home. Where''s Xiang heading to? He finds comfort in drawing and his work reveals his longing for care and affection. Life is full of hope again when he meets the old school janitor who doesn''t show his kindness easily and a portly man who has crazy ideas and is haunted with nightmares of his brother. A scary truth is about to be unmasked. Will Xiang be able to depict his own image in the fourth portrait?', 'Ten year-old Xiang faces a lonely future after his father dies. Just when he thinks he''s going to spend his life in the orphanage, his estranged mother shows up. And his life changes forever... A loveless mother, a hateful stepfather, a chilly home. Where''s Xiang heading to? He finds comfort in drawing and his work reveals his longing for care and affection. Life is full of hope again when he meets the old school janitor who doesn''t show his kindness easily and a portly man who has crazy ideas and is haunted with nightmares of his brother. A scary truth is about to be unmasked. Will Xiang be able to depict his own image in the fourth portrait?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eCVRuFyR9nhkZ8S9zd8RDOYUwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59164'),
  ('229288956630856482', 'The Fourth Power', 1985, 'Drama', 'Serge Leroy, André Domage', 'Serge Leroy, Yonnick Flot', 'Philippe Noiret, Nicole Garcia, Roland Blanche, Michel Subor, Jean-Claude Brialy, Pascal Légitimus, Jean Lescot, Bernard Freyd', null, 'Yves Dorget, major reporter in a daily newspaper, finds on an "affair" part of a simple news item Catherine Carré, his former friend, editor and chief and star presenter of a television newscast.', 'Yves Dorget, major reporter in a daily newspaper, finds on an "affair" part of a simple news item Catherine Carré, his former friend, editor and chief and star presenter of a television newscast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOypOOhDBb2zMyV3K5661Ryz2Eu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533868'),
  ('46374147270077116', 'The Fourth Protocol', 1987, 'Action, Thriller', 'Phil Meheux, John Mackenzie, Mark Raggett', 'Frederick Forsyth', 'Michael Caine, Pierce Brosnan, Ned Beatty, Joanna Cassidy, Julian Glover, Michael Gough, Ray McAnally, Ian Richardson', null, 'Led by Kim Philby, Plan Aurora is a plan that breaches the top-secret Fourth Protocol and turns the fears that shaped it into a living nightmare. A crack Soviet agent, placed under cover in a quiet English country town, begins to assemble a nuclear bomb, whilst an MI5 agent attempts to prevent its detonation.', 'Led by Kim Philby, Plan Aurora is a plan that breaches the top-secret Fourth Protocol and turns the fears that shaped it into a living nightmare. A crack Soviet agent, placed under cover in a quiet English country town, begins to assemble a nuclear bomb, whilst an MI5 agent attempts to prevent its detonation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qh4JMlyWKttjTUvARdEfqpuvqP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4918'),
  ('477852297230989781', 'The Fourth State', 2012, 'Thriller', 'Daniel Gottschalk, Dennis Gansel', 'Dennis Gansel', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Kasia Smutniak, Mark Ivanir, Max Riemelt, Stipe Erceg, Cosima Shaw, Reiner Schöne, Rade Šerbedžija', null, 'A journalist gets caught up in a terrorist plot in Moscow while investigating the Russian secret service.', 'A journalist gets caught up in a terrorist plot in Moscow while investigating the Russian secret service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHns6BrDBnxQAHZTmr8rtiDXQEU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92484'),
  ('868370037273061282', 'The Fourth Victim', 1971, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Eugenio Martín, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Santiago Moncada, Vicente Coello, Eugenio Martín', 'Carroll Baker, Michael Craig, Miranda Campa, José Luis López Vázquez, Enzo Garinei, Phillip Ross, Alberto Fernández, Manuel Gallardo', null, 'A wealthy Englishman finds his third wife dead. After the police discover that his first two wives had also died suddenly, an investigation is launched. Meanwhile, a new neighbor moves in and becomes very interested in him.', 'A wealthy Englishman finds his third wife dead. After the police discover that his first two wives had also died suddenly, an investigation is launched. Meanwhile, a new neighbor moves in and becomes very interested in him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKi6IRe5rZGPGRKovyK2Bu7wgzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29498'),
  ('706890763103155078', 'The Fourth War', 1990, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John Frankenheimer, Julia Done, Don French', 'Stephen Peters, Kenneth Ross', 'Roy Scheider, Jürgen Prochnow, Tim Reid, Lara Harris, Harry Dean Stanton, Dale Dye, William MacDonald, David Palffy', 'R', 'Cold War adversaries Col. Jack Knowles and his Russian counterpart, Col. Valachev, are stationed on opposite sides of the German-Czech border. Both men are responsible for a group of troops in their remote settings, and both have been shaped by their combat experiences and a shared aversion to their superiors'' ways of doing things. After a defector is killed, things escalate into a full-fledged battle with serious geopolitical ramifications.', 'Cold War adversaries Col. Jack Knowles and his Russian counterpart, Col. Valachev, are stationed on opposite sides of the German-Czech border. Both men are responsible for a group of troops in their remote settings, and both have been shaped by their combat experiences and a shared aversion to their superiors'' ways of doing things. After a defector is killed, things escalate into a full-fledged battle with serious geopolitical ramifications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxSLCQQ37QP0YZxUITtB18bynHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51434'),
  ('807968241141160007', 'The Fourth Wise Man', 1985, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Ray Rhodes, Jon Kranhouse', null, 'Martin Sheen, Alan Arkin, James Farentino, Eileen Brennan, Harold Gould, Lance Kerwin, Jerry Houser, Charlie Sheen', null, 'Artaban is a young Magus (Wise Man) who desires to follow the star to the birthplace of the coming King, against the counsel of his friends and family. Carrying three precious jewels to give to the baby Messiah, Artaban and his reluctant servant Orontes set off to join the caravan of the three other wise men. They miss the caravan, but Artaban continues the search for his King, always one step behind. Artaban spends much of his remaining wealth and all of his energy helping the poor and unfortunate people he meets, until at the end of his life he finally finds Jesus--at His trial! Has Artaban wasted his life in a foolish quest? Will he ever get the chance to present his gifts to the King?', 'Artaban is a young Magus (Wise Man) who desires to follow the star to the birthplace of the coming King, against the counsel of his friends and family. Carrying three precious jewels to give to the baby Messiah, Artaban and his reluctant servant Orontes set off to join the caravan of the three other wise men. They miss the caravan, but Artaban continues the search for his King, always one step behind. Artaban spends much of his remaining wealth and all of his energy helping the poor and unfortunate people he meets, until at the end of his life he finally finds Jesus--at His trial! Has Artaban wasted his life in a foolish quest? Will he ever get the chance to present his gifts to the King?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYD0CjsTOCxCvbGvEcD3mx1MMbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81268'),
  ('97208964779243880', 'The Fox', 1967, 'Drama', 'Mark Rydell, William A. Fraker, Burtt Harris', 'Lewis John Carlino, Howard Koch', 'Sandy Dennis, Anne Heywood, Keir Dullea, Glynne Morris', 'PG', 'Jill Banford and Ellen March have built a good life together on a hardscrabble Canadian farm. Then handsome Paul Grenfell enters their isolated world, and sets friend against friend. But is Paul the real trouble between Jill and Ellen? Or has his presence merely awakened the unspoken, unexplored sexual tension that always existed between the women?', 'Jill Banford and Ellen March have built a good life together on a hardscrabble Canadian farm. Then handsome Paul Grenfell enters their isolated world, and sets friend against friend. But is Paul the real trouble between Jill and Ellen? Or has his presence merely awakened the unspoken, unexplored sexual tension that always existed between the women?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzme3QqBk2gbVBOwpffupF3y4Ip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74896'),
  ('681760404979620732', 'The Fox', 2023, 'History, Drama, War', 'Adrian Goiginger, Yoshi Heimrath, Paul Sprinz', 'Adrian Goiginger', 'Simon Morzé, Karl Markovics, Pit Bukowski, Karola Niederhuber, Marko Kerezovic, Joseph Stoisits, Maximilian Echtinger, Joshua Bader', 'NR', 'At the dawn of World War II, a young motorcycle courier in the Austrian army encounters a wounded fox cub and takes it with him to occupied France. The soldier and the fox develop an unlikely bond. Based on the true story of Franz Streitberger, director Adrian Goiginger’s great-grandfather.', 'At the dawn of World War II, a young motorcycle courier in the Austrian army encounters a wounded fox cub and takes it with him to occupied France. The soldier and the fox develop an unlikely bond. Based on the true story of Franz Streitberger, director Adrian Goiginger’s great-grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxY4NZFRKr9faxR5CMK6pIDpm0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936117'),
  ('362899431767381414', 'The Fox & the Bird', 2019, 'Animation', 'Frédéric Guillaume, Samuel Guillaume', 'Christophe Pagnon', null, null, 'A solitary fox finds itself improvising fatherhood for a freshly hatched baby bird. Two paths cross and a family is formed, until fate reminds each of the life it is meant to lead.', 'A solitary fox finds itself improvising fatherhood for a freshly hatched baby bird. Two paths cross and a family is formed, until fate reminds each of the life it is meant to lead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RxJOGTLYWIqk0Bkvc0cjku2hsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585596'),
  ('686704232604110674', 'The Fox and the Child', 2007, 'Adventure, Family', 'Gérard Simon, François Royet, Luc Jacquet', 'Luc Jacquet, Eric Rognard', 'Bertille Noël-Bruneau, Isabelle Carré, Thomas Laliberté, Camille Lambert', 'G', 'A young girl of about 10 years lives in a solitary peasant''s house on the edge of the jurassic mountains in the East of France. One day in autumn, when she is on her way to school through the forest, she observes a hunting fox. Of course, the fox flees from her, but the girl feels a strong desire to meet the fox again.', 'A young girl of about 10 years lives in a solitary peasant''s house on the edge of the jurassic mountains in the East of France. One day in autumn, when she is on her way to school through the forest, she observes a hunting fox. Of course, the fox flees from her, but the girl feels a strong desire to meet the fox again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBpc03hS9A7QPv0k6AZfDCdKURt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5139'),
  ('1093233536391884748', 'The Fox and the Hare', 1973, 'Animation, Family', 'Yuri Norstein, Teodor Bunimovich', 'Yuri Norstein', 'Viktor Khokhryakov', null, 'Hare enlists four brave friends to help him reclaim his home from the wily Fox.', 'Hare enlists four brave friends to help him reclaim his home from the wily Fox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzajMiBdmJHBoJVugzZ91T6Vwry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72205'),
  ('940844420352223356', 'The Fox and the Hound', 1981, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama, Family', 'Richard Rich, Art Stevens, Ted Berman', null, 'Mickey Rooney, Kurt Russell, Pearl Bailey, Jack Albertson, Sandy Duncan, Jeanette Nolan, Pat Buttram, Richard Bakalyan', 'G', 'When a feisty little fox named Tod is adopted into a farm family, he quickly becomes friends with a fun and adorable hound puppy named Copper. Life is full of hilarious adventures until Copper is expected to take on his role as a hunting dog -- and the object of his search is his best friend!', 'When a feisty little fox named Tod is adopted into a farm family, he quickly becomes friends with a fun and adorable hound puppy named Copper. Life is full of hilarious adventures until Copper is expected to take on his role as a hunting dog -- and the object of his search is his best friend!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aC3k6XBaYnulGSkK8263ABjU3Md.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10948'),
  ('957776816549090510', 'The Fox and the Hound 2', 2006, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Jim Kammerud', 'Roger S.H. Schulman, Rich Burns', 'Reba McEntire, Patrick Swayze, Jonah Bobo, Harrison Fahn, Jeff Foxworthy, Vicki Lawrence, Stephen Root, Jim Cummings', 'G', 'Best friends Tod, a fox kit, and Copper, a hound puppy, visit a country fair when they see a band of dogs called "The Singin'' Strays". The band has five members: Dixie, Cash, Granny Rose, and twin brothers Waylon and Floyd. It is important that they perform well because a talent scout is visiting.', 'Best friends Tod, a fox kit, and Copper, a hound puppy, visit a country fair when they see a band of dogs called "The Singin'' Strays". The band has five members: Dixie, Cash, Granny Rose, and twin brothers Waylon and Floyd. It is important that they perform well because a talent scout is visiting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3b8nenAzu5OJk7sbPJURwmeHSV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9948'),
  ('651715817771011566', 'The Fox Chase', 1928, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Oswald is with his mates in a fox hunt, but he finds his horse is stubborn and won''t let him ride at first. Meanwhile, the sly fox outwits the dogs and riders in pursuit at every turn.', 'Oswald is with his mates in a fox hunt, but he finds his horse is stubborn and won''t let him ride at first. Meanwhile, the sly fox outwits the dogs and riders in pursuit at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJxkaBXBCjQg2pP3kRzIo95AatL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39819'),
  ('243500113454744852', 'The Fox Family', 2006, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music', 'Lee Hyung-gon', null, 'Joo Hyun, Park Jun-gyu, Ha Jung-woo, Park Si-yeon, Ko Joo-yeon, Sunwoo Yong-nyeo, Woo Hyeon, Byun Shin-ho', null, 'The Kumiho family circus in town -- and with it, apparently, a mysterious murderer. The members of motherless family aren’t helping their case with their strange remarks about humans and their initial performances, cavalcades of dismemberment and torrents of blood which terrify the local kids. Pretty soon, a dour, downbeat cop is on the tail of the plucky, bumbling Kumihos. Or rather, tails -- “kumiho” is the word for the fox spirits of Korean mythology, and this clan from Nam Mountain near Seoul, temporarily disguised as people thanks to a magic spell, must eat human livers during a brief, once-in-a-millennium lunar eclipse to shed their foxy nature and assume permanent human form. When the sleazy reprobate on the run from mobsters stumbles into their eerie household, he soon finds himself a little too enthusiastically involved in their scheming after human flesh—and involved with the sexy elder-sister fox spirit as well!', 'The Kumiho family circus in town -- and with it, apparently, a mysterious murderer. The members of motherless family aren’t helping their case with their strange remarks about humans and their initial performances, cavalcades of dismemberment and torrents of blood which terrify the local kids. Pretty soon, a dour, downbeat cop is on the tail of the plucky, bumbling Kumihos. Or rather, tails -- “kumiho” is the word for the fox spirits of Korean mythology, and this clan from Nam Mountain near Seoul, temporarily disguised as people thanks to a magic spell, must eat human livers during a brief, once-in-a-millennium lunar eclipse to shed their foxy nature and assume permanent human form. When the sleazy reprobate on the run from mobsters stumbles into their eerie household, he soon finds himself a little too enthusiastically involved in their scheming after human flesh—and involved with the sexy elder-sister fox spirit as well!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvlBxg7vIxyBEi0uFVHDftHE69m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58542'),
  ('344905361643042561', 'The Fox Hunt', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Richard Edwards', 'NR', 'It''s morning in the English countryside and time for the gentry to participate in their favorite sport: the fox hunt. The eccentric gentlemen come in all shapes and sizes, the fat ones putting the greatest strain on the horses. The craziest things happen to the monocled hunters. One even gets knocked off his horse when it jumps over a brick wall. He shoots straight up into the air and, thanks to a parachute hidden in his clothes, makes a gentle landing. But instead of the ground, he lands on a cow. Upset by her unwanted passenger, she takes off at top speed, finally dumping him in a mud puddle, where he lands on a pig and continues his wacky ride. Meanwhile, the poor fox finally gets trapped in a hollow log. Dogs to the left of him, dogs to the right! Luckily, the beleaguered creature gets help from a certain powerful, and pungent, friend.', 'It''s morning in the English countryside and time for the gentry to participate in their favorite sport: the fox hunt. The eccentric gentlemen come in all shapes and sizes, the fat ones putting the greatest strain on the horses. The craziest things happen to the monocled hunters. One even gets knocked off his horse when it jumps over a brick wall. He shoots straight up into the air and, thanks to a parachute hidden in his clothes, makes a gentle landing. But instead of the ground, he lands on a cow. Upset by her unwanted passenger, she takes off at top speed, finally dumping him in a mud puddle, where he lands on a pig and continues his wacky ride. Meanwhile, the poor fox finally gets trapped in a hollow log. Dogs to the left of him, dogs to the right! Luckily, the beleaguered creature gets help from a certain powerful, and pungent, friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ab6JRxWFiTaNdbyXaup4TFVNrek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57222'),
  ('868815321287924765', 'The Fox Hunt', 1938, 'Animation, Family', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Florence Gill, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald controls the hounds , and Goofy is riding on Horace Horsecollar, as the fox outwits both of them.', 'Donald controls the hounds , and Goofy is riding on Horace Horsecollar, as the fox outwits both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukjVTFhObcsuxBcEZlAeVuiVfrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69101'),
  ('270069212147317020', 'The Fox''s Widow', 1962, 'Animation', 'Ivo Caprino', 'Peter Christen Asbjørnsen', 'Harald Heide Steen, Siri Rom, Trine Pedersen, Svein Byhring, Turid Haaland, Lasse Kolstad, Sølvi Wang', null, 'Ivo Caprinos animated adaption of the classical Norwegian folktale', 'Ivo Caprinos animated adaption of the classical Norwegian folktale', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8PGlsd4ftKFmKBj2xBLMiNZOwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39215'),
  ('784077239928787393', 'The Foxes of Harrow', 1947, 'Romance, Drama', 'John M. Stahl, Joseph LaShelle', 'Wanda Tuchock', 'Rex Harrison, Maureen O''Hara, Richard Haydn, Victor McLaglen, Patricia Medina, Vanessa Brown, Gene Lockhart, Hugo Haas', null, 'An Irish rascal and inveterate gambler uses his considerable skills at the gaming tables of New Orleans to become fabulously rich.', 'An Irish rascal and inveterate gambler uses his considerable skills at the gaming tables of New Orleans to become fabulously rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pHPNhz2HqNCiHq0S2PE1WShiM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217155'),
  ('1092420283089842073', 'The Fragile Colossus', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Frédéric Fourgeaud, Malik Brahimi, Stéphanie Murat', 'Aude Marcle', 'Éric Cantona, Françoise Fabian, Aure Atika, Alix Poisson, Éric Caravaca, Timi-Joy Marbot, André Marcon, Lyes Salem', null, 'Sébastien is a former rugby player and a true colossus. Between the ages of 12 to 16, he was a victim of rape by a beloved relative. Thirty years later, he has failed to speak out. After he meets a little colossus like him, he is compelled to make the right choice.', 'Sébastien is a former rugby player and a true colossus. Between the ages of 12 to 16, he was a victim of rape by a beloved relative. Thirty years later, he has failed to speak out. After he meets a little colossus like him, he is compelled to make the right choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tM3Z8kPX8jN1kEThvvtPdrvpLN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006925'),
  ('876000326131673489', 'The Frame', 2014, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Tara Hunter, Jamin Winans, Tom Farnsworth', 'Jamin Winans', 'David Carranza, Tiffany Mualem, Christopher Soren Kelly, Cal Bartlett, Megan Heffernan, Marty Lindsey, Rafael Hernández, Evan Lai', null, 'Two strangers find their lives colliding in an impossible way. Alex is a methodical cargo thief working for a dangerous cartel. Sam is a determined paramedic trying to save the world while running from her past.', 'Two strangers find their lives colliding in an impossible way. Alex is a methodical cargo thief working for a dangerous cartel. Sam is a determined paramedic trying to save the world while running from her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1xuWy0sHQ1s5UfNcwN2VYnbGhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305127'),
  ('457991157541144467', 'The Framed Cat', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Lillian Randolph, Daws Butler, Jerry Mann', 'NR', 'Tom filches a drumstick from a fresh-baked chicken. When Mammy is about to discover him, he hands it off to Jerry; this lets him be a hero to Mammy and still get his chicken. Jerry is miffed, and sees his chance to retaliate: Spike is very possessive of his bone. Jerry keeps stealing the bone and planting it on Tom. Finally, Jerry bores a hole in the bone, inserts a bolt, and gets Tom to swallow a magnet. The bone keeps coming back to Tom, even through a fence. Finally, as Tom runs off followed by Spike, Jerry, who''s been hiding in a tin can, is also dragged along.', 'Tom filches a drumstick from a fresh-baked chicken. When Mammy is about to discover him, he hands it off to Jerry; this lets him be a hero to Mammy and still get his chicken. Jerry is miffed, and sees his chance to retaliate: Spike is very possessive of his bone. Jerry keeps stealing the bone and planting it on Tom. Finally, Jerry bores a hole in the bone, inserts a bolt, and gets Tom to swallow a magnet. The bone keeps coming back to Tom, even through a fence. Finally, as Tom runs off followed by Spike, Jerry, who''s been hiding in a tin can, is also dragged along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxv2X0atQFHvajT2CEbuts91Afi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57233'),
  ('423963812091576992', 'The Frankenstein Theory', 2013, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Weiner', 'Andrew Weiner', 'Heather Stephens, Kris Lemche, Eric Zuckerman, Brian Henderson, Timothy V. Murphy, Luke Geissbühler, Joe Egender, Christine Lakin', 'NR', 'When he is suspended from his university job for his outlandish ideas, Professor John Venkenheim leads a documentary film crew to the rim of the Arctic Circle in a desperate effort to vindicate his academic reputation. His theory: Mary Shelley''s ghastly story, "Frankenstein," is, in fact, a work of non-fiction disguised as fantasy. In the vast, frozen wilderness, Venkenheim and his team search for the legendary monster, a creature mired in mystery and drenched in blood. What they find is an unspeakable truth more terrifying than any fiction...a nightmare from which there is no waking.', 'When he is suspended from his university job for his outlandish ideas, Professor John Venkenheim leads a documentary film crew to the rim of the Arctic Circle in a desperate effort to vindicate his academic reputation. His theory: Mary Shelley''s ghastly story, "Frankenstein," is, in fact, a work of non-fiction disguised as fantasy. In the vast, frozen wilderness, Venkenheim and his team search for the legendary monster, a creature mired in mystery and drenched in blood. What they find is an unspeakable truth more terrifying than any fiction...a nightmare from which there is no waking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kC8J8grw6G9EZfXun041hrVTKH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169865'),
  ('262611849332164663', 'The Freddie Mercury Tribute Concert', 1992, 'Music, Documentary', 'David Mallet, Geoff Dibben', null, 'Brian May, Roger Taylor, John Deacon, Freddie Mercury, David Bowie, Rick Allen, James Hetfield, Annie Lennox', null, 'A live concert in tribute to Freddie Mercury, former lead singer of Queen. Mercury died of AIDS and so some of the proceeds of this concert went to AIDS research. Features performers such as Metallica, Def Leppard, Elton John, Axl Rose, Extreme, George Michael, and many others. Performers alternate between doing their own hits, covering Queen songs, or jamming with the surviving members of Queen.', 'A live concert in tribute to Freddie Mercury, former lead singer of Queen. Mercury died of AIDS and so some of the proceeds of this concert went to AIDS research. Features performers such as Metallica, Def Leppard, Elton John, Axl Rose, Extreme, George Michael, and many others. Performers alternate between doing their own hits, covering Queen songs, or jamming with the surviving members of Queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruDIZj4M7Mw4TU58dVEISHkz54C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34490'),
  ('42420569356953249', 'The Free Fall', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Adam Stilwell, Chuck Scott, James Kniest', 'Kent Harper', 'Andrea Londo, Shawn Ashmore, Jane Badler, Michael Berry Jr., Elizabeth Cappuccino, Dominic Hoffman, Lorenzo Antonucci, Marc Senter', null, 'Sara wakes from a coma to a life she doesn''t remember; a fragile, slippery reality that spirals into a nightmare where nothing is as it seems.', 'Sara wakes from a coma to a life she doesn''t remember; a fragile, slippery reality that spirals into a nightmare where nothing is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exjf5UDJTrOHALugoBAxFUfEPwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860135'),
  ('287452614617105157', 'The Free Will', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ingo Scheel, Matthias Glasner, Matthias Glasner', 'Judith Angerbauer, Matthias Glasner, Jürgen Vogel', 'Jürgen Vogel, Sabine Timoteo, André Hennicke, Manfred Zapatka, Judith Engel, Maya Bothe, Anna Brass, Anne-Kathrin Golinsky', null, 'After nine years in psychiatric detention Theo, who has brutally assaulted and raped three women, is released. Living in a supervised community, he connects well with his social worker Sascha, finds a job at a print shop and even a girlfriend, Nettie, his principal''s brittle and estranged daughter. But even though superficially everything seems to work out Theo''s seething rage remains ready to erupt.', 'After nine years in psychiatric detention Theo, who has brutally assaulted and raped three women, is released. Living in a supervised community, he connects well with his social worker Sascha, finds a job at a print shop and even a girlfriend, Nettie, his principal''s brittle and estranged daughter. But even though superficially everything seems to work out Theo''s seething rage remains ready to erupt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwKCbmyJGpvozQ0nhnR4ztNTzg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9999'),
  ('99019866449117328', 'The Free World', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jason Lew, Ardy Brent Carlson, Bérénice Eveno', 'Jason Lew', 'Boyd Holbrook, Elisabeth Moss, Octavia Spencer, Sung Kang, Waleed Zuaiter, Stephen Louis Grush, Dane Rhodes, Austin Amelio', 'R', 'Following his release from a brutal stretch in prison for crimes he didn''t commit, Mo is struggling to adapt to life on the outside. When his world collides with Doris, a mysterious woman with a violent past, he decides to risk his newfound freedom to keep her in his life.', 'Following his release from a brutal stretch in prison for crimes he didn''t commit, Mo is struggling to adapt to life on the outside. When his world collides with Doris, a mysterious woman with a violent past, he decides to risk his newfound freedom to keep her in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YzGqiaOzErI8i7VK57hUwbMudH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371446'),
  ('523694769596092270', 'The Freeway Maniac', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Paul Winters', 'Paul Winters, Gahan Wilson', 'Loren Winters, James Jude Courtney, Shepherd Sanders, Donald Hotton, Jeff Morris, Robert Bruce, Dale Richard Howard, Kathryn Hauber', 'R', 'A crazed killer sneaks onto the set of a sci-fi film and begins murdering the cast and crew.', 'A crazed killer sneaks onto the set of a sci-fi film and begins murdering the cast and crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74pbqVTuar5ICe7cbN4ihL40irw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85174'),
  ('632381167662598644', 'The French', 1982, 'Documentary', 'William Klein, Jean-David Lefebvre, Nurith Aviv', null, 'Arthur Ashe, Marcel Bernard, Björn Borg, Don Budge, Philippe Chatrier, Henri Cochet, Jimmy Connors, Chris Evert', null, 'Roland-Garros, 1981: For the very first time, a documentary team is allowed to shoot sequences in the backstage of the French Open of tennis of Roland-Garros. William Klein''s camera takes us on the heels of the greatest players of the time: Björn Borg, Jimmy Connors, Ivan Lendl, Chris Evert-Lloyd, John McEnroe, Martina Navratilova, Yannick Noah, Guillermo Vilas... Miles of film. Historical pictures, a thousand and one details, a thousand and one unusual scenes. A declaration of love from a tennis lover.', 'Roland-Garros, 1981: For the very first time, a documentary team is allowed to shoot sequences in the backstage of the French Open of tennis of Roland-Garros. William Klein''s camera takes us on the heels of the greatest players of the time: Björn Borg, Jimmy Connors, Ivan Lendl, Chris Evert-Lloyd, John McEnroe, Martina Navratilova, Yannick Noah, Guillermo Vilas... Miles of film. Historical pictures, a thousand and one details, a thousand and one unusual scenes. A declaration of love from a tennis lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62CdhRG0meYvc6HaLxpOz7tim9p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183981'),
  ('532579126829939887', 'The French as Seen by…', 1988, 'War, Documentary, Drama', 'David Lynch, Andrzej Wajda, Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'Ève Ruggieri, Jean Clemente, Claude Josse, Barbara Hendricks, Harry Dean Stanton, Frederic Golchan, Tracey Walter, Jack Nance', null, 'In 1988, Figaro magazine asked a few famous directors to direct a series of short movies to celebrate the 10 years of the revue. The movies have been released for the French revolution bicentenary. Includes: Werner Herzog''s Les Gaulois, David Lynch''s The Cowboy and the Frenchman, Andrzej Wajda''s Proust contre la déchéance, Luigi Comencini''s Pèlerinage à Agen, Jean-Luc Godard''s Le dernier mot.', 'In 1988, Figaro magazine asked a few famous directors to direct a series of short movies to celebrate the 10 years of the revue. The movies have been released for the French revolution bicentenary. Includes: Werner Herzog''s Les Gaulois, David Lynch''s The Cowboy and the Frenchman, Andrzej Wajda''s Proust contre la déchéance, Luigi Comencini''s Pèlerinage à Agen, Jean-Luc Godard''s Le dernier mot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9XvRGI9OH5FDFWmCOFjxxnGTlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341961'),
  ('912999519251059282', 'The French Connection', 1971, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'William Friedkin, Owen Roizman, William C. Gerrity', 'Ernest Tidyman', 'Gene Hackman, Roy Scheider, Fernando Rey, Tony Lo Bianco, Marcel Bozzuffi, Frédéric de Pasquale, Bill Hickman, Ann Rebbot', 'R', 'Tough narcotics detective ''Popeye'' Doyle is in hot pursuit of a suave French drug dealer who may be the key to a huge heroin-smuggling operation.', 'Tough narcotics detective ''Popeye'' Doyle is in hot pursuit of a suave French drug dealer who may be the key to a huge heroin-smuggling operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pH4saPwMjhnVGwmSH6RkMaHrt3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051'),
  ('75508047274942924', 'The French Detective', 1975, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Jean Collomb', 'Francis Veber', 'Lino Ventura, Patrick Dewaere, Victor Lanoux, Julien Guiomar, Pierre Tornade, Françoise Brion, Claude Rich, Michel Peyrelon', null, 'When political thugs murder an opponent''s volunteer and also kill a cop, chief inspector Verjeat believes the politician who hired them is as guilty as the murderous goon. Verjeat''s pursuit of the councilman, Lardatte, gets him a warning from his superiors. When he embarrasses Lardatte while disarming a hostage (the dead volunteer''s father), Verjeat is told he''s being transferred within a week. He speeds up his hunt for the goon and, with Lefévre, one of his young detectives, he engineers a complicated scheme to buy more time before the transfer. How should Verjeat play out his values of honor and duty?', 'When political thugs murder an opponent''s volunteer and also kill a cop, chief inspector Verjeat believes the politician who hired them is as guilty as the murderous goon. Verjeat''s pursuit of the councilman, Lardatte, gets him a warning from his superiors. When he embarrasses Lardatte while disarming a hostage (the dead volunteer''s father), Verjeat is told he''s being transferred within a week. He speeds up his hunt for the goon and, with Lefévre, one of his young detectives, he engineers a complicated scheme to buy more time before the transfer. How should Verjeat play out his values of honor and duty?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SCYW55I3fpW0EIqyPWcdg85QuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58694'),
  ('625816102570580164', 'The French Dispatch of the Liberty, Kansas Evening Sun', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Charlie Vaughan, Andrea Hachuel, Martin Scali', 'Wes Anderson', 'Benicio del Toro, Adrien Brody, Tilda Swinton, Léa Seydoux, Frances McDormand, Timothée Chalamet, Lyna Khoudri, Jeffrey Wright', 'R', 'The staff of an American magazine based in France puts out its last issue, with stories featuring an artist sentenced to life imprisonment, student riots, and a kidnapping resolved by a chef.', 'The staff of an American magazine based in France puts out its last issue, with stories featuring an artist sentenced to life imprisonment, student riots, and a kidnapping resolved by a chef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JXR3KJH5roiBCjWFt09xfgxHZc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542178'),
  ('1099734304269799620', 'The French Kissers', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dominique Colin, Riad Sattouf', 'Marc Syrigas, Riad Sattouf', 'Vincent Lacoste, Anthony Sonigo, Alice Trémolière, Julie Scheibling, Robin Nizan-Duverger, Baptiste Huet, Simon Barbery, Camille Andreys', null, 'An awkward adolescent boy and his angst-ridden friends try their best to fit in amongst a cast of varied characters.', 'An awkward adolescent boy and his angst-ridden friends try their best to fit in amongst a cast of varied characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozs5DufKj2Rdj2MUYeGK7QcUL52.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18896'),
  ('1078090305390110125', 'The French Lieutenant''s Woman', 1981, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Karel Reisz, Freddie Francis, Richard Hoult', 'Harold Pinter', 'Meryl Streep, Jeremy Irons, Hilton McRae, Lynsey Baxter, Emily Morgan, Penelope Wilton, Jean Faulds, Charlotte Mitchell', 'R', 'In this story-within-a-story, Anna is an actress starring opposite Mike in a period piece about the forbidden love between their respective characters, Sarah and Charles. Both actors are involved in serious relationships, but the passionate nature of the script leads to an off-camera love affair as well. While attempting to maintain their composure and professionalism, Anna and Mike struggle to come to terms with their infidelity.', 'In this story-within-a-story, Anna is an actress starring opposite Mike in a period piece about the forbidden love between their respective characters, Sarah and Charles. Both actors are involved in serious relationships, but the passionate nature of the script leads to an off-camera love affair as well. While attempting to maintain their composure and professionalism, Anna and Mike struggle to come to terms with their infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqpeqPjziAH3VXMqwQ0Ds3Ffx9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12537'),
  ('722012146884782210', 'The French Line', 1954, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Lloyd Bacon, Harry J. Wild, William Dorfman', 'Mary Loos, Richard Sale', 'Jane Russell, Gilbert Roland, Arthur Hunnicutt, Mary McCarty, Joyce Mackenzie, Rita Corday, Scott Elliott, Craig Stevens', 'NR', 'Oil heiress Mame Carson takes an incognito cruise so that men will love her for her body, not her money.', 'Oil heiress Mame Carson takes an incognito cruise so that men will love her for her body, not her money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igP9H7FCCnTzaqWgfyEij1xWp86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52843'),
  ('333796385508534628', 'The French Minister', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Jérôme Alméras', 'Christophe Blain, Bertrand Tavernier, Antonin Baudry', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Raphaël Personnaz, Niels Arestrup, Bruno Raffaelli, Julie Gayet, Anaïs Demoustier, Thomas Chabrol, Thierry Frémont', null, 'Alexandre Taillard de Vorms is a force to be reckoned with. With his silver mane and tanned, athletic body, he stalks the world stage as Minister of Foreign Affairs for France, waging his own war backed up by the holy trinity of diplomatic concepts: legitimacy, lucidity, and efficacy. Enter Arthur Vlaminck. Hired to write the minister''s speeches, Arthur must contend with the sensibilities of his boss and the dirty dealings within the Quai d''Orsay, the ministry''s home.', 'Alexandre Taillard de Vorms is a force to be reckoned with. With his silver mane and tanned, athletic body, he stalks the world stage as Minister of Foreign Affairs for France, waging his own war backed up by the holy trinity of diplomatic concepts: legitimacy, lucidity, and efficacy. Enter Arthur Vlaminck. Hired to write the minister''s speeches, Arthur must contend with the sensibilities of his boss and the dirty dealings within the Quai d''Orsay, the ministry''s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uXxAaZudlNEg1Lwu7GDEWbK3dV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209355'),
  ('953172588423708472', 'The French Revolution', 1989, 'Drama, War, History, Thriller', 'François Catonné, Bernard Zitzermann, Richard T. Heffron', 'David Ambrose, Robert Enrico, Daniel Boulanger', 'Klaus Maria Brandauer, François Cluzet, Marie Bunel, Jane Seymour, Jean-François Balmer, Andrzej Seweryn, Vittorio Mezzogiorno, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu', null, 'A history of the French Revolution beginning from the decision of the king to convene the Etats-Generaux in 1789 in order to deal with France''s debt problem. Part one spans the event until August 10, 1792 (when the King Louis XVI lost all authority and was imprisoned). Part two carries the story through the end of the terror in 1794.', 'A history of the French Revolution beginning from the decision of the king to convene the Etats-Generaux in 1789 in order to deal with France''s debt problem. Part one spans the event until August 10, 1792 (when the King Louis XVI lost all authority and was imprisoned). Part two carries the story through the end of the terror in 1794.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkIOwWwXQTNxr9q8X9YSfeYgvmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4228'),
  ('63685766629363103', 'The French Sex Murders', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ferdinando Merighi, Flavio Merkel, Mario Mancini', 'Ferdinando Merighi, Dick Randall, Marius Mattei', 'Anita Ekberg, Rosalba Neri, Evelyne Kraft, Howard Vernon, Pietro Martellanza, Barbara Bouchet, Robert Sacchi, Eva Astor', null, 'After a French prostitute is found dead, one of her regular clients is tried and convicted for her murder. He is eventually sentenced to death but dies in a high speed pursuit after attempting to escape custody. Soon, the witnesses that testified against him end up being systematically murdered by a mysterious killer wearing black gloves.', 'After a French prostitute is found dead, one of her regular clients is tried and convicted for her murder. He is eventually sentenced to death but dies in a high speed pursuit after attempting to escape custody. Soon, the witnesses that testified against him end up being systematically murdered by a mysterious killer wearing black gloves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4O6XZdBXm6DwJzH3eh3A7LHE3Tx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39910'),
  ('83450528415419451', 'The Frenchman''s Garden', 1978, 'Horror, Drama', 'Paul Naschy, Leopoldo Villaseñor', 'Paul Naschy, Antonio Fos', 'María José Cantudo, Ágata Lys, Paul Naschy, José Calvo, Silvia Tortosa, Julia Saly, Yolanda Ríos, Nélida Quiroga', null, '"The Frenchman" was what locals called the man who ran the bar and restaurant in the small town of Peñaflor in rural Spain in the early part of the 20th century. But Juan Andrés Aldije Monmeja was not your usual jolly innkeeper. He ran an illegal gambling den and pimped out the waitresses who worked for him. Deciding there were easier and quicker ways to exploit his customers, The Frenchman started slaughtering them, stealing their money and burying their corpses in the garden at the back of his inn. It was not long before people started asking questions...', '"The Frenchman" was what locals called the man who ran the bar and restaurant in the small town of Peñaflor in rural Spain in the early part of the 20th century. But Juan Andrés Aldije Monmeja was not your usual jolly innkeeper. He ran an illegal gambling den and pimped out the waitresses who worked for him. Deciding there were easier and quicker ways to exploit his customers, The Frenchman started slaughtering them, stealing their money and burying their corpses in the garden at the back of his inn. It was not long before people started asking questions...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CgVseNVH6VCWGdZ60nPXXS0mK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251046'),
  ('560872040302048606', 'The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air Reunion', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Marcus Raboy', null, 'Will Smith, Tatyana Ali, Karyn Parsons, Joseph Marcell, Daphne Maxwell Reid, Alfonso Ribeiro, DJ Jazzy Jeff, Janet Hubert', null, 'Join Will Smith, Tatyana Ali, Karyn Parsons, Joseph Marcell, Daphne Maxwell Reid, Alfonso Ribeiro and DJ Jazzy Jeff, for a funny and heartfelt night full of music and dancing in honor of the show that ran for six seasons and 148 episodes.', 'Join Will Smith, Tatyana Ali, Karyn Parsons, Joseph Marcell, Daphne Maxwell Reid, Alfonso Ribeiro and DJ Jazzy Jeff, for a funny and heartfelt night full of music and dancing in honor of the show that ran for six seasons and 148 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcKsgTnrjuZLWAJwn8uBZHy5YWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:738362'),
  ('583930600212014496', 'The Fresh Vegetable Mystery', 1939, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Jack Mercer, Margie Hines, Pinto Colvig', null, 'Crime strikes the vegetable world when Mrs. Mama Carrot awakens and finds her children have been carrot-napped. She summons the Irish-Potato Police and they are soon on the trail of the culprit. But the various suspects they round up, and grill, aren''t the criminals. They finally track down the guilty parties, who turn out to be a gang of mice in disguise. Thrown into a third-degree mousetrap, the mice soon confess.', 'Crime strikes the vegetable world when Mrs. Mama Carrot awakens and finds her children have been carrot-napped. She summons the Irish-Potato Police and they are soon on the trail of the culprit. But the various suspects they round up, and grill, aren''t the criminals. They finally track down the guilty parties, who turn out to be a gang of mice in disguise. Thrown into a third-degree mousetrap, the mice soon confess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oZAyplNQBKJWCdm5zn6ygxb7VF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204813'),
  ('156170276994075125', 'The Freshman', 1925, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fred C. Newmeyer, Sam Taylor, Walter Lundin', null, 'Harold Lloyd, Jobyna Ralston, Brooks Benedict, Hazel Keener, Joseph Harrington, Pat Harmon, Leon Beaumon, Ethel Broadhurst', 'NR', 'An unathletic college freshman ridiculed by his peers for his mannerisms strives to become popular by making the football team.', 'An unathletic college freshman ridiculed by his peers for his mannerisms strives to become popular by making the football team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3531lJNSMhrpcNWXrDIYYoYH6Rp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42359'),
  ('335349747846909577', 'The Freshman', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Andrew Bergman, William A. Fraker, David McLennan', 'Andrew Bergman', 'Marlon Brando, Matthew Broderick, Bruno Kirby, Penelope Ann Miller, Frank Whaley, Jon Polito, Kenneth Welsh, Richard Gant', 'PG', 'After a film student gets his belongings stolen, he meets a mobster bearing a startling resemblance to a certain cinematic godfather. Soon, he finds himself caught up in a caper involving endangered species and fine dining.', 'After a film student gets his belongings stolen, he meets a mobster bearing a startling resemblance to a certain cinematic godfather. Soon, he finds himself caught up in a caper involving endangered species and fine dining.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKeZDE3Hbne5w43k7ASFolDKroC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10168'),
  ('115611993029761146', 'The Freshmen', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thomas Lilti, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Thomas Lilti', 'Vincent Lacoste, William Lebghil, Michel Lerousseau, Darina Al Joundi, Benoît Di Marco, Graziella Delerm, Guillaume Clérice, Noémi Silvania', null, 'Antoine is about to start his first year of medical school… for the third time. Benjamin, just out of high school, will make his first try. He soon realizes it''s not exactly a walk in the park. In a fiercely competitive environment, with nights dedicated to hard studying rather than hard partying, the two freshmen will have to adapt and find a middle ground between despair for the present and hope for the future.', 'Antoine is about to start his first year of medical school… for the third time. Benjamin, just out of high school, will make his first try. He soon realizes it''s not exactly a walk in the park. In a fiercely competitive environment, with nights dedicated to hard studying rather than hard partying, the two freshmen will have to adapt and find a middle ground between despair for the present and hope for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlPYKV4Pav3ee9Kf1tw5acMZofU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463858'),
  ('840593173951196509', 'The Friend', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Scott McGehee, David Siegel, Giles Nuttgens', 'David Siegel, Scott McGehee', 'Naomi Watts, Bill Murray, Ann Dowd, Constance Wu, Sarah Pidgeon, Carla Gugino, Noma Dumezweni, Felix Solis', 'R', 'New York City writer Iris finds her comfortable, solitary life thrown into disarray after her closest friend and mentor bequeaths her a Great Dane named Apollo. The huge dog immediately creates practical problems for Iris, from furniture destruction to eviction notices, as well as more existential ones. Yet as Iris finds herself unexpectedly bonding with Apollo, she begins to come to terms with her past, and her own creative inner life.', 'New York City writer Iris finds her comfortable, solitary life thrown into disarray after her closest friend and mentor bequeaths her a Great Dane named Apollo. The huge dog immediately creates practical problems for Iris, from furniture destruction to eviction notices, as well as more existential ones. Yet as Iris finds herself unexpectedly bonding with Apollo, she begins to come to terms with her past, and her own creative inner life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPAcaKFWvbB9fXAmhIr3leBCRVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186563'),
  ('942092051394146582', 'The Friend''s House Is Here', 2026, 'Drama', 'Hossein Keshavarz, Maryam Ataei, Ali Ehsani', 'Hossein Keshavarz, Maryam Ataei', 'Mahshad Bahram, Hana Mana, Farzad Karen', null, 'Two women in Tehran''s underground art scene create a haven of freedom and sisterhood until their circle is discovered, forcing them to struggle for each other''s survival.', 'Two women in Tehran''s underground art scene create a haven of freedom and sisterhood until their circle is discovered, forcing them to struggle for each other''s survival.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FutVWw8DsBKlmTkItA3CaAJb0CDw.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-friends-house-is-here'),
  ('775754551862734099', 'The Friendly Ghost', 1945, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Izzy Sparber, Nick Tafuri', null, 'Alan Shay, Jack Mercer, Mae Questel, Cecil Roy, Frank Gallop', null, 'Casper struggles to find friends who won''t run away scared when they meet him.', 'Casper struggles to find friends who won''t run away scared when they meet him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frWxvZ6AaDx7VGa6CRozy4BXlxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150316'),
  ('637969394750162504', 'The Friends', 1971, 'Drama', 'Gérard Blain, Jacques Robin', 'André Debaecque, Gérard Blain', 'Philippe March, Jean Favre, Jean-Claude Dauphin, Nathalie Fontaine, Dany Roussel, Claude Larcher, Hélène Zanicolli, Christian Chevreuse', null, 'Philippe is an older man and an industrialist whose wife is confined to her bed. They have no children. As he is preparing to go on a vacation to the seaside, he strikes up an acquaintance with Paul, a young working-class boy, and decides to bring him along. This is Paul''s first glimpse of how the other half lives, with their first-class hotels and so on. When he meets some aristocratic young people at the resort, he tries to put over the fiction that he is of their class, with poor success.', 'Philippe is an older man and an industrialist whose wife is confined to her bed. They have no children. As he is preparing to go on a vacation to the seaside, he strikes up an acquaintance with Paul, a young working-class boy, and decides to bring him along. This is Paul''s first glimpse of how the other half lives, with their first-class hotels and so on. When he meets some aristocratic young people at the resort, he tries to put over the fiction that he is of their class, with poor success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhUG4flyMpwhW1kxDVlqVtzZK0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219823'),
  ('520772256768163064', 'The Friends', 1994, 'Drama', 'Shinji Sōmai, Noboru Shinoda', 'Yōzō Tanaka', 'Rentaro Mikuni, Naoki Sakata, Yasutaka Oh, Ken''ichi Makino, Akira Emoto, Tsurube Shofukutei, Minori Terada, Naho Toda', null, 'A delightful and moving coming-of-age story. One summer, three young boys take an increasing interest in an eccentric old man who lives alone in a house surrounded by an overgrown garden. The boys form a bond with the recluse and set about weeding and replanting the garden.', 'A delightful and moving coming-of-age story. One summer, three young boys take an increasing interest in an eccentric old man who lives alone in a house surrounded by an overgrown garden. The boys form a bond with the recluse and set about weeding and replanting the garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70K0yVXeenU1Ukan4AZ5TuevL3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115786'),
  ('1055820996211649521', 'The Friends At The Margherita Café', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini, Anna Cuocolo', 'Pupi Avati', 'Diego Abatantuono, Pierpaolo Zizzi, Neri Marcorè, Laura Chiatti, Fabio De Luigi, Luigi Lo Cascio, Claudio Botosso, Gianni Ippoliti', null, 'Bologna, 1954. Taddeo, a young man of 18 whom everyone calls Kid, dreams of becoming one of the regulars of the mythical Margherita Café, located under the portico across from his family''s home. Through a ploy, he manages to get work as the chauffeur for Al, the neighborhood''s most glamorous and mysterious resident. Having been taken under Al''s wing, Taddeo gets to witness the adventures of Bep, who is in love with Marcella the entraineuse; the trials and tribulations of Gian, an aspiring singer and the victim of a horrible practical joke; the crazy behavior of Manuelo, a small-time robber with a sex phobia; the meanness of Zanchi, inventor of the elastic necktie; and the bizarre manias of Sarti, a ballroom dancing champion who wears his tux day and night. And Taddeo''s home life is no less out of the ordinary, considering his mother is being led on by the family physician while his grandfather has fallen head over heels for a well-built piano teacher.', 'Bologna, 1954. Taddeo, a young man of 18 whom everyone calls Kid, dreams of becoming one of the regulars of the mythical Margherita Café, located under the portico across from his family''s home. Through a ploy, he manages to get work as the chauffeur for Al, the neighborhood''s most glamorous and mysterious resident. Having been taken under Al''s wing, Taddeo gets to witness the adventures of Bep, who is in love with Marcella the entraineuse; the trials and tribulations of Gian, an aspiring singer and the victim of a horrible practical joke; the crazy behavior of Manuelo, a small-time robber with a sex phobia; the meanness of Zanchi, inventor of the elastic necktie; and the bizarre manias of Sarti, a ballroom dancing champion who wears his tux day and night. And Taddeo''s home life is no less out of the ordinary, considering his mother is being led on by the family physician while his grandfather has fallen head over heels for a well-built piano teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYiwydcZW5Tobs0RzQkvCKkelpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42399'),
  ('674694125240162772', 'The Friends of Eddie Coyle', 1973, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Peter Yates, Victor J. Kemper, Peter R. Scoppa', 'Paul Monash', 'Robert Mitchum, Peter Boyle, Richard Jordan, Steven Keats, Alex Rocco, Joe Santos, Mitchell Ryan, Peter MacLean', 'R', 'An aging hood is about to go back to prison. Hoping to escape his fate, he supplies information on stolen guns to the feds, while simultaneously supplying arms to his bank robbing chums.', 'An aging hood is about to go back to prison. Hoping to escape his fate, he supplies information on stolen guns to the feds, while simultaneously supplying arms to his bank robbing chums.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyV8Bgf2huCIbGUxTdGgnzdIRKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25680'),
  ('1013377979021936449', 'The Friends of Jesus: Thomas', 2001, 'Drama, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Raffaele Mertes, Elisabetta Marchetti', 'Gareth Jones', 'Ricky Tognazzi, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Roberta Armani, Mathieu Carrière, Enrica Maria Modugno, Danny Quinn, Mehmet Günsür, Hannes Jaenicke', null, 'When Jesus is taken off the cross at Golgotha, Thomas arrives. Like most other disciples, he worriedly took refuge with friends in Jerusalem after Jesus''s arrest. After Jesus''s burial, the disciples decide to leave Jerusalem quickly, but Thomas refuses to leave Jesus'' body behind, as he fears that the tomb may be desecrated.', 'When Jesus is taken off the cross at Golgotha, Thomas arrives. Like most other disciples, he worriedly took refuge with friends in Jerusalem after Jesus''s arrest. After Jesus''s burial, the disciples decide to leave Jerusalem quickly, but Thomas refuses to leave Jesus'' body behind, as he fears that the tomb may be desecrated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhcE8CCaPVjlxEXvJhXkFDU4CvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58440'),
  ('58119356523373192', 'The Friendship Game', 2022, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Scooter Corkle, Farhad Ghaderi', 'Damien Ober', 'Peyton List, Brendan Meyer, Kelcey Mawema, Kaitlyn Santa Juana, Dylan Schombing, Miriam Smith, Jennifer Copping, Miranda Edwards', null, 'A group of teens in a small town come across a strange object that tests their loyalties to each other with increasingly destructive consequences the deeper into the game they go.', 'A group of teens in a small town come across a strange object that tests their loyalties to each other with increasingly destructive consequences the deeper into the game they go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXaJkaVTNMhrOylFi6xrWnBQGE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844396'),
  ('1069315291322022397', 'The Frightened City', 1961, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Lemont, Desmond Dickinson', 'Leigh Vance', 'Herbert Lom, John Gregson, Sean Connery, Alfred Marks, Yvonne Romain, Olive McFarland, Frederick Piper, Marianne Stone', null, 'A small time thief is recruited by a mobster to help with the racketeering. He doesn''t like the job, but with the mob on his back, a femme fatale in his bed and a sick friend to care for, he will have to keep all his wits about him.', 'A small time thief is recruited by a mobster to help with the racketeering. He doesn''t like the job, but with the mob on his back, a femme fatale in his bed and a sick friend to care for, he will have to keep all his wits about him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t80DcZSUerkZWShr0jUBWj7RwxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80595'),
  ('778459290859719702', 'The Frighteners', 1996, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Peter Jackson, John Blick, Alun Bollinger', 'Peter Jackson, Fran Walsh', 'Michael J. Fox, Trini Alvarado, Peter Dobson, John Astin, Jeffrey Combs, Dee Wallace, Jake Busey, Chi McBride', 'R', 'Once an architect, Frank Bannister now passes himself off as an exorcist of evil spirits. To bolster his facade, he claims his "special" gift is the result of a car accident that killed his wife. But what he does not count on is more people dying in the small town where he lives. As he tries to piece together the supernatural mystery of these killings, he falls in love with the wife of one of the victims and deals with a crazy FBI agent.', 'Once an architect, Frank Bannister now passes himself off as an exorcist of evil spirits. To bolster his facade, he claims his "special" gift is the result of a car accident that killed his wife. But what he does not count on is more people dying in the small town where he lives. As he tries to piece together the supernatural mystery of these killings, he falls in love with the wife of one of the victims and deals with a crazy FBI agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcJbCMwFLJdn5OLjhYwMVaSB32R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10779'),
  ('697461989384822790', 'The Frisco Kid', 1979, 'Adventure, Comedy, Western, Drama', 'Robert Aldrich, Robert B. Hauser, Mel Dellar', 'Michael Elias, Frank Shaw', 'Gene Wilder, Harrison Ford, Ramon Bieri, Val Bisoglio, George DiCenzo, Leo Fuchs, Penny Peyser, William Smith', 'PG', 'Rabbi Avram arrives in Philadelphia from Poland en route to San Francisco where he will be a congregation''s new rabbi. An innocent and inexperienced traveller, he is tricked by con men to pay for the trip to go west, then they leave him and his belongings scattered along a deserted road. He is befriended by a stranger, Tommy, who is a bank robber and have many adventures during their journey.', 'Rabbi Avram arrives in Philadelphia from Poland en route to San Francisco where he will be a congregation''s new rabbi. An innocent and inexperienced traveller, he is tricked by con men to pay for the trip to go west, then they leave him and his belongings scattered along a deserted road. He is befriended by a stranger, Tommy, who is a bank robber and have many adventures during their journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2Oo1Ds4Vbns5WP4BfSnU3wXwpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16972'),
  ('817609374232128149', 'The Frog', 1908, 'Fantasy', 'Segundo de Chomón', null, 'Julienne Mathieu', null, 'A frog hops around a magic fountain.', 'A frog hops around a magic fountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5cW7ADd9oHIr7cr2DZr2bNGC8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232942'),
  ('567707598509994504', 'The Frog Prince', 1986, 'Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Jackson Hunsicker, Amnon Salomon', 'Jackson Hunsicker', 'Aileen Quinn, Helen Hunt, John Paragon, Clive Revill, Seagull Cohen, Shmuel Atzmon, Jeff Gerner, Aaron Kaplan', null, 'Children''s musical based on Grimm''s fairy tale of The Frog-King. A young girl learns how to be a good friend and princess with the help of a "tall frog."', 'Children''s musical based on Grimm''s fairy tale of The Frog-King. A young girl learns how to be a good friend and princess with the help of a "tall frog."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13pKq7HqlaBtU2OurMU3zRCtooi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71747'),
  ('355081532334423706', 'The Frog Prince', 1988, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Walter Beck, Wolfgang Braumann', 'Walter Beck, Brigitte Bernert', 'Jana Mattukat, Jens-Uwe Bogadtke, Peter Sodann, Franziska Glöss-Ebermann, Susanne Lüning, Thomas Wolff, Pedro Hebenstreit, Dieter Wien', null, 'Henriette is a princess; she is playing with her ball, but drops it into a well. A talking frog replaces it with a golden ball, on condition that he can eat and drink with her, and rest in her bed. She accepts, but then is repelled at the thought of the frog eating and drinking with her, etc., but her Father makes her do so. In her bedroom, the frog turns into a handsome prince, and she falls in love with him, but he leaves immediately because of her broken promises. She pines and eventually seeks him out, braving various tests of her truthfulness in the process.', 'Henriette is a princess; she is playing with her ball, but drops it into a well. A talking frog replaces it with a golden ball, on condition that he can eat and drink with her, and rest in her bed. She accepts, but then is repelled at the thought of the frog eating and drinking with her, etc., but her Father makes her do so. In her bedroom, the frog turns into a handsome prince, and she falls in love with him, but he leaves immediately because of her broken promises. She pines and eventually seeks him out, braving various tests of her truthfulness in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufPCL1akoESZ2VflaqpchJjPblZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13104'),
  ('63067014047289006', 'The Frog Prince', 2009, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Robson Lima', 'Ale McHaddo', 'Marta Nicholson, Francisco Freitas, Tiago Guimarães, Silton Cardoso, Raul Schlosser', null, 'Beautiful but arrogant Princes Iria, the King''s only daughter, troubles to find suitors that live up to her high self image. Worried by her overly discerning attitude, the King frets about her future happiness and the prospect that she may lose her inheritance if she doesn''t find a match by the prescribed time of crowning. Seeking clarity, Princess Iria confesses her dilemna to the night, and hears a voice in return! Will she magically find true love behind the illusion of vain reflections or will an arranged marriage be her fate? Everyone will be enchanted and amused at princess Iria''s search to find prince charming in this highly entertaining animated feature of the classic tale, the princess and the frog.', 'Beautiful but arrogant Princes Iria, the King''s only daughter, troubles to find suitors that live up to her high self image. Worried by her overly discerning attitude, the King frets about her future happiness and the prospect that she may lose her inheritance if she doesn''t find a match by the prescribed time of crowning. Seeking clarity, Princess Iria confesses her dilemna to the night, and hears a voice in return! Will she magically find true love behind the illusion of vain reflections or will an arranged marriage be her fate? Everyone will be enchanted and amused at princess Iria''s search to find prince charming in this highly entertaining animated feature of the classic tale, the princess and the frog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7wH3OwYk9tmOeMJ6IzIsxsPFvb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258725'),
  ('939674913455480718', 'The Frog Princess', 1954, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Mikhail Tsekhanovskiy, Vera Tsekhanovskaya, Aleksandr Astafyev', 'Mikhail Volpin', 'Margarita Kupriyanova, Anatoliy Verbitskiy, Aleksandr Rumnyov, Georgi Millyar, Boris Chirkov, Aleksei Gribov, Vladimir Gribkov', null, 'A prince discovers an enchanted beauty turned into a frog by Koschei the Immortal. After Koschei steals her again, the prince goes on a dangerous quest to free the land of the evil.', 'A prince discovers an enchanted beauty turned into a frog by Koschei the Immortal. After Koschei steals her again, the prince goes on a dangerous quest to free the land of the evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/by9mCwxYhOh4t5Qg4kFeeX3guV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90512'),
  ('876114267045237261', 'The Frogmen', 1951, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, War', 'Lloyd Bacon, Norbert Brodine, Robert D. Webb', 'John Tucker Battle', 'Richard Widmark, Robert Wagner, Dana Andrews, Gary Merrill, Jeffrey Hunter, Warren Stevens, Harvey Lembeck, Robert Rockwell', 'NR', 'The new commander of a Navy Underwater Demolition Team--nicknamed "Frogmen"--must earn the respect of the men in his unit, who are still grieving over the death of their former commander and resentful of the new one.', 'The new commander of a Navy Underwater Demolition Team--nicknamed "Frogmen"--must earn the respect of the men in his unit, who are still grieving over the death of their former commander and resentful of the new one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFdHsoCgCr1bhDWtRokdkZhp3af.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44890'),
  ('290633301489066668', 'The Frogs', 1985, 'Drama', 'Şerif Gören', null, 'Hülya Koçyiğit, Talat Bulut, Yavuzer Çetinkaya, Metin Çekmez, Tomris Oğuzalp, Şerif Gören, Selahattin Fırat, Yaman Okay', null, 'In the half-light of dawn, Halil falls down dead, murdered. His wife, Elmas, cries for justice, but, in fact, there will be no investigation. Life goes on for Elmas: during the day she works in the rice paddies with her little boy and, at night, she goes to catch frogs with the other villagers.', 'In the half-light of dawn, Halil falls down dead, murdered. His wife, Elmas, cries for justice, but, in fact, there will be no investigation. Life goes on for Elmas: during the day she works in the rice paddies with her little boy and, at night, she goes to catch frogs with the other villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozPgmxTEylVHZBfctrTR01tvqVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297531'),
  ('688105468079156245', 'The Frogs Who Wanted a King', 1922, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Władysław Starewicz', 'Władysław Starewicz', null, null, 'The frogs have a democracy, but they beseech Jupiter to send them a king. Jupiter can hardly believe this amphibian foolishness, so he sends them a tree as king. The frogs make obeisance to their new monarch, but they are dissatisfied and petition Jupiter again.', 'The frogs have a democracy, but they beseech Jupiter to send them a king. Jupiter can hardly believe this amphibian foolishness, so he sends them a tree as king. The frogs make obeisance to their new monarch, but they are dissatisfied and petition Jupiter again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOYY72XiqBKxYJDbI3VCzltmUI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90040'),
  ('1110443230751577265', 'The Front', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Chapman, Martin Ritt, Peter R. Scoppa', 'Walter Bernstein', 'Woody Allen, Zero Mostel, Herschel Bernardi, Michael Murphy, Andrea Marcovicci, Remak Ramsay, Marvin Lichterman, Lloyd Gough', 'PG', 'A cashier poses as a writer for blacklisted talents to submit their work through, but the injustice around him pushes him to take a stand.', 'A cashier poses as a writer for blacklisted talents to submit their work through, but the injustice around him pushes him to take a stand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXXNbw7xeW2nuUiSSKJ59xNSf6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1723'),
  ('90129788087950890', 'The Front Line', 2009, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Renato De Maria, Gian Filippo Corticelli, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Fidel Signorile, Ivan Cotroneo, Sandro Petraglia', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Fabrizio Rongione, Dario Aita, Michele Alhaique, Jacopo Maria Bicocchi, Piero Cardano, Claudia Coli', null, 'United by an uncompromising struggle as members of the infamous 1970s far-left terrorist group Prima Linea, fugitive couple Sergio and Susanna have become increasingly alienated from the real world. Their luck runs out when Susanna is captured and thrown in jail. Putting his life on the line, Sergio embarks on a radical plan... Loosely based on the memoir by Prima Linea''s ''commander'' Sergio Segio.', 'United by an uncompromising struggle as members of the infamous 1970s far-left terrorist group Prima Linea, fugitive couple Sergio and Susanna have become increasingly alienated from the real world. Their luck runs out when Susanna is captured and thrown in jail. Putting his life on the line, Sergio embarks on a radical plan... Loosely based on the memoir by Prima Linea''s ''commander'' Sergio Segio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJlHXDLQ0XVLkXctKqgIecnjs2x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34788'),
  ('572104059019181926', 'The Front Line', 2011, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Jang Hoon, Kim Woo-hyung, Kim Min-jae', 'Sang-yeon Park', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Go Soo, Lee Je-hoon, Ryu Seung-su, Ko Chang-seok, David Lee, Ryu Seung-ryong, Kim Ok-bin', null, 'In 1951 ceasefire is declared, but two remaining armies fought their final battle on the front line Towards the end of the Korean War, a South Korean battalion is fiercely battling over a hill on the front line border against the North in order to capture a strategic point that would determine the new border between two nations. The ownership of this small patch of land would swap multiple times each day. Kang is dispatched to the front line in order to investigate the tacit case that’s been happening there.', 'In 1951 ceasefire is declared, but two remaining armies fought their final battle on the front line Towards the end of the Korean War, a South Korean battalion is fiercely battling over a hill on the front line border against the North in order to capture a strategic point that would determine the new border between two nations. The ownership of this small patch of land would swap multiple times each day. Kang is dispatched to the front line in order to investigate the tacit case that’s been happening there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRw9czK3hOnNenW1iVVpGM3kbn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79553'),
  ('529690386129282919', 'The Front Page', 1931, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Lewis Milestone, Glen MacWilliams, Nate Watt', 'Ben Hecht, Charles MacArthur', 'Adolphe Menjou, Pat O''Brien, Mary Brian, Edward Everett Horton, Walter Catlett, George E. Stone, Mae Clarke, Slim Summerville', 'NR', 'Hildy Johnson is an investigative reporter looking for a bigger paycheck. When an accused murderer escapes from custody, Hildy sees an opportunity for the story of a lifetime. But when he finds the criminal, he learns that the man may not be guilty. With the help of his editor, Hildy attempts to hide the convict, uncover the conspiracy and write the scoop of his career.', 'Hildy Johnson is an investigative reporter looking for a bigger paycheck. When an accused murderer escapes from custody, Hildy sees an opportunity for the story of a lifetime. But when he finds the criminal, he learns that the man may not be guilty. With the help of his editor, Hildy attempts to hide the convict, uncover the conspiracy and write the scoop of his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifV0m0RRPAkchL5gS4MOLoWPBjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42814'),
  ('1133131877764149575', 'The Front Page', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Billy Wilder, Jordan Cronenweth', 'Billy Wilder, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Jack Lemmon, Walter Matthau, Susan Sarandon, Vincent Gardenia, David Wayne, Allen Garfield, Austin Pendleton, Charles Durning', 'PG', 'Ruthless Chicago newspaper editor Walter Burns resorts to dubious motives in order to get top reporter Hildy Johnson to cover one more big crime story before retirement.', 'Ruthless Chicago newspaper editor Walter Burns resorts to dubious motives in order to get top reporter Hildy Johnson to cover one more big crime story before retirement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4RtbJk8wVyZ1yk6yBZjzGD4ANU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987'),
  ('1120871292787534346', 'The Front Room', 2024, 'Horror', 'Max Eggers, Sam Eggers, Ava Berkofsky', 'Max Eggers, Sam Eggers', 'Brandy Norwood, Andrew Burnap, Kathryn Hunter, Neal Huff, David Manis, Mary Catherine Wright, Ellen J. Maddow, Mary Testa', 'R', 'Everything goes to hell for newly-pregnant Belinda after her mother-in-law moves in. As the diabolical guest tries to get her claws on the child, Belinda must draw the line somewhere.', 'Everything goes to hell for newly-pregnant Belinda after her mother-in-law moves in. As the diabolical guest tries to get her claws on the child, Belinda must draw the line somewhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjkU6mZH9dMbQK2B622MlsRT8uw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016848'),
  ('25123590648265815', 'The Front Runner', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Eric Steelberg, Jason Reitman', 'Jay Carson, Jason Reitman, Matt Bai', 'Hugh Jackman, Vera Farmiga, J.K. Simmons, Mark O''Brien, Molly Ephraim, Chris Coy, Alex Karpovsky, Josh Brener', 'R', 'Gary Hart, former Senator of Colorado, becomes the front-runner for the Democratic presidential nomination in 1987. Hart''s intelligence, charisma and idealism makes him popular with young voters, leaving him with a seemingly clear path to the White House. All that comes crashing down when allegations of an extramarital affair surface in the media, forcing the candidate to address a scandal that threatens to derail his campaign and personal life.', 'Gary Hart, former Senator of Colorado, becomes the front-runner for the Democratic presidential nomination in 1987. Hart''s intelligence, charisma and idealism makes him popular with young voters, leaving him with a seemingly clear path to the White House. All that comes crashing down when allegations of an extramarital affair surface in the media, forcing the candidate to address a scandal that threatens to derail his campaign and personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QKzd31H1bCjMAJ8HoaASWqbHfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476764'),
  ('1135373786640503051', 'The Frontier', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ricardo Larraín, Héctor Ríos', 'Jorge Goldenberg, Ricardo Larraín', 'Patricio Contreras, Gloria Laso, Alonso Venegas, Sergio Schmied, Aldo Bernales, Héctor Noguera, Patricio Bunster, Aníbal Reyna', null, 'A Chilean teacher, Ramiro, is sentenced to internal exile in a southern town where tidal waves often appear. He falls for a woman, Maite, whose father asks him to take her away. Although he gets his freedom he doesn''t leave and when the water rises, Maite and her father die, and Ramiro flees to the hills.', 'A Chilean teacher, Ramiro, is sentenced to internal exile in a southern town where tidal waves often appear. He falls for a woman, Maite, whose father asks him to take her away. Although he gets his freedom he doesn''t leave and when the water rises, Maite and her father die, and Ramiro flees to the hills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Wh2MhzjswMzliPq7lWkOG8JZ65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114092'),
  ('191591450314166826', 'The Frozen Dead', 1966, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Herbert J. Leder, Davis Boulton', 'Herbert J. Leder', 'Dana Andrews, Anna Palk, Philip Gilbert, Kathleen Breck, Karl Stepanek, Basil Henson, Alan Tilvern, Anne Tirard', 'NR', 'A crazed scientist keeps the heads of Nazi war criminals alive until he can find appropriate bodies on which to attach them so he can revive the Third Reich.', 'A crazed scientist keeps the heads of Nazi war criminals alive until he can find appropriate bodies on which to attach them so he can revive the Third Reich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cijZmJ0z8KPcxvXSC4nG7ktCS9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89995'),
  ('1043751107419881861', 'The Frozen Ghost', 1945, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Harold Young, Bernard B. Brown, Paul Ivano', 'Luci Ward, Bernard Schubert', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Evelyn Ankers, Elena Verdugo, Martin Kosleck, Tala Birell, Milburn Stone, Douglass Dumbrille, Arthur Hohl', null, 'When a man dies of a heart attack, a stage and radio mentalist believes he has willed him to die because he was angry with the man. Riddled with guilt, the mentalist cancels further shows, breaks off his engagement to his female partner, who can read minds while in a hypnotic trance, and takes refuge in the eerie wax-museum-cum-home of another woman friend.', 'When a man dies of a heart attack, a stage and radio mentalist believes he has willed him to die because he was angry with the man. Riddled with guilt, the mentalist cancels further shows, breaks off his engagement to his female partner, who can read minds while in a hypnotic trance, and takes refuge in the eerie wax-museum-cum-home of another woman friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oA1yY7hW6i259eTXxeFMqmYStHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64078'),
  ('50848008128689084', 'The Frozen Ground', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Margot Coleman Martin, Scott Walker, Patrick Murguia', 'Scott Walker', 'Nicolas Cage, Vanessa Hudgens, John Cusack, Radha Mitchell, Jodi Lyn O''Keefe, Katherine LaNasa, Dean Norris, 50 Cent', 'R', 'An Alaska State Trooper partners with a young woman who escaped the clutches of serial killer Robert Hansen to bring the murderer to justice. Based on actual events.', 'An Alaska State Trooper partners with a young woman who escaped the clutches of serial killer Robert Hansen to bring the murderer to justice. Based on actual events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHDj1h3lJvYd9Cervoswz9crhWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199373'),
  ('407372596295589', 'The Frozen North', 1922, 'Comedy, Western', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline', 'Buster Keaton, Joe Roberts, Sybil Seely, Bonnie Hill, Freeman Wood, Edward F. Cline', null, 'A mix of guns and mistaken identity leads to chaos in this satirical parody of William S. Hart''s melodramatic westerns, finding Buster in the frozen north - "the last stop on the subway".', 'A mix of guns and mistaken identity leads to chaos in this satirical parody of William S. Hart''s melodramatic westerns, finding Buster in the frozen north - "the last stop on the subway".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz0zcPq6oG27v23abgeZD5NzCW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51364'),
  ('1066403617074255811', 'The Fruit Is Ripe', 1977, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sigi Rothemund, Heinz Hölscher', 'Patrizia Piccardi', 'Betty Vergès, Claus Richt, Olivia Pascal, Corinne Brodbeck, Rut Rex, Thomas Fritsch, Sabi Dorr, Eric Wedekind', 'R', 'A good-looking German girl goes on vacation in Greece, and a large number of people try to get her to go to bed with them. With a light, teasing manner, she turns all of them down, until at last she meets a boy she really likes.', 'A good-looking German girl goes on vacation in Greece, and a large number of people try to get her to go to bed with them. With a light, teasing manner, she turns all of them down, until at last she meets a boy she really likes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8g35jOzMld7IcW6vyERw5VS3Tun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74949'),
  ('587288492711468045', 'The Fruit Is Swelling', 1997, 'Romance', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Jane Chung Chun, Christine Hung Hiu-Wan, Stephanie Fong Shuan, Shu Qi, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Jimmy Wong Shu-Kei', null, 'An 8-year-old girl named Peach makes a wish and wakes up to find herself transformed into an 18-year-old woman.', 'An 8-year-old girl named Peach makes a wish and wakes up to find herself transformed into an 18-year-old woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IbVhACQ6wyt6chFj1LUycIhMle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39998'),
  ('428638777095812521', 'The Fruit Machine', 1988, 'Drama', 'Philip Saville, Dick Pope', 'Frank Clarke', 'Emile Charles, Tony Forsyth, Robert Stephens, Clare Higgins, Bruce Payne, Robbie Coltrane, Carsten Nørgaard, Kim Christie', null, 'Eddie and Michael are two 16-year-old gay friends from Liverpool. Berated by his father for his camp behavior, Eddie runs away from his Liverpool home and joins Michael, a streetwise hustler, who is also on the run.', 'Eddie and Michael are two 16-year-old gay friends from Liverpool. Berated by his father for his camp behavior, Eddie runs away from his Liverpool home and joins Michael, a streetwise hustler, who is also on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHCBoIUXUIGpdG8whweUAZ8W0je.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40927'),
  ('705689535396826636', 'The Fugitive', 1947, 'Drama', 'John Ford, Gabriel Figueroa, Richard Hageman', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Henry Fonda, Dolores del Río, Pedro Armendáriz, J. Carrol Naish, Leo Carrillo, Ward Bond, Robert Armstrong, John Qualen', 'NR', 'Anti-Catholic and anti-cleric policies in the Mexican state of Tabasco lead the revolutionary government to persecute the state''s last remaining priest.', 'Anti-Catholic and anti-cleric policies in the Mexican state of Tabasco lead the revolutionary government to persecute the state''s last remaining priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CHA46FqD5rQAoJZwkjxMb0EOw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37368'),
  ('908565986335599851', 'The Fugitive', 1993, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Andrew Davis, Michael Chapman, Terry Leonard', 'David Twohy, Jeb Stuart', 'Harrison Ford, Tommy Lee Jones, Joe Pantoliano, Jeroen Krabbé, Daniel Roebuck, L. Scott Caldwell, Tom Wood, Ron Dean', 'PG-13', 'Wrongfully convicted of murdering his wife and sentenced to death, Richard Kimble escapes from the law in an attempt to find the real killer and clear his name.', 'Wrongfully convicted of murdering his wife and sentenced to death, Richard Kimble escapes from the law in an attempt to find the real killer and clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3rEtLKyOnF89mcK75GXDXdmOEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5503'),
  ('366723686413893297', 'The Fugitive Apparitions', 1904, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A magician makes a woman appear and disappear.', 'A magician makes a woman appear and disappear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiILIzyAuxVUljUeaSF4XBPrDTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196061'),
  ('989964260891616332', 'The Fugitive Kind', 1960, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, Boris Kaufman, Charles H. Maguire', 'Tennessee Williams, Meade Roberts', 'Marlon Brando, Anna Magnani, Joanne Woodward, Victor Jory, Maureen Stapleton, R.G. Armstrong, Emory Richardson, Madame Spivy', 'NR', 'Val Xavier, a drifter of obscure origins, arrives at a small town and gets a job in a store run by Lady Torrence. Her husband, Jabe M. Torrance, is dying of cancer. Val is pursued by Carol Cutere, the enigmatic local tramp-of-good-family.', 'Val Xavier, a drifter of obscure origins, arrives at a small town and gets a job in a store run by Lady Torrence. Her husband, Jabe M. Torrance, is dying of cancer. Val is pursued by Carol Cutere, the enigmatic local tramp-of-good-family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ta2ircBtQs8EZXe6QznCI5J6N3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47837'),
  ('687497367841741240', 'The Fugitives', 1955, 'War, Drama', 'Jean-Paul Le Chanois, Marc Fossard, Georges Charlot', 'Michel André', 'Pierre Fresnay, François Périer, Michel André, Silvia Monfort, Georgette Anys, François Darbon, Jacques Marin, Robert Rollis', null, 'During the Second World War, in 1943, two French prisoners, François and Michel, escape from Stalag B377 in northern Germany near the Baltic Sea. They meet another escaped compatriot, Pierre, who has donned the uniform of a German officer and joins them. Their goal: to reach neutral Sweden. To get there, they''ll have to walk part of the way, then take a train to the coast and, from there, find a way to cross the sea to the shores of Sweden.', 'During the Second World War, in 1943, two French prisoners, François and Michel, escape from Stalag B377 in northern Germany near the Baltic Sea. They meet another escaped compatriot, Pierre, who has donned the uniform of a German officer and joins them. Their goal: to reach neutral Sweden. To get there, they''ll have to walk part of the way, then take a train to the coast and, from there, find a way to cross the sea to the shores of Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k35VYTY3PmYPpKWNNxzZkyqcie0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202695'),
