  ('900082919938739348', 'The Fury of the Wolf Man', 1972, 'Horror', 'José María Zabalza, Leopoldo Villaseñor', 'Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Perla Cristal, Verónica Luján, Miguel de la Riva, Pilar Zorrilla, José Marco, Francisco Amorós, Javier de Rivera', 'PG', 'A man has had a werewolf curse cast upon him. If he doesn''t get rid of it, he turns into a killer werewolf when the moon is full.', 'A man has had a werewolf curse cast upon him. If he doesn''t get rid of it, he turns into a killer werewolf when the moon is full.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6L8x3DiOoOmTOofH1LmEKRD3AuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28406'),
  ('956656449313252346', 'The Future', 2011, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Miranda July, Nikolai von Graevenitz, Shawn Bisi', 'Miranda July', 'Miranda July, Hamish Linklater, David Warshofsky, Isabella Acres, Angela Trimbur, Mary Passeri, Kathleen Gati, Ryker Baloun', 'R', 'When a couple decides to adopt a stray cat their perspective on life changes radically, literally altering the course of time and space and testing their faith in each other and themselves.', 'When a couple decides to adopt a stray cat their perspective on life changes radically, literally altering the course of time and space and testing their faith in each other and themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gu9zd9rzYaQj2eU1IGeOqcpytoW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54662'),
  ('627528252991497157', 'The Future', 2013, 'Drama', 'Alicia Scherson, Ricardo DeAngelis, Michael Löseke', 'Alicia Scherson', 'Manuela Martelli, Nicolas Vaporidis, Luigi Ciardo, Alessandro Giallocosta, Pino Calabrese, Rutger Hauer, Sara Manni, Daniela Piperno', 'NR', 'When their parents die, Bianca starts to smoke and Tomas is still a virgin. The orphans explore the dangerous streets of adulthood until Bianca finds Maciste, a retired Mr. Universe, and enters his dark mansion in search of a future.', 'When their parents die, Bianca starts to smoke and Tomas is still a virgin. The orphans explore the dangerous streets of adulthood until Bianca finds Maciste, a retired Mr. Universe, and enters his dark mansion in search of a future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRHHZVNfOwYzFQMTt185I7fEyp8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153774'),
  ('153054008850228577', 'The Future Awaits', 2025, 'Drama, History, War', 'Nils Tavernier, Tatyana Umek, Emmanuel Mathieu', 'Nils Tavernier, Guy Birenbaum, Laurent Bertoni', 'Violette Guillon, Guillaume Gallienne, Adeline D''Hermy, Sandrine Bonnaire, Laurent Bateau, Claude Mathieu, Zoé Richard, Bernard Le Coq', null, 'In July 1942, during the Vel’ d’Hiv’ Roundup of Jewish families in Paris, 13 year old Tauba Birenbaum and her parents, who are Polish Jews, find refuge in a tiny room for the next 765 days. Living conditions are tough and they fear being discovered at any moment. But while her parents sink further into despair, Tauba’s fighting spirit shines through. She finds joy in every little thing, from a piano drawn on the floor, to the views of Paris through an open window. Despite extreme circumstances, she will keep hope until the liberation of Paris, and take back control of her life.', 'In July 1942, during the Vel’ d’Hiv’ Roundup of Jewish families in Paris, 13 year old Tauba Birenbaum and her parents, who are Polish Jews, find refuge in a tiny room for the next 765 days. Living conditions are tough and they fear being discovered at any moment. But while her parents sink further into despair, Tauba’s fighting spirit shines through. She finds joy in every little thing, from a piano drawn on the floor, to the views of Paris through an open window. Despite extreme circumstances, she will keep hope until the liberation of Paris, and take back control of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQL0cZvAiAYPHf5hYizmvar1Wzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001435'),
  ('701106997567205979', 'The Future Is Woman', 1984, 'Drama', 'Marco Ferreri, Beatrice Banfi, Paolo Trotta', 'Dacia Maraini, Piera Degli Esposti, Marco Ferreri', 'Ornella Muti, Hanna Schygulla, Niels Arestrup, Maurizio Donadoni, Isabella Biagini, Michele Bovenzi, Ute Cremer, Christian Fremont', null, 'In this improbable, ponderous story about a couple who do not want to have children of their own, and a pregnant, single woman who needs a home for awhile, the relationship between the three is strange, at the very least.', 'In this improbable, ponderous story about a couple who do not want to have children of their own, and a pregnant, single woman who needs a home for awhile, the relationship between the three is strange, at the very least.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGiwh3KGOvHSg1qv3VwR19Z8pju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81787'),
  ('524911018552358237', 'The Future of Food', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Deborah Koons', 'Deborah Koons', null, null, 'Before compiling your next grocery list, you might want to watch filmmaker Deborah Koons Garcia''s eye-opening documentary, which sheds light on a shadowy relationship between agriculture, big business and government. By examining the effects of biotechnology on the nation''s smallest farmers, the film reveals the unappetizing truth about genetically modified foods: You could unknowingly be serving them for dinner.', 'Before compiling your next grocery list, you might want to watch filmmaker Deborah Koons Garcia''s eye-opening documentary, which sheds light on a shadowy relationship between agriculture, big business and government. By examining the effects of biotechnology on the nation''s smallest farmers, the film reveals the unappetizing truth about genetically modified foods: You could unknowingly be serving them for dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1j001mLedx9b95AVguAezMMUthP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25465'),
  ('285547496496033523', 'The Future Perfect', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nele Wohlatz, Agustina San Martín, Roman Kasseroller', 'Pío Longo', 'Zhang Xiaobing, Saroj Kumar Malik, Mian Jiang, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Dong Xi Wang', null, 'A smart and innovative look at the possible futures of a young Chinese immigrant to Buenos Aires, told in the stilted language of an elementary Spanish textbook.', 'A smart and innovative look at the possible futures of a young Chinese immigrant to Buenos Aires, told in the stilted language of an elementary Spanish textbook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJfgezWiIte2FjsEG6yMzm9NPlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408376'),
  ('1147896603131383642', 'The Fuzzy Pink Nightgown', 1957, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Norman Taurog, Joseph LaShelle', 'Richard Alan Simmons', 'Jane Russell, Keenan Wynn, Ralph Meeker, Fred Clark, Una Merkel, Benay Venuta, Robert H. Harris, Bob Kelley', null, 'When beautiful blonde movie star Laurel Stevens is kidnapped on the verge of the premiere of her film “The Kidnapped Bride”, everyone thinks it''s a publicity stunt. It''s not.', 'When beautiful blonde movie star Laurel Stevens is kidnapped on the verge of the premiere of her film “The Kidnapped Bride”, everyone thinks it''s a publicity stunt. It''s not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Q7IhCvT1eMwe6vu2bkfLpUb6vE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148193'),
  ('527341048730318009', 'The Gabby Douglas Story', 2014, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Gregg Champion, Gordon Lonsdale', 'Maria Nation, Sterling Anderson', 'Regina King, Imani Hakim, Sydney Mikayla, Riele Downs, Brian Tee, David Haydn-Jones, S. Epatha Merkerson, Gabby Douglas', null, 'The true story of Gabby Douglas who becomes the first African American to be named Individual All-Around Champion in artistic gymnastics at the Olympic Games.', 'The true story of Gabby Douglas who becomes the first African American to be named Individual All-Around Champion in artistic gymnastics at the Olympic Games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIsFplFgFXFMMBfK0Ei0i5qlRVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254065'),
  ('666436180121940908', 'The Gabby Petito Story', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Thora Birch, Eitan Almagor, Zack Walker', 'Gregory Small, Richard Blaney', 'Skyler Samuels, Evan Hall, Thora Birch, Douglas Taurel, Monica Moore Smith, Matisha Baldwin, Samuel Whitten, Lonzo Liggins', null, 'The disappearance of Gabby Petito captured America’s attention, setting off a nationwide search for the 22-year-old travel blogger after her parents reported her missing in September 2021, when she failed to return home following her cross country “van-life” trip with her fiancé Brian Laundrie. Non-stop coverage on the news drove amateur sleuths to dissect Gabby’s social media posts for clues about what happened to her during her trip, leading to the eventual discovery of her body in Wyoming.', 'The disappearance of Gabby Petito captured America’s attention, setting off a nationwide search for the 22-year-old travel blogger after her parents reported her missing in September 2021, when she failed to return home following her cross country “van-life” trip with her fiancé Brian Laundrie. Non-stop coverage on the news drove amateur sleuths to dissect Gabby’s social media posts for clues about what happened to her during her trip, leading to the eventual discovery of her body in Wyoming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ws3R5LG8p7brQe7zq2xClDM3Yft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012661'),
  ('99804806027134067', 'The Gal Who Took the West', 1949, 'Western', 'Frederick de Cordova, William H. Daniels', 'William Bowers, Oscar Brodney', 'Yvonne De Carlo, Charles Coburn, Scott Brady, John Russell, Myrna Dell, James Millican, Clem Bevans, Robert R. Stephenson', 'NR', 'In order to gain passage to the West, a woman poses as an opera singer, and causes a feud between two cousins.', 'In order to gain passage to the West, a woman poses as an opera singer, and causes a feud between two cousins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBUD5SzDlveax5hD9kodzUAEBGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60905'),
  ('573876895195849088', 'The Galaxy Invader', 1985, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Don Dohler, Paul E. Loeschke, Anne Frith', 'Don Dohler', 'Richard Ruxton, Faye Tilles, George Stover, Greg Dohler, Anne Frith, Richard Dyszel, Kim Pfeiffer, Theresa Harold', 'PG', 'An alien is hunted by a gang of drunken hillbillies who saw him crash-land his spaceship.', 'An alien is hunted by a gang of drunken hillbillies who saw him crash-land his spaceship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZ4aOLMsBiMLjYtyEJsHk17OaNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75564'),
  ('641173481347129388', 'The Galíndez File', 2003, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Gerardo Herrero, Alfredo Mayo, Javier Petit', 'Luis Marías, Rafael Azcona, Ángeles González-Sinde', 'Harvey Keitel, Saffron Burrows, Eduard Fernández, Guillermo Toledo, Reynaldo Miravalles, Joel Angelino, John Furey, Chete Lera', null, 'On March 12, 1956, Basque Nationalist Jesús de Galíndez Suarez disappears from his apartment in New York, never heard from again. He had been working with the FBI and was about to publish a book critical of Dominican strongman, Trujillo. In 1988, a graduate student, Muriel Colber, wants to make Galíndez the subject of her dissertation. She''s in Spain doing research; finding little, she goes to Santo Domingo. At every turn, the CIA, in the person of agent Robards, tries to thwart her; and, at each turn, as she considers abandoning the project, someone offers new information, often contradictory. She wants the truth behind the Galíndez mystery; will she find it?', 'On March 12, 1956, Basque Nationalist Jesús de Galíndez Suarez disappears from his apartment in New York, never heard from again. He had been working with the FBI and was about to publish a book critical of Dominican strongman, Trujillo. In 1988, a graduate student, Muriel Colber, wants to make Galíndez the subject of her dissertation. She''s in Spain doing research; finding little, she goes to Santo Domingo. At every turn, the CIA, in the person of agent Robards, tries to thwart her; and, at each turn, as she considers abandoning the project, someone offers new information, often contradictory. She wants the truth behind the Galíndez mystery; will she find it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ycqWF1XkgonCjz972B0t4xwzmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189332'),
  ('70611642118059591', 'The Gallant Hours', 1960, 'Drama, War', 'Joseph MacDonald, Robert Montgomery, Joseph C. Behm', 'Beirne Lay Jr., Frank D. Gilroy', 'James Cagney, Dennis Weaver, Ward Costello, Vaughn Taylor, Richard Jaeckel, Les Tremayne, Walter Sande, Karl Swenson', 'NR', 'A semi-documentary dramatization of five weeks in the life of Vice Admiral William F. "Bull" Halsey, Jr., from his assignment to command the U.S. naval operations in the South Pacific to the Allied victory at Guadalcanal.', 'A semi-documentary dramatization of five weeks in the life of Vice Admiral William F. "Bull" Halsey, Jr., from his assignment to command the U.S. naval operations in the South Pacific to the Allied victory at Guadalcanal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YKWqCWnSfE3fJB2lLUAiQOu0ol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99345'),
  ('1090417298557732343', 'The Gallerist', 2026, 'Thriller, Comedy, Drama', 'Cathy Yan, Federico Cesca, Claire Letoret, Sydney Wattiez', 'Cathy Yan, James Pedersen', 'Jenna Ortega, Da''Vine Joy Randolph, Sterling K. Brown, Zach Galifianakis, Catherine Zeta-Jones', null, 'A gallerist, driven by desperation, hatches a scheme to sell a dead guy at Art Basel Miami.', 'A gallerist, driven by desperation, hatches a scheme to sell a dead guy at Art Basel Miami.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fxqqno510An90CfExaIW5Co7m0xY.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-gallerist-2026'),
  ('601322979134632339', 'The Gallopin'' Gaucho', 1928, 'Western, Comedy, Animation', 'Ub Iwerks', null, 'Walt Disney', null, 'Mickey rides up to a cantina and does a tango with Minnie. When a big cat steals her away, Mickey gives chase, riding a drunken ostrich. At the hideout, Mickey has a swordfight with the cat.', 'Mickey rides up to a cantina and does a tango with Minnie. When a big cat steals her away, Mickey gives chase, riding a drunken ostrich. At the hideout, Mickey has a swordfight with the cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Q9NlnGfgsCphR89qFSAOR6BWq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113252'),
  ('375377642128857373', 'The Gallows', 2015, 'Horror', 'Travis Cluff, Chris Lofing, Edd Lukas', 'Travis Cluff, Chris Lofing', 'Reese Mishler, Pfeifer Brown, Ryan Shoos, Cassidy Gifford, Price T. Morgan, Mackie Burt, Travis Cluff, Melissa Bratton', 'R', '20 years after a horrific accident during a small town school play, students at the school resurrect the failed show in a misguided attempt to honor the anniversary of the tragedy - but soon discover that some things are better left alone.', '20 years after a horrific accident during a small town school play, students at the school resurrect the failed show in a misguided attempt to honor the anniversary of the tragedy - but soon discover that some things are better left alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oBk2DsYRO0VuloOX52ROmz2QhU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299245'),
  ('518417257391041', 'The Gallows Act II', 2019, 'Horror', 'Chris Lofing, Travis Cluff, Kyle Gentz', 'Chris Lofing, Travis Cluff', 'Ema Horvath, Chris Milligan, Brittany Falardeau, Pfeifer Brown, Erika Miranda, Deandre Pierre, Jono Cota, Jener Dasilva', 'R', 'When Auna Rue transfers to a prestigious new acting school, she encounters a malevolent spirit after participating in a viral challenge.', 'When Auna Rue transfers to a prestigious new acting school, she encounters a malevolent spirit after participating in a viral challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hObV2CtJll0wJjn1I9WjT6O8dw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505060'),
  ('84532593374033702', 'The Gambler', 1958, 'Drama', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Ghislaine Autant-Lara, Jacques Natteau', 'Jean Aurenche, Pierre Bost, François Boyer', 'Gérard Philipe, Liselotte Pulver, Françoise Rosay, Jean Danet, Jean-Max, Nadine Alari, Sacha Pitoëff, Suzanne Dantès', null, 'In 1866, a young Muscovite named Alexei Ivanovitch arrives in Baden Baden, then the gambling capital of Austria, and is soon engaged by General Zagorianski to look after his children. Alexei discovers that his employer is a compulsive gambler who has been almost ruined by his addiction. The only money the General has is provided by the Marquis de Grieux, an adventurer who intends to marry Zagorianski’s sister, Pauline. In doing so, de Grieux hopes to profit from the vast inheritance that will come the General’s way from his Aunt Antonina, who is presently very ill. Alexei is appalled by this society which lives only for money. He loves Pauline and wants to take her to a healthier place, but when she refuses to marry him, he begins to gamble at the casino…', 'In 1866, a young Muscovite named Alexei Ivanovitch arrives in Baden Baden, then the gambling capital of Austria, and is soon engaged by General Zagorianski to look after his children. Alexei discovers that his employer is a compulsive gambler who has been almost ruined by his addiction. The only money the General has is provided by the Marquis de Grieux, an adventurer who intends to marry Zagorianski’s sister, Pauline. In doing so, de Grieux hopes to profit from the vast inheritance that will come the General’s way from his Aunt Antonina, who is presently very ill. Alexei is appalled by this society which lives only for money. He loves Pauline and wants to take her to a healthier place, but when she refuses to marry him, he begins to gamble at the casino…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5LSPFGWlZoweDZLaGNanjgLZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80588'),
  ('107149112358808357', 'The Gambler', 1974, 'Drama, Crime', 'Karel Reisz, Victor J. Kemper', 'James Toback', 'James Caan, Paul Sorvino, Lauren Hutton, Morris Carnovsky, Jacqueline Brookes, Burt Young, Carmine Caridi, Carl W. Crudup', 'R', 'New York City English professor Axel Freed outwardly seems like an upstanding citizen. But privately Freed is in the clutches of a severe gambling addiction that threatens to destroy him.', 'New York City English professor Axel Freed outwardly seems like an upstanding citizen. But privately Freed is in the clutches of a severe gambling addiction that threatens to destroy him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyZyUHOm14wmStWnuBjflOkzajt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44800'),
  ('567715820525663667', 'The Gambler', 1979, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Rogelio A. González, Xavier Cruz', 'Adolfo Torres Portillo', 'Vicente Fernández, Jorge Rivero, Martha D''Castro, Amparo Muñoz, Eduardo de la Peña, Tito Junco, Ignacio Retes, Alfredo Mayo', null, 'Three childhood friends; when they grow up, the poor boy is shut out from the possibility of romancing the girl because of class issues. He leaves town, learns to play pro-level poker, wins a fortune, then goes home to ruin his rival''s life.', 'Three childhood friends; when they grow up, the poor boy is shut out from the possibility of romancing the girl because of class issues. He leaves town, learns to play pro-level poker, wins a fortune, then goes home to ruin his rival''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UcPHf3sZCjdLUw2enr2uRJkiJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372749'),
  ('865637074672542458', 'The Gambler', 1980, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry, Joseph F. Biroc, John Marias', 'Jim Byrnes', 'Kenny Rogers, Christine Belford, Bruce Boxleitner, Harold Gould, Clu Gulager, Lance LeGault, Lee Purcell, Ronnie Scribner', 'NR', 'This Western adventure, inspired by Kenny Rogers'' hit song, tells how fictional gambler Brady Hawkes, going in search of a young son he never knew he had, teams up with an impetuous young admirer and a shady lady on his journey, which also involves him with an arrogant railroad owner and a gang of villains.', 'This Western adventure, inspired by Kenny Rogers'' hit song, tells how fictional gambler Brady Hawkes, going in search of a young son he never knew he had, teams up with an impetuous young admirer and a shady lady on his journey, which also involves him with an arrogant railroad owner and a gang of villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16qBOtkbv9z8PE6pym3M4rgQ3yu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44789'),
  ('678105915873960746', 'The Gambler', 2014, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Rupert Wyatt, Greig Fraser, Peter Dress', 'James Toback', 'Mark Wahlberg, John Goodman, Brie Larson, Michael Kenneth Williams, George Kennedy, Jessica Lange, Richard Schiff, Andre Braugher', 'R', 'Literature professor Jim Bennett leads a secret life as a high-stakes gambler. Always a risk-taker, Bennett bets it all when he borrows from a gangster and offers his own life as collateral. Staying one step ahead, he pits his creditor against the operator of an illicit gambling ring while garnering the attention of Frank, a paternalistic loan shark. As his relationship with a student deepens, Bennett must risk everything for a second chance.', 'Literature professor Jim Bennett leads a secret life as a high-stakes gambler. Always a risk-taker, Bennett bets it all when he borrows from a gangster and offers his own life as collateral. Staying one step ahead, he pits his creditor against the operator of an illicit gambling ring while garnering the attention of Frank, a paternalistic loan shark. As his relationship with a student deepens, Bennett must risk everything for a second chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIgU3cxn7Y87joQGM3srofnXOm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284536'),
  ('71190997567752821', 'The Gambler and the Lady', 1952, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Patrick Jenkins, Walter J. Harvey, Phil Rigal', 'Sam Newfield', 'Dane Clark, Kathleen Byron, Naomi Chance, Meredith Edwards, Anthony Forwood, Eric Pohlmann, Enzo Coticchia, Julian Somers', 'NR', 'A greedy but successful professional gambler wants to join the British Establishment when he falls in love with a blue-blooded lady. But first he must mend his ways and then dump his nightclub singer girl friend. She''s not so easy to get rid of, neither is his past.', 'A greedy but successful professional gambler wants to join the British Establishment when he falls in love with a blue-blooded lady. But first he must mend his ways and then dump his nightclub singer girl friend. She''s not so easy to get rid of, neither is his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/newPN1gewtL0hcybCIRVOgTCMMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46586'),
  ('840119497053410072', 'The Gambler Lady', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Nikos Dimopoulos, Markos Zervas', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Rena Vlahopoulou, Labros Konstadaras, Kostas Voutsas, Lili Papayanni, Hloi Liaskou, Sapfo Notara, Nikos Fermas, Aggelos Mavropoulos', null, 'About Aleka who is obsessed with playing cards and the efforts of her husband to make her quit this bad "habit".', 'About Aleka who is obsessed with playing cards and the efforts of her husband to make her quit this bad "habit".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHwTtIhzxNCo4e8WdyVwevZzPL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297336'),
  ('518403452127424035', 'The Gambler: The Adventure Continues', 1983, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry, James Pergola, David S. Cass Sr.', 'Cort Casady, Jim Byrnes', 'Kenny Rogers, Bruce Boxleitner, Linda Evans, Johnny Crawford, Charles Fields, David Hedison, Robert F. Hoy, Brion James', 'PG', 'Brady Hawkes, Billy Montana, and Jeremiah Hawkes are on a train bound for a huge gambling event when the train is taken over by a gang of vicious killers in search of money. As ransom, the gang takes young Jeremiah hostage. Brady and Billy embark on a quest to rescue him and form a small gang of their own along the way.', 'Brady Hawkes, Billy Montana, and Jeremiah Hawkes are on a train bound for a huge gambling event when the train is taken over by a gang of vicious killers in search of money. As ransom, the gang takes young Jeremiah hostage. Brady and Billy embark on a quest to rescue him and form a small gang of their own along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAUp4puxpqnBf69b6c8Vikt6DqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154068'),
  ('583120791606233793', 'The Gambling Ghost', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Kerrick Wong, Chu Yat-Hung', 'Roman Cheung', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Mang Hoi, Nina Li Chi, Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, James Wong Jim, Norman Ng Siu-Ping, Lam Ching-Ying, Wu Ma', null, 'Sammo Hung plays three different characters: Fatty, Fatty''s father and Fatty''s grandfather, Hung Kau. Fatty is a hotel worker, yearning for sudden wealth. Therefore, he, and his co-worker, enter the gambling world, to the dismay of his father. When Fatty hits rock bottom, the ghost of his grandfather resurrects to help him. However, Fatty learns that his grandfather was murdered, therefore, he will stop at nothing to avenge his death.', 'Sammo Hung plays three different characters: Fatty, Fatty''s father and Fatty''s grandfather, Hung Kau. Fatty is a hotel worker, yearning for sudden wealth. Therefore, he, and his co-worker, enter the gambling world, to the dismay of his father. When Fatty hits rock bottom, the ghost of his grandfather resurrects to help him. However, Fatty learns that his grandfather was murdered, therefore, he will stop at nothing to avenge his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfTgslO2hQcc4elwJX9SxtMb9sU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173042'),
  ('227925444527654621', 'The Game', 1984, 'Horror', 'Bill Rebane, Bill Rebane', 'William Arthur, Larry Dreyfus', 'Tom Blair, Jim Iaquinta, Carol Perry, Stuart Osborne, Don Arthur, Debbie Martin, Lori Minnetti, Pamela Rohleder', null, 'Three bored millionaires set a fortune as the prize if any one of nine people, that they''ve gathered in an old mansion, can meet and conquer their greatest fear.', 'Three bored millionaires set a fortune as the prize if any one of nine people, that they''ve gathered in an old mansion, can meet and conquer their greatest fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7v5mG6N0XSuWeaCDIAv7A9vt2tk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114604'),
  ('657387829166937490', 'The Game', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Harris Savides, David Fincher, James J. Murakami', 'Michael Ferris, John Brancato', 'Michael Douglas, Sean Penn, Deborah Kara Unger, James Rebhorn, Peter Donat, Carroll Baker, Anna Katarina, Armin Mueller-Stahl', 'R', 'In honor of his birthday, San Francisco banker Nicholas Van Orton, a financial genius and a cold-hearted loner, receives an unusual present from his younger brother, Conrad: a gift certificate to play a unique kind of game. In nary a nanosecond, Nicholas finds himself consumed by a dangerous set of ever-changing rules, unable to distinguish where the charade ends and reality begins.', 'In honor of his birthday, San Francisco banker Nicholas Van Orton, a financial genius and a cold-hearted loner, receives an unusual present from his younger brother, Conrad: a gift certificate to play a unique kind of game. In nary a nanosecond, Nicholas finds himself consumed by a dangerous set of ever-changing rules, unable to distinguish where the charade ends and reality begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UOa079915QjiTA2u5hT2yKVgUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2649'),
  ('738581096322783342', 'The Game', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Péter Fazakas, András Nagy', 'Norbert Köbli', 'Gabriella Hámori, Péter Scherer, Zsolt Nagy, János Kulka, Viktória Staub, Ákos Orosz', null, 'During the Cold War, the secret service of Kádár began a more dangerous state security game than ever before.', 'During the Cold War, the secret service of Kádár began a more dangerous state security game than ever before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iikGOkF5pIMhJW0TdQHgiePry79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925471'),
  ('663119192793366319', 'The Game Changers', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Louie Psihoyos, Hunter Nolan, John Behrens', 'Mark Monroe, Joseph Pace, Shannon Kornelsen', 'James Wilks, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Patrik Baboumian, Scott Jurek, Dotsie Bausch, Tia Blanco, Nimai Delgado, Rip Esselstyn', 'NR', 'From the UFC Octagon in Las Vegas and the anthropology lab at Dartmouth, to a strongman gym in Berlin and the bushlands of Zimbabwe, the world is introduced to elite athletes, special ops soldiers, visionary scientists, cultural icons, and everyday heroes—each on a mission to create a seismic shift in the way we eat and live.', 'From the UFC Octagon in Las Vegas and the anthropology lab at Dartmouth, to a strongman gym in Berlin and the bushlands of Zimbabwe, the world is introduced to elite athletes, special ops soldiers, visionary scientists, cultural icons, and everyday heroes—each on a mission to create a seismic shift in the way we eat and live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eufF3xEif5EZ1gTjdubw3KWh9xU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463088'),
  ('627053275336224181', 'The Game Is Over', 1966, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Renoir, Roger Vadim, Robert André', 'Claude Choublier', 'Jane Fonda, Michel Piccoli, Peter McEnery, Tina Aumont, Jacques Monod, Howard Vernon, Ham Chau Luong, Germaine Montero', null, 'Renee Saccard is a pampered, selfish young wife of a middle-aged Parisian businessman who falls in love with her stepson but is driven to the point of madness when her husband tricks the stepson into betraying her.', 'Renee Saccard is a pampered, selfish young wife of a middle-aged Parisian businessman who falls in love with her stepson but is driven to the point of madness when her husband tricks the stepson into betraying her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibMcsIw2Bv8y3c6Rz9mDLJvv0hb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92180'),
  ('1135306924251548674', 'The Game of Love', 1954, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Claude Autant-Lara', null, 'Edwige Feuillère, Nicole Berger, Pierre-Michel Beck, Robert Berri, Simone Duhart, Hélène Tossy, Charles Dechamps, Louis de Funès', null, 'Friends since infancy, two youngsters struggle as their platonic bond blossoms into romantic love with adolescence.', 'Friends since infancy, two youngsters struggle as their platonic bond blossoms into romantic love with adolescence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quafZN9fRSKu0vTUBEH3nvBjgp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107837'),
  ('863040393265989242', 'The Game of Their Lives', 2005, 'Drama', 'David Anspaugh, Johnny E. Jensen', 'Angelo Pizzo', 'Gerard Butler, Wes Bentley, Gavin Rossdale, Costas Mandylor, Louis Mandylor, Zachery Ty Bryan, Jimmy Jean-Louis, Patrick Stewart', 'PG', 'During the 1950 World Cup, the hastily assembled U.S. soccer team enters as heavy underdogs when matched up against the highest-ranked team in competition — England.', 'During the 1950 World Cup, the hastily assembled U.S. soccer team enters as heavy underdogs when matched up against the highest-ranked team in competition — England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZkVLxvWfx9PzuixNnlVz1Y9fa6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29078'),
  ('584240217275775512', 'The Game of Truth', 1961, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Robert Hossein, Christian Matras', 'Steve Passeur, Louis Martin, Robert Hossein', 'Robert Hossein, Françoise Prévost, Paul Meurisse, Jean Servais, Nadia Gray, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Perrette Pradier, Jeanne Valérie', null, 'A dozen elegant people are gathered in a writer''s desirable mansion. In the grand tradition of Agatha Christie, they all have something to hide.They begin a cruel game of truth, a game where you''re not supposed to tell lies. As the questions become more and more intimate and precise, the tempers rise, while outside the storm is raging. Enter a hateful person (played by Paul Meurisse, the nasty headmaster in "Les Diaboliques") who seems to know a lot about them. Someone is murdered. Whodunit?', 'A dozen elegant people are gathered in a writer''s desirable mansion. In the grand tradition of Agatha Christie, they all have something to hide.They begin a cruel game of truth, a game where you''re not supposed to tell lies. As the questions become more and more intimate and precise, the tempers rise, while outside the storm is raging. Enter a hateful person (played by Paul Meurisse, the nasty headmaster in "Les Diaboliques") who seems to know a lot about them. Someone is murdered. Whodunit?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hesGECqZPgtlbLqdugmP4Rh0kMn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79299'),
  ('1018815965631396776', 'The Game of Truth', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero, Pablo Ramos', 'Roberto Santiago, Álvaro Fernández Armero', 'Tristán Ulloa, Natalia Verbeke, María Esteve, Óscar Jaenada, Sonia Castelo, Fernando Cayo', null, 'Four friends (two couples) play a game of truth on the evening after one of them, Ernesto, is mistakenly told by a doctor he has only three months to live. Ernesto''s a sad sack, living with Lea at his parents'', about to lose a job he got through his best friend, Alberto. Ernesto is also hopelessly in love with Alberto''s fiancée, Susana - who, for her part, has gotten Lea a job as the sign-language interpreter on a local TV news show Susana anchors, a job Lea is about to lose. The truths that come out during the game, especially Ernesto''s desire for Susana, create havoc. Alberto and Susana''s wedding and Ernesto''s new test results are coming soon.', 'Four friends (two couples) play a game of truth on the evening after one of them, Ernesto, is mistakenly told by a doctor he has only three months to live. Ernesto''s a sad sack, living with Lea at his parents'', about to lose a job he got through his best friend, Alberto. Ernesto is also hopelessly in love with Alberto''s fiancée, Susana - who, for her part, has gotten Lea a job as the sign-language interpreter on a local TV news show Susana anchors, a job Lea is about to lose. The truths that come out during the game, especially Ernesto''s desire for Susana, create havoc. Alberto and Susana''s wedding and Ernesto''s new test results are coming soon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/no2YnWjtSDRHwZTqSQY1W93zwxe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98959'),
  ('303407090332166291', 'The Game Plan', 2007, 'Comedy, Family', 'Andy Fickman, Greg Gardiner', 'Kathryn Price, Nichole Millard', 'Dwayne Johnson, Madison Pettis, Kyra Sedgwick, Roselyn Sánchez, Morris Chestnut, Hayes MacArthur, Brian J. White, Jamal Duff', 'PG', 'Bachelor football star Joe Kingman seems to have it all. He is wealthy and carefree, and his team is on the way to capturing a championship. Suddenly, he is tackled by some unexpected news: He has a young daughter, the result of a last fling with his ex-wife. Joe must learn to balance his personal and professional lives with the needs of his child.', 'Bachelor football star Joe Kingman seems to have it all. He is wealthy and carefree, and his team is on the way to capturing a championship. Suddenly, he is tackled by some unexpected news: He has a young daughter, the result of a last fling with his ex-wife. Joe must learn to balance his personal and professional lives with the needs of his child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcLFvIqCUrhY96mkSmr3okxaMEw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13680'),
  ('998659569163400399', 'The Gamechangers', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Owen Harris, Gustav Danielsson', 'James Wood', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Bill Paxton, Joe Dempsie, Ryan Gage, Alex McGregor, Nick Boraine, Garion Dowds, Lex King', null, 'The struggle of Houser''s legal feud against American lawyer Jack Thompson, over the morality of the "Grand Theft Auto" video game series.', 'The struggle of Houser''s legal feud against American lawyer Jack Thompson, over the morality of the "Grand Theft Auto" video game series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEDS8LF86ni40oUW3RChE5fyF0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356846'),
  ('933724676360332070', 'The Gamers', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Matt Vancil', 'Matt Vancil', 'Matt Shimkus, Nathan Rice, Phil M. Price, Justin MacGregor, Chris Duppenthaler, Matt Cameron, Emily Olson, Scot McIntosh', 'NR', 'Sent on a quest to rescue a princess, four clueless players must guide their players through dangerous forests, ancient ruins, and past the girl next door.', 'Sent on a quest to rescue a princess, four clueless players must guide their players through dangerous forests, ancient ruins, and past the girl next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQ1iSUsD9PntzSDlnaIJC4Q3qY7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25745'),
  ('1089573835176752767', 'The Gamers: Dorkness Rising', 2008, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Matt Vancil', null, 'Nathan Rice, Carol Roscoe, Brian S. Lewis, Scott C. Brown, Christian Doyle, Jennifer Page, Geoff Gibbs, Ed Gibbs', null, 'All Lodge wants is for his gaming group to finish their adventure. Unfortunately, they''re more interested in seducing barmaids, mooning their enemies, and setting random villagers on fire. Desperate to rein in his players, Lodge injects two newbies into the party: a non-player character controlled by Lodge, who the power gamers immediately distrust, and the rarest gamer of all... a girl. Can the group overcome their bickering to save the kingdom, or will the evil necromancer Mort Kemnon triumph unopposed? A fun parody of fantasy films and the adventure gaming community.', 'All Lodge wants is for his gaming group to finish their adventure. Unfortunately, they''re more interested in seducing barmaids, mooning their enemies, and setting random villagers on fire. Desperate to rein in his players, Lodge injects two newbies into the party: a non-player character controlled by Lodge, who the power gamers immediately distrust, and the rarest gamer of all... a girl. Can the group overcome their bickering to save the kingdom, or will the evil necromancer Mort Kemnon triumph unopposed? A fun parody of fantasy films and the adventure gaming community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qu4obP0b8D9UrTkqj3NHOdcSinq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26235'),
  ('213954008510033937', 'The Gamers: The Shadow Menace', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'L. Gabriel Gonda', 'Ben Dobyns, L. Gabriel Gonda, Larry Dixon', 'Justin MacGregor, Matt Shimkus, Phil M. Price, Nathan Rice, Anna Clausen Williams, Khanh Doan, Brandon J. Simmons, Maggie Ferguson-Wagstaffe', null, 'Fifteen years after stumbling into our world from the fantasy land of Fartherall, Newmoon, Nimble, Magellan, and Rogar have struggled to adapt to modern life. Guided by the mysterious Professor, a new group of gamers takes control of their destiny and leads them on a new quest to find a portal to return home and defeat their nemesis, The Shadow, once and for all.', 'Fifteen years after stumbling into our world from the fantasy land of Fartherall, Newmoon, Nimble, Magellan, and Rogar have struggled to adapt to modern life. Guided by the mysterious Professor, a new group of gamers takes control of their destiny and leads them on a new quest to find a portal to return home and defeat their nemesis, The Shadow, once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcRrF8DoprnKlSE6FPGuF3bBQSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495018'),
  ('267154767921103865', 'The Games Maker', 2014, 'Adventure, Family', 'Juan Pablo Buscarini, Roman Osin', 'Juan Pablo Buscarini', 'Ed Asner, David Mazouz, Joseph Fiennes, Tom Cavanagh, Valentina Lodovini, Megan Charpentier, Alejandro Awada, Vando Villamil', 'PG', 'Young Ivan Drago''s newfound love of board games catapults him into the fantastical and competitive world of game invention, and pits him against the inventor Morodian, who has long desired to destroy the city of Zyl, founded by Ivan''s grandfather. To save his family and defeat Morodian, Ivan must come to know what it is to be a true games maker.', 'Young Ivan Drago''s newfound love of board games catapults him into the fantastical and competitive world of game invention, and pits him against the inventor Morodian, who has long desired to destroy the city of Zyl, founded by Ivan''s grandfather. To save his family and defeat Morodian, Ivan must come to know what it is to be a true games maker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5X2IqHXicO3miUlenOdnGhZWnn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262788'),
  ('1001361812335716883', 'The Games of Angels', 1967, 'Animation', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Claude Copin, Gérard Cox', 'Walerian Borowczyk', null, null, 'Animated short. Abstract forms in a setting evocative of a concentration camp created by the universe. Based on a series of paintings by the Polish artists and filmmaker Walerian Borowczyk, Les Jeux des Anges takes the viewer into a nightmarish and sinister labyrinth world. With images reminiscent of Bosch and Ernst and an abstract soundtrack the film evoke unspeakable horrors lurking at the heart Borowczyk''s masterpiece. Borowczyk described the film himself as "A report on the city of angels."', 'Animated short. Abstract forms in a setting evocative of a concentration camp created by the universe. Based on a series of paintings by the Polish artists and filmmaker Walerian Borowczyk, Les Jeux des Anges takes the viewer into a nightmarish and sinister labyrinth world. With images reminiscent of Bosch and Ernst and an abstract soundtrack the film evoke unspeakable horrors lurking at the heart Borowczyk''s masterpiece. Borowczyk described the film himself as "A report on the city of angels."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rArDYpo0hBwID0J1e4p8g6Rn4fT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145623'),
  ('66557230557233016', 'The Gamma People', 1956, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Ted Moore, John Gilling, Robert Lynn', 'John W. Gossage, John Gilling', 'Paul Douglas, Eva Bartok, Leslie Phillips, Walter Rilla, Philip Leaver, Martin Miller, Jocelyn Lane, Rosalie Crutchley', 'NR', 'An American reporter smells a story when he is stranded in an Iron Curtain country where the local dictator is using gamma rays to transform children into mutated henchmen.', 'An American reporter smells a story when he is stranded in an Iron Curtain country where the local dictator is using gamma rays to transform children into mutated henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZE9qkRt4tpqvLaNqzzG0bvdnta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43309'),
  ('825120501939664836', 'The Gang', 1977, 'Crime', 'Jacques Deray, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Alphonse Boudard, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Alain Delon, Xavier Depraz, Roland Bertin, Adalberto Maria Merli, Maurice Barrier, Raymond Bussières, Giampiero Albertini, Laura Betti', null, 'In 1945, as World War Two comes to a close, five small time crooks unite to form a gang. After several bold robberies they become notorious as "the front-wheel drive gang". The police attempt to stop their crime spree with little success, but how long will their luck last?', 'In 1945, as World War Two comes to a close, five small time crooks unite to form a gang. After several bold robberies they become notorious as "the front-wheel drive gang". The police attempt to stop their crime spree with little success, but how long will their luck last?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eGQokhRN1TnopEi0iDwr4Lhfib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146886'),
  ('935420634604233192', 'The Gang of Oss', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'André van Duren, Piotr Kukla', 'Paul Jan Nelissen, André van Duren', 'Sylvia Hoeks, Marcel Musters, Matthias Schoenaerts, Pierre Bokma, Frank Lammers, Benja Bruijning, Maria Kraakman, Bert Geurkink', null, 'Johanna wants to change her life and quit the criminal gangs of the town of Oss in the 1930s. The harder she tries, the more she is involved.', 'Johanna wants to change her life and quit the criminal gangs of the town of Oss in the 1930s. The harder she tries, the more she is involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxgC4WBngyoJoZYDo56erRa6K3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72370'),
  ('891935352531571148', 'The Gang That Couldn''t Shoot Straight', 1971, 'Comedy, Crime', 'James Goldstone, William C. Gerrity, Owen Roizman', 'Waldo Salt', 'Jerry Orbach, Leigh Taylor-Young, Jo Van Fleet, Lionel Stander, Robert De Niro, Irving Selbst, Hervé Villechaize, Joe Santos', null, 'A Brooklyn mobster and his gang try to rub out their rivals.', 'A Brooklyn mobster and his gang try to rub out their rivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmecTGLXTRXDfFUFqlTuXn6p7GO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59226'),
  ('234331540991385288', 'The Gang That Sold America', 1979, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Bruno Corbucci, Roberto Tatti, Giovanni Ciarlo', 'Bruno Corbucci, Mario Amendola', 'Tomas Milian, Enzo Cannavale, Asha Puthli, Margherita Fumero, Gianni Musy, Leo Gavero, Andrea Aureli, Ombretta De Carlo', null, 'Now an agent of Interpol undercover, the former Inspector Giraldi, goes to New York to find his friend Salvatore Esposito, aspiring restaurateur in Little Italy, suffocated by debts with the usurers headed by Don Gerolamo. He will remove the gang and assure her of justice, but she will suffer the advances of the Boss''s daughter, the ugly Maria Sole.', 'Now an agent of Interpol undercover, the former Inspector Giraldi, goes to New York to find his friend Salvatore Esposito, aspiring restaurateur in Little Italy, suffocated by debts with the usurers headed by Don Gerolamo. He will remove the gang and assure her of justice, but she will suffer the advances of the Boss''s daughter, the ugly Maria Sole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmMnrnRIYMZJnOZYakUPsbWy6bV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52238'),
  ('471237315909356019', 'The Gang''s All Here', 1943, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Busby Berkeley, Edward Cronjager, Tom Dudley', 'Walter Bullock', 'Alice Faye, Carmen Miranda, Phil Baker, Benny Goodman, Eugene Pallette, Charlotte Greenwood, Edward Everett Horton, Tony De Marco', 'NR', 'A soldier falls for a chorus girl and then experiences trouble when he is posted to the Pacific.', 'A soldier falls for a chorus girl and then experiences trouble when he is posted to the Pacific.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8ayiYlqLkGAOYacaxX1hWm9ZX9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67967'),
  ('618184325813723994', 'The Gangster', 1947, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Gordon Wiles, Paul Ivano, Frank Heath', 'Daniel Fuchs', 'Barry Sullivan, Belita, Joan Lorring, Akim Tamiroff, Harry Morgan, John Ireland, Sheldon Leonard, Fifi D''Orsay', 'NR', 'Based on the novel Low Company. One of the most peculiar film noirs of the 1940s stars Barry Sullivan as a small-time hood who suffers a mental breakdown as his big plans begin to crumble. Beautiful Belita is his singer girlfriend who only fuels his paranoia.', 'Based on the novel Low Company. One of the most peculiar film noirs of the 1940s stars Barry Sullivan as a small-time hood who suffers a mental breakdown as his big plans begin to crumble. Beautiful Belita is his singer girlfriend who only fuels his paranoia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iD780H3mMhXFWkPMhBIgoreyKjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25735'),
  ('338369706594398112', 'The Gangster', 2012, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Sukanya Vongsthapat, Kongkiat Khomsiri', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri', 'Krissada Sukosol Clapp, Somchai Kemklad, Sakarin Suthamsamai, Krisada Supapprom, Wasu Saengsingkaeo, Nantharat Chaowarat, Pakchanok Wo-Onsri, Atthiwat Theeranithitnanth', null, 'Set in 1950s and ''60s Bangkok, this Thai crime drama tells the tale of Jod, a promising young gangster moving through the ranks of the city''s mafia.', 'Set in 1950s and ''60s Bangkok, this Thai crime drama tells the tale of Jod, a promising young gangster moving through the ranks of the city''s mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98F5TPQwVdZMvyNZNHVo6cBuPYX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116028'),
  ('1021388776507756048', 'The Garage', 1920, 'Comedy', 'Roscoe Arbuckle, Elgin Lessley', null, 'Roscoe Arbuckle, Buster Keaton, Molly Malone, Harry McCoy, Dan Crimmins, Monty Banks', 'NR', 'Roscoe and Buster operate a combination garage and fire station. In the first half they destroy a car left for them to clean. In the second half they go off on a false alarm and return to find their own building on fire.', 'Roscoe and Buster operate a combination garage and fire station. In the first half they destroy a car left for them to clean. In the second half they go off on a false alarm and return to find their own building on fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdyFKJ6OQL4HSoPmihctRZFmSD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51472'),
  ('231469074475397011', 'The Garage', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Vladimir Nakhabtsev, Igor Petrov', 'Emil Braginskiy, Eldar Ryazanov', 'Liya Akhedzhakova, Iya Savvina, Valentin Gaft, Svetlana Nemolyaeva, Georgi Burkov, Vyacheslav Nevinnyy, Andrey Myagkov, Leonid Markov', null, 'An automotive highway is scheduled to be built through the territory of a garage cooperative. A special meeting of the cooperative takes place to reduce the number of garages. As all was already decided and arranged by the chairholder and the board, the decision passes easily at the meeting. But one unexpected event happens - the meeting room''s entrance has been locked by an anonymous member and the key is missing...', 'An automotive highway is scheduled to be built through the territory of a garage cooperative. A special meeting of the cooperative takes place to reduce the number of garages. As all was already decided and arranged by the chairholder and the board, the decision passes easily at the meeting. But one unexpected event happens - the meeting room''s entrance has been locked by an anonymous member and the key is missing...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RnHUa3h5Dfe1fRXjdvsJFDaWSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56547'),
  ('1113432029062268190', 'The Garage', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Erkan Kolçak Köstendil, Cenk Altun, Utku Bildirgen', 'Bülent Şakrak', 'Nejat İşler, Rıza Kocaoğlu, Merve Dizdar, Bülent Şakrak, Ali Seçkiner Alıcı, Gökhan Kıraç, Engin Hepileri, Yaren Alaca', null, 'Two brothers Yılmaz and Müjdat, who have grown up in an orphanage, are inherited a car body repair shop from Nuri and İsmet who were like fathers to them. One night they take an old grumpy man''s car to couple of streets away. In the middle of the night, when they are hotwiring the car, the old man''s heart can''t take it. Thus, their short journey now leads them to somewhere unknown. One thing leads to another, now Yılmaz and Müjdat have to put the old man''s dead body into a thinner solvent tank. The duo keeps painting the cars in their shop but they realize that the thinner they take from the tank with the dead body is giving amazing results. That "a couple of streets away" now leads to something really odd.', 'Two brothers Yılmaz and Müjdat, who have grown up in an orphanage, are inherited a car body repair shop from Nuri and İsmet who were like fathers to them. One night they take an old grumpy man''s car to couple of streets away. In the middle of the night, when they are hotwiring the car, the old man''s heart can''t take it. Thus, their short journey now leads them to somewhere unknown. One thing leads to another, now Yılmaz and Müjdat have to put the old man''s dead body into a thinner solvent tank. The duo keeps painting the cars in their shop but they realize that the thinner they take from the tank with the dead body is giving amazing results. That "a couple of streets away" now leads to something really odd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vatBamQyEQ28k0ToIeqgwN5FksP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046571'),
  ('791960497245342435', 'The Garbage Pail Kids Movie', 1987, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Comedy, Family', 'Rod Amateau, Harvey Genkins', null, 'Anthony Newley, Mackenzie Astin, Katie Barberi, Phil Fondacaro, Ron MacLachlan, J.P. Amateau, Marjory Graue, Debbie Lee Carrington', 'PG', 'Crude, grotesque, pint-sized aliens known as the Garbage Pail Kids® help a young boy exact revenge on his bullies and win the girl of his dreams.', 'Crude, grotesque, pint-sized aliens known as the Garbage Pail Kids® help a young boy exact revenge on his bullies and win the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6PqKUptGhQjTTgqN2s2uPdNW0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14443'),
  ('899556106430484993', 'The Garden', 1968, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jan Švankmajer, Jaroslav Toms, Svatopluk Malý', 'Ivan Kraus, Jan Švankmajer', 'Jiří Hálek, Luděk Kopřiva, Míla Myslíková, Václav Borovička, František Husák', null, 'Frank visits his friend Josef, who introduces him to his pedigree rabbits and his wife Mary. Frank is more interested in the slightly unsettling fact that Josef and Mary''s garden fence is entirely made up of living people holding hands.', 'Frank visits his friend Josef, who introduces him to his pedigree rabbits and his wife Mary. Frank is more interested in the slightly unsettling fact that Josef and Mary''s garden fence is entirely made up of living people holding hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nN7nsSMnl0aG79MoSLGmwxAw51.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19009'),
  ('87371092223852282', 'The Garden', 1990, 'Drama', 'Derek Jarman, Derek Jarman, Ian Francis', 'Derek Jarman', 'Tilda Swinton, Johnny Mills, Philip MacDonald, Pete Lee-Wilson, Spencer Leigh, Jody Graber, Roger Cook, Kevin Collins', null, 'A nearly wordless visual narrative intercuts two main stories and a couple of minor ones. A woman, perhaps the Madonna, brings forth her baby to a crowd of intrusive paparazzi; she tries to flee them. Two men who are lovers marry and are arrested by the powers that be. The men are mocked and pilloried, tarred, feathered, and beaten. Loose in this contemporary world of electrical-power transmission lines is also Jesus. The elements, particularly fire and water, content with political power, which is intolerant and murderous.', 'A nearly wordless visual narrative intercuts two main stories and a couple of minor ones. A woman, perhaps the Madonna, brings forth her baby to a crowd of intrusive paparazzi; she tries to flee them. Two men who are lovers marry and are arrested by the powers that be. The men are mocked and pilloried, tarred, feathered, and beaten. Loose in this contemporary world of electrical-power transmission lines is also Jesus. The elements, particularly fire and water, content with political power, which is intolerant and murderous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDeEZAdPFwzTUEp8Ba9M8Naw2dG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110838'),
  ('429628094692959827', 'The Garden', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Martin Šulík, Peter Mojžiš, Martin Štrba', 'Miro Šindelka, Ondrej Šulaj, Martin Šulík', 'Roman Luknár, Marián Labuda, Zuzana Šulajová, Jana Švandová, Katarína Hrobárová-Vrzalová, Ján Melkovič, Stanislav Štepka, František Kovár', null, 'Jakub''s life arrived at a dead-end. He leaves his job, and gets into conflict with his father. The trouble just grows by his relation with a married woman. Breaking out, Jakub realizes the pleasures of the countryside in the old garden of his grandfather. He finds true love with an angel, and encounters various exciting moments of his new free life. Strange visitors arrive, and he wont get back to town anymore.', 'Jakub''s life arrived at a dead-end. He leaves his job, and gets into conflict with his father. The trouble just grows by his relation with a married woman. Breaking out, Jakub realizes the pleasures of the countryside in the old garden of his grandfather. He finds true love with an angel, and encounters various exciting moments of his new free life. Strange visitors arrive, and he wont get back to town anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9rrUaFUUePbPdem4ZnsyE7rbtF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19008'),
  ('316073099590664332', 'The Garden', 2017, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Julia Daschner, Sonja Kröner', 'Sonja Kröner', 'Laura Tonke, Mavie Hörbiger, Ursula Werner, Günther Maria Halmer, Christine Schorn, Thomas Loibl, Johannes Silberschneider, Inge Maux', null, 'In the summer of 1976, a shared family yard becomes the setting, as the adults bicker over selling the garden and the kids are free to explore the mysterious neighboring lot. Then they hear about a girl that has disappeared...', 'In the summer of 1976, a shared family yard becomes the setting, as the adults bicker over selling the garden and the kids are free to explore the mysterious neighboring lot. Then they hear about a girl that has disappeared...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tunEATQ4axjTc4nK1593YO0lgGc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434371'),
  ('1098271937620850092', 'The Garden Murder Case', 1936, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Edwin L. Marin, Lesley Selander, Charles G. Clarke', 'Bertram Millhauser', 'Edmund Lowe, Virginia Bruce, Benita Hume, Douglas Walton, Nat Pendleton, Gene Lockhart, H.B. Warner, Kent Smith', 'NR', 'Two people with ties to rich murdered socialite Lowe Hammle die from unusual suicides—but Vance suspects foul play.', 'Two people with ties to rich murdered socialite Lowe Hammle die from unusual suicides—but Vance suspects foul play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCmBYsR3p7DeiWut8diRa3eU4WC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127815'),
  ('66569048148097685', 'The Garden of Afflictions', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Matheus Cartaxo, Josias Teófilo, Daniel Aragão', 'Josias Teófilo', 'Olavo de Carvalho', null, 'Brazilian philosopher Olavo de Carvalho''s thinking, presented through his presence, his daily work routine and his family life in Virginia (USA).', 'Brazilian philosopher Olavo de Carvalho''s thinking, presented through his presence, his daily work routine and his family life in Virginia (USA).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkTcgLo2LYARlaSdRqLbE5h8t3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423303'),
  ('386485426865745994', 'The Garden of Allah', 1936, 'Drama, Romance, Adventure', 'Richard Boleslawski, Eric Stacey', 'W.P. Lipscomb, Lynn Riggs', 'Marlene Dietrich, Charles Boyer, Basil Rathbone, C. Aubrey Smith, Joseph Schildkraut, John Carradine, Alan Marshal, Lucile Watson', 'NR', 'The star-crossed desert romance of a cloistered woman and a renegade monk.', 'The star-crossed desert romance of a cloistered woman and a renegade monk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilEUSPjSJC50sgsJgQkDesW7iok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151848'),
  ('1122340754450109476', 'The Garden of Delights', 1970, 'Drama', 'Carlos Saura, Luis Cuadrado', 'Carlos Saura, Rafael Azcona', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Luchy Soto, Lina Canalejas, Alberto Alonso, Charo Soriano, Esperanza Roy, Mayrata O''Wisiedo, Francisco Pierrá', null, 'The greedy relatives of a paralysed 45-year-old amnesiac millionaire go to extreme lengths to help him recover his memory.', 'The greedy relatives of a paralysed 45-year-old amnesiac millionaire go to extreme lengths to help him recover his memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCz6mzFgae7KnkacCRiY2HPVjci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114336'),
  ('698056021129631272', 'The Garden of Earthly Delights', 1981, 'Animation', 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'A collage of two-dimensional images of vegetation, each appearing only for a moment, sometimes as a single image, more often with other bits of stem, leaf, bud, or petal. Often we see only the outline of objects against a black background. Black and green are occasionally joined by fragments of orange or of white and blue. The objects in the frame don''t move but they are quickly replaced by another collage, giving the feel of rapid motion. Each collage is crisp, its lines etched against the background of black and later of white. Whitman anyone, or Hieronymus Bosch? Although there is no soundtrack, the rapidity of changing images and colors suggests a riot.', 'A collage of two-dimensional images of vegetation, each appearing only for a moment, sometimes as a single image, more often with other bits of stem, leaf, bud, or petal. Often we see only the outline of objects against a black background. Black and green are occasionally joined by fragments of orange or of white and blue. The objects in the frame don''t move but they are quickly replaced by another collage, giving the feel of rapid motion. Each collage is crisp, its lines etched against the background of black and later of white. Whitman anyone, or Hieronymus Bosch? Although there is no soundtrack, the rapidity of changing images and colors suggests a riot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vU4j5Wx14qrdPVPGbT4Noz2Wzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126189'),
  ('787101755798373809', 'The Garden of Sinners: Epilogue', 2010, 'Mystery, Animation, Fantasy', 'Hikaru Kondô, Yuichi Terao, Seiji Matsuda', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura', null, 'March 1999: Mikiya Kokutou meets Shiki Ryougi again at the same place where he met her for the first time four years ago...', 'March 1999: Mikiya Kokutou meets Shiki Ryougi again at the same place where he met her for the first time four years ago...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30nQDfkjf3afbYehVIQuKDS1LT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47747'),
  ('751140667924347358', 'The Garden of Sinners: Future Gospel', 2013, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Tomonori Sudo, Kojiro Shishido, Shunya Kikuchi', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Takako Honda, Yuka Iguchi, Akira Ishida, Hisako Kanemoto, Ayumi Fujimura, Hiroki Touchi', null, 'A side story of the original Kara no Kyōkai - the Garden of sinners movie series divided into 2 parts. In the first part, Shizune Seo, who finds her life too predictable due to her precognition, and Mitsuru‎ Kamekura, who uses his precognition to be a professional bomber, meet Mikiya and Shiki, respectively, and their futures begin to change. In the second part, 10 years after the original series, Shiki and Mikiya''s daughter, Mana Ryōgi, spends a day with Mitsuru.', 'A side story of the original Kara no Kyōkai - the Garden of sinners movie series divided into 2 parts. In the first part, Shizune Seo, who finds her life too predictable due to her precognition, and Mitsuru‎ Kamekura, who uses his precognition to be a professional bomber, meet Mikiya and Shiki, respectively, and their futures begin to change. In the second part, 10 years after the original series, Shiki and Mikiya''s daughter, Mana Ryōgi, spends a day with Mitsuru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8J826SPcv1YHPMSgx4JjjVlT9X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212156'),
  ('393541670222171056', 'The Garden of Sinners: Future Gospel - Extra Chorus', 2013, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Drama', 'Tomonori Sudo, Shizuka Fujisaki, Yuichi Terao', 'Ei Aoki', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Takako Honda, Risa Taneda, Mamiko Noto, Yuka Iguchi, Ayumi Fujimura', null, 'Mikiya Kokutou gives Shiki Ryougi a cat to watch, as he will be away for a little while. Though Shiki protests, he leaves the cat anyway, and Shiki is stuck trying to understand her new feline companion. But as luck would have it, the cat seems to have taken a liking to Mikiya and misses him. Later in another part of the city, Ririsu Miyazuki visits the place where her dear friend committed suicide. She intends to end her life as well, but she meets Fujino Asagami, a blind classmate with a traumatic past. Though the two girls don''t have much in common, Asagami reminds Miyazuki of her lost friend and helps her understand her pain. Two months later, Mikiya elects to celebrate New Year''s with Shiki instead of his family, which makes his sister Azaka very upset, leading to her spending the holiday with her school friends. As the snow begins to fall, Mikiya reflects on what he wishes for most of all: that Shiki''s life be filled with happiness.', 'Mikiya Kokutou gives Shiki Ryougi a cat to watch, as he will be away for a little while. Though Shiki protests, he leaves the cat anyway, and Shiki is stuck trying to understand her new feline companion. But as luck would have it, the cat seems to have taken a liking to Mikiya and misses him. Later in another part of the city, Ririsu Miyazuki visits the place where her dear friend committed suicide. She intends to end her life as well, but she meets Fujino Asagami, a blind classmate with a traumatic past. Though the two girls don''t have much in common, Asagami reminds Miyazuki of her lost friend and helps her understand her pain. Two months later, Mikiya elects to celebrate New Year''s with Shiki instead of his family, which makes his sister Azaka very upset, leading to her spending the holiday with her school friends. As the snow begins to fall, Mikiya reflects on what he wishes for most of all: that Shiki''s life be filled with happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2plsuUbqVPOwdA1We9kbBTtltl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253987'),
  ('865507728188024402', 'The Garden of Sinners: Murder Speculation Part A', 2007, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Romance, Mystery', 'Tomonori Sudo, Takuro Takahashi, Takuya Nonaka', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Jouji Nakata, Takako Honda, Hiroki Touchi, Makoto Yasumura, Soichiro Hoshi, Kenji Takahashi', null, 'August 1995: Mikiya first meets Shiki in a white kimono during a snowing day. Later on, at the high school freshmen ceremony, Mikiya sees Shiki in the crowd and chases after her, introducing himself to her. But Shiki hides a big secret: A wave of bizarre murders occur around many loose ends, and no suspects. there are still many questions: Who to believe? Who is the murderer? What is the secret of Shiki? and especially: Who is SHIKI?', 'August 1995: Mikiya first meets Shiki in a white kimono during a snowing day. Later on, at the high school freshmen ceremony, Mikiya sees Shiki in the crowd and chases after her, introducing himself to her. But Shiki hides a big secret: A wave of bizarre murders occur around many loose ends, and no suspects. there are still many questions: Who to believe? Who is the murderer? What is the secret of Shiki? and especially: Who is SHIKI?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxNZpMkis5XnD81Y3gqJhh9ZOmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23151'),
  ('1049583911936076869', 'The Garden of Sinners: Murder Speculation Part B', 2009, 'Animation, Fantasy, Mystery, Romance, Action, Crime', 'Takuro Takahashi, Hikaru Kondô, Mitsuru Obunai', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Jouji Nakata, Ryotaro Okiayu, Takako Honda, Ayumi Fujimura, Hiroki Touchi, Soichiro Hoshi', null, 'In February 1999, a string of murders has Shiki Ryougi and Mikiya Kokutou on edge. These crimes share a disturbing resemblance to a similar set of homicides from 1995, when Shiki and Mikiya first met, and awaken a dark, murderous desire that has laid dormant within Shiki''s soul ever since then.', 'In February 1999, a string of murders has Shiki Ryougi and Mikiya Kokutou on edge. These crimes share a disturbing resemblance to a similar set of homicides from 1995, when Shiki and Mikiya first met, and awaken a dark, murderous desire that has laid dormant within Shiki''s soul ever since then.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiOc87AV2sDlZomxKQtJrvHETiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23167'),
  ('82144882522613971', 'The Garden of Sinners: Oblivion Recording', 2008, 'Animation, Fantasy, Mystery, Romance', 'Shintaro Nakamura, Atsushi Ogasawara, Tomonori Sudo', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Jouji Nakata, Soichiro Hoshi, Takako Honda, Ayumi Fujimura, Nana Mizuki, Ryotaro Okiayu', null, 'January 1999: Apprentice mage Azaka Kokutou, Mikiya''s younger sister, has been ordered by her mentor, Touko Aozaki, to investigate a certain incident in which fairies steal the memories of students at Azaka''s school, Reien Academy. Azaka launches an investigation with the help of Shiki.', 'January 1999: Apprentice mage Azaka Kokutou, Mikiya''s younger sister, has been ordered by her mentor, Touko Aozaki, to investigate a certain incident in which fairies steal the memories of students at Azaka''s school, Reien Academy. Azaka launches an investigation with the help of Shiki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbjuKoI5pNLpFAhtGSne9mgpW5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23166'),
  ('581202028725925897', 'The Garden of Sinners: Overlooking View', 2007, 'Animation, Crime, Action, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Ei Aoki, Yuichi Terao, Shintaro Nakamura', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Rie Tanaka, Takako Honda, Ayumi Fujimura, Shuzo Nakamura, Eri Nakao', null, 'The story starts following an incident: a young girl jumps from the top of a building. The image provokes a certain dread, as the girl appears to have been a corpse even before she jumped. The case is dismissed, yet more and more of these suicides occur, and all from the same building. Thus began the rumour, that a ghost inhabited the rooftop of the building.', 'The story starts following an incident: a young girl jumps from the top of a building. The image provokes a certain dread, as the girl appears to have been a corpse even before she jumped. The case is dismissed, yet more and more of these suicides occur, and all from the same building. Thus began the rumour, that a ghost inhabited the rooftop of the building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMmHdhAM1xCQTQ4O3XhXLuXQ0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23150'),
  ('987559909348125225', 'The Garden of Sinners: Paradox Spiral', 2008, 'Action, Animation, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Mitsuru Obunai, Kei Tsunematsu, Takuro Takahashi', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Jouji Nakata, Tetsuya Kakihara, Koji Yusa, Takako Honda, Ayumi Fujimura, Hiroki Touchi', null, 'Tomoe Enjou is attacked by bullies from his old school and saved by Shiki Ryougi. He asks her to hide him at her place and admits that he killed someone. Several days later, there are still no broadcasts about the murder as if it didn''t happen... and when the victims are found, they''re alive and unharmed.', 'Tomoe Enjou is attacked by bullies from his old school and saved by Shiki Ryougi. He asks her to hide him at her place and admits that he killed someone. Several days later, there are still no broadcasts about the murder as if it didn''t happen... and when the victims are found, they''re alive and unharmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vScnbrMbDpuwbiRafOcuxHjDKsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23155'),
  ('843268043860203902', 'The Garden of Sinners: Remaining Sense of Pain', 2008, 'Crime, Animation, Action, Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Mitsuru Obunai, Tomonori Sudo, Ei Aoki', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Mamiko Noto, Takako Honda, Ayumi Fujimura, Kenji Takahashi, Shintaro Asanuma, Hiroki Yasumoto', null, 'July 1998 - After a group of delinquents is found dead in their hangout place with all their limbs twisted and torn off, Aozaki Touko receives a request to find the murderer and asks Shiki for help. The main suspect is Asagami Fujino; a girl who was the boys'' plaything until recently, who Shiki believes to be "one of her kind".', 'July 1998 - After a group of delinquents is found dead in their hangout place with all their limbs twisted and torn off, Aozaki Touko receives a request to find the murderer and asks Shiki for help. The main suspect is Asagami Fujino; a girl who was the boys'' plaything until recently, who Shiki believes to be "one of her kind".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TeeCstvdqb6E72dMPEb43rCD0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23153'),
  ('613461416314890778', 'The Garden of Sinners: Remix -Gate of seventh heaven-', 2009, 'Action, Mystery, Romance, Thriller, Animation', 'Ei Aoki, Takuya Nonaka, Mitsuru Obunai', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Jouji Nakata, Takako Honda, Ayumi Fujimura, Mamiko Noto, Rie Tanaka, Tetsuya Kakihara', null, 'Before the release of the final 7th movie, a remix work "Kara no Kyoukai Remix-Gate of seventh heaven-" comes out in theaters on March 14, 2009. This remix collection extracts the key themes and scenes from first six movies. The hour long movie is organized in chronological order, beginning from the 2nd movie, followed by the 4th, 3rd, 1st, 5th and 6th. It''s a mixture of mostly existing scenes, and some new scenes.', 'Before the release of the final 7th movie, a remix work "Kara no Kyoukai Remix-Gate of seventh heaven-" comes out in theaters on March 14, 2009. This remix collection extracts the key themes and scenes from first six movies. The hour long movie is organized in chronological order, beginning from the 2nd movie, followed by the 4th, 3rd, 1st, 5th and 6th. It''s a mixture of mostly existing scenes, and some new scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gb27lFMJ8MEIZeHJLmvB0x1cezn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61666'),
  ('318653050433450126', 'The Garden of Sinners: The Hollow Shrine', 2008, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Mystery', 'Teiichi Takiguchi, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Tomonori Sudo', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichi Suzumura, Jouji Nakata, Mamiko Noto, Soichiro Hoshi, Takako Honda, Rie Tanaka, Yuichi Ishigami', null, 'June 1998: After spending two years in a coma caused by a traffic accident, Shiki Ryougi awakens with amnesia. She is visited by Touko Aozaki, a wizard and proprietor of a studio called Garan no Dou. Shiki has lost not only the memory of her accident, but also any real sense that she''s even alive. Strangely, enigmatic beings begin to attack her...', 'June 1998: After spending two years in a coma caused by a traffic accident, Shiki Ryougi awakens with amnesia. She is visited by Touko Aozaki, a wizard and proprietor of a studio called Garan no Dou. Shiki has lost not only the memory of her accident, but also any real sense that she''s even alive. Strangely, enigmatic beings begin to attack her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jycWY9V9Chf8XlAwrjBSVWONTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23154'),
  ('533806015436271685', 'The Garden of the Finzi-Continis', 1970, 'Drama, History', 'Ennio Guarnieri, Vittorio De Sica, Luisa Alessandri', 'Ugo Pirro, Vittorio Bonicelli', 'Lino Capolicchio, Dominique Sanda, Fabio Testi, Romolo Valli, Helmut Berger, Camillo Cesarei, Inna Alexeievna, Katina Morisani', 'R', 'In 1930s Italy, a wealthy Jewish family tries to maintain their privileged lifestyle, hosting friends for tennis and parties at their villa. As anti-Semitism intensifies under Fascism, they must ultimately face the horrors of the Holocaust.', 'In 1930s Italy, a wealthy Jewish family tries to maintain their privileged lifestyle, hosting friends for tennis and parties at their villa. As anti-Semitism intensifies under Fascism, they must ultimately face the horrors of the Holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHDATOZMoiJjfy2bb1xEFFPzkuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4789'),
  ('1098921721448824295', 'The Garden of Torment', 1976, 'Drama', 'Christian Gion, Lionel Legros', 'Pascal Lainé', 'Roger Van Hool, Jacqueline Kerry, Tony Taffin, Ysabelle Lacamp, Robert Bazil, Raymond Jourdan, Arlette Balkis, Stéphane Fey', null, 'The story of a Antoine, a physician who was exiled to China in the 1930''s due to his drug habit.', 'The story of a Antoine, a physician who was exiled to China in the 1930''s due to his drug habit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0vrv9ulTK5dOgflnlSlZzIBbNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402158'),
  ('369576076526173455', 'The Garden of Words', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Makoto Shinkai, Kenichi Tsuchiya, Makoto Ooga', 'Makoto Shinkai', 'Miyu Irino, Kana Hanazawa, Fumi Hirano, Takeshi Maeda, Yuka Terasaki, Takanori Hoshino, Suguru Inoue, Megumi Han', 'PG-13', 'Takao, who is training to become a shoemaker, skipped school and is sketching shoes in a Japanese-style garden. He meets a mysterious woman, Yukino, who is older than him. Then, without arranging the times, the two start to see each other again and again, but only on rainy days. They deepen their relationship and open up to each other. But the end of the rainy season soon approaches.', 'Takao, who is training to become a shoemaker, skipped school and is sketching shoes in a Japanese-style garden. He meets a mysterious woman, Yukino, who is older than him. Then, without arranging the times, the two start to see each other again and again, but only on rainy days. They deepen their relationship and open up to each other. But the end of the rainy season soon approaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXUCVq3HMtS4Y9IQ8vmEOPyN0vH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198375'),
  ('672142886614427781', 'The Garden That Tilts', 1975, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Guy Gilles, Jean-François Robin', 'Guy Gilles', 'Delphine Seyrig, Anouk Ferjac, Patrick Jouané, Sami Frey, Caroline Cartier, Philippe Chemin, Guy Bedos, Jeanne Moreau', null, 'Karl, a young killer is to kill Kate, an adventurous lady living in a mansion by a lake. He approaches her but fails to kill her. Instead, he falls in love and becomes her lover ...', 'Karl, a young killer is to kill Kate, an adventurous lady living in a mansion by a lake. He approaches her but fails to kill her. Instead, he falls in love and becomes her lover ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oi0qLf1NEVBoYgyKP2WXgJZmerH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134205'),
  ('47755946874182547', 'The Gardener', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Becca Hirani, Scott Chambers, Ben Collin', 'Ben Demaree', 'Robert Bronzi, Gary Daniels, Nicola Wright, Jake Watkins, Jon Callaway, Sarah T. Cohen, Arthur Boan, Kate Sandison', 'R', 'A troubled wealthy family gathers in a quaint manor home for the holidays, never suspecting that bloodthirsty, sadistic Volker and his crew linger at the gates, ready to attack, rob, and maim them at nightfall. But they didn’t count on the estate’s quiet gardener, Peter Juhasz , who must return to the savage ways he learned as a soldier to save the family.', 'A troubled wealthy family gathers in a quaint manor home for the holidays, never suspecting that bloodthirsty, sadistic Volker and his crew linger at the gates, ready to attack, rob, and maim them at nightfall. But they didn’t count on the estate’s quiet gardener, Peter Juhasz , who must return to the savage ways he learned as a soldier to save the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixbCnipX726c6rzv1T6reZDXgJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:894432'),
  ('353065819155863533', 'The Gardener', 2025, 'Action, Comedy', 'David Charhon, Roger Torremorell, Thierry Arbogast', 'David Charhon, Sebastien Fechner, Vincent de Brus', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Michaël Youn, Nawell Madani, Carla Poquin, Jérôme Le Banner, Ragnar Le Breton, Kaaris, Danielle Renault', null, 'Every year the Prime Minister has a list of all kinds of troublemakers eliminated in the name of the famous Reason of State. Serge Shuster, Special Adviser to the President of the Republic, finds himself on this list, better known as the Matignon List. Condemned to certain death and at the heart of an implacable plot and a state secret that also put his family in danger, Serge, his wife and children have only one hope left - their gardener, Léo, who hates it when « slugs » invade his garden... Especially those that want to kill innocent families.', 'Every year the Prime Minister has a list of all kinds of troublemakers eliminated in the name of the famous Reason of State. Serge Shuster, Special Adviser to the President of the Republic, finds himself on this list, better known as the Matignon List. Condemned to certain death and at the heart of an implacable plot and a state secret that also put his family in danger, Serge, his wife and children have only one hope left - their gardener, Léo, who hates it when « slugs » invade his garden... Especially those that want to kill innocent families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5T9WR7vIOnHm6xhVt5zBuPbBgt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255788'),
  ('422406773507717166', 'The Gardener of Argenteuil', 1966, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Walter Wottitz, Jean-Paul Le Chanois, Louis Pascal', 'François Boyer, Jean-Paul Le Chanois, Alphonse Boudard', 'Jean Gabin, Liselotte Pulver, Pierre Vernier, Mary Marquet, Jean Tissier, Curd Jürgens, Noël Roquevert, Alfred Adam', null, 'Tulipe, is an old man who lives alone in an old railway carriage in the Argentueil region of Paris. His main passions are gardening and oil painting, but he also has a secret source of income. His godson discovers that Tulipe is actually a master forger, producing perfect copies of 10 franc notes. His godson’s girlfriend sees this as an opportunity to get very rich – but she must persuade Tulipe to forge 500 franc notes. Assuming Tulipe’s agreement, his godson and his girlfriend buy an expensive new car and luxury villa in provincial France – but there is a cruel turn of fate in store for them when Tulipe strikes up a friendship with a millionaire playboy.', 'Tulipe, is an old man who lives alone in an old railway carriage in the Argentueil region of Paris. His main passions are gardening and oil painting, but he also has a secret source of income. His godson discovers that Tulipe is actually a master forger, producing perfect copies of 10 franc notes. His godson’s girlfriend sees this as an opportunity to get very rich – but she must persuade Tulipe to forge 500 franc notes. Assuming Tulipe’s agreement, his godson and his girlfriend buy an expensive new car and luxury villa in provincial France – but there is a cruel turn of fate in store for them when Tulipe strikes up a friendship with a millionaire playboy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igp7zhP8gPsFxexpW9iRHmQ3Emu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4733'),
  ('293552158982072162', 'The Garfield Movie', 2024, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Jason Boose, Mark Dindal', 'Mark Torgove, Paul A. Kaplan, David Reynolds', 'Chris Pratt, Samuel L. Jackson, Hannah Waddingham, Ving Rhames, Nicholas Hoult, Cecily Strong, Harvey Guillén, Brett Goldstein', 'PG', 'Garfield, the world-famous, Monday-hating, lasagna-loving indoor cat, is about to have a wild outdoor adventure! After an unexpected reunion with his long-lost father – scruffy street cat Vic – Garfield and his canine friend Odie are forced from their perfectly pampered life into joining Vic in a hilarious, high-stakes heist.', 'Garfield, the world-famous, Monday-hating, lasagna-loving indoor cat, is about to have a wild outdoor adventure! After an unexpected reunion with his long-lost father – scruffy street cat Vic – Garfield and his canine friend Odie are forced from their perfectly pampered life into joining Vic in a hilarious, high-stakes heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYduFGuch9OwbCOEUiamml18ZoB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748783'),
  ('744407589094800892', 'The Garment Jungle', 1957, 'Drama, Crime', 'Vincent Sherman, Irving J. Moore, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Harry Kleiner', 'Lee J. Cobb, Kerwin Mathews, Gia Scala, Richard Boone, Valerie French, Robert Loggia, Joseph Wiseman, Harold J. Stone', 'NR', 'Alan Mitchell returns to New York to work for his father Walter, the owner of a fashion house that designs and manufactures dresses. To stay non-union, Walter has hired Artie Ravidge, a hood who uses strong-arm tactics to keep the employees in line.', 'Alan Mitchell returns to New York to work for his father Walter, the owner of a fashion house that designs and manufactures dresses. To stay non-union, Walter has hired Artie Ravidge, a hood who uses strong-arm tactics to keep the employees in line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b36jLE9uSKOkNwzh5oWZpsfxVdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24468'),
  ('34553289642293908', 'The Gasoline Thieves', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Edgar Nito, Juan Pablo Ramírez', 'Alfredo Mendoza, Edgar Nito', 'Eduardo Banda, Regina Reynoso, Fernando Becerril, Leonardo Alonso, Pedro Joaquín, Pascacio López, Myriam Bravo', null, 'Lalo is a fourteen year old teenager who, from an naive approach, gets involved in the underground world of the gas theft mafia while he''s trying to make money to buy a gift for Ana and win her heart.', 'Lalo is a fourteen year old teenager who, from an naive approach, gets involved in the underground world of the gas theft mafia while he''s trying to make money to buy a gift for Ana and win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLWpZzyLSvnOM09f4JXiOFFzwjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586069'),
  ('481141832665051959', 'The Gate', 1987, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Thomas Vámos, Tibor Takács, Barry Birnberg', 'Michael Nankin', 'Stephen Dorff, Christa Denton, Louis Tripp, Kelly Rowan, Jennifer Irwin, Deborah Grover, Ingrid Veninger, Linda Goranson', 'PG-13', 'Three young children accidentally release a horde of nasty, pint-sized demons from a hole in a suburban backyard. What follows is a classic battle between good and evil as the three kids struggle to overcome a nightmarish hell that is literally taking over the Earth.', 'Three young children accidentally release a horde of nasty, pint-sized demons from a hole in a suburban backyard. What follows is a classic battle between good and evil as the three kids struggle to overcome a nightmarish hell that is literally taking over the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik7AfGWpwKnjaQeth3LZqrqzvfB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6917'),
  ('515491117045959864', 'The Gate', 2014, 'Drama', 'Régis Wargnier, Renaud Chassaing', 'Antoine Audouard, Régis Wargnier', 'Raphaël Personnaz, Phoeung Kompheak, Olivier Gourmet, Thanet Thorn, Boren Chhith, Rathana Soth', null, 'Two decades after forging an unlikely alliance in Pol Pot''s Cambodia, a French ethnologist and a former Khmer Rouge official meet again after the latter is arrested for crimes against humanity.', 'Two decades after forging an unlikely alliance in Pol Pot''s Cambodia, a French ethnologist and a former Khmer Rouge official meet again after the latter is arrested for crimes against humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3KzqnJsLb1iajpkHYU2cV40zTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284280'),
  ('183163289006343122', 'The Gate of Heavenly Peace', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Richard Gordon, Carma Hinton', 'Geramie Barmé, John Crowley', null, null, 'The Gate of Heavenly Peace is a feature-length documentary about the 1989 protest movement, reflecting the drama, tension, humor, absurdity, heroism, and many tragedies of the six weeks from April to June in 1989. The film reveals how the hard-liners within the government marginalized moderates among the protesters (including students, workers and intellectuals), while the actions of radical protesters undermined moderates in the government. Moderate voices were gradually cowed and then silenced by extremism and emotionalism on both sides.', 'The Gate of Heavenly Peace is a feature-length documentary about the 1989 protest movement, reflecting the drama, tension, humor, absurdity, heroism, and many tragedies of the six weeks from April to June in 1989. The film reveals how the hard-liners within the government marginalized moderates among the protesters (including students, workers and intellectuals), while the actions of radical protesters undermined moderates in the government. Moderate voices were gradually cowed and then silenced by extremism and emotionalism on both sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a097YNBiTFR9eryZPylZ2INwExz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52059'),
  ('287691867495314227', 'The Gatekeepers', 2012, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Dror Moreh, Avner Shahaf', 'Oron Adar', 'Ami Ayalon, Avraham Shalom, Yaakov Peri, Carmi Gillon, Avi Dichter, Yuval Diskin', 'PG-13', 'In an unprecedented and candid series of interviews, six former heads of the Shin Bet — Israel''s intelligence and security agency — speak about their role in Israel''s decades-long counterterrorism campaign, discussing their controversial methods and whether the ends ultimately justify the means.', 'In an unprecedented and candid series of interviews, six former heads of the Shin Bet — Israel''s intelligence and security agency — speak about their role in Israel''s decades-long counterterrorism campaign, discussing their controversial methods and whether the ends ultimately justify the means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7B7Ko7ZEXKcBLkO8HiGFAxAKjA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127918'),
  ('37180296901459625', 'The Gates', 2026, 'Thriller', 'John Burr, Ray Huang', 'John Burr', 'Mason Gooding, Algee Smith, Keith Powers, James Van Der Beek, Brad Leland', 'R', 'Three friends'' road trip turns terrifying when they witness a murder in a gated community. Trapped inside, hunted by residents who blame them, their bond fractures as a charismatic yet sinister patriarch closes in.', 'Three friends'' road trip turns terrifying when they witness a murder in a gated community. Trapped inside, hunted by residents who blame them, their bond fractures as a charismatic yet sinister patriarch closes in.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Ff%2Fgracenote%2Ff4536c0937f561134ed107b8a22b6c3a.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-gates-2026'),
  ('332347906028032687', 'The Gates of Paris', 1957, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'René Clair, Robert Lefebvre', 'René Clair, Jean Aurel', 'Pierre Brasseur, Georges Brassens, Henri Vidal, Dany Carrel, Raymond Bussières, Gabrielle Fontan, Philippe de Chérisey, Annette Poivre', null, 'Juju, a drunken oaf who feels the need of being important to someone---anyone---and his friend The Artist are forced at gunpoint to house a fugitive, Pierre Barbier, in Juju''s broken-down home. The urge for being needed is such in Juju that he gives up drinking and takes care of Pierre. But one day Juju finds out that Pierre has been making love to his girl Maria...', 'Juju, a drunken oaf who feels the need of being important to someone---anyone---and his friend The Artist are forced at gunpoint to house a fugitive, Pierre Barbier, in Juju''s broken-down home. The urge for being needed is such in Juju that he gives up drinking and takes care of Pierre. But one day Juju finds out that Pierre has been making love to his girl Maria...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8Uuoqv2CGCZf2BG9Li1VqQX9WI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67555'),
  ('689818112531503614', 'The Gateway', 2018, 'Science Fiction', 'David Le May, John V. Soto', 'John V. Soto, Michael White', 'Jacqueline McKenzie, Myles Pollard, Hayley McElhinney, Troy Coward, Ben Mortley, Shannon Berry, Ryan Panizza', 'NR', 'A particle physicist grieving over the loss of her husband in a car crash uses a revolutionary machine to bring him back, with dire consequences for her family.', 'A particle physicist grieving over the loss of her husband in a car crash uses a revolutionary machine to bring him back, with dire consequences for her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Gp2lj5jnP08Sie6j0gNL3zfiSE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472744'),
  ('648497438791557211', 'The Gateway', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michele Civetta', 'Alex Felix Bendaña, Andrew Levitas, Michele Civetta', 'Shea Whigham, Olivia Munn, Taryn Manning, Frank Grillo, Bruce Dern, Keith David, Mark Boone Junior, Zach Avery', 'R', 'A social worker assigned to the care of the daughter of a single mother intervenes when the dad returns from prison and lures them into a life of crime.', 'A social worker assigned to the care of the daughter of a single mother intervenes when the dad returns from prison and lures them into a life of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUilTInQpzoK7iCkPjysamiVmjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713711'),
  ('960507885449418828', 'The Gathering', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brian Gilbert, Martin Fuhrer, Guy Bradley', 'Anthony Horowitz', 'Christina Ricci, Ioan Gruffudd, Stephen Dillane, Kerry Fox, Robert Hardy, Simon Russell Beale, Harry Forrester, Jessica Mann', null, 'Itinerant traveler Cassie Grant comes out of a car accident in Glastonbury, England, with partial memory loss. The deeply regretful driver allows her to convalesce at a large rural home, where she becomes friends with the woman''s stepson, Michael. As Cassie delves into Michael''s research about an old, newly discovered area church, it triggers some strange premonitions and offers gradual clues about her deeper links to this British community.', 'Itinerant traveler Cassie Grant comes out of a car accident in Glastonbury, England, with partial memory loss. The deeply regretful driver allows her to convalesce at a large rural home, where she becomes friends with the woman''s stepson, Michael. As Cassie delves into Michael''s research about an old, newly discovered area church, it triggers some strange premonitions and offers gradual clues about her deeper links to this British community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIlPzicLM5NQgUriVgPZrAofmsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10943'),
  ('556155159848029315', 'The Gathering Storm', 2002, 'Drama, History', 'Richard Loncraine, Peter Hannan, James Foster', 'Hugh Whitemore, Larry Ramin', 'Albert Finney, Vanessa Redgrave, Jim Broadbent, Linus Roache, Lena Headey, Tom Wilkinson, Derek Jacobi, Celia Imrie', null, 'A love story offering an intimate look inside the marriage of Winston and Clementine Churchill during a particularly troubled, though little-known, moment in their lives.', 'A love story offering an intimate look inside the marriage of Winston and Clementine Churchill during a particularly troubled, though little-known, moment in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NfDZwBPNxceuynFKXU2VkSsH6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36464'),
  ('959049020599586870', 'The Gauntlet', 1977, 'Drama, Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Clint Eastwood, Rexford L. Metz, Richard Hashimoto', 'Michael Butler, Dennis Shryack', 'Clint Eastwood, Sondra Locke, Pat Hingle, William Prince, Bill McKinney, Michael Cavanaugh, Carole Cook, Mara Corday', 'R', 'Phoenix cop Ben Shockley is well on his way to becoming a derelict when he is assigned to transport a witness from Las Vegas. The witness turns out to be a belligerent prostitute with mob ties—and incriminating information regarding a high-ranking official.', 'Phoenix cop Ben Shockley is well on his way to becoming a derelict when he is assigned to transport a witness from Las Vegas. The witness turns out to be a belligerent prostitute with mob ties—and incriminating information regarding a high-ranking official.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYXkHixmH2W4hXA0qVJpT4ONPt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17689'),
  ('1077254701559418553', 'The Gay Deceivers', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Bruce Kessler, Richard C. Glouner, Pearl Kempton', 'Jerome Wish', 'Kevin Coughlin, Lawrence P. Casey, Brooke Bundy, Jo Ann Harris, Michael Greer, Sebastian Brook, Jack Starrett, Christopher Riordan', 'R', 'Two men try to avoid military service by pretending to be gay, but they must act the part when the recruiting officer doesn''t buy it.', 'Two men try to avoid military service by pretending to be gay, but they must act the part when the recruiting officer doesn''t buy it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cv8uIUY7xXzhW79ekw0dTbkD1ri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205054'),
  ('560832008165002381', 'The Gay Deception', 1935, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William Wyler, Louis De Francesco, Joseph A. Valentine', 'Stephen Morehouse Avery, Don Hartman', 'Francis Lederer, Frances Dee, Benita Hume, Alan Mowbray, Lennox Pawle, Adele St. Mauer, Akim Tamiroff, Luis Alberni', 'NR', 'A wide-eyed working girl wins a $5,000 sweepstakes and plunges into the lush life of New York City, where she meets a bellboy who is more than he seems.', 'A wide-eyed working girl wins a $5,000 sweepstakes and plunges into the lush life of New York City, where she meets a bellboy who is more than he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhXbD4gKt3v0v67hDBlnyVZw3e5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54570'),
  ('967984047504812349', 'The Gay Divorcee', 1934, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Sandrich, David Abel, Max Steiner', 'Dorothy Yost, George Marion Jr., Edward Kaufman', 'Fred Astaire, Ginger Rogers, Alice Brady, Edward Everett Horton, Erik Rhodes, Eric Blore, William Austin, Charles Coleman', 'NR', 'Seeking a divorce from her absentee husband, Mimi Glossop travels to an English seaside resort. There she falls in love with dancer Guy Holden, whom she later mistakes for the corespondent her lawyer hired.', 'Seeking a divorce from her absentee husband, Mimi Glossop travels to an English seaside resort. There she falls in love with dancer Guy Holden, whom she later mistakes for the corespondent her lawyer hired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD6oUOAa0Q6PppaOnY6dy6sWPLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28288'),
  ('860849139384283686', 'The Gay Falcon', 1941, 'Mystery', 'Irving Reis, Nicholas Musuraca, Carroll Clark', 'Frank Fenton, Lynn Root', 'George Sanders, Wendy Barrie, Allen Jenkins, Nina Vale, Gladys Cooper, Edward Brophy, Arthur Shields, Damian O''Flynn', 'NR', 'Having forsaken the detective business for the safer confines of personal insurance, Gay Laurence is compelled to return to his sleuthing ways. Along with sidekick Jonathan "Goldie" Locke, he agrees to look into a series of home party robberies that have victimized socialite Maxine Wood. The duo gets more than they bargained for when a murder is committed at Wood''s home, but Lawrence still finds time to romance the damsel.', 'Having forsaken the detective business for the safer confines of personal insurance, Gay Laurence is compelled to return to his sleuthing ways. Along with sidekick Jonathan "Goldie" Locke, he agrees to look into a series of home party robberies that have victimized socialite Maxine Wood. The duo gets more than they bargained for when a murder is committed at Wood''s home, but Lawrence still finds time to romance the damsel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0jx2OaNHYLxPl25GULpDRDc5Ls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44175'),
  ('456349519800929448', 'The Gay Parisian', 1942, 'Music, Romance', 'Jean Negulesco, Efrem Kurtz, Ernest Haller', null, 'Léonide Massine, Milada Mladova, Frederic Franklin, Nathalie Krassovska, Andre Eglevsky, Igor Youskevitch, James Starbuck, Lubov Roudenko', null, 'The Gay Parisian is an American short film produced in 1941 by Warner Bros. featuring the Ballet Russe de Monte-Carlo and directed by Jean Negulesco. The film is a screen adaptation, in Technicolor, of the 1938 ballet Gaîté Parisienne, choreographed by Léonide Massine to music by Jacques Offenbach. It was nominated for an Academy Award at the 14th Academy Awards for Best Short Subject (Two-Reel).', 'The Gay Parisian is an American short film produced in 1941 by Warner Bros. featuring the Ballet Russe de Monte-Carlo and directed by Jean Negulesco. The film is a screen adaptation, in Technicolor, of the 1938 ballet Gaîté Parisienne, choreographed by Léonide Massine to music by Jacques Offenbach. It was nominated for an Academy Award at the 14th Academy Awards for Best Short Subject (Two-Reel).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2WkqPB9unqAZe4EGqDWO3OrMy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236804'),
  ('1000368462968540069', 'The Gay Shoe Clerk', 1903, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Edwin S. Porter, Edwin S. Porter', null, 'Edward Boulden', null, 'A woman being fitted for shoes exposes her ankle to the shoe clerk, who is intrigued. He kisses her, but her chaperone hits him with her umbrella.', 'A woman being fitted for shoes exposes her ankle to the shoe clerk, who is intrigued. He kisses her, but her chaperone hits him with her umbrella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgddajNhFfH2d1AMKIa4Bm3gP5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131933'),
  ('654118376586394637', 'The Gazebo', 1960, 'Comedy, Crime', 'George Marshall, Paul Vogel, Erich von Stroheim Jr.', 'George Wells', 'Glenn Ford, Debbie Reynolds, John McGiver, Doro Merande, Mabel Albertson, Carl Reiner, Bert Freed, Martin Landau', null, 'TV writer Elliott Nash buries a blackmailer under the new gazebo in his suburban backyard. But the nervous man can''t let the body rest there.', 'TV writer Elliott Nash buries a blackmailer under the new gazebo in his suburban backyard. But the nervous man can''t let the body rest there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shQcJ6OuxmmbG5s4AntXmTbIlCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1789'),
  ('259105718251268061', 'The Geisha', 1983, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Hideo Gosha, Fujio Morita', 'Tomiko Miyao', 'Ken Ogata, Kimiko Ikegami, Mitsuko Baisho, Atsuko Asano, Akiko Kana, Asao Koike, Tetsuro Tamba, Mikio Narita', null, 'Yokiro was the most successful Geisha house in Western Japan during the first half of the 20th century and remains open to this day. At its peak, it was home to over 200 geisha, however behind the fabulous facade, there were many battles - between family members, men and women, and with the Yakuza. Momokawa was sold to Yokiro at age 12, and despite being the top geisha, her many complicated relationships provide unending challenges throughout her glamorous but turbulent life.', 'Yokiro was the most successful Geisha house in Western Japan during the first half of the 20th century and remains open to this day. At its peak, it was home to over 200 geisha, however behind the fabulous facade, there were many battles - between family members, men and women, and with the Yakuza. Momokawa was sold to Yokiro at age 12, and despite being the top geisha, her many complicated relationships provide unending challenges throughout her glamorous but turbulent life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0aliYRUUxQhD1Mzwrls8A9KNsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50896'),
  ('619814048248841016', 'The Geisha Boy', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin, Ralph Axness, Haskell B. Boggs', 'Frank Tashlin', 'Jerry Lewis, Marie McDonald, Nobu McCarthy, Sessue Hayakawa, Barton MacLane, Robert Hirano, Suzanne Pleshette, Sid Melton', null, 'Gilbert Wooley is a second-rate magician who is sent to entertain the troops in the pacific. During his time in Japan he becomes attached to a little orphan boy.', 'Gilbert Wooley is a second-rate magician who is sent to entertain the troops in the pacific. During his time in Japan he becomes attached to a little orphan boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDosiUr0iacsqLNnhWtQdU5a5ad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37610'),
  ('603434800205759315', 'The Gendarme and the Creatures from Outer Space', 1979, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Didier Tarot, Jean Girault, Marcel Grignon', 'Jacques Vilfrid, Louis de Funès, Gérard Beytout', 'Louis de Funès, Michel Galabru, Maurice Risch, Jean-Pierre Rambal, Guy Grosso, Michel Modo, France Rumilly, Jean-Roger Caussimon', null, 'The bungling inspector Cruchot finds himself trying to save the residents of St. Tropez from some oil-drinking humanoid aliens. The only way to tell the aliens from the real people, besides their constant thirst for oil-products, is that they sound like empty garbage cans when you touch them. Chaos is ahead.', 'The bungling inspector Cruchot finds himself trying to save the residents of St. Tropez from some oil-drinking humanoid aliens. The only way to tell the aliens from the real people, besides their constant thirst for oil-products, is that they sound like empty garbage cans when you touch them. Chaos is ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZuUIAOjzT3rLkaSaIHB30UQZv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10516'),
  ('711388883691839522', 'The Gendarme and the Gendarmettes', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Tony Aboyantz, Jean Girault, Jean Boffety', 'Gérard Beytout, Jean Girault, Jacques Vilfrid', 'Louis de Funès, Michel Galabru, Maurice Risch, Jacques François, Guy Grosso, Michel Modo, Patrick Préjean, France Rumilly', null, 'Cruchot''s police office moves into a new building. They do not only get high tech equipment, but also four young female police officers to educate. All of them scramble to work with them -- and cause pure chaos while being distracted by the fine ladies. Then they get into real trouble when one after the other of their female colleagues is kidnapped.', 'Cruchot''s police office moves into a new building. They do not only get high tech equipment, but also four young female police officers to educate. All of them scramble to work with them -- and cause pure chaos while being distracted by the fine ladies. Then they get into real trouble when one after the other of their female colleagues is kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMRRaX48RpSGp7RJxwkIJUndtdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11915'),
  ('1151567365242946852', 'The Gendarme Gets Married', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Grignon, Jean Girault, Tony Aboyantz', null, 'Louis de Funès, Jean Lefebvre, Geneviève Grad, Christian Marin, Yves Vincent, Guy Grosso, Michel Modo, Maurizio Bonuglia', null, 'The Saint-Tropez police launch a major offensive against dangerous drivers. Marechal Cruchot (Louis de Funès) relishes the assignment, which he pursues with a manic zeal. Cruchot is after an offending driver, who turns out to be Josépha (Claude Gensac), the widow of a highly regarded police colonel. When they meet, Cruchot falls instantly in love....', 'The Saint-Tropez police launch a major offensive against dangerous drivers. Marechal Cruchot (Louis de Funès) relishes the assignment, which he pursues with a manic zeal. Cruchot is after an offending driver, who turns out to be Josépha (Claude Gensac), the widow of a highly regarded police colonel. When they meet, Cruchot falls instantly in love....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7e1OEPLRN4XqXiWjxXzKgnVZjPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4729'),
  ('38714214603441206', 'The Gendarme in New York', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Jean Girault, Edmond Séchan, Tony Aboyantz', null, 'Louis de Funès, Michel Galabru, Christian Marin, Guy Grosso, Michel Modo, Alan Scott, Jean Lefebvre, Geneviève Grad', null, 'Sergeant Cruchot and his faithful comrades have been sent to the International Congress of Gendarmerie in N.Y.', 'Sergeant Cruchot and his faithful comrades have been sent to the International Congress of Gendarmerie in N.Y.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1p0OftpJ4Bdk5TCkxaZ37XQjGH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4728'),
  ('510417843068826418', 'The Gendarme Takes Off', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Montazel, Jean Girault, Jean-Noël Jourdanet', 'Richard Balducci, Jean Girault, Jacques Vilfrid', 'Louis de Funès, Jean Lefebvre, Guy Grosso, Michel Modo, Nicole Vervil, France Rumilly, Yves Vincent, Christian Marin', null, 'The whole clique of Cruchot''s police station is retired. Now he lives with his rich wife in her castle - and is bored almost to death. He fights with the butler, because he isn''t even allowed to do the simple works. But when one of the clique suffers from amnesia after an accident, all of the others reunite and kidnap him, to take him on a tour to their old working places and through their memories. In their old uniforms they turn St. Tropez upside down.', 'The whole clique of Cruchot''s police station is retired. Now he lives with his rich wife in her castle - and is bored almost to death. He fights with the butler, because he isn''t even allowed to do the simple works. But when one of the clique suffers from amnesia after an accident, all of the others reunite and kidnap him, to take him on a tour to their old working places and through their memories. In their old uniforms they turn St. Tropez upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vyd7FSnU1LOb1CpLI20KnZZjJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11913'),
  ('1016549658565461109', 'The Gene Generation', 2007, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Anthony G. Nakonechnyj, Pearry Reginald Teo, Anthony Garcia', 'Keith Collea, Pearry Reginald Teo', 'Faye Dunaway, Parry Shen, Bai Ling, Alec Newman, Ethan Cohn, Michael Shamus Wiles, Daniel Zacapa, Robert David Hall', 'R', 'In a futuristic world, Michelle lives everyday battling with DNA Hackers who use their skills to hack into people''s bodies and kill them. She is an assassin, trying to keep her younger brother, Jackie, out of trouble. When Jackie gets involved in a petty crime of robbery, he propels himself into the world of DNA Hackers, Shylocks (Loan Sharks) and Gangs', 'In a futuristic world, Michelle lives everyday battling with DNA Hackers who use their skills to hack into people''s bodies and kill them. She is an assassin, trying to keep her younger brother, Jackie, out of trouble. When Jackie gets involved in a petty crime of robbery, he propels himself into the world of DNA Hackers, Shylocks (Loan Sharks) and Gangs', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zoOytPe2KkWJZxIXS525cscSod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15166'),
  ('471642578258589325', 'The General', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Boorman, Seamus Deasy', 'John Boorman', 'Brendan Gleeson, Adrian Dunbar, Sean McGinley, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Angeline Ball, Jon Voight, Eanna MacLiam, Tom Murphy', 'R', 'The real-life story of Dublin folk hero and criminal Martin Cahill, who pulled off two daring robberies in Ireland with his team, but attracted unwanted attention from the police, the I.R.A., the U.V.F., and members of his own team.', 'The real-life story of Dublin folk hero and criminal Martin Cahill, who pulled off two daring robberies in Ireland with his team, but attracted unwanted attention from the police, the I.R.A., the U.V.F., and members of his own team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UUR2Evm2JtC2odd2UMYgs9Yi1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16885'),
  ('729435903008940606', 'The General', 2026, 'War', 'Miloslav Samardzic, Bojan Krstic', 'Miloslav Samardzic', 'Nikola Rakočević, Stevan Mrdjenovic, Igor Bojovic, Igor Borojević, Dejan Cicmilovic', null, '1943 Yugoslavia: Buoyed by Allied promises, the Chetniks strike Axis forces on an unprecedented scale. As enemies multiply and landings collapse, tensions between Armstrong and General Draza drive the war''s tragic outcome.', '1943 Yugoslavia: Buoyed by Allied promises, the Chetniks strike Axis forces on an unprecedented scale. As enemies multiply and landings collapse, tensions between Armstrong and General Draza drive the war''s tragic outcome.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:the-general-2026'),
  ('1134352988723852273', 'The General Case', 2016, 'Drama', 'Stephan Wagner, Thomas Benesch', 'Alex Buresch', 'Ulrich Noethen, David Kross, Bernhard Schütz, Uwe Bohm, Godehard Giese, Gustav Peter Wöhler, Karl Knaup, Manfred Möck', null, 'In the young Federal Republic of Germany, which in the late 1950s in politics and justice is still interspersed with only superficially purified Nazi cliques, leads the Hessian Attorney General Fritz Bauer a lonely fight against the coverup of Nazi crimes and the restorative policy of the government Adenauer - he is firmly convinced that only in this way can the young democracy be consolidated. Not only his attitude, but also his temperament make Bauer vulnerable, again and again resistance forms from politics, intelligence services and the judiciary against the lone fighter.', 'In the young Federal Republic of Germany, which in the late 1950s in politics and justice is still interspersed with only superficially purified Nazi cliques, leads the Hessian Attorney General Fritz Bauer a lonely fight against the coverup of Nazi crimes and the restorative policy of the government Adenauer - he is firmly convinced that only in this way can the young democracy be consolidated. Not only his attitude, but also his temperament make Bauer vulnerable, again and again resistance forms from politics, intelligence services and the judiciary against the lone fighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/873jDHdcUe5TIs59j3wiKdNZXl0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384485'),
  ('1088243287607177475', 'The General Died at Dawn', 1936, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lewis Milestone, Victor Milner, Boris Morros', 'Clifford Odets', 'Gary Cooper, Madeleine Carroll, Akim Tamiroff, Dudley Digges, Porter Hall, William Frawley, J.M. Kerrigan, Philip Ahn', 'NR', 'China, 1930s, during the ravaging civil war. General Pen entrusts O''Hara, an intrepid American adventurer, with the mission of providing a large sum of money to Mr. Wu with the task of buying weapons in Shanghai to help end General Yang''s tyranny that keeps an entire province under his ruthless iron boot.', 'China, 1930s, during the ravaging civil war. General Pen entrusts O''Hara, an intrepid American adventurer, with the mission of providing a large sum of money to Mr. Wu with the task of buying weapons in Shanghai to help end General Yang''s tyranny that keeps an entire province under his ruthless iron boot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpt6AyISPBYesV8lFxED7PoHxZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113916'),
  ('918415842612707891', 'The General Line', 1929, 'Drama', 'Sergei Eisenstein, Mikhail Gomorov, Maksim Shtraukh', 'Sergei Eisenstein, Grigori Aleksandrov', 'Marfa Lapkina, M. Ivanin, Konstantin Vasilyev, Vasili Buzenkov, Nezhnikov, Chukamaryev, Ivan Yudin, E. Suhareva', null, 'Also known as The Old and the New (Staroye i Novoye), The General Line illustrates Lenin’s stated imperative that the nation move from agrarian to industrial culture in an epic ode to farm-collectivization progress.', 'Also known as The Old and the New (Staroye i Novoye), The General Line illustrates Lenin’s stated imperative that the nation move from agrarian to industrial culture in an epic ode to farm-collectivization progress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tc40LBkdIydQga2BSJur9WGq5RM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110741'),
  ('746409837185029783', 'The General''s Daughter', 1999, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Simon West, Peter Menzies Jr., Steve Danton', 'Christopher Bertolini, William Goldman', 'John Travolta, Madeleine Stowe, James Cromwell, Timothy Hutton, Leslie Stefanson, Daniel von Bargen, Clarence Williams III, James Woods', 'R', 'When the body of Army Capt. Elisabeth Campbell is found on a Georgia military base, two investigators, Warrant Officers Paul Brenner and Sara Sunhill, are ordered to solve her murder. What they uncover is anything but clear-cut. Unseemly details emerge about Campbell''s life, leading to allegations of a possible military coverup of her death and the involvement of her father, Lt. Gen. Joseph Campbell.', 'When the body of Army Capt. Elisabeth Campbell is found on a Georgia military base, two investigators, Warrant Officers Paul Brenner and Sara Sunhill, are ordered to solve her murder. What they uncover is anything but clear-cut. Unseemly details emerge about Campbell''s life, leading to allegations of a possible military coverup of her death and the involvement of her father, Lt. Gen. Joseph Campbell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8CMN81n7SON7ALPMlxZtOzBZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2275'),
  ('355315858599712610', 'The Generation of Evil', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Andrius Bražas, Danielė Zavadskytė, Lukas Lukoševičius', 'Jonas Banys, Emilis Vėlyvis', 'Vytautas Kaniušonis, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Ainis Storpirštis, Vaidotas Martinaitis, Toma Vaškevičiūtė, Donatas Šimukauskas, Dalia Michelevičiūtė, Greta Petrovskytė', null, 'On the verge of retirement, Commissioner Gintas must undertake the investigation of a series of heinous murders, a dangerous task that could expose the many dirty secrets of several prominent members of the social elite of a small Lithuanian town.', 'On the verge of retirement, Commissioner Gintas must undertake the investigation of a series of heinous murders, a dangerous task that could expose the many dirty secrets of several prominent members of the social elite of a small Lithuanian town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PZZHbpvzChfuFwzHXYGodpHfyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:782044'),
  ('170418691204686201', 'The Genesis Children', 1972, 'Drama', 'Anthony Aikman', 'Barbara Smith, Billy Byars, Anthony Aikman', 'Vincent Child, Greg Hill, Peter Glawson, Butch Burr, Max Adams, David Johnson, Bubba Collins, Mike Good', null, 'A charismatic leader and a high-spirited student group are on holiday in Italy. The surreal adventures of these friends are a free-flowing, four-part "multi-sensual symphony," bereft of traditional story line. One national critic described the boys'' anarchic revelry as a "dream-like descent from civilization into the chaos reminiscent of Lord of the Flies."', 'A charismatic leader and a high-spirited student group are on holiday in Italy. The surreal adventures of these friends are a free-flowing, four-part "multi-sensual symphony," bereft of traditional story line. One national critic described the boys'' anarchic revelry as a "dream-like descent from civilization into the chaos reminiscent of Lord of the Flies."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQlBdH98AAqrT1FdWz94s3vIheN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47094'),
  ('649351378489705645', 'The Gentiles', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Santi Amodeo', 'Santi Amodeo, Rafael Cobos', 'África de la Cruz, Paula Díaz, Beatriz Cotobal, Olga Navalón, Lola Buero, Teresa Cruz, Rafa de Vera, Alva Inger', null, 'Ana throws her life on the Instagram and other social networks, where she posts pictures, videos and short animations, together with witty (and lucid) texts. Ana is going through a strange moment. In addition to going through the family conflicts and identity issues typical of her age, she experiences something new. She feels something she does not quite understand, for her close friend Corrales.', 'Ana throws her life on the Instagram and other social networks, where she posts pictures, videos and short animations, together with witty (and lucid) texts. Ana is going through a strange moment. In addition to going through the family conflicts and identity issues typical of her age, she experiences something new. She feels something she does not quite understand, for her close friend Corrales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppmcKno9CoyXQVLZbUviX3uQdim.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807193'),
  ('150538172555828209', 'The Gentle Gunman', 1952, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Basil Dearden, Gordon Dines', 'Roger MacDougall', 'John Mills, Dirk Bogarde, Robert Beatty, Elizabeth Sellars, Barbara Mullen, Eddie Byrne, Joseph Tomelty, Gilbert Harding', null, 'The relationship between brothers Terry and Matt, both active in the IRA, comes under strain when Terry begins to question the use of violence.', 'The relationship between brothers Terry and Matt, both active in the IRA, comes under strain when Terry begins to question the use of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmfQttXza7Xf8KwhQZEQtSYa1Z4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81029'),
  ('323492615632863755', 'The Gentle Sex', 1943, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Leslie Howard, Cecil Gurney, Paul Sheriff', 'Moie Charles', 'Joan Gates, Jean Gillie, Joan Greenwood, Joyce Howard, Rosamund John, Lilli Palmer, Barbara Waring, John Justin', null, 'During the War seven women from very different backgrounds find themselves together in the Auxiliary Territorial Services. They are soon drilling, driving lorries, and manning ack-ack batteries.', 'During the War seven women from very different backgrounds find themselves together in the Auxiliary Territorial Services. They are soon drilling, driving lorries, and manning ack-ack batteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bz2HMBEcRzb3JPgFqSqDMRP9TFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75155'),
  ('428683599093332054', 'The Gentleman', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Gabriel Beristain, Javier Salmones, Pablo Ruiz Alarcón', 'Juma Fodde, Teresa Trasancos', 'Ron Perlman, Megan Montaner, Hovik Keuchkerian, Damián Alcázar, Marco de la O, Natti Natasha, Karra Elejalde, Unax Ugalde', null, 'Aging ex-soldier Theo meets weekly with prostitute Olga to reminisce. After Olga''s murder, Theo seeks bloody revenge, attracting attention of alcoholic cop Iborra and hitman Herodes.', 'Aging ex-soldier Theo meets weekly with prostitute Olga to reminisce. After Olga''s murder, Theo seeks bloody revenge, attracting attention of alcoholic cop Iborra and hitman Herodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIIZ3qIh7A3B8Y1VVo5laFyusVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1426968'),
  ('1108071437195967676', 'The Gentleman from Epsom', 1962, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gilles Grangier, Louis Page', 'Michel Audiard, Gilles Grangier, Albert Simonin', 'Jean Gabin, Louis de Funès, Madeleine Robinson, Jean Lefebvre, Paul Frankeur, Frank Villard, Jacques Marin, Jean Martinelli', null, 'The story takes place in the racecourses around Paris. A so-called major sells his tips to naive characters.', 'The story takes place in the racecourses around Paris. A so-called major sells his tips to naive characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jydLsmfTSEJjZJyoQz3ZVfXpldm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44522'),
  ('244916008287385322', 'The Gentlemen', 2020, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Guy Ritchie, Max Keene, Alan Stewart', 'Lauren Bond', 'Matthew McConaughey, Charlie Hunnam, Michelle Dockery, Jeremy Strong, Lyne Renee, Colin Farrell, Henry Golding, Tom Wu', 'R', 'American expat Mickey Pearson has built a highly profitable marijuana empire in London. When word gets out that he’s looking to cash out of the business forever it triggers plots, schemes, bribery and blackmail in an attempt to steal his domain out from under him.', 'American expat Mickey Pearson has built a highly profitable marijuana empire in London. When word gets out that he’s looking to cash out of the business forever it triggers plots, schemes, bribery and blackmail in an attempt to steal his domain out from under him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtrhTYB7xSrJxR1vusu99nvnZ1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522627'),
  ('1003448811479493585', 'The Geographer Drank His Globe Away', 2013, 'Drama', 'Alexandr Veledinsky, Vladimir Bashta, Irina Tretyakova', 'Rauf Kubaev', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Elena Lyadova, Aleksandr Robak, Agrippina Steklova, Andrey Prytkov, Anfisa Chernykh, Evgeniya Kregzhde, Alla Mezentseva', null, 'Victor Sluzhkin signs on as a teacher of geography in a secondary school in his native Perm (in the Urals) and gets lost in a haze of hard vodka, desperate love for a nymphet-like student and the stress of educating teenagers. Geographer, as the students immediately dub Sluzhkin, attempts to escape from the grueling, dull, stultifying reality of Russia''s provincial life in a rafting tour to the Urals. Accompanied by wild, adventure-seeking adolescents, faced with the numerous grim surprises of the nature, Geographer is poised to find himself and his own truth.', 'Victor Sluzhkin signs on as a teacher of geography in a secondary school in his native Perm (in the Urals) and gets lost in a haze of hard vodka, desperate love for a nymphet-like student and the stress of educating teenagers. Geographer, as the students immediately dub Sluzhkin, attempts to escape from the grueling, dull, stultifying reality of Russia''s provincial life in a rafting tour to the Urals. Accompanied by wild, adventure-seeking adolescents, faced with the numerous grim surprises of the nature, Geographer is poised to find himself and his own truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyWyVgDHYkjejwAQQrUCQXuZYjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225235'),
  ('392816028547843757', 'The Geography of the Body', 1943, 'Documentary', 'Willard Maas', null, 'George Barker, Willard Maas, Marie Menken', null, 'A quotation from Aristophanes, "The desire and pursuit of the whole is called love," precedes views of a man and a woman''s bodies, often in extreme close up. Off-screen, a voice recites fragments of oracular literature and purple prose. We see an eye, an ear, a mouth, a tongue, bits of hair, a hand, the tips of fingers, toes. Occasionally, the frame includes a larger scape of a body: a chest, a back, a breast. Usually the camera is stationery; sometimes, it moves across a body, remaining in close up. They hold hands for one moment. The bodies are without clothes; no genitalia are visible.', 'A quotation from Aristophanes, "The desire and pursuit of the whole is called love," precedes views of a man and a woman''s bodies, often in extreme close up. Off-screen, a voice recites fragments of oracular literature and purple prose. We see an eye, an ear, a mouth, a tongue, bits of hair, a hand, the tips of fingers, toes. Occasionally, the frame includes a larger scape of a body: a chest, a back, a breast. Usually the camera is stationery; sometimes, it moves across a body, remaining in close up. They hold hands for one moment. The bodies are without clothes; no genitalia are visible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSVv7trJ6WIiKDAsm4jrN2YSH63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47461'),
  ('689684341214449165', 'The George McKenna Story', 1988, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Eric Laneuville, Isidore Mankofsky', 'Charles Eric Johnson', 'Denzel Washington, Lynn Whitfield, Akosua Busia, Richard Masur, Ray Buktenica, Virginia Capers, Barbara Townsend, Israel Juarbe', null, 'Washington plays a school principal in a tough inner city Los Angeles high school out to rid it of drugs, gangs, low moral of teachers, and restore educational values. Based on a true story.', 'Washington plays a school principal in a tough inner city Los Angeles high school out to rid it of drugs, gangs, low moral of teachers, and restore educational values. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3giHNZZ347b7vsCEEzddJPAWS5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41869'),
  ('661343240692079232', 'The Gerber Syndrome - Il contagio', 2011, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Maxì Dejoie, Stefano Rogliatti', 'Maxì Dejoie', 'Valentina Bartolo, Elisabetta Fischer, Pia Lanciotti, Nicola Marchitiello, Anna Nevalder, Ettore Nicoletti, Beppe Rosso, Sax Nicosia', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBmvk8D8sE9PiICNk0MP9yJQxM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202865'),
  ('172391718771790433', 'The German Chainsaw Massacre', 1990, 'Comedy, Thriller, Horror', 'Christoph Schlingensief, Udo Kier, Voxi Bärenklau', 'Christoph Schlingensief', 'Karina Fallenstein, Susanne Bredehöft, Artur Albrecht, Volker Spengler, Alfred Edel, Brigitte Kausch, Dietrich Kuhlbrodt, Reinald Schnell', null, 'Taking place around the German reunification of 1990, a group of East Germans cross the border to visit West Germany and get slaughtered by a psychopathic cannibal family who want to turn them into sausages.', 'Taking place around the German reunification of 1990, a group of East Germans cross the border to visit West Germany and get slaughtered by a psychopathic cannibal family who want to turn them into sausages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJhUqwMTY3EjYLX819NMopIb3gj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81611'),
  ('922082311047127746', 'The German Doctor', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Lucía Puenzo, Marcello Pozzo, Mariana Cavagnaro Rouge', 'Lucía Puenzo', 'Àlex Brendemühl, Natalia Oreiro, Diego Peretti, Elena Roger, Florencia Bado, Abril Braunstein, Juan I Martinez, Guillermo Pfening', 'PG-13', 'Patagonia, 1960. A German doctor meets an Argentinean family and follows them to a town where the family will be starting a new life. The family welcomes the doctor into their home and entrust their young daughter to his care, not knowing that he is one of the most dangerous criminals in the world.', 'Patagonia, 1960. A German doctor meets an Argentinean family and follows them to a town where the family will be starting a new life. The family welcomes the doctor into their home and entrust their young daughter to his care, not knowing that he is one of the most dangerous criminals in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZwX3U4eRQBB8ZWTjsxAmnikk1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188761'),
  ('433362760750900014', 'The German Friend', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jeanine Meerapfel, Víctor González', 'Jeanine Meerapfel', 'Celeste Cid, Max Riemelt, Benjamin Sadler, Hartmut Becker, Joaquín Berthold, Jean Pierre Noher, Sebastián Mogordoy, Daniel Fanego', null, 'It’s the late 1950s, and in an affluent and quietly respectable part of Buenos Aires, young Sulamit Löwenstein strikes up a friendship with her next-door neighbour Friedrich over the whereabouts of her family dog. She is the daughter of German-Jewish immigrants to Argentina, he is the son of a senior SS officer, a tragic political legacy from whose shadow both characters struggle to escape over the next three decades. Following the teenaged Friedrich to Germany, Sulamit finds him caught up in the radical politics of late-1960s student life; and she’s forced to make important decisions about her attitude to her homeland when Friedrich returns to Argentina to join the fight against the military junta.', 'It’s the late 1950s, and in an affluent and quietly respectable part of Buenos Aires, young Sulamit Löwenstein strikes up a friendship with her next-door neighbour Friedrich over the whereabouts of her family dog. She is the daughter of German-Jewish immigrants to Argentina, he is the son of a senior SS officer, a tragic political legacy from whose shadow both characters struggle to escape over the next three decades. Following the teenaged Friedrich to Germany, Sulamit finds him caught up in the radical politics of late-1960s student life; and she’s forced to make important decisions about her attitude to her homeland when Friedrich returns to Argentina to join the fight against the military junta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCwQS2X4DoFqLbDiCgzdWS8DtzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133552'),
  ('721258150953385492', 'The German Lesson', 2019, 'Drama', 'Christian Schwochow, Frank Lamm', 'Heide Schwochow', 'Ulrich Noethen, Tobias Moretti, Levi Eisenblätter, Tom Gronau, Johanna Wokalek, Sonja Richter, Maria Dragus, Louis Hofmann', null, 'In a small North German village a drama played out during and shortly after the Second World War about duty versus individual conscience and morality.', 'In a small North German village a drama played out during and shortly after the Second World War about duty versus individual conscience and morality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nR478Q3qVSQLMpUcHIjwHf4q5Mz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500245'),
  ('694533765562895422', 'The Germans Strike Again', 1948, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Christos Giannakopoulos, Alekos Sakellarios', 'Vasilis Logothetidis, Nitsa Tsaganea, Ilia Livykou, Marina Smyrnaki, Ora Vaza, Georgia Vasileiadou, Dinos Dimopoulos, Lavrentis Dianellos', null, '4 years after the Nazi occupation in Greece, the Greeks are involved in a Civil War and they are killing each other. Theodoros, a quiet and modest man, disgusted and disappointed, falls asleep and has a nightmare. Hitler is alive and the Nazis strike back with new, more powerful weapons.', '4 years after the Nazi occupation in Greece, the Greeks are involved in a Civil War and they are killing each other. Theodoros, a quiet and modest man, disgusted and disappointed, falls asleep and has a nightmare. Hitler is alive and the Nazis strike back with new, more powerful weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMJ42V3U9y9Xhj5yMAzoIhtpZJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258636'),
  ('140296360799284691', 'The Getaway', 1972, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Lucien Ballard, Sam Peckinpah, Newt Arnold', 'Walter Hill', 'Steve McQueen, Ali MacGraw, Ben Johnson, Sally Struthers, Al Lettieri, Slim Pickens, Richard Bright, Jack Dodson', 'PG', 'A recently released ex-convict and his loyal wife go on the run after a heist goes wrong.', 'A recently released ex-convict and his loyal wife go on the run after a heist goes wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SvnGUJsr16zUJ2CN7ONX1ZWtZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5916'),
  ('740153867941078200', 'The Getaway', 1994, 'Action, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Roger Donaldson, Peter Menzies Jr.', 'Amy Holden Jones, Walter Hill', 'Alec Baldwin, Kim Basinger, Michael Madsen, James Woods, David Morse, Jennifer Tilly, James Stephens, Richard Farnsworth', 'R', 'An ex-con and his devoted wife must flee from danger when a heist doesn''t go as planned.', 'An ex-con and his devoted wife must flee from danger when a heist doesn''t go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftbdJTJi6mR5iZV5ESJWv8f8pWN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2087'),
  ('301893034496023156', 'The Getaway King', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Mateusz Rakowicz, Kacper Lisowski, Jacek Podgórski', 'Łukasz M. Maciejewski, Mateusz Rakowicz', 'Dawid Ogrodnik, Robert Więckiewicz, Jakub Gierszał, Masza Wągrocka, Rafał Zawierucha, Sandra Drzymalska, Andrzej Andrzejewski, Dorota Kolak', null, 'Comedy about Zdzisław Najmrodzki, most famous polish criminal in the times of Polish People Republic, named "the getaway king", known for stealing cars and escaping prison many times, but never hurting anybody.', 'Comedy about Zdzisław Najmrodzki, most famous polish criminal in the times of Polish People Republic, named "the getaway king", known for stealing cars and escaping prison many times, but never hurting anybody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfoudpFhAo5Mn8Sqyuu4Y006ITQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:859453'),
  ('659457962502721992', 'The Getting of Wisdom', 1977, 'Drama', 'Bruce Beresford', 'Eleanor Witcombe', 'Susannah Fowle, Hilary Ryan, Terence Donovan, Patricia Kennedy, Sheila Helpmann, Candy Raymond, Barry Humphries, John Waters', null, 'Based on the 1910 novel by Henry Handel Richardson, thought to be an account of her own schooldays at the Presbyterian Ladies College in Melbourne. A young girl, Laura Tweedle-Rambotham who grew up in the outback, and at around the age of 14, is sent off by her poor mother who has scrimped and saved for her to go to a prestigious women’s private college in Melbourne, the Presbyterian Ladies College.', 'Based on the 1910 novel by Henry Handel Richardson, thought to be an account of her own schooldays at the Presbyterian Ladies College in Melbourne. A young girl, Laura Tweedle-Rambotham who grew up in the outback, and at around the age of 14, is sent off by her poor mother who has scrimped and saved for her to go to a prestigious women’s private college in Melbourne, the Presbyterian Ladies College.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkt62WcwW11iknPSYHpzmkK4pnE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42214'),
  ('95371796778149985', 'The Ghastly Ones', 1968, 'Horror', 'Andy Milligan, Andy Milligan', 'Andy Milligan, Hal Sherwood', 'Veronica Radburn, Maggie Rogers, Hal Borske, Anne Linden, Fib LaBlaque, Carol Vogel, Richard Romanus, Eileen Hayes', null, 'Three sisters must spend three nights on an eerie island to inherit their father''s fortune. A deformed man leads them to the estate where horrors await.', 'Three sisters must spend three nights on an eerie island to inherit their father''s fortune. A deformed man leads them to the estate where horrors await.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xRW3MnxOssgMVIK5ab3xkFt4Zn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84360'),
  ('280662485675000412', 'The Ghazi Attack', 2017, 'Action, War, Thriller, History', 'Sankalp Reddy, R. Madhi', 'Gangaraju Gunnam, Niranjan Reddy, Sankalp Reddy', 'Kay Kay Menon, Rana Daggubati, Atul Kulkarni, Taapsee Pannu, Amitabh Bachchan, Om Puri, Milind Gunaji, Rahul Singh', null, 'India’s first underwater war film tries to decode the mystery behind the sinking of Pakistani submarine PNS Ghazi during the Indo-Pak war of 1971.', 'India’s first underwater war film tries to decode the mystery behind the sinking of Pakistani submarine PNS Ghazi during the Indo-Pak war of 1971.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7lITQa1v7dZZgLIdE8vZRnPhOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442405'),
  ('182427126432091539', 'The Ghost', 1963, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Riccardo Freda, Raffaele Masciocchi, Silvana Merli', 'Riccardo Freda', 'Barbara Steele, Peter Baldwin, Harriet Medin, Elio Jotta, Carol Bennet, Carlo Kechler, Umberto Raho, Reginald Price Anderson', null, 'A woman and her lover murder her husband, a doctor. Soon, however, strange things start happening, and they wonder if they really killed him, or if he is coming back from the dead to haunt them.', 'A woman and her lover murder her husband, a doctor. Soon, however, strange things start happening, and they wonder if they really killed him, or if he is coming back from the dead to haunt them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJUiTm53JRXZsmDqtcQDPYMnkxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28533'),
  ('1098095561659544345', 'The Ghost', 2004, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Kim Tae-kyung, Lee Jung-ho', 'Kim Tae-kyung', 'Kim Ha-neul, Ryu Jin, Nam Sang-mi, Jeon Hye-bin, Shin Yi, Jeon Hie-Ju, Lee Yoo-Ji, Ki Joo-bong', null, 'Min Ji-won is suffering from amnesia. Her memory slowly comes back, after she discovers that all her friends mysteriously drowned recently. She begins piecing together her past, revealing the event that caused her memory loss.', 'Min Ji-won is suffering from amnesia. Her memory slowly comes back, after she discovers that all her friends mysteriously drowned recently. She begins piecing together her past, revealing the event that caused her memory loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQVyDiVfrfT7ZDFMh4FA2AoH425.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21792'),
  ('162905028950057670', 'The Ghost', 2007, 'Action, Drama', 'Amr Arafa, Mohsen Ahmed', 'Wael Abdallah', 'Ahmed Ezz, Zeina, Mahmoud Abdel Moghny, Salah Abdallah, Youssef Fawzy, Osama Abu Al Ata, Hanaa Abdel Fattah, Mohamed El Sawy', null, 'A young amnesiac accused of murder seeks to know the truth about himself while he is on the run from the police, searching for the real killer with the help of his friend.', 'A young amnesiac accused of murder seeks to know the truth about himself while he is on the run from the police, searching for the real killer with the help of his friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvQNej68frHx72oBuo3N0KsqzHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300415'),
  ('26982652465093560', 'The Ghost', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Karen Oganesyan, Yevgeniya Kadilova, Ivan Burlakov', 'Sergey Yudakov, Oleg Malovichko', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Vladimir Mashkov, Chulpan Khamatova, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Anatoliy Semyonov, Vitaly Kishchenko, Ramil Sabitov, Alexander Adabashyan', null, 'A novelist struggling with writer''s block enlists the aid of an assassin for some inspiration -- fully unaware that he is being set up to take the blame for a murder.', 'A novelist struggling with writer''s block enlists the aid of an assassin for some inspiration -- fully unaware that he is being set up to take the blame for a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjiUm5NzFaGp5466rAxwHUs04PE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20449'),
  ('1062336563777925944', 'The Ghost and Mr. Chicken', 1966, 'Comedy, Family, Mystery, Romance', 'Alan Rafkin, William Margulies', 'James Fritzell, Everett Greenbaum', 'Don Knotts, Joan Staley, Liam Redmond, Dick Sargent, Skip Homeier, Reta Shaw, Lurene Tuttle, Philip Ober', 'G', 'Luther Heggs, a typesetter for the town newspaper, pitches an idea for a story about a local haunted house where a famous murder/suicide occurred 20 years earlier. After the editor assigns Luther to spend one night alone in the mansion, Heggs has a number of supernatural encounters and writes a front page story that makes him a hometown hero...until the nephew of the deceased sues him for libel.', 'Luther Heggs, a typesetter for the town newspaper, pitches an idea for a story about a local haunted house where a famous murder/suicide occurred 20 years earlier. After the editor assigns Luther to spend one night alone in the mansion, Heggs has a number of supernatural encounters and writes a front page story that makes him a hometown hero...until the nephew of the deceased sues him for libel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AomOgoN5kmVtMWWMKVeTPT8nVOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13343'),
  ('76093181135540197', 'The Ghost and Mrs. Muir', 1947, 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Charles Lang, F.E. ''Johnny'' Johnston', 'Philip Dunne', 'Gene Tierney, Rex Harrison, George Sanders, Edna Best, Vanessa Brown, Anna Lee, Robert Coote, Natalie Wood', 'NR', 'In 1900, young widow Lucy Muir learns that her seaside cottage is haunted and forms a unique relationship with the ghost.', 'In 1900, young widow Lucy Muir learns that her seaside cottage is haunted and forms a unique relationship with the ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idoD3cwfwj86BPvVoWVgWhnT2xq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22292'),
  ('92573859170159896', 'The Ghost and the Darkness', 1996, 'Adventure, Thriller, History', 'Stephen Hopkins, Vilmos Zsigmond, José Luis Escolar', 'William Goldman', 'Michael Douglas, Val Kilmer, Tom Wilkinson, John Kani, Emily Mortimer, Bernard Hill, Brian McCardie, Om Puri', 'R', 'Sir Robert Beaumont is behind schedule on a railroad in Africa. Enlisting noted engineer John Henry Patterson to right the ship, Beaumont expects results. Everything seems great until the crew discovers the mutilated corpse of the project''s foreman, seemingly killed by a lion. After several more attacks, Patterson calls in famed hunter Charles Remington, who has finally met his match in the bloodthirsty lions.', 'Sir Robert Beaumont is behind schedule on a railroad in Africa. Enlisting noted engineer John Henry Patterson to right the ship, Beaumont expects results. Everything seems great until the crew discovers the mutilated corpse of the project''s foreman, seemingly killed by a lion. After several more attacks, Patterson calls in famed hunter Charles Remington, who has finally met his match in the bloodthirsty lions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KEPs6RKlin9pT9fqjtW7MSLC8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10586'),
  ('568881055425036086', 'The Ghost Breakers', 1940, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'George Marshall, Charles Lang', 'Walter DeLeon', 'Bob Hope, Paulette Goddard, Richard Carlson, Paul Lukas, Anthony Quinn, Willie Best, Pedro de Cordoba, Virginia Brissac', 'NR', 'After intrepid working girl Mary Carter becomes the new owner of a reputedly haunted mansion located off the Cuban coast, a stranger phones warning her to stay away from the castle. Undaunted, Mary sets sail for Cuba with a stowaway in her trunk—wise-cracking Larry Lawrence, a radio announcer who helps Mary get to the bottom of the voodoo magic, zombies and ghosts that supposedly curse the spooky estate.', 'After intrepid working girl Mary Carter becomes the new owner of a reputedly haunted mansion located off the Cuban coast, a stranger phones warning her to stay away from the castle. Undaunted, Mary sets sail for Cuba with a stowaway in her trunk—wise-cracking Larry Lawrence, a radio announcer who helps Mary get to the bottom of the voodoo magic, zombies and ghosts that supposedly curse the spooky estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zytHhgTgPuHNdKFxeyznHa6BkA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14605'),
  ('185510348999852632', 'The Ghost Camera', 1933, 'Comedy, Thriller, Romance, Mystery, Crime', 'Bernard Vorhaus, Ernest Palmer, Arthur Barnes', null, 'Henry Kendall, Ida Lupino, Victor Stanley, John Mills, George Merritt, Felix Aylmer, Fred Groves, Charles Paton', null, 'When a photograph is taken at the scene of a murder, the camera is tossed out of a castle window to destroy the evidence and lands in the back of a passing car belonging to chemist John Gray who becomes amateur sleuth after developing the film and goes in search of the woman captured by the photograph. When the camera is stolen from his laboratory, Gray''s suspicions are further aroused.', 'When a photograph is taken at the scene of a murder, the camera is tossed out of a castle window to destroy the evidence and lands in the back of a passing car belonging to chemist John Gray who becomes amateur sleuth after developing the film and goes in search of the woman captured by the photograph. When the camera is stolen from his laboratory, Gray''s suspicions are further aroused.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNXjRFGkQp0nRMwiPwv4P55DCXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165057'),
  ('910419686834705959', 'The Ghost Dance', 1982, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Fred Murphy, Peter F. Buffa', 'Peter F. Buffa, Robert M. Sutton', 'Julie Amato, Victor Mohica, Henry Bal, Frank Salsedo, James Andronica, Patricia Alice Albrecht, Deloris Maaske, J. Christopher Senter', 'R', 'The spirit of a long-dead warrior possesses the body of an Indian medicine man and turns him into a homicidal maniac.', 'The spirit of a long-dead warrior possesses the body of an Indian medicine man and turns him into a homicidal maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMebgYtEg1TzL3Roh9xmjiJ5gry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85185'),
  ('962648835860874994', 'The Ghost Galleon', 1974, 'Horror', 'Amando de Ossorio, Raúl Artigot', 'Amando de Ossorio', 'Maria Perschy, Jack Taylor, Bárbara Rey, Carlos Lemos, Manuel de Blas, Blanca Estrada, Margarita Merino', null, 'After a pair of models go missing from a boat, a rescue party discover an empty galleon carrying the coffins of the long dead Knights Templar. The rescue party board the galleon and then discover their own boat has vanished. The survivors struggle to fight off the spectral knights with what little knowledge they have of them.', 'After a pair of models go missing from a boat, a rescue party discover an empty galleon carrying the coffins of the long dead Knights Templar. The rescue party board the galleon and then discover their own boat has vanished. The survivors struggle to fight off the spectral knights with what little knowledge they have of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zASO7gtxGnlSiMcTMAB78UPSPK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28067'),
  ('753835863874448418', 'The Ghost Game', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Son Dong-wan', 'Son Dong-wan', 'YERI, Lee Chan-hyeong, Suh Dong-hyun, Oh So-hyun, Kim Eun-bi, Park Seo-yeon', null, 'Aspiring YouTuber Gi-ho stages a fake seance for viral content, but Ja-young joins, seeking her missing sister Seo-woo. In an underground cistern, Seo-woo volunteers as the "possessed," but when she collapses, terror unfolds. Trapped with sinister forces, the students face a deadly fate, leading to a shocking twist.', 'Aspiring YouTuber Gi-ho stages a fake seance for viral content, but Ja-young joins, seeking her missing sister Seo-woo. In an underground cistern, Seo-woo volunteers as the "possessed," but when she collapses, terror unfolds. Trapped with sinister forces, the students face a deadly fate, leading to a shocking twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uF6PnY1gWNmDkAMYO1qhgdgozM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1354700'),
  ('399575121786086603', 'The Ghost Goes West', 1935, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'René Clair, Harold Rosson, Albert Valentin', 'René Clair, Eric Keown, Geoffrey Kerr', 'Robert Donat, Jean Parker, Eugene Pallette, Elsa Lanchester, Ralph Bunker, Patricia Hilliard, Everley Gregg, Morton Selten', 'NR', 'Donald Glourie shares his crumbling ancestral home with the ghost of his Highland ancestor, Murdoch, who has been condemned to haunt the castle until he avenges a 200-year-old insult from a rival clan. To clear his mounting debts, Donald sells the dilapidated pile to an American businessman, Mr Martin, who has the castle complete with the Glourie ghost transported and rebuilt in Florida. While old-world gentility rubs up comically against 20th-century materialism, Martin''s daughter takes a liking to both Donald and Murdoch, convinced they are one and the same man...', 'Donald Glourie shares his crumbling ancestral home with the ghost of his Highland ancestor, Murdoch, who has been condemned to haunt the castle until he avenges a 200-year-old insult from a rival clan. To clear his mounting debts, Donald sells the dilapidated pile to an American businessman, Mr Martin, who has the castle complete with the Glourie ghost transported and rebuilt in Florida. While old-world gentility rubs up comically against 20th-century materialism, Martin''s daughter takes a liking to both Donald and Murdoch, convinced they are one and the same man...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zT8v1fXrs1SpttBzXVamPjfBqRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132263'),
  ('887681650727562477', 'The Ghost in the Invisible Bikini', 1966, 'Music, Comedy, Horror', 'Don Weis, Stanley Cortez, Clark L. Paylow', 'Louis M. Heyward, Elwood Ullman', 'Tommy Kirk, Deborah Walley, Aron Kincaid, Quinn O''Hara, Jesse White, Harvey Lembeck, Nancy Sinatra, Claudia Martini', 'NR', 'A corpse has 24 hours to mastermind a good deed without leaving his crypt, to go "up there" and have his youth restored.', 'A corpse has 24 hours to mastermind a good deed without leaving his crypt, to go "up there" and have his youth restored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQi7TMOoFHF0J3DIojK9FKX2pQT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86343'),
  ('100158862827949835', 'The Ghost of Flight 401', 1978, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Steven Hilliard Stern, Howard Schwartz', null, 'Ernest Borgnine, Gary Lockwood, Tina Chen, Kim Basinger, Tom Clancy, Howard Hesseman, Russell Johnson, Robert F. Lyons', null, 'An aircraft crashes in the Florida Everglades, killing 103 passengers. After the wreckage is removed, salvageable parts from the plane are used to repair other aircraft. Soon passengers and crew on those aircraft report seeing what they believe to be the ghost of the wrecked airplane''s flight engineer.', 'An aircraft crashes in the Florida Everglades, killing 103 passengers. After the wreckage is removed, salvageable parts from the plane are used to repair other aircraft. Soon passengers and crew on those aircraft report seeing what they believe to be the ghost of the wrecked airplane''s flight engineer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxHCCQCNHX4IKsydgV0X368wHsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72111'),
  ('560954890897656283', 'The Ghost of Frankenstein', 1942, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Elwood Bredell, Erle C. Kenton, Milton Krasner', 'Scott Darling', 'Cedric Hardwicke, Ralph Bellamy, Lionel Atwill, Bela Lugosi, Evelyn Ankers, Lon Chaney Jr., Janet Ann Gallow, Barton Yarborough', null, 'Frankenstein''s unscrupulous colleague, Dr. Bohmer, plans to transplant Ygor''s brain so he can rule the world using the monster''s body, but the plan goes sour when he turns malevolent and goes on a rampage.', 'Frankenstein''s unscrupulous colleague, Dr. Bohmer, plans to transplant Ygor''s brain so he can rule the world using the monster''s body, but the plan goes sour when he turns malevolent and goes on a rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGKJ2kjNXHCLyWKMx3b8D5kKCag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3074'),
  ('844093388481356530', 'The Ghost of Lord Farquaad', 2003, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Simon J. Smith', 'David Lipman', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, John Lithgow, Conrad Vernon, Christopher Knights, Cody Cameron', null, 'Lord Farquaad was eaten by the dragon, but his ghost has returned, and he''s still evil. With the help of his henchman, Thelonious, he kidnaps Fiona. Shrek and the donkey set out to save her, with help from the dragon, before she goes over a waterfall on a raft. This entry is for the 2-D version released on, for example, DVD and Netflix.', 'Lord Farquaad was eaten by the dragon, but his ghost has returned, and he''s still evil. With the help of his henchman, Thelonious, he kidnaps Fiona. Shrek and the donkey set out to save her, with help from the dragon, before she goes over a waterfall on a raft. This entry is for the 2-D version released on, for example, DVD and Netflix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yyGjJ0Og9LrM9XQ35quIhZpZiQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25523'),
  ('1145261035788742528', 'The Ghost of Sierra de Cobre', 1964, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Conrad Hall, Joseph Stefano, Gregg Peters', 'Joseph Stefano', 'Martin Landau, Judith Anderson, Diane Baker, Tom Simcox, Nellie Burt, Leonard Stone, Priscilla Morrill, Dolores Starr', null, 'Terrified of being buried alive, a woman installs a phone in her crypt. A few days after her death, the phone suddenly rings and paranormal investigator Nelson Orion is brought in to probe the case.', 'Terrified of being buried alive, a woman installs a phone in her crypt. A few days after her death, the phone suddenly rings and paranormal investigator Nelson Orion is brought in to probe the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8K91pVWEF1Ih5Jhs5xWRjv5PFVr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467925'),
  ('695988356576508315', 'The Ghost of St. Michael''s', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Varnel', 'John Dighton, Angus MacPhail', 'Will Hay, Claude Hulbert, Felix Aylmer, Raymond Huntley, Charles Mortimer, Charles Hawtrey, John Laurie, Manning Whiley', null, 'Will Hay, back in his role as a hapless teacher, is hired by a grim school in remotest Scotland. The school soon starts to be haunted by a legendary ghost, whose spectral bagpipes signal the death of one of the staff. Hay, assisted by Claude Hulbert and Charles Hawtrey, has to unravel the mystery before he becomes the next victim.', 'Will Hay, back in his role as a hapless teacher, is hired by a grim school in remotest Scotland. The school soon starts to be haunted by a legendary ghost, whose spectral bagpipes signal the death of one of the staff. Hay, assisted by Claude Hulbert and Charles Hawtrey, has to unravel the mystery before he becomes the next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YD6HcChELFpOTd0Fbgkf5pmupJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115170'),
  ('931087355965325959', 'The Ghost of Yotsuya', 1959, 'Horror', 'Nobuo Nakagawa, Tadashi Nishimoto, Yoshihiro Ishikawa', 'Masayoshi Ônuki, Yoshihiro Ishikawa', 'Shigeru Amachi, Noriko Kitazawa, Katsuko Wakasugi, Shuntarō Emi, Ryūzaburō Nakamura, Junko Ikeuchi, Jun Ōtomo, Hiroshi Hayashi', null, 'This horror tale adapts the Japanese legend which tells of a man who faces the consequences of betraying his wife in order to acquire wealth and power.', 'This horror tale adapts the Japanese legend which tells of a man who faces the consequences of betraying his wife in order to acquire wealth and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZMPk7bZo1YE6eStUebqkYio9xd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84508'),
  ('363719136512253021', 'The Ghost Ship', 1943, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Mark Robson, Nicholas Musuraca, Ruby Rosenberg', 'Donald Henderson Clarke', 'Richard Dix, Russell Wade, Edith Barrett, Ben Bard, Edmund Glover, Sir Lancelot, Lawrence Tierney, Dewey Robinson', 'NR', 'Captain Stone''s newly recruited officer, Tom Merriam, idolizes his senior who treats him like a friend. But when a couple of his crew members die mysteriously, Tom starts doubting Stone''s authority.', 'Captain Stone''s newly recruited officer, Tom Merriam, idolizes his senior who treats him like a friend. But when a couple of his crew members die mysteriously, Tom starts doubting Stone''s authority.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ix6GofmJIfZYUk3uw9OK0JrpXeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40765'),
  ('261933048966828779', 'The Ghost Station', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jeong Yong-ki, Seo Ho-yeong, Sun Sang-jae', 'Koji Shiraishi, Hiroshi Takahashi', 'Kim Bo-ra, Kim Jae-hyun, Shin So-yul, Oh Jin-seok, Kim Kang-il, Kim Soo-jin, Kim Kwang-hyun, Kim Koo-taek', null, 'Reporter Na-yeong and her partner investigate a series of mysterious deaths and a perplexing case where her source was allegedly already dead at the time of their interview. Together they end up confronting a terrifying truth.', 'Reporter Na-yeong and her partner investigate a series of mysterious deaths and a perplexing case where her source was allegedly already dead at the time of their interview. Together they end up confronting a terrifying truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gx5dkBdGSFCijowANbLF5Ew7mOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844386'),
  ('25832032909794224', 'The Ghost Story: Lotus the Beauty', 2009, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Fung Yip', null, 'Sophie Ngan Chin-Man, Lily Chung Suk-Wai, Chim Bing-Hei', null, '"Hua Gu Zi": An Sheng is a very kind-hearted gentleman. Once, he gave birth to an old musk deer by chance. The old musk deer''s daughter, Hua Gu Zi, deeply remembered the favor of saving his life. One day, An Sheng got lost in the woods and accidentally broke into a maze set up by a snake spirit, where he unfortunately died. In order to repay her kindness, Hua Gu Zi killed the snake spirit and saved An Sheng. "The Third Lady of Lotus": Teacher Zong Xiangruo loved lotus very much, but he accidentally married a fox girl who had cultivated into a spirit. The fox girl was suppressed by the wandering monk and was imprisoned. Zong Xiangruo couldn''t bear to see the fox girl suffer, so he begged the monk to release the fox girl. In order to repay Zong Xiangruo, the fox girl led Zong Xiangruo to find the Third Lady of Lotus, whom he had been dreaming about, and facilitated a beautiful marriage.', '"Hua Gu Zi": An Sheng is a very kind-hearted gentleman. Once, he gave birth to an old musk deer by chance. The old musk deer''s daughter, Hua Gu Zi, deeply remembered the favor of saving his life. One day, An Sheng got lost in the woods and accidentally broke into a maze set up by a snake spirit, where he unfortunately died. In order to repay her kindness, Hua Gu Zi killed the snake spirit and saved An Sheng. "The Third Lady of Lotus": Teacher Zong Xiangruo loved lotus very much, but he accidentally married a fox girl who had cultivated into a spirit. The fox girl was suppressed by the wandering monk and was imprisoned. Zong Xiangruo couldn''t bear to see the fox girl suffer, so he begged the monk to release the fox girl. In order to repay Zong Xiangruo, the fox girl led Zong Xiangruo to find the Third Lady of Lotus, whom he had been dreaming about, and facilitated a beautiful marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBCgpndOpHmmih2GRzclpHbpmIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404149'),
  ('1126865040834740284', 'The Ghost That Never Returns', 1930, 'Drama', 'Abram Room, Dmitriy Feldman', 'Valentin Turkin', 'Boris Ferdinandov, A. Filippov, Karl Gurnyak, Dmitriy Kara-Dmitriev, Ivan Lavrov, A. Repin, Maksim Shtraukh, Gavriil Terekhov', null, 'The rebel leader Jose Real is allowed to leave prison for one day to visit his family. But it is a ruse to make him reveal the whereabouts of his rebel gang. This existential drama disguised as a saga about the proletarian struggle presents a lonely and insecure individual who is challenged to act more heroically than he is prepared to, but who constantly questions his confidence and loyalties.', 'The rebel leader Jose Real is allowed to leave prison for one day to visit his family. But it is a ruse to make him reveal the whereabouts of his rebel gang. This existential drama disguised as a saga about the proletarian struggle presents a lonely and insecure individual who is challenged to act more heroically than he is prepared to, but who constantly questions his confidence and loyalties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucacYXyCzsHR5eJsY8Y3G2g4Fwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128383'),
  ('1141314335982880464', 'The Ghost Train', 1941, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Walter Forde, Jack E. Cox', 'J.O.C. Orton, Arnold Ridley, Marriott Edgar', 'Arthur Askey, Richard Murdoch, Kathleen Harrison, Peter Murray-Hill, Carole Lynne, Morland Graham, Betty Jardine, Stuart Latham', null, 'Mismatched travellers are stranded overnight at a lonely rural railway station. They soon learn of local superstition about a phantom train which is said to travel these parts at dead of night, carrying ghosts from a long-ago train wreck in the area.', 'Mismatched travellers are stranded overnight at a lonely rural railway station. They soon learn of local superstition about a phantom train which is said to travel these parts at dead of night, carrying ghosts from a long-ago train wreck in the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHpUL7rUjAGHcKJmzoQcnsphanU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29609'),
