  ('983851923312858010', 'The Ghost Writer', 2010, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Roman Polanski, Paweł Edelman, David Scheunemann', 'Robert Harris, Roman Polanski', 'Ewan McGregor, Pierce Brosnan, Kim Cattrall, Olivia Williams, Tom Wilkinson, Timothy Hutton, Jon Bernthal, Tim Preece', 'PG-13', 'A writer stumbles upon a long-hidden secret when he agrees to help former British Prime Minister Adam Lang complete his memoirs on a remote island after the politician''s assistant drowns in a mysterious accident.', 'A writer stumbles upon a long-hidden secret when he agrees to help former British Prime Minister Adam Lang complete his memoirs on a remote island after the politician''s assistant drowns in a mysterious accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK7m2Ba0ieXa37NaAmrx4dfRvvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11439'),
  ('429356605685859677', 'The Ghost Writer', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Paul Wilkins', 'Guy Fee, Paul Wilkins', 'Luke Mably, Brendan Patricks, Matthew Jure, Emma James, Jago Erith, Andrea Deck, Robert Portal, Howard Lee', null, 'A struggling author plagiarizes his deceased father''s undiscovered last novel, unleashing the demons of his dad''s past that he must overcome or be haunted by for the rest of his life.', 'A struggling author plagiarizes his deceased father''s undiscovered last novel, unleashing the demons of his dad''s past that he must overcome or be haunted by for the rest of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQ7ASvRzJ4BlV4iEWFeHYuu6OEU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002258'),
  ('768883798972125051', 'The Ghostmaker', 2011, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mauro Borrelli, Elizabeth McGavock, Vincent Albo', 'Scott Svatos, Mauro Borrelli', 'Aaron Dean Eisenberg, Liz Fenning, J. Walter Holland, Jared Grey, Domiziano Arcangeli, Jeffrey Damnit, Hans Uder, Greg Maness', null, 'A group of college friends discover a 15th century coffin that allows them to experience the world as ghosts. While their first adventures in the spirit world are playful and innocent, the "Box of Shadows" soon brings out the group''s most dangerous impulses and desires. The friends find themselves pulled into a world of evil where they learn the line between life and death is there for a reason.', 'A group of college friends discover a 15th century coffin that allows them to experience the world as ghosts. While their first adventures in the spirit world are playful and innocent, the "Box of Shadows" soon brings out the group''s most dangerous impulses and desires. The friends find themselves pulled into a world of evil where they learn the line between life and death is there for a reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWDX11KWm3Sq2FGs7XUBXeW5fgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122372'),
