  ('897704188429849557', 'The Ghosts of Monday', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Francesco Cinquemani, Peter Stephanou, Pau Mirabet', 'Mark Thompson-Ashworth, Loris Curci, Francesco Cinquemani', 'Julian Sands, Elva Trill, Anthony Skordi, Ioanna Triantafyllidou, Mark Huberman, Flavia Watson, Maria Ioannou, Loris Curci', null, 'A group of US filmmakers travel to Cyprus to film a documentary in the tragically famous Hotel Gula - a once popular resort where more than 100 people died in mysterious circumstances. What begins as just another day at the office will eventually turn into a terrifying journey into the unknown.', 'A group of US filmmakers travel to Cyprus to film a documentary in the tragically famous Hotel Gula - a once popular resort where more than 100 people died in mysterious circumstances. What begins as just another day at the office will eventually turn into a terrifying journey into the unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfY6RW1sNaY5IyO50tWxHEAZX26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977866'),
  ('148529959787741202', 'The Ghosts of Yotsuya', 1956, 'Horror', 'Tatsuo Yamada, Hiroshi Suzuki, Masaki Mōri', 'Hideo Oguni, Torao Tanabe', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Akemi Tsukushi, Chieko Sōma, Haruo Tanaka, Shigeru Ogura, Unpei Yokoyama, Chōko Iida, Kō Mihashi', null, 'Oiwa has been searching for the one who killed her father for a long time. She comes to Yedo and sees a man named Naosuke. The film is based on the kabuki classic: Toukaidou Yotsuya Kaidan (1826) written by Tsuruya Nanboku and is one of the most famous ghost stories throughout Japan.', 'Oiwa has been searching for the one who killed her father for a long time. She comes to Yedo and sees a man named Naosuke. The film is based on the kabuki classic: Toukaidou Yotsuya Kaidan (1826) written by Tsuruya Nanboku and is one of the most famous ghost stories throughout Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgHega8ZEFEHR64t4gBDt29dkm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140508'),
  ('42284810674688783', 'The Ghoul', 1933, 'Horror, Mystery', 'T. Hayes Hunter, R. Lyons, Günther Krampf', 'Roland Pertwee, John Hastings Turner', 'Boris Karloff, Cedric Hardwicke, Ernest Thesiger, Ralph Richardson, Dorothy Hyson, Anthony Bushell, Kathleen Harrison, Harold Huth', 'NR', 'British Egyptologist Professor Morlant seeks immortality through a jewel buried in the tomb of an Oriental idol. Upon his death, Morlant returns to Earth to seek vengeance upon those who removed the jewel from his grave.', 'British Egyptologist Professor Morlant seeks immortality through a jewel buried in the tomb of an Oriental idol. Upon his death, Morlant returns to Earth to seek vengeance upon those who removed the jewel from his grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmMBlNiGLQJRVNGgy8SRnscidUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28046'),
