  ('1035160017670262790', 'The Giant Gila Monster', 1959, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ray Kellogg, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Jay Simms', 'Don Sullivan, Fred Graham, Lisa Simone, Shug Fisher, Bob Thompson, Janice Stone, Ken Knox, Gay McLendon', null, 'A small town in Texas finds itself under attack from a hungry, fifty-foot-long gila monster. No longer content to forage in the desert, the giant lizard begins chomping on motorists and train passengers before descending upon the town itself. Only Chase Winstead, a quick-thinking mechanic, can save the town from being wiped out.', 'A small town in Texas finds itself under attack from a hungry, fifty-foot-long gila monster. No longer content to forage in the desert, the giant lizard begins chomping on motorists and train passengers before descending upon the town itself. Only Chase Winstead, a quick-thinking mechanic, can save the town from being wiped out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7LI2NQ0KtDaVaIYYhZ9PHFDV37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34077'),
