  ('832245963711646714', 'The Gifted Hands', 2013, 'Mystery', 'Kwon Ho-young, Yu Yeong-jong', 'Kwon Ho-Jung, Han Jun-hee, Lee Young-jong', 'Kim Kang-woo, Kim Bum, Esom, Kim Yoo-bin, Park Sung-woong, Seo Hyun-chul, Choi Kyo-sik, Kim Jung-pal', null, 'While investigating the kidnapping and murder of a little girl, a detective spots a piece of graffiti that depicts the crime scene perfectly—but the graffiti was drawn a month before the crime took place, and that the artist knows more than he is telling.', 'While investigating the kidnapping and murder of a little girl, a detective spots a piece of graffiti that depicts the crime scene perfectly—but the graffiti was drawn a month before the crime took place, and that the artist knows more than he is telling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a5ajYpawjv5Ujz5Hf9QeZq3LZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193717'),
  ('1055323897861212124', 'The Gigolo', 2015, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Amen Au Cheuk-Man', 'Amen Au Cheuk-Man', 'Dominic Ho Hou-Man, Candy Yuen, Jeana Ho Pui-Yu, Hazel Tong Chi-Yui, Winnie Leung Man-Yee, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Angelina Lo, Elena Kong Mei-Yee', null, 'Fung looks like a super-heartthrob and was born with a special endowment, making him the high school idol. He was expelled from school when he was caught fighting on campus. When his mom, the sole provider of his family with her poultry business, had to stop working due to her back problems, Fung decides to support his family financially. And from that moment, his life takes on a tumultuous change…', 'Fung looks like a super-heartthrob and was born with a special endowment, making him the high school idol. He was expelled from school when he was caught fighting on campus. When his mom, the sole provider of his family with her poultry business, had to stop working due to her back problems, Fung decides to support his family financially. And from that moment, his life takes on a tumultuous change…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0YIyJc5EtAGciCZsvqsW2QPRAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323260'),
  ('325076479526012096', 'The Gigolo 2', 2016, 'Drama', 'Venus Keung, Venus Keung, Ng King-Man', 'Clement Sze-Kit Cheng, Lung Man-Hong, Kwok Chi-Kin', 'Dominic Ho Hou-Man, Connie Man, Jazz Lam Tsz-Sin, Iris Chung, Leslie Lam, Teresa Mak Ka-Kei, Hazel Tong Chi-Yui, Winnie Leung Man-Yee', null, 'Fung, aka “King of the Gigolos”, is now ‘retired’ and running a nightspot in Hong Kong’s Lan Kwai Fong entertainment district. He takes on a rare new client, Monica, who has reluctantly turned to prostitution to pay her mother’s medical bills. Having been referred to him for carnal guidance after a customer labels her a “dead fish”, Monica inevitably falls for Fung’s charms.', 'Fung, aka “King of the Gigolos”, is now ‘retired’ and running a nightspot in Hong Kong’s Lan Kwai Fong entertainment district. He takes on a rare new client, Monica, who has reluctantly turned to prostitution to pay her mother’s medical bills. Having been referred to him for carnal guidance after a customer labels her a “dead fish”, Monica inevitably falls for Fung’s charms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9rb4RxyUpKlwQFo7UsjuZI63L3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378462'),
  ('728917430902993613', 'The Gigolo Revelation', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Ally Wong', null, 'Lily Lee Lai-Lai, Otomo Rena, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Chui Bo-Lun, Ruby Wong Jo-Yi', null, 'A look at Hong Kong''s nightlife, where gigolos service women.', 'A look at Hong Kong''s nightlife, where gigolos service women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66R0ZIpQr7CEKWcc96R5IJhQ1cv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1055623'),
  ('1140216434117201612', 'The Gilded Cage', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Ruben Alves, André Szankowski', 'Jean-André Yerlès, Hugo Gélin, Ruben Alves', 'Rita Blanco, Joaquim de Almeida, Roland Giraud, Chantal Lauby, Barbara Cabrita, Lannick Gautry, Maria Vieira, Jacqueline Corado', null, 'In the beautiful area of ​​Paris, Maria and José Ribeiro lived for almost thirty years on the ground floor of a Haussmann building, in their dear little lodge.', 'In the beautiful area of ​​Paris, Maria and José Ribeiro lived for almost thirty years on the ground floor of a Haussmann building, in their dear little lodge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rts29kBtuw1xAlNeWMFuZN4WZRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186161'),
  ('564436710622292324', 'The Gilded Lily', 1935, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Wesley Ruggles, Victor Milner', 'Claude Binyon', 'Claudette Colbert, Fred MacMurray, Ray Milland, C. Aubrey Smith, Eddie Craven, Luis Alberni, Forrester Harvey, Grace Bradley', 'NR', 'Secretary Marilyn David falls in love with British aristocrat Charles Gray, to the dismay of her best friend, reporter Peter Dawes, who secretly loves her. When Peter learns that the already-engaged Charles has hurt Marilyn, he fabricates an article casting her as the "No Girl" who refused to marry a callous aristocrat. But when the publicity brings Marilyn unexpected fame, and Charles returns, she is forced to choose between the two men.', 'Secretary Marilyn David falls in love with British aristocrat Charles Gray, to the dismay of her best friend, reporter Peter Dawes, who secretly loves her. When Peter learns that the already-engaged Charles has hurt Marilyn, he fabricates an article casting her as the "No Girl" who refused to marry a callous aristocrat. But when the publicity brings Marilyn unexpected fame, and Charles returns, she is forced to choose between the two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aleyxnXuT5Sa4wutIS54cxX2c98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54773'),
  ('852821591196885084', 'The Gingerbread Man', 1998, 'Thriller', 'Gu Changwei, Robert Altman', 'Clyde Hayes', 'Kenneth Branagh, Embeth Davidtz, Robert Downey Jr., Daryl Hannah, Tom Berenger, Famke Janssen, Mae Whitman, Jesse James', 'R', 'A successful Savannah defense attorney gets romantically involved with a sexy, mysterious waitress troubled by psychopaths and dark family secrets.', 'A successful Savannah defense attorney gets romantically involved with a sexy, mysterious waitress troubled by psychopaths and dark family secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bfWAXuFjsZAslkA2HqFU30OZ2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12488'),
  ('539527453760243521', 'The Gingerdead Man', 2005, 'Fantasy, Horror, Comedy', 'Charles Band, Jethro Rothe-Kushel, Aaron Steele-Nicholson', 'Domonic Muir', 'Gary Busey, Robin Sydney, Ryan Locke, Larry Cedar, Jonathan Chase, Alexia Aleman, Margaret Blye, Newell Alexander', 'NR', 'An evil yet adorable Gingerbread man comes to life with the soul of a convicted killer, and this real life cookie monster wreaks havoc on the girl who sent the killer to the electric chair.', 'An evil yet adorable Gingerbread man comes to life with the soul of a convicted killer, and this real life cookie monster wreaks havoc on the girl who sent the killer to the electric chair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZgIllFk4ncvhuzNipLkStjPjqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27296'),
  ('370441703153372620', 'The Gingko Bed', 1996, 'Fantasy, Action, Romance', 'Kang Je-kyu, Lee Kang-san', 'Kang Je-kyu', 'Han Suk-kyu, Shim Hye-jin, Jin Hee-kyung, Shin Hyun-jun, Kim Hak-cheol, Kim Myeong-kuk, Ryoo Sun-Cheol, Ji Chun-seong', null, 'A young art professor, Su-hyun lives a contented existence with his pretty girlfriend. Things change, however, when he discovers an antique wooden bed in the garbage and brings it home.', 'A young art professor, Su-hyun lives a contented existence with his pretty girlfriend. Things change, however, when he discovers an antique wooden bed in the garbage and brings it home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAB5ltE9SFkuLjlj8OTW37g905X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87859'),
  ('988364905274448377', 'The Girl', 1968, 'Drama', 'Pál Gábor, Péter Zimre, Márta Mészáros', 'Márta Mészáros', 'Kati Kovács, Teri Horváth, Ádám Szirtes, Gábor Agárdy, Zsuzsa Pálos, András Kozák, Harsányi Gábor, Ilona Gurnik', null, 'A young woman leaves a state orphanage to find her mother in this interesting examination of how the overt repression of women in the older pattern of village life has been replaced by the more subtle exploitation inherent in the apparently freer existence of young girls in the contemporary city.', 'A young woman leaves a state orphanage to find her mother in this interesting examination of how the overt repression of women in the older pattern of village life has been replaced by the more subtle exploitation inherent in the apparently freer existence of young girls in the contemporary city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q2qTicIgtYlqbSyFCpjWDG9bpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122095'),
  ('189289071904018051', 'The Girl', 2000, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Sande Zeig, Georges Lechaptois', 'Monique Wittig, Sande Zeig', 'Claire Keim, Agathe de La Boulaye, Cyril Lecomte, Sandra Nkake, Ronald Guttman, Pascal Cervo', 'NR', 'A torrid affair between two women, a struggling artist and a flame-haired blues singer, upsets a man who has a thing for the girl.', 'A torrid affair between two women, a struggling artist and a flame-haired blues singer, upsets a man who has a thing for the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gYkAUY5o9VxMqjYLfXmEl9fThT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144515'),
  ('56064301436261721', 'The Girl', 2009, 'Drama, Family', 'Fredrik Edfeldt, Hoyte van Hoytema', 'Karin Arrhenius', 'Blanca Engström, Shanti Roney, Annika Hallin, Leif Andrée, Calle Lindqvist, Tova Magnusson, Ia Langhammer, Kryštof Hádek', null, 'Story of a ten-year-old girl left alone in her house in the summer of 1981.', 'Story of a ten-year-old girl left alone in her house in the summer of 1981.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ByfjzE1XVnyR3LHaonhTsJgm3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33091'),
  ('679775571497726389', 'The Girl', 2012, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Julian Jarrold, John Pardue', 'Gwyneth Hughes', 'Sienna Miller, Toby Jones, Imelda Staunton, Conrad Kemp, Penelope Wilton, Angelina Ingpen, Candice D''Arcy, Carl Beukes', 'NR', 'Director Alfred Hitchcock is revered as one of the greatest creative minds in the history of cinema. Known for his psychological thrillers, Hitchcock’s leading ladies were cool, beautiful and preferably blonde. One such actress was Tippi Hedren, an unknown fashion model given her big break when Hitchcock’s wife saw her on a TV commercial. Brought to Universal Studios, Hedren was shocked when the director, at the peak of his career, quickly cast her to star in his next feature, 1963’s The Birds. Little did Hedren know that as ambitious and terrifying as the production would be to shoot, the most daunting aspect of the film ended up coming from behind the camera.', 'Director Alfred Hitchcock is revered as one of the greatest creative minds in the history of cinema. Known for his psychological thrillers, Hitchcock’s leading ladies were cool, beautiful and preferably blonde. One such actress was Tippi Hedren, an unknown fashion model given her big break when Hitchcock’s wife saw her on a TV commercial. Brought to Universal Studios, Hedren was shocked when the director, at the peak of his career, quickly cast her to star in his next feature, 1963’s The Birds. Little did Hedren know that as ambitious and terrifying as the production would be to shoot, the most daunting aspect of the film ended up coming from behind the camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LKSvrDqOWGvbE3JPleBrQeo0jO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133557'),
  ('117623382415885430', 'The Girl and the Echo', 1964, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Arūnas Žebriūnas, Algirdas Araminas, Regina Vosyliūtė', 'Arūnas Žebriūnas', 'Lina Braknyte, Valeri Zubarev, Bronius Babkauskas, Kaarel Karm, V. Denas, I. Makarovas, R. Petkevicius, V. Spakovskis', null, 'The movie, based on a story by Yuri Nagibin, depicts a young girl named Vika enjoying the last days of summer vacations in a sea resort somewhere in the south.', 'The movie, based on a story by Yuri Nagibin, depicts a young girl named Vika enjoying the last days of summer vacations in a sea resort somewhere in the south.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFKGfhqLdhTGb5VJSisy8RFS7uR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258631'),
  ('703305147471681211', 'The Girl and the Playboy', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Ebbe Langberg, Henning Bendtsen', 'Peer Guldbrandsen, Carl Ottosen', 'Dirch Passer, Birgitte Price, Paul Hagen, Axel Strøbye, Ove Sprogøe, Jessie Rindom, Karl Stegger, Carl-Gustaf Lindstedt', null, 'A millionaire gets amnesia after a hit to the head and now he has to rediscover his past and decide what kind of man he wants to be in the future.', 'A millionaire gets amnesia after a hit to the head and now he has to rediscover his past and decide what kind of man he wants to be in the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIkkpfA7jOUfFsXYC6Ki1sGlUAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41600'),
  ('1139578824401815949', 'The Girl and the Rapist', 1982, 'Drama', 'Conrado Sanchez', 'Conrado Sanchez', 'Vanessa Alves, Zózimo Bulbul, Jussara Calmon, Rubens Pignatari, Helen Cristiane, Léo Magalhães, Lia Furlin', null, 'In São Paulo, Vanessa who is normally spoiled rotten, is neglected and rejected by her mother, practically raised alone by her butler and driver Pedro and the maid, Dalva. Vanessa has disturbing daydreams and sexual fantasies, but doesn''t let Arlindo, a teenager that flirts with her get close to her. Her best friend is Denise, a promiscuous girl that has intercourse with different men. When Vanessa discloses to Denise her problem, Denise gives the address of her psychotherapist Dr. Artur, to her friend. The unethical shrink pushes Vanessa to the edge, bringing memories of a severe trauma of her childhood. Then the disturbed Dr. Artur induces the girls to commit suicide.', 'In São Paulo, Vanessa who is normally spoiled rotten, is neglected and rejected by her mother, practically raised alone by her butler and driver Pedro and the maid, Dalva. Vanessa has disturbing daydreams and sexual fantasies, but doesn''t let Arlindo, a teenager that flirts with her get close to her. Her best friend is Denise, a promiscuous girl that has intercourse with different men. When Vanessa discloses to Denise her problem, Denise gives the address of her psychotherapist Dr. Artur, to her friend. The unethical shrink pushes Vanessa to the edge, bringing memories of a severe trauma of her childhood. Then the disturbed Dr. Artur induces the girls to commit suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifGJXECrpGXmlNsm5AqRClbiynJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80784'),
  ('931670027488204722', 'The Girl and the Spider', 2021, 'Drama', 'Silvan Zürcher, Nicole Schink, Ramon Zürcher', 'Ramon Zürcher, Silvan Zürcher', 'Henriette Confurius, Liliane Amuat, Ursina Lardi, Flurin Giger, André Hennicke, Ivan Georgiev, Dagna Litzenberger-Vinet, Lea Draeger', null, 'Lisa is moving. Upheaval all around: Her mother flirts with a handyman. An eccentric woman seems to be preparing for a glamorous event, a family next door returns from vacation, and a girl documents the adventurous day. As boxes are transported, walls painted white, and furniture is assembled, underlying problems in need of fixing are revealed, a to-do list expands, and desires and needs flair up.', 'Lisa is moving. Upheaval all around: Her mother flirts with a handyman. An eccentric woman seems to be preparing for a glamorous event, a family next door returns from vacation, and a girl documents the adventurous day. As boxes are transported, walls painted white, and furniture is assembled, underlying problems in need of fixing are revealed, a to-do list expands, and desires and needs flair up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tBtcy3vidUUvKm0MU29dyvfxQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517815'),
  ('1099910797354593304', 'The Girl and the Wooden Horse Torture', 1982, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Fumihiko Katō, Kazumi Sugimoto, Yasuhiro Horiuchi', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Serina Nishikawa, Waka Oda, Anri Megumi, Shirō Shimomoto, Hideo Shirayama, Yoko Ishido, Ryoichi Kusanagi, Asami Ogawa', null, 'A seemly ordinary high school girl tormented by masochistic visions gets involved with a teacher who harbours a secret passion for her.', 'A seemly ordinary high school girl tormented by masochistic visions gets involved with a teacher who harbours a secret passion for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkwglTUH6k7fgufdv1HeqUNodH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185648'),
  ('21501871536135493', 'The Girl by the Lake', 2007, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Andrea Molaioli, Ramiro Civita, Ciro Scognamiglio', 'Sandro Petraglia', 'Toni Servillo, Valeria Golino, Fabrizio Gifuni, Anna Bonaiuto, Omero Antonutti, Marco Baliani, Denis Fasolo, Sara D''Amario', 'R', 'A cop investigates the murder of a beautiful teen girl left naked by a lake.', 'A cop investigates the murder of a beautiful teen girl left naked by a lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUBjWE92xXj0JWxnYvsPB7CFyyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42411'),
  ('495407923554044936', 'The Girl Can''t Help It', 1956, 'Comedy, Music', 'Frank Tashlin, Leon Shamroy, Ad Schaumer', 'Frank Tashlin, Herbert Baker', 'Tom Ewell, Jayne Mansfield, Edmond O''Brien, Henry Jones, Julie London, Barry Gordon, Ray Anthony, John Emery', null, 'A down-and-out gangster hires a down-on-his-luck agent to make his girlfriend a recording star within six weeks.', 'A down-and-out gangster hires a down-on-his-luck agent to make his girlfriend a recording star within six weeks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eN8PI9qc0dkZ19qiv2cTm6hygMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42839'),
  ('1089894676431563894', 'The Girl Chewing Gum', 1976, 'Drama', 'John Smith', null, null, null, 'At Stamford Road in Dalston Junction of east London, the camera follows pedestrians, cars and birds while a narrator, who appears to be the director behind the camera, seems to instruct the objects.', 'At Stamford Road in Dalston Junction of east London, the camera follows pedestrians, cars and birds while a narrator, who appears to be the director behind the camera, seems to instruct the objects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRqUwZCdfyTlVrymIdpwFwOgJ7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49485'),
  ('1017127685514634803', 'The Girl From Ipanema: Astrud Gilberto, Queen of Bossa Nova', 2026, 'Documentary, Biography, Music', 'Antoine Baldassari, Véronique Mortaigne', 'Antoine Baldassari', 'Astrud Gilberto, João Gilberto, Marcos Valle, Edu Lobo, Roberto Menescal', null, 'The Girl from Ipanema charts the progress of bossa nova (new wave), and the Brazilian singer Astrud Gilberto''s musical development and rise to fame. Best of all, at the end of the documentary the mature Astrud answers the question that must surely be on every viewer''s mind: Was she sick to death of singing The Girl from Ipanema?', 'The Girl from Ipanema charts the progress of bossa nova (new wave), and the Brazilian singer Astrud Gilberto''s musical development and rise to fame. Best of all, at the end of the documentary the mature Astrud answers the question that must surely be on every viewer''s mind: Was she sick to death of singing The Girl from Ipanema?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1SvC0Uk731d7MA5kMe87ortE0pH.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-girl-from-ipanema-astrud-gilberto-reine-de-la-bossa-nova-2026'),
  ('1076307788597112847', 'The Girl from Missouri', 1934, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jack Conway, Douglas Shearer, Ray June', 'John Emerson, Anita Loos', 'Jean Harlow, Lionel Barrymore, Franchot Tone, Lewis Stone, Patsy Kelly, Alan Mowbray, Clara Blandick, Hale Hamilton', 'NR', 'Leaving Missouri to find a wealthy husband in New York City, Eadie Chapman becomes a chorus girl and soon entertains at the lavish home of millionaire Frank Cousins. Cousins proposes to Eadie, only to then commit suicide due to bankruptcy. Fellow millionaire T. R. Paige defends Eadie when the police question her for having Cousins'' jewelry -- but when she becomes enamored with his son, Tom, Paige declares Eadie a gold digger.', 'Leaving Missouri to find a wealthy husband in New York City, Eadie Chapman becomes a chorus girl and soon entertains at the lavish home of millionaire Frank Cousins. Cousins proposes to Eadie, only to then commit suicide due to bankruptcy. Fellow millionaire T. R. Paige defends Eadie when the police question her for having Cousins'' jewelry -- but when she becomes enamored with his son, Tom, Paige declares Eadie a gold digger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXYWwXcABj84FGhGp11gST4Pvxi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121003'),
  ('90138461819916890', 'The Girl from Monaco', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anne Fontaine, Patrick Blossier', 'Benoît Graffin, Anne Fontaine', 'Fabrice Luchini, Roschdy Zem, Louise Bourgoin, Stéphane Audran, Gilles Cohen, Alexandre Steiger, Philippe Duclos, Jeanne Balibar', 'R', 'A brilliant and neurotic attorney goes to Monaco to defend a famous criminal. But, instead of focusing on the case, he falls for a beautiful she-devil, who turns him into a complete wreck... Hopefully, his zealous bodyguard will step in and put everything back in order... Or will he ?', 'A brilliant and neurotic attorney goes to Monaco to defend a famous criminal. But, instead of focusing on the case, he falls for a beautiful she-devil, who turns him into a complete wreck... Hopefully, his zealous bodyguard will step in and put everything back in order... Or will he ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAe375gjZjrBkbfL4cS6k9R2Ffk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15342'),
  ('64490272818220323', 'The Girl from Nowhere', 2013, 'Drama, Horror', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau, David Chambille, Virginie Legeay', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau, Virginie Legeay, Claude Morel, Lise Bellynck, Sébastien Bailly, Anne Berry, Emmanuel Noblet', null, 'Michel, a retired math teacher, has lived alone since his wife’s death and occupies his time writing an essay about the beliefs that shape daily life. One day he comes across Dora, a young homeless woman, who shows up injured on his doorstep, and puts her up until she recovers. Her presence brings something new to Michel’s life, but gradually the apartment becomes the site of mysterious happenings.', 'Michel, a retired math teacher, has lived alone since his wife’s death and occupies his time writing an essay about the beliefs that shape daily life. One day he comes across Dora, a young homeless woman, who shows up injured on his doorstep, and puts her up until she recovers. Her presence brings something new to Michel’s life, but gradually the apartment becomes the site of mysterious happenings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owfUSK1VmrC4rlTufC7k3YL2NPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153820'),
  ('999066711637102529', 'The Girl from Paris', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christian Carion, Antoine Héberlé, Nicolas Cambois', 'Christian Carion, Eric Assous', 'Michel Serrault, Mathilde Seigner, Jean-Paul Roussillon, Frédéric Pierrot, Marc Berman, Françoise Bette, Christophe Rossignon, Roland Chalosse', null, 'A woman in her thirties gets tired of life in Paris and decides to leave and become a farmer.', 'A woman in her thirties gets tired of life in Paris and decides to leave and become a farmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muykQb9inG47Wi0Cs9FsV91PgT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33302'),
  ('1000562378845558759', 'The Girl from Parma', 1963, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Antonio Pietrangeli, Marcello Ugolini, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Antonio Pietrangeli, Stefano Strucchi, Ruggero Maccari', 'Nino Manfredi, Catherine Spaak, Didi Perego, Salvo Randone, Lando Buzzanca, Vanni De Maigret, Rosalia Maggio, Umberto D''Orsi', null, 'Dora, driven away from her town by malicious gossip following her first love affair, has a series of short-lived adventures until she falls in love with Nino, a small time crook. In Parma, a police officer courts her but she keeps thinking of Nino.', 'Dora, driven away from her town by malicious gossip following her first love affair, has a series of short-lived adventures until she falls in love with Nino, a small time crook. In Parma, a police officer courts her but she keeps thinking of Nino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOzPKXNhMXc6mymUhVEI68FYAhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221527'),
  ('1010999138878174863', 'The Girl from Petrovka', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Ellis Miller, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Chris Bryant, Allan Scott', 'Goldie Hawn, Hal Holbrook, Anthony Hopkins, Grégoire Aslan, Anton Dolin, Bruno Wintzell, Zoran Andrić, Hanna Landy', 'PG', 'A beautiful Russian ballerina falls in love with an American news correspondent. The KGB is most displeased and does everything it can to break them up.', 'A beautiful Russian ballerina falls in love with an American news correspondent. The KGB is most displeased and does everything it can to break them up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCrir2dXPvJXCa2yiFaE1puZUcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62376'),
