  ('93835550250093994', 'The Girl from Starship Venus', 1975, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Derek Ford, Roy Pointer', 'Derek Ford', 'Monika Ringwald, Mark Jones, Andrew Grant, Tony Kenyon, David Rayner, Beatrice Shaw, Michael Cronin, Dave Carter', 'R', 'A young Venusian girl lands on Earth to explore the planet. She lands in Soho in London, UK where she has ample opportunities to research sex on Earth.', 'A young Venusian girl lands on Earth to explore the planet. She lands in Soho in London, UK where she has ample opportunities to research sex on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDoUt1NgNZ6Hmflg4gkumQmBgkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81931'),
  ('268299291976619090', 'The Girl From The Marsh Croft', 1934, 'Drama', 'Muhsin Ertuğrul', 'Nazım Hikmet Ran', 'Cahide Sonku, Talat Artemel, Feriha Tevfik, Sait Köknar, Behzat Haki Butak, İsmail Galip Arcan, Mahmut Moralı, Hâzım Körmükçü', null, 'Aysel, while working for the strong Satilmiszade family, is seduced by her boss and becomes pregnant. Giving birth to the child, she applies to the court for alimony, but the father rejects the child. Ali, from another village is concerned with her situation, and he offers her a job: to accompany his disabled mother.', 'Aysel, while working for the strong Satilmiszade family, is seduced by her boss and becomes pregnant. Giving birth to the child, she applies to the court for alimony, but the father rejects the child. Ali, from another village is concerned with her situation, and he offers her a job: to accompany his disabled mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6b2DWyejHVyxpnAFLZm6wdTjbp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270051'),
  ('1010330678510627937', 'The Girl from the Other Side', 2019, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Takeru Yokoi, Shoji Hata, Yutaro Kubo', 'Satomi Maiya, Yutaro Kubo', null, null, 'Touch not the Outsiders, lest ye become an Outsider. But when two creatures belonging to opposite kinds - a lost little girl from the Inside and a demonic beast-looking Outsider - initiate an impossible coexistence on the same side of the forest, their bond seems to transcend their incompatible natures and the unnamed curse that has divided the world.', 'Touch not the Outsiders, lest ye become an Outsider. But when two creatures belonging to opposite kinds - a lost little girl from the Inside and a demonic beast-looking Outsider - initiate an impossible coexistence on the same side of the forest, their bond seems to transcend their incompatible natures and the unnamed curse that has divided the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wupjbTnf0G0GWeK9fKNhqBbDayc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587873'),
  ('143912444838649999', 'The Girl from the Other Side', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Namiko Torii, Shoji Hata, Takeru Yokoi', 'Satomi Maiya, Yutaro Kubo', 'Jun Fukuyama, Rie Takahashi, Hiroki Goto, Tadashi Miyazawa, Kouichi Sakaguchi, Daiki Kobayashi, Kento Shiraishi, Kazuya Saji', null, 'Once upon a time, in a far, faraway place, there were two lands. The world was divided into an inner land and an outer land. People feared the outer land, inhabited by eerie beings, the carriers of curse. One day, on the border to the inner land inhabited by humans, one such being finds a girl on heaps of abandoned dead bodies. The girl says her name is Shiva and shows affection to the "being" who found her, calling him "Teacher." This is a story of two people—one human, one inhuman—who linger in the hazy twilight that separates night from day.', 'Once upon a time, in a far, faraway place, there were two lands. The world was divided into an inner land and an outer land. People feared the outer land, inhabited by eerie beings, the carriers of curse. One day, on the border to the inner land inhabited by humans, one such being finds a girl on heaps of abandoned dead bodies. The girl says her name is Shiva and shows affection to the "being" who found her, calling him "Teacher." This is a story of two people—one human, one inhuman—who linger in the hazy twilight that separates night from day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tSAF374WDBBcvFM7Qe6i205gSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802699'),
  ('280781812530327120', 'The Girl from the Song', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ibai Abad, Guillem Manzanares', 'Natalia Durán, Elisabet Mainez', 'Lewis Rainer, Joséphine Berry, Charlotte Atkinson, Charlie MacGechan, Rory Nolan, Sion Tudor Owen, Adam Quintero, Phoebe Farnham', null, 'A young musician travels to Burning Man, a psychedelic festival in the middle of the Nevada desert, in an attempt to get the impetuous girl he has fallen in love with.', 'A young musician travels to Burning Man, a psychedelic festival in the middle of the Nevada desert, in an attempt to get the impetuous girl he has fallen in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkPhyfQzfKvQcEokZAyhYoQCC9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454774'),
  ('307819169091674981', 'The Girl from the South', 2012, 'Documentary', 'José Luis García', null, 'Im Su-kyong, Alejandro Kim', null, 'Twenty years after peace activist Im Su-kyong swore that she would cross the border between North and South Korea on foot, Argentine documentary filmmaker José Luis García goes in search of the young woman who was once known as "The Flower of Reunification." (TIFF)', 'Twenty years after peace activist Im Su-kyong swore that she would cross the border between North and South Korea on foot, Argentine documentary filmmaker José Luis García goes in search of the young woman who was once known as "The Flower of Reunification." (TIFF)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62tMrl21g6AegSD2EemvdsOYcK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127921'),
  ('654006448696149030', 'The Girl From Tomorrow', 2023, 'Drama', 'Marta Savina', 'Marta Savina', 'Claudia Gusmano, Fabrizio Ferracane, Francesco Colella, Manuela Ventura, Dario Aita, Thony, Maziar Firouzi, Francesco Giulio Cerilli', null, 'It’s 1965 and Lia, a spirited young woman living in a small Sicilian town, is initially attracted to Lorenzo, the son of the most prominent (and possibly Mafia-tied) local family. His possessiveness eventually repels her. But soon after, he appears with his cronies to kidnap, rape and force her into a shotgun marriage, all with the collusion of the town’s authorities. Lia and her family refuse to accept this barbaric ‘tradition’ and, despite the constant intimidation and violence, they take their fight for Lia’s rights to court.', 'It’s 1965 and Lia, a spirited young woman living in a small Sicilian town, is initially attracted to Lorenzo, the son of the most prominent (and possibly Mafia-tied) local family. His possessiveness eventually repels her. But soon after, he appears with his cronies to kidnap, rape and force her into a shotgun marriage, all with the collusion of the town’s authorities. Lia and her family refuse to accept this barbaric ‘tradition’ and, despite the constant intimidation and violence, they take their fight for Lia’s rights to court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azAjwDZu3ogIKjKD9evWXZARLOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882005'),
  ('325310603210487760', 'The Girl from Trieste', 1982, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Alfio Contini', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Ottavio Jemma', 'Ben Gazzara, Ornella Muti, Mimsy Farmer, Jean-Claude Brialy, Andréa Ferréol, William Berger, Romano Puppo, Bianca Toso', null, 'A middle-aged artist (Ben Gazarra) sketching on the beach witnesses a young woman (Ornella Muti) being rescued from drowning. He loans her a blanket. Later she returns the blanket and they have sex several times, but she always leaves right afterward, leaving the man to wonder who she is and where she goes. Things become more complicated as he begins to fall in love with her, and after his regular girlfriend (Mimsy Farmer), with whom he has a curiously open relationship, returns. He eventually begins to realize his mysterious new lover may be very much insane.', 'A middle-aged artist (Ben Gazarra) sketching on the beach witnesses a young woman (Ornella Muti) being rescued from drowning. He loans her a blanket. Later she returns the blanket and they have sex several times, but she always leaves right afterward, leaving the man to wonder who she is and where she goes. Things become more complicated as he begins to fall in love with her, and after his regular girlfriend (Mimsy Farmer), with whom he has a curiously open relationship, returns. He eventually begins to realize his mysterious new lover may be very much insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdDvxZ9JdO8h1bUqpXQaYTHf6t5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64560'),
  ('494673347282879355', 'The Girl Has Flown', 2021, 'Drama', 'Sophie Chiarello, Sandro Chessa, Wilma Labate', 'Fabio D''Innocenzo, Damiano D''Innocenzo, Wilma Labate', 'Alma Noce, Luka Zunic, Rossana Mortara, Massimo Somaglino, Livia Rossi', null, 'Nadia is an apathetic 16-year-old girl with no friends of sorts, in or outside school. One day, she takes a walk with local no-good Brando, and the boy rapes her. From that moment on, Nadia''s life changes forever.', 'Nadia is an apathetic 16-year-old girl with no friends of sorts, in or outside school. One day, she takes a walk with local no-good Brando, and the boy rapes her. From that moment on, Nadia''s life changes forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQOu7nXcBR7W0Eaeql0XOo9lxsi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816213'),
  ('695019661424331138', 'The Girl Hunters', 1963, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Kenneth Talbot, Roy Rowland', 'Mickey Spillane, Roy Rowland, Robert Fellows', 'Mickey Spillane, Shirley Eaton, Lloyd Nolan, Scott Peters, Hy Gardner, Guy Kingsley Poynter, James Dyrenforth, Murray Kash', 'NR', 'Mickey Spillane plays his own creation, street-thug-turned-PI Mike Hammer, in this 1963 adaptation of his novel. The film opens with Hammer on the downside of a years-long bender, scooped out of the gutter by a bitter cop intent on prying information from a dying man. Inspired to clean up his act by the secrets he hears, Hammer hits the streets on a personal crusade to find the love of his life. Future Bond girl Shirley Eaton costars as a glamorous society widow who goes slumming with Hammer.--Sean Axmaker', 'Mickey Spillane plays his own creation, street-thug-turned-PI Mike Hammer, in this 1963 adaptation of his novel. The film opens with Hammer on the downside of a years-long bender, scooped out of the gutter by a bitter cop intent on prying information from a dying man. Inspired to clean up his act by the secrets he hears, Hammer hits the streets on a personal crusade to find the love of his life. Future Bond girl Shirley Eaton costars as a glamorous society widow who goes slumming with Hammer.--Sean Axmaker', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdtlR85mBI4ZcNrAqmvNsFiAd4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95345'),
  ('646131864428187689', 'The Girl in a Swing', 1988, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gordon Hessler, Claus Loof, Otto Stenov', 'Gordon Hessler', 'Meg Tilly, Rupert Frazer, Nicholas Le Prevost, Elspet Gray, Lynsey Baxter, Jean Boht, Lorna Heilbron, Hanne Borchsenius', 'R', 'A London art broker goes to Copenhagen where he requires the services of a secretary fluent in Danish, English, and German. He falls deeply in love with the woman, despite the fact that he knows virtually nothing about her. She insists on not being married in a church, and after they are married, some bad things from her past begin surfacing in subtly supernatural ways, and he must find the best way to deal with them without destroying their relationship.', 'A London art broker goes to Copenhagen where he requires the services of a secretary fluent in Danish, English, and German. He falls deeply in love with the woman, despite the fact that he knows virtually nothing about her. She insists on not being married in a church, and after they are married, some bad things from her past begin surfacing in subtly supernatural ways, and he must find the best way to deal with them without destroying their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4T5l7RUhZ6TJsGaRjSKxmIIC9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41969'),
  ('389737236925398322', 'The Girl in Black Stockings', 1957, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Howard W. Koch, William Margulies, Don Torpin', 'Richard H. Landau', 'Lex Barker, Anne Bancroft, Mamie Van Doren, Ron Randell, Marie Windsor, John Dehner, John Holland, Diana Van der Vlis', null, 'Residents at a posh Utah hotel become suspects when a girl is found murdered during a pool party. Local sheriff Jess Holmes takes charge of the investigation and must discover who among the terrified guests and staff -- including bodacious vixen Harriet Ames, the hotel''s bitter, crippled proprietor, visiting lawyer David Hewson and his secretary, Beth -- is the culprit, even as murders continue to take place.', 'Residents at a posh Utah hotel become suspects when a girl is found murdered during a pool party. Local sheriff Jess Holmes takes charge of the investigation and must discover who among the terrified guests and staff -- including bodacious vixen Harriet Ames, the hotel''s bitter, crippled proprietor, visiting lawyer David Hewson and his secretary, Beth -- is the culprit, even as murders continue to take place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0d9ZLInWvzoczOc3Flg7GL5zPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62033'),
  ('894099084892344874', 'The Girl in Lovers Lane', 1960, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Edward Cronjager, Charles R. Rondeau, C.M. Florance', 'Jo Heims', 'Brett Halsey, Jack Elam, Joyce Meadows, Lowell Brown, Emile Meyer, Selette Cole, Bill Coontz, Del Monroe', 'NR', 'Two drifters contend with love and murder in a small town.', 'Two drifters contend with love and murder in a small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVDAYfzKfAihA14ssPDwDlWNuCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89763'),
  ('346149597347484763', 'The Girl in Mourning', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Summers, Pilar Miró, Francisco Fraile', 'Manuel Summers', 'Alfredo Landa, María José Alfonso, Pilar Gómez Ferrer, Vicente Llosá, José Vicente Cerrudo, Carmen Santonja, Doris Kent, Mercedes Huete', null, 'Rocio and Raphael are a young couple from a small Spanish town. Rocio must mourn the death of a relative for six months and is forbidden to see Raphael. Very much in love, they are frustrated by the old-fashioned customs of their village. When they can finally see each other, the two plan to soon marry. Unfortunately, the girl''s grandfather dies and she must start the process of mourning all over again. This time Raphael begs her to rebel against her family and the villagers, but she refuses for fear of persecution. When Rocio has had enough of putting her own happiness aside, she decides to run away with Raphael in spite of what her family will say. Things do not go as planned, however, when yet another family member passes away.', 'Rocio and Raphael are a young couple from a small Spanish town. Rocio must mourn the death of a relative for six months and is forbidden to see Raphael. Very much in love, they are frustrated by the old-fashioned customs of their village. When they can finally see each other, the two plan to soon marry. Unfortunately, the girl''s grandfather dies and she must start the process of mourning all over again. This time Raphael begs her to rebel against her family and the villagers, but she refuses for fear of persecution. When Rocio has had enough of putting her own happiness aside, she decides to run away with Raphael in spite of what her family will say. Things do not go as planned, however, when yet another family member passes away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJIYEmLD34ZMfZHnZRccf0xNmuC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198831'),
  ('770794269954392546', 'The Girl in Room 2A', 1974, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'William Rose, Giorgio Montagnani', 'William Rose', 'Daniela Giordano, Raf Vallone, John Scanlon, Angelo Infanti, Karin Schubert, Rosalba Neri, Brad Harris, Giovanna Galletti', 'R', 'A sadistic killer cult kidnaps and sacrifices beautiful women. A young girl, just paroled from prison, moves into a strange house and appears to be the cult''s next victim.', 'A sadistic killer cult kidnaps and sacrifices beautiful women. A young girl, just paroled from prison, moves into a strange house and appears to be the cult''s next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRTFkaPvnotXROtk30KVC04arcW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97527'),
  ('1064732839675201326', 'The Girl in the Bathtub', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Karen Moncrieff, Thomas M. Harting', 'Karen Moncrieff', 'Caitlin Stasey, Kate Isaac, Warren Abbott, Bethany Brown, Paul Campbell, Glynis Davies, Lisa Marie DiGiacinto, Dominic Downer', null, 'Julia Law, a young paralegal, is found dead in a bathtub. Her boss, a prominent Philadelphia lawyer, is questioned by the authorities.', 'Julia Law, a young paralegal, is found dead in a bathtub. Her boss, a prominent Philadelphia lawyer, is questioned by the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHP9SJpjuHPSPMMTK6rKPsBeu47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552799'),
  ('1023704850702231112', 'The Girl in the Book', 2015, 'Drama', 'Marya Cohn, Trevor Forrest', 'Marya Cohn', 'Emily VanCamp, Michael Nyqvist, Ana Mulvoy-Ten, Talia Balsam, Ali Ahn, David Call, Michael Cristofer, Courtney Daniels', null, 'The story of a young writer''s transformation when her past invades her present.', 'The story of a young writer''s transformation when her past invades her present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVvOHOz5848dZ5x7mGqxBWzsPmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339145'),
  ('922187962282763519', 'The Girl in the Café', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Yates, Chris Seager', 'Richard Curtis', 'Bill Nighy, Kelly Macdonald, Meneka Das, Anton Lesser, Paul Ritter, Ken Stott, Penny Downie, Damon Younger', null, 'Lawrence, an aging, lonely civil servant falls for Gina, an enigmatic young woman. When he takes her to the G8 Summit in Reykjavik, however, their bond is tested by Lawrence''s professional obligations.', 'Lawrence, an aging, lonely civil servant falls for Gina, an enigmatic young woman. When he takes her to the G8 Summit in Reykjavik, however, their bond is tested by Lawrence''s professional obligations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rk3hm0syx3eBvov0uLFaZv9Rr4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28201'),
  ('233410570605329713', 'The Girl in the Park', 2007, 'Drama', 'David Auburn, Adam Escott, Annie Tan', 'David Auburn', 'Sigourney Weaver, Kate Bosworth, Alessandro Nivola, Keri Russell, David Rasche, Elias Koteas, Felipe Bonilla, Alex Burns', 'R', 'A mother, enduringly traumatized by the disappearance of her three-year old daughter 15 years ago, has cut herself off from her ex-husband and son. However, when a troubled young woman with a checkered past enters her life, old psychic wounds painfully resurface, as does the illogical and increasingly irrational hope that the young woman may be the daughter she lost so long ago.', 'A mother, enduringly traumatized by the disappearance of her three-year old daughter 15 years ago, has cut herself off from her ex-husband and son. However, when a troubled young woman with a checkered past enters her life, old psychic wounds painfully resurface, as does the illogical and increasingly irrational hope that the young woman may be the daughter she lost so long ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BK61BwA9rWjfOtWVbwJtM70IiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16204'),
  ('941543894902356161', 'The Girl in the Photographs', 2015, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Dean Cundey, Nick Simon', 'Nick Simon, Robert Morast, Osgood Perkins', 'Kal Penn, Claudia Lee, Kenny Wormald, Toby Hemingway, Luke Baines, Miranda Rae Mayo, Katharine Isabelle, Mitch Pileggi', null, 'Small-town store clerk Colleen is eager to escape her tedious existence and annoying boyfriend. Then gruesome photos of murdered women start appearing.', 'Small-town store clerk Colleen is eager to escape her tedious existence and annoying boyfriend. Then gruesome photos of murdered women start appearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHq78AyplquMh5fogT0QGGYhzUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354220'),
  ('1152912080551996050', 'The Girl in the Pool', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Dakota Gorman', 'Jackson Reid Williams', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Monica Potter, Kevin Pollak, Brielle Barbusca, Dionysio Basco, Rickey Brown, Micah Giovanni, Tyler Lawrence Gray', null, 'A well-to-do family man must get through a surprise birthday party thrown by his wife shortly after he has hidden the corpse of his murdered mistress.', 'A well-to-do family man must get through a surprise birthday party thrown by his wife shortly after he has hidden the corpse of his murdered mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8gd4DxykPmnNgJKqNb8n0z0JDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1277296'),
  ('1090481150369209334', 'The Girl in the Red Velvet Swing', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Fleischer', 'Walter Reisch, Charles Brackett', 'Ray Milland, Joan Collins, Farley Granger, Luther Adler, Cornelia Otis Skinner, Glenda Farrell, Frances Fuller, Phillip Reed', null, 'Broadway showgirl Evelyn Nesbit is the object of affection of two men: playboy architect Stanford White and the wealthy but unstable Harry Thaw. Nesbit marries Thaw, but White’s continued pursuit puts him in the path of Thaw’s volatile temper. A fictionalized account of true events that occurred at the turn of the 20th century.', 'Broadway showgirl Evelyn Nesbit is the object of affection of two men: playboy architect Stanford White and the wealthy but unstable Harry Thaw. Nesbit marries Thaw, but White’s continued pursuit puts him in the path of Thaw’s volatile temper. A fictionalized account of true events that occurred at the turn of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mv1ia76cFLSNI7Ma9QZpnRrW3RE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82203'),
  ('21152809235116766', 'The Girl in the Snow', 2025, 'Drama', 'Marine Atlan, Louise Hémon, Jean-Baptiste Becq', 'Louise Hémon, Anaïs Tellenne, Maxence Stamatiadis', 'Galatea Bellugi, Matthieu Lucci, Samuel Kircher, Oscar Pons, Sharif Andoura, Léna Camillieri Dorléans, Solal Griveau Martin, Lula Guaydan', null, '1899. On a stormy night, Aimée, a young Republican schoolteacher, arrives in a snowy hamlet on the edge of the Alps. Despite the mistrust of the inhabitants, she is determined to shed light on their dark beliefs. As she blends into the life of the community, a sensual vertigo grows within her.', '1899. On a stormy night, Aimée, a young Republican schoolteacher, arrives in a snowy hamlet on the edge of the Alps. Despite the mistrust of the inhabitants, she is determined to shed light on their dark beliefs. As she blends into the life of the community, a sensual vertigo grows within her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzMVS2PPaCj58i3Og7FgtIpMLA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1069650'),
  ('496093666929859620', 'The Girl in the Spider''s Web', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Josef Brandl, Klemens Becker, Nick Laurence', 'Jay Basu, Fede Álvarez, Steven Knight', 'Claire Foy, Sverrir Gudnason, LaKeith Stanfield, Sylvia Hoeks, Stephen Merchant, Christopher Convery, Claes Bang, Synnøve Macody Lund', 'R', 'After being enlisted to recover a dangerous computer program, hacker Lisbeth Salander and journalist Mikael Blomkvist find themselves caught in a web of spies, cybercriminals and corrupt government officials.', 'After being enlisted to recover a dangerous computer program, hacker Lisbeth Salander and journalist Mikael Blomkvist find themselves caught in a web of spies, cybercriminals and corrupt government officials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4ibr8R702DCjwYniry1D1XwQXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446807'),
  ('479993810248614914', 'The Girl in the Wood', 2021, 'Crime, TV Movie, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Philippe Pavans de Ceccatty, Marie-Hélène Copti', 'Natalie Carter, Ève de Castro', 'Carolina Jurczak, Antoine Duléry, Agnès Soral, Philippe Duquesne, Mathieu Spinosi, Thibault Authié, Magali Bonat, Coralie Russier', null, 'Blandine''s life changes dramatically when her sister makes a deathbed confession that she sent an innocent man to jail 15 years previously by refusing to give him an alibi. Blandine will have to do all she can to get this man released and find out who really killed her best friend.', 'Blandine''s life changes dramatically when her sister makes a deathbed confession that she sent an innocent man to jail 15 years previously by refusing to give him an alibi. Blandine will have to do all she can to get this man released and find out who really killed her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfnlQ0p5NX8G2v8XRibg2EPwyPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788251'),
  ('948264534153908937', 'The Girl in the Yellow Jumper', 2020, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Loukman Ali, Naizi Nasser', 'Loukman Ali', 'Maurice Kirya, Michael Wawuyo Jr., Gladys Oyenbot, Rehema Nanfuka, Philip Luswata, River Dan Rugaju, Morocco Omari, Bash Luks', null, 'As word spreads that there is a serial killer at large who continues to commit murder, an off-duty police officer must return an elderly witness who lives in a remote part of Uganda back to town. Along the way, the policeman gives a ride to an injured man. On the way to the city, the passenger tells the policeman the events that led him to end up injured in the middle of the road. But as we travel with these mysterious characters in the car, director Loukman Ali shows us that the stories they tell are only fragmentary and partial versions of the events that took place, and that perhaps there are truths buried beneath each of their words.', 'As word spreads that there is a serial killer at large who continues to commit murder, an off-duty police officer must return an elderly witness who lives in a remote part of Uganda back to town. Along the way, the policeman gives a ride to an injured man. On the way to the city, the passenger tells the policeman the events that led him to end up injured in the middle of the road. But as we travel with these mysterious characters in the car, director Loukman Ali shows us that the stories they tell are only fragmentary and partial versions of the events that took place, and that perhaps there are truths buried beneath each of their words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYFUPov4zuoB5F1Am9Ni8E5kCwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881274'),
  ('196269007914252653', 'The Girl King', 2015, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Guy Dufaux', 'Michel Marc Bouchard', 'Malin Buska, Sarah Gadon, Michael Nyqvist, Lucas Bryant, Laura Birn, Hippolyte Girardot, Peter Lohmeyer, François Arnaud', null, 'A portrait of the brilliant, extravagant Kristina of Sweden, queen from age six, who fights the conservative forces that are against her ideas to modernize Sweden and who have no tolerance for her awakening sexuality.', 'A portrait of the brilliant, extravagant Kristina of Sweden, queen from age six, who fights the conservative forces that are against her ideas to modernize Sweden and who have no tolerance for her awakening sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sT5Bl1YXLXeGF1oE7jEOGQpDwDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329829'),
  ('223108589683667732', 'The Girl Most Likely To...', 1973, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Lee Philips, Richard C. Glouner, Frederic W. Brost', null, 'Stockard Channing, Ed Asner, Jim Backus, Joe Flynn, Chuck McCann, Carl Ballantine, Cyril Delevanti, Fred Grandy', 'NR', 'An ugly girl undergoes plastic surgery and becomes beautiful. She then takes revenge on all the people who mistreated her when she was ugly.', 'An ugly girl undergoes plastic surgery and becomes beautiful. She then takes revenge on all the people who mistreated her when she was ugly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cgCUrEvonEhVenrSdj9laOa5zU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57873'),
  ('791756319393904646', 'The Girl Next Door', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alberto Salvá, Antonio Luiz Mendes, Walter Goulart', 'Elisa Tolomelli, Alberto Salvá', 'Reginaldo Faria, Flávia Monteiro, Sérgio Mamberti, Débora Duarte, John Herbert, Adriano Reys, Tânia Scher, Lídia Mattos', null, 'Middle-aged married journalist goes to the beach resort of Búzios, in Brazil, to write a book. Gradually, he falls in love with his neighbor''s daughter, a beautiful teenager much younger than he, ignoring the social implications.', 'Middle-aged married journalist goes to the beach resort of Búzios, in Brazil, to write a book. Gradually, he falls in love with his neighbor''s daughter, a beautiful teenager much younger than he, ignoring the social implications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qD3QRfAqBfh8ZyY7XFqxRFRot3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59875'),
  ('962787663804720415', 'The Girl Next Door', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Luke Greenfield, Jamie Anderson, Jules Kovisars', 'David Wagner, Stuart Blumberg, Brent Goldberg', 'Emile Hirsch, Elisha Cuthbert, Timothy Olyphant, Christopher Rodriguez Marquette, Paul Dano, James Remar, Timothy Bottoms, Donna Bullock', 'R', 'Exceptionally ambitious high schooler Matthew has aspirations for a career in politics when he falls in love with his gorgeous 19-year-old neighbor, Danielle. But Matthew''s bright future is jeopardized when he finds Danielle was once a porn star. As Danielle''s past catches up with her, Matthew''s love for her forces him to re-evaluate his goals.', 'Exceptionally ambitious high schooler Matthew has aspirations for a career in politics when he falls in love with his gorgeous 19-year-old neighbor, Danielle. But Matthew''s bright future is jeopardized when he finds Danielle was once a porn star. As Danielle''s past catches up with her, Matthew''s love for her forces him to re-evaluate his goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mVyFHSY2rSsNgD4NfEwV82HigU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10591'),
  ('807620376845674785', 'The Girl Next Door', 2007, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Gregory Wilson, William M. Miller, Dawn Leuchter', 'Philip Nutman, Daniel Farrands', 'Blythe Auffarth, Daniel Manche, Michael Zegen, Catherine Mary Stewart, Grant Show, Graham Patrick Martin, William Atherton, Blanche Baker', 'R', 'In a quiet suburban town in the summer of 1958, two recently orphaned sisters are placed in the care of their mentally unstable Aunt Ruth. But Ruth''s depraved sense of discipline will soon lead to unspeakable acts of abuse and torture that involve her young sons, the neighborhood children, and one 12-year-old boy whose life will be changed forever.', 'In a quiet suburban town in the summer of 1958, two recently orphaned sisters are placed in the care of their mentally unstable Aunt Ruth. But Ruth''s depraved sense of discipline will soon lead to unspeakable acts of abuse and torture that involve her young sons, the neighborhood children, and one 12-year-old boy whose life will be changed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXjLp7k7ILyg22T0s9VvpPKc9jn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15356'),
  ('609704328375022766', 'The Girl Next Door', 2017, 'Romance', 'Park Sun-Uk', 'Chae Seol-ah', 'Hong Sae-hee, Ha Bin, Choi Yong-joon, Min Do-yoon, Jeong Hyang, Jeon Eun-jin', null, 'Sae-hee couldn''t go to sleep from the first day in her new house because of the moaning coming from next door. Sae-hee has never had sex before, but she''s writing sex novels. Playboy Seong-hyeon was getting tired of his sex partner Jia when he finds out that Sae-hee is a sex novelist. He begins to help her with her work but really he''s using that as bait to get into her pants and he does. Will Sae-hee be able to complete the novel?', 'Sae-hee couldn''t go to sleep from the first day in her new house because of the moaning coming from next door. Sae-hee has never had sex before, but she''s writing sex novels. Playboy Seong-hyeon was getting tired of his sex partner Jia when he finds out that Sae-hee is a sex novelist. He begins to help her with her work but really he''s using that as bait to get into her pants and he does. Will Sae-hee be able to complete the novel?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sg2xNXLacKgj9NHm8M6Tv1HTIhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451417'),
  ('49165100890609554', 'The Girl Next Door', 2023, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Crime', 'Carole Kornmann', 'Ève de Castro, Natalie Carter', 'Chloé Chaudoye, Bruno Wolkowitch, Nicolas Gob, Barbara Probst, Samir Boitard, Emmanuel Bordier, Ann-Gisel Glass, Alexandre Carrière', null, 'Everyone''s in shock when esteemed doctor Pierre is found to have killed his wife. 15 years later, released on parole and determined to find the culprit, he is rejected by his sons and only finds support with his daughter, Nina.', 'Everyone''s in shock when esteemed doctor Pierre is found to have killed his wife. 15 years later, released on parole and determined to find the culprit, he is rejected by his sons and only finds support with his daughter, Nina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ena1qUDnjiNrZdUPNKqXKrVgHRd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1192615'),
  ('561699789116688526', 'The Girl Next Door 2', 2018, 'Romance', 'Sung Gi-man', null, 'Yoo Sul-young, Jin Joo, Kang Min-woo, Kim Hyo-sang', null, 'Her husband Sejin is not interested in his wife Ahae as a woman. Ahae''s husband is just heartless. In fact, Sejin is having an affair with Ara''s young and beautiful younger brother Ara. After having suffered from depression due to work poisoning, he receives a message from the alumni association, and he changes his mind and attends. There, she meets Ahae, the next-door sister who had a crush on her childhood, and is still fantastic with her pretty appearance. Lonely Aha due to the innocence of her husband and Gunhoo approaching her with counseling. As if they were aware of each other''s loneliness, they are attracted to each other and spend one night, returning to each other''s daily lives, but after forgetting about the Ahae, the hand of the Ahae Abandonment comes to mind all night. Will they be able to go back to their daily lives?', 'Her husband Sejin is not interested in his wife Ahae as a woman. Ahae''s husband is just heartless. In fact, Sejin is having an affair with Ara''s young and beautiful younger brother Ara. After having suffered from depression due to work poisoning, he receives a message from the alumni association, and he changes his mind and attends. There, she meets Ahae, the next-door sister who had a crush on her childhood, and is still fantastic with her pretty appearance. Lonely Aha due to the innocence of her husband and Gunhoo approaching her with counseling. As if they were aware of each other''s loneliness, they are attracted to each other and spend one night, returning to each other''s daily lives, but after forgetting about the Ahae, the hand of the Ahae Abandonment comes to mind all night. Will they be able to go back to their daily lives?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNk72g9PqEufTJcrNcch3SdQKxE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560238'),
  ('762624697623603544', 'The Girl of Your Dreams', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Fernando Trueba, Petr Hartl, Tomáš Obermaier', 'Miguel Ángel Egea, Carlos López, David Trueba', 'Penélope Cruz, Antonio Resines, Jorge Sanz, Rosa María Sardà, Santiago Segura, Loles León, Jesús Bonilla, Neus Asensi', null, 'A company of Spanish movie makers leaves Franco''s Spain and moves to Hitler''s Germany to make a film in co-production. Soon some problems start to arise...', 'A company of Spanish movie makers leaves Franco''s Spain and moves to Hitler''s Germany to make a film in co-production. Soon some problems start to arise...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKu9RSzI8yjs8o18f2SwelPsifW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67297'),
  ('506312256512017659', 'The Girl on a Bulldozer', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Jin Hyun-woo, Park Ri-woong', 'Park Ri-woong', 'Kim Hye-yoon, Park Hyuk-kwon, Yesung, Shin Jae-whi, Oh Man-seok, Choi Hee-jin, Park Hyun-woo, Park So-eul', null, 'Hae-young is a hopeless girl. She lives with her father who runs a Chinese restaurant, and a younger sibling. One day, her father has a mysterious accident, which places her in a position of responsibility. She is now not only the head of the house and must look after her younger sibling, but also an investigator tasked with finding the truth about the accident, and a fighter standing against the ugly world.', 'Hae-young is a hopeless girl. She lives with her father who runs a Chinese restaurant, and a younger sibling. One day, her father has a mysterious accident, which places her in a position of responsibility. She is now not only the head of the house and must look after her younger sibling, but also an investigator tasked with finding the truth about the accident, and a fighter standing against the ugly world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZoM9pj30E2fV2YX0L0fg7oR5xN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783127'),
  ('80093536928688828', 'The Girl on a Motorcycle', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jack Cardiff, Jack Cardiff, James Hodgetts', 'Ronald Duncan', 'Marianne Faithfull, Alain Delon, Marius Goring, Roger Mutton, Catherine Jourdan, Jean Leduc, Jacques Marin, André Maranne', 'R', 'Newly-married Rebecca leaves her husband''s Alsatian bed on her prized motorbike - symbol of freedom and escape - to visit her lover in Heidelberg. En route she indulges in psychedelic reveries as she relives her changing relationship with the two men.', 'Newly-married Rebecca leaves her husband''s Alsatian bed on her prized motorbike - symbol of freedom and escape - to visit her lover in Heidelberg. En route she indulges in psychedelic reveries as she relives her changing relationship with the two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9h6X4oJaEqJsRMVcr03fHiTMdVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29722'),
  ('696806876506662827', 'The Girl on the Bridge', 1951, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Hugo Haas, Paul Ivano, Leonard Shapiro', 'Hugo Haas, Arnold Lipp', 'Hugo Haas, Beverly Michaels, Robert Dane, John Close, Anthony Jochim, Judy Clark, Darr Smith, Maria Bibikov', 'NR', 'A young woman''s suicide attempt is stopped by an old man passing by. The two fall in love -- but the relationship between the young girl and old man is threatened when a blackmailer from her past shows up.', 'A young woman''s suicide attempt is stopped by an old man passing by. The two fall in love -- but the relationship between the young girl and old man is threatened when a blackmailer from her past shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HHyq8fLPif6voStnlxj9c9xUri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46662'),
  ('1045264571508326878', 'The Girl on the Bridge', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Patrice Leconte, Jean-Marie Dreujou, Corinne Renard-Bendjadi', 'Serge Frydman', 'Vanessa Paradis, Daniel Auteuil, Demetre Georgalas, Catherine Lascault, Frédéric Pfluger, Isabelle Petit-Jacques, Mireille Mossé, Didier Lemoine', null, 'It''s night on a Paris bridge. A girl leans over Seine River with tears in her eyes and a violent yearning to drown her sorrows. Out of nowhere someone takes an interest in her. He is Gabor, a knife thrower who needs a human target for his show. The girl, Adele, has never been lucky and nowhere else to go. So she follows him. They travel along the northern bank of the Mediterranean to perform.', 'It''s night on a Paris bridge. A girl leans over Seine River with tears in her eyes and a violent yearning to drown her sorrows. Out of nowhere someone takes an interest in her. He is Gabor, a knife thrower who needs a human target for his show. The girl, Adele, has never been lucky and nowhere else to go. So she follows him. They travel along the northern bank of the Mediterranean to perform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5hKllCsmpWWA7XpxBXPjx0Gfct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10401'),
  ('850737750401693158', 'The Girl on the Broomstick', 1972, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Václav Vorlíček, Jaroslav Pour, Robert Vacík', 'Václav Vorlíček, Miloš Macourek', 'Petra Černocká, Jan Hrušínský, Jan Kraus, Vlastimil Zavřel, Michal Hejný, Jaromír Spal, Jana Drbohlavová, Vlastimil Hašek', null, 'A teenage witch, frozen in time as a punishment for 300 years, finds herself in a modern world.', 'A teenage witch, frozen in time as a punishment for 300 years, finds herself in a modern world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnbCWqg0OQUwsfdtcXbHxIpy0UD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47712'),
  ('1006143897609393923', 'The Girl on the Mountain', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Matt Sconce, Matt Sconce', 'Matt Sconce', 'Daniel O''Reilly, Makenzie Sconce, Sarah Dorothy Little, D.T. Carney, Heather Sconce, David Holt, Ryan Kos, Lorenzo Leonard', 'R', 'When a reclusive backwoodsman finds a mute little girl wandering alone in the forest, he must protect her from the evil forces determined to end her life.', 'When a reclusive backwoodsman finds a mute little girl wandering alone in the forest, he must protect her from the evil forces determined to end her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZiZ3eVUWPxJROTkYbH8FBC9UuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:754342'),
  ('924424371927589928', 'The Girl on the Train', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'André Téchiné, Julien Hirsch, Michel Nasri', 'André Téchiné, Odile Barski, Jean-Marie Besset', 'Émilie Dequenne, Catherine Deneuve, Michel Blanc, Mathieu Demy, Ronit Elkabetz, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Jérémie Quaegebeur, Arnaud Valois', null, 'Jeanne is a young woman, striking but otherwise without qualities. Her mother tries to get her a job in the office of a lawyer, Bleistein, her lover years ago. Jeanne fails the interview but falls into a relationship with Franck, a wrestler whose dreams and claims of being in a legitimate business partnership Jeanne is only too happy to believe. When Franck is arrested, he turns on Jeanne for her naivety; she''s stung and seeks attention by making up a story of an attack on a train. Is there any way out for her?', 'Jeanne is a young woman, striking but otherwise without qualities. Her mother tries to get her a job in the office of a lawyer, Bleistein, her lover years ago. Jeanne fails the interview but falls into a relationship with Franck, a wrestler whose dreams and claims of being in a legitimate business partnership Jeanne is only too happy to believe. When Franck is arrested, he turns on Jeanne for her naivety; she''s stung and seeks attention by making up a story of an attack on a train. Is there any way out for her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nche2N7Iu9hGJJcAKLpmeW4bEcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41248'),
  ('1091091510154890211', 'The Girl on the Train', 2016, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Patrick Capone, Tate Taylor, Charlotte Bruus Christensen', 'Erin Cressida Wilson', 'Emily Blunt, Rebecca Ferguson, Haley Bennett, Luke Evans, Justin Theroux, Allison Janney, Lisa Kudrow, Laura Prepon', 'R', 'Rachel Watson, devastated by her recent divorce, spends her daily commute fantasizing about the seemingly perfect couple who live in a house that her train passes every day, until one morning she sees something shocking happen there and becomes entangled in the mystery that unfolds.', 'Rachel Watson, devastated by her recent divorce, spends her daily commute fantasizing about the seemingly perfect couple who live in a house that her train passes every day, until one morning she sees something shocking happen there and becomes entangled in the mystery that unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhTO2QWG0tug7yDoh0XoaMhPt3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346685'),
  ('291771329913259981', 'The Girl on the Train', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rachita Kapoor, Ribhu Dasgupta, Tribhuvan Babu Sadineni', 'Ribhu Dasgupta', 'Parineeti Chopra, Aditi Rao Hydari, Kirti Kulhari, Tota Roy Chowdhury, Shamaun Ahmed, Vatsal Sheth, Avinash Tiwary, Natasha Benton', null, 'When a voyeuristic divorcee fixates on the lives of a perfect couple a far, she soon gets embroiled in a murder mystery that unfolds revealing truths about her own life.', 'When a voyeuristic divorcee fixates on the lives of a perfect couple a far, she soon gets embroiled in a murder mystery that unfolds revealing truths about her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Zvov912Mm0mrjR5nEGbSujjnGE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695958'),
  ('644012646463718567', 'The Girl Who Believes in Miracles', 2021, 'Family, Drama', 'Rich Correll', 'G.M. Mercier, Rich Correll', 'Mira Sorvino, Austyn Johnson, Kevin Sorbo, Peter Coyote, Burgess Jenkins, Tommi Rose, Stephanie Cood, Paul-Mikél Williams', 'PG', 'When Sara hears a preacher say faith can move mountains, she starts praying. Suddenly people in her town are mysteriously healed! But fame soon takes its toll – can Sara’s family save her before it’s too late?', 'When Sara hears a preacher say faith can move mountains, she starts praying. Suddenly people in her town are mysteriously healed! But fame soon takes its toll – can Sara’s family save her before it’s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBhM7HadGVfVyUp7UaEsutCEtYu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805195'),
  ('434059460905769315', 'The Girl Who Cried Pearls', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Chris Lavis, Maciek Szczerbowski', 'Chris Lavis, Isabelle Mandalian, Maciek Szczerbowski', 'James Hyndman, Simone Paradis, Gabrielle Dallaire, Charlotte Loseth', null, 'A poor boy’s love for a girl whose tears turn to pearls leads him into a perilous bargain between love, greed, and survival.', 'A poor boy’s love for a girl whose tears turn to pearls leads him into a perilous bargain between love, greed, and survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqdqvstmM2vOBnb5beVT8lOQ4Oi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142149'),
  ('1106521235848756815', 'The Girl Who Escaped: The Kara Robinson Story', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Mark D. Currie, Greg Nicod, Simone Stock', 'Haley Harris', 'Katie Douglas, Cara Buono, Kristian Bruun, Erik Athavale, Lisa Marie DiGiacinto, Sophia Carriere, Brandon McEwan, Derek Kun', 'PG-13', 'Based on a true story. 15-year-old Kara Robinson was kidnapped, assaulted and held captive for 18 hours. With her survival instincts kicking in, she plots a daring escape from the serial killer and leads police to his apartment.', 'Based on a true story. 15-year-old Kara Robinson was kidnapped, assaulted and held captive for 18 hours. With her survival instincts kicking in, she plots a daring escape from the serial killer and leads police to his apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9hwOE1FeOelkNxfsGtTNrlWnyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075334'),
  ('851973174199581993', 'The Girl Who Got Away', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Michael Morrissey, Peter Mariuzza', 'Michael Morrissey', 'Lexi Johnson, Chukwudi Iwuji, Kaye Tuckerman, Willow McCarthy, Ned Van Zandt, Audrey Grace Marshall, Geoffrey Cantor, Anni Krueger', null, 'A female serial killer who killed four young girls is sent away to prison, but a fifth victim escaped with her life. Twenty years later, the killer escapes and begins hunting for the one who got away.', 'A female serial killer who killed four young girls is sent away to prison, but a fifth victim escaped with her life. Twenty years later, the killer escapes and begins hunting for the one who got away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCzmo6Lt8YUdq62QzurbgHe4gLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:855228'),
  ('307722790000935529', 'The Girl Who Kicked the Hornet''s Nest', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Peter Mokrosinski, Daniel Alfredson', 'Ulf Ryberg', 'Michael Nyqvist, Noomi Rapace, Lena Endre, Annika Hallin, Jacob Ericksson, Sofia Ledarp, Anders Ahlbom Rosendahl, Micke Spreitz', 'R', 'After taking a bullet to the head, Salander is under close supervision in a hospital and is set to face trial for attempted murder on her eventual release. With the help of journalist Mikael Blomkvist and his researchers at Millennium magazine, Salander must prove her innocence. In doing this she plays against powerful enemies and her own past.', 'After taking a bullet to the head, Salander is under close supervision in a hospital and is set to face trial for attempted murder on her eventual release. With the help of journalist Mikael Blomkvist and his researchers at Millennium magazine, Salander must prove her innocence. In doing this she plays against powerful enemies and her own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92byRQBuuiLcfKnBi5NOuipSgV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33613'),
  ('450144031188162951', 'The Girl Who Killed Her Parents', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Jacob Solitrenick, Dudu Lima, Yuri Scocuglia', 'Ilana Casoy, Raphael Montes', 'Carla Diaz, Leonardo Bittencourt, Allan Souza Lima, Leonardo Medeiros, Vera Zimmermann, Augusto Madeira, Debora Duboc, Kauan Ceglio', null, 'Based on one of the most shocking and gruesome murder cases in Brazil, the film presents Daniel Cravinhos''s point of view of the events that led to the death of Marísia and Manfred von Richthofen, his girlfriend’s parents.', 'Based on one of the most shocking and gruesome murder cases in Brazil, the film presents Daniel Cravinhos''s point of view of the events that led to the death of Marísia and Manfred von Richthofen, his girlfriend’s parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gqZyGlLjNKXIk8RBswqAGJygVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608804'),
  ('505785516045985319', 'The Girl Who Killed Her Parents: The Confession', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Zé Eduardo Jordão, Yuri Scocuglia, Hugo Lobo Mejía', 'Ilana Casoy, Raphael Montes', 'Carla Diaz, Leonardo Bittencourt, Allan Souza Lima, Bárbara Colen, Augusto Madeira, Debora Duboc, Arthur Kohl, Che Moais', null, 'See what Suzane von Richthofen, Daniel Cravinhos and Cristian Cravinhos did in the days following the brutal crime that led to the Richthofen couple''s death. This film reveals crucial moments of the police investigation, testimonies and the confession of the crime.', 'See what Suzane von Richthofen, Daniel Cravinhos and Cristian Cravinhos did in the days following the brutal crime that led to the Richthofen couple''s death. This film reveals crucial moments of the police investigation, testimonies and the confession of the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25BwKEuYESPHyynhJ37otmcM3qh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1135408'),
  ('287363655004634278', 'The Girl Who Knew Too Much', 1963, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Mario Bava, Mario Bava, Franco Prosperi', 'Eliana De Sabata, Sergio Corbucci, Mario Bava', 'John Saxon, Letícia Román, Valentina Cortese, Dante DiPaolo, Titti Tomaino, Luigi Bonos, Milo Quesada, Gustavo De Nardo', null, 'A tourist witnesses a murder and finds herself caught up in a series of bloody killings.', 'A tourist witnesses a murder and finds herself caught up in a series of bloody killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14z6WFMEoFdVEKhEGJQuGk9vU8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28041'),
  ('526905488557189743', 'The Girl Who Leapt Through Time', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Romance', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Yoshitaka Sakamoto, Tadashi Naitô', 'Wataru Kenmotsu', 'Tomoyo Harada, Ryōichi Takayanagi, Toshinori Omi, Toshie Negishi, Ittoku Kishibe, Wakaba Irie, Akiko Kitamura, Yukari Tsuda', null, 'Kazuko Yoshiyama is a third-year junior-high-school student. One day, while cleaning the lab, she smells lavender and faints. From then on, she has the power to travel through time.', 'Kazuko Yoshiyama is a third-year junior-high-school student. One day, while cleaning the lab, she smells lavender and faints. From then on, she has the power to travel through time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zMGrEqPXFQbDilDKXAXUirKN2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62385'),
  ('1055872131809042676', 'The Girl Who Leapt Through Time', 2006, 'Fantasy, Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Tomohiko Ito, Hiroyuki Aoyama', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Riisa Naka, Takuya Ishida, Mitsutaka Itakura, Ayami Kakiuchi, Mitsuki Tanimura, Yuki Sekido, Utawaka Katsura, Midori Ando', 'NR', 'When 17-year-old Makoto Konno gains the ability to ''leap'' backwards through time, she immediately sets about improving her grades and preventing personal mishaps. However, she soon realises that changing the past isn''t as simple as it seems, and eventually, will have to rely on her new powers to shape the future of herself and her friends.', 'When 17-year-old Makoto Konno gains the ability to ''leap'' backwards through time, she immediately sets about improving her grades and preventing personal mishaps. However, she soon realises that changing the past isn''t as simple as it seems, and eventually, will have to rely on her new powers to shape the future of herself and her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHnlWM8BmqY419YUccYy2KC5Jqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14069'),
  ('637882516133413198', 'The Girl Who Played with Fire', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Daniel Alfredson, Peter Mokrosinski', 'Jonas Frykberg', 'Michael Nyqvist, Noomi Rapace, Lena Endre, Peter Andersson, Annika Hallin, Per Oscarsson, Sofia Ledarp, Micke Spreitz', 'R', 'Mikael Blomkvist, publisher of Millennium magazine, has made his living exposing the crooked and corrupt practices of establishment Swedish figures. So when a young journalist approaches him with a meticulously researched thesis about sex trafficking in Sweden and those in high office who abuse underage girls, Blomkvist immediately throws himself into the investigation.', 'Mikael Blomkvist, publisher of Millennium magazine, has made his living exposing the crooked and corrupt practices of establishment Swedish figures. So when a young journalist approaches him with a meticulously researched thesis about sex trafficking in Sweden and those in high office who abuse underage girls, Blomkvist immediately throws himself into the investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axR8YcQVUgWYhvN2UcZKhzexKsI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24253'),
  ('882023792356459322', 'The Girl with a Bracelet', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Guilhem Amesland, Aurélia Hollart, Stéphane Demoustier', 'Ulises Porra, Gonzalo Tobal', 'Roschdy Zem, Chiara Mastroianni, Melissa Guers, Anaïs Demoustier, Annie Mercier, Pascal Garbarini, Paul Aïssaoui-Cuvelier, Carlo Ferrante', null, 'Lise (16 years old) is accused of murdering her best friend. As the trial starts, her parents stand right by her side. But once her secret life is revealed in court, the truth becomes indistinguishable.', 'Lise (16 years old) is accused of murdering her best friend. As the trial starts, her parents stand right by her side. But once her secret life is revealed in court, the truth becomes indistinguishable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnIQq8R50P7rEwi2UivROxYiJv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582923'),
  ('490680074299089448', 'The Girl with a Pistol', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Carlo Di Palma, Renzo Marignano', 'Rodolfo Sonego, Luigi Magni', 'Monica Vitti, Stanley Baker, Carlo Giuffrè, Corin Redgrave, Anthony Booth, Nicolina Papetti, Tiberio Murgia, Aldo Puglisi', null, 'A Sicilian woman is dishonored by her lover, then goes to London with a pistol intending to murder him.', 'A Sicilian woman is dishonored by her lover, then goes to London with a pistol intending to murder him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbHIDYHPRIVaDSwVT3A6ck2gr8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56233'),
  ('200885572299853959', 'The Girl with All the Gifts', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Colm McCarthy, Agis Pyrlis, Simon Dennis', 'Mike Carey', 'Sennia Nanua, Gemma Arterton, Paddy Considine, Glenn Close, Fisayo Akinade, Anamaria Marinca, Anthony Welsh, Joe Lomas', 'R', 'In the future, a strange fungus has changed nearly everyone into thoughtless, flesh-eating monsters. When a scientist and a teacher find a girl who seems to be immune to the fungus, they all begin a journey to save humanity.', 'In the future, a strange fungus has changed nearly everyone into thoughtless, flesh-eating monsters. When a scientist and a teacher find a girl who seems to be immune to the fungus, they all begin a journey to save humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdCD8z55a4RNmHQDPIpuMFqoY2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375366'),
  ('753847077633475852', 'The Girl with Nine Wigs', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Rothemund, Martin Langer', 'Katharina Eyssen', 'Lisa Tomaschewsky, Karoline Teska, David Rott, Alice Dwyer, Peter Prager, Alexander Held, Jasmin Gerat, Daniel Zillmann', null, 'The true story of a young woman whose lust for life means she is determined to be so very much more than just another cancer patient.', 'The true story of a young woman whose lust for life means she is determined to be so very much more than just another cancer patient.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cVZAL8mL3fi7nbE2zZRKg2KogM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170125'),
  ('954671271939144264', 'The Girl with the Blue Backpack', 1979, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Rubén Galindo', 'Rubén Galindo, Carlos Valdemar', 'Pedro Fernández, Adalberto Martínez, María Rebeca, Mónica Prado, Mario Cid, Federico Falcón', null, 'In a fishermen''s town in Texas, the kids Amy and Raul are close friends. Andrew, uncle and guardian of Amy is alcoholic, but she loves him. The three of them have to face the autorities when they try to take Amy away.', 'In a fishermen''s town in Texas, the kids Amy and Raul are close friends. Andrew, uncle and guardian of Amy is alcoholic, but she loves him. The three of them have to face the autorities when they try to take Amy away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1KRpSYxCC1I82VfjNSuUlujtLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266212'),
  ('950768714954627991', 'The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Niels Arden Oplev, Eric Kress, Maria Håård', 'Rasmus Heisterberg, Nikolaj Arcel', 'Michael Nyqvist, Noomi Rapace, Lena Endre, Sven-Bertil Taube, Peter Haber, Peter Andersson, Marika Lagercrantz, Ingvar Hirdwall', 'R', 'Swedish thriller based on Stieg Larsson''s novel about a male journalist and a young female hacker. In the opening of the movie, Mikael Blomkvist, a middle-aged publisher for the magazine Millennium, loses a libel case brought by corrupt Swedish industrialist Hans-Erik Wennerström. Nevertheless, he is hired by Henrik Vanger in order to solve a cold case, the disappearance of Vanger''s niece', 'Swedish thriller based on Stieg Larsson''s novel about a male journalist and a young female hacker. In the opening of the movie, Mikael Blomkvist, a middle-aged publisher for the magazine Millennium, loses a libel case brought by corrupt Swedish industrialist Hans-Erik Wennerström. Nevertheless, he is hired by Henrik Vanger in order to solve a cold case, the disappearance of Vanger''s niece', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6w0TKhfR0Rzby5SXxgfuI99Jrva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15472'),
  ('1115119181803386095', 'The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo', 2011, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'David Fincher, Hanna Nilsson, Serge Garcia', 'Steven Zaillian', 'Daniel Craig, Rooney Mara, Christopher Plummer, Stellan Skarsgård, Robin Wright, Yorick van Wageningen, Steven Berkoff, Joely Richardson', 'R', 'Disgraced journalist Mikael Blomkvist investigates the disappearance of a weary patriarch''s niece from 40 years ago. He is aided by the pierced, tattooed, punk computer hacker named Lisbeth Salander. As they work together in the investigation, Blomkvist and Salander uncover immense corruption beyond anything they have ever imagined.', 'Disgraced journalist Mikael Blomkvist investigates the disappearance of a weary patriarch''s niece from 40 years ago. He is aided by the pierced, tattooed, punk computer hacker named Lisbeth Salander. As they work together in the investigation, Blomkvist and Salander uncover immense corruption beyond anything they have ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bokS83zGdhaXgN9tjidUKmAftW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65754'),
  ('597226547649381587', 'The Girl with the Golden Eyes', 1961, 'Drama', 'Jean-Gabriel Albicocco', 'Pierre Pelegri, Philippe Dumarçay', 'Marie Laforêt, Françoise Dorléac, Paul Guers, Françoise Prévost, Jacques Verlier, Alice Sapritch, Carla Marlier, Frédéric de Pasquale', null, 'A skirt-chasing fashion photographer meets a charming young woman who captures his interest immediately. She is not wholly forthcoming, but after a period of time, he realizes that he is in love with her -- she is not just another conquest. It takes awhile before he also realizes that she is the partner of his femme associate who is possessive, at the very least.', 'A skirt-chasing fashion photographer meets a charming young woman who captures his interest immediately. She is not wholly forthcoming, but after a period of time, he realizes that he is in love with her -- she is not just another conquest. It takes awhile before he also realizes that she is the partner of his femme associate who is possessive, at the very least.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVdr6BpuEJYZjm19yo6nwtG01Gu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63680'),
  ('898237333639965126', 'The Girl with the Hat Box', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Boris Barnet, Boris Filshin, Boris Frantsisson', 'Vadim Shershenevich, Valentin Turkin', 'Anna Sten, Vladimir Fogel, Ivan Koval-Samborskyi, Serafima Birman, Volodymyr Mikhajlov, Vladimir Popov, Pavel Pol, Yeva Milyutina', null, 'A Moscow hat shop girl chances upon a penniless young man who has arrived from the countryside for university and takes pity on him.', 'A Moscow hat shop girl chances upon a penniless young man who has arrived from the countryside for university and takes pity on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bx6n6Oi96w0bImKVdJ8hNBjEl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47590'),
  ('1140544662026582905', 'The Girl with the Needle', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Magnus von Horn, Michał Dymek, Dagna Kidoń', 'Line Langebek Knudsen, Magnus von Horn', 'Vic Carmen Sonne, Trine Dyrholm, Besir Zeciri, Joachim Fjelstrup, Tessa Hoder, Ava Knox Martin, Ari Alexander, Søren Sætter-Lassen', null, 'Struggling to survive in post-WWI Copenhagen, a newly unemployed and pregnant young woman is taken in by a charismatic elder to help run an underground adoption agency. The two form an unexpected bond, until a sudden discovery changes everything.', 'Struggling to survive in post-WWI Copenhagen, a newly unemployed and pregnant young woman is taken in by a charismatic elder to help run an underground adoption agency. The two form an unexpected bond, until a sudden discovery changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xkyx8v9G3ePxe1IcFugFQkXHzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232827'),
  ('923265667615530445', 'The Girl with the Red Hair', 1981, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ben Verbong', 'Ben Verbong, Pieter De Vos', 'Renée Soutendijk, Peter Tuinman, Loes Luca, Johan Leysen, Robert Delhez, Ada Bouwman, Lineke Rijxman, Maria de Booy', null, 'During the second world war law student Hannie Schaft is a member of the Dutch resistance movement.', 'During the second world war law student Hannie Schaft is a member of the Dutch resistance movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRTuL8QaPFia3KmCmFw067AqEN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97547'),
  ('442322743417489560', 'The Girl with the Red Scarf', 1977, 'Drama, Romance', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Çetin Tunca', 'Ali Özgentürk', 'Türkan Şoray, Kadir İnanır, Ahmet Mekin, Hülya Tuğlu, Nurhan Nur, Cengiz Sezici, İhsan Yüce, Elif İnci', null, 'İlyas, a truck driver from Istanbul, arrives in a remote village to work on a dam construction project and meets a young village woman named Asya. They fall madly in love and get married. However, their life together is fraught with conflict. When İlyas cheats on Asya, the final straw in their relationship, she takes her son and begins wandering without knowing where she is going, until a familiar hand reaches out to help her selflessly.', 'İlyas, a truck driver from Istanbul, arrives in a remote village to work on a dam construction project and meets a young village woman named Asya. They fall madly in love and get married. However, their life together is fraught with conflict. When İlyas cheats on Asya, the final straw in their relationship, she takes her son and begins wandering without knowing where she is going, until a familiar hand reaches out to help her selflessly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFxItCQrYIbJ1FMISjo2YNApuPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31412'),
  ('795343741306779231', 'The Girl Without Hands', 2016, 'Animation, Fantasy, Romance', 'Sébastien Laudenbach, Sébastien Laudenbach', 'Sébastien Laudenbach', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Jérémie Elkaïm, Philippe Laudenbach, Olivier Broche, Françoise Lebrun, Sacha Bourdo, Elina Löwensohn', null, 'A poor miller gets tricked by the Devil and accidentally sells his daughter for a bit of gold. But Satan can''t take her because she''s too pure and has wept on her hands. So Satan orders the miller to cut her hands off. It''s the beginning of the young girl''s journey towards freedom.', 'A poor miller gets tricked by the Devil and accidentally sells his daughter for a bit of gold. But Satan can''t take her because she''s too pure and has wept on her hands. So Satan orders the miller to cut her hands off. It''s the beginning of the young girl''s journey towards freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4EVSG3CPshLfnUe3hdQBVyliX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396899'),
  ('391473931153910301', 'The Girl, the Gold Watch & Everything', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, TV Movie', 'William Wiard, Jacques Haitkin', null, 'Robert Hays, Pam Dawber, Zohra Lampert, Ed Nelson, Maurice Evans, Peter Brown, Larry Hankin, Macdonald Carey', null, 'After inheriting a magical gold watch from his multimillionaire uncle''s estate, Robert Hays and his girlfriend, Pam Dawber, soon discover not only that he can stop time with the watch, but also that it holds the secret to his late uncle''s fortune -- a secret that others fall over themselves trying to steal.', 'After inheriting a magical gold watch from his multimillionaire uncle''s estate, Robert Hays and his girlfriend, Pam Dawber, soon discover not only that he can stop time with the watch, but also that it holds the secret to his late uncle''s fortune -- a secret that others fall over themselves trying to steal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbwNYWh5Dd3jgdAonqsQWie4YQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152423'),
  ('83122275009183668', 'The Girlfriend Experience', 2009, 'Drama', 'Steven Soderbergh, Derek Wimble, Gregory Jacobs', 'Brian Koppelman, David Levien', 'Sasha Grey, Chris Santos, Philip Eytan, Peter Zizzo, Ron Stein, Marshall Gilman, Michael Roberts, Jim Kempner', 'R', 'Chelsea is an in-demand call girl whose $2,000 an hour price tag allows her to live in New York''s lap of luxury. Besides her beauty and sexual skill, Chelsea offers her clients companionship and conversation, or, as she dubs it, "the girlfriend experience." With her successful business and a devoted, live-in boyfriend, Chelsea thinks she has it made... until a new client rocks her world.', 'Chelsea is an in-demand call girl whose $2,000 an hour price tag allows her to live in New York''s lap of luxury. Besides her beauty and sexual skill, Chelsea offers her clients companionship and conversation, or, as she dubs it, "the girlfriend experience." With her successful business and a devoted, live-in boyfriend, Chelsea thinks she has it made... until a new client rocks her world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDxSasCAEdXpaeEo3GsBt8i9wkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17680'),
  ('836959303542273461', 'The Girls', 1962, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yuri Chulyukin, Timofei Lebeshev, G. Rosenthal', 'Boris Bedny', 'Nadezhda Rumyantseva, Nikolai Rybnikov, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova, Inna Makarova, Svetlana Druzhinina, Nina Menshikova, Stanislav Khitrov, Nikolay Pogodin', null, 'A graduate of the culinary technical school of the cook, Tosya Kislitsyna, a naive and eccentric girl, came to the village lost in the northern forests. She sticks her nose in all affairs, seeks to help everyone. She met Ilya on the day of arrival: the "first guy in the village" fell upon her indignantly, and in the evening, to brighten up an unpleasant meeting, she decided to "make happy" with an invitation to a dance and was refused. Not accustomed to refusals, Ilya argues with Filya that during the week he will fall in love with Tosya...', 'A graduate of the culinary technical school of the cook, Tosya Kislitsyna, a naive and eccentric girl, came to the village lost in the northern forests. She sticks her nose in all affairs, seeks to help everyone. She met Ilya on the day of arrival: the "first guy in the village" fell upon her indignantly, and in the evening, to brighten up an unpleasant meeting, she decided to "make happy" with an invitation to a dance and was refused. Not accustomed to refusals, Ilya argues with Filya that during the week he will fall in love with Tosya...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAmv4i2sARwa17npj8rJD4OA4md.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20975'),
  ('728423736035517899', 'The Girls', 1968, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mai Zetterling, Rune Ericson, Brita Werkmäster', 'Mai Zetterling, David Hughes', 'Bibi Andersson, Harriet Andersson, Gunnel Lindblom, Gunnar Björnstrand, Erland Josephson, Frank Sundström, Åke Lindström, Stig Engström', null, 'As they tour Sweden in a theatrical production of "Lysistrata", performing to often uncomprehending audiences, three women find their own lives and marriages mirrored in Aristophanes’s play. Soon, onstage drama, offstage reality, and surrealist fantasies begin to collide.', 'As they tour Sweden in a theatrical production of "Lysistrata", performing to often uncomprehending audiences, three women find their own lives and marriages mirrored in Aristophanes’s play. Soon, onstage drama, offstage reality, and surrealist fantasies begin to collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scPW0OP6qcZjAfcHvQaxbNsucaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135337'),
  ('921932944240850694', 'The Girls Are Alright', 2023, 'Drama', 'Itsaso Arana, Sara Gallego, Lionel Braverman', 'Itsaso Arana', 'Bárbara Lennie, Irene Escolar, Itziar Manero, Helena Ezquerro, Itsaso Arana, Julia León, Mercedes Unzeta, Gonzalo Herrero', null, 'In the middle of summer, five women rehearse a play in an old mill, isolated from the world.', 'In the middle of summer, five women rehearse a play in an old mill, isolated from the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGsZmr4pDlza4Msw0iHpH0qZnNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002711'),
  ('845936914093136963', 'The Girls at the Station', 2024, 'Drama', 'Juana Macías, Alex Martín, Itziar Azkoaga', 'Juana Macías, Isa Sánchez', 'Julieta Tobio, Salua Hadra, María Steelman, Xoán Fórneas, Carla Gris, Pepo Llopís, Daniel Mantero, Saida Santana', null, 'Jara, Alex and Miranda are three girls coming of age who grew up in a juvenile detention centre, with no knowledge of unconditional love. Jara’s birthday is coming up and the three of them want to celebrate by going to the concert of their favourite performer, but they can’t afford the tickets. So, they meet up with an older girl and former resident of the centre who offers them an indecent proposal. But before they know it, they find themselves sliding deeper into the underbelly of Mallorca.', 'Jara, Alex and Miranda are three girls coming of age who grew up in a juvenile detention centre, with no knowledge of unconditional love. Jara’s birthday is coming up and the three of them want to celebrate by going to the concert of their favourite performer, but they can’t afford the tickets. So, they meet up with an older girl and former resident of the centre who offers them an indecent proposal. But before they know it, they find themselves sliding deeper into the underbelly of Mallorca.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKUJ6rl3NdESf5qKjpsk7BM6YyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1299040'),
  ('711506158280517473', 'The Girls from China', 1992, 'Drama', 'Barry Lee Ying-Lok', null, 'Isabelle Chow Wang, Pauline Chan Bo-Lin, Jimmy Au Shui-Wai, Hoh Ying-Wai, Law Yun-Ping, John Ching Tung, Leung Hak-Shun, Leung Gam-San', null, 'The story is about Ying, a girl from Beijing who comes to Hong Kong to find work and stay with her wealthy uncle. She is played by the stunningly beautiful Isabella Chow, whose charms easily carry this picture', 'The story is about Ying, a girl from Beijing who comes to Hong Kong to find work and stay with her wealthy uncle. She is played by the stunningly beautiful Isabella Chow, whose charms easily carry this picture', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8uNNPfQCpfZ0p30rKTfnv30FTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364329'),
  ('978984798577266932', 'The Girls of Grenoble', 1981, 'Drama', 'Joël Le Moigné, Jean-Claude Rivière, Roland Dantigny', 'Joël Le Moigné', 'Zoé Chauveau, André Dussollier, Alain Doutey, Régis Ander, Georges Berthomieu, David Jalil, Steve Kalfa, Patrick Lafani', null, 'In Grenoble, a prostitute is murdered in her hospital bed. Cora twenty-two and also a prostitute was one of her friends. On a daily basis these women suffer violence receive a miserable salary and work non-stop in terror of the pimps.', 'In Grenoble, a prostitute is murdered in her hospital bed. Cora twenty-two and also a prostitute was one of her friends. On a daily basis these women suffer violence receive a miserable salary and work non-stop in terror of the pimps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPHLEQ03YevZZxLOTMsg0BeAzd5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357850'),
  ('43186773770319669', 'The Girls of San Frediano', 1955, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Valerio Zurlini, Gianni Di Venanzo', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi', 'Rossana Podestà, Giovanna Ralli, Marcella Mariani, Antonio Cifariello, Giulia Rubini, Luciana Liberati, Corinne Calvet, Adriano Micantoni', null, 'Andrea, a young and charming florentine mechanic in the 1950s, romances five beautiful women simultaneously, enjoying life without really committing to anyone, but in the end who wants to grasp all lose all.', 'Andrea, a young and charming florentine mechanic in the 1950s, romances five beautiful women simultaneously, enjoying life without really committing to anyone, but in the end who wants to grasp all lose all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRL2GwVcR5lbxdDi6UZL2WLqwxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276789'),
  ('1021567603119625198', 'The Girls of the Golden Saloon', 1975, 'Western, Crime', 'Gilbert Roussel, Johan Vincent, Raymond Heil', 'H.L. Rostaine, Henri Bral de Boitselier', 'Sandra Julien, Evelyne Scott, Roger Darton, Alice Arno, Allan Spencer, France Nicolas, Claude Boisson, Gillian Gill', null, 'Richard le Noir, disguised as a woman, helps free the local girls of the California town of Harriba Lannana, from enslavement at a local brothel called the Golden Saloon.', 'Richard le Noir, disguised as a woman, helps free the local girls of the California town of Harriba Lannana, from enslavement at a local brothel called the Golden Saloon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGh44go4gipJ6yJhowIpIeRZrny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260775'),
  ('692510397270647127', 'The Girls on F Street', 1966, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Saul Resnick', null, 'Ken McCormick, Toni Lee Oliver, Nick Nickerson, Althea Currier, Kellie Everts, Barbara Nordin, Eve St. Pierre, Margo Lynn Sweet', null, 'A pathetic Joe pays a bitter prostitute, Margo to have sex with him, and is abused endlessly. A woman sculptor and her live model try to suppress their lesbian longings for each other. Lonely, bespectacled middle-aged Nick goes to the House of Fetish - the local brothel - after watching a buxom stripper do her exotic dance on stage. His wife catches him in bed with another woman, and whips her silly.', 'A pathetic Joe pays a bitter prostitute, Margo to have sex with him, and is abused endlessly. A woman sculptor and her live model try to suppress their lesbian longings for each other. Lonely, bespectacled middle-aged Nick goes to the House of Fetish - the local brothel - after watching a buxom stripper do her exotic dance on stage. His wife catches him in bed with another woman, and whips her silly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSwqmL3dQMJIqpVnI4Ko0MUJ2R9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89968'),
  ('631009868812122116', 'The Girls We Want', 2025, 'Drama', 'Prïncia Car, Raphaël Vandenbussche, Amine Taher', 'Prïncia Car, Léna Mardi', 'Houssam Mohamed, Leïa Haichour, Lou Anna Hamon, Kader Benchoudar, Mortadha Hasni, Achraf Jamai, Nawed Selassie Said, Malou Khebizi', null, 'Marseille, the holidays. Omar, 20, oversees the children summer camp with his longtime friends. The adolescents are full of dreams, principles, and prejudices. When Carmen returns after years being away, the group dynamic is put to the test. In a group where reputation is everything, the electric and free spirit Carmen triggers everyone to question his own belief, desire, and sexuality.', 'Marseille, the holidays. Omar, 20, oversees the children summer camp with his longtime friends. The adolescents are full of dreams, principles, and prejudices. When Carmen returns after years being away, the group dynamic is put to the test. In a group where reputation is everything, the electric and free spirit Carmen triggers everyone to question his own belief, desire, and sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEsE2bRRQUh0hO0xx7yP2NbzHSy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084816'),
  ('712126472717859026', 'The Given Word', 1962, 'Drama', 'Anselmo Duarte, H.E. Fowle', 'Anselmo Duarte, Dias Gomes', 'Leonardo Villar, Glória Menezes, Dionísio Azevedo, Geraldo del Rey, Roberto Ferreira, Othon Bastos, Antônio Pitanga, Gilberto Marques', null, 'Zé is a very poor man whose most prized possession is his donkey. When his donkey falls terminally ill, Zé makes a promise to Saint Bárbara: If his donkey recovers, he will carry a cross - like Jesus - all the way from his city to Saint Bárbara''s church, in the state capital. Upon the recovery of his donkey, Zé leaves on his journey. He makes it to the church, but the priest refuses to accept the cross once he discovers the context of Zé''s promise.', 'Zé is a very poor man whose most prized possession is his donkey. When his donkey falls terminally ill, Zé makes a promise to Saint Bárbara: If his donkey recovers, he will carry a cross - like Jesus - all the way from his city to Saint Bárbara''s church, in the state capital. Upon the recovery of his donkey, Zé leaves on his journey. He makes it to the church, but the priest refuses to accept the cross once he discovers the context of Zé''s promise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjNydK6CnoJFEp69OzAcSsAaIME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59990'),
  ('91938419849967505', 'The Giver', 2014, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Phillip Noyce, Ross Emery', 'Michael Mitnick, Robert B. Weide', 'Jeff Bridges, Meryl Streep, Brenton Thwaites, Alexander Skarsgård, Katie Holmes, Odeya Rush, Cameron Monaghan, Taylor Swift', 'PG-13', 'In a seemingly perfect community, without war, pain, suffering, differences or choice, a young boy is chosen to learn from an elderly man about the true pain and pleasure of the "real" world.', 'In a seemingly perfect community, without war, pain, suffering, differences or choice, a young boy is chosen to learn from an elderly man about the true pain and pleasure of the "real" world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dul62Av4pgi5x8LP7ELHzNyka9Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227156'),
  ('683784627293357897', 'The Gladiator', 1986, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, TV Movie', 'Abel Ferrara, James Lemmo', null, 'Ken Wahl, Nancy Allen, Robert Culp, Stan Shaw, Rosemary Forsyth, Bart Braverman, Linda Thorson, Rick Dees', null, 'A road warrior vigilante avenges his brother''s death at the hands of a crazy motorist by using his souped-up pickup to apprehend drunken drivers and others who abuse their driving privileges.', 'A road warrior vigilante avenges his brother''s death at the hands of a crazy motorist by using his souped-up pickup to apprehend drunken drivers and others who abuse their driving privileges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ke6w2jpFbxtglMuUlBbzl8EmFl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114657'),
  ('436421246318843590', 'The Gladiators', 1969, 'War, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Peter Watkins, Peter Suschitzky', 'Nicholas Gosling, Peter Watkins', 'Arthur Pentelow, Frederick Danner, Hans Bendrik, Christer Gynge, Daniel Harle, Björn Franzén, Kenneth Lo, Hans Berger', null, 'Some time in the future, East and West have stopped maintaining standing armies and nuclear weapons. Instead, to settle their differences they pit different teams of crack combat specialists against each other.', 'Some time in the future, East and West have stopped maintaining standing armies and nuclear weapons. Instead, to settle their differences they pit different teams of crack combat specialists against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYSRNwxQl2zWJWGjWqAS3RjtLls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54919'),
  ('957749007124071795', 'The Glamorous Life of Sachiko Hanai', 2003, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Mitsuru Meike', 'Takao Nakano', 'Emi Kuroda, Yukijiro Hotaru, Kikujiro Honda, Takeshi Itō, Tetsuaki Matsue, Kyoko Hayami', 'NR', 'Sachiko Hanai is a call girl. One day she is caught up in a gunfight and is shot in the forehead. Instead of killing her, the bullet in her head gives her psychic powers. She also accidentally comes into possession of a cylinder containing George W. Bush''s finger, whose fingerprint is designed to launch a nuclear missile, and international spies are soon chasing her.', 'Sachiko Hanai is a call girl. One day she is caught up in a gunfight and is shot in the forehead. Instead of killing her, the bullet in her head gives her psychic powers. She also accidentally comes into possession of a cylinder containing George W. Bush''s finger, whose fingerprint is designed to launch a nuclear missile, and international spies are soon chasing her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liSPCTNMLwPYyYOe40HDtAnx8JZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71261'),
  ('947381679583825828', 'The Glass Agency', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Ebrahim Hatamikia', 'Ebrahim Hatamikia', 'Parviz Parastouei, Reza Kianian, Habib Rezaei, Qasem Zare, Bita Baadraan, Asghar Naghizade, Behrooz Shoeibi', null, 'An armed veteran of the Iran-Iraq War takes hostages at a travel agency after failing to raise enough money for his injured comrade to travel abroad for medical treatment.', 'An armed veteran of the Iran-Iraq War takes hostages at a travel agency after failing to raise enough money for his injured comrade to travel abroad for medical treatment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyT1BT6W0zvPrJe8cIOx9XyF1PB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328069'),
  ('511833002005058589', 'The Glass Alibi', 1946, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'W. Lee Wilder, Henry Sharp', 'Mindret Lord', 'Paul Kelly, Douglas Fowley, Anne Gwynne, Maris Wrixon, Jack Conrad, Selmer Jackson, Cyril Thornton, Cy Kendall', 'NR', 'Eying a large inheritance, a reporter marries a rich woman with failing health. When she begins feeling healthy after the wedding, the reporter takes drastic measures to make sure his wife dies.', 'Eying a large inheritance, a reporter marries a rich woman with failing health. When she begins feeling healthy after the wedding, the reporter takes drastic measures to make sure his wife dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3RPkudaKEgUZ1m950CU5NsGxxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46680'),
  ('414913446184520050', 'The Glass Bottom Boat', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Tashlin, Al Jennings, Leon Shamroy', 'Everett Freeman', 'Doris Day, Rod Taylor, Arthur Godfrey, John McGiver, Paul Lynde, Edward Andrews, Eric Fleming, Dom DeLuise', 'NR', 'Bruce, the owner of an aerospace company, is infatuated with Jennifer and hires her to be his biographer so that he can be near her and win her affections. Is she actually a Russian spy trying to obtain aerospace secrets?', 'Bruce, the owner of an aerospace company, is infatuated with Jennifer and hires her to be his biographer so that he can be near her and win her affections. Is she actually a Russian spy trying to obtain aerospace secrets?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlj5rCl7jfW7QskJ1vucd7j5n5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33666'),
  ('576836586175304198', 'The Glass Cage', 1955, 'Crime', 'Montgomery Tully, Walter J. Harvey, Jack Causey', 'Richard H. Landau', 'John Ireland, Honor Blackman, Geoffrey Keen, Eric Pohlmann, Sidney James, Liam Redmond, Tonia Bern, Sydney Tafler', 'NR', 'A circus barker stages a sensational new act, the world''s longest fast undertaken by “Sapolio”, on view in a glass cage. But this act also results in several murders, a kidnapping, and a poisoning!', 'A circus barker stages a sensational new act, the world''s longest fast undertaken by “Sapolio”, on view in a glass cage. But this act also results in several murders, a kidnapping, and a poisoning!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yo7MZOJgfZpuviX7pQQYiYmaShm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124525'),
  ('666271370182446937', 'The Glass Castle', 1950, 'Romance, Drama', 'René Clément, Robert Lefebvre', 'Gian Bistolfi, René Clément, Pierre Bost', 'Michèle Morgan, Jean Marais, Jean Servais, Elisa Cegani, Élina Labourdette, Germaine Stainval, Fosco Giachetti, Giovanna Galletti', null, 'Evelyne, a judge''s young wife, falls in love with Rémy while vacationing in Italy. Upon returning home, she must decide between telling her husband and continuing to see Rémy.', 'Evelyne, a judge''s young wife, falls in love with Rémy while vacationing in Italy. Upon returning home, she must decide between telling her husband and continuing to see Rémy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yibNaLMD9voPl13y00eAkjw6nkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5770'),
  ('9356836328365993', 'The Glass Castle', 2017, 'Drama', 'Destin Daniel Cretton, Richard L. Fox, Renato De Cotiis', 'Andrew Lanham, Destin Daniel Cretton', 'Brie Larson, Woody Harrelson, Naomi Watts, Max Greenfield, Sarah Snook, Ella Anderson, Sadie Sink, Robin Bartlett', 'PG-13', 'A young girl is raised in a dysfunctional family constantly on the run from the FBI. Living in poverty, she comes of age guided by her drunkard, ingenious father who distracts her with magical stories to keep her mind off the family''s dire state, and her selfish, nonconformist mother who has no intention of raising a family, along with her younger brother and sister, and her other older sister. Together, they fend for each other as they mature in an unorthodox journey that is their family life.', 'A young girl is raised in a dysfunctional family constantly on the run from the FBI. Living in poverty, she comes of age guided by her drunkard, ingenious father who distracts her with magical stories to keep her mind off the family''s dire state, and her selfish, nonconformist mother who has no intention of raising a family, along with her younger brother and sister, and her other older sister. Together, they fend for each other as they mature in an unorthodox journey that is their family life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NPP7mliHLlVMHce8SjApiRxgzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336000'),
  ('233860648278254545', 'The Glass Ceiling', 1971, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, José Luis Ruiz Marcos, Francisco Fraile', 'Antonio Fos, Eloy de la Iglesia', 'Carmen Sevilla, Dean Selmier, Patty Shepard, Fernando Cebrián, Emma Cohen, Encarna Paso, Rafael Hernández, Javier De Campos', null, 'A lonely housewife hears a man’s footsteps in the apartment above her late at night. The upstairs neighbor insists it is her husband who has returned from business but her explanations are soon contradicted. The woman begins to think her neighbor has murdered her husband.', 'A lonely housewife hears a man’s footsteps in the apartment above her late at night. The upstairs neighbor insists it is her husband who has returned from business but her explanations are soon contradicted. The woman begins to think her neighbor has murdered her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1ZUmdJrvmx9UOgrNqt0VSQcvv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105093'),
  ('527255362559045777', 'The Glass Coffin', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Haritz Zubillaga, Jon D. Domínguez', 'Haritz Zubillaga, Aitor Enériz', 'Paola Bontempi, Juan Dopico, Ramón Moro, Luis Posada, María Luisa Solá', null, 'A famous actress is trapped by an unknown captor in the limo sent to take her to the gala at which she will collect a lifetime achievement award.', 'A famous actress is trapped by an unknown captor in the limo sent to take her to the gala at which she will collect a lifetime achievement award.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VnpOHSFxAZjmIMiNMLhUzVAcIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415445'),
  ('343535278613843378', 'The Glass Harmonica', 1968, 'Animation', 'Andrey Khrzhanovsky, Ekaterina Rizo', 'Gennady Shpalikov', null, null, 'A craftsman builds a glass harmonica that enlightens him. He travels to a town where the people are obsessed with money. A bureaucrat smashes the glass harmonica which leads to chaos and eventually to social reform.', 'A craftsman builds a glass harmonica that enlightens him. He travels to a town where the people are obsessed with money. A bureaucrat smashes the glass harmonica which leads to chaos and eventually to social reform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/al7Zi1roENbIBVF0ICv18g51r8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215400'),
  ('121830659761791947', 'The Glass House', 1972, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Tom Gries, Jules Brenner', 'Wyatt Cooper', 'Alan Alda, Vic Morrow, Clu Gulager, Billy Dee Williams, Kristoffer Tabori, Dean Jagger, Scott Hylands, Edward Bell', null, 'Adapted from a story by Truman Capote ("In Cold Blood"), the world of the prison convict is open to the viewer. As the story develops, one thing becomes clear. As in the outside world, there is a "system"; and just as on the outside, there is accommodation, honesty, cynicism, violence and all the other factors that make up our society. The film follows the three newcomers, it records the grim, terrifying, sometimes fascinating events that occur.', 'Adapted from a story by Truman Capote ("In Cold Blood"), the world of the prison convict is open to the viewer. As the story develops, one thing becomes clear. As in the outside world, there is a "system"; and just as on the outside, there is accommodation, honesty, cynicism, violence and all the other factors that make up our society. The film follows the three newcomers, it records the grim, terrifying, sometimes fascinating events that occur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uG8KlJKIIUlNNfFSkPVaeinIqMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242920'),
  ('833274328402479777', 'The Glass House', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alar Kivilo, Daniel Sackheim, Michael Viglietta', 'Wesley Strick', 'Leelee Sobieski, Diane Lane, Stellan Skarsgård, Trevor Morgan, Chris Noth, Bruce Dern, Kathy Baker, Michael O''Keefe', 'PG-13', 'When Ruby and Rhett''s parents are killed in a car accident, their carefree teenage lives are suddenly shattered. Moving to an incredible house in Malibu with the Glasses'', old friends of the family, seems to be the beginning of a new life for them.', 'When Ruby and Rhett''s parents are killed in a car accident, their carefree teenage lives are suddenly shattered. Moving to an incredible house in Malibu with the Glasses'', old friends of the family, seems to be the beginning of a new life for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16obDcmphjfq17zwWKJlur53fCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2176'),
  ('50677436619548646', 'The Glass Key', 1935, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Frank Tuttle, Henry Sharp, Russell Mathews', 'Kubec Glasmon, Kathryn Scola', 'George Raft, Edward Arnold, Claire Dodd, Ray Milland, Rosalind Keith, Charles Richman, Robert Gleckler, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams', 'NR', 'When Paul Madvig, a successful politician who fights his rivals to seize the city, becomes implicated in a murder, Ed Beaumont, his friend and right-hand man, must decide which side he is on.', 'When Paul Madvig, a successful politician who fights his rivals to seize the city, becomes implicated in a murder, Ed Beaumont, his friend and right-hand man, must decide which side he is on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ir2l4zF08seGFVxPzxiDiHdYqwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29992'),
  ('905253613206097184', 'The Glass Key', 1942, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Stuart Heisler, Theodor Sparkuhl, Arthur S. Black Jr.', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'Brian Donlevy, Veronica Lake, Alan Ladd, Bonita Granville, Richard Denning, Joseph Calleia, William Bendix, Frances Gifford', 'NR', 'A crooked politician finds himself being accused of murder by a gangster from whom he refused help during a re-election campaign.', 'A crooked politician finds himself being accused of murder by a gangster from whom he refused help during a re-election campaign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMUEEEdqKWIN9BxcSFx3dlFb7i1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17131'),
  ('574526578207664456', 'The Glass Menagerie', 1950, 'Drama', 'Irving Rapper, Robert Burks', 'Tennessee Williams, Peter Berneis', 'Jane Wyman, Kirk Douglas, Gertrude Lawrence, Arthur Kennedy, Ralph Sanford, Ann Tyrrell, John Compton, Gertrude Graner', null, 'An aging Southern Belle makes life horrible for her ambitious son and crippled daughter because of her dreams of what life should be.', 'An aging Southern Belle makes life horrible for her ambitious son and crippled daughter because of her dreams of what life should be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBqa5vGXo8ipOfUauJ1Wtx3j7y0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68443'),
  ('119568747877329075', 'The Glass Menagerie', 1973, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Anthony Harvey, Billy Williams', 'Stewart Stern', 'Katharine Hepburn, Sam Waterston, Joanna Miles, Michael Moriarty', 'PG', 'Amanda Wingfield dominates her children with her faded gentility and exaggerated tales of her Southern belle past. Her son plans escape; her daughter withdraws into a dream world. When a gentleman caller appears, things move to crisis point.', 'Amanda Wingfield dominates her children with her faded gentility and exaggerated tales of her Southern belle past. Her son plans escape; her daughter withdraws into a dream world. When a gentleman caller appears, things move to crisis point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GbdnZdjjQwEeHpn2xstOWDYIXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56764'),
  ('183336675123485829', 'The Glass Menagerie', 1987, 'Drama', 'Paul Newman, Michael Ballhaus, Burtt Harris', 'Tennessee Williams', 'Joanne Woodward, John Malkovich, Karen Allen, James Naughton', 'PG', 'An aging Southern Belle makes life horrible for her ambitious son and crippled daughter because of her dreams of what life should be.', 'An aging Southern Belle makes life horrible for her ambitious son and crippled daughter because of her dreams of what life should be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zF02disLmOSyb3BSS4c50MC7xNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52780'),
  ('106447589467524540', 'The Glass Shield', 1994, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Charles Burnett, Elliot Davis', 'Charles Burnett', 'Michael Boatman, Lori Petty, Ice Cube, Erich Anderson, Bernie Casey, Richard Anderson, Elliott Gould, Victoria Dillard', 'PG-13', 'J.J. is a rookie in the Sheriff''s Department and the first black officer at that station. Racial tensions run high in the department as some of J.J.''s fellow officers resent his presence. His only real friend is the other new trooper, the first female officer to work there, who also suffers similar discrimination in the otherwise all-white male work environment. When J.J. becomes increasingly aware of police corruption during the murder trial of Teddy Woods, whom he helped to arrest, he faces difficult decisions and puts himself into grave personal danger in the service of justice.', 'J.J. is a rookie in the Sheriff''s Department and the first black officer at that station. Racial tensions run high in the department as some of J.J.''s fellow officers resent his presence. His only real friend is the other new trooper, the first female officer to work there, who also suffers similar discrimination in the otherwise all-white male work environment. When J.J. becomes increasingly aware of police corruption during the murder trial of Teddy Woods, whom he helped to arrest, he faces difficult decisions and puts himself into grave personal danger in the service of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgvBosSBpjF8ynBi7A1KmMwYoxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72031'),
  ('520132896920225855', 'The Glass Slipper', 1955, 'Music, Fantasy, Romance, Comedy', 'Charles Walters', 'Helen Deutsch', 'Leslie Caron, Michael Wilding, Keenan Wynn, Estelle Winwood, Elsa Lanchester, Barry Jones, Amanda Blake, Lurene Tuttle', null, 'In a musical retelling of the Cinderella tale, a mistreated scullery maid escapes the oppression of her stepfamily to finding love with a prince.', 'In a musical retelling of the Cinderella tale, a mistreated scullery maid escapes the oppression of her stepfamily to finding love with a prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEDHZKUKB5m28tDYKJ8V83F3QDr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139799'),
  ('38555243249083502', 'The Glass Wall', 1953, 'Drama', 'Maxwell Shane, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Ivan Tors, Maxwell Shane', 'Vittorio Gassman, Gloria Grahame, Ann Robinson, Douglas Spencer, Robin Raymond, Jerry Paris, Elizabeth Slifer, Richard Reeves', null, 'Peter Kuban, a Hungarian refugee, is about to be deported after jumping ship in New York harbor. He needs to find an ex-G.I. named Tom whom he helped during the war, as Tom can prove Peter''s right to legal entry into the United States. If he can''t find Tom within 24 hours and prove his case, he will be branded a fugitive and will be permanently disqualified for U.S. citizenship.', 'Peter Kuban, a Hungarian refugee, is about to be deported after jumping ship in New York harbor. He needs to find an ex-G.I. named Tom whom he helped during the war, as Tom can prove Peter''s right to legal entry into the United States. If he can''t find Tom within 24 hours and prove his case, he will be branded a fugitive and will be permanently disqualified for U.S. citizenship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fg0Y0KlcmG4ALhecZCQ3y1tCzVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34752'),
  ('478131123560541191', 'The Glass Web', 1953, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jack Arnold, Maury Gertsman, Joseph Gershenson', 'Robert Blees, Leonard Lee', 'Edward G. Robinson, John Forsythe, Kathleen Hughes, Marcia Henderson, Richard Denning, Hugh Sanders, Jean Willes, Eve McVeagh', 'NR', 'A manipulative diva blackmails a married man and insults her secret lover, leading to her murder. As the husband tries to cover his tracks, the lover sabotages him and suggests turning the case into a TV show episode.', 'A manipulative diva blackmails a married man and insults her secret lover, leading to her murder. As the husband tries to cover his tracks, the lover sabotages him and suggests turning the case into a TV show episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRRdbYDtSlbkwwNmCgqAWgnZ7Qp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37183'),
  ('1095123615656209888', 'The Glass-Blower''s Children', 1998, 'Drama, Family', 'Philip Øgaard, Anders Grönros, Mikael Lundberg', 'Anders Grönros', 'Pernilla August, Stellan Skarsgård, Oliver P. Peldius, Jasmine Heikura, Lena Granhagen, Elin Klinga, Thommy Berggren, Ann-Cathrin Palme', null, 'Based on the novel by Maria Gripe, this is the story of two children, Klas and Klara, growing up in the poor Swedish countryside of the mid-19th century. Their father Albert is a glass-blower, famous for his beautiful vases, but still unable to earn enough money for his wife Sofia and the children. At a spring fair a distinguished gentleman arrives and buys all of Albert''s glassware. After this nothing will be the same again. Klas and Klara are kidnapped and taken to a strange castle...', 'Based on the novel by Maria Gripe, this is the story of two children, Klas and Klara, growing up in the poor Swedish countryside of the mid-19th century. Their father Albert is a glass-blower, famous for his beautiful vases, but still unable to earn enough money for his wife Sofia and the children. At a spring fair a distinguished gentleman arrives and buys all of Albert''s glassware. After this nothing will be the same again. Klas and Klara are kidnapped and taken to a strange castle...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67MQjrQU9JQj3ntlxvHoVzhRrj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83678'),
  ('214139450570611680', 'The Glassblower', 2016, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Christiane Balthasar, Hannes Hubach', 'Léonie-Claire Breinersdorfer', 'Luise Heyer, Maria Ehrich, Robert Gwisdek, Franz Dinda, Dirk Borchardt, Ute Willing, Johanna Bittenbinder, Max Hopp', null, 'Marie violates tradition in a small German town of Lauscha, to become the first female glassblower in in 1890. Her glass ball decorations find a new market in America.', 'Marie violates tradition in a small German town of Lauscha, to become the first female glassblower in in 1890. Her glass ball decorations find a new market in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ux2V2U77lJ1LQTjaPt8GXYCMjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422154'),
  ('172378826792575540', 'The Glassworker', 2024, 'Animation, Family, Romance, War', 'Mariam Riaz Paracha, Usman Riaz, Usman Riaz', 'Moya O''Shea', 'Mooroo, Mariam Riaz Paracha, Khaled Anam, Ameed Riaz, Mahum Moazzam, Khalifa Sajeeruddin, Dino Ali, Usman Riaz', null, 'A young glassworker-in-training living with his pacifist father finds his apprenticeship upended by an impending war and the arrival of an army colonel to their seaside town.', 'A young glassworker-in-training living with his pacifist father finds his apprenticeship upended by an impending war and the arrival of an army colonel to their seaside town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aj4IhLVphVwKuZrE5EcSGTUMmk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629078'),
  ('992306014620028303', 'The Gleaners and I', 2000, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Agnès Varda, Didier Doussin', 'Agnès Varda', 'Agnès Varda, Bodan Litnanski, François Wertheimer', 'NR', 'Varda focuses her eye on gleaners: those who scour already-reaped fields for the odd potato or turnip. Her investigation leads from forgotten corners of the French countryside to off-hours at the green markets of Paris, following those who insist on finding a use for that which society has cast off, whether out of necessity or activism.', 'Varda focuses her eye on gleaners: those who scour already-reaped fields for the odd potato or turnip. Her investigation leads from forgotten corners of the French countryside to off-hours at the green markets of Paris, following those who insist on finding a use for that which society has cast off, whether out of necessity or activism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IdCTKi4Eu7i897jpe59wIDGCri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44379'),
  ('257900473291334898', 'The Gleaners and I: Two Years Later', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Agnès Varda', null, 'Agnès Varda', null, 'Agnès Varda’s follow-up to her acclaimed documentary THE GLEANERS AND I takes us deeper into the world of those who find purpose and beauty in the refuse of society, revisiting many of the original film’s subjects.', 'Agnès Varda’s follow-up to her acclaimed documentary THE GLEANERS AND I takes us deeper into the world of those who find purpose and beauty in the refuse of society, revisiting many of the original film’s subjects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azTpxHHruFZlroxfcYir9ESpcAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84026'),
  ('1078589718706241261', 'The Gleiwitz Case', 1961, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Gerhard Klein, Jan Čuřík', 'Günther Rücker, Wolfgang Kohlhaase', 'Hannjo Hasse, Herwart Grosse, Hilmar Thate, Christoph Beyertt, Wolfgang Kalweit, Georg Leopold, Heinz Behrens, Rolf Ripperger', null, 'To justify their invasion of Poland at the start of WWII, Nazi high command hatches a secret plan: six Polish men from an SS training camp are sent on a special mission to the town of Gleiwitz, to fake a Polish raid on Germany. The ‘provoked’ Germans will thus launch a ‘counterattack’ on Poland.', 'To justify their invasion of Poland at the start of WWII, Nazi high command hatches a secret plan: six Polish men from an SS training camp are sent on a special mission to the town of Gleiwitz, to fake a Polish raid on Germany. The ‘provoked’ Germans will thus launch a ‘counterattack’ on Poland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y56eXJCnQJmA7phTwe7GgKa6Uqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205409'),
  ('761447478911237885', 'The Glembays', 1988, 'Drama', 'Antun Vrdoljak', 'Antun Vrdoljak', 'Mustafa Nadarević, Ena Begović, Tonko Lonza, Bernarda Oman, Matko Raguž, Žarko Potočnjak, Zvonko Strmac, Zvonimir Zoričić', null, 'The Glembays of Zagreb are a rich family cursed with tragedies and haunted by sinister past. Leone Glembay, a rebelious son of the family patriarch, is becoming disgusted with hypocrisy, perversion and crime that runs in the family.', 'The Glembays of Zagreb are a rich family cursed with tragedies and haunted by sinister past. Leone Glembay, a rebelious son of the family patriarch, is becoming disgusted with hypocrisy, perversion and crime that runs in the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tShg7S3VbuSiKNxKOy4fdItcbBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259731'),
  ('1118242884400371961', 'The Glenn Miller Story', 1954, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'William H. Daniels, Anthony Mann, Joseph Gershenson', 'Oscar Brodney, Valentine Davies', 'James Stewart, June Allyson, Harry Morgan, Charles Drake, George Tobias, Barton MacLane, Sig Ruman, Irving Bacon', 'G', 'A vibrant tribute to one of America''s legendary bandleaders, charting Glenn Miller''s rise from obscurity and poverty to fame and wealth in the early 1940s.', 'A vibrant tribute to one of America''s legendary bandleaders, charting Glenn Miller''s rise from obscurity and poverty to fame and wealth in the early 1940s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEuwIMj7jKYaUt0ZG6aVpYxlkrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17729'),
  ('194873497941008739', 'The Glimmer Man', 1996, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Gray, Rick Bota, Michael Neumann', 'Kevin Brodbin', 'Steven Seagal, Keenen Ivory Wayans, Bob Gunton, Brian Cox, John M. Jackson, Michelle Johnson, Stephen Tobolowsky, Peter Jason', 'R', 'A former government operative renowned for his stealth, Jack Cole is now a Los Angeles police detective. When a series of horrible murders occurs in the metro area, Cole is assigned to the case, along with tough-talking fellow cop Jim Campbell. Although the two men clash, they gradually become effective partners as they uncover a conspiracy linked to the killings, which also involves terrorism and organized crime.', 'A former government operative renowned for his stealth, Jack Cole is now a Los Angeles police detective. When a series of horrible murders occurs in the metro area, Cole is assigned to the case, along with tough-talking fellow cop Jim Campbell. Although the two men clash, they gradually become effective partners as they uncover a conspiracy linked to the killings, which also involves terrorism and organized crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMXc2nf3iZFsVbNNmJ5MCtjcwlk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9625'),
  ('1152670388321650465', 'The Glorias', 2020, 'Drama', 'Victor Capoccia, Julie Taymor, Rodrigo Prieto', 'Sarah Ruhl, Julie Taymor', 'Julianne Moore, Alicia Vikander, Lulu Wilson, Ryan Kiera Armstrong, Timothy Hutton, Janelle Monáe, Enid Graham, Bette Midler', 'R', 'An equal rights crusader, journalist and activist: Gloria Steinem embodies these and more. From her role in the revolutionary women''s rights movement to her travels throughout the U.S. and around the world, Steinem has made an everlasting mark on modern history. A nontraditional chronicle of a trailblazing life.', 'An equal rights crusader, journalist and activist: Gloria Steinem embodies these and more. From her role in the revolutionary women''s rights movement to her travels throughout the U.S. and around the world, Steinem has made an everlasting mark on modern history. A nontraditional chronicle of a trailblazing life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bItFQ4QahfILGj9mA5uyJvAimeD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519056'),
  ('654775169688965373', 'The Glorious Acceptance of Nicolas Chauvin', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Thomas Bobrowski, Rémi Bouvier, Benjamin Crotty', 'Christelle Meaux', 'Alexis Manenti, Antoine Cholet, Pauline Jacquard, Caroline Deruas, Ragnar Árni Ágústsson, Christophe Tek', null, 'During his acceptance speech for a lifetime achievement award, Nicolas Chauvin – a farmer-soldier, a veteran of the Revolutionary Army and the Napoleonic Wars, “father” of the chauvinism that bears his name – embarks on a monologue and recounts his life story. At the bend of a road, a spectral encounter shocks his (non-)existence.', 'During his acceptance speech for a lifetime achievement award, Nicolas Chauvin – a farmer-soldier, a veteran of the Revolutionary Army and the Napoleonic Wars, “father” of the chauvinism that bears his name – embarks on a monologue and recounts his life story. At the bend of a road, a spectral encounter shocks his (non-)existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upOlnBkSQUCBMo8K1aE3D2Jkay3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538078'),
  ('472693872493603559', 'The Glorious Team Batista', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura', 'Mitsuharu Makita, Hiroshi Saito', 'Yuko Takeuchi, Hiroshi Abe, Koji Kikkawa, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Tetsuji Tamayama, Haruka Igawa, Hiromasa Taguchi, Naoki Tanaka', null, 'Toho university hospital has established an outstanding coronary surgery team under the leadership of a up and coming, star, U.S. trained surgeon that specializes in the highly risky "Batista" procedure to shrink the size of enlarged hearts. Normally this procedure has only a 60% success rate, but "Team Batista" has achieved a run of 26 straight successes....when suddenly 3 patients in a row die on the operating table. Very disturbed, the lead surgeon requests an independent investigation. The hospital turns to Dr. Taguchi who is a specialist in psychosomatic disorders who is shocked to at the assignment because she knows nothing in particular about surgery. Assured, however, that this very lack of insider specialized knowledge is in fact the "objectivity" required, she diligently begins to investigate in her own polite, but persistent manner.', 'Toho university hospital has established an outstanding coronary surgery team under the leadership of a up and coming, star, U.S. trained surgeon that specializes in the highly risky "Batista" procedure to shrink the size of enlarged hearts. Normally this procedure has only a 60% success rate, but "Team Batista" has achieved a run of 26 straight successes....when suddenly 3 patients in a row die on the operating table. Very disturbed, the lead surgeon requests an independent investigation. The hospital turns to Dr. Taguchi who is a specialist in psychosomatic disorders who is shocked to at the assignment because she knows nothing in particular about surgery. Assured, however, that this very lack of insider specialized knowledge is in fact the "objectivity" required, she diligently begins to investigate in her own polite, but persistent manner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAz0oeMFeocP4Jg1XkP3pacufaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18399'),
  ('621638039443906875', 'The Glory Guys', 1965, 'Drama, Action, Western, Romance', 'James Wong Howe, Arnold Laven', 'Sam Peckinpah', 'Tom Tryon, Harve Presnell, Senta Berger, Michael Anderson Jr., James Caan, Slim Pickens, Erik Holland, Adam Williams', null, 'Though a fictionalized Western based on George Armstrong Custer''s 7th Cavalry Regiment at the Battle of the Little Big Horn, the film is almost a generic war story covering the enlistment, training, and operational deployment of a group of recruits that could take place in any time period.', 'Though a fictionalized Western based on George Armstrong Custer''s 7th Cavalry Regiment at the Battle of the Little Big Horn, the film is almost a generic war story covering the enlistment, training, and operational deployment of a group of recruits that could take place in any time period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ih3HDaXFrYBd6U25eOPJTe2RFpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37377'),
  ('828682342132555318', 'The Glory of Life', 2024, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Georg Maas, Judith Kaufmann, Judith Kaufmann', 'Georg Maas, Michael Gutmann', 'Henriette Confurius, Sabin Tambrea, Manuel Rubey, Daniela Golpashin, Leo Altaras, Klaus Huhle, Kristian Nekrasov, Peter Moltzen', null, 'Because of the power of love, the last year of Franz Kafka''s life becomes his happiest. The well-known writer has never before been able to allow himself to experience intimacy, he suffers from tuberculosis and is dependent on his overbearing family. In the summer of 1923, he met Dora Diamant in the seaside resort Graal-Müritz on the Baltic Sea coast, where he is convalescing and she is working in a Jewish Volksheim. He is a man of world, the 14 years younger woman is from the deep East, he can write, she can dance. She has both feet firmly on the ground, he is always hovering a little above it. She embraces the indicative, he gets tangled up in the conjunctive. But the worldly wise Dora accepts him as he is. And he accepts her. Together they go to Berlin and when Franz''s health deteriorates rapidly, to a sanatorium in Austria. They are granted a single year together until Franz Kafka''s health deteriorates incurable. However their year together allows them to feel the glory of life.', 'Because of the power of love, the last year of Franz Kafka''s life becomes his happiest. The well-known writer has never before been able to allow himself to experience intimacy, he suffers from tuberculosis and is dependent on his overbearing family. In the summer of 1923, he met Dora Diamant in the seaside resort Graal-Müritz on the Baltic Sea coast, where he is convalescing and she is working in a Jewish Volksheim. He is a man of world, the 14 years younger woman is from the deep East, he can write, she can dance. She has both feet firmly on the ground, he is always hovering a little above it. She embraces the indicative, he gets tangled up in the conjunctive. But the worldly wise Dora accepts him as he is. And he accepts her. Together they go to Berlin and when Franz''s health deteriorates rapidly, to a sanatorium in Austria. They are granted a single year together until Franz Kafka''s health deteriorates incurable. However their year together allows them to feel the glory of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sYdCAa8CY3KAOcjvSpd47Qe7MB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1231180'),
  ('898813420034125681', 'The Glory Stompers', 1967, 'Action, Drama', 'Anthony M. Lanza, Mario Tosi', 'James Gordon White, John Lawrence', 'Dennis Hopper, Jody McCrea, Chris Noel, Jock Mahoney, Lindsay Crosby, Casey Kasem, Jim Reader, Sandra Bettin', null, 'Chino is the tough leader of a motorcycle gang who starts off a war when he abducts and mistreats the leader of the enemy biker gang, Darryl, and his girlfriend Chris. Things get violent when Darryl comes back for revenge.', 'Chino is the tough leader of a motorcycle gang who starts off a war when he abducts and mistreats the leader of the enemy biker gang, Darryl, and his girlfriend Chris. Things get violent when Darryl comes back for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18nRXGWKBkgulTxXOCu0yGv6uVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88737'),
  ('1108933735235986691', 'The Glove', 1979, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ross Hagen, Gary Graver, Tony Lorea', 'Hubert Smith, Julian Roffman', 'John Saxon, Rosey Grier, Joanna Cassidy, Joan Blondell, Jack Carter, Aldo Ray, Keenan Wynn, Howard Honig', 'R', 'In this actioner, a bounty hunter is assigned to bring back an enormous and angry ex-convict who wears a deadly glove made of leather and steel. Rock''em sock''em mayhem ensues.', 'In this actioner, a bounty hunter is assigned to bring back an enormous and angry ex-convict who wears a deadly glove made of leather and steel. Rock''em sock''em mayhem ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLIKSyuWeGI7hq7Kz1dfv5QjvTx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80638'),
