  ('185334626598414442', 'The Gnome-Mobile', 1967, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Robert Stevenson, Edward Colman, Arthur J. Vitarelli', 'Ellis Kadison', 'Walter Brennan, Matthew Garber, Karen Dotrice, Richard Deacon, Sean McClory, Ed Wynn, Jerome Cowan, Charles Lane', 'G', 'An eccentric millionaire and his grandchildren are embroiled in the plights of some forest gnomes who are searching for the rest of their tribe. While helping them, the millionaire is suspected of being crazy because he''s seeing gnomes! He''s committed, and the niece and nephew and the gnomes have to find him and free him.', 'An eccentric millionaire and his grandchildren are embroiled in the plights of some forest gnomes who are searching for the rest of their tribe. While helping them, the millionaire is suspected of being crazy because he''s seeing gnomes! He''s committed, and the niece and nephew and the gnomes have to find him and free him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeugD3jvHaNCaSc6r3NK1EcYvty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24816'),
  ('103647536080904456', 'The Gnomes'' Great Adventure', 1990, 'Animation, Family', 'Claudio Biern Boyd', null, 'Manuel Lázaro, Marta Martorell, Gonzalo Abril, Emilio Freixas, Emilio Freixas, Francisco Alborch, Francisco Alborch, Aleix Estadella', 'G', 'David the Gnome and Swift the Fox embark on a search to find a gold treasure stolen by trolls.', 'David the Gnome and Swift the Fox embark on a search to find a gold treasure stolen by trolls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDfL9vVvNrZZX8j1lqAPZQEO5Ki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101538'),
  ('43229266652620052', 'The Go Master', 2007, 'Drama', 'Tian Zhuangzhuang, Wang Yu', 'Zhong A-Cheng', 'Chang Chen, Akira Emoto, Sylvia Chang, Ayumi Ito, Takashi Nishina, Nao Omori, Takayuki Inoue, Hironobu Nomura', null, 'The life of Go master Wu Qingyuan from his meteoric rise as a child prodigy to fame and fortune as a revolutionary strategic thinker, as well as the tumultuous conflicts between his homeland of China and his adopted nation of Japan.', 'The life of Go master Wu Qingyuan from his meteoric rise as a child prodigy to fame and fortune as a revolutionary strategic thinker, as well as the tumultuous conflicts between his homeland of China and his adopted nation of Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nStNI7Ke625kfBuD8QN5Tuh5Mj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38181'),
  ('1083735124790115895', 'The Go-Between', 1971, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gerry Fisher, Joseph Losey', 'Harold Pinter', 'Julie Christie, Alan Bates, Edward Fox, Michael Redgrave, Dominic Guard, Margaret Leighton, Michael Gough, Richard Gibson', 'PG', 'British teenager Leo Colston spends a summer in the countryside, where he develops a crush on the beautiful young aristocrat Marian. Eager to impress her, Leo becomes the "go-between" for Marian, delivering secret romantic letters to Ted Burgess, a handsome neighboring farmer.', 'British teenager Leo Colston spends a summer in the countryside, where he develops a crush on the beautiful young aristocrat Marian. Eager to impress her, Leo becomes the "go-between" for Marian, delivering secret romantic letters to Ted Burgess, a handsome neighboring farmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61dXOIpDaiWCp7aIjBYkd6ujdXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36194'),
  ('248143272433410508', 'The Go-Getter', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Martin Hynes, Byron Shah', 'Martin Hynes', 'Lou Taylor Pucci, Zooey Deschanel, Jena Malone, Giuseppe Andrews, Kathleen M. Darcy, Judy Greer, Nick Offerman, Brian McNamara', null, 'When his mother dies, a teenager takes a road-trip in a stolen car to find his long-lost brother. Along the way he discovers a profound connection with the car-owner and with himself as well.', 'When his mother dies, a teenager takes a road-trip in a stolen car to find his long-lost brother. Along the way he discovers a profound connection with the car-owner and with himself as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WMZHz3Im5B41g63COwQsZcY7F5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9867'),
  ('645766750671101703', 'The Go-Go Boys: The Inside Story of Cannon Films', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Hilla Medalia', 'Daniel Sivan, Hilla Medalia', 'Menahem Golan, Yoram Globus, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Michael Dudikoff, Jon Voight, Billy Drago, Andrei Konchalovsky, Franco Zeffirelli', 'NR', 'Cousins Menahem Golan and Yoram Globus relive the creation, rise and fall of their independent film company, Cannon Films. This documentary recounts their many successes and discusses their eventual downfall.', 'Cousins Menahem Golan and Yoram Globus relive the creation, rise and fall of their independent film company, Cannon Films. This documentary recounts their many successes and discusses their eventual downfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpc5p8NyADSsZyZAcn7qdsWuvsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295099'),
  ('80913739888209096', 'The Go-Go''s', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Alison Ellwood, Sam Painter, Ronan Killeen', null, 'Charlotte Caffey, Belinda Carlisle, Gina Schock, Kathy Valentine, Jane Wiedlin, Elissa Bello, Paula Jean Brown, Ginger Canzoneri', 'NR', 'As the first all-female band to play their instruments, write their songs and have a No. 1 album, The Go-Go’s made history. Underpinned by candid testimonies, this film chronicles the meteoric rise to fame of a band born in the LA punk scene who became a pop phenomenon.', 'As the first all-female band to play their instruments, write their songs and have a No. 1 album, The Go-Go’s made history. Underpinned by candid testimonies, this film chronicles the meteoric rise to fame of a band born in the LA punk scene who became a pop phenomenon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5bktp3aUDplX9xCPrPrKxwOnVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653748'),
  ('27242411357543573', 'The Goal', 2005, 'Drama', 'Darla Rae', 'Haylar Garcia', 'Ryan J. Parker, Gale Grove, Steve Sanner, Wendy Duncan, Jason Regier', null, '"The Goal" chronicles the lives of two athletes who are on an adrenaline track, one to the Olympics and the other to the world of Pro Soccer.', '"The Goal" chronicles the lives of two athletes who are on an adrenaline track, one to the Olympics and the other to the world of Pro Soccer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/me5SAqnXaTHp7sPLkfPuIxwTl1i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296811'),
  ('600426035468161937', 'The Goalie''s Anxiety at the Penalty Kick', 1975, 'Drama', 'Wim Wenders, Robby Müller, Klaus Bädekerl', 'Wim Wenders', 'Arthur Brauss, Kai Fischer, Erika Pluhar, Libgart Schwarz, Marie Bardischewski, Michael Toost, Bert Fortell, Edda Köchl', 'NR', 'Goalkeeper Josef Bloch is sent off after committing a foul during an away game. This causes him to lose his bearings, and he wanders aimlessly through the city streets and spends the night with the box-office attendant of a movie theatre.', 'Goalkeeper Josef Bloch is sent off after committing a foul during an away game. This causes him to lose his bearings, and he wanders aimlessly through the city streets and spends the night with the box-office attendant of a movie theatre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/havaGXwHhznTiW53yqHgcyulSGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42481'),
  ('621029262710465002', 'The Goalkeeper', 2000, 'Drama', 'Gonzalo Suárez, Javier Balaguer, Carlos Suárez', 'Manuel Hidalgo, Gonzalo Suárez', 'Carmelo Gómez, Maribel Verdú, Antonio Resines, Roberto Álvarez, Eduard Fernández, Elvira Mínguez, Abel Vitón, Andoni Gracia', null, 'Ramiro Forteza is a Premier League goalkeeper whom the Civil War and the rigors of the war led to make a living visiting villages and challenging locals to mark him penalty goals. One evening he arrives to a town in Asturias and meets Manuela, a young widow with a son, who survives sewing for Ursula, Andrade''s wife, the Civil Guard sergeant.', 'Ramiro Forteza is a Premier League goalkeeper whom the Civil War and the rigors of the war led to make a living visiting villages and challenging locals to mark him penalty goals. One evening he arrives to a town in Asturias and meets Manuela, a young widow with a son, who survives sewing for Ursula, Andrade''s wife, the Civil Guard sergeant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gadm0a5z6p5JySNUbSG0jrM2u1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89297'),
