  ('628951148680969268', 'The God', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Konstantin Bronzit', 'Konstantin Bronzit', null, null, 'The film shows Shiva in a very traditional representation--in bronze and standing within a circle of bronze flames. Suddenly, a fly lands on Shiva''s arm--one of many arms to be exact. Slowly, the bronze statue comes alive and swats the fly--missing again and again and eventually smashing the bronze circle.', 'The film shows Shiva in a very traditional representation--in bronze and standing within a circle of bronze flames. Suddenly, a fly lands on Shiva''s arm--one of many arms to be exact. Slowly, the bronze statue comes alive and swats the fly--missing again and again and eventually smashing the bronze circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inZBy4F6OGEQKLTDrZfhS8y548o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48520'),
  ('758290429288581115', 'The God Committee', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Matt Sakatani Roe, Austin Stark', 'Austin Stark', 'Kelsey Grammer, Julia Stiles, Janeane Garofalo, Dan Hedaya, Colman Domingo, Patricia R. Floyd, Elizabeth Masucci, Patricia Mauceri', null, 'Medicine, money and morality clash when a hospital''s Heart Transplant Selection Committee has only minutes to decide which of three patients on the transplant list will receive a heart that has suddenly become available.', 'Medicine, money and morality clash when a hospital''s Heart Transplant Selection Committee has only minutes to decide which of three patients on the transplant list will receive a heart that has suddenly become available.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1dXPdz5C1tPpPIy3kth3rTCOQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653024'),
  ('507254529171426735', 'The God of Cookery', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Lee Lik-Chi, Stephen Chow, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Tsang Kan-Cheong, Lo Man-Sang, Stephen Chow', 'Stephen Chow, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Nancy Sit Ka-Yin, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Law Kar-Ying, Tats Lau Yee-Tat, Lee Siu-Kay', null, 'The most renowned and feared chef in the world loses his title of God of Cookery because of his pompous attitude. Humbled, he sets out to reclaim his title.', 'The most renowned and feared chef in the world loses his title of God of Cookery because of his pompous attitude. Humbled, he sets out to reclaim his title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BbEsmLl1kVPcsojW5W8kMm5Ws5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41343'),
  ('95068462289668341', 'The God Who Wasn''t There', 2005, 'Documentary, Drama, Fantasy', 'Brian Flemming', 'Brian Flemming', 'Richard Dawkins, Sam Harris, Robert M. Price, Richard Carrier, Alan Dundes, Barbara Mikkelson, David P. Mikkelson, Brian Flemming', null, 'Did Jesus exist? This film starts with that question, then goes on to examine Christianity as a whole.', 'Did Jesus exist? This film starts with that question, then goes on to examine Christianity as a whole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySkzTtTuQDJ4Nzl1fC7NxsIUL9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13014'),
  ('502499519861227700', 'The Goddess', 1934, 'Drama', 'Yonggang Wu, Weilie Hong', 'Yonggang Wu', 'Ruan Lingyu, Zhang Zhizhi, Keng Li, Junpan Li, Huaiqiu Tang, Tian Jian', null, 'A young prostitute, who is trying to give her infant son a good start in life, must contend with a coercive pimp and the prejudices of others.', 'A young prostitute, who is trying to give her infant son a good start in life, must contend with a coercive pimp and the prejudices of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhKVL4m9anBX0S8N6SWqsXx6W2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112698'),
