  ('191916444252428368', 'The Goddess of 1967', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Clara Law, Chris Webb, Tanya Jackson', 'Clara Law, Eddie Fong Ling-Ching', 'Rose Byrne, Rikiya Kurokawa, Nicholas Hope, Elise McCredie, Tim Richards, Bree Beadman, Satya Gumbert, Tina Bursill', null, 'A rich, young businessman travels to Australia with the intention of buying a 1967 Citroën DS. Once he arrives, things do not go to plan, and he must drive the DS into the outback alongside a blind young woman in order to track down its seller.', 'A rich, young businessman travels to Australia with the intention of buying a 1967 Citroën DS. Once he arrives, things do not go to plan, and he must drive the DS into the outback alongside a blind young woman in order to track down its seller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJ5EH3WJBfZPYU4elOAwZDuZQ7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46226'),
  ('857453836827751990', 'The Goddess of Fortune', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Silvia Ranfagni, Gianni Romoli', 'Stefano Accorsi, Edoardo Leo, Jasmine Trinca, Serra Yılmaz, Sara Ciocca, Filippo Nigro, Barbara Alberti, Edoardo Brandi', null, 'Alessandro and Arturo have been together for over 15 years and, despite the feeling they still have for each other, their relationship is now at crisis. When Alessandro’s best friend, out of the blue, asks them to take care of her two kids for a few days, something changes in their daily routine and love will drive them to a crazy and unexpected turn in their life.', 'Alessandro and Arturo have been together for over 15 years and, despite the feeling they still have for each other, their relationship is now at crisis. When Alessandro’s best friend, out of the blue, asks them to take care of her two kids for a few days, something changes in their daily routine and love will drive them to a crazy and unexpected turn in their life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8ArEpu81pYN77zMcodSPvH3S0J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606952'),
  ('718614607281522404', 'The Goddess of Spring', 1934, 'Animation, Fantasy, Music', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Diana Gaylen, Kenny Baker, Tudor Williams, Jessica Dragonette, Purv Pullen', 'NR', 'The goddess is greeted by dancing flowers and fairies. The devil comes and takes her away to be his queen. She''s despondent, as winter settles in above ground. But the devil isn''t happy either, and offers anything to make her happy. They reach an agreement: she''ll spend six months above ground and six below. Thus we have seasons.', 'The goddess is greeted by dancing flowers and fairies. The devil comes and takes her away to be his queen. She''s despondent, as winter settles in above ground. But the devil isn''t happy either, and offers anything to make her happy. They reach an agreement: she''ll spend six months above ground and six below. Thus we have seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGWnxK5ziYAlPsYtAfuUQamIkVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67588'),
  ('388396467437268017', 'The Goddesses', 1972, 'Drama', 'Walter Hugo Khouri, Rudolf Icsey, Antonio Meliande', 'Walter Hugo Khouri', 'Lilian Lemmertz, Mário Benvenutti, Kate Hansen', null, 'Psychiatrist lends her country house to patient, expecting she would repose. But she meets a neurotic former lover, and the psychiatrist gets so involved in the couple''s problems that she ends up getting dependent of them.', 'Psychiatrist lends her country house to patient, expecting she would repose. But she meets a neurotic former lover, and the psychiatrist gets so involved in the couple''s problems that she ends up getting dependent of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jVJxAFr2Z2pJmmxxpPoPTrxsbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195457'),
  ('502633869048214958', 'The Godfather', 1972, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gordon Willis, Tony Brandt, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Mario Puzo, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Marlon Brando, Al Pacino, James Caan, Robert Duvall, Richard S. Castellano, Diane Keaton, Talia Shire, Gianni Russo', 'R', 'Spanning the years 1945 to 1955, a chronicle of the fictional Italian-American Corleone crime family. When organized crime family patriarch, Vito Corleone barely survives an attempt on his life, his youngest son, Michael steps in to take care of the would-be killers, launching a campaign of bloody revenge.', 'Spanning the years 1945 to 1955, a chronicle of the fictional Italian-American Corleone crime family. When organized crime family patriarch, Vito Corleone barely survives an attempt on his life, his youngest son, Michael steps in to take care of the would-be killers, launching a campaign of bloody revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bhkrj58Vtu7enYsRolD1fZdja1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238'),
  ('671885567209731232', 'The Godfather Family: A Look Inside', 1990, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Jeff Werner', 'David Gilbert', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Mario Puzo, James Caan, Sofia Coppola, Robert De Niro, Al Pacino, Joe Mantegna, Robert Duvall', null, 'A documentary on the making of the three Godfather films, with interviews and recollections from the film makers and cast. This feature also includes the original screen tests of some of the actors for "The Godfather" film, and some candid moments on the set of "The Godfather: Part III."', 'A documentary on the making of the three Godfather films, with interviews and recollections from the film makers and cast. This feature also includes the original screen tests of some of the actors for "The Godfather" film, and some candid moments on the set of "The Godfather: Part III."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDdybr7reoVABPthX9OSlazvncD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56205'),
  ('243201758458812630', 'The Godfather Part II', 1974, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gordon Willis, Newt Arnold, Tony Brandt', 'Mario Puzo, Francis Ford Coppola', 'Al Pacino, Robert Duvall, Diane Keaton, Robert De Niro, John Cazale, Talia Shire, Lee Strasberg, Michael V. Gazzo', 'R', 'In the continuing saga of the Corleone crime family, a young Vito Corleone grows up in Sicily and in 1910s New York. In the 1950s, Michael Corleone attempts to expand the family business into Las Vegas, Hollywood and Cuba.', 'In the continuing saga of the Corleone crime family, a young Vito Corleone grows up in Sicily and in 1910s New York. In the 1950s, Michael Corleone attempts to expand the family business into Las Vegas, Hollywood and Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hek3koDUyRQk7FIhPXsa6mT2Zc3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240'),
  ('124503300878201643', 'The Godfather Part III', 1990, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Gordon Willis, Francis Ford Coppola, Franckie Diago', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Mario Puzo', 'Al Pacino, Diane Keaton, Talia Shire, Andy Garcia, Eli Wallach, Joe Mantegna, George Hamilton, Bridget Fonda', 'R', 'In the midst of trying to legitimize his business dealings in 1979 New York and Italy, aging mafia don, Michael Corleone seeks forgiveness for his sins while taking a young protege under his wing.', 'In the midst of trying to legitimize his business dealings in 1979 New York and Italy, aging mafia don, Michael Corleone seeks forgiveness for his sins while taking a young protege under his wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lm3pQ2QoQ16pextRsmnUbG2onES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242'),
  ('108544983306923025', 'The Godless Girl', 1928, 'Drama, Crime', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Frank Urson, J. Peverell Marley', null, 'Lina Basquette, Tom Keene, Marie Prevost, Noah Beery, Eddie Quillan, Mary Jane Irving, Clarence Burton, Kate Price', 'NR', 'High school students led by the Girl and Boy turn from Christianity toward secret atheistic meetings. When a girl is accidentally killed by a stairway collapse, the Girl and Boy go to reform school where they are treated brutally.', 'High school students led by the Girl and Boy turn from Christianity toward secret atheistic meetings. When a girl is accidentally killed by a stairway collapse, the Girl and Boy go to reform school where they are treated brutally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNEwDBiFeG8lZcCX8O7xqg1DOKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85685'),
  ('927775354116363134', 'The Gods Must Be Crazy', 1980, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jamie Uys, Buster Reynolds, Robert Lewis', 'Jamie Uys', 'Marius Weyers, Sandra Prinsloo, N!xau, Louw Verwey, Michael Thys, Nic De Jager, Fanyana H. Sidumo, Joe Seakatsie', 'PG', 'A Coca-Cola bottle dropped from an airplane raises havoc among a normally peaceful tribe of African bushmen who believe it to be a utensil of the gods.', 'A Coca-Cola bottle dropped from an airplane raises havoc among a normally peaceful tribe of African bushmen who believe it to be a utensil of the gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wntGWN2mpeS3QaUm1PTKAcTM9K7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8393'),
  ('631122485779711391', 'The Gods Must Be Crazy II', 1989, 'Action, Comedy', 'Buster Reynolds, Jamie Uys', 'Jamie Uys', 'N!xau, Lena Farugia, Hans Strydom, Eiros, Nadies, Erick Bowen, Pierre van Pletzen, Lourens Swanepoel', 'PG', 'Xixo is back again. This time, his children accidentally stow away on a fast-moving poachers'' truck, unable to get off, and Xixo sets out to rescue them. Along the way, he encounters a couple of soldiers trying to capture each other and a pilot and passenger of a small plane, who are each having a few problems of their own.', 'Xixo is back again. This time, his children accidentally stow away on a fast-moving poachers'' truck, unable to get off, and Xixo sets out to rescue them. Along the way, he encounters a couple of soldiers trying to capture each other and a pilot and passenger of a small plane, who are each having a few problems of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxPpBTB2Rd5PHs97E2zn0t9GCSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11937'),
  ('99826001996034725', 'The Gods Must Be Crazy: Crazy Safari', 1991, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Billy Chan Wui-Ngai, Henry Chan, Chan Tung-Chuen', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'N!xau, Lam Ching-Ying, Christopher Chan San-Hiu, Peter Chan Lung, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Michelle Bestbier, Saul Bamberger, Peter Mahlangu', null, 'Two guys, one of them a magician, are transporting an ancient chinese vampire who can only be controlled by a series of yellow tapes, and is the ancestor of the other guy. On the way, while flying over Africa, their plane stalls. And of all places, where do they land? That''s right, in the village of the tribe of "The Gods Must Be Crazy".', 'Two guys, one of them a magician, are transporting an ancient chinese vampire who can only be controlled by a series of yellow tapes, and is the ancestor of the other guy. On the way, while flying over Africa, their plane stalls. And of all places, where do they land? That''s right, in the village of the tribe of "The Gods Must Be Crazy".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bULIYu1m6h9aJfV3Odz6k1DbZzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50507'),
  ('56284898385997729', 'The Gods Must Be Funny in China', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Dick Cho', null, 'N!xau, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Cheng Pei-Pei, Gloria Yip Wan-Yee, Joseph Cheng King-Kei, Simon Lui Yu-Yeung, Cynthia Khan, Evergreen Mak Cheung-Ching', null, 'Hijinks ensue when N!xau the Bushman travels to Beijing, where he''s recruited to accompany a track team on a week-long survival race through the Chinese wilderness.', 'Hijinks ensue when N!xau the Bushman travels to Beijing, where he''s recruited to accompany a track team on a week-long survival race through the Chinese wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f73U8VUkS9Xe5RidijYpJlsnFTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125386'),
  ('108671126297725451', 'The Godsend', 1980, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gabrielle Beaumont, Norman Warwick, Derek Whitehurst', 'Olaf Pooley', 'Malcolm Stoddard, Cyd Hayman, Angela Pleasence, Patrick Barr, Wilhelmina Green, Joanne Boorman, Angela Deamer, Clarissa Young', 'R', 'An English family of six takes in a pregnant woman who disappears shortly after giving birth. They raise the baby girl as their own, but over the years the strange deaths of their children make them consider whether the little girl is more than she appears.', 'An English family of six takes in a pregnant woman who disappears shortly after giving birth. They raise the baby girl as their own, but over the years the strange deaths of their children make them consider whether the little girl is more than she appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kXPEcqpWue0TZfztnvmpC2w1lp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80624'),
  ('723877513435801289', 'The Godson', 1971, 'Crime', 'William Rotsler, William Rotsler, Phil Miller', 'William Rotsler', 'Jason Yukon, Orita De Chadwick, Damon Kebroyd, Don Garcia, Lois Mitchell, Keith Erickson, Jane Allyson, Maria Arnold', null, 'An ambitious mobster, Marko, makes the local brothel into a rousing success after double-crossing the mafia Don. This of course angers certain people who come after him.', 'An ambitious mobster, Marko, makes the local brothel into a rousing success after double-crossing the mafia Don. This of course angers certain people who come after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvPH7xVz5PXX9gbg6KEbDvW2LHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42520'),
  ('392424085576904357', 'The Godson', 1998, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Nigel Logan, Thomas Lappin, Andrew Coffing', 'Bob Hoge', 'Rodney Dangerfield, Kevin McDonald, Dom DeLuise, Fabiana Udenio, Lou Ferrigno, Paul Greenberg, Carol Arthur, Barbara Crampton', null, 'After the death of his older brother, Guiseppe "the guppy" Calzone becomes head of the Calzone Mob family. His aging father knows his son is not cut out for the job, so he sends him to "Mafia University". The head of a rival Mafia Family sees this as an opportunity to strike and bring the Calzone Family to its knees. Surrounded by danger, double-crossing and pasta.', 'After the death of his older brother, Guiseppe "the guppy" Calzone becomes head of the Calzone Mob family. His aging father knows his son is not cut out for the job, so he sends him to "Mafia University". The head of a rival Mafia Family sees this as an opportunity to strike and bring the Calzone Family to its knees. Surrounded by danger, double-crossing and pasta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHbSKVxRRHf18mtp9yinaYlAjK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45758'),
  ('752855250640997256', 'The Goebbels Experiment', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Lutz Hachmeister', null, 'Kenneth Branagh, Joseph Goebbels, Adolf Hitler, Hermann Göring, Leni Riefenstahl, Heinrich Himmler, Winston Churchill', null, 'The Nazi propaganda mastermind behind Hitler speaks in first person as actor Kenneth Branagh reads pages of the diary kept by the chief of propaganda, Joseph Goebbels, revealing the man''s most inner thoughts.', 'The Nazi propaganda mastermind behind Hitler speaks in first person as actor Kenneth Branagh reads pages of the diary kept by the chief of propaganda, Joseph Goebbels, revealing the man''s most inner thoughts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RkVTjWASZ1HJGYMfQyruaRiRtm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21073'),
  ('826041575615339663', 'The Gold Brick', 1943, 'Animation', 'Frank Tashlin', 'Dr. Seuss, Phil Eastman', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A fairy encourages Snafu to duck out of his training regime for his own reasons.', 'A fairy encourages Snafu to duck out of his training regime for his own reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkLTGzJx0tWybHxtjJmJxO7xwtz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100740'),
  ('713327216975698920', 'The Gold Diggers', 1983, 'Drama, Music, Science Fiction', 'Sally Potter, Babette Mangolte', 'Rose English, Sally Potter, Lindsay Cooper', 'Julie Christie, Colette Laffont, Hilary Westlake, David Gale, Thom Osborn, Jacky Lansley, George Antoni, Kassandra Colson', 'NR', 'An avant-garde examination of the relationship between women and money in society. Mixing musical, silent melodrama, and philosophical treatise into a post-punk, heady brew.', 'An avant-garde examination of the relationship between women and money in society. Mixing musical, silent melodrama, and philosophical treatise into a post-punk, heady brew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vT2jIgvexGUU0H6AvcOg9JL5RhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54852'),
  ('641080226811798647', 'The Gold of Naples', 1954, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Vittorio De Sica, Luisa Alessandri, Franco Montemurro', 'Giuseppe Marotta, Vittorio De Sica, Cesare Zavattini', 'Silvana Mangano, Sophia Loren, Eduardo De Filippo, Paolo Stoppa, Erno Crisa, Totò, Lianella Carell, Giacomo Furia', null, 'A tribute to Naples, this film presents six episodes: a clown exploited by a gangster, a pizza seller losing her husband’s ring, a child''s funeral, a gambler beaten by a kid, a prostitute''s unusual wedding, and a "wisdom seller" offering advice.', 'A tribute to Naples, this film presents six episodes: a clown exploited by a gangster, a pizza seller losing her husband’s ring, a child''s funeral, a gambler beaten by a kid, a prostitute''s unusual wedding, and a "wisdom seller" offering advice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQcXnwwc05ovRurcA9TlVQIwwjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56122'),
  ('928806793005050572', 'The Gold Rimmed Glasses', 1987, 'Drama', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Vera Pescarolo, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Nicola Badalucco, Antonella Grassi, Giuliano Montaldo', 'Philippe Noiret, Rupert Everett, Stefania Sandrelli, Valeria Golino, Nicola Farron, Roberto Herlitzka, Riccardo Diana, Anna Lezzi', null, 'A Jewish couple and a homosexual doctor fall to prejudice and scandal in 1938 Italy.', 'A Jewish couple and a homosexual doctor fall to prejudice and scandal in 1938 Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCfTYHcEdEpGP4txRP7Ejm8npvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162808'),
  ('10319135979356282', 'The Gold Seekers', 2017, 'Adventure', 'Juan Carlos Maneglia, Tana Schémbori, Richard Careaga', 'Juan Carlos Maneglia', 'Tomás Arredondo, Christian Ferreira, Mario Toñánez, Cecilia Torres, Sandra Sanabria, Leticia Panambi Sosa, Nelly Davalos, Martín Oviedo', null, 'Los Buscadores tells the story of Manu, a young paperboy who lives in the Chacarita neighborhood. He receives an old map, a gift from his grandfather, and embarks on the adventure of finding a treasure called "Plata Yvyguy", gold and jewels buried by families in Paraguay''s 1864-70 War of the Triple Alianza.', 'Los Buscadores tells the story of Manu, a young paperboy who lives in the Chacarita neighborhood. He receives an old map, a gift from his grandfather, and embarks on the adventure of finding a treasure called "Plata Yvyguy", gold and jewels buried by families in Paraguay''s 1864-70 War of the Triple Alianza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCI6J2kSHEmI85s0treOInw4qmt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430219'),
  ('689360213504382580', 'The Golden Age', 2020, 'Music', 'Justin Connor', null, 'Justin Connor, Christopher May, Brian Jacobs, Ellen Gerstein, David Lovering, Joe Fiske, Andrew Leeds, Michael Faulkner', null, 'A musical rockumentary about subversive pop star Maya O''Malley and his journey towards spiritual redemption following his being dropped from Aspect Records in the Fall of 2012.', 'A musical rockumentary about subversive pop star Maya O''Malley and his journey towards spiritual redemption following his being dropped from Aspect Records in the Fall of 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miCUeKwX2DfIzAuaX2n96KMEpyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392586'),
  ('956340895179476839', 'The Golden Age of Comedy', 1957, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Robert Youngson', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Ward Wilson, Will Rogers, Carole Lombard, Jean Harlow, Ben Turpin, Harry Langdon', 'NR', 'A compilation featuring comedic stars of the silent era including Will Rogers, Laurel and Hardy, and the Keystone Cops.', 'A compilation featuring comedic stars of the silent era including Will Rogers, Laurel and Hardy, and the Keystone Cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvBi7y9Cp8dcqECKWLYTA0MjKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47993'),
  ('417746509408311678', 'The Golden Anniversary', 2019, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Nader T. Homayoun, Stephan Massis', 'Nader T. Homayoun, Nagar Djavadi', 'Alice Taglioni, Babak Hamidian, Hélène Vincent, Christa Théret, Stanley Weber, Nasser Memarzia, Marie-Bénédicte Roy, Bernard Verley', null, '"Allow me to be your husband." Not only does Alix Saint-Cast, who has Alzheimer''s disease, recognize her husband Octave two days before her Golden Wedding, she has also fallen in love again. Their new beloved is Farhad Mozafari, Iranian, also suffering from Alzheimer''s disease and can not be separated from Alix. So Farhad has to come with son Iradj and his little daughter to the stately home of the Saint-Casts. However, they are only gradually aware of the unusual family encounters that newcomers have accepted.', '"Allow me to be your husband." Not only does Alix Saint-Cast, who has Alzheimer''s disease, recognize her husband Octave two days before her Golden Wedding, she has also fallen in love again. Their new beloved is Farhad Mozafari, Iranian, also suffering from Alzheimer''s disease and can not be separated from Alix. So Farhad has to come with son Iradj and his little daughter to the stately home of the Saint-Casts. However, they are only gradually aware of the unusual family encounters that newcomers have accepted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0xNjZvdC5R1I3yhnXhrDBndx0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628291'),
  ('544455973743747425', 'The Golden Antelope', 1954, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Lev Atamanov, Mikhail Druyan, Roman Kachanov', 'Nikolai Abramov', 'Valentina Sperantova, Nina Nikitina, Ruben Simonov, Aleksandr Gruzinsky, Kolya Tagunov', null, 'It is a screen version of an Indian national fairy tale. Malicious and greedy rajah wishes to get a wonderful antelope who strikes gold coins by hoofs. The country boy rescues an antelope, but rajah, threatening the boy, compels the antelope to serve him but he is severely punished for it.', 'It is a screen version of an Indian national fairy tale. Malicious and greedy rajah wishes to get a wonderful antelope who strikes gold coins by hoofs. The country boy rescues an antelope, but rajah, threatening the boy, compels the antelope to serve him but he is severely punished for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afImFjO6uyEA6y4zgzpwZOlGiic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203046'),
  ('1062314600753804375', 'The Golden Arrow', 1936, 'Family, Comedy', 'Alfred E. Green, Arthur Edeson', 'Charles Kenyon', 'Bette Davis, George Brent, Eugene Pallette, Carol Hughes, Dick Foran, Catherine Doucet, Craig Reynolds, Ivan Lebedeff', 'NR', 'A fake heiress marries a common reporter to thwart the advances of gold-digging playboys.', 'A fake heiress marries a common reporter to thwart the advances of gold-digging playboys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLOi2qJxbLKKGPQvDaPoo22t7F7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176259'),
  ('618052556283664432', 'The Golden Ball', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Cheik Doukouré, Alain Choquart', 'Martin Brossollet, Cheik Doukouré, David Carayan', 'Aboubacar Sidiki Sumah, Aboubacar Kolta, Agnès Soral, Habib Hammoud, Mody Sory Barry, Salif Keita, Mariam Kaba, Keita Alama', null, 'The Golden Ball is a wonderful children''s film that tells of a young boy''s dream of being a soccer player. Whenever a match is broadcast live in the village of Makono, Bandian and his brother keep their ears to the transistor radio, spinning a picture of the game from the announcer''s commentary much as they fantasize themselves on the field. A gift of a real soccer ball, which Bandian paints gold, like a magical object involves him in a series of adventures which bring him in reach of his dream, but which also require him to make difficult choices.', 'The Golden Ball is a wonderful children''s film that tells of a young boy''s dream of being a soccer player. Whenever a match is broadcast live in the village of Makono, Bandian and his brother keep their ears to the transistor radio, spinning a picture of the game from the announcer''s commentary much as they fantasize themselves on the field. A gift of a real soccer ball, which Bandian paints gold, like a magical object involves him in a series of adventures which bring him in reach of his dream, but which also require him to make difficult choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukjN0Zv8V32JsorQYEpP2y6PbKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160372'),
  ('53430743301703383', 'The Golden Bat', 1966, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Hajime Sato, Yoshikazu Yamasawa', 'Susumu Takaku', 'Sonny Chiba, Wataru Yamagawa, Hisako Tsukuba, Emily Takami, Osamu Kobayashi, Andrew Hughes, Hirohisa Nakata, Kosaku Okano', null, 'A teenage boy discovers that the planet Icarus is on a collision course with Earth by gazing through his telescope. Scoffed at by the scientific establishment, the boy is kidnapped and brought to a secret UN base in the Japan alps. He is immediately inducted into the secret program whose mission is to finish the Super-Destruction Beam cannon and destroy Icarus. The cannon is missing a special mineral for the lens. The team heads for a mysterious island in the middle of the Pacific. There they find ancient ruins of Atlantis but they are suddenly attacked by a strange drill shaped metal squid spaceship. It''s commanded by the evil being Nazu who has engineered the collision with Icarus! He doesn''t want to share the universe with humans and he really doesn''t want the cannon finished. The action is on and the team discovers the Golden Bat who has been asleep for over 10,000 years awaiting this very moment to save the earth!', 'A teenage boy discovers that the planet Icarus is on a collision course with Earth by gazing through his telescope. Scoffed at by the scientific establishment, the boy is kidnapped and brought to a secret UN base in the Japan alps. He is immediately inducted into the secret program whose mission is to finish the Super-Destruction Beam cannon and destroy Icarus. The cannon is missing a special mineral for the lens. The team heads for a mysterious island in the middle of the Pacific. There they find ancient ruins of Atlantis but they are suddenly attacked by a strange drill shaped metal squid spaceship. It''s commanded by the evil being Nazu who has engineered the collision with Icarus! He doesn''t want to share the universe with humans and he really doesn''t want the cannon finished. The action is on and the team discovers the Golden Bat who has been asleep for over 10,000 years awaiting this very moment to save the earth!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukhUNJsQxvqKVXZ7uaDJnKNZBDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107308'),
  ('1036949170870069415', 'The Golden Beetle', 1907, 'Fantasy', 'Segundo de Chomón', null, null, null, 'A magician is surprised when he attempts to transform a beetle.', 'A magician is surprised when he attempts to transform a beetle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdijmM82QVkiM3w4cQHLzDsKLMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127102'),
