  ('3262871814389014', 'The Golden Holiday', 2020, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Kim Bong-han, Yoo Huck-jun, Kim Sung-chul', 'Ha Kyeong-jin, Kim Bong-han', 'Kwak Do-won, Kim Dae-myung, Kim Sang-ho, Kim Hie-won, Shin Dong-mi, Lee Han-seo, Son Hyun-joo, Jo Jae-yun', null, 'A laid-back countryside detective Byung-su takes his family to the Philippines for his 10th wedding anniversary. In fact, his hidden agenda is to track down his old friend Yong-bae who scammed him and got away a few years ago. In Manila, Byung-su finds Yong-bae in prison for murder, and hears about the case surrounding ''Yamashita’s Gold''. Swayed by a share of the Gold that Yong-bae offers, Byung-su suddenly becomes embroiled in the case.', 'A laid-back countryside detective Byung-su takes his family to the Philippines for his 10th wedding anniversary. In fact, his hidden agenda is to track down his old friend Yong-bae who scammed him and got away a few years ago. In Manila, Byung-su finds Yong-bae in prison for murder, and hears about the case surrounding ''Yamashita’s Gold''. Swayed by a share of the Gold that Yong-bae offers, Byung-su suddenly becomes embroiled in the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NuFk54ay8ZvD7s2Y27fSw4j14I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573801'),
  ('396152978081130110', 'The Golden K Award', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Jérémy Ferrari, Antoine Marteau, Hamza Boumalki, Victor Mirabel, Amonlath Pholyotha, Lola Resch, Sandra Durando', 'Jérémy Ferrari, Clément Peny, Saïd Belktibia', 'Laura Felpin, Éric Judor, Fred Testot, Zaynab Alji, Céline Groussard', null, 'Noah, who believes he is Gaddafi''s secret son, hunts as a treasure seeker for the Libyan leader''s lost gold in the Sahel region. He allies himself with Zoulika, an unpredictable rebel from a reintegration camp.', 'Noah, who believes he is Gaddafi''s secret son, hunts as a treasure seeker for the Libyan leader''s lost gold in the Sahel region. He allies himself with Zoulika, an unpredictable rebel from a reintegration camp.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FxZODXZeys9ARnXe2DekYFoUx385.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-golden-k-award'),
  ('346902796502821915', 'The Golden Key', 1939, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Nikolai Renkov, S. Zonnenburg', 'Nikolai Leshchenko, Aleksei Tolstoy, Lyudmila Tolstaya', 'Sergei Martinson, Olga Shaganova-Obraztsova, Aleksandr Shchagin, Georgiy Uvarov, Mikhail Dagmarov, Raisa Khairova, Tamara Adelheim, Nikolai Michurin', null, 'A film combining live action and stop-motion animation about the adventures of the wooden boy Pinocchio and his friends - Pierrot, Malvina and Artemon the Poodle, about the mysterious golden key that opens the cherished door, about the good Papa Carlo and the evil Karabas-Barabas, Duremar, Basilio the Cat and Alice the Fox.', 'A film combining live action and stop-motion animation about the adventures of the wooden boy Pinocchio and his friends - Pierrot, Malvina and Artemon the Poodle, about the mysterious golden key that opens the cherished door, about the good Papa Carlo and the evil Karabas-Barabas, Duremar, Basilio the Cat and Alice the Fox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaHKyRQBM8jStZCtR7B4TrQFFyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239536'),
  ('858208626785635351', 'The Golden Key: A New Pinocchio Story', 2026, 'Family, Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Igor Voloshin, Maxim Zhukov, Anastasia Maslennikova', 'Aksinya Borisova, Andrey Zolotarev, Alina Tyazhlova', 'Vitaliya Kornienko, Aleksandr Yatsenko, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Alexander Petrov, Viktoriya Isakova, Svetlana Nemolyaeva, Lev Zulkarnaev, Mark Eydelshteyn', null, 'A screen adaptation of the beloved international fairy tale by Alexei Tolstoy in a new way. The story of everyone''s favorite hero Pinocchio, his dad Carlo and their friends, told with the help of modern life-action technologies.', 'A screen adaptation of the beloved international fairy tale by Alexei Tolstoy in a new way. The story of everyone''s favorite hero Pinocchio, his dad Carlo and their friends, told with the help of modern life-action technologies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/An3iR7yPP6GKQi2SDscWlEMFXAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1248723'),
  ('166033205817184000', 'The Golden Lotus', 1974, 'Romance, Action, Drama', 'Li Han-Hsiang, Lin Ching-Hsiung, Lam Wa-Chiu', 'Li Han-Hsiang', 'Peter Yang Kwan, Hu Chin, Chen Ping, Tanny Tien-Ni, Chiang Nan, Tin Ching, Dean Shek Tin, Teresa Ha Ping', null, 'Golden Lotus is based, in part, on Jin Ping Mei, a famous erotic novel of ancient China. Li Han-Hsiang adapted part of the story into this film, which starts with Hsi Men Ching, a successful merchant, wooing Pan Chin Lien, the beautiful wife of one of the townspeople.', 'Golden Lotus is based, in part, on Jin Ping Mei, a famous erotic novel of ancient China. Li Han-Hsiang adapted part of the story into this film, which starts with Hsi Men Ching, a successful merchant, wooing Pan Chin Lien, the beautiful wife of one of the townspeople.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woB42KiNtESKv9O0h5yOYBYzm0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50146'),
  ('888366862162001743', 'The Golden Lotus: Love and Desire', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Li Han-Hsiang', 'Li Han-Hsiang', 'Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Yuk Ting Fong, Sin Yi Gei, Yuen Suk Lee', null, 'A corrupt local official, Xi Men Qing, who lusts after women and money, pursues his brother''s young wife, Lee Ping Er. Ping finds Men attractive, and under her drunken husband''s nose, she and Men work their way through the illustrations of a pillow book, the "Golden Lotus." Men pursues the same feat with his fourth concubine, Pan Jing Lien, who lives in the compound next to Ping. Jing''s jealousy compounds a tale of humiliation, childbirth, death, and depravity. Does karma or enlightenment await anyone?', 'A corrupt local official, Xi Men Qing, who lusts after women and money, pursues his brother''s young wife, Lee Ping Er. Ping finds Men attractive, and under her drunken husband''s nose, she and Men work their way through the illustrations of a pillow book, the "Golden Lotus." Men pursues the same feat with his fourth concubine, Pan Jing Lien, who lives in the compound next to Ping. Jing''s jealousy compounds a tale of humiliation, childbirth, death, and depravity. Does karma or enlightenment await anyone?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nA1WbYl6Sllm71g8koNXhjWbMOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173129'),
  ('1034855939384416221', 'The Golden Monk', 2017, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Action', 'Wong Jing, Billy Chung Siu-Hung', 'Wong Jing', 'Ryan Zheng, Zhang Yuqi, Xie Yi-lin, Wong Cho-Lam, Mao Junjie, Jim Chim Sui-Man, Law Kar-Ying, Cheng Ye', null, 'The film tells the story of a monk who realizes he is the reincarnation of Golden Child / Taming Dragon Lohan who was cast down from heaven to experience life and death one hundred times as he broke a sacred rule by falling in love with another fairy, Jade. While Golden Child’s memories were erased, Jade refused to forget their love and accumulated goodwill over one hundred reincarnations…', 'The film tells the story of a monk who realizes he is the reincarnation of Golden Child / Taming Dragon Lohan who was cast down from heaven to experience life and death one hundred times as he broke a sacred rule by falling in love with another fairy, Jade. While Golden Child’s memories were erased, Jade refused to forget their love and accumulated goodwill over one hundred reincarnations…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUzzgy0J2GZ45HAUZPVTJgrepBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474125'),
  ('238198305268323992', 'The Golden Positions', 1970, 'Drama, Documentary', 'James Broughton, Kermit Sheets', null, 'Anna Halprin, Norma Leistiko', null, 'A lovely, poetic, humorous and crystal investigation of mankind standing, sitting and lying down.', 'A lovely, poetic, humorous and crystal investigation of mankind standing, sitting and lying down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYwCuJ3cvXAJ9c3jDYSdwR2XYjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293752'),
  ('81005357921812341', 'The Golden Thread', 1965, 'Drama', 'Ritwik Ghatak', 'Ritwik Ghatak, Umanath Bhattacharya', 'Madhabi Mukherjee, Satindra Bhattacharya, Abhi Bhattacharya, Gita Dey, Bijon Bhattacharya, Indrani Chakrabarty, Abanish Banerjee, Shyamal Ghoshal', null, 'After an old college friend offers him a job at an iron foundry, the upright and honest Ishwar leaves a shanty town on the outskirts of Calcutta where he lives with a group of refugees from East Bengal. With plans to forge a solid living for himself, sister Sita and Abhiram, an orphaned boy he offers a home to, Ishwar is accused of selling out and deserting his people.', 'After an old college friend offers him a job at an iron foundry, the upright and honest Ishwar leaves a shanty town on the outskirts of Calcutta where he lives with a group of refugees from East Bengal. With plans to forge a solid living for himself, sister Sita and Abhiram, an orphaned boy he offers a home to, Ishwar is accused of selling out and deserting his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3le6UjPH0E8ZNgdBwPysDSag5jE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86303'),
  ('758178128985971915', 'The Golden Touch', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Mary Moder, Clarence Nash, Purv Pullen, Toby Wing', 'NR', 'King Midas is visited by an elf; the elf turns his cat to gold, then claps his hands and it changes back. Midas begs for the golden touch, but the elf warns him it would be a curse to him. Midas insists. He dances about joyfully at first, but discovers the drawbacks when he sits down to dinner. Fearing death by starvation, he summons the elf and agrees to surrender everything he owns to have the curse lifted.', 'King Midas is visited by an elf; the elf turns his cat to gold, then claps his hands and it changes back. Midas begs for the golden touch, but the elf warns him it would be a curse to him. Midas insists. He dances about joyfully at first, but discovers the drawbacks when he sits down to dinner. Fearing death by starvation, he summons the elf and agrees to surrender everything he owns to have the curse lifted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ACP4ZTWjxUr3gfuycyzNkL2HIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58164'),
  ('996378140388365636', 'The Golden Voyage of Sinbad', 1973, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Family', 'Ted Moore, Gordon Hessler, Miguel Gil', 'Brian Clemens', 'John Phillip Law, Caroline Munro, Tom Baker, Douglas Wilmer, Martin Shaw, Grégoire Aslan, Kurt Christian, Takis Emmanuel', 'G', 'Sinbad and his crew intercept a homunculus carrying a golden tablet. Koura, the creator of the homunculus and practitioner of evil magic, wants the tablet back and pursues Sinbad. Meanwhile, Sinbad meets the Vizier who has another part of the interlocking golden map, and they mount a quest across the seas to solve the riddle of the map.', 'Sinbad and his crew intercept a homunculus carrying a golden tablet. Koura, the creator of the homunculus and practitioner of evil magic, wants the tablet back and pursues Sinbad. Meanwhile, Sinbad meets the Vizier who has another part of the interlocking golden map, and they mount a quest across the seas to solve the riddle of the map.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DQPnuAjD7H4ae6BeBAVhu9RLWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17897'),
  ('379684485020628746', 'The Goldfinch', 2019, 'Drama', 'Maceo Bishop, John Crowley, Roger Deakins', 'Peter Straughan', 'Ansel Elgort, Oakes Fegley, Nicole Kidman, Jeffrey Wright, Luke Wilson, Sarah Paulson, Willa Fitzgerald, Aneurin Barnard', 'R', 'A boy in New York is taken in by a wealthy family after his mother is killed in a bombing at the Metropolitan Museum of Art. In a rush of panic, he steals ''The Goldfinch'', a painting that eventually draws him into a world of crime.', 'A boy in New York is taken in by a wealthy family after his mother is killed in a bombing at the Metropolitan Museum of Art. In a rush of panic, he steals ''The Goldfinch'', a painting that eventually draws him into a world of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Jx9VyVPiK9GQ7ouKLkTUYnZSQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472674'),
  ('353414656519187716', 'The Goldfinger', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Felix Chong Man-Keung, Chin Ka-Lok, Man Uen-Ching', 'Felix Chong Man-Keung', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Andy Lau, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Simon Yam, Michael Ning, Carlos Chan Ka-Lok, Tai Bo, Alex Fong Chung-Sun', null, 'In 1970s Hong Kong, the Independent Commission Against Corruption (ICAC) was formed to bring down the corruption syndicate led by British government officials. One of its top investigators is Senior Investigator Lau Kai-Yuen, who brought down countless corrupted officials. Just as he thought stability and prosperity are within reach, a new era of greed and riches takes him into a new battlefield of corruption.', 'In 1970s Hong Kong, the Independent Commission Against Corruption (ICAC) was formed to bring down the corruption syndicate led by British government officials. One of its top investigators is Senior Investigator Lau Kai-Yuen, who brought down countless corrupted officials. Just as he thought stability and prosperity are within reach, a new era of greed and riches takes him into a new battlefield of corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cU5o3TJSs7Xv3FD20il5tQIB6Lm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823598'),
  ('395703180476864386', 'The Goldfish', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Alireza Golafshan', 'Alireza Golafshan', 'Jella Haase, Birgit Minichmayr, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Tom Schilling, Jan Henrik Stahlberg, Axel Stein, Luisa Wöllisch, Andreas Dubois', null, 'Oliver is a banker and portfolio manager and leads a life in the fast lane, which one day comes to an abrupt end, as he builds a self-inflicted accident on highway with 230 km / h and raced through a guardrail. When he wakes up in the hospital again, he faces a devastating diagnosis: paraplegia. Actually, a rehabilitation stay of several months is planned in the hospital, but Oliver soon falls on his head and ends up in a disabled shared flat with the name "Die Goldfische"', 'Oliver is a banker and portfolio manager and leads a life in the fast lane, which one day comes to an abrupt end, as he builds a self-inflicted accident on highway with 230 km / h and raced through a guardrail. When he wakes up in the hospital again, he faces a devastating diagnosis: paraplegia. Actually, a rehabilitation stay of several months is planned in the hospital, but Oliver soon falls on his head and ends up in a disabled shared flat with the name "Die Goldfische"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arqU72w8tkCGCIKEul476of8qZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535092'),
  ('943015114334178232', 'The Goldman Case', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Cédric Kahn, Romaric Thomas, Patrick Ghiringhelli', 'Cédric Kahn, Nathalie Hertzberg', 'Arieh Worthalter, Arthur Harari, Stéphan Guérin-Tillié, Nicolas Briançon, Maxime Canat, Jeremy Lewin, Christian Mazucchini, Aurélien Chaussade', null, 'A second trial begins in November 1975 against French left-wing revolutionary Pierre Goldman, accused of several armed robberies and the death of two chemists.', 'A second trial begins in November 1975 against French left-wing revolutionary Pierre Goldman, accused of several armed robberies and the death of two chemists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYbjXgBQUPgj1mtcmH0GafbJlXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:972118'),
  ('38707429514423659', 'The Goldsmith', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Vincenzo Ricchiuto, Francesco Collinelli, Monica Cappiello', 'Germano Tarricone, Vincenzo Ricchiuto', 'Stefania Casini, Giuseppe Pambieri, Gianluca Vannucci, Tania Bambaci, Mike Cimini, Rita Reggiani, Manuela De Tommaso, Matthias Cavallo', null, 'Determined to rob a goldsmith, three young robbers break into his country house. The man and his wife turn out to be less defenseless than they seem.', 'Determined to rob a goldsmith, three young robbers break into his country house. The man and his wife turn out to be less defenseless than they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eUxBpQSfFvQx1tJLRe74lyMw13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999278'),
  ('179312412258864352', 'The Goldsmith''s Secret', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marc Miró, Olga Osorio, Judith López', 'Olga Osorio', 'Mario Casas, Michelle Jenner, Zoe Bonafonte, Enzo Oliver, Sergio Crespo, Martina Pérez, Guillermo San Emeterio, Quique Niza', null, 'In 1999, a goldsmith revisits his hometown, triggering memories of his summer love affair with a seamstress 25 years prior. Despite their age gap, he vows to rewrite their story but struggles to find her upon his return.', 'In 1999, a goldsmith revisits his hometown, triggering memories of his summer love affair with a seamstress 25 years prior. Despite their age gap, he vows to rewrite their story but struggles to find her upon his return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPW9fszYL0EG7YJW4NwvnAZbfuq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1310861'),
