  ('1128419742724870818', 'The Golem', 1915, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Paul Wegener, Henrik Galeen, Guido Seeber', 'Paul Wegener, Henrik Galeen', 'Paul Wegener, Rudolf Blümner, Carl Ebert, Henrik Galeen, Lyda Salmonova, Robert A. Dietrich, Jakob Tiedtke', null, 'This mostly lost film is often confused with director Paul Wegener third and readily available interpretation of the legend; Der Golem, wie er in die Welt kam (1920). In this version of the golem legend, the golem, a clay statue brought to life by Rabbi Loew in 16th century Prague to save the Jews from the ongoing brutal persecution by the city''s rulers, is found in the rubble of an old synagogue in the 20th century. Brought to life by an antique dealer, the golem is used as a menial servant. Eventually falling in love with the dealer''s wife, it goes on a murderous rampage when its love for her goes unanswered.', 'This mostly lost film is often confused with director Paul Wegener third and readily available interpretation of the legend; Der Golem, wie er in die Welt kam (1920). In this version of the golem legend, the golem, a clay statue brought to life by Rabbi Loew in 16th century Prague to save the Jews from the ongoing brutal persecution by the city''s rulers, is found in the rubble of an old synagogue in the 20th century. Brought to life by an antique dealer, the golem is used as a menial servant. Eventually falling in love with the dealer''s wife, it goes on a murderous rampage when its love for her goes unanswered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vu5KgTbTqeCNu0uqOrESBfnw3EV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10695'),
  ('61906858976484975', 'The Golem', 1936, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Václav Vích, Jan Stallich, Julien Duvivier', 'Julien Duvivier, Josef Kodíček, André-Paul Antoine', 'Harry Baur, Charles Dorat, Jany Holt, Germaine Aussey, Roger Karl, Roger Duchesne, Raymond Aimos, Gaston Jacquet', null, 'The Golem, a giant creature created out of clay by a rabbi, comes to life in a time of trouble to protect the Jews of Prague from persecution.', 'The Golem, a giant creature created out of clay by a rabbi, comes to life in a time of trouble to protect the Jews of Prague from persecution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l39CE8uKKDhxnJJe25DkqhgmaeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169479'),
  ('864742182600039042', 'The Golem', 2018, 'Horror, Drama', 'Rutie Blum, Roman Kruter, Ooroshenko Nataliya', 'Ariel Cohen', 'Hani Furstenberg, Ishai Golan, Lenny Ravich, Brynie Furstenberg, Konstantin Anikienko, Oleksii Trytenko, Kirill Cernyakov, Lenny Ravitz', 'R', 'A re-imagining of the old mystical folklore that follows a woman and a tight-knit Jewish community that is besieged by foreign invaders. She conjures a dangerous creature to protect them but it may be more evil than she ever imagined.', 'A re-imagining of the old mystical folklore that follows a woman and a tight-knit Jewish community that is besieged by foreign invaders. She conjures a dangerous creature to protect them but it may be more evil than she ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwdbyKJ2PKTLamQzr57OgMuFUlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532635'),
  ('557941470573000384', 'The Golem: How He Came Into the World', 1920, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Karl Freund, Carl Boese, Guido Seeber', 'Paul Wegener, Henrik Galeen', 'Paul Wegener, Albert Steinrück, Lyda Salmonova, Ernst Deutsch, Hans Stürm, Max Kronert, Otto Gebühr, Dore Paetzold', null, 'In 16th-century Prague, a rabbi creates the Golem - a giant creature made of clay. Using sorcery, he brings the creature to life in order to protect the Jews of Prague from persecution.', 'In 16th-century Prague, a rabbi creates the Golem - a giant creature made of clay. Using sorcery, he brings the creature to life in order to protect the Jews of Prague from persecution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zdqM0MgZBfy3tuJdNO4cWAGBtj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2972'),
  ('786986838149092553', 'The Golf Specialist', 1930, 'Comedy', 'Monte Brice', 'W.C. Fields', 'W.C. Fields, Shirley Grey, John Dunsmuir, Allen Wood, Johnny Kane, William Black, Harriet MacGibbon', null, 'At a Florida hotel, absconding miscreant J. Effingham Bellweather goes slapstick golfing with the house detective''s flirtatious wife and an incompetent caddy.', 'At a Florida hotel, absconding miscreant J. Effingham Bellweather goes slapstick golfing with the house detective''s flirtatious wife and an incompetent caddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbR3YlxVa4SQB6o7tLwnh1v2EaN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37358'),
