  ('954236408427883709', 'The Good and the Bad', 1976, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy, Romance', 'Jacques Lefrançois, Claude Lelouch', 'Pierre Uytterhoeven, Claude Lelouch', 'Jacques Dutronc, Marlène Jobert, Jacques Villeret, Bruno Cremer, Brigitte Fossey, Serge Reggiani, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Marie Déa', null, 'The film follows the exploits of Jacques, a car-mechanic turned pro-thief, and his Jewish co-conspirator Simon as their robberies, beginning well before the Second World War, take on a political coloration under the occupation.', 'The film follows the exploits of Jacques, a car-mechanic turned pro-thief, and his Jewish co-conspirator Simon as their robberies, beginning well before the Second World War, take on a political coloration under the occupation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bUCM70za8ARtCkeQVkEOybXovJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4735'),
  ('12284120126583825', 'The Good Boss', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fernando León de Aranoa, Pau Esteve Birba', 'Fernando León de Aranoa', 'Javier Bardem, Manolo Solo, Almudena Amor, Óscar de la Fuente, Sonia Almarcha, Fernando Albizu, María de Nati, Tarik Rmili', null, 'Julio Blanco is the proprietor of Básculas Blanco, a Spanish company producing industrial scales in a provincial Spanish town, which awaits the imminent visit from a committee that will decide if they merit a local Business Excellence award: everything has to be perfect when the time comes. Working against the clock, Blanco pulls out all the stops to address and resolve issues with his employees, crossing every imaginable line in the process.', 'Julio Blanco is the proprietor of Básculas Blanco, a Spanish company producing industrial scales in a provincial Spanish town, which awaits the imminent visit from a committee that will decide if they merit a local Business Excellence award: everything has to be perfect when the time comes. Working against the clock, Blanco pulls out all the stops to address and resolve issues with his employees, crossing every imaginable line in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1OgeRKB8AoOYKt3DzxJelLLpLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820722'),
  ('969067996547066626', 'The Good Cop', 2004, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lasse Spang Olsen, Lasse Spang Olsen, Jacob Banke Olesen', 'Kim Bodnia, Lasse Spang Olsen', 'Kim Bodnia, Jens Okking, René Dif, Nicolas Bro, Robert Hansen, Kenneth Carmohn, Kenneth Fogel, Iben Hjejle', null, 'A crew of young, small-time crooks screws up. Ripping off a shipping container of Chinese silk for a Rasta gang, they also come away with two and a half kilos of heroin belonging to the Latvian mafia. A friend of theirs, Jens (Kim Bodnia), a plainclothes cop, tries to mediate, but instead all barrels are turned on him. The Latvians and the Chinese want him. Jamaican dope growers, ice-cold Serbian heroin dealers and Polish human smugglers are gunning for him. And to top it all off, he also has to dodge his fellow officers, backed by the scuba corps and elite-forces soldiers, to save his young friends.', 'A crew of young, small-time crooks screws up. Ripping off a shipping container of Chinese silk for a Rasta gang, they also come away with two and a half kilos of heroin belonging to the Latvian mafia. A friend of theirs, Jens (Kim Bodnia), a plainclothes cop, tries to mediate, but instead all barrels are turned on him. The Latvians and the Chinese want him. Jamaican dope growers, ice-cold Serbian heroin dealers and Polish human smugglers are gunning for him. And to top it all off, he also has to dodge his fellow officers, backed by the scuba corps and elite-forces soldiers, to save his young friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OuBPvfEAWBRxg4NsU2KOn0xR2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4991'),
  ('131994958289436917', 'The Good Die Young', 1954, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Jack Asher, Lewis Gilbert, Ted Sturgis', 'Vernon Harris, Lewis Gilbert', 'Laurence Harvey, Richard Basehart, Joan Collins, Gloria Grahame, John Ireland, Rène Ray, Stanley Baker, Margaret Leighton', 'NR', 'An amoral, psychotic playboy incites three men who are down on their luck to commit a mail van robbery, which goes badly wrong.', 'An amoral, psychotic playboy incites three men who are down on their luck to commit a mail van robbery, which goes badly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kR9IJpuIzhyvdHxmHzcdmYeFJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47312'),
  ('186204525893398351', 'The Good Dinosaur', 2015, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Peter Sohn, Sharon Calahan, Mahyar Abousaeedi', 'Meg LeFauve', 'Frances McDormand, Raymond Ochoa, Jeffrey Wright, Steve Zahn, Sam Elliott, Anna Paquin, John Ratzenberger, A.J. Buckley', 'PG', 'An epic journey into the world of dinosaurs where an Apatosaurus named Arlo makes an unlikely human friend.', 'An epic journey into the world of dinosaurs where an Apatosaurus named Arlo makes an unlikely human friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RSkxOO80btfKjyiC5ZiTaCHIT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105864'),
  ('251766517283289598', 'The Good Doctor', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Lance Daly, Yaron Orbach', 'John Enbom', 'Orlando Bloom, Riley Keough, Taraji P. Henson, Rob Morrow, Michael Peña, Troy Garity, J.K. Simmons, Wade Williams', 'PG-13', 'Dr. Martin Blake, who has spent his life looking for respect, meets an 18-year-old patient named Diane, suffering from a kidney infection, and gets a much-needed boost of self-esteem. However, when her health starts improving, Martin fears losing her, so he begins tampering with her treatment, keeping Diane sick and in the hospital right next to him.', 'Dr. Martin Blake, who has spent his life looking for respect, meets an 18-year-old patient named Diane, suffering from a kidney infection, and gets a much-needed boost of self-esteem. However, when her health starts improving, Martin fears losing her, so he begins tampering with her treatment, keeping Diane sick and in the hospital right next to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJSdqHzpMeCkXMrILYt1SdGN2sL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65650'),
  ('816372678725250276', 'The Good Doctor', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Nikita Grammatikov, Mikhail Veriysky, Evgeny Verenev, Nikolay Kornienko, Stepan Turik, Ekaterina Pushkina, Denis Veykhman, Вадим Яковлев, Ekaterina Malyutina', 'Varvara Borodina, Ilya Kulikov, Varvara Morozova', 'Natalya Kurenkova, Artem Isaakyan, Ivan Korovin, Yuriy Stoyanov, Viktor Horinyak', null, 'Oleg Semyonovich Mandrykin is a doctor, which means he promised Hippocrates to treat even those who are not paying cash, but are covered by insurance, in difficult times. He is hit by a courier, Dima, at the entrance to his building. Now the culprit of the accident will have to go on calls, and a real doctor will direct him by phone. But everything goes wrong from the very first patient. Dima immerses himself in the profession so deeply that Oleg Semyonovich can only dream of one thing - for this day to end as soon as possible.', 'Oleg Semyonovich Mandrykin is a doctor, which means he promised Hippocrates to treat even those who are not paying cash, but are covered by insurance, in difficult times. He is hit by a courier, Dima, at the entrance to his building. Now the culprit of the accident will have to go on calls, and a real doctor will direct him by phone. But everything goes wrong from the very first patient. Dima immerses himself in the profession so deeply that Oleg Semyonovich can only dream of one thing - for this day to end as soon as possible.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkXLyyomAIVKA0MBdwyqg62dR08m.jpg', 'plex:movie:dobryy-doktor-2026'),
  ('716773801309481068', 'The Good Earth', 1937, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Sidney Franklin, Edwin B. Willis, A. Arnold Gillespie', 'Talbot Jennings, Tess Slesinger, Claudine West', 'Paul Muni, Luise Rainer, Walter Connolly, Tilly Losch, Charley Grapewin, Jessie Ralph, Soo Yong, Keye Luke', 'NR', 'China, during the rule of the Qing Dynasty. The arranged marriage between Wang Lung, a humble farmer, and O-Lan, a domestic slave, will endure the many hardships of life over the years; but the temptations of a fragile prosperity will endanger their love and the survival of their entire family.', 'China, during the rule of the Qing Dynasty. The arranged marriage between Wang Lung, a humble farmer, and O-Lan, a domestic slave, will endure the many hardships of life over the years; but the temptations of a fragile prosperity will endanger their love and the survival of their entire family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPJe6d8etqVPyPYrNtE5rRNts9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36652'),
  ('324503605659904522', 'The Good Egg', 1945, 'Animation', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Arthur Lake, Mel Blanc', null, 'Navy seaman Mr. Hook is convinced of the value of holding on to his war bonds.', 'Navy seaman Mr. Hook is convinced of the value of holding on to his war bonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sAhCjn25fqUCgYzCNNSyEjp9OCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236998'),
  ('1107788171302963233', 'The Good Fairy', 1935, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William Wyler, Norbert Brodine, Heinz Roemheld', 'Preston Sturges', 'Margaret Sullavan, Herbert Marshall, Frank Morgan, Reginald Owen, Eric Blore, Beulah Bondi, Alan Hale, Cesar Romero', 'NR', 'In 1930s Budapest, naïve orphan Luisa Ginglebuscher becomes an usherette at the local movie house, determined to succeed in her first job by doing good deeds for others and maintaining her purity. Luisa''s well-meaning lies get her caught between a lecherous businessman, Konrad, and a decent but confused doctor, Max Sporum. When Luisa convinces Konrad that she''s married to Max, Konrad tries everything he can to get rid of the baffled doctor.', 'In 1930s Budapest, naïve orphan Luisa Ginglebuscher becomes an usherette at the local movie house, determined to succeed in her first job by doing good deeds for others and maintaining her purity. Luisa''s well-meaning lies get her caught between a lecherous businessman, Konrad, and a decent but confused doctor, Max Sporum. When Luisa convinces Konrad that she''s married to Max, Konrad tries everything he can to get rid of the baffled doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtn7wvW5I2xty7X64m3cwxZAjhA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47758'),
  ('537690366373027659', 'The Good Father', 1985, 'Drama', 'Mike Newell, Michael Coulter', 'Christopher Hampton, Peter Prince', 'Anthony Hopkins, Jim Broadbent, Harriet Walter, Frances Viner, Simon Callow, Miriam Margolyes, Joanne Whalley, Michael Byrne', 'R', 'Bill is a man who''s very bitter about his divorce and losing custody of his son. So, when one of his friends is being sued for divorce by his wife so that she can enter a lesbian relationship, Bill decides to help his friend gain custody of his son...in any way that they can devise, including using a sleazeball lawyer. But while Bill feels that feminism has robbed him of his family, he begins to be appalled at what he and Roger have done.', 'Bill is a man who''s very bitter about his divorce and losing custody of his son. So, when one of his friends is being sued for divorce by his wife so that she can enter a lesbian relationship, Bill decides to help his friend gain custody of his son...in any way that they can devise, including using a sleazeball lawyer. But while Bill feels that feminism has robbed him of his family, he begins to be appalled at what he and Roger have done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld5GsfLnxsvwrZJsjklCBW7dr0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47158'),
  ('1041279625449306091', 'The Good German', 2006, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller, War', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Jody Spilkoman', 'Paul Attanasio', 'George Clooney, Cate Blanchett, Tobey Maguire, Beau Bridges, Tony Curran, Leland Orser, Jack Thompson, Robin Weigert', 'R', 'An American journalist arrives in Berlin just after the end of World War Two. He becomes involved in a murder mystery surrounding a dead GI who washes up at a lakeside mansion during the Potsdam negotiations between the Allied powers. Soon his investigation connects with his search for his married pre-war German lover.', 'An American journalist arrives in Berlin just after the end of World War Two. He becomes involved in a murder mystery surrounding a dead GI who washes up at a lakeside mansion during the Potsdam negotiations between the Allied powers. Soon his investigation connects with his search for his married pre-war German lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LjHC2CWDkzoiPehf3GViujws0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182'),
  ('569883102414767409', 'The Good Girl', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Miguel Arteta, Enrique Chediak, Jeff Bilger', 'Mike White', 'Jennifer Aniston, Zooey Deschanel, Jake Gyllenhaal, John Carroll Lynch, Tim Blake Nelson, John C. Reilly, Deborah Rush, Mike White', 'R', 'A discount store clerk strikes up an affair with a stock boy who considers himself the incarnation of Holden Caulfield.', 'A discount store clerk strikes up an affair with a stock boy who considers himself the incarnation of Holden Caulfield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpRumFobwgPzxj5YH33Wswnxdam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9962'),
  ('747877858807578345', 'The Good Girls', 2019, 'Drama', 'Alejandra Márquez Abella, Dariela Ludlow Deloya', 'Alejandra Márquez Abella', 'Ilse Salas, Flavio Medina, Cassandra Ciangherotti, Paulina Gaitán, Johanna Murillo, Jimena Guerra, Claudia Lobo, Diego Jáuregui', null, 'Sofía, a well-to-do socialite and her husband must wrestle with the impact of Mexico''s 1982 economic crisis.', 'Sofía, a well-to-do socialite and her husband must wrestle with the impact of Mexico''s 1982 economic crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCy2Kz2EKEP4axNzcBpgXKtEXCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541339'),
  ('59246424876921017', 'The Good Ground', 2018, 'Drama', 'Emanuele Caruso, Cinzia de Luca, Cristian de Giglio', 'Emanuele Caruso, Marco Domenicale', 'Giulio Brogi, Orfeo Orlando, Fabrizio Ferracane, Mattia Sbragia, Sergio Albelli, Lorenzo Pedrotti, Viola Sartoretto, Cristian Di Sante', null, 'A young woman with cancer travels to a remote wilderness zone in Northern Italy in search of an alternative cure. What she and her friend, Martino, find is a secluded paradise, but their arrival threatens its fragile existence.', 'A young woman with cancer travels to a remote wilderness zone in Northern Italy in search of an alternative cure. What she and her friend, Martino, find is a secluded paradise, but their arrival threatens its fragile existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71cq2hlPm3jj7ziyxOsspeE7Yxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472181'),
  ('330594108934471077', 'The Good Guy', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Julio DePietro, Seamus Tierney', 'Julio DePietro', 'Alexis Bledel, Scott Porter, Bryan Greenberg, Aaron Yoo, Anna Chlumsky, Colin Egglesfield, Andrew McCarthy, Kate Nauta', 'R', 'Ambitious young Manhattanite and urban conservationist Beth wants it all: a good job, good friends, and a good guy to share the city with. Of course that last one is often the trickiest of all. Beth falls hard for Tommy, a sexy, young Wall Street hot-shot. But just as everything seems to be falling into place, complications arise in the form of Tommy''s sensitive and handsome co-worker Daniel. Beth soon learns that the game of love in the big city is a lot like Wall Street -- high risk, high reward and everybody has an angle.', 'Ambitious young Manhattanite and urban conservationist Beth wants it all: a good job, good friends, and a good guy to share the city with. Of course that last one is often the trickiest of all. Beth falls hard for Tommy, a sexy, young Wall Street hot-shot. But just as everything seems to be falling into place, complications arise in the form of Tommy''s sensitive and handsome co-worker Daniel. Beth soon learns that the game of love in the big city is a lot like Wall Street -- high risk, high reward and everybody has an angle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwSQ62M3B1LTpHhau4MaREIwfSy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39037'),
  ('1087893284742217888', 'The Good Guys and the Bad Guys', 1969, 'Comedy, Western', 'Burt Kennedy, Harry Stradling Jr., Richard C. Bennett', 'Ronald M. Cohen, Dennis Shryack', 'Robert Mitchum, George Kennedy, Martin Balsam, David Carradine, Tina Louise, Douglas Fowley, Lois Nettleton, John Davis Chandler', null, 'An aging lawman and an aging outlaw join forces when their respective positions in society are usurped by a younger, but incompetent Marshal, and a younger, but vicious gang leader.', 'An aging lawman and an aging outlaw join forces when their respective positions in society are usurped by a younger, but incompetent Marshal, and a younger, but vicious gang leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqdCWEVwGHGFwAb0NqAH5WLPcEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70191'),
  ('1106232036675162645', 'The Good Half', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Rizzi, Robert Schwartzman', 'Brett Ryland', 'Nick Jonas, Brittany Snow, Alexandra Shipp, David Arquette, Matt Walsh, Elisabeth Shue, Steve Park, Ryan Bergara', 'NR', 'Renn Wheeland returns home to Cleveland for his mother''s funeral. Once there, he forges new relationships while healing old ones, before confronting his problems and trying to face his grief.', 'Renn Wheeland returns home to Cleveland for his mother''s funeral. Once there, he forges new relationships while healing old ones, before confronting his problems and trying to face his grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYXaJmBwPhiVAMlRIiIKhKptvc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114926'),
  ('138214998704058190', 'The Good Heart', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Dagur Kári, Rasmus Videbæk', 'Dagur Kári', 'Brian Cox, Paul Dano, Stephanie Szostak, Isild Le Besco, Bill Buell, Ed Wheeler, Clark Middleton, Edmund Lyndeck', 'R', 'Jacques is the curmudgeonly owner of a gritty New York dive bar that serves as home to a motley assortment of professional drinkers. Jacques is determinedly drinking and smoking himself to death when he meets Lucas, a homeless young man who has already given up on life. Determined to keep his legacy alive, Jacques deems Lucas is a fitting heir and takes him under his wing.', 'Jacques is the curmudgeonly owner of a gritty New York dive bar that serves as home to a motley assortment of professional drinkers. Jacques is determinedly drinking and smoking himself to death when he meets Lucas, a homeless young man who has already given up on life. Determined to keep his legacy alive, Jacques deems Lucas is a fitting heir and takes him under his wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSoUB8SFcVNaCFs1b3dTN3niYck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5178'),
  ('115668477436686993', 'The Good Hope', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guido Pieters', 'Karin Loomans', 'Kitty Courbois, Danny de Munk, Renée Soutendijk, Huub Stapel, Rijk de Gooyer, Willeke van Ammelrooy, Tamar van den Dop, Lex Goudsmit', null, 'Young Barend is worried about the safety of the sailing vessel he is on. The owner is an unscrupulous and stingy man who skimps on repairs and Barend becomes aware of this. Inevitably there is drama and tragedy. The film is set in an early 20th century Dutch fishing village with local period costume and colour.', 'Young Barend is worried about the safety of the sailing vessel he is on. The owner is an unscrupulous and stingy man who skimps on repairs and Barend becomes aware of this. Inevitably there is drama and tragedy. The film is set in an early 20th century Dutch fishing village with local period costume and colour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dhpedrQbgv4JKMPM2mxMXV2zfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57591'),
  ('585290266912916147', 'The Good House', 2021, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Andrei Schwartz, Wallace Wolodarsky, Maya Forbes', 'Thomas Bezucha, Wallace Wolodarsky, Maya Forbes', 'Sigourney Weaver, Kevin Kline, Morena Baccarin, Rob Delaney, David Rasche, Rebecca Henderson, Molly Brown, Kathryn Erbe', 'R', 'Hildy Good, a wry New England realtor and descendant of the Salem witches who loves her wine and loves her secrets. Her compartmentalized life starts to unravel as she rekindles an old romance and becomes dangerously entwined in one person’s reckless behavior.', 'Hildy Good, a wry New England realtor and descendant of the Salem witches who loves her wine and loves her secrets. Her compartmentalized life starts to unravel as she rekindles an old romance and becomes dangerously entwined in one person’s reckless behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0tSiNq9Ze4ucWFU6oRPd4OEGJr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633657'),
  ('956609888793456064', 'The Good Intentions', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ana García Blaya, Soledad Rodríguez, Martín García Blaya', 'Ana García Blaya', 'Javier Drolas, Amanda Minujín, Ezequiel Fontenla, Carmela Minujín, Sebastián Arzeno, Jazmín Stuart, Juan Minujín, Gabriel Medina', null, 'An aging slacker finds his comfortable status quo and family dynamic disrupted when his ex-wife and her current partner decide to move from Argentina to Paraguay and take his children with them.', 'An aging slacker finds his comfortable status quo and family dynamic disrupted when his ex-wife and her current partner decide to move from Argentina to Paraguay and take his children with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pz01AJf9hvKqdSo93T4JFtDMVmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621739'),
  ('901712500526676184', 'The Good Liar', 2019, 'Crime', 'Dominic Channing-Williams, Bill Condon, Vicki Stevenson', 'Jeffrey Hatcher', 'Helen Mirren, Ian McKellen, Russell Tovey, Jim Carter, Mark Lewis Jones, Laurie Davidson, Phil Dunster, Lucian Msamati', 'R', 'Career con man Roy sets his sights on his latest mark: recently widowed Betty, worth millions. And he means to take it all. But as the two draw closer, what should have been another simple swindle takes on the ultimate stakes.', 'Career con man Roy sets his sights on his latest mark: recently widowed Betty, worth millions. And he means to take it all. But as the two draw closer, what should have been another simple swindle takes on the ultimate stakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kmxXfg3aSWrzUlEPt2L0YD4jz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511322'),
  ('109120742327072552', 'The Good Lie', 2014, 'Drama', 'Philippe Falardeau, Ronald Plante', 'Margaret Nagle', 'Reese Witherspoon, Corey Stoll, Arnold Oceng, Ger Duany, Thad Luckinbill, Afemo Omilami, Sarah Baker, Joshua Mikel', 'PG-13', 'A young refugee of the Sudanese Civil War who wins a lottery for relocation to the United States with three other lost boys. Encountering the modern world for the first time, they develop an unlikely friendship with a brash American woman assigned to help them, but the young man struggles to adjust to this new life and his feelings of guilt about the brother he left behind.', 'A young refugee of the Sudanese Civil War who wins a lottery for relocation to the United States with three other lost boys. Encountering the modern world for the first time, they develop an unlikely friendship with a brash American woman assigned to help them, but the young man struggles to adjust to this new life and his feelings of guilt about the brother he left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAhoeIwwtPxJ7uf9HLIMHIqWFnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250538'),
  ('996111300125656241', 'The Good Life', 1996, 'Drama', 'David Trueba, William Lubtchansky', 'David Trueba', 'Fernando Ramallo, Lucía Jiménez, Luis Cuenca, Isabel Otero, Joel Joan, Vicky Peña, Jordi Bosch, Alma Rosa Castellanos', null, 'Tristan is about to turn fifteen. He enjoys the good life his parents have built for him. And yet, it won''t be long before his environment of protection, affection and comfort crumbles. From then on, he will learn the taste of loneliness, sadness and that survival is often more important than life.', 'Tristan is about to turn fifteen. He enjoys the good life his parents have built for him. And yet, it won''t be long before his environment of protection, affection and comfort crumbles. From then on, he will learn the taste of loneliness, sadness and that survival is often more important than life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HMyAuRywQuSrhk5ftMXt9RorD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47366'),
  ('845809193552479884', 'The Good Life', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen Berra, Patrice Lucien Cochet, Richard O''Brien-Moran', 'Stephen Berra', 'Mark Webber, Zooey Deschanel, Harry Dean Stanton, Drea De Matteo, Patrick Fugit, Chris Klein, Donal Logue, Bruce McGill', 'R', 'A movie about the travails of Jason (Mark Webber), a young gas station attendant and movie projectionist living in Nebraska. His encounters with various social difficulties and with Frances (Zooey Deschanel), a beautiful and enigmatic young woman leads to dramatic changes and decisions in his life.', 'A movie about the travails of Jason (Mark Webber), a young gas station attendant and movie projectionist living in Nebraska. His encounters with various social difficulties and with Frances (Zooey Deschanel), a beautiful and enigmatic young woman leads to dramatic changes and decisions in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FRYcXaRMfyB1BYpzjlwXfuoXvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24050'),
  ('1077442787685395079', 'The Good Life', 2008, 'Drama', 'Andrés Wood, M.I. Littin-Menz, Patricio Pereira', 'Andrés Wood', 'Aline Küppenheim, Eduardo Paxeco, Roberto Farías, Paula Sotelo, Manuela Martelli, Alfredo Castro, Francisco Acuña, Marcial Edwards', null, 'In the city of Santiago, four characters struggle to reach their goals: a psychologist who wants to help other women and save their lives, a hairdresser who wants to buy a car, a musician who wants to play in a philharmonic orchestra, and a young woman who simply survives in the city, but each of them obtains something unexpected and different from what they wanted.', 'In the city of Santiago, four characters struggle to reach their goals: a psychologist who wants to help other women and save their lives, a hairdresser who wants to buy a car, a musician who wants to play in a philharmonic orchestra, and a young woman who simply survives in the city, but each of them obtains something unexpected and different from what they wanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iRciud5XPJWqRFjqRSOFNA9aRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196324'),
  ('986687491727416507', 'The Good Life', 2009, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Virginie Wagon, Pierre Milon', 'Victor Bellaïch, Virginie Wagon', 'Valérie Donzelli, Michel Voïta, Boris Terral, Agathe Dronne, Nicolas Vaude, Nadia Fossier, Arielle Sémenoff, Sophie-Charlotte Husson', null, 'Desillussioned by life, Béa decides to commit suicide. She is interrupted by a phone call with a proposal of work for a financial tycoon. Far from the watchful eyes of her boss, she practices fraud, but it seems it gonna last not so long.', 'Desillussioned by life, Béa decides to commit suicide. She is interrupted by a phone call with a proposal of work for a financial tycoon. Far from the watchful eyes of her boss, she practices fraud, but it seems it gonna last not so long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uo92aNkbWYlVTcOY8fkjVbt1rVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235739'),
  ('1065301306146312651', 'The Good Life', 2014, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Jean Denizot', 'Frédérique Moreau, Jean Denizot', 'Zacharie Chasseriaud, Nicolas Bouchaud, Jules Pelissier, Solène Rigot, Jean-Philippe Écoffey, Maya Sansa', null, 'Sylvain and Pierre have been running from the law ever since a custody battle with their mother pushed their father Yves into hiding ten years ago. But now that they’re older, the two brothers are road-weary and eager to take advantage of the perks of young adulthood. When the authorities discover their whereabouts, they are forced to move yet again and Pierre, the elder, disappears. Alone with his father on an island in the Loire River, Sylvain meets Gilda: his first girl, his first crush, and the first stop on his way to “the good life” – his own.', 'Sylvain and Pierre have been running from the law ever since a custody battle with their mother pushed their father Yves into hiding ten years ago. But now that they’re older, the two brothers are road-weary and eager to take advantage of the perks of young adulthood. When the authorities discover their whereabouts, they are forced to move yet again and Pierre, the elder, disappears. Alone with his father on an island in the Loire River, Sylvain meets Gilda: his first girl, his first crush, and the first stop on his way to “the good life” – his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5C2Ab5g9xQeKdjdjS0RYyAVChrJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232580'),
  ('152472953682317211', 'The Good Luck', 2025, 'Drama', 'Gracia Querejeta, Juan Carlos Gómez, Emma Galvé', 'Gracia Querejeta, María Ruiz', 'Hugo Silva, Megan Montaner, Miguel Rellán, Eva Ugarte, Ismael Martínez, Paqui Horcajo, Álvaro Rico, Chani Martín', null, 'Pablo decides to get off the train at the station of a small town, buy an old and ramshackle apartment in front of the tracks and start living as if he were not the renowned architect he really is. Maybe he is running away from someone, or something, or even himself. In the village everything seems stagnant except Raluca, an optimistic woman open to surprises that can change your life for the better. She decided to trust her luck, even if life does not always present its best face.', 'Pablo decides to get off the train at the station of a small town, buy an old and ramshackle apartment in front of the tracks and start living as if he were not the renowned architect he really is. Maybe he is running away from someone, or something, or even himself. In the village everything seems stagnant except Raluca, an optimistic woman open to surprises that can change your life for the better. She decided to trust her luck, even if life does not always present its best face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSPnmFLkoqXgcQNQ3OKo0pOPGDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1432635'),
  ('383823734290663919', 'The Good Manners', 2025, 'Drama', 'Celia Rico Clavellino, Sara Gallego, Eva Leira', 'Celia Rico Clavellino', 'Loreto Mauleón, Enric Auquer, Roger Casamajor, Ana Rujas, Sofía Puerta Badenas, Teresa Lozano, Gloria March, Rosana Espinós', null, 'In a Valencian village, during the postwar period, Ana tries to get ahead with her family; the civil war has opened a deep wound in all of them, especially in her brother-in-law, Antonio. Ana tries to heal that wound with stews, secrets and silences, but when Isabel, newly married to Antonio, comes to the family, Ana’s attention and care will be worth little or nothing: the sacrifice does not always have its reward.', 'In a Valencian village, during the postwar period, Ana tries to get ahead with her family; the civil war has opened a deep wound in all of them, especially in her brother-in-law, Antonio. Ana tries to heal that wound with stews, secrets and silences, but when Isabel, newly married to Antonio, comes to the family, Ana’s attention and care will be worth little or nothing: the sacrifice does not always have its reward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bVMsq7jOsBAY2mlAkzkeQkf4M8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1407635'),
  ('537927664209319150', 'The Good Mother', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Watkin, Leonard Nimoy', 'Michael Bortman', 'Diane Keaton, Liam Neeson, Jason Robards, Ralph Bellamy, Teresa Wright, James Naughton, Asia Vieira, Joe Morton', 'R', 'After finding a sexually liberated boyfriend, a divorced woman gets sued over daughter''s custody, by her ex, who claims that her lover has a bad influence on the kid.', 'After finding a sexually liberated boyfriend, a divorced woman gets sued over daughter''s custody, by her ex, who claims that her lover has a bad influence on the kid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13AsjChBPvhefDsAazSqukmNCSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104301'),
  ('622944422085477251', 'The Good Mother', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Miles Joris-Peyrafitte, Jessie Roland, Callum Stembridge', 'Miles Joris-Peyrafitte, Madison Harrison', 'Hilary Swank, Olivia Cooke, Jack Reynor, Dilone, Hopper Penn, Norm Lewis, Karen Aldridge, Larry Fessenden', 'R', 'A journalist and her son''s pregnant girlfriend attempt to track down those responsible for the murder of her estranged son. Together, they confront a world of drugs and corruption in the underbelly of their small city in upstate New York, where they uncover an even darker secret.', 'A journalist and her son''s pregnant girlfriend attempt to track down those responsible for the murder of her estranged son. Together, they confront a world of drugs and corruption in the underbelly of their small city in upstate New York, where they uncover an even darker secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whwxm3JUXNiGvqZWcRC6g6kAHm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996347'),
  ('1076552382871524723', 'The Good Neighbor', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Stephan Rick, Felix Cramer', 'Stephan Rick, Silja Clemens', 'Maxim Mehmet, Charly Hübner, Petra Schmidt-Schaller, Helmut Rühl, Rainer Sellien, Katharina Heyer, Max Ruhbaum, Wolfgang Packhäuser', null, 'The budding friendship between two very different neighbors takes a tragic turn when David runs over a young woman and causes her death. At Robert''s insistence David leaves her lying and flees. While Robert hopes his new neighbor will now be irreversibly bound to him, David is increasingly devoured by feelings of guilt. When he meets Vanessa, the sister of his victim, he believes he can put things right. But he hasn''t taken Robert into account. Robert is prepared to do anything to keep his neighbor to himself.', 'The budding friendship between two very different neighbors takes a tragic turn when David runs over a young woman and causes her death. At Robert''s insistence David leaves her lying and flees. While Robert hopes his new neighbor will now be irreversibly bound to him, David is increasingly devoured by feelings of guilt. When he meets Vanessa, the sister of his victim, he believes he can put things right. But he hasn''t taken Robert into account. Robert is prepared to do anything to keep his neighbor to himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MbsHBOyXT3zW1OoUrNHSKEOxAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270367'),
  ('158356172737055091', 'The Good Neighbor', 2016, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Kasra Farahani, Alexander Alexandrov', 'Mark Bianculli, Jeff Richard', 'Logan Miller, Keir Gilchrist, James Caan, Bailey Noble, Lili Reinhart, Edwin Hodge, Laura Innes, Anne Dudek', 'R', 'Two high school filmmakers decide to create the illusion of a haunting on an unsuspecting neighbor.', 'Two high school filmmakers decide to create the illusion of a haunting on an unsuspecting neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ub0hBxjkfOUoymQR3NOWIVH400A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339994'),
  ('1097452706832807579', 'The Good Neighbor', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Stephan Rick, Stefan Ciupek, Svetlana Punte', 'Stephan Rick, Ross Partrige', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Luke Kleintank, Eloise Smyth, Bruce Davison, Ieva Florence-Vīksne, Regīna Razuma, Guna Zariņa, Kaspars Znotiņš', 'R', 'A nightmarish evening unfolds for neighbors David and Robert when they accidentally hit a woman on her bike and flee the scene. While David is increasingly plagued by feelings of guilt, Robert shows no remorse and becomes overbearing and possessive.', 'A nightmarish evening unfolds for neighbors David and Robert when they accidentally hit a woman on her bike and flee the scene. While David is increasingly plagued by feelings of guilt, Robert shows no remorse and becomes overbearing and possessive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXJ2xI7B0Z9WxDjyv18anPsOxeE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893086'),
  ('449238418524247992', 'The Good Night', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Fantasy, Music', 'Jake Paltrow, Giles Nuttgens', 'Jake Paltrow', 'Martin Freeman, Gwyneth Paltrow, Penélope Cruz, Simon Pegg, Danny DeVito, Amber Sealey, Sonia Doubell, Steffan Boje', 'R', 'Gary, a musician, is trapped in an unhappy relationship with his live-in lover, Dora. He becomes enthralled with a beautiful seductress who enters his dreams, and tries to control his dream-state so he can spend more and more time with her. When Gary sees his mystery woman''s face on a bus billboard, he discovers she is real, and fate brings him an opportunity to meet her.', 'Gary, a musician, is trapped in an unhappy relationship with his live-in lover, Dora. He becomes enthralled with a beautiful seductress who enters his dreams, and tries to control his dream-state so he can spend more and more time with her. When Gary sees his mystery woman''s face on a bus billboard, he discovers she is real, and fate brings him an opportunity to meet her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74TDF1OMKOkTonAUbtbsJOdqtVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13501'),
  ('143542757685826917', 'The Good Nurse', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Jody Lee Lipes, Tobias Lindholm', 'Krysty Wilson-Cairns', 'Jessica Chastain, Eddie Redmayne, Nnamdi Asomugha, Kim Dickens, Malik Yoba, Alix West Lefler, Noah Emmerich, Gabe Fazio', 'R', 'Suspicious that her colleague is responsible for a series of mysterious patient deaths, a nurse risks her own life to uncover the truth.', 'Suspicious that her colleague is responsible for a series of mysterious patient deaths, a nurse risks her own life to uncover the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSq6cq0LCcbro10jbEaPTEb3WmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541134'),
  ('978272253413876715', 'The Good Old Boys', 1995, 'Western, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Alan Caso, Sarah Shields', null, 'Tommy Lee Jones, Terry Kinney, Frances McDormand, Sam Shepard, Sissy Spacek, Wilford Brimley, Walter Olkewicz, Matt Damon', 'PG-13', 'An aging cowboy must choose between his desire to remain free and the responsibilities of maintaining a family.', 'An aging cowboy must choose between his desire to remain free and the responsibilities of maintaining a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMbkbVfocibpao6YoLqH87ExGA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277388'),
  ('500368012964773225', 'The Good Shepherd', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lewin Webb, Curtis Petersen', 'Brad Mirman', 'Christian Slater, Molly Parker, Stephen Rea, Gordon Pinsent, Nancy Beatty, Von Flores, Daniel Kash, Alex Paxton-Beesley', 'PG-13', 'When a clergyman is accused for the murder of a social worker, the parish priest recruits a reporter (and his ex-girlfriend) to clear his name.', 'When a clergyman is accused for the murder of a social worker, the parish priest recruits a reporter (and his ex-girlfriend) to clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkNl18FRZcbuifRo6rYvVuYtVrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10356'),
  ('1076089484755345967', 'The Good Shepherd', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Robert De Niro, Francisco Ortiz, Robert Richardson', 'Eric Roth', 'Matt Damon, Angelina Jolie, Robert De Niro, Alec Baldwin, William Hurt, Joe Pesci, John Turturro, Billy Crudup', 'R', 'Edward Wilson, the only witness to his father''s suicide and member of the Skull and Bones Society while a student at Yale, is a morally upright young man who values honor and discretion, qualities that help him to be recruited for a career in the newly founded OSS. His dedication to his work does not come without a price though, leading him to sacrifice his ideals and eventually his family.', 'Edward Wilson, the only witness to his father''s suicide and member of the Skull and Bones Society while a student at Yale, is a morally upright young man who values honor and discretion, qualities that help him to be recruited for a career in the newly founded OSS. His dedication to his work does not come without a price though, leading him to sacrifice his ideals and eventually his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWmF0rQRPeIVQRfwQN3C9VFKsBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1247'),
  ('33879938953307434', 'The Good Shepherdess and the Evil Princess', 1908, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A good shepherdess is persecuted by an evil, tantrum-throwing princess. A good fairy decides to intervene, and dishes out quite a bit of retribution.', 'A good shepherdess is persecuted by an evil, tantrum-throwing princess. A good fairy decides to intervene, and dishes out quite a bit of retribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPDjlurAM1segSAhujrnnWWSCeb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196600'),
  ('440695262012246224', 'The Good Soldier Svejk', 1956, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jiří Trnka', 'Jiří Trnka', 'Jan Werich', null, 'Adapting Jaroslav Hasek''s raucous satirical novel, and also bringing Josef Lada''s equally famous illustrations to garrulous puppet life, posed Trnka one of his biggest creative challenges. Trnka himself felt that the final episode was the most artistically successful, but there''s much to enjoy in all three, not least the way that the lackadaisical layabout Svejk''s own self-serving anecdotes are realized through cut-out animation.', 'Adapting Jaroslav Hasek''s raucous satirical novel, and also bringing Josef Lada''s equally famous illustrations to garrulous puppet life, posed Trnka one of his biggest creative challenges. Trnka himself felt that the final episode was the most artistically successful, but there''s much to enjoy in all three, not least the way that the lackadaisical layabout Svejk''s own self-serving anecdotes are realized through cut-out animation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSJEDLTnir2Un4rJleOLiHaAsTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257101'),
  ('516738994866322865', 'The Good Soldier Švejk', 1957, 'Comedy, War', 'Karel Steklý, Rudolf Stahl, Lada Vacková', 'Karel Steklý', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Eva Svobodová, Josef Hlinomaz, František Filipovský, Miloš Kopecký, Svatopluk Beneš, Božena Havlíčková, Felix le Breux', null, 'Good-natured and garrulous, Schweik becomes the Austrian army''s most loyal Czech soldier when he is called up on the outbreak of World War I -- although his bumbling attempts to get to the front serve only to prevent him from reaching it. Playing cards and getting drunk, he uses all his cunning and genial subterfuge to deal with the police, clergy, and officers who chivy him toward battle.', 'Good-natured and garrulous, Schweik becomes the Austrian army''s most loyal Czech soldier when he is called up on the outbreak of World War I -- although his bumbling attempts to get to the front serve only to prevent him from reaching it. Playing cards and getting drunk, he uses all his cunning and genial subterfuge to deal with the police, clergy, and officers who chivy him toward battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK3R4cFvcyXZT0XTZ6UJZXJi3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123513'),
  ('179889617001369008', 'The Good Son', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Joseph Ruben, John Lindley, Barbara M. Ravis', 'Ian McEwan', 'Macaulay Culkin, Elijah Wood, Wendy Crewson, David Morse, Daniel Hugh Kelly, Jacqueline Brookes, Quinn Culkin, Ashley Crow', 'R', 'A young boy stays with his aunt and uncle, and befriends his cousin who''s the same age. But his cousin begins showing increasing signs of psychotic behavior.', 'A young boy stays with his aunt and uncle, and befriends his cousin who''s the same age. But his cousin begins showing increasing signs of psychotic behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jZ1eef6SCVSMb4o1pSHHq84Nyf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9272'),
  ('549029490775749078', 'The Good Student', 2006, 'Comedy', 'David Ostry, Jennifer McNamara, Jordan Lynn', 'Adam Targum', 'Tim Daly, Hayden Panettiere, William Sadler, Dan Hedaya, Paula Devicq, Sarah Steele, John Gallagher Jr., Mark Kassen', 'R', 'When Ally, a popular teen and local celebrity goes missing, her small suburban town erupts in panic.', 'When Ally, a popular teen and local celebrity goes missing, her small suburban town erupts in panic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOmBrbZBABF7G3F0QaaJJURJGCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16053'),
  ('1083871352577716351', 'The Good Teacher', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Teddy Lussi-Modeste, Lucile Jacques, Hichame Alaouié', 'Audrey Diwan, Teddy Lussi-Modeste', 'François Civil, Shaïn Boumedine, Toscane Duquesne, Mallory Wanecque, Bakary Kebe, Marianne Ehouman, Luna Ho Poumey, Emma Boumali', null, 'Julien, a young teacher, is wrongfully accused of sexual misconduct by a teenage girl from his class. As he faces mounting pressures from the girl’s older brother and her classmates, the situation spirals out of control. Allegations spread, the entire school is thrown into turmoil, and the teacher has to fight to clear his name.', 'Julien, a young teacher, is wrongfully accused of sexual misconduct by a teenage girl from his class. As he faces mounting pressures from the girl’s older brother and her classmates, the situation spirals out of control. Allegations spread, the entire school is thrown into turmoil, and the teacher has to fight to clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haqfplSRnIwO8ha5tKOxwnG1sxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000862'),
  ('714737582085226407', 'The Good Thief', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Giancarlo Ferrando, Vivalda Vigorelli', 'Renato Ghiotto, Ottavio Jemma, Santino Spartà', 'Enrico Montesano, Edwige Fenech, Bernadette Lafont, Claudio Cassinelli, Enzo Robutti, Daniele Vargas, Sara Franchetti, Stefania D''Amario', null, 'Caleb, "son of nobody" (Enrico Montesano) lives in Galilee in Jesus'' day and struggles as a thief and con-man, pretending to be a magician. When he witnesses Jesus turning water into wine, he thinks he''s found a competitor. So Caleb goes on, convinced that Jesus is a fake just as he is, always trying to figure out his tricks. In the meantime, he gets involved with a prostitute (played by Edwige Fenech), but also with the wife of a Roman patrician (played by the equally alluring Bernadette Lafont), he steals a few goats and cons a few people, he befriends a lovable dog and gets in trouble with some Roman soldiers.', 'Caleb, "son of nobody" (Enrico Montesano) lives in Galilee in Jesus'' day and struggles as a thief and con-man, pretending to be a magician. When he witnesses Jesus turning water into wine, he thinks he''s found a competitor. So Caleb goes on, convinced that Jesus is a fake just as he is, always trying to figure out his tricks. In the meantime, he gets involved with a prostitute (played by Edwige Fenech), but also with the wife of a Roman patrician (played by the equally alluring Bernadette Lafont), he steals a few goats and cons a few people, he befriends a lovable dog and gets in trouble with some Roman soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqrrv56CjBhHot0ucjyNOSHviBQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82660'),
  ('795129789011250828', 'The Good Thief', 2003, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Neil Jordan, Chris Menges, Chris Seagers', 'Neil Jordan, Jean-Pierre Melville, Auguste Le Breton', 'Nick Nolte, Nutsa Kukhianidze, Saïd Taghmaoui, Mark Polish, Tchéky Karyo, Gérard Darmon, Emir Kusturica, Marc Lavoine', 'R', 'An aging gambler on a losing streak attempts to rob a casino in Monte Carlo. But someone''s already tipped off the cops before he even makes a move.', 'An aging gambler on a losing streak attempts to rob a casino in Monte Carlo. But someone''s already tipped off the cops before he even makes a move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TMlSiPuj9LymfwPiKFiRRnhkRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6016'),
  ('645458195342343345', 'The Good Times Are Here: Let It All Hang Out', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Ivan Cardoso, John Herbert, Alberto Gieco', 'Daniel Más', 'Carla Camurati, Paulo César Grande, Carina Cooper, Pedro Cardoso, Alexandre Frota, Marcos Frota, Kátia Lopes, Vanessa Alves', null, 'Two stories chronicle the days of the bohemian, libertine youth of 1960s Rio de Janeiro.', 'Two stories chronicle the days of the bohemian, libertine youth of 1960s Rio de Janeiro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dpbHpYdIGrUE22brTxvzE4gByd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75275'),
  ('504664301348943763', 'The Good Traitor', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Christina Rosendahl, Louise McLaughlin, Anna Schulin-Zeuthen', 'Dunja Gry Jensen, Christina Rosendahl, Kristian Bang Foss', 'Ulrich Thomsen, Denise Gough, Mikkel Boe Følsgaard, Zoë Tapper, Burn Gorman, Henry Goodman, Esben Dalgaard Andersen, Ross McCall', null, 'The Danish ambassador to Washington declares himself to be the sole representative of a free Denmark during the Nazi occupation of the country.', 'The Danish ambassador to Washington declares himself to be the sole representative of a free Denmark during the Nazi occupation of the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dwG9e4vtKTVEhSec8bQJsLut4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:702557'),
  ('441076453521594826', 'The Good Wife', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Bartle, Craig Bolles, Phil Rich', 'Peter Kenna', 'Rachel Ward, Bryan Brown, Sam Neill, Steven Vidler, Jennifer Claire, Bruce Barry, Peter Cummins, Carole Skinner', 'R', 'In pre-WWII Australia, a love triangle develops between a man, his wife and the man''s brother.', 'In pre-WWII Australia, a love triangle develops between a man, his wife and the man''s brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2cFXujeW68LXn1uCo8SxcCeXhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59066'),
  ('1126454197444996776', 'The Good Witch', 2008, 'Family, Fantasy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Craig Pryce, Gerald Packer', 'Rod Spence', 'Catherine Bell, Chris Potter, Catherine Disher, Peter MacNeill, Allan Royal, Matthew Knight, Paula Boudreau, Hannah Endicott-Douglas', 'PG', 'A mysterious woman comes in to town and inhabits the local haunted mansion, making everyone wonder if she''s a witch or "The Grey Lady".', 'A mysterious woman comes in to town and inhabits the local haunted mansion, making everyone wonder if she''s a witch or "The Grey Lady".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZVOeGCbhLzIfCOB7BCvIrE2TaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32790'),
  ('990035752916732900', 'The Good Witch''s Charm', 2012, 'TV Movie, Family, Fantasy', 'Craig Pryce, John Berrie', 'G. Ross Parker', 'Catherine Bell, Chris Potter, Hannah Endicott-Douglas, Matthew Knight, Peter MacNeill, Catherine Disher, Geordie Johnson, Janet-Laine Green', 'G', 'Good Witch Cassie Nightingale is back to her bewitching ways, but this time she’s also juggling a newborn daughter and her job as town Mayor. With such a busy schedule she and her husband, town sheriff Jake Russell, aren’t getting much sleep. Hoping for a break, Cassie plans a much needed vacation with her new family. But things go awry when a crime wave sweeps through town and an investigative reporter tries to ruin Cassie’s image after a video of her magically disappearing turns up on the internet. To make matters worse, Cassie’s estranged foster mother appears in town and Cassie’s stepdaughter is suddenly accused of the recent robberies. Supported by her loyal family and friends, Cassie must rely on her signature charm to put a stop to the rumors before they completely destroy the town, and a Good Witch’s reputation!', 'Good Witch Cassie Nightingale is back to her bewitching ways, but this time she’s also juggling a newborn daughter and her job as town Mayor. With such a busy schedule she and her husband, town sheriff Jake Russell, aren’t getting much sleep. Hoping for a break, Cassie plans a much needed vacation with her new family. But things go awry when a crime wave sweeps through town and an investigative reporter tries to ruin Cassie’s image after a video of her magically disappearing turns up on the internet. To make matters worse, Cassie’s estranged foster mother appears in town and Cassie’s stepdaughter is suddenly accused of the recent robberies. Supported by her loyal family and friends, Cassie must rely on her signature charm to put a stop to the rumors before they completely destroy the town, and a Good Witch’s reputation!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXdG4mMNqUwurLgOfNzEdDsyyGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148656'),
  ('503892097675720015', 'The Good Witch''s Family', 2011, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Craig Pryce, John Berrie, Ross Clyde', 'G. Ross Parker', 'Catherine Bell, Chris Potter, Catherine Disher, Sarah Power, Hannah Endicott-Douglas, Matthew Knight, Rhys Ward, Noah Cappe', 'PG', 'A young witch visits her cousin in a small town during a heated mayoral election race. Her kind-hearted cousin, the town’s beloved “good witch” and newlywed with two teenage step-kids, is running for office, but must keep her family from falling apart when their visitor uses her magic to put them—and the whole town—under her bitter spell.', 'A young witch visits her cousin in a small town during a heated mayoral election race. Her kind-hearted cousin, the town’s beloved “good witch” and newlywed with two teenage step-kids, is running for office, but must keep her family from falling apart when their visitor uses her magic to put them—and the whole town—under her bitter spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywsP21sGXXzui0gk1sVMAZ751Sh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81033'),
  ('247789816381735593', 'The Good Witch''s Garden', 2009, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Craig Pryce, John Dyer', 'G. Ross Parker', 'Catherine Bell, Chris Potter, Catherine Disher, Peter MacNeill, Rob Stewart, Matthew Knight, Hannah Endicott-Douglas, Elizabeth Lennie', 'PG', 'Middleton prepares for its bicentennial, and Grey House is to be the party venue. Good witch Cassie is remodeling it as B&amp;B. her first and only guest, Nick Chasen, claims to be a distant relative. He produces papers to prove he''s the heir of the builder, colonial era captain Hamblin, while the Grey lady was his mistress and stole it. Police chief and lover Jake Russell goes all the way to motivate her to fight and disprove the claim before she''s effectively disowned. Brandon is dared to pass a rascals-initiation by local brat Steve and Duke. George''s gardening skills lead to romance.', 'Middleton prepares for its bicentennial, and Grey House is to be the party venue. Good witch Cassie is remodeling it as B&amp;B. her first and only guest, Nick Chasen, claims to be a distant relative. He produces papers to prove he''s the heir of the builder, colonial era captain Hamblin, while the Grey lady was his mistress and stole it. Police chief and lover Jake Russell goes all the way to motivate her to fight and disprove the claim before she''s effectively disowned. Brandon is dared to pass a rascals-initiation by local brat Steve and Duke. George''s gardening skills lead to romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XMRMsKAKvA5reGZIL4m3YqQwQv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60821'),
  ('484659279047827432', 'The Good Witch''s Gift', 2010, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Craig Pryce, John Berrie, Tom Willey', 'G. Ross Parker, Rod Spence', 'Catherine Bell, Chris Potter, Catherine Disher, Peter MacNeill, Matthew Knight, Hannah Endicott-Douglas, Elizabeth Lennie, Noah Cappe', 'G', 'Almost as soon as Jake and Cassie decide to get married on Christmas Eve, complications arise.', 'Almost as soon as Jake and Cassie decide to get married on Christmas Eve, complications arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cw6gQD0QRS3MA3bdGnAqQYSYhdr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61005'),
  ('1041721713581683372', 'The Good, the Bad and Huckleberry Hound', 1988, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie, Western', 'Andrea Romano, Ray Patterson, Charles August Nichols', 'John Ludin, Tom Ruegger', 'Daws Butler, Charlie Adler, Michael Bell, Pat Buttram, Pat Fraley, Allan Melvin, Don Messick, Howard Morris', null, 'It''s the gold rush era in the Wild West. A mysterious stranger (Huckleberry Hound) arrives in a small desert town carrying a huge golden nugget. The notorious Dalton brothers steal it. The town asks "the stranger" to go after them.', 'It''s the gold rush era in the Wild West. A mysterious stranger (Huckleberry Hound) arrives in a small desert town carrying a huge golden nugget. The notorious Dalton brothers steal it. The town asks "the stranger" to go after them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6eq83LtIVUtJ8AFL1yGPKqIf6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182217'),
  ('848472747148609353', 'The Good, the Bad and the Ugly', 1966, 'Western', 'Tonino Delli Colli, Sergio Leone, Carlo Leva', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Sergio Leone, Agenore Incrocci', 'Clint Eastwood, Eli Wallach, Lee Van Cleef, Aldo Giuffrè, Luigi Pistilli, Rada Rassimov, Enzo Petito, Claudio Scarchilli', 'R', 'While the Civil War rages on between the Union and the Confederacy, three men – a quiet loner, a ruthless hitman, and a Mexican bandit – comb the American Southwest in search of a strongbox containing $200,000 in stolen gold.', 'While the Civil War rages on between the Union and the Confederacy, three men – a quiet loner, a ruthless hitman, and a Mexican bandit – comb the American Southwest in search of a strongbox containing $200,000 in stolen gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bX2xnavhMYjWDoZp1VM6VnU1xwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429'),
  ('351697137806214432', 'The Good, the Bad, the Weird', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Western', 'Lee Mo-gae, Kim Jee-woon, Oh Seung-chul', 'Kim Min-suk, Kim Jee-woon', 'Song Kang-ho, Lee Byung-hun, Jung Woo-sung, Yoon Je-moon, Ryu Seung-su, Song Young-chang, Son Byung-ho, Oh Dal-su', 'R', 'The story of three Korean outlaws in 1930s Manchuria and their dealings with the Japanese army and Chinese and Russian bandits. The Good (a bounty hunter), the Bad (a hitman), and the Weird (a thief) battle the army and the bandits in a race to use a treasure map to uncover the riches of legend.', 'The story of three Korean outlaws in 1930s Manchuria and their dealings with the Japanese army and Chinese and Russian bandits. The Good (a bounty hunter), the Bad (a hitman), and the Weird (a thief) battle the army and the bandits in a race to use a treasure map to uncover the riches of legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbPZ0aNoF0cHisg6DubFO2eS8so.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15067'),
  ('581109367144259709', 'The Good, the Bart, and the Loki', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'David Silverman', 'Jeff Westbrook, Al Jean, John Frink', 'Tom Hiddleston, Dan Castellaneta, Nancy Cartwright, Yeardley Smith, Maurice LaMarche, Dawnn Lewis', 'PG', 'Loki is banished from Asgard once again and must face his toughest opponents yet: the Simpsons and Springfield’s mightiest heroes. The God of Mischief teams up with Bart Simpson in the ultimate crossover event paying tribute to the Marvel Cinematic Universe of superheroes and villains.', 'Loki is banished from Asgard once again and must face his toughest opponents yet: the Simpsons and Springfield’s mightiest heroes. The God of Mischief teams up with Bart Simpson in the ultimate crossover event paying tribute to the Marvel Cinematic Universe of superheroes and villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtMdtzywcAGOrF6t8fbxJBqpdcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846214'),
  ('481703025320337166', 'The Goodbye Girl', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Herbert Ross, David M. Walsh, Spencer Deverell', 'Neil Simon', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Marsha Mason, Quinn Cummings, Paul Benedict, Barbara Rhoades, Theresa Merritt, Michael Shawn, Patricia Pearcy', 'PG', 'After being dumped by her live-in boyfriend, an unemployed dancer and her 10-year-old daughter are reluctantly forced to live with a struggling off-Broadway actor.', 'After being dumped by her live-in boyfriend, an unemployed dancer and her 10-year-old daughter are reluctantly forced to live with a struggling off-Broadway actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdaPFRARLPJuSdQIfxKVJSCOsmD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14741'),
  ('194923684694595763', 'The Goodbye Kiss', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Michele Soavi, Barbara Daniele, Stefano Falivene', 'Michele Soavi, Marco Colli, Franco Ferrini', 'Alessio Boni, Michele Placido, Isabella Ferrari, Alina Nedelea, Carlo Cecchi, Antonello Fassari, Marjo Berasategui, Riccardo Zinna', null, 'Leftist radical-turned-terrorist Giorgio—hiding out in Latin America since the 1970s—turns himself in as soon as the Berlin Wall falls. Wishing to lead a comfortable, bourgeois life in his native Italy, he cuts a deal with a dirty cop, getting his sentence reduced in return for ratting former comrades out. Once released, Giorgio obsessively pursues his dream of becoming an upright citizen, but his old police aquaintance keeps dragging him down...', 'Leftist radical-turned-terrorist Giorgio—hiding out in Latin America since the 1970s—turns himself in as soon as the Berlin Wall falls. Wishing to lead a comfortable, bourgeois life in his native Italy, he cuts a deal with a dirty cop, getting his sentence reduced in return for ratting former comrades out. Once released, Giorgio obsessively pursues his dream of becoming an upright citizen, but his old police aquaintance keeps dragging him down...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gstmEqp3c9GY9u94Kswf9zT5Ke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35464'),
  ('690537236970629394', 'The Goodbye Place', 1996, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Richard Kelly', 'Richard Kelly', 'George Shrouder, Staci Greason, Edwin C. Waite, Norma Barbour, Sindy Shrouder', null, 'An abused child is offered escape by some mysterious strangers who may or may not know where missing children truly disappear to.', 'An abused child is offered escape by some mysterious strangers who may or may not know where missing children truly disappear to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjM4Uh1tPYPBvvMWyXdBQNuJSLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200678'),
  ('652764936061478118', 'The Goods: Live Hard, Sell Hard', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Neal Brennan, Daryn Okada, Douglas S. Holgate', 'Andy Stock, Rick Stempson', 'Jeremy Piven, Ving Rhames, James Brolin, David Koechner, Kathryn Hahn, Ed Helms, Jordana Spiro, Tony Hale', 'R', 'Don Ready is many things, but he is best-known as an extraordinary salesman. When a car dealership in Temecula teeters on the brink of bankruptcy, he and his ragtag team dive in to save the day. But what Ready doesn''t count on is falling in love and finding his soul.', 'Don Ready is many things, but he is best-known as an extraordinary salesman. When a car dealership in Temecula teeters on the brink of bankruptcy, he and his ragtag team dive in to save the day. But what Ready doesn''t count on is falling in love and finding his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nEd4aLuRlAPFqUdcCYekAAjWsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19905'),
  ('309089878997649379', 'The Goofy Bandit', 1983, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Daniel Filho, Edgar Moura', 'Renato Aragão, Aguinaldo Silva, Doc Comparato', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Regina Duarte, Nelson Xavier, Tânia Alves, José Dumont', null, 'Severino do Quixadá (Renato Aragão), a humble northeastern shepherd of goats, rescues Captain Virgulano or simply Captain (Nelson Xavier) and his band of cangaceiros of an ambush armed by the lieutenant Zé Bezerra (Jose Dumont), its eternal persecutor. Captain escapes taking with him the mysterious box that he removed from the interior of the assaulted train in the city of Cajarana. Seeking to escape the shooting, Severino ends up finding himself in the cangaceiros'' camp, along with the mishap friends Mussum and Zacarias who, taking advantage of the confusion, fled the chain.', 'Severino do Quixadá (Renato Aragão), a humble northeastern shepherd of goats, rescues Captain Virgulano or simply Captain (Nelson Xavier) and his band of cangaceiros of an ambush armed by the lieutenant Zé Bezerra (Jose Dumont), its eternal persecutor. Captain escapes taking with him the mysterious box that he removed from the interior of the assaulted train in the city of Cajarana. Seeking to escape the shooting, Severino ends up finding himself in the cangaceiros'' camp, along with the mishap friends Mussum and Zacarias who, taking advantage of the confusion, fled the chain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTeVkngp93Cxw1t5RpWy8ErSN4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251356'),
  ('576444511908978152', 'The Goofy Ghosts', 1987, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'J.B. Tanko, José Alvarenga Jr., Nonato Estrela', 'J.B. Tanko, Domingos Demasi', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Bia Seidl, Carla Daniel, Gugu Liberato, Afonso Nigro', null, 'The friends Didi, Dede, and Zechariah Mussum sell crafts on the roadside when supreendidos a car chase. After an accident succor old Giovanni (Grey Wilson) who before dying reveals the hiding place of a fortune. It is money stolen from a bank in Italy for which it is offered a reward of five million dollars. With the help of Delegate Augusto (Gugu Liberato), the four go in search of money, a haunted castle..', 'The friends Didi, Dede, and Zechariah Mussum sell crafts on the roadside when supreendidos a car chase. After an accident succor old Giovanni (Grey Wilson) who before dying reveals the hiding place of a fortune. It is money stolen from a bank in Italy for which it is offered a reward of five million dollars. With the help of Delegate Augusto (Gugu Liberato), the four go in search of money, a haunted castle..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vg0PfhA56MJgVZM7RMFdiXjdC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133007'),
  ('755800467758439058', 'The Goofy Heroes: An Adventure in the Jungle', 1988, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'José Alvarenga Jr., Wilton Franco, Nonato Estrela', 'Dedé Santana', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Angélica, Luma de Oliveira, Afonso Nigro, Nill', null, 'Didi, Dedé, Mussum and Zacarias are sent in a rescue mission to the daughter of the Army''s minister.', 'Didi, Dedé, Mussum and Zacarias are sent in a rescue mission to the daughter of the Army''s minister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzMEN8amxrPMN4TlENgH7DOi0q3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100988'),
  ('614264179221664592', 'The Goofy Vagabonds', 1982, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'J.B. Tanko, Victor Lustosa, Marco Antonio Rocha', 'Gilvan Pereira', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Mussum, Zacarias, Louise Cardoso, Denise Dumont, Edson Celulari, João Joedes', null, 'Bonga, his three friends and his girlfriend Loló care for abandoned children in a cave on the outskirts of a city. One day, Pedrinho runs away from home and goes to live in the cave. His father, a powerful industrial, offers a reward to anyone who brings the child back.', 'Bonga, his three friends and his girlfriend Loló care for abandoned children in a cave on the outskirts of a city. One day, Pedrinho runs away from home and goes to live in the cave. His father, a powerful industrial, offers a reward to anyone who brings the child back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujUGAGdxM7fPc0LwooYq7FyG8Qq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172514'),
  ('702359910304272210', 'The Goonies', 1985, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Richard Donner, Nick McLean, Joseph C. Nemec III', 'Chris Columbus', 'Sean Astin, Josh Brolin, Jeff Cohen, Corey Feldman, Kerri Green, Martha Plimpton, Ke Huy Quan, John Matuszak', 'PG', 'Young teen Mikey Walsh and his friends set off on a quest to find Pirate One-Eyed Willie''s treasure in hopes of saving their homes from demolition. However, on their quest to find the treasure, they run into a family of recently escaped criminals, determined to capture the kids and reach the treasure first.', 'Young teen Mikey Walsh and his friends set off on a quest to find Pirate One-Eyed Willie''s treasure in hopes of saving their homes from demolition. However, on their quest to find the treasure, they run into a family of recently escaped criminals, determined to capture the kids and reach the treasure first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBU7gCjTCj9n2LTxvCSIXXOvHkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9340'),
