  ('1093337067039773598', 'The Goose Steps Out', 1942, 'Comedy, War', 'Basil Dearden, Will Hay, Ernest Palmer', 'Angus MacPhail, John Dighton', 'Will Hay, Frank Pettingell, Julien Mitchell, Charles Hawtrey, Barry Morse, Peter Ustinov, Peter Croft, Anne Firth', null, 'Schoolteacher William Potts is the double of a captured German spy, so he is sent to Germany by British Intelligence to obtain the plans of a new secret weapon, causing chaos in a Hitler Youth school in the process.', 'Schoolteacher William Potts is the double of a captured German spy, so he is sent to Germany by British Intelligence to obtain the plans of a new secret weapon, causing chaos in a Hitler Youth school in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3T4LWe3PxjbKunulwU4KBxwHCQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163848'),
  ('974152020000471996', 'The Gorge', 2025, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Scott Derrickson, Dan Laustsen, Coalin Smith', 'Zach Dean', 'Miles Teller, Anya Taylor-Joy, Sigourney Weaver, Ṣọpẹ́ Dìrísù, William Houston, Kobna Holdbrook-Smith, James Marlowe, Julianna Kurokawa', 'PG-13', 'Two highly trained operatives grow close from a distance after being sent to guard opposite sides of a mysterious gorge. When an evil below emerges, they must work together to survive what lies within.', 'Two highly trained operatives grow close from a distance after being sent to guard opposite sides of a mysterious gorge. When an evil below emerges, they must work together to survive what lies within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iMBZzVZtG0oBug4TfqDb9ZxAOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950396'),
  ('963625636169226551', 'The Gorgeous Hussy', 1936, 'Drama, History', 'Clarence Brown, George J. Folsey', 'Ainsworth Morgan, Stephen Morehouse Avery', 'Joan Crawford, Robert Taylor, Lionel Barrymore, Franchot Tone, Melvyn Douglas, James Stewart, Beulah Bondi, Alison Skipworth', null, 'It''s the early nineteenth century Washington. Young adult Margaret O''Neal, Peggy to most that know her, is the daughter of Major William O''Neal, who is the innkeeper of the establishment where most out-of-town politicians and military men stay when they''re in Washington. Peggy is pretty and politically aware. She is courted by several of those politicians and military men who all want to marry her, except for the one with who she is truly in love.', 'It''s the early nineteenth century Washington. Young adult Margaret O''Neal, Peggy to most that know her, is the daughter of Major William O''Neal, who is the innkeeper of the establishment where most out-of-town politicians and military men stay when they''re in Washington. Peggy is pretty and politically aware. She is courted by several of those politicians and military men who all want to marry her, except for the one with who she is truly in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvqWDuu9NRjB8MnIMunYH9GchfZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112284'),
  ('676347041216043202', 'The Gorgon', 1964, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Terence Fisher, Michael Reed', 'John Gilling', 'Peter Cushing, Christopher Lee, Richard Pasco, Barbara Shelley, Michael Goodliffe, Patrick Troughton, Joseph O''Conor, Prudence Hyman', 'NR', 'In the early 20th century a village experienced a series of inexplicable murders. All the victims were young men who had been turned to stone. The perpetrator of these deaths was a being so repulsive that she transformed the onlooker using the power of her deadly stare. Much of the time the creature took the form of a beautiful and seductive woman, but during periods of the full moon she becomes a living horror, vicious and deadly. A professor has come to investigate the deaths, bringing with him his beautiful assistant whose knowledge of the Gorgon is more intimate than anyone would ever realise.', 'In the early 20th century a village experienced a series of inexplicable murders. All the victims were young men who had been turned to stone. The perpetrator of these deaths was a being so repulsive that she transformed the onlooker using the power of her deadly stare. Much of the time the creature took the form of a beautiful and seductive woman, but during periods of the full moon she becomes a living horror, vicious and deadly. A professor has come to investigate the deaths, bringing with him his beautiful assistant whose knowledge of the Gorgon is more intimate than anyone would ever realise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yk0hJB3hy3o6cAzv5tjcPoKQd9p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28667'),
  ('596546314128478495', 'The Gorilla', 1939, 'Comedy, Mystery, Horror', 'Allan Dwan, Aaron Rosenberg, Edward Cronjager', 'Rian James, Sid Silvers', 'Jimmy Ritz, Harry Ritz, Al Ritz, Anita Louise, Patsy Kelly, Lionel Atwill, Bela Lugosi, Joseph Calleia', 'NR', 'When an escaped circus gorilla appears to have gone on a murderous rampage, a threatened attorney calls on the detective trio of Garrity, Harrigan and Mullivan to act as bodyguards. In short order, we discover that there is more to the attorney than meets the eye, and the ape may be innocent after all. When a pretty young heiress faces peril, it''s up to our heroic trio to save the day.', 'When an escaped circus gorilla appears to have gone on a murderous rampage, a threatened attorney calls on the detective trio of Garrity, Harrigan and Mullivan to act as bodyguards. In short order, we discover that there is more to the attorney than meets the eye, and the ape may be innocent after all. When a pretty young heiress faces peril, it''s up to our heroic trio to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SoQjbhbjWnqtbXWoZ4ha9qUBLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89723'),
  ('821159283555507209', 'The Gorilla Mystery', 1930, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Marcellite Garner, Walt Disney', null, 'A gorilla has escaped; Mickey, panicked, calls Minnie, but she plays a song to show she is not afraid. That is, until the gorilla comes up behind her and grabs her. Mickey rushes right over to save her.', 'A gorilla has escaped; Mickey, panicked, calls Minnie, but she plays a song to show she is not afraid. That is, until the gorilla comes up behind her and grabs her. Mickey rushes right over to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHSvBnz0o7OSUWMZmPI5CTEfUKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162791'),
  ('1106112936200133059', 'The Gospel According to St. Matthew', 1965, 'Drama', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Maurizio Lucidi, Paolo Schneider', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Enrique Irazoqui, Margherita Caruso, Susanna Pasolini, Marcello Morante, Mario Socrate, Settimio Di Porto, Alfonso Gatto, Luigi Barbini', null, 'Along a rocky, barren coastline, Jesus begins teaching, primarily using parables. He attracts disciples; he''s stern, brusque, and demanding. His parables often take on the powers that be, so he and his teachings come to the attention of the Pharisees, the chief priests, and elders. They conspire to have him arrested, beaten, tried, and crucified, just as he prophesied to his followers.', 'Along a rocky, barren coastline, Jesus begins teaching, primarily using parables. He attracts disciples; he''s stern, brusque, and demanding. His parables often take on the powers that be, so he and his teachings come to the attention of the Pharisees, the chief priests, and elders. They conspire to have him arrested, beaten, tried, and crucified, just as he prophesied to his followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oifi2CQkKbb6Y2x6J5K6CjaKab9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24192'),
  ('901413690015233850', 'The Gospel of John', 2003, 'Drama', 'Philip Saville, Mirosław Baszak', 'John Goldsmith', 'Christopher Plummer, Henry Ian Cusick, Stuart Bunce, Daniel Kash, Stephen Russell, Alan van Sprang, Diana Berriman, Richard Lintern', 'PG-13', 'A word for word depiction of the life of Jesus Christ from the Good News Translation Bible as recorded in the Gospel of John.', 'A word for word depiction of the life of Jesus Christ from the Good News Translation Bible as recorded in the Gospel of John.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKbmbnYfFhgTjGoDU9F4pIhVvKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30973'),
  ('762160747106309228', 'The Gospel of the Flesh', 2013, 'Drama', 'Eduardo Mendoza de Echave, Mario Bassino', 'Úrsula Vilca, Eduardo Mendoza de Echave', 'Giovanni Ciccia, Jimena Lindo, Lucho Cáceres, Sebastián Monteghirfo, Ismael Contreras, Aristóteles Picho, Gianfranco Brero, Ebelin Ortiz', null, 'Three lives in search of redemption intersect in the streets of Lima: undercover cop Gamarra’s desperate attempts to save his wife from a terminal illness gets him into trouble; bus driver Felix wants to be accepted into a religious sect after his involvement in a tragic traffic accident; and imperiled soccer club leader Narciso tries to secure his younger brother’s release from prison.', 'Three lives in search of redemption intersect in the streets of Lima: undercover cop Gamarra’s desperate attempts to save his wife from a terminal illness gets him into trouble; bus driver Felix wants to be accepted into a religious sect after his involvement in a tragic traffic accident; and imperiled soccer club leader Narciso tries to secure his younger brother’s release from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofqtScikFHRbgnW4aWesxm3aTSx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293121'),
  ('457150945762227450', 'The Governess', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sandra Goldbacher, Ashley Rowe, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Sandra Goldbacher', 'Minnie Driver, Tom Wilkinson, Harriet Walter, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Florence Hoath, Arlene Cockburn, Emma Bird, Adam Levy', null, 'When the father of privileged Rosina da Silva violently dies, she decides to pass herself off as a gentile and finds employment with a family in faraway Scotland. Soon she and the family father, Charles, start a passionate secret affair.', 'When the father of privileged Rosina da Silva violently dies, she decides to pass herself off as a gentile and finds employment with a family in faraway Scotland. Soon she and the family father, Charles, start a passionate secret affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi1nfYolXIJI6bV8YGq1Zv7XwTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96196'),
  ('361008300624698916', 'The Goya Murders', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Javier Petit, Coralia Rosales, David Omedes', 'Ángela Armero', 'Maribel Verdú, Aura Garrido, Roberto Álamo, Ginés García Millán, Daniel Grao, Ruth Gabriel, Antonio Velázquez, Tamar Novas', null, 'Madrid, Spain. A mysterious serial killer murders art collectors and uses their bodies to reproduce scenes from Los Caprichos, a famous series of drawings by Spanish painter Francisco de Goya.', 'Madrid, Spain. A mysterious serial killer murders art collectors and uses their bodies to reproduce scenes from Los Caprichos, a famous series of drawings by Spanish painter Francisco de Goya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9A37JvPZ5laqEfgn0b88xjcl73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573150'),
  ('227952894213122617', 'The Gracefield Incident', 2017, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action, Mystery', 'Mathieu Ratthe', 'Mathieu Ratthe', 'Alexandre Nachi, Mathieu Ratthe, Victor Andres Trelles Turgeon, Juliette Gosselin, Laurence Dauphinais, Kimberly Laferriere', 'PG-13', 'On August 16, 2013, the Supreme Court mandated the CIA to declassify files that had been kept secret for the past 75 years. Visual records of documented paranormal events were released to the public. The following incident took place in Gracefield, Quebec.', 'On August 16, 2013, the Supreme Court mandated the CIA to declassify files that had been kept secret for the past 75 years. Visual records of documented paranormal events were released to the public. The following incident took place in Gracefield, Quebec.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWZsV3dJfpWlEQG1Yn7GUSmrxdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327253'),
  ('310635992992353478', 'The Grad Job', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Aïm, Antoine Blossier, Valentin Rodriguez', 'Sabrina Amara, Antoine Blossier, Michaël Souhaité', 'Marc Lavoine, Valérie Karsenti, Thomas Solivérès, Samy Seghir, Laouni Mouhid, Louise Grinberg, Mathilde Warnier, Alison Wheeler', null, 'Teenagers, in their last year of High School, steel the subjects of the Baccalaureate from the education exam division in order to succeed at the exam.', 'Teenagers, in their last year of High School, steel the subjects of the Baccalaureate from the education exam division in order to succeed at the exam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie71603aYaTXunFS9kp4MqyO0uF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283739'),
  ('934073301161181112', 'The Graduate', 1967, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Robert Surtees, Mike Nichols, Don Kranze', 'Calder Willingham, Buck Henry', 'Dustin Hoffman, Anne Bancroft, Katharine Ross, Murray Hamilton, William Daniels, Elizabeth Wilson, Buck Henry, Brian Avery', 'PG', 'A disillusioned college graduate finds himself torn between his older lover and her daughter.', 'A disillusioned college graduate finds himself torn between his older lover and her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1Z1tZMR66RxcNeHbwoEhYeqOlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37247'),
  ('97850945868737819', 'The Graduates', 1995, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Alessandro Pesci, Marco Limberti', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Leonardo Pieraccioni', 'Massimo Ceccherini, Rocco Papaleo, Leonardo Pieraccioni, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Alessandro Haber, Tosca D''Aquino, Elisabetta Cavallotti', null, 'Four thirtysomething college students share a flat in Florence: Leonardo pursues beautiful Letizia, Rocco moonlights as a night watchman, Bruno needs to graduate to inherit his father-in-law''s business, and Pino dreams of becoming a stand-up comedian.', 'Four thirtysomething college students share a flat in Florence: Leonardo pursues beautiful Letizia, Rocco moonlights as a night watchman, Bruno needs to graduate to inherit his father-in-law''s business, and Pino dreams of becoming a stand-up comedian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6S17LRh2RY2SCFak7KE9aIHxMc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56374'),
  ('98474407303938983', 'The Graduates of the Last Row', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Christian Gion', 'Christian Gion', 'Patrick Bruel, Marie Laforêt, Philippe Manesse, Patrice Minet, Henri Guybet, Charles Gérard, Hélène Zidi, Walter Spanghero', null, 'The students of a prestigious law school try their best to mess things up.', 'The students of a prestigious law school try their best to mess things up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ab8AtAZk44WBt4N34RlkSPMBTWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61795'),
  ('73003199874376969', 'The Graffiti Artist', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Bolton', 'James Bolton', 'Ruben Bansie-Snellman, Pepper Fajans, Luke Cook, Pledgure Duoshun, Zachary S. Smalls, Robert D. Heath Jr., Rich Clemets, Rich Carlton', null, 'Adrift in the lush, nocturnal urban landscape of THE GRAFFITI ARTIST, Nick (Ruben Bansie-Snellman) is a post-modern urban hero asserting his anarchistic agenda on the endless maze of virgin exterior walls that comprise downtown Seattle and Portland. For this iconoclastic young visionary, the vast wall surfaces of deserted alleys and train yards are at once a daunting symbol of capitalist oppression and a texturally rich, seamless tableau ripe for exploitation to amplify his artistic dialectic of anger and rebellion.', 'Adrift in the lush, nocturnal urban landscape of THE GRAFFITI ARTIST, Nick (Ruben Bansie-Snellman) is a post-modern urban hero asserting his anarchistic agenda on the endless maze of virgin exterior walls that comprise downtown Seattle and Portland. For this iconoclastic young visionary, the vast wall surfaces of deserted alleys and train yards are at once a daunting symbol of capitalist oppression and a texturally rich, seamless tableau ripe for exploitation to amplify his artistic dialectic of anger and rebellion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKyp4lgIhI8pNGZj29Y8xH8vR1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33827'),
  ('313709309077645274', 'The Grain That Built a Hemisphere', 1943, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Bill Justice', null, null, 'NR', 'This animated documentary outlines the history and importance of corn in North America.', 'This animated documentary outlines the history and importance of corn in North America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iSin9J77Be3Vqp2sPBjN0XwrzW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64698'),
  ('126926871779332797', 'The Grand', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Zak Penn, Gary Marcus', 'Matt Bierman, Zak Penn', 'Woody Harrelson, Werner Herzog, Dennis Farina, David Cross, Cheryl Hines, Richard Kind, Chris Parnell, Jason Alexander', 'R', 'The Grand is in the tradition of improvisational comedies like Best In Show and This Is Spinal Tap. The story is set in the world of professional poker and follows six players who reach the final table of the world’s second most famous high stakes tournament, the Grand Championship of Poker.', 'The Grand is in the tradition of improvisational comedies like Best In Show and This Is Spinal Tap. The story is set in the world of professional poker and follows six players who reach the final table of the world’s second most famous high stakes tournament, the Grand Championship of Poker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3H4QTgFxt1lJps8U2tKfSTbsMl7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15378'),
  ('1087735259792297082', 'The Grand Ball', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Laurent Coltelloni, Prisca Bourgoin, Karine Aulnette', 'Laetitia Carton', null, null, 'It is the history of a ball. A grand ball. Each summer, more than two thousand people tributary of the whole of Europe in a corner of the French countryside. For 7 days and 8 nights, they dance, again and again, lose the concept of time, braving their toil and their body. It rotates, laughs, it spin round, it cries, it sings. And the life pulse.', 'It is the history of a ball. A grand ball. Each summer, more than two thousand people tributary of the whole of Europe in a corner of the French countryside. For 7 days and 8 nights, they dance, again and again, lose the concept of time, braving their toil and their body. It rotates, laughs, it spin round, it cries, it sings. And the life pulse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewuPBqJ4vIySQ2QX2LgpNFJQemW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525427'),
  ('971941448642782380', 'The Grand Budapest Hotel', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wes Anderson, Robert D. Yeoman, Josh Robertson', 'Wes Anderson', 'Ralph Fiennes, F. Murray Abraham, Mathieu Amalric, Adrien Brody, Willem Dafoe, Jeff Goldblum, Harvey Keitel, Jude Law', 'R', 'The Grand Budapest Hotel tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the wars and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protégé. The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance painting, the battle for an enormous family fortune and the slow and then sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th century.', 'The Grand Budapest Hotel tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the wars and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protégé. The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance painting, the battle for an enormous family fortune and the slow and then sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWdyYQreja6JGCzqHWXpWHDrrPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120467'),
  ('358137138048618453', 'The Grand Duel', 1972, 'Western', 'Giancarlo Santi, Fabio Garriba, Claude Othnin-Girard', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Lee Van Cleef, Alberto Dentice, Jess Hahn, Horst Frank, Klaus Grünberg, Antonio Casale, Marc Mazza, Dominique Darel', 'R', 'A grizzled ex-sheriff helps a man framed for murder to confront the powerful trio of brothers who want him dead.', 'A grizzled ex-sheriff helps a man framed for murder to confront the powerful trio of brothers who want him dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqakl71MiIHvtStOBEyBejHdrtp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61594'),
  ('1114265567233829357', 'The Grand Dukes', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte', 'Serge Frydman, Patrice Leconte', 'Philippe Noiret, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Jean Rochefort, Catherine Jacob, Michel Blanc, Clotilde Courau, Jacques Nolot, Jacques Mathou', null, 'Three aging and failed comedians, Georges Cox, Victor Vialat and Eddie Carpentier, hit the road again with a lousy production of a lousy play, of course under the worst possible conditions.', 'Three aging and failed comedians, Georges Cox, Victor Vialat and Eddie Carpentier, hit the road again with a lousy production of a lousy play, of course under the worst possible conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gT3MgXPTeXmhOU3tJTsYuPgGoA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47496'),
  ('1149345132900784054', 'The Grand Heist', 2012, 'Comedy, Action', 'Kim Joo-ho, Lee Seong-je', 'Kim Min-seong', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Oh Ji-ho, Min Hyo-rin, Sung Dong-il, Shin Jung-keun, Ko Chang-seok, Kim Hyang-gi, Song Jong-ho', null, 'Ice suddenly becomes a more valuable commodity during the Joseon Dynasty and a gang of eleven professionals are assigned to protect the market situation from irresponsible people.', 'Ice suddenly becomes a more valuable commodity during the Joseon Dynasty and a gang of eleven professionals are assigned to protect the market situation from irresponsible people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/of8NnfBmjka5PGfEmPXaAyt8F3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132711'),
  ('1112092710315429939', 'The Grand Highway', 1987, 'Drama', 'Jean-Loup Hubert, Claude Lecomte, Olivier Horlait', 'Jean-Loup Hubert', 'Anémone, Richard Bohringer, Antoine Hubert, Vanessa Guedj, Christine Pascal, Pascale Roberts, Marie Matheron, Daniel Rialet', 'R', 'Louis, a nine-year-old boy from Paris, spends his summer vacation in a small town in Brittany. His mother Claire has lodged him with her girlfriend Marcelle and her husband Pelo while she''s having her second baby. There Louis makes friends with Martine, the ten-year- old girl next door, and learns from her about life.', 'Louis, a nine-year-old boy from Paris, spends his summer vacation in a small town in Brittany. His mother Claire has lodged him with her girlfriend Marcelle and her husband Pelo while she''s having her second baby. There Louis makes friends with Martine, the ten-year- old girl next door, and learns from her about life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLHEn5Yw8SDkhbqnOU0gpOOGzY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60797'),
  ('530037393109932515', 'The Grand Manoeuvre', 1955, 'Comedy, Romance', 'René Clair, Robert Lefebvre', 'René Clair', 'Michèle Morgan, Gérard Philipe, Jean Desailly, Pierre Dux, Brigitte Bardot, Jacques François, Jacques Fabbri, Yves Robert', null, 'Armand, a boastful womaniser, makes a bet that he can seduce any girl he wants. He soon crosses paths with a beautiful Parisian divorcee, who is nothing like anyone he has ever met before.', 'Armand, a boastful womaniser, makes a bet that he can seduce any girl he wants. He soon crosses paths with a beautiful Parisian divorcee, who is nothing like anyone he has ever met before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNJ3417OQ0Mt8rQ00Hd0BdsMrhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66436'),
  ('1082133097604166771', 'The Grand Seduction', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Don McKellar, Douglas Koch, Gina Rae Anderson', 'Michael Dowse, Ken Scott', 'Brendan Gleeson, Taylor Kitsch, Gordon Pinsent, Liane Balaban, Mark Critch, Peter Keleghan, Mary Walsh, Margaret Killingbeck', 'PG-13', 'A small fishing village must procure a local doctor to secure a lucrative business contract. When unlikely candidate and big city doctor Paul Lewis lands in their lap for a trial residence, the townsfolk rally together to charm him into staying. As the doctor’s time in the village winds to a close, acting mayor Murray French has no choice but to pull out all the stops and begin The Grand Seduction.', 'A small fishing village must procure a local doctor to secure a lucrative business contract. When unlikely candidate and big city doctor Paul Lewis lands in their lap for a trial residence, the townsfolk rally together to charm him into staying. As the doctor’s time in the village winds to a close, acting mayor Murray French has no choice but to pull out all the stops and begin The Grand Seduction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEmeM9BKYWaCxzX0nF6thqLl9zp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209185'),
  ('789083279598876582', 'The Grandfather', 1998, 'Drama', 'José Luis Garci, Raúl Pérez Cubero, Salvador Gómez Cuenca', 'José Luis Garci, Horacio Valcárcel', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Rafael Alonso, Cayetana Guillén Cuervo, Agustín González, Cristina Cruz, Alicia Rozas, Fernando Guillén, Francisco Piquer', 'G', 'After his son dies, an elderly man comes back to Spain from the US and hopes to find out which of his granddaughters is true, and which one is bastard.', 'After his son dies, an elderly man comes back to Spain from the US and hopes to find out which of his granddaughters is true, and which one is bastard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63OYLpAPcHWMIHr96VDmqQUdJ5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69851'),
  ('608342397651436024', 'The Grandmaster', 2013, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Philippe Le Sourd, Ronald Zee', 'Xu Haofeng, Wong Kar-Wai, Zou Jingzhi', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Zhang Ziyi, Chang Chen, Zhao Benshan, Xiao Shenyang, Song Hye-kyo, Wang Qingxiang, Max Zhang', 'PG-13', 'Ip Man''s peaceful life in Foshan changes after Gong Yutian seeks an heir for his family in Southern China. Ip Man then meets Gong Er who challenges him for the sake of regaining her family''s honor. After the Second Sino-Japanese War, Ip Man moves to Hong Kong and struggles to provide for his family. In the mean time, Gong Er chooses the path of vengeance after her father was killed by Ma San.', 'Ip Man''s peaceful life in Foshan changes after Gong Yutian seeks an heir for his family in Southern China. Ip Man then meets Gong Er who challenges him for the sake of regaining her family''s honor. After the Second Sino-Japanese War, Ip Man moves to Hong Kong and struggles to provide for his family. In the mean time, Gong Er chooses the path of vengeance after her father was killed by Ma San.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydBVVIscL6TsX5hYztA5YpBCwJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44865'),
  ('1023348588543393692', 'The Grandmother', 1970, 'Animation, Horror', 'David Lynch', 'David Lynch', 'Dorothy McGinnis, Virginia Maitland, Robert Chadwick, Richard White', null, 'To escape neglect and abuse from his parents, a young boy plants some strange seeds and they grow into a grandmother.', 'To escape neglect and abuse from his parents, a young boy plants some strange seeds and they grow into a grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llhiY0rV6RWU1LOdy9Zljhf7cXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44510'),
  ('316365466526345845', 'The Grandmother', 2022, 'Drama, Horror', 'Pilar Robla, Arantza Vélez, Ana Hernando', 'Carlos Vermut', 'Almudena Amor, Vera Valdez, Karina Kolokolchykova, Marina Gutiérrez, Berta Sánchez, Alba Bonnin, Gabriela Calonfirescu, Ileana Wilson', 'R', 'Susana leaves her life in Paris, where she works as a model, and returns to Madrid to take care of her grandmother Pilar.', 'Susana leaves her life in Paris, where she works as a model, and returns to Madrid to take care of her grandmother Pilar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ri3KIjGp3Ek6iKUsTzMigmxTvdw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661791'),
  ('1087292648307745700', 'The Grandson', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kristóf Deák', 'Kristóf Deák, Nina Kov', 'Gergő Blahó, Tamás Jordán, Gábor Jászberényi, Judit Pogány, Laura Döbrösi, Judit Pecháček, Ildikó Hámori, János Papp', null, 'Rudi, a polite and quiet office hand, shares a special bond with his elderly grandpa. When Grandpa falls victim to a uniquely heartless phone scam that breaks his spirit and his health, Rudi decides he’s not going to let the petty criminals get away with it. But in order to get close to them, he needs to step far out of his comfort zone and turn into a different person. With a band of grey-haired allies on his side, he might just get to the scammers before it’s too late…', 'Rudi, a polite and quiet office hand, shares a special bond with his elderly grandpa. When Grandpa falls victim to a uniquely heartless phone scam that breaks his spirit and his health, Rudi decides he’s not going to let the petty criminals get away with it. But in order to get close to them, he needs to step far out of his comfort zone and turn into a different person. With a band of grey-haired allies on his side, he might just get to the scammers before it’s too late…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izwRjEfdxI9en3QmzDAjfSZVqlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788922'),
  ('929863225418184926', 'The Granny', 1995, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Luca Bercovici, Wally Pfister', 'Luca Bercovici', 'Stella Stevens, Shannon Whirry, Luca Bercovici, Brant von Hoffman, Sandy Helberg, Patricia Sturges, Heather Elizabeth Parkhurst, Ryan Bollman', 'R', 'Granny''s family wants her dead so they can collect her insurance. While she is on her death bed, she drinks an eternal life potion and returns to the land of the living. She is on a mission to wreak havoc over her greedy relatives.', 'Granny''s family wants her dead so they can collect her insurance. While she is on her death bed, she drinks an eternal life potion and returns to the land of the living. She is on a mission to wreak havoc over her greedy relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYA06TITutaSJrlK4ODrKd0TjkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83414'),
