  ('964363271115646734', 'The Grass Harp', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Charles Matthau, John A. Alonzo', 'Stirling Silliphant, Kirk Ellis', 'Piper Laurie, Sissy Spacek, Walter Matthau, Edward Furlong, Nell Carter, Jack Lemmon, Mary Steenburgen, Sean Patrick Flanery', 'PG', 'Based on the novel by Truman Capote, this often-witty coming-of-age drama looks at a young man growing up with an unusual family in the Deep South in the 1940s. Becoming an orphan in 1935, Collin moves to his dad''s cousins Verena and Dolly. Verena is a rich, bossy businesswoman. Dolly, Collin and the maid revolt, moving to a tree house.', 'Based on the novel by Truman Capote, this often-witty coming-of-age drama looks at a young man growing up with an unusual family in the Deep South in the 1940s. Becoming an orphan in 1935, Collin moves to his dad''s cousins Verena and Dolly. Verena is a rich, bossy businesswoman. Dolly, Collin and the maid revolt, moving to a tree house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcdi92LC26RW3zm97SwF3NXYTUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46732'),
  ('986373394734673334', 'The Grass Is Greener', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stanley Donen, Michael Stevenson, Christopher Challis', 'Hugh Williams, Margaret Vyner', 'Cary Grant, Deborah Kerr, Robert Mitchum, Jean Simmons, Moray Watson, Joan Benham, Gwen Watford, Elisabeth Orion', null, 'Victor and Hillary are down on their luck to the point that they allow tourists to take guided tours of their castle. But Charles Delacro, a millionaire oil tycoon, visits, and takes a liking to more than the house. Soon, Hattie Durant gets involved and they have a good old fashioned love triangle.', 'Victor and Hillary are down on their luck to the point that they allow tourists to take guided tours of their castle. But Charles Delacro, a millionaire oil tycoon, visits, and takes a liking to more than the house. Soon, Hattie Durant gets involved and they have a good old fashioned love triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3peOV81MRImLDX8bnGUHOJSB0lN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25767'),
  ('99931257817316432', 'The Grasshopper', 1970, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sam Leavitt, James A. Rosenberger, Jerry Paris', 'Jerry Belson, Garry Marshall', 'Jacqueline Bisset, Jim Brown, Joseph Cotten, Corbett Monica, Christopher Stone, Ramon Bieri, Ed Flanders, William Callaway', 'R', 'A British Columbia teenager dreams of show business but winds up as a call girl in Las Vegas.', 'A British Columbia teenager dreams of show business but winds up as a call girl in Las Vegas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvTEuUDnR7cWeSlh3oQzsYLtyNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47646'),
  ('194235499322067686', 'The Grasshopper and the Ants', 1934, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'Wilfred Jackson', 'William Cottrell, Pinto Colvig, Joe Grant', 'Pinto Colvig, Dorothy Compton', 'NR', 'As in the classic fable, the grasshopper plays his fiddle and lives for the moment, while the industrious ants squirrel away massive amounts of food for the winter. With his song, he''s able to convince at least one small ant until the queen arrives and scares him back to work. The queen warns the grasshopper of the trouble he''ll be in, come winter. Winter comes, and the grasshopper, near starvation, stumbles across the ants, who are having a full-on feast in their snug little tree. They take him in and warm him up. The queen tells him only those who work can eat so he must play for them. Written by Jon Reeves', 'As in the classic fable, the grasshopper plays his fiddle and lives for the moment, while the industrious ants squirrel away massive amounts of food for the winter. With his song, he''s able to convince at least one small ant until the queen arrives and scares him back to work. The queen warns the grasshopper of the trouble he''ll be in, come winter. Winter comes, and the grasshopper, near starvation, stumbles across the ants, who are having a full-on feast in their snug little tree. They take him in and warm him up. The queen tells him only those who work can eat so he must play for them. Written by Jon Reeves', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTRYC5loiIL5EuQgZv7NXEiH0Pd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81077'),
