  ('103047215177583257', 'The Gravedigger''s Wife', 2021, 'Drama', 'Arttu Peltomaa, Iiris Orasmaa, Mika Orasmaa', 'Khadar Ayderus Ahmed', 'Omar Abdi, Yasmin Warsame, Kadar Adboul-Aziz Ibrahim, Samaleh Ali Obsieh, Hamdi Ahmed Omar, Sermaan Abdoulkader Omar, Awa Ali Nour, Amina Ayanleh Omar', null, 'Guled and Nasra are a loving couple, living in the outskirts of Djibouti city with their teenage son, Mahad. However, they are facing difficult times: Nasra urgently needs an expensive surgery to treat a chronic kidney disease. Guled is already working hard as a gravedigger to make ends meet.', 'Guled and Nasra are a loving couple, living in the outskirts of Djibouti city with their teenage son, Mahad. However, they are facing difficult times: Nasra urgently needs an expensive surgery to treat a chronic kidney disease. Guled is already working hard as a gravedigger to make ends meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4COWFUlnTBb1w9RZQsBJHk2Axx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587668'),
