  ('190587020543834720', 'The Greasy Strangler', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Jim Hosking, Mårten Tedin', 'Jim Hosking, Toby Harvard', 'Michael St. Michaels, Sky Elobar, Elizabeth De Razzo, Gil Gex, Abdoulaye N''Gom, Holland MacFallister, Sam Dissanayake, Joe David Walters', null, 'Ronnie runs a Disco walking tour with his son, Brayden. When a sexy woman takes the tour, it begins a competition between father and son for her love. It also signals the arrival of an oily strangler who stalks the streets at night.', 'Ronnie runs a Disco walking tour with his son, Brayden. When a sexy woman takes the tour, it begins a competition between father and son for her love. It also signals the arrival of an oily strangler who stalks the streets at night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsIJ8iTA2DK12SNTKf0vLKh1BGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320413'),
  ('147186872400864503', 'The Great Adventure', 1953, 'Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Arne Sucksdorff, Arne Sucksdorff, Åke Bäcklund', 'Arne Sucksdorff', 'Anders Nohrborg, Kjell Sucksdorff, Holger Stockman, Arne Sucksdorff, Amanda Haglund, Annika Ekedahl, Aina Fritzell, Gunnar Sjöberg', null, 'Arne Sucksdorff’s celebrated nature film follows two brothers in rural Sweden as they witness a fox raid and secretly raise an orphaned otter. Told through an adult’s memories, it reflects on childhood, nature, and the fragile balance between wilderness and civilization. The film won the International Prize at the 1954 Cannes Film Festival.', 'Arne Sucksdorff’s celebrated nature film follows two brothers in rural Sweden as they witness a fox raid and secretly raise an orphaned otter. Told through an adult’s memories, it reflects on childhood, nature, and the fragile balance between wilderness and civilization. The film won the International Prize at the 1954 Cannes Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1dubNiJ6kvgMV0cJE1jA8PkWBx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119555'),
  ('482221409288691689', 'The Great Adventure of Zorro', 1976, 'Action, Adventure, Family', 'Raúl de Anda Jr.', 'X. Randa', 'Rodolfo de Anda, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Helena Rojo, Ricardo Carrión, Jorge Russek', null, 'The De La Vega''s are a wealthy and prestigious family known throughout the territory. When Diego, the youngest son of Don Alejandro de La Vega, returns from his 4 year stay in Spain, he finds him hometown oppressed by the corrupt military forces. The farmers are being run out of their homes and their land is being used as military camps and/or sold off to pay for military supplies and wages, along with taking the poor villagers and using them as slaves. So Diego/Zorro has multiple face offs with the local military and swears to restore order and freedom to the oppressed.', 'The De La Vega''s are a wealthy and prestigious family known throughout the territory. When Diego, the youngest son of Don Alejandro de La Vega, returns from his 4 year stay in Spain, he finds him hometown oppressed by the corrupt military forces. The farmers are being run out of their homes and their land is being used as military camps and/or sold off to pay for military supplies and wages, along with taking the poor villagers and using them as slaves. So Diego/Zorro has multiple face offs with the local military and swears to restore order and freedom to the oppressed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10CYXtFztrkx3FGttvwIbnRkmwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323444'),
  ('474348531747520495', 'The Great Alibi', 2008, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Marie Spencer', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Jérôme Beaujour', 'Miou-Miou, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Lambert Wilson, Pierre Arditi, Anne Consigny, Mathieu Demy, Maurice Bénichou, Céline Sallette', null, 'Like every weekend senator Henri Pagès and his wife entertain guests at their beautiful mansion in a peaceful village near Paris. But this time around, things go awry: Pierre Collier, a psychoanalyst and consummate womanizer, is brutally murdered. Claire, his wife, dazed and confused by his corpse, with a smoking gun still in her hand, seems to be the ideal culprit...', 'Like every weekend senator Henri Pagès and his wife entertain guests at their beautiful mansion in a peaceful village near Paris. But this time around, things go awry: Pierre Collier, a psychoanalyst and consummate womanizer, is brutally murdered. Claire, his wife, dazed and confused by his corpse, with a smoking gun still in her hand, seems to be the ideal culprit...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tM25U6lvg1FBquzlwKFd4bNwm9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10287'),
  ('95375405072375917', 'The Great Alligator', 1979, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Sergio Martino, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Cesare Frugoni, Sergio Martino', 'Barbara Bach, Claudio Cassinelli, Mel Ferrer, Romano Puppo, Fabrizia Castagnoli, Enzo Fisichella, Lory Del Santo, Anny Papa', null, 'Tourists on a tropical island anger an island god, who turns himself into a giant alligator and stalks them.', 'Tourists on a tropical island anger an island god, who turns himself into a giant alligator and stalks them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxxM6aY0KDsl6KB1RU6K791RYg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67219'),
  ('883456249824344890', 'The Great Ambition', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Andrea Segre, Benoît Dervaux, Vincenzo Rosa', 'Andrea Segre, Marco Pettenello', 'Elio Germano, Paolo Pierobon, Roberto Citran, Stefano Abbati, Francesco Acquaroli, Paolo Calabresi, Pierluigi Corallo, Nikola Danchev', null, 'Secretary of the most influential Communist Party in the Western world, Enrico Berlinguer challenged the international balance by seeking to bring the Communists to government in Italy and achieve socialism in a democratic country. From 1973, when he escaped an attack by the Bulgarian secret services, to the assassination of his main ally Aldo Moro in 1978, not forgetting his trips to Moscow and the covers of Time: the story of a man who wanted to change the world, but failed.', 'Secretary of the most influential Communist Party in the Western world, Enrico Berlinguer challenged the international balance by seeking to bring the Communists to government in Italy and achieve socialism in a democratic country. From 1973, when he escaped an attack by the Bulgarian secret services, to the assassination of his main ally Aldo Moro in 1978, not forgetting his trips to Moscow and the covers of Time: the story of a man who wanted to change the world, but failed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEWyws4H2MZq975KEgYoTQ1kENG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193421'),
  ('528815044871798354', 'The Great American Girl Robbery', 1979, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Jeff Werner, Paul Ryan, David Kahler', 'D.W. Gilbert, Jason Williams', 'Kristine DeBell, Jason Williams, Wyatt Johnson, Wally Ann Wharton, Janet Blythe, Deslyn Bernet, Leslie King, Joan Wolff', 'R', 'A busload containing three cheerleading teams from three different schools who are heading to compete against each other is hijacked by terrorists and the girls are kidnapped.', 'A busload containing three cheerleading teams from three different schools who are heading to compete against each other is hijacked by terrorists and the girls are kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOXejwfmHUzcJDmFalSbJb0VU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46578'),
  ('662954948845869952', 'The Great and Terrible Day of the Lord', 2021, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Clark Runciman, Jared Jay Mason', 'Jared Jay Mason', 'Jordan Ashley Grier, Swayde McCoy', 'NR', 'On Michael and Gabby''s first romantic get-away things takes a terrifying turn when God delivers unsettling news to Gabby after taking over Michael''s body. Is Michael a manipulative psychopath or could this really be a direct experience with her creator offering a path to eternal happiness?', 'On Michael and Gabby''s first romantic get-away things takes a terrifying turn when God delivers unsettling news to Gabby after taking over Michael''s body. Is Michael a manipulative psychopath or could this really be a direct experience with her creator offering a path to eternal happiness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EyEGGhkaDZLCjxRIRoeUm248G8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920429'),
  ('1115231828791043257', 'The Great Arch', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Stéphane Demoustier, David Chambille, Thomas Metairie', 'Stéphane Demoustier', 'Claes Bang, Xavier Dolan, Swann Arlaud, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Michel Fau, Jean des Forêts, Micha Lescot, Alessandro Bressanello', null, 'France, 1983. The biggest architectural competition in history is launched by the new socialist president, François Mitterrand. Coveted by all the biggest international architectural firms, the open-call competition is surprisingly won by an unknown: Johan Otto von Spreckelsen, an architecture teacher from Copenhagen. Until then, the fifty-year-old Dane had built only four buildings: his home, and three small chapels.', 'France, 1983. The biggest architectural competition in history is launched by the new socialist president, François Mitterrand. Coveted by all the biggest international architectural firms, the open-call competition is surprisingly won by an unknown: Johan Otto von Spreckelsen, an architecture teacher from Copenhagen. Until then, the fifty-year-old Dane had built only four buildings: his home, and three small chapels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zriwECvMyJNcUdXrELeYSrXF0f2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290424'),
  ('301028788321592219', 'The Great Arms Robbery', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Jin Hao, Ma Erkang', 'Zian Wang', 'Michael Tong Man-Lung, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Cai Die, Zhang Yameng, Alexandre Robillard', null, 'Agent Wen goes undercover to locate weapons for an arms dealer. He''s attacked after finding them, so he teams up with his partner to recover the munitions and prevent disaster.', 'Agent Wen goes undercover to locate weapons for an arms dealer. He''s attacked after finding them, so he teams up with his partner to recover the munitions and prevent disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ronrzgFs2FOk0R4BAZgyLaYdhua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957992'),
