  ('92584640882521231', 'The Great Buck Howard', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Sean McGinly, Tak Fujimoto', 'Sean McGinly', 'John Malkovich, Emily Blunt, Steve Zahn, Tom Hanks, Colin Hanks, Patrick Fischler, Ricky Jay, Griffin Dunne', 'PG', 'When a law school dropout answers an advertisement to be a personal assistant he unknowingly signs on to work for a belligerent has-been magician struggling to resurrect his career. This leads to a journey across the country staging the comeback of a lifetime.', 'When a law school dropout answers an advertisement to be a personal assistant he unknowingly signs on to work for a belligerent has-been magician struggling to resurrect his career. This leads to a journey across the country staging the comeback of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iglKvmA7sq6Pnd6KWFnT6WW9Vpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16279'),
  ('798210115396641192', 'The Great Buddha+', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Huang Hsin-Yao, Chung Mong-hong', 'Huang Hsin-Yao', 'Cres Chuang, Bamboo Chen, Leon Dai, Chen Yi-wen, Na-Do, Kuo-Lin Ting, Lee Yung-Feng, Chu Yueh-Hsin', null, 'Security guard Pickle and his trash collector friend Belly Button kill time together in night shifts watching the American-educated boss''s dash-cam recordings of his various sexual encounters with women. Against the buddies'' will, something horrifying rather than erotic reveals.', 'Security guard Pickle and his trash collector friend Belly Button kill time together in night shifts watching the American-educated boss''s dash-cam recordings of his various sexual encounters with women. Against the buddies'' will, something horrifying rather than erotic reveals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUVHENyEicvL25aaC03xnCk0XTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475149'),
  ('337218909847055670', 'The Great Buster: A Celebration', 2018, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Peter Bogdanovich, Dustin Pearlman', 'Peter Bogdanovich', 'Peter Bogdanovich, James Karen, Dick Van Dyke, Johnny Knoxville, Paul Dooley, French Stewart, Richard Lewis, Carl Reiner', 'NR', 'A celebration of the life and career of one of America''s most influential and celebrated filmmakers and comedians—Buster Keaton—whose singular style and fertile output during the silent era created his legacy as a true cinematic visionary.', 'A celebration of the life and career of one of America''s most influential and celebrated filmmakers and comedians—Buster Keaton—whose singular style and fertile output during the silent era created his legacy as a true cinematic visionary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4quZfHND8eOqdYXbCKeRG4wc5VI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539199'),
  ('910809326338665798', 'The Great Caruso', 1951, 'Drama, Music', 'Richard Thorpe, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'William Ludwig', 'Mario Lanza, Ann Blyth, Dorothy Kirsten, Jarmila Novotná, Richard Hageman, Carl Benton Reid, Eduard Franz, Ludwig Donath', 'NR', 'Enrico Caruso''s only passion is to sing. For that, he leaves his hometown of Naples, Italy, and travels to America to sing for the Metropolitan Opera. At first, his lack of education and poor background make him an outcast in the high-class opera world. Eventually, his voice wins him both fans and the hand of his love, Dorothy. But his nonstop pace and desire to perform at any cost eventually take their toll on the singer''s health.', 'Enrico Caruso''s only passion is to sing. For that, he leaves his hometown of Naples, Italy, and travels to America to sing for the Metropolitan Opera. At first, his lack of education and poor background make him an outcast in the high-class opera world. Eventually, his voice wins him both fans and the hand of his love, Dorothy. But his nonstop pace and desire to perform at any cost eventually take their toll on the singer''s health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNPl1UGjzXQCaQqdlB4CblFjsyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98328'),
  ('547089389029617020', 'The Great Challenge', 2004, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Julien Seri, Michel Taburiaux', 'Philippe Lyon, Julien Seri, Charles Perrière', 'Williams Belle, Châu Belle Dinh, Malik Diouf, Yann Hnautra, Guylain N''Guba-Boyeke, Charles Perrière, Laurent Piemontesi, Élodie Yung', 'PG-13', 'A multicultural band of acrobatic do-gooders take on gangsters of three great nations in this action-packed sequel to the French box-office smash Yamakasi. The Yamakasi are a team of crime fighters who can scale buildings and urban towers with the ease of a fly walking up the wall; after leaving their home base in Paris to set up operations in England, the men decide to set up a satellite facility', 'A multicultural band of acrobatic do-gooders take on gangsters of three great nations in this action-packed sequel to the French box-office smash Yamakasi. The Yamakasi are a team of crime fighters who can scale buildings and urban towers with the ease of a fly walking up the wall; after leaving their home base in Paris to set up operations in England, the men decide to set up a satellite facility', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fy4t7qzeNvEkew3cTBOopyX399.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25631'),
  ('31513873828885578', 'The Great Cognito', 1982, 'Animation', 'Will Vinton', 'Susan Shadburne, John Morrison', 'John Morrison, Tim Conner, Brian Bressler', null, 'The film tells of a music hall impressionist who caricatures personalities from the second world war. Animated by Barry Bruce at Will Vinton Productions. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2012.', 'The film tells of a music hall impressionist who caricatures personalities from the second world war. Animated by Barry Bruce at Will Vinton Productions. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Z3DtTIb4iQGIDM0G9Eu4TJVCVw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210963'),
  ('245140299862929823', 'The Great Consoler', 1933, 'Drama', 'Lev Kuleshov, Konstantin Kuznetsov, Alexandra Khokhlova', 'Aleksandr Kurs, Lev Kuleshov', 'Alexandra Khokhlova, Konstantin Khokhlov, Ivan Novoseltsev, O. Rayevskaya, Vasiliy Kovrigin, Andrey Fayt, Valentina Lopatina, Weyland Rodd Sr.', null, 'The Great Consoler is Lev Kuleshov’s most personal film reflecting both the facts of his life and his thoughts about the place of the artist in contemporary reality. It was the only film in the Soviet cinema of those years that raised the question of what role a creative person played in society.', 'The Great Consoler is Lev Kuleshov’s most personal film reflecting both the facts of his life and his thoughts about the place of the artist in contemporary reality. It was the only film in the Soviet cinema of those years that raised the question of what role a creative person played in society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMmbjDa57as7WVG9rciIhkUHE93.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148630'),
  ('850503127873828007', 'The Great Darkened Days', 2019, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Maxime Giroux, Sara Mishara', 'Maxime Giroux', 'Martin Dubreuil, Romain Duris, Sarah Gadon, Reda Kateb, Soko, Cody Fern, Buddy Duress, Luzer Twersky', null, 'While a world war rages, Philippe, a draft-dodger from Quebec, takes refuge in the American West, surviving by competing in Charlie Chaplin impersonation contests. As Philippe makes his long journey home, he encounters various characters under the sway of a destructive madness borne of the chaotic times. His voyage, both violent and fascinating, is a hallucinatory initiation to the darker side of the American dream.', 'While a world war rages, Philippe, a draft-dodger from Quebec, takes refuge in the American West, surviving by competing in Charlie Chaplin impersonation contests. As Philippe makes his long journey home, he encounters various characters under the sway of a destructive madness borne of the chaotic times. His voyage, both violent and fascinating, is a hallucinatory initiation to the darker side of the American dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tj3EJRAzOK3QVsDoOaNUdBn0GmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539825'),
  ('865548487407784783', 'The Great Day', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Pascal Plisson, Simon Watel', 'Olivier Dazat, Pascal Plisson', 'Nidhi Jha, Albert Ensasi Gonzalez Monteagudo, Deegii Batjargal, Tom Ssekabira', null, 'Around the world, young boys and girls take up a challenge: to live their dream and their passion by undertaking a challenge that will change their lives forever. Together, they will live a unique day, a day where anything is possible.', 'Around the world, young boys and girls take up a challenge: to live their dream and their passion by undertaking a challenge that will change their lives forever. Together, they will live a unique day, a day where anything is possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxWyVgaao4nPDE0dzVbVH8Ei7zf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351183'),
  ('611891682739767569', 'The Great Day', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Venier, Vittorio Omodei Zorini, Marcella Libonati', 'Michele Pellegrini, Giacomo Poretti, Giovanni Storti', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti, Antonella Attili, Elena Lietti, Lucia Mascino, Margherita Mannino, Giovanni Anzaldo', null, 'In a large villa on Lake Como, everything is ready to celebrate Elio and Caterina''s wedding. It will be the most beautiful day of their lives and also of their parents'' lives, especially their respective fathers, Giacomo and Giovanni. Too bad that together with Margherita, Giovanni''s ex-wife and mother of the bride, Aldo, her new partner, also arrives at the wedding. Friendly, outgoing and above all a total troublemaker. Giacomo and Giovanni try to contain him in every way, but under Aldo''s blows, cracks open up from which a hidden malaise emerges, destined to call into question the friendship between Giovanni and Giacomo, their marriages and more. And that will force everyone to deal with their own doubts and with the courage it takes to allow themselves happiness.', 'In a large villa on Lake Como, everything is ready to celebrate Elio and Caterina''s wedding. It will be the most beautiful day of their lives and also of their parents'' lives, especially their respective fathers, Giacomo and Giovanni. Too bad that together with Margherita, Giovanni''s ex-wife and mother of the bride, Aldo, her new partner, also arrives at the wedding. Friendly, outgoing and above all a total troublemaker. Giacomo and Giovanni try to contain him in every way, but under Aldo''s blows, cracks open up from which a hidden malaise emerges, destined to call into question the friendship between Giovanni and Giacomo, their marriages and more. And that will force everyone to deal with their own doubts and with the courage it takes to allow themselves happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DyTIexH2TMfmy3jArpifBANRh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919952'),
  ('653269816938619047', 'The Great Day on the Beach', 1991, 'Comedy, Family', 'Stellan Olsson, Søren Skjær', 'Stellan Olsson, Søren Skjær', 'Erik Clausen, Nina Gunke, Benjamin Rothenborg Vibe, Jesper Klein, Hans Alfredson, Bjarne Liller, Kirsten Rolffes, Yvonne Schaloske', null, 'It is the adult Gustav Adolf, who tells the story of the momentous day when he as a little boy with his father and mother and the whole staircase, went to the beach to enjoy the pleasures of bathing. We are in 1930s working-class neighborhood in Copenhagen. In a backyard apartment, we meet the little working-up of small Gustav Adolf (Benjamin Rothenborg Vibe) who has great respect for his father, Axel (Erik Clausen). Father has a very lively gab and is always ready to tell a story from her exciting life - often from the time he was on the big Argentine pampas.', 'It is the adult Gustav Adolf, who tells the story of the momentous day when he as a little boy with his father and mother and the whole staircase, went to the beach to enjoy the pleasures of bathing. We are in 1930s working-class neighborhood in Copenhagen. In a backyard apartment, we meet the little working-up of small Gustav Adolf (Benjamin Rothenborg Vibe) who has great respect for his father, Axel (Erik Clausen). Father has a very lively gab and is always ready to tell a story from her exciting life - often from the time he was on the big Argentine pampas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8g5IX6TRToNNDZQK38l7UXpSDvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60484'),
  ('675209786867960132', 'The Great Debaters', 2007, 'Drama', 'Denzel Washington, Jono Oliver, Greg Hale', 'Robert Eisele', 'Denzel Whitaker, Denzel Washington, Nate Parker, Jurnee Smollett, Forest Whitaker, Kimberly Elise, Jermaine Williams, Gina Ravera', 'PG-13', 'The true story of a brilliant but politically radical debate team coach who uses the power of words to transform a group of underdog African-American college students into a historical powerhouse that took on the Harvard elite.', 'The true story of a brilliant but politically radical debate team coach who uses the power of words to transform a group of underdog African-American college students into a historical powerhouse that took on the Harvard elite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pikfybjZNMh5MYsrmgWtyxkstmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14047'),
  ('15172743907554566', 'The Great Dictator', 1940, 'Comedy, War', 'Roland Totheroh, Charlie Chaplin, Karl Struss', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Paulette Goddard, Jack Oakie, Reginald Gardiner, Henry Daniell, Billy Gilbert, Grace Hayle, Carter DeHaven', 'NR', 'Dictator Adenoid Hynkel tries to expand his empire while a poor Jewish barber tries to avoid persecution from Hynkel''s regime.', 'Dictator Adenoid Hynkel tries to expand his empire while a poor Jewish barber tries to avoid persecution from Hynkel''s regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QpO9wo7JWecZ4NiBuu625FiY1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:914'),
  ('76179988804366425', 'The Great Ecstasy of Robert Carmichael', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Thomas Clay, Giorgos Arvanitis, Robert Cannan', 'Thomas Clay, Joseph Lang', 'Lesley Manville, Danny Dyer, Daniel Spencer, Miranda Wilson, Phil Deguara, Rob Dixon, Michael Howe, Stuart Laing', null, 'In a small English coastal town, three teenage boys are drawn into a world of temptation and violence. Bored, troubled and excluded, the boys are unable to accept or even recognise moral boundaries. Their actions move inexorably towards a truly shocking act, that will horrify their sleepy community and expose its deepest, hidden fears.', 'In a small English coastal town, three teenage boys are drawn into a world of temptation and violence. Bored, troubled and excluded, the boys are unable to accept or even recognise moral boundaries. Their actions move inexorably towards a truly shocking act, that will horrify their sleepy community and expose its deepest, hidden fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEjuqo83fh4Qd5YSIJhc9R2pUag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44986'),
  ('421337797135180996', 'The Great Ecstasy of Woodcarver Steiner', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Jörg Schmidt-Reitwein', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Walter Steiner', null, 'A study of the psychology of a champion ski-flyer, whose full-time occupation is carpentry.', 'A study of the psychology of a champion ski-flyer, whose full-time occupation is carpentry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3RaqQQMBc83saZxMNwrMq4OsJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46595'),
  ('210169036559944003', 'The Great Escape', 1963, 'Adventure, Drama, War', 'John Sturges, Daniel L. Fapp, Jack N. Reddish', 'James Clavell, W.R. Burnett', 'Steve McQueen, James Garner, Richard Attenborough, James Donald, Charles Bronson, Donald Pleasence, James Coburn, Hannes Messemer', 'NR', 'The Nazis, exasperated at the number of escapes from their prison camps by a relatively small number of Allied prisoners, relocate them to a high-security ''escape-proof'' camp to sit out the remainder of the war. Undaunted, the prisoners plan one of the most ambitious escape attempts of World War II. Based on a true story.', 'The Nazis, exasperated at the number of escapes from their prison camps by a relatively small number of Allied prisoners, relocate them to a high-security ''escape-proof'' camp to sit out the remainder of the war. Undaunted, the prisoners plan one of the most ambitious escape attempts of World War II. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBH4H8UMFxl139HaLz6lRuvsel8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5925'),
  ('247355534540512946', 'The Great Escape II: The Untold Story', 1988, 'TV Movie, War, Drama', 'Jud Taylor, Paul Wendkos, Nenad Pečur', 'Walter Halsey Davis', 'Christopher Reeve, Judd Hirsch, Tony Denison, Charles Haid, Michael Nader, Ian McShane, Derek de Lint, Donald Pleasence', null, 'Allied prisoners tunnel out of a stalag, then return to avenge fellow escapees executed by the Nazis.', 'Allied prisoners tunnel out of a stalag, then return to avenge fellow escapees executed by the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz2Utoai6tXqP1B2RriiBqHf3gZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219646'),
  ('459783012628657630', 'The Great Escaper', 2023, 'History, Drama, War', 'Oliver Parker, Lauren Evans, Christopher Ross', 'William Ivory', 'Michael Caine, Glenda Jackson, John Standing, Will Fletcher, Laura Marcus, Victor Oshin, Danielle Vitalis, Joe Bone', null, 'In the summer of 2014, a World War II veteran sneaks out of his care home to attend the 70th anniversary commemoration of the D-Day landings in Normandy.', 'In the summer of 2014, a World War II veteran sneaks out of his care home to attend the 70th anniversary commemoration of the D-Day landings in Normandy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50rOFWgFUsCw3zfwSKXcdglh3Ji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:944194'),
  ('237527002687478860', 'The Great Fava Beans of China', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Sameh Selim, Shady El-Fakharany, Sherif Arafa', 'Ahmed Abdallah', 'Mohamed Henedi, Kamala Kumpu Na Ayuthaya, Kowit Wattanakul, Mohamed Shoman, Sami Sarhan, Soliman Eid, Hagag Abdel Azim, Said Tarabeek', null, 'Mohy Al-Sharqawi is a young man whose grandfather and his uncles form a smuggling gang. As Mohy is a coward who cannot go along with them, he goes to live with his mother and step-father but they send him to China to represent Egypt in a cooking competition which gets him into a lot of troubles', 'Mohy Al-Sharqawi is a young man whose grandfather and his uncles form a smuggling gang. As Mohy is a coward who cannot go along with them, he goes to live with his mother and step-father but they send him to China to represent Egypt in a cooking competition which gets him into a lot of troubles', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xk3cOm7iRFi3kFom3zdh1c7qpKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455657'),
  ('164021224922344866', 'The Great Flamarion', 1945, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Anthony Mann, James S. Brown Jr., Raoul Pagel', 'Heinz Herald, Richard Weil', 'Erich von Stroheim, Mary Beth Hughes, Dan Duryea, Steve Barclay, Lester Allen, Esther Howard, Michael Mark, William A. Boardway', 'NR', 'A beautiful but unscrupulous female performer manipulates all the men in her life in order to achieve her aims.', 'A beautiful but unscrupulous female performer manipulates all the men in her life in order to achieve her aims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6u1XCswVV3ESYzgX9896y3gMzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35543'),
  ('156801668801872063', 'The Great Flood', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama', 'Kim Byung-woo, Kim Tae-soo, Shin Kyung-man', 'Kim Byung-woo, Han Ji-su', 'Kim Da-mi, Park Hae-soo, Kwon Eun-seong, Jeon Hye-jin, Park Byung-eun, Lee Hak-ju, Yuna, Park Mi-hyeon', 'R', 'When a raging flood traps a researcher and her young son, a call to a crucial mission puts their escape — and the future of humanity — on the line.', 'When a raging flood traps a researcher and her young son, a call to a crucial mission puts their escape — and the future of humanity — on the line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tUOZQDgZaGqZtrB21MieiXARL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982843'),
  ('380178296988351417', 'The Great Gabbo', 1929, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'James Cruze, Bruce Weyman, Ira H. Morgan', null, 'Erich von Stroheim, Betty Compson, Donald Douglas, Marjorie Kane, Earl Burtnett, George Grandee, Bo Peep Karlin, Rosina Lawrence', 'NR', 'For the ventriloquist Gabbo his wooden dummy Otto is the only means of expression. When he starts relying more and more on Otto, he starts going mad.', 'For the ventriloquist Gabbo his wooden dummy Otto is the only means of expression. When he starts relying more and more on Otto, he starts going mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnEXHaii4Kw7RmY0irO0FhcF4ua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117531'),
  ('980013759068983194', 'The Great Gambler', 1979, 'Action, Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Shakti Samanta', 'Shakti Samanta', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Zeenat Aman, Neetu Singh, Prem Chopra, Utpal Dutt, Madan Puri, Om Shivpuri, Helen', null, 'A gambler works for a villain not knowing that he''s being used to entrap a patriot and gain military secrets. The cops assign a lookalike to nab him, but not having gambling skills could give him away.', 'A gambler works for a villain not knowing that he''s being used to entrap a patriot and gain military secrets. The cops assign a lookalike to nab him, but not having gambling skills could give him away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5M2X0ivSSR8iIRsnCskg1VC4S6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65106'),
  ('935972464043047412', 'The Great Game', 1934, 'Drama', 'Jacques Feyder, Maurice Forster, Marcel Carné', 'Jacques Feyder, Charles Spaak', 'Marie Bell, Pierre Richard-Willm, Charles Vanel, Georges Pitoeff, Camille Bert, André Dubosc, Pierre Larquey, Lyne Clevers', null, 'Pierre , a young lawyer, has enormous debts due to his mistress Florence and her whims of luxury life. Pierre has gone too far and put the family firm in jeopardy. They ask him to expatriate. To avoid scandal, Pierre joins the Foreign Legion. In Morocco, near the desert, Pierre goes with his comrades of the Legion to a bar-restaurant-brothel, owned by a shady character, Mr. Clement . Clement lives more or less with Ms.Blanche who is a fortune teller with cards, as a hobby. But Clement is also after his girls now and then. Pierre is still obsessed with Florence but he meets Irma , one of Clement''s girls, who is the double of Florence except for hair color. Irma has had an accident and has lost part of her memory at a certain point of her recent past, and Pierre slowly persuades himself she is Florence, but cannot remember it. Advised by Ms.Blanche, Irma finally accepts to act as if she was Florence because she is falling in love with Pierre.', 'Pierre , a young lawyer, has enormous debts due to his mistress Florence and her whims of luxury life. Pierre has gone too far and put the family firm in jeopardy. They ask him to expatriate. To avoid scandal, Pierre joins the Foreign Legion. In Morocco, near the desert, Pierre goes with his comrades of the Legion to a bar-restaurant-brothel, owned by a shady character, Mr. Clement . Clement lives more or less with Ms.Blanche who is a fortune teller with cards, as a hobby. But Clement is also after his girls now and then. Pierre is still obsessed with Florence but he meets Irma , one of Clement''s girls, who is the double of Florence except for hair color. Irma has had an accident and has lost part of her memory at a certain point of her recent past, and Pierre slowly persuades himself she is Florence, but cannot remember it. Advised by Ms.Blanche, Irma finally accepts to act as if she was Florence because she is falling in love with Pierre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bolOcVaDijynNMAEnThXvZZ9fD2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166883'),
  ('98355318851440281', 'The Great Game', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Nicolas Pariser, Sébastien Buchmann', 'Nicolas Pariser', 'Melvil Poupaud, André Dussollier, Clémence Poésy, Sophie Cattani, Nicolas Wanczycki, Gavino Dessi, Antoine Chappey, Audrey Bastien', null, 'Pierre Blum, 40, is a writer who had his time of glory in the early 2000s. One evening, on a casino terrace, he meets Joseph Paskin. This mysterious man, charismatic and manipulative, is influential in the world of politics and persuades Pierre to take on a strange mission that takes him back to a past he’d prefer to forget, and puts his life in danger. In the middle of all this, Pierre falls in love with Laura, a young extreme-left activist. But in this world of subterfuge, who can really be trusted?', 'Pierre Blum, 40, is a writer who had his time of glory in the early 2000s. One evening, on a casino terrace, he meets Joseph Paskin. This mysterious man, charismatic and manipulative, is influential in the world of politics and persuades Pierre to take on a strange mission that takes him back to a past he’d prefer to forget, and puts his life in danger. In the middle of all this, Pierre falls in love with Laura, a young extreme-left activist. But in this world of subterfuge, who can really be trusted?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ubPA1nzNM8xpZ9ekRFwj3tEYxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367546'),
  ('980586126028605243', 'The Great Garrick', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Leo F. Forbstein, James Whale, Ernest Haller', 'Ernest Vajda', 'Brian Aherne, Olivia de Havilland, Edward Everett Horton, Melville Cooper, Lionel Atwill, Luis Alberni, Lana Turner, Marie Wilson', 'NR', 'A British actor insults a French acting group only to fall victim to a prank that might destroy his career.', 'A British actor insults a French acting group only to fall victim to a prank that might destroy his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CFkAVzUOANMhfLjDOW8LjhrJyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134480'),
  ('1012225139697471536', 'The Great Gatsby', 1949, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Elliott Nugent, Herbert Coleman, John F. Seitz', 'Cyril Hume, Richard Maibaum', 'Alan Ladd, Betty Field, Macdonald Carey, Ruth Hussey, Barry Sullivan, Howard Da Silva, Shelley Winters, Henry Hull', null, 'Nick Carraway, a young Midwesterner now living on Long Island, finds himself fascinated by the mysterious past and lavish lifetyle of his landlord, the nouveau riche Jay Gatsby. He is drawn into Gatsby''s circle, becoming a witness to obsession and tragedy.', 'Nick Carraway, a young Midwesterner now living on Long Island, finds himself fascinated by the mysterious past and lavish lifetyle of his landlord, the nouveau riche Jay Gatsby. He is drawn into Gatsby''s circle, becoming a witness to obsession and tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpNkW8Hl7oVSWKhYsuIFaod4VUp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80890'),
  ('125683979531511389', 'The Great Gatsby', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jack Clayton, Douglas Slocombe, Alex Hapsas', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Robert Redford, Mia Farrow, Bruce Dern, Karen Black, Scott Wilson, Sam Waterston, Lois Chiles, Howard Da Silva', 'PG', 'Nick Carraway, a young Midwesterner now living on Long Island, finds himself fascinated by the mysterious past and lavish lifestyle of his neighbor, the nouveau riche Jay Gatsby. He is drawn into Gatsby''s circle, becoming a witness to obsession and tragedy.', 'Nick Carraway, a young Midwesterner now living on Long Island, finds himself fascinated by the mysterious past and lavish lifestyle of his neighbor, the nouveau riche Jay Gatsby. He is drawn into Gatsby''s circle, becoming a witness to obsession and tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCjwyhfDTFgunVVzBoEFzafpjbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11034'),
  ('456439367637572684', 'The Great Gatsby', 2000, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Robert Markowitz, Guy Dufaux', 'John J. McLaughlin', 'Toby Stephens, Mira Sorvino, Paul Rudd, Martin Donovan, Francie Swift, Heather Goldenhersh, Matt Malloy, Bill Camp', null, 'Stock broker Nick Carraway consents to play Cupid for his rich married cousin Daisy Buchanan and her former love, nouveau riche Jay Gatsby.', 'Stock broker Nick Carraway consents to play Cupid for his rich married cousin Daisy Buchanan and her former love, nouveau riche Jay Gatsby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUDjfu74ef8KFveJJ7OJnEaQe1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34027'),
  ('498804192851160289', 'The Great Gatsby', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Baz Luhrmann, Simon Duggan, Eddie Thorne', 'Baz Luhrmann, Craig Pearce', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Tobey Maguire, Carey Mulligan, Joel Edgerton, Elizabeth Debicki, Isla Fisher, Jason Clarke, Amitabh Bachchan', 'PG-13', 'An adaptation of F. Scott Fitzgerald''s Long Island-set novel, where Midwesterner Nick Carraway is lured into the lavish world of his neighbor, Jay Gatsby. Soon enough, however, Carraway will see through the cracks of Gatsby''s nouveau riche existence, where obsession, madness, and tragedy await.', 'An adaptation of F. Scott Fitzgerald''s Long Island-set novel, where Midwesterner Nick Carraway is lured into the lavish world of his neighbor, Jay Gatsby. Soon enough, however, Carraway will see through the cracks of Gatsby''s nouveau riche existence, where obsession, madness, and tragedy await.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyxfCBQv6Ap74jcu3xd7aBiaa29.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64682'),
  ('372823666016325431', 'The Great Gilly Hopkins', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Stephen Herek, David M. Dunlap, Scott Lazar', 'David Paterson', 'Sophie Nélisse, Kathy Bates, Glenn Close, Bill Cobbs, Octavia Spencer, Julia Stiles, Clare Foley, Billy Magnussen', 'PG', 'Young and feisty Gilly Hopkins devises a scheme to escape from her new foster home and reunite with her birth mother.', 'Young and feisty Gilly Hopkins devises a scheme to escape from her new foster home and reunite with her birth mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQn2OgADfttTzk8pghMdjHPaKH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331588'),
  ('597632615421725929', 'The Great Global Warming Swindle', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Martin Durkin, Craig Hastings', 'Martin Durkin', 'Tim Ball, Nir Shaviv, Ian Clark', null, 'This film tries to blow the whistle on what it calls the biggest swindle in modern history: ''Man Made Global Warming''. Watch this film and make up your own mind.', 'This film tries to blow the whistle on what it calls the biggest swindle in modern history: ''Man Made Global Warming''. Watch this film and make up your own mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxL8AOvegjwMpQfQsftk2qwPBRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3048'),
  ('1090804358463366531', 'The Great Hack', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Karim Amer, Jehane Noujaim, Basil Childers', 'Karim Amer, Erin Barnett, Pedro Kos', 'Brittany Kaiser, David Carroll, Paul-Olivier Dehaye, Ravi Naik, Julian Wheatland, Carole Cadwalladr, Christopher Wiley, Paul Hilder', null, 'Data—arguably the world’s most valuable asset—is being weaponized to wage cultural and political wars. The dark world of data exploitation is uncovered through the unpredictable, personal journeys of players on different sides of the explosive Cambridge Analytica/Facebook data story.', 'Data—arguably the world’s most valuable asset—is being weaponized to wage cultural and political wars. The dark world of data exploitation is uncovered through the unpredictable, personal journeys of players on different sides of the explosive Cambridge Analytica/Facebook data story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIrGgUzasEUA7v8uChRhUUFzLwE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566222'),
  ('16690900813954414', 'The Great Happiness Space: Tale of an Osaka Love Thief', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Jake Clennell, Jake Clennell', null, null, null, 'Welcome to The Great Happiness Space: Rakkyo Café. The club''s owner, Issei (22), has a staff of twenty boys all under his training to become the top escorts of Osaka''s underground love scene. During their training, they learn how to dress, how to talk, how to walk, and most importantly, how to fake relationships with the girls who become their source of income. Join us as Osaka''s number one host boy takes us on a journey through the complex and heartrenching world of love for sale in the Japanese underground.', 'Welcome to The Great Happiness Space: Rakkyo Café. The club''s owner, Issei (22), has a staff of twenty boys all under his training to become the top escorts of Osaka''s underground love scene. During their training, they learn how to dress, how to talk, how to walk, and most importantly, how to fake relationships with the girls who become their source of income. Join us as Osaka''s number one host boy takes us on a journey through the complex and heartrenching world of love for sale in the Japanese underground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoRCRrUGsAhmooGpYFrjiWQvgma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24999'),
  ('102353931828095638', 'The Great Houdinis', 1976, 'Drama, TV Movie, History', 'Melville Shavelson, Archie R. Dalzell', 'Peter Benchley, Melville Shavelson', 'Paul Michael Glaser, Sally Struthers, Ruth Gordon, Vivian Vance, Adrienne Barbeau, Bill Bixby, Jack Carter, Peter Cushing', 'NR', 'A biography of the renowned escape artist Harry Houdini, examining his fascination with the occult and his promise to his wife on her deathbed that he would speak from the beyond.', 'A biography of the renowned escape artist Harry Houdini, examining his fascination with the occult and his promise to his wife on her deathbed that he would speak from the beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7upv1jzKyDnG7uzmO43Gg6DuDgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232321'),
  ('130679203524882566', 'The Great Hypnotist', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Leste Chen, Charlie Lam Chi-Kin', 'Leste Chen, Ren Peng', 'Xu Zheng, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Lü Zhong, David Wang, Hu Jing, Cady Yang, Yin Hang', null, 'The famous psychologist Xu Ruining has a raising career, when he met the troublesome patient Ren Xiaoyan. The meeting is not easy as feeble-looking Ren is point by point against him.', 'The famous psychologist Xu Ruining has a raising career, when he met the troublesome patient Ren Xiaoyan. The meeting is not easy as feeble-looking Ren is point by point against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqfKwoVMe3WCtTWWv2rIW6Oe05X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273197'),
  ('1095675394909773478', 'The Great Impostor', 1960, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Mulligan, Joseph E. Kenney, Robert Burks', 'Liam O''Brien', 'Tony Curtis, Karl Malden, Edmond O''Brien, Arthur O''Connell, Gary Merrill, Joan Blackman, Raymond Massey, Robert Middleton', 'NR', 'Fictionalized account of Ferdinand Waldo Demara Jr., who stole or created fictional identities and worked in a variety of occupations, most quite successfully.', 'Fictionalized account of Ferdinand Waldo Demara Jr., who stole or created fictional identities and worked in a variety of occupations, most quite successfully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geTOtU4S4nM5By8aA49nLpppwya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63887'),
  ('610477038213074284', 'The Great Indian Family', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shanoo Sharma, Vijay Krishna Acharya, Ayananka Bose', 'Vijay Krishna Acharya', 'Vicky Kaushal, Manushi Chhillar, Kumud Mishra, Manoj Pahwa, Bhuvan Arora, Alka Amin, Sadiya Siddiqui, Srishti Dixit', null, 'The film is set in the fictional town of Balrampur where Vedvyas Tripathi better known as Bhajan Kumar lives with his family headed by his father Pandit Siyaram Tripathi. Bhajan Kumar’s life with his family was going well till a question on his identity arises that throws the city in a flurry of rumour and apprehension. Will he survive or fall prey to this onslaught?', 'The film is set in the fictional town of Balrampur where Vedvyas Tripathi better known as Bhajan Kumar lives with his family headed by his father Pandit Siyaram Tripathi. Bhajan Kumar’s life with his family was going well till a question on his identity arises that throws the city in a flurry of rumour and apprehension. Will he survive or fall prey to this onslaught?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Gxe853oX3URrNj8PKGfvoBF3tx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:984092'),
  ('768475498309806731', 'The Great Indian Kitchen', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jeo Baby, Salu K Thomas', 'Jeo Baby', 'Nimisha Sajayan, Suraj Venjaramoodu, Ajitha V M, T. Suresh Babu, Ramadevi Kannanchery, Sidhartha Siva, Anupama V. P., Nishitha Kallingal', null, 'After marriage, a woman struggles to be the submissive wife that her husband and his family expect her to be.', 'After marriage, a woman struggles to be the submissive wife that her husband and his family expect her to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6SDfxoU3l8hpe9tzzf8MyjOPHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786064'),
  ('143868421634356711', 'The Great Java', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Clair, Claude Zidi', 'Michel Ardan, Philippe Clair, Claude Zidi', 'Francis Blanche, Gérard Rinaldi, Jean Sarrus, Luis Rego, Gérard Filipelli, Jean-Guy Fechner, Corinne Le Poulain, Fransined', null, 'Five friends come to the city Brizul. Here they want to find Mr Auguste Kougloff who owns them money, namely 20 million.', 'Five friends come to the city Brizul. Here they want to find Mr Auguste Kougloff who owns them money, namely 20 million.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v24GPPhnlH9gW5YOhoJqv9u1TX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72280'),
  ('784507554845160208', 'The Great Journey', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ismaël Ferroukhi, Katell Djian', 'Ismaël Ferroukhi', 'Nicolas Cazalé, Mohamed Majd, Jacky Nercessian, Ghina Ognianova, Kamel Belghazi, Atik Mohamed, Malika Mesrar El Hadaoui, François Baroni', null, 'Reda, summoned to accompany his father on a pilgrimage to Mecca, complies reluctantly - as he preparing for his baccalaureat and, even more important, has a secret love relationship. The trip across Europe in a broken-down car is also the departure of his father: upon arrival in Mecca, both Reda and his father are not the characters they were at the start of the movie. Avoiding the hackneyed theme of the return to the homeland, the film uses the departure to renew a connection between two generation.', 'Reda, summoned to accompany his father on a pilgrimage to Mecca, complies reluctantly - as he preparing for his baccalaureat and, even more important, has a secret love relationship. The trip across Europe in a broken-down car is also the departure of his father: upon arrival in Mecca, both Reda and his father are not the characters they were at the start of the movie. Avoiding the hackneyed theme of the return to the homeland, the film uses the departure to renew a connection between two generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypKFwK1Sn8eeXoEu5vXTThue1eb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44003'),
  ('318059067096965997', 'The Great K&A Train Robbery', 1926, 'Western, Action', 'Lewis Seiler, Daniel B. Clark', 'John Stone', 'Tom Mix, Tony the Horse, Dorothy Dwan, Will Walling, Harry Gripp, Carl Miller, Edward Peil Sr., Curtis ''Snowball'' McHenry', 'NR', 'Cullen has hired Tom to try and stop the robberies on his railroad. Knowing Cullen''s secretary Holt is tipping off the gang, Tom works undercover by posing as a highwayman. To help him bring in the gang he enlists the help of the hobo DeLuxe Harry.', 'Cullen has hired Tom to try and stop the robberies on his railroad. Knowing Cullen''s secretary Holt is tipping off the gang, Tom works undercover by posing as a highwayman. To help him bring in the gang he enlists the help of the hobo DeLuxe Harry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1G3NRuUSx4wDWmgTRctAdxUPXUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120828'),
  ('50554378067254149', 'The Great Killing', 1964, 'Action, Drama', 'Eiichi Kudō, Osamu Furuya, Tatsuo Honda', 'Kaneo Ikegami', 'Tōru Abe, Mikijiro Hira, Yoshio Inaba, Chiezo Kataoka, Chōichirō Kawarasaki, Nami Munakata, Kōtarō Satomi, Minoru Ōki', null, 'A cynical samurai is left as the sole survivor to fulfill a plot to assassinate the puppet of a villain intent on usurping the shogunate in the 17th century. A Shogunate Elder connives to rule Japan by making his puppet, the Shogun''s brother Tsunashige, the next Shogun. The best strategist in Japan, Yamaga, leads a plot to stop the Elder, but his cabal is betrayed and most of the conspirators are captured and tortured.', 'A cynical samurai is left as the sole survivor to fulfill a plot to assassinate the puppet of a villain intent on usurping the shogunate in the 17th century. A Shogunate Elder connives to rule Japan by making his puppet, the Shogun''s brother Tsunashige, the next Shogun. The best strategist in Japan, Yamaga, leads a plot to stop the Elder, but his cabal is betrayed and most of the conspirators are captured and tortured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2cSaThp6N5aBgQLf6T3wPQ3Y4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58881'),
  ('601083689098268143', 'The Great Lie', 1941, 'Drama', 'Edmund Goulding, Leo F. Forbstein, Jack Sullivan', 'Lenore J. Coffee', 'Bette Davis, Mary Astor, George Brent, Lucile Watson, Hattie McDaniel, Grant Mitchell, Jerome Cowan, Charles Trowbridge', 'NR', 'After a newlywed''s husband apparently dies in a plane crash, she discovers that her rival for his affections is pregnant with his child.', 'After a newlywed''s husband apparently dies in a plane crash, she discovers that her rival for his affections is pregnant with his child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sibxFGB8qmriHBi2z38d3qfEsgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43705'),
  ('912882430039137189', 'The Great Lillian Hall', 2024, 'Drama, Adventure, Mystery, History', 'Michael Cristofer, Simon Dennis', 'Elisabeth Seldes Annacone', 'Jessica Lange, Kathy Bates, Jesse Williams, Lily Rabe, Pierce Brosnan, Michael Rose, Cindy Hogan, Keith Arthur Bolden', 'PG-13', 'Lillian Hall, a Broadway actress, has never missed a performance throughout her long, illustrious career. Yet in rehearsals for a new play her confidence is challenged. People and events conspire to take away her ability to do what she loves most.', 'Lillian Hall, a Broadway actress, has never missed a performance throughout her long, illustrious career. Yet in rehearsals for a new play her confidence is challenged. People and events conspire to take away her ability to do what she loves most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rbwcw8yQXEmSweaxDfyMRwXaVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800513'),
  ('115750856810925350', 'The Great Locomotive Chase', 1956, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family, War, Western', 'Francis D. Lyon, Charles P. Boyle', 'Lawrence Edward Watkin', 'Fess Parker, Jeffrey Hunter, Jeff York, John Lupton, Eddie Firestone, Kenneth Tobey, Don Megowan, Claude Jarman Jr.', 'NR', 'During the Civil War, a Union spy, Andrews, is asked to lead a band of Union soldiers into the South so that they could destroy the railway system. However, things don''t go as planned when the conductor of the train that they stole is on to them and is doing everything he can to stop them. Based on a true story.', 'During the Civil War, a Union spy, Andrews, is asked to lead a band of Union soldiers into the South so that they could destroy the railway system. However, things don''t go as planned when the conductor of the train that they stole is on to them and is doing everything he can to stop them. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbU8ECQEhWhMx3rEVaBulmId4s0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37112'),
  ('645514708318569067', 'The Great Los Angeles Earthquake', 1990, 'Drama, Action, TV Movie', 'Larry Elikann', 'William Bast, Paul Huson', 'Joanna Kerns, Dan Lauria, Bonnie Bartlett, Lindsay Frost, Alan Autry, Joe Spano, Holly Fields, Brock Peters', null, 'After a series of small tremors in Los Angeles, Dr. Clare Winslow, a local seismologist, pinpoints the exact location and time of when the long awaited earthquake--"The Big One"--will strike southern California. With this information, she must battle city officials to release this information to the general public. Also, she hopes that her family is out of harms way when the quake strikes. Subplots show how other families and people cope with the the tremors that strike before the impending "Big One."', 'After a series of small tremors in Los Angeles, Dr. Clare Winslow, a local seismologist, pinpoints the exact location and time of when the long awaited earthquake--"The Big One"--will strike southern California. With this information, she must battle city officials to release this information to the general public. Also, she hopes that her family is out of harms way when the quake strikes. Subplots show how other families and people cope with the the tremors that strike before the impending "Big One."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x14XJWToMVLyTBXdXPDltP0nBwK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100032'),
  ('927337311178935763', 'The Great Love', 1942, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rolf Hansen, Franz Weihmayr', 'Peter Groll', 'Zarah Leander, Grethe Weiser, Viktor Staal, Paul Hörbiger, Wolfgang Preiss, Hans Schwarz Jr., Victor Janson, Leopold von Ledebur', null, 'The attractive Oberleutnant Paul Wendlandt is stationed in North Africa as a fighter pilot. While in Berlin to deliver a report he is given a day''s leave, and on the stage of the cabaret theatre "Skala" sees the popular Danish singer Hanna Holberg. For Paul it is love at first sight. When Hanna visits friends after the end of the performance, he follows her, and speaks to her in the U-Bahn. After the party in her friends'' flat, he accompanies her home and chance throws them further together when an air raid warning forces them to take cover in the air raid shelter. Hanna reciprocates Paul''s feelings, but after a night spent together Paul has to return immediately to the front. There now follows a whole series of misunderstandings, and one missed opportunity after another. While Hanna waits in vain for some sign of life from Paul, he is flying on missions in North Africa. When he tries to visit her in her Berlin flat, she is giving a Christmas concert in Paris.', 'The attractive Oberleutnant Paul Wendlandt is stationed in North Africa as a fighter pilot. While in Berlin to deliver a report he is given a day''s leave, and on the stage of the cabaret theatre "Skala" sees the popular Danish singer Hanna Holberg. For Paul it is love at first sight. When Hanna visits friends after the end of the performance, he follows her, and speaks to her in the U-Bahn. After the party in her friends'' flat, he accompanies her home and chance throws them further together when an air raid warning forces them to take cover in the air raid shelter. Hanna reciprocates Paul''s feelings, but after a night spent together Paul has to return immediately to the front. There now follows a whole series of misunderstandings, and one missed opportunity after another. While Hanna waits in vain for some sign of life from Paul, he is flying on missions in North Africa. When he tries to visit her in her Berlin flat, she is giving a Christmas concert in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeN9RRrGbvlSkCNX4NbGFIloZPz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:930'),
  ('121425675992233969', 'The Great Madcap', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Luis Buñuel, Ezequiel Carrasco, Jesús González Gancy', 'Adolfo Torrado', 'Fernando Soler, Rosario Granados, Andrés Soler, Rubén Rojo, Gustavo Rojo, Maruja Grifell, Francisco Jambrina, Luis Alcoriza', null, 'Portrayal of a family’s attempt to change the spending habit of the indulgent and hedonistic patriarch, Alfredo. The family decides to try to fool him into spending less by telling him that his large fortune is gone.', 'Portrayal of a family’s attempt to change the spending habit of the indulgent and hedonistic patriarch, Alfredo. The family decides to try to fool him into spending less by telling him that his large fortune is gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBXUXJFzrXx2ggbMQGtjLUZNPCE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38811'),
  ('897665272747044603', 'The Great Magic', 2023, 'Comedy, Music', 'Lysa Chamard, Franck Heslon, Nicolas Guilleminot', 'Arthur Teboul, Maud Ameline, Noémie Lvovsky', 'Denis Podalydès, Sergi López, Noémie Lvovsky, Rebecca Marder, Judith Chemla, François Morel, Paolo Mattei, Micha Lescot', null, 'The 20s. In a seaside resort where everybody is bored, Albert Marvuglia, a slightly shabby conjurer, makes Marta, the wife of the wealthy bourgeois Charles Moufflet, disappear, who takes advantage of this tour to escape for good.', 'The 20s. In a seaside resort where everybody is bored, Albert Marvuglia, a slightly shabby conjurer, makes Marta, the wife of the wealthy bourgeois Charles Moufflet, disappear, who takes advantage of this tour to escape for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdwA3FsKPmgdyfyO6gENqB3vfBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657197'),
  ('1077937091943426740', 'The Great Magician', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Derek Yee, Nobuyasu Kita', 'Chun Tin-Nam, Derek Yee, Lau Ho-Leung', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Zhou Xun, Yan Ni, Wu Gang, Daniel Wu, Paul Chun Pui, Alex Fong Chung-Sun', null, 'In the years after the Revolution, China broken up into fiefdoms held by warlords, who are busy fighting each other. One warlord has imprisoned a girl and wants her to be his seventh wife, but he''s too honorable to force her. The local revolutionaries wants to kill him and bring back the republic. But when a stranger returns from abroad with mastery of magic to recover the girl he loved, who is tricking whom and who will win at the end?', 'In the years after the Revolution, China broken up into fiefdoms held by warlords, who are busy fighting each other. One warlord has imprisoned a girl and wants her to be his seventh wife, but he''s too honorable to force her. The local revolutionaries wants to kill him and bring back the republic. But when a stranger returns from abroad with mastery of magic to recover the girl he loved, who is tricking whom and who will win at the end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96k1xo0HLv0uzwefbUoAafaXBJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83721'),
  ('263452108831489438', 'The Great Man''s Lady', 1941, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, William C. Mellor, Clem Jones', 'W.L. River', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Joel McCrea, Brian Donlevy, K.T. Stevens, Thurston Hall, Lloyd Corrigan, Etta McDaniel, William B. Davidson', 'NR', 'In Hoyt City, a statue of founder Ethan Hoyt is dedicated, and 100 year old Hannah Sempler Hoyt (who lives in the last residence among skyscrapers) is at last persuaded to tell her story to a ''girl biographer''. Flashback: in 1848, teenage Hannah meets and flirts with pioneer Ethan; on a sudden impulse, they elope. We follow their struggle to found a city in the wilderness, hampered by the Gold Rush, star-crossed love, peril, and heartbreak. The star "ages" 80 years.', 'In Hoyt City, a statue of founder Ethan Hoyt is dedicated, and 100 year old Hannah Sempler Hoyt (who lives in the last residence among skyscrapers) is at last persuaded to tell her story to a ''girl biographer''. Flashback: in 1848, teenage Hannah meets and flirts with pioneer Ethan; on a sudden impulse, they elope. We follow their struggle to found a city in the wilderness, hampered by the Gold Rush, star-crossed love, peril, and heartbreak. The star "ages" 80 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glNBE9uGqsUOP8yw1jLMVkW1lh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97815'),
  ('115920176302791304', 'The Great Match', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Gerardo Olivares', null, 'Atibou Aboubacar, Adalberto Jr., Ahmed Alansar, Tano Alansar, Abu Aldanish, Kenshleg Alen Khan, Mahamadou Alzouma, Boshai Dalai Khan', null, 'A comedy about the attempts of tribal groups around the world to watch a soccer match.', 'A comedy about the attempts of tribal groups around the world to watch a soccer match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GxDtyX3vQv2zdOFM6ZGCbkTDjc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99819'),
  ('465757516616271311', 'The Great McGinty', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Preston Sturges, William C. Mellor', 'Preston Sturges', 'Brian Donlevy, Muriel Angelus, Akim Tamiroff, Allyn Joslyn, William Demarest, Louis Jean Heydt, Harry Rosenthal, Arthur Hoyt', 'NR', 'Told in flashback, Depression-era bum Dan McGinty is recruited by the city''s political machine to help with vote fraud. His great aptitude for this brings rapid promotion from "the boss," who finally decides he''d be ideal as a new, nominally "reform" mayor; but this candidacy requires marriage. His in-name-only marriage to honest Catherine proves the beginning of the end for dishonest Dan...', 'Told in flashback, Depression-era bum Dan McGinty is recruited by the city''s political machine to help with vote fraud. His great aptitude for this brings rapid promotion from "the boss," who finally decides he''d be ideal as a new, nominally "reform" mayor; but this candidacy requires marriage. His in-name-only marriage to honest Catherine proves the beginning of the end for dishonest Dan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Lrt9YthfN9Iay4QyiLz4pdp2k0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36495'),
  ('995756300223567815', 'The Great Meaulnes', 2006, 'Drama', 'Jean-Daniel Verhaeghe', 'Jean-Daniel Verhaeghe, Jean Cosmos', 'Jean-Baptiste Maunier, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Philippe Torreton, Émilie Dequenne, Malik Zidi, Valérie Stroh, Florence Thomassin', null, 'A coming-of-age story set in France in the years leading up to World War I. Two teenage boys experience love, loss, anguish and betrayal in a rural setting of great beauty.', 'A coming-of-age story set in France in the years leading up to World War I. Two teenage boys experience love, loss, anguish and betrayal in a rural setting of great beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JKnBlqQYUPAct69cqiXVOZjQvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68046'),
