  ('354621506120463030', 'The Great Pumpkin', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Francesca Archibugi, Paolo Carnera, Marina Zangirolami', 'Francesca Archibugi', 'Sergio Castellitto, Anna Galiena, Alessia Fugardi, Silvio Vannucci, Alessandra Panelli, Victor Cavallo, Maria Consagra, Lidia Broccolino', null, 'An epileptic 12-year-old girl, Pippi, is hospitalized in the psychiatric ward instead of the neurological ward, due to an administration error. Out of this mistake begins the difficult journey towards being cured.', 'An epileptic 12-year-old girl, Pippi, is hospitalized in the psychiatric ward instead of the neurological ward, due to an administration error. Out of this mistake begins the difficult journey towards being cured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8tga1NXx8ggykzLEqPStsheY7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56381'),
