  ('940634894258034371', 'The Great Silence', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Mike Stern Sterzyński, Alessandro Labadessa', 'Alessandro Regaldo, Alessandro Gassmann, Maurizio De Giovanni', 'Massimiliano Gallo, Margherita Buy, Marina Confalone, Antonia Fotaras, Emanuele Linfatti, Roberto De Francesco, Alessandro Gassmann', null, 'Villa Primic was once a luxurious home. Now in disrepair, the Primic family home is up for sale by the owner, Rose, and her two heirs, Massimiliano and Adele. The head of the family, Valerio, is vehemently opposed to this. The reunion is going to be complicated...', 'Villa Primic was once a luxurious home. Now in disrepair, the Primic family home is up for sale by the owner, Rose, and her two heirs, Massimiliano and Adele. The head of the family, Valerio, is vehemently opposed to this. The reunion is going to be complicated...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfL6o0uR7zoYdW5YuEenWi4CJqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784376'),
