  ('123697464490853201', 'The Great Space Voyage', 1975, 'Family, Adventure, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Valentin Selivanov, Vladimir Arkhangelskiy, Vadim Nabatnikov', 'Sergey Mikhalkov, Valentin Selivanov', 'Ludmila Berlinskaya, Sergei Obrazov, Igor Sakharov, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova, Ninel Myshkova, Zinaida Sorochinskaya, Pavel Ivanov, Vladimir Plotnikov', null, 'Three youngsters have to take command of a space flight when their adult captain comes down sick and is forced to quarantine himself.', 'Three youngsters have to take command of a space flight when their adult captain comes down sick and is forced to quarantine himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFLyS9ajm4uhy88SmYPMbLsHY93.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163843'),
  ('537723025500428000', 'The Great Spirit', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gisella Gobbi, Michele D''Attanasio, Sergio Rubini', 'Angelo Pasquini, Carla Cavalluzzi, Sergio Rubini', 'Rocco Papaleo, Sergio Rubini, Ivana Lotito, Bianca Guaccero, Gennaro Diana, Alessandro Giallocosta, Ilaria Cangalosi, Antonio Andrisani', null, 'In a neighbourhood on the outskirts of Taranto, high upon the rooftops framed by the Ilva steel factory, we meet Tonino a.k.a. “Barboncino” (poodle). Tonino has just committed a robbery and, in a moment of foolishness, ﬂed from his accomplices, taking the entire loot for himself. He escapes upward, clambering from roof to roof, until he can go no further and must take refuge in an old water tank. Here he ﬁnds Renato, a strange and eccentric man who believes he is an American Indian from the Sioux tribe. Trapped with no other choice, Tonino is forced to team up with Renato. A strange and crazy friendship is formed, and Tonino learns to see things from a very different perspective.', 'In a neighbourhood on the outskirts of Taranto, high upon the rooftops framed by the Ilva steel factory, we meet Tonino a.k.a. “Barboncino” (poodle). Tonino has just committed a robbery and, in a moment of foolishness, ﬂed from his accomplices, taking the entire loot for himself. He escapes upward, clambering from roof to roof, until he can go no further and must take refuge in an old water tank. Here he ﬁnds Renato, a strange and eccentric man who believes he is an American Indian from the Sioux tribe. Trapped with no other choice, Tonino is forced to team up with Renato. A strange and crazy friendship is formed, and Tonino learns to see things from a very different perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWd7Op4wYba9ZnDR6uf50nIoTHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595680'),
