  ('953665324588144165', 'The Great War', 2019, 'History, War, Drama, Action', 'Joseph Loeffler, Apostolos Gliarmis, Steven Luke', 'Steven Luke', 'Jordan McFadden, Ron Perlman, Trinity Schuetzle, Billy Zane, Bates Wilder, Cody Fleury, Edgar Damatian, Aaron Courteau', 'R', 'In November of 1918 as World War I was ending, a unit of American soldiers goes behind enemy lines to find a lost platoon of African American soldiers.', 'In November of 1918 as World War I was ending, a unit of American soldiers goes behind enemy lines to find a lost platoon of African American soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mB8sqwHkVZWBvhEn71ICewPCfNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647063'),
  ('382005934494570907', 'The Great War of Archimedes', 2019, 'War, Action, Mystery, Drama', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Kohei Adachi, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Masaki Suda, Tasuku Emoto, Minami Hamabe, Tsurube Shofukutei, Katsuya Kobayashi, Fumiyo Kohinata, Jun Kunimura, Isao Hashizume', null, 'It is the early 1930s and the command of the Japanese Imperial Navy determines to construct the world''s biggest and most formidable battleship, Yamato. One of the admirals, Yamamoto Isoroku, disagrees. He recruits the upstart and mathematics'' expert Tadashi Kai who discovers there are discrepancies between the official cost estimates and the actual figures. They soon find out that they have stumbled upon a conspiracy.', 'It is the early 1930s and the command of the Japanese Imperial Navy determines to construct the world''s biggest and most formidable battleship, Yamato. One of the admirals, Yamamoto Isoroku, disagrees. He recruits the upstart and mathematics'' expert Tadashi Kai who discovers there are discrepancies between the official cost estimates and the actual figures. They soon find out that they have stumbled upon a conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9Xd4wa2FdkONYv0BVdmcgxFRUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605389'),
  ('297709253930910739', 'The Great Warning', 2024, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Juan Carlos Salas Tamez', 'Juan Carlos Salas Tamez', 'Carl Butler, Mar Carrera, Luana Colpani, Sebastian Kahuna, Isabel Peña Almaraz', null, 'In a world where the inexplicable becomes reality, this documentary immerses us in the impactful experiences of people from different countries, unknown to each other but united by a common destiny. Their testimonies, filled with mystery and wonder, converge in an alarming revelation: an event of unimaginable proportions is about to occur and will change the course of humanity forever.', 'In a world where the inexplicable becomes reality, this documentary immerses us in the impactful experiences of people from different countries, unknown to each other but united by a common destiny. Their testimonies, filled with mystery and wonder, converge in an alarming revelation: an event of unimaginable proportions is about to occur and will change the course of humanity forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmR8RiKM147anW8p7FtBRN3rbA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1339606'),
  ('621814575465531033', 'The Great Warrior Skanderbeg', 1953, 'Action, History, Drama', 'Sergei Yutkevich, Yevgeni Andrikanis', 'Mikhail Papava', 'Akaki Khorava, Besa Imami, Adivie Alibali, Semyon Sokolovsky, Veriko Anjaparidze, Marie Logoreci, Georgi Chernovolenko, Naim Frashëri', null, 'A biography of George Kastriot Skanderbeg widely known as Skanderbeg, a 15th-century Albanian lord who defended his land against the Ottoman Empire for more than two decades.', 'A biography of George Kastriot Skanderbeg widely known as Skanderbeg, a 15th-century Albanian lord who defended his land against the Ottoman Empire for more than two decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guZE57QZI0s5ZyD8U4ptWbwsbUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199460'),
  ('855064179937836118', 'The Great Warsaw Race', 2026, 'Drama, Action, History', 'Bartłomiej Ignaciuk, Klaudiusz Dwulit, Bartlomiej Ignaciuk', 'Jan Purzycki, Bartlomiej Ignaciuk', 'Tomasz Ziętek, Marcin Bosak, Tomasz Kot, Agnieszka Żulewska, Mary Pawłowska', null, 'A story about a young jockey dreaming of a sports career. These dreams culminate in the most important event in Poland — The Great Warsaw Race. Krzysiek enters the horse-racing world with the naivety of a novice and enthusiast. Only after some time does he realize that races are a network of dependencies, powerful interests, and manipulation of results.', 'A story about a young jockey dreaming of a sports career. These dreams culminate in the most important event in Poland — The Great Warsaw Race. Krzysiek enters the horse-racing world with the naivety of a novice and enthusiast. Only after some time does he realize that races are a network of dependencies, powerful interests, and manipulation of results.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fliha1XgssW4IogMnpiBht98wrBy.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-great-warsaw-race'),
  ('204272789704869441', 'The Great White Hope', 1970, 'Drama', 'Martin Ritt, Burnett Guffey, Jerry Ziesmer', 'Howard Sackler', 'James Earl Jones, Jane Alexander, Lou Gilbert, Joel Fluellen, Chester Morris, Robert Webber, Marlene Warfield, Hal Holbrook', 'PG-13', 'A black champion boxer and his white female companion struggle to survive while the white boxing establishment looks for ways to knock him down.', 'A black champion boxer and his white female companion struggle to survive while the white boxing establishment looks for ways to knock him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guVIeqNrjeAszhIDe68TDnlY6ik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17978'),
  ('313375557726574213', 'The Great White Hype', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Reginald Hudlin, Ronald Víctor García', 'Ron Shelton, Tony Hendra', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Jeff Goldblum, Peter Berg, Corbin Bernsen, Jon Lovitz, Cheech Marin, John Rhys-Davies, Salli Richardson-Whitfield', 'R', 'When the champ''s promoter, Rev. Sultan, decides something new is needed to boost the marketability of the boxing matches, he searches and finds the only man to ever beat the champ. The problem is that he isn''t a boxer anymore and he''s white. However, once Rev. Sultan convinces him to fight, he goes into heavy training while the confident champ takes it easy and falls out of shape.', 'When the champ''s promoter, Rev. Sultan, decides something new is needed to boost the marketability of the boxing matches, he searches and finds the only man to ever beat the champ. The problem is that he isn''t a boxer anymore and he''s white. However, once Rev. Sultan convinces him to fight, he goes into heavy training while the confident champ takes it easy and falls out of shape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEPiu0mC4NqMHOoFLsC6CxQW34d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20759'),
  ('917680503421678782', 'The Great White Silence', 1924, 'Documentary', 'Herbert G. Ponting', null, 'Robert Falcon Scott, Herbert G. Ponting, Henry R. Bowers, Edgar Evans, Lawrence E.G. Oates, Edward Adrian Wilson', null, 'Herbert Ponting travelled to Antarctica with Captain Scott’s ill-fated South Pole expedition and filmed the stunning images that make up this extraordinary documentary. (Originally released in 1912 as With Captain Scott in the Antarctic, the material was re-edited and re-issued by Ponting in 1924 as The Great White Silence.)', 'Herbert Ponting travelled to Antarctica with Captain Scott’s ill-fated South Pole expedition and filmed the stunning images that make up this extraordinary documentary. (Originally released in 1912 as With Captain Scott in the Antarctic, the material was re-edited and re-issued by Ponting in 1924 as The Great White Silence.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zygS2mwsnnE6ILFg0Iekuy2zW2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84880'),
  ('749408399366763807', 'The Great White Tower', 1966, 'Drama', 'Satsuo Yamamoto, Akira Okazaki, Nobuo Munekawa', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Jirō Tamiya, Eijirō Tōno, Takahiro Tamura, Eitarō Ozawa, Eiji Funakoshi, Osamu Takizawa, Shiho Fujimura, Mayumi Ogawa', null, 'The story contrasts the life of two doctors, former classmates and now both assistant professors at Naniwa University Hospital in Osaka. The brilliant and ambitious surgeon Goro Zaizen stops at nothing to rise to a position of eminence and authority, while the friendly Shuji Satomi busies himself with his patients and research.', 'The story contrasts the life of two doctors, former classmates and now both assistant professors at Naniwa University Hospital in Osaka. The brilliant and ambitious surgeon Goro Zaizen stops at nothing to rise to a position of eminence and authority, while the friendly Shuji Satomi busies himself with his patients and research.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6V6EDeMt39L5Ncqj3OlXxSy5Eq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261541'),
  ('446362905262670672', 'The Great Yokai War', 2005, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Action', 'Takashi Miike, Hideo Yamamoto, Yamamoto Hideyuki', 'Hiroshi Aramata, Takashi Miike, Mitsuhiko Sawamura', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Hiroyuki Miyasako, Kaho Minami, Riko Narumi, Shiro Sano, Miyuki Miyabe, Arimasa Osawa, Yuu Tokui', 'PG-13', 'A young boy with a troubled home life becomes "chosen," and he stumbles into the middle of a great war of yōkai (a class of mythological creatures), where he meets a group of friendly yōkai who become his companions through his journey. Now he must fight to protect his friends and free the world of the yōkai from oppression.', 'A young boy with a troubled home life becomes "chosen," and he stumbles into the middle of a great war of yōkai (a class of mythological creatures), where he meets a group of friendly yōkai who become his companions through his journey. Now he must fight to protect his friends and free the world of the yōkai from oppression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xk96VmT0IC2nvWJG9iRWJrzEpmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42000'),
  ('900056504249167598', 'The Great Yokai War: Guardians', 2021, 'Fantasy, Family, Adventure, Horror', 'Raku Nagao, Hideo Yamamoto, Takashi Miike', 'Yusuke Watanabe', 'Kokoro Terada, Hana Sugisaki, Ray Inomata, Nanako Matsushima, Kazuki Kitamura, Sakura Ando, Koji Ohkura, Takahiro Miura', null, 'Fifth grader Kei Watanabe has inherited the hunter''s blood to hunt yōkai. To save the world from destruction, Kei challenges a war against the yōkai.', 'Fifth grader Kei Watanabe has inherited the hunter''s blood to hunt yōkai. To save the world from destruction, Kei challenges a war against the yōkai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40As72DGjh37ZxeYXyQHIVMJ10o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746808'),
  ('745487217838145980', 'The Great Ziegfeld', 1936, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Z. Leonard, Oliver T. Marsh, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'William Anthony McGuire', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, Luise Rainer, Frank Morgan, Fanny Brice, Virginia Bruce, Reginald Owen, Ray Bolger', 'NR', 'At the 1893 Chicago World''s Fair, sideshow barker Florenz Ziegfeld turns the tables on his more-successful neighbor Billings, and also steals his girlfriend. This pattern repeats throughout their lives, as Ziegfeld makes and loses many fortunes putting on ever-bigger, more spectacular shows', 'At the 1893 Chicago World''s Fair, sideshow barker Florenz Ziegfeld turns the tables on his more-successful neighbor Billings, and also steals his girlfriend. This pattern repeats throughout their lives, as Ziegfeld makes and loses many fortunes putting on ever-bigger, more spectacular shows', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhF6vYFVCaPCs7CgDqg3n4mNod3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43277'),
  ('630383006734449943', 'The Greatest', 1977, 'Drama', 'Tom Gries, Harry Stradling Jr., Richard Alexander Wells', 'Ring Lardner, Jr.', 'Muhammad Ali, Ernest Borgnine, John Marley, Lloyd Haynes, Lucille Benson, Sally Bondi, Malachi Throne, Teddy Wilson', 'PG', 'Muhammad Ali''s life story up to the late 1970s, which includes his Olympic boxing triumphs as Cassius Clay, his conversion to Islam, his refusal of the Army draft and the legal battle after being stripped of his World Title.', 'Muhammad Ali''s life story up to the late 1970s, which includes his Olympic boxing triumphs as Cassius Clay, his conversion to Islam, his refusal of the Army draft and the legal battle after being stripped of his World Title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkPVN51q9hbzkN5zmwybsLMhCej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69903'),
  ('449569335855151365', 'The Greatest', 2009, 'Drama', 'Shana Feste, Scott Larkin, Curtis Smith', 'Shana Feste', 'Pierce Brosnan, Susan Sarandon, Carey Mulligan, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Johnny Simmons, Kevin Hagan, Amy Morton, Deirdre O''Connell', 'R', 'Teenagers Rose and Bennett were in love, and then a car crash claimed Bennett''s life. He left behind a grieving mother, father and younger brother, and Rose was left all alone. She has no family to turn to for support, so when she finds out she''s pregnant, she winds up at the Brewer''s door. She needs their help, and although they can''t quite admit it, they each need her so they can begin to heal.', 'Teenagers Rose and Bennett were in love, and then a car crash claimed Bennett''s life. He left behind a grieving mother, father and younger brother, and Rose was left all alone. She has no family to turn to for support, so when she finds out she''s pregnant, she winds up at the Brewer''s door. She needs their help, and although they can''t quite admit it, they each need her so they can begin to heal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dNynUNdYSxeOpuJJNv3Fyk54NA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32395'),
  ('1054410634286640075', 'The Greatest Beer Run Ever', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, War', 'Sean Porter, Jeremy Woolsey, Peter Farrelly', 'Peter Farrelly, Pete Jones, Brian Hayes Currie', 'Zac Efron, Russell Crowe, Kyle Allen, Bill Murray, Jake Picking, Will Ropp, Archie Renaux, Ruby Ashbourne Serkis', 'R', 'Chickie wants to support his friends fighting in Vietnam, so he does something wild—personally bring them American beer. What starts as a well-meaning journey quickly changes Chickie''s life and perspective.', 'Chickie wants to support his friends fighting in Vietnam, so he does something wild—personally bring them American beer. What starts as a well-meaning journey quickly changes Chickie''s life and perspective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggf37TpcKaxwguhvtNn6MQpyqBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597922'),
  ('54571711670028263', 'The Greatest Game Ever Played', 2005, 'Drama', 'Bill Paxton, Shane Hurlbut', 'Mark Frost', 'Shia LaBeouf, Stephen Dillane, Josh Flitter, Peter Firth, Elias Koteas, Peyton List, Scott Faulconbridge, James Paxton', 'PG', 'A biopic of 20-year-old Francis Ouimet who defeated his golfing idol and 1900 US Open Champion, Harry Vardon.', 'A biopic of 20-year-old Francis Ouimet who defeated his golfing idol and 1900 US Open Champion, Harry Vardon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kh4vd6wKa6j9xVFzxhQrsT0p2YN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15487'),
  ('53017369220745948', 'The Greatest Hits', 2024, 'Drama, Music, Romance, Fantasy', 'Ned Benson, TK Shom, Erika Eads', 'Ned Benson', 'Lucy Boynton, Justin H. Min, David Corenswet, Austin Crute, Retta, Andie Ju, Nelly Furtado, Clementine Creevy', 'PG-13', 'Harriet finds art imitating life when she discovers certain songs can transport her back in time – literally. While she relives the past through romantic memories of her former boyfriend, her time travelling collides with a burgeoning new love interest in the present. As she takes her journey through the hypnotic connection between music and memory, she wonders – even if she could change the past, should she?', 'Harriet finds art imitating life when she discovers certain songs can transport her back in time – literally. While she relives the past through romantic memories of her former boyfriend, her time travelling collides with a burgeoning new love interest in the present. As she takes her journey through the hypnotic connection between music and memory, she wonders – even if she could change the past, should she?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cve12HkI9psBUfmkx7FeBciaQN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1011082'),
  ('909382910526244766', 'The Greatest Inheritance', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Catherine Stroud, Lisa London, John K.D. Graham', 'Andrea Polnaszek, Alexandra Boylan, John K.D. Graham', 'Cameron Kelly, Jaleel White, Mena Suvari, Leticia Jimenez, Miles Mussenden, Jeff Schroeder, Mychala Lee, Meredith Riley Stewart', null, 'Estranged siblings return home to bury their mother and claim their inheritance, only to discover that their deceased mother has hidden the deed to the entire estate somewhere on the property.', 'Estranged siblings return home to bury their mother and claim their inheritance, only to discover that their deceased mother has hidden the deed to the entire estate somewhere on the property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31HtzVDE7VnqQmREYzRjwPS6v0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949640'),
  ('182000455172066669', 'The Greatest Lie Ever Sold: George Floyd and the Rise of BLM', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Candace Owens', null, 'Candace Owens, Bob Kroll, Liz Collin, Alvin Manago, Theresa Scott, Joey Sandberg, Kim Voss, Samir Abumayyaleh', null, 'In the aftermath of George Floyd’s death, the media concocted a narrative that justified a summer of worldwide riots and helped contribute to the rise of Black Lives Matter who used the chaos to raise 90 million dollars. In this documentary, Candace Owens follows the money and discovers exactly how the money was spent and where it did—and didn’t go.', 'In the aftermath of George Floyd’s death, the media concocted a narrative that justified a summer of worldwide riots and helped contribute to the rise of Black Lives Matter who used the chaos to raise 90 million dollars. In this documentary, Candace Owens follows the money and discovers exactly how the money was spent and where it did—and didn’t go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imT07ON4hfWtNvLgXryERZdbtC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977367'),
