  ('952607988628181110', 'The Greatest Show on Earth', 1952, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cecil B. DeMille, George Barnes, Arthur Rosson', 'Fredric M. Frank, Theodore St. John, Barré Lyndon', 'Betty Hutton, Cornel Wilde, Charlton Heston, Dorothy Lamour, Gloria Grahame, James Stewart, Henry Wilcoxon, Lyle Bettger', 'NR', 'To ensure a full profitable season, circus manager Brad Braden engages The Great Sebastian, though this moves his girlfriend Holly from her hard-won center trapeze spot. Holly and Sebastian begin a dangerous one-upmanship duel in the ring, while he pursues her on the ground.', 'To ensure a full profitable season, circus manager Brad Braden engages The Great Sebastian, though this moves his girlfriend Holly from her hard-won center trapeze spot. Holly and Sebastian begin a dangerous one-upmanship duel in the ring, while he pursues her on the ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKI0yGPRh1IlvRKKJRoMZruior8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27191'),
  ('116418028230550138', 'The Greatest Showman', 2017, 'Drama', 'Lauren Rockman, Ann Bartek, Joel Chang', 'Jenny Bicks, Bill Condon', 'Hugh Jackman, Zac Efron, Michelle Williams, Rebecca Ferguson, Zendaya, Keala Settle, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Natasha Liu Bordizzo', 'PG', 'The story of American showman P.T. Barnum, founder of the circus that became the famous traveling Ringling Bros. and Barnum & Bailey Circus.', 'The story of American showman P.T. Barnum, founder of the circus that became the famous traveling Ringling Bros. and Barnum & Bailey Circus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9CeobiihCx1uG1tpw8hXmpi7nm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316029'),
  ('158451619091565855', 'The Greatest Story Ever Told', 1965, 'Drama, History', 'George Stevens, Loyal Griggs, William C. Mellor', 'George Stevens, James Lee Barrett', 'Max von Sydow, Michael Anderson Jr., Carroll Baker, Ina Balin, Victor Buono, Richard Conte, Joanna Dunham, José Ferrer', 'G', 'From his birth in Bethlehem to his death and eventual resurrection, the life of Jesus Christ is given the all-star treatment in this epic retelling. Major aspects of Christ''s life are touched upon, including the execution of all the newborn males in Egypt by King Herod; Christ''s baptism by John the Baptist; and the betrayal by Judas after the Last Supper that eventually leads to Christ''s crucifixion and miraculous return.', 'From his birth in Bethlehem to his death and eventual resurrection, the life of Jesus Christ is given the all-star treatment in this epic retelling. Major aspects of Christ''s life are touched upon, including the execution of all the newborn males in Egypt by King Herod; Christ''s baptism by John the Baptist; and the betrayal by Judas after the Last Supper that eventually leads to Christ''s crucifixion and miraculous return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c21ON7BZn0jwdNl6ibZ1vhXJmpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2428'),
  ('630143623569476689', 'The Greek Tycoon', 1978, 'Drama', 'J. Lee Thompson, Anthony B. Richmond, Michael Stevenson', 'Morton S. Fine', 'Anthony Quinn, Jacqueline Bisset, Raf Vallone, Edward Albert, James Franciscus, Camilla Sparv, Marilù Tolo, Charles Durning', 'R', 'A lusty Greek shipping magnate courts the widow of an assassinated U.S. president.', 'A lusty Greek shipping magnate courts the widow of an assassinated U.S. president.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skNKybBwbo8CqZ6ceMsqAZEUCGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57578'),
  ('1049724304973902487', 'The Greeks Had a Word for Them', 1932, 'Comedy', 'Lowell Sherman, George Barnes', null, 'Joan Blondell, Madge Evans, Ina Claire, David Manners, Lowell Sherman, Phillips Smalley, Sidney Bracey, Betty Grable', 'NR', 'A trio of money-hungry women rent a luxurious penthouse, spending their dough on drink and debonair clothing, backbiting and catfighting as they steal each other''s boyfriends.', 'A trio of money-hungry women rent a luxurious penthouse, spending their dough on drink and debonair clothing, backbiting and catfighting as they steal each other''s boyfriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPyCVzofmPg4wNOpPppiwCbX7ih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36783'),
  ('92113142958152383', 'The Green Archer', 1961, 'Crime', 'Heinz Hölscher, Jürgen Roland', 'Wolfgang Menge, Wolfgang Schnitzler', 'Klausjürgen Wussow, Karin Dor, Gert Fröbe, Wolfgang Völz, Eddi Arent, Heinz Weiss, Stanislav Ledinek, Harry Wüstenhagen', null, 'The country estate of American emigre Abel Bellamy is haunted by the ghost of the Green Archer, a 14th century Robin Hood type figure who terrorised the former lords of the manor. Now, with the gangster coming home on vaguely defined business and his niece Valerie arriving with her adoptive father to take up residence in the adjacent mansion, much to Bellamy''s annoyance, the archer has returned. Who is he and what does he want?', 'The country estate of American emigre Abel Bellamy is haunted by the ghost of the Green Archer, a 14th century Robin Hood type figure who terrorised the former lords of the manor. Now, with the gangster coming home on vaguely defined business and his niece Valerie arriving with her adoptive father to take up residence in the adjacent mansion, much to Bellamy''s annoyance, the archer has returned. Who is he and what does he want?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7LGyh9fAMyjlE7H3yTEYJXj6Ur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5631'),
  ('618069021322010927', 'The Green Berets', 1968, 'War, Drama', 'John Wayne, Ray Kellogg, Winton C. Hoch', 'James Lee Barrett', 'John Wayne, David Janssen, Jim Hutton, Aldo Ray, Raymond St. Jacques, Bruce Cabot, Jack Soo, George Takei', 'G', 'Col. Mike Kirby picks two teams of crack Green Berets for two missions in South Vietnam. The first is to strengthen a camp that is trying to be taken by the enemy. The second is to kidnap a North Vietnamese General.', 'Col. Mike Kirby picks two teams of crack Green Berets for two missions in South Vietnam. The first is to strengthen a camp that is trying to be taken by the enemy. The second is to kidnap a North Vietnamese General.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3y5qhIPg7uFEoVRvx2GvOc4UMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22377'),
  ('751150939146820006', 'The Green Book: Guide to Freedom', 2019, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Yoruba Richen, Ariel Grandoli', 'Yoruba Richen', 'Yoruba Richen, Delbert Hunt, Marquette Folley, Karen Allen Baxter, Jennifer Ivey, Henrie Monteith Treadwel, Murray Bishoff, Jack George', null, 'In 1936, Victor H. Green (1892-1960) published The Negro Motorist Green Book, a book that was both a travel guide and a survival manual, to help African-Americans navigate safe those regions of the United States where segregation and Jim Crow laws were disgracefully applied.', 'In 1936, Victor H. Green (1892-1960) published The Negro Motorist Green Book, a book that was both a travel guide and a survival manual, to help African-Americans navigate safe those regions of the United States where segregation and Jim Crow laws were disgracefully applied.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JQmPWE8ZCGx6D3Z2ZIy1MU6ZSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581012'),
  ('167791550931033448', 'The Green Butchers', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Sebastian Blenkov, Peter Bækkel', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Mads Mikkelsen, Line Kruse, Nicolas Bro, Aksel Erhardtsen, Bodil Jørgensen, Ole Thestrup, Lily Weiding', null, 'Svend and Bjarne work for a butcher in a small Danish town. Fed up with their boss'' arrogance, they decide to start their own butcher shop. After dismal beginnings, an unfortunate accident happens which coincides with a large order of meat. One hasty decision leads to another and soon the business thrives. In the meantime, Bjarne has to deal with his twin brother who has been in coma for years following a gruesome car accident.', 'Svend and Bjarne work for a butcher in a small Danish town. Fed up with their boss'' arrogance, they decide to start their own butcher shop. After dismal beginnings, an unfortunate accident happens which coincides with a large order of meat. One hasty decision leads to another and soon the business thrives. In the meantime, Bjarne has to deal with his twin brother who has been in coma for years following a gruesome car accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plIr2NknxxvzY9nkR8AgnuLl4mK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4972'),
  ('1108769095708161340', 'The Green Cockatoo', 1937, 'Crime, Drama', 'William Cameron Menzies, Mutz Greenbaum, Slim Hand', 'Arthur Wimperis', 'John Mills, Rène Ray, Charles Oliver, Bruce Seton, Julian Vedey, Robert Newton, Allan Jeayes, Frank Atkinson', 'NR', 'A young girl is travelling to London to find work. Arriving at the station, she meets a man who has been stabbed by a member of a gang of crooks involved with greyhound racing. She becomes a suspect, but flees the scene in order to deliver a message to the dead man''s brother. She is protected from the police by a night club entertainer, who she learns is the man she is seeking.', 'A young girl is travelling to London to find work. Arriving at the station, she meets a man who has been stabbed by a member of a gang of crooks involved with greyhound racing. She becomes a suspect, but flees the scene in order to deliver a message to the dead man''s brother. She is protected from the police by a night club entertainer, who she learns is the man she is seeking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ODhXgtyzkOerBbryNMDZmbR4Kz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26529'),
  ('395964407430294885', 'The Green Deal', 2024, 'Drama', 'Euric Allaire, Nina Boussad, Gigi Akoka', 'Emmanuel Courcol, Édouard Bergeon', 'Alexandra Lamy, Philippe Torreton, Félix Moati, Sofian Khammes, Julie Chen, Fatou N''Diaye, Charlie Costillas, Antoine Bertrand', null, 'Carole tries to save the life of her son who has been wrongfully sentenced to death in a rigged trial.', 'Carole tries to save the life of her son who has been wrongfully sentenced to death in a rigged trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gkvKdu3wYvNfkaRGap60iguZAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062644'),
  ('397428683740660033', 'The Green Domino', 1935, 'Drama', 'Henri Decoin, Herbert Selpin, Otto Baecker', 'Emil Burri, Harald Bratt', 'Danielle Darrieux, Charles Vanel, Maurice Escande, Daniel Lecourtois, Marcel Herrand, Jany Holt, Jeanne Pérez, Henri Beaulieu', null, 'After his girlfriend is murdered, an art critic realizes that a wealthy heiress is falling in love with him.', 'After his girlfriend is murdered, an art critic realizes that a wealthy heiress is falling in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SoeroZtyVpm6O7qcVH9SD9t0Lp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333266'),
  ('671222962999257186', 'The Green Elephant', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Svetlana Baskova, Svetlana Baskova', 'Svetlana Baskova', 'Vladimir Yepifantsev, Aleksandr Maslaev, Anatoly Osmolovsky, Sergey Pakhomov, Oleg Mavromatti', null, 'Two Russian prisoners are abused mentally and physically.', 'Two Russian prisoners are abused mentally and physically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziIQkTkfG2kSBFDWDva7XAao47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132030'),
  ('312587061916677913', 'The Green Gang', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Julie Manoukian, Romain Le Bonniec, François Mathon', 'Julie Manoukian, Jean-Marcel Erre', 'Émilie Caen, Vincent Elbaz, Tracy Gotoas, Gaspard Meier-Chaurand, Stéphane Debac, Georges Corraface, Myriam Boyer', null, 'Environmental crimes drive them nuts, injustices suffered by women revolt them, and greenwashing makes them sick. Meet The Green Panthers, modern day Robin Hoods with a feminist streak, specialized in burglaries against polluters and misogynists. But to break into a safe and get the goods on their biggest target yet, they must team up with Bernard, an aging burglar whose ecofeminism isn’t quite up to date.', 'Environmental crimes drive them nuts, injustices suffered by women revolt them, and greenwashing makes them sick. Meet The Green Panthers, modern day Robin Hoods with a feminist streak, specialized in burglaries against polluters and misogynists. But to break into a safe and get the goods on their biggest target yet, they must team up with Bernard, an aging burglar whose ecofeminism isn’t quite up to date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKaBVsZncMcWn1FtLT0ox9aLBpx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193450'),
  ('812987946119929050', 'The Green Glove', 1952, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Claude Renoir, Rudolph Maté, Gilbert Mandelik', 'Charles Bennett', 'Glenn Ford, Geraldine Brooks, Cedric Hardwicke, George Macready, Gaby André, Jany Holt, Roger Tréville, Juliette Gréco', 'NR', 'In World War II France, American soldier Michael Blake captures, then loses Nazi-collaborator art thief Paul Rona, who leaves behind a gem studded gauntlet (a stolen religious relic). Years later, financial reverses lead Mike to return in search of the object. In Paris, he must dodge mysterious followers and a corpse that''s hard to explain; so he and attractive tour guide Christine decamp on a cross-country pursuit that becomes love on the run...then takes yet another turn.', 'In World War II France, American soldier Michael Blake captures, then loses Nazi-collaborator art thief Paul Rona, who leaves behind a gem studded gauntlet (a stolen religious relic). Years later, financial reverses lead Mike to return in search of the object. In Paris, he must dodge mysterious followers and a corpse that''s hard to explain; so he and attractive tour guide Christine decamp on a cross-country pursuit that becomes love on the run...then takes yet another turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPeBA9EbyNyZA5el0pjp914dGAy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62722'),
  ('369717408659751080', 'The Green Goddess', 1930, 'Adventure', 'Alfred E. Green, James Van Trees', 'William Archer', 'George Arliss, Ralph Forbes, H.B. Warner, Alice Joyce, Ivan F. Simpson, Reginald Sheffield, Betty Boyd, Nigel De Brulier', null, 'An airplane carrying three Brits crash lands in the kingdom of Rukh. The Rajah holds them prisoner because the British are about to execute his three half-brothers in neighboring India.', 'An airplane carrying three Brits crash lands in the kingdom of Rukh. The Rajah holds them prisoner because the British are about to execute his three half-brothers in neighboring India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcZyoGfqyJLh7Kfb3JrEu6sWoMn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113430'),
  ('246601268711758646', 'The Green Hornet', 1940, 'Adventure, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Ford Beebe, Ray Taylor, Jerome Ash', 'George H. Plympton, Basil Dickey, Morrison Wood', 'Gordon Jones, Anne Nagel, Keye Luke, Cy Kendall, Wade Boteler, Phillip Trent, Stanley Andrews, Selmer Jackson', 'NR', 'A newspaper publisher and his Korean servant fight crime as vigilantes who pose as a notorious masked gangster and his aide.', 'A newspaper publisher and his Korean servant fight crime as vigilantes who pose as a notorious masked gangster and his aide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFbSaS9HOoMpHSWaQUPPgisCJ5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250332'),
  ('329049372066191455', 'The Green Hornet', 1974, 'Action, Comedy', 'William Beaudine, Norman Foster, E. Darrell Hallenbeck', 'Ken Pettus, Charles Hoffman', 'Van Williams, Bruce Lee, Charles Bateman, Geoffrey Horne, Mako, Wende Wagner, Lloyd Gough, Walter Brooke', 'NR', 'After the superstardom and early death of Bruce Lee, 20th Century Fox decided to cobble together a couple of theatrical feature films from this property, of which this 1974 effort is the first. The bulk of the film consists of four episodes crudely spliced together. Scattered throughout are bizarrely irrelevant fight scenes from other episodes, which make the already disjointed plotting quite surreal. The television image was cropped to make a widescreen film, which means the tops of heads and hats are lopped off the frame with alarming regularity.', 'After the superstardom and early death of Bruce Lee, 20th Century Fox decided to cobble together a couple of theatrical feature films from this property, of which this 1974 effort is the first. The bulk of the film consists of four episodes crudely spliced together. Scattered throughout are bizarrely irrelevant fight scenes from other episodes, which make the already disjointed plotting quite surreal. The television image was cropped to make a widescreen film, which means the tops of heads and hats are lopped off the frame with alarming regularity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBLxQ5gbOCThld8lo0coirOiZE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213955'),
  ('610370679115007546', 'The Green Hornet', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'John Schwartzman, Michel Gondry, Jonathan Watson', 'Evan Goldberg, Seth Rogen', 'Seth Rogen, Jay Chou, Cameron Diaz, Tom Wilkinson, Christoph Waltz, Edward James Olmos, David Harbour, Chad L. Coleman', 'PG-13', 'Britt Reid, the heir to the largest newspaper fortune in Los Angeles, is a spoiled playboy who has been, thus far, happy to lead an aimless life. After his father dies, Britt meets Kato, a resourceful company employee. Realizing that they have the talent and resources to make something of their lives, Britt and Kato join forces as costumed crime-fighters to bring down the city''s most-powerful criminal, Chudnofsky.', 'Britt Reid, the heir to the largest newspaper fortune in Los Angeles, is a spoiled playboy who has been, thus far, happy to lead an aimless life. After his father dies, Britt meets Kato, a resourceful company employee. Realizing that they have the talent and resources to make something of their lives, Britt and Kato join forces as costumed crime-fighters to bring down the city''s most-powerful criminal, Chudnofsky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YrRviphr3eXPus9iHyQX56QgIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40805'),
  ('899482624831069350', 'The Green Inferno', 1988, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Antonio Climati, Antonio Climati', 'Franco Prosperi, Antonio Climati, Federico Moccia', 'Pio Maria Federici, May Deseligny, Marco Merlo, Fabrizio Merlo, Bruno Corazzari, Jessica Quintero, Sal Borgese, Sasha D''Arc', null, 'Four friends head into the jungle to locate a lost professor but instead face off against treasure hunters who are torturing and killing natives.', 'Four friends head into the jungle to locate a lost professor but instead face off against treasure hunters who are torturing and killing natives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTJV5ppzpNIATunEsX1H5VFQyu0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90164'),
  ('913247006082590584', 'The Green Inferno', 2013, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Eli Roth, Antonio Quercia, Pablo Atienza', 'Guillermo Amoedo, Eli Roth', 'Lorenza Izzo, Ariel Levy, Sky Ferreira, Ramón Llao, Daryl Sabara, Richard Burgi, Paz Bascuñan, Magda Apanowicz', 'R', 'A group of student activists travel from New York City to the Amazon to save the rainforest. However, once they arrive in this vast green landscape, they soon discover that they are not alone… and that no good deed goes unpunished.', 'A group of student activists travel from New York City to the Amazon to save the rainforest. However, once they arrive in this vast green landscape, they soon discover that they are not alone… and that no good deed goes unpunished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTnAYyUwp6lT0cKrt4aNujj5mdF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171424'),
  ('998236730128101487', 'The Green Knight', 2021, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'David Lowery, Louise Kiely, Andrew Droz Palermo', 'David Lowery', 'Dev Patel, Alicia Vikander, Joel Edgerton, Sarita Choudhury, Sean Harris, Kate Dickie, Barry Keoghan, Erin Kellyman', 'R', 'An epic fantasy adventure based on the timeless Arthurian legend, The Green Knight tells the story of Sir Gawain, King Arthur''s reckless and headstrong nephew, who embarks on a daring quest to confront the eponymous Green Knight, a gigantic emerald-skinned stranger and tester of men.', 'An epic fantasy adventure based on the timeless Arthurian legend, The Green Knight tells the story of Sir Gawain, King Arthur''s reckless and headstrong nephew, who embarks on a daring quest to confront the eponymous Green Knight, a gigantic emerald-skinned stranger and tester of men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/if4hw3Ou5Sav9Em7WWHj66mnywp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559907'),
  ('136496727787742894', 'The Green Man', 1956, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Robert Day, Basil Dearden, Gerald Gibbs', 'Sidney Gilliat, Frank Launder', 'Alastair Sim, George Cole, Terry-Thomas, Jill Adams, Raymond Huntley, Colin Gordon, Avril Angers, John Chandos', 'NR', 'Unknown to everyone but his shady Middle Eastern bosses, watchmaker Hawkins is actually a professional hired assassin with a predilection for killing his targets with bombs. After disposing of a dictator and millionaire, Hawkins is assigned to kill a politician who is heading to a remote hotel, The Green Man, for a secret tryst with his secretary. There, however, Hawkins'' plot is discovered by vacuum salesman William Blake, who determines to stop him.', 'Unknown to everyone but his shady Middle Eastern bosses, watchmaker Hawkins is actually a professional hired assassin with a predilection for killing his targets with bombs. After disposing of a dictator and millionaire, Hawkins is assigned to kill a politician who is heading to a remote hotel, The Green Man, for a secret tryst with his secretary. There, however, Hawkins'' plot is discovered by vacuum salesman William Blake, who determines to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UQISYyjXtqjkKzaDp3c84Whk1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58470'),
  ('637321902581602906', 'The Green Mare', 1959, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Autant-Lara', 'Jean Aurenche, Marcel Aymé', 'Bourvil, Francis Blanche, Yves Robert, Sandra Milo, Julien Carette, Valérie Lagrange, Marie Déa, Guy Bertil', null, 'A green mare makes the fortune of her owner, the horse dealer Haudouin. Shortly after his death, war broke out in 1870. One day, his neighbor Zèphe Maloret denounces Honoré, Haudouin''s son, a maverick, to the Prussians. Following this denunciation, their non-commissioned officer enters the Haudouin home and rapes the mother while Honoré is hidden under the bed. The resentment already existing between the Haudouin and Maloret families turns to hatred... A letter recalling the events is lost, which doesn''t help matters.', 'A green mare makes the fortune of her owner, the horse dealer Haudouin. Shortly after his death, war broke out in 1870. One day, his neighbor Zèphe Maloret denounces Honoré, Haudouin''s son, a maverick, to the Prussians. Following this denunciation, their non-commissioned officer enters the Haudouin home and rapes the mother while Honoré is hidden under the bed. The resentment already existing between the Haudouin and Maloret families turns to hatred... A letter recalling the events is lost, which doesn''t help matters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rfvJUemqsxmtuSRJlPJy0xgLyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80571'),
  ('6660206855973418', 'The Green Mile', 1999, 'Fantasy, Drama, Crime', 'David Tattersall, Frank Darabont, William Cruse', 'Frank Darabont', 'Tom Hanks, David Morse, Bonnie Hunt, Michael Clarke Duncan, James Cromwell, Michael Jeter, Graham Greene, Doug Hutchison', 'R', 'A supernatural tale set on death row in a Southern prison, where gentle giant John Coffey possesses the mysterious power to heal people''s ailments. When the cell block''s head guard, Paul Edgecomb, recognizes Coffey''s miraculous gift, he tries desperately to help stave off the condemned man''s execution.', 'A supernatural tale set on death row in a Southern prison, where gentle giant John Coffey possesses the mysterious power to heal people''s ailments. When the cell block''s head guard, Paul Edgecomb, recognizes Coffey''s miraculous gift, he tries desperately to help stave off the condemned man''s execution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VG8fDNiy50H4FedGwdSVUPoaJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497'),
  ('26338776372150887', 'The Green Pastures', 1936, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'William Keighley, Marc Connelly, Sherry Shourds', 'Sheridan Gibney', 'Oscar Polk, Eddie ''Rochester'' Anderson, Rex Ingram, Frank H. Wilson, George H. Reed, Abraham Gleaves, Myrtle Anderson, Al Stokes', null, 'God, heaven, and several Old Testament stories, including the Creation and Noah''s Ark, are described supposedly using the perspective of rural, black Americans.', 'God, heaven, and several Old Testament stories, including the Creation and Noah''s Ark, are described supposedly using the perspective of rural, black Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyYQzdDPyS0EXmpJaurjOnKpH83.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95015'),
  ('570824304246544210', 'The Green Perfume', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Nicolas Pariser, Sébastien Buchmann, Lóránd Banner-Szûcs', 'Nicolas Pariser', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Vincent Lacoste, Rüdiger Vogler, Léonie Simaga, Arieh Worthalter, Jenna Thiam, Alexandre Steiger, Lucie Gallo', null, 'In the middle of a performance at la Comédie-Française, an actor dies on stage, poisoned. Martin, member of the troupe and friend of the victim, becomes the center of everyone’s attention. Suspected by the police, he’s also chased by a mysterious organization, Le Parfum vert, that seems to have ordered the murder.', 'In the middle of a performance at la Comédie-Française, an actor dies on stage, poisoned. Martin, member of the troupe and friend of the victim, becomes the center of everyone’s attention. Suspected by the police, he’s also chased by a mysterious organization, Le Parfum vert, that seems to have ordered the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxKgr8OSvm4qnXOMURLzG942pLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950053'),
  ('704076963481497256', 'The Green Planet', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Jan Haft, Jan Haft', 'Jan Haft, Gerwig Lawitzky', 'Benno Fürmann', null, 'It covers thirty percent of the Earth''s land mass and yet, most of us barely scratch the surface. Now, discover what few people have seen, as The Green Planet follows the stories of forest inhabitants, from graceful red deer to cunning foxes and impressive wild boar. With cutting edge technology, we also explore some of the more bizarre and wonderful forest dwellers: the purple emperor, liverworts, stag beetles and corydalis. See flowers bloom and blades of grass cut through the snow. Spend time in a foxes den with her new born cubs and follow tiny insects and creatures with microscopic detail. Be a part of a journey that takes you through the seasons and be prepared to be amazed by the natural wonder of creation, destruction and rebirth in this incomparable landscape.', 'It covers thirty percent of the Earth''s land mass and yet, most of us barely scratch the surface. Now, discover what few people have seen, as The Green Planet follows the stories of forest inhabitants, from graceful red deer to cunning foxes and impressive wild boar. With cutting edge technology, we also explore some of the more bizarre and wonderful forest dwellers: the purple emperor, liverworts, stag beetles and corydalis. See flowers bloom and blades of grass cut through the snow. Spend time in a foxes den with her new born cubs and follow tiny insects and creatures with microscopic detail. Be a part of a journey that takes you through the seasons and be prepared to be amazed by the natural wonder of creation, destruction and rebirth in this incomparable landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3BARsvEvrIrBkSpHhuxdDRvlhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173773'),
  ('1125655895679038429', 'The Green Promise', 1949, 'Drama', 'William D. Russell, John L. Russell', 'Monte Collins', 'Marguerite Chapman, Walter Brennan, Natalie Wood, Robert Paige, Ted Donaldson, Connie Marshall, Irving Bacon, Milburn Stone', 'NR', 'A stubborn farmer is raising his children alone. When his oldest daughter gets a suitor, the father nearly goes on the rampage, but he is forced to change his tune when he is injured, leaving her in charge of the farm.', 'A stubborn farmer is raising his children alone. When his oldest daughter gets a suitor, the father nearly goes on the rampage, but he is forced to change his tune when he is injured, leaving her in charge of the farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Mn419A64AOMakBR0v8vYqQt8df.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272596'),
  ('1029187630670507166', 'The Green Ray', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Éric Rohmer, Sophie Maintigneux', 'Marie Rivière, Éric Rohmer', 'Marie Rivière, Amira Chemakhi, Sylvie Richez, María Luisa García, Béatrice Romand, Rosette, Vincent Gauthier, Basile Gervaise', null, 'A lonely Parisian woman comes to terms with her isolation and anxieties during a long summer vacation.', 'A lonely Parisian woman comes to terms with her isolation and anxieties during a long summer vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1E3pliSC7lXWw6zJhMvG6ba0UNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54898'),
  ('266370702877664684', 'The Green Room', 1978, 'Drama', 'Néstor Almendros, François Truffaut, Suzanne Schiffman', 'Jean-Pierre Moulin', 'François Truffaut, Nathalie Baye, Jean Dasté, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Antoine Vitez, Jeanne Lobre, Annie Miller, Marie-Jaoul de Poncheville', 'PG', 'A widower maintains a memorial room filled with his late wife''s belongings. When fire destroys it, he transforms a chapel into a new shrine to preserve her memory.', 'A widower maintains a memorial room filled with his late wife''s belongings. When fire destroys it, he transforms a chapel into a new shrine to preserve her memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8D2Oty3FpihcNoNowuYbzOaXKsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8070'),
  ('439284543595587527', 'The Green Shutters', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jean Becker, Yves Angelo, Hubert Engammare', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie, Jean Becker', 'Gérard Depardieu, Fanny Ardant, Stéfi Celma, Benoît Poelvoorde, Anouk Grinberg, Loïc Armel Colin, Ted Etienne, Fred Testot', null, 'The twilight of a sacred monster, Jules Maugin, an actor at the height of his glory. Beneath the famous personality, the big mouth, and the social shell, lies the intimate portrait of a man laid bare.', 'The twilight of a sacred monster, Jules Maugin, an actor at the height of his glory. Beneath the famous personality, the big mouth, and the social shell, lies the intimate portrait of a man laid bare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kQd5ofi1BeJZo7fdqGc1upd5tn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892503'),
  ('1040407560905472540', 'The Green Slime', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Katsuhiko Taguchi', 'Tom Rowe, Charles Sinclair, Bill Finger', 'Robert Horton, Luciana Paluzzi, Richard Jaeckel, Bud Widom, Ted Gunther, David Yorston, Robert Dunham, Gary Randolf', 'G', 'A giant asteroid is heading toward Earth so some astronauts disembark from a nearby space station to blow it up. The mission is successful, and they return to the station unknowingly bringing back a gooey green substance that mutates into one-eyed tentacled monsters that feed off electricity. Soon the station is crawling with them, and people are being zapped left and right!', 'A giant asteroid is heading toward Earth so some astronauts disembark from a nearby space station to blow it up. The mission is successful, and they return to the station unknowingly bringing back a gooey green substance that mutates into one-eyed tentacled monsters that feed off electricity. Soon the station is crawling with them, and people are being zapped left and right!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MWnOwcLeySNqPtHpxqr7bJTZE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29290'),
  ('489029478197110700', 'The Green Snake', 2019, null, 'Fei Xu', 'Ding Qi', 'Ma Jiaming, Nan Sheng, Dong Liwuyou, Yuan Yuan, Zhao Ziluo', null, 'Xun Ya, an exiled god turned oracle, ferries souls across the Luochuan River. After saving the Green Snake from a fatal lightning strike, he builds the Sansheng Inn and creates Zhe Sheng as a companion. For three hundred years, they live peacefully caring for passing souls. When a destructive demon threatens their world, Green Snake courageously decides to fight and protect her loved ones, risking everything to defend her home.', 'Xun Ya, an exiled god turned oracle, ferries souls across the Luochuan River. After saving the Green Snake from a fatal lightning strike, he builds the Sansheng Inn and creates Zhe Sheng as a companion. For three hundred years, they live peacefully caring for passing souls. When a destructive demon threatens their world, Green Snake courageously decides to fight and protect her loved ones, risking everything to defend her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axTGjsvloZrxtm2QF2geWPBOLor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:754727'),
  ('743827465871098607', 'The Green Van', 1983, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Aleksandr Pavlovskiy', 'Igor Shevtsov', 'Dmitriy Kharatyan, Boryslav Brondukov, Aleksandr Demyanenko, Aleksandr Solovyov, Regimantas Adomaitis, Konstantin Grigorev, Viktor Ilichyov, Eduard Martsevich', null, 'It is 1920. After three years of the Russian Civil War, communist government is finally established in Odessa. Young Alyosha Patrikeyv, who dreams of being a detective like Sherlock Holmes, joins the newly forming Odessa Criminal Police. He is assigned to fight illegal booz production in a small village of Severinovka. When he goes on a chase after a horse thief Krasavchik, Alyosha finds himself up against Cherven - the most dangerous criminal in Odessa.', 'It is 1920. After three years of the Russian Civil War, communist government is finally established in Odessa. Young Alyosha Patrikeyv, who dreams of being a detective like Sherlock Holmes, joins the newly forming Odessa Criminal Police. He is assigned to fight illegal booz production in a small village of Severinovka. When he goes on a chase after a horse thief Krasavchik, Alyosha finds himself up against Cherven - the most dangerous criminal in Odessa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDp5PiqDFOl9rcCvrxQ0fLXLAJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191096'),
  ('1110966722184425259', 'The Green Wall', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Armando Robles Godoy, Mario Robles', 'Juan Cuadros', 'Julio Alemán, Sandra Riva, Raúl Martin, Lorena Duval, Enrique Victoria, Jorge Montoro, Juan Bautista Font, Escolástico Dávila', null, 'A young couple forsakes their urban existence for life in the exciting but dangerous Peruvian jungle.', 'A young couple forsakes their urban existence for life in the exciting but dangerous Peruvian jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m10MNgVUwwAQWglt0Vr5k6OwocH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106887'),
  ('165477384639015136', 'The Green Years', 1946, 'Drama', 'Victor Saville, George J. Folsey', 'A.J. Cronin', 'Charles Coburn, Tom Drake, Hume Cronyn, Gladys Cooper, Dean Stockwell, Selena Royle, Jessica Tandy, Richard Haydn', 'NR', 'An orphaned young boy is guided by his great-grandfather and strives to go to university to become a doctor. However, the boy''s harsh grandfather stands in his way.', 'An orphaned young boy is guided by his great-grandfather and strives to go to university to become a doctor. However, the boy''s harsh grandfather stands in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sD8tUj5O9zrOHbgovQoKFM9VdRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99351'),
  ('1072165223018322479', 'The Green Years', 1963, 'Drama', 'Paulo Rocha, Heliodoro Pires, Fernando Matos Silva', 'Nuno Bragança, Paulo Rocha', 'Rui Gomes, Isabel Ruth, Paulo Renato, Ruy Furtado, Cândida Lacerda, Irene Dyne, Carlos José Teixeira, Harry Wheeland', null, 'Nineteen-year-old Julio heads to Lisbon from the provinces and gets a job as a shoemaker for his uncle Raul. But when he meets Ilda, a confident young housemaid who becomes a regular shop visitor, his working-class values collide with the bourgeois trappings of modern life.', 'Nineteen-year-old Julio heads to Lisbon from the provinces and gets a job as a shoemaker for his uncle Raul. But when he meets Ilda, a confident young housemaid who becomes a regular shop visitor, his working-class values collide with the bourgeois trappings of modern life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdw09WPUcz9mcByvx1qYLyf8Ma8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170368'),
  ('1037170020046559981', 'The Green, Green Grass of Home', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chen Kun-hou', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien', 'Kenny Bee, Jiang Ling, Jonathan Lee, Yen Cheng-kuo, Hu Tou, Mei Fang, Shih Ying, Ling Wu', null, 'A substitute teacher from Taipei arrives in a country village to teach a class of mischievous students. He soon falls in love with nature, country life and a fellow teacher at the school.', 'A substitute teacher from Taipei arrives in a country village to teach a class of mischievous students. He soon falls in love with nature, country life and a fellow teacher at the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g0vba2RNfDxL0Ccu3aM7vzBVB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104171'),
