  ('387600969672941701', 'The Greener Yard', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Dink Trout, Florence Gill, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'An old beetle (though he looks more like Jiminy Cricket) living next door to Donald Duck explains to his young charge why Donald''s garden isn''t the paradise it appears to be, by recounting his battles with Donald when he first discovered the garden, and his narrow escape assisted by a couple of birds.', 'An old beetle (though he looks more like Jiminy Cricket) living next door to Donald Duck explains to his young charge why Donald''s garden isn''t the paradise it appears to be, by recounting his battles with Donald when he first discovered the garden, and his narrow escape assisted by a couple of birds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wB7zEzemoMFGQfcwtIxBZdsTOLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67590'),
  ('218969355737272295', 'The Greengage Summer', 1961, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Lewis Gilbert, Freddie Young', 'Howard Koch', 'Kenneth More, Danielle Darrieux, Susannah York, Claude Nollier, Jane Asher, Raymond Gérôme, Maurice Denham, Harold Kasket', null, 'Sensitive story of a British girl''s awakening from childhood into life and love on vacation in France.', 'Sensitive story of a British girl''s awakening from childhood into life and love on vacation in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOFCR94jw0QroKMWr4RrjTQmiur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194806'),
  ('964862584165507998', 'The Grey', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Masanobu Takayanagi, Joe Carnahan, Stephane Stoll', 'Ian Mackenzie Jeffers, Joe Carnahan', 'Liam Neeson, Dermot Mulroney, Frank Grillo, Dallas Roberts, Nonso Anozie, James Badge Dale, Anne Openshaw, Jonathan James Bitonti', 'R', 'Following a grueling five-week shift at an Alaskan oil refinery, workers led by sharpshooter John Ottway are flying home for a much-needed vacation. But a brutal storm causes their plane to crash in the frozen wilderness, and only eight men, including Ottway, survive. As they trek southward toward civilization and safety, Ottway and his companions must battle mortal injuries, the icy elements, and a pack of hungry wolves.', 'Following a grueling five-week shift at an Alaskan oil refinery, workers led by sharpshooter John Ottway are flying home for a much-needed vacation. But a brutal storm causes their plane to crash in the frozen wilderness, and only eight men, including Ottway, survive. As they trek southward toward civilization and safety, Ottway and his companions must battle mortal injuries, the icy elements, and a pack of hungry wolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0Vt3wx8ciKmPt4iXPx9sH4HBVU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75174'),
  ('298181619137748476', 'The Grey Automobile', 1919, 'Action, Crime', 'Enrique Rosas', 'José Manuel Ramos, Juan Manuel Cabrera', 'Joaquín Coss, Juan de Homs, Manuel de los Ríos, María Tereza Montoya, Carlos E. González, Dora Vila', null, 'A gang terrorizes Mexico City''s high society in 1915. Murder, kidnaping and robbery are their trademarks. One police inspector (Cabrera) follows the gang''s crimes and eventually sends them to jail.', 'A gang terrorizes Mexico City''s high society in 1915. Murder, kidnaping and robbery are their trademarks. One police inspector (Cabrera) follows the gang''s crimes and eventually sends them to jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXhWCA2sCrqhbKoWCnhMrBy7if4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115012'),
  ('1107232200015996824', 'The Grey Fox', 1982, 'Western, History', 'Phillip Borsos, Frank Tidy', 'John Hunter', 'Richard Farnsworth, Jackie Burroughs, Ken Pogue, Wayne Robson, Timothy Webber, Gary Reineke, David Petersen, Don MacKay', 'PG', 'Old West highwayman Bill Miner, known to Pinkertons as "The Gentleman Bandit," is released in 1901 after 33 years in prison. A genial and charming old man, he re-enters a world unfamiliar to him, and returns to the only thing that gives him purpose — robbery.', 'Old West highwayman Bill Miner, known to Pinkertons as "The Gentleman Bandit," is released in 1901 after 33 years in prison. A genial and charming old man, he re-enters a world unfamiliar to him, and returns to the only thing that gives him purpose — robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycE2WBSczxBgM1vtRQ9KTtwGTMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42136'),
  ('413763421183840926', 'The Grey Hounded Hare', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Bugs goes to the dog track, falls in love with the mechanical rabbit there, and has to outsmart the dogs to get to her.', 'Bugs goes to the dog track, falls in love with the mechanical rabbit there, and has to outsmart the dogs to get to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBnUPJf9ccmXnsAdXZl6901WjLT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213874'),
  ('770786607490976285', 'The Grey Men', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Yi Huang', null, 'Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Andy On Chi-Kit, Samuel Ku, Eason Hung Chun-Ga, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Jeana Ho Pui-Yu, Ken Wong, Jazz Lam Tsz-Sin', null, 'The film''s story unfolds in the fictional country of Laika and in Hong Kong, China. A police academy student who has not yet graduated, Ashan (played by Gu Bin), is tasked with a dangerous mission. He helps the criminal organization by eliminating obstacles for their leader, Atian (played by An Zhi Jie), in prison. Ashan approaches Atian, gains his trust, and collects evidence against the criminal group. After both of them are released from prison, Ashan assists Atian in rising within the criminal organization in Hong Kong. After enduring numerous challenges, Atian successfully replaces the group''s leader, Bao Ge (played by Zeng Zhiwei), becoming the new boss and taking control of the organization. However, just as Ashan is about to complete his mission, his true identity is exposed.', 'The film''s story unfolds in the fictional country of Laika and in Hong Kong, China. A police academy student who has not yet graduated, Ashan (played by Gu Bin), is tasked with a dangerous mission. He helps the criminal organization by eliminating obstacles for their leader, Atian (played by An Zhi Jie), in prison. Ashan approaches Atian, gains his trust, and collects evidence against the criminal group. After both of them are released from prison, Ashan assists Atian in rising within the criminal organization in Hong Kong. After enduring numerous challenges, Atian successfully replaces the group''s leader, Bao Ge (played by Zeng Zhiwei), becoming the new boss and taking control of the organization. However, just as Ashan is about to complete his mission, his true identity is exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cY5ndIXDcfODBncEucbWYyXqOaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1240224'),
  ('538078372778169409', 'The Grey Zone', 2001, 'Drama, War, History', 'Tim Blake Nelson, Russell Lee Fine, Peter Mechkoff', 'Tim Blake Nelson', 'David Arquette, Velizar Binev, Michael Stuhlbarg, Daniel Benzali, Allan Corduner, Steve Buscemi, Harvey Keitel, Natasha Lyonne', null, 'The story of Auschwitz''s twelfth Sonderkommando — one of the thirteen consecutive "Special Squads" of Jewish prisoners placed by the Nazis in the excruciating moral dilemma of assisting in the extermination of fellow Jews in exchange for a few more months of life.', 'The story of Auschwitz''s twelfth Sonderkommando — one of the thirteen consecutive "Special Squads" of Jewish prisoners placed by the Nazis in the excruciating moral dilemma of assisting in the extermination of fellow Jews in exchange for a few more months of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jRsWnpciWHRy0MC7K5eMDKKqPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15192'),
  ('483510201152582779', 'The Grifters', 1990, 'Crime, Drama', 'Oliver Stapleton, Stephen Frears, J. Stephen Buck', 'Donald E. Westlake', 'Anjelica Huston, John Cusack, Annette Bening, Jan Munroe, Robert Weems, Stephen Tobolowsky, Jimmy Noonan, Richard Holden', 'R', 'A small-time conman has his loyalties torn between his estranged mother and his new girlfriend, both of whom are high-stakes grifters with their own angles to play.', 'A small-time conman has his loyalties torn between his estranged mother and his new girlfriend, both of whom are high-stakes grifters with their own angles to play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMpGfkiDIdg5bB7WGcAT3Fdrfpt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18129'),
  ('271687585027591558', 'The Grim Adventures of the Kids Next Door', 2007, 'Adventure, Comedy, Animation, TV Movie, Action, Family, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Maxwell Atoms, Tom Warburton, Danny Antonucci', 'Tom Warburton, Maxwell Atoms', 'Grey DeLisle, Ben Diskin, Lauren Tom, Dee Bradley Baker, Cree Summer, Richard Steven Horvitz, Greg Eagles, Rachael MacFarlane', null, 'A crossover with The Grim Adventures of Billy and Mandy and Codename: Kids Next Door. While Billy''s Dad is underwear shopping, Billy wears his dad''s lucky pants, and accidentely rips them with Grim''s scythe. He calls Ed, Edd n Eddy, and they recommend Kids Next Door for charity. Numbuh 1 disguises as Billy while Billy is taken to the Deep Sea Lab. Mandy arrives at Billy''s house and knows Numbuh 1 is not Billy, and tortures him into revealing the truth. Meanwhile, the Delightful Children From Down the Lane and Billy accidentally fuse with the scythes power to create the Delightful Reaper, and Mandy takes over the KND by fooling Numbuh 362 and the rest of the operatives. Now its up to Numbuh 1 and the Grim Reaper to save KND and stop Mandy and the Delightful Reaper.', 'A crossover with The Grim Adventures of Billy and Mandy and Codename: Kids Next Door. While Billy''s Dad is underwear shopping, Billy wears his dad''s lucky pants, and accidentely rips them with Grim''s scythe. He calls Ed, Edd n Eddy, and they recommend Kids Next Door for charity. Numbuh 1 disguises as Billy while Billy is taken to the Deep Sea Lab. Mandy arrives at Billy''s house and knows Numbuh 1 is not Billy, and tortures him into revealing the truth. Meanwhile, the Delightful Children From Down the Lane and Billy accidentally fuse with the scythes power to create the Delightful Reaper, and Mandy takes over the KND by fooling Numbuh 362 and the rest of the operatives. Now its up to Numbuh 1 and the Grim Reaper to save KND and stop Mandy and the Delightful Reaper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g59h3zVB242z5KQhyOYiPpya27N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361472'),
  ('551518990234290924', 'The Grinch', 2018, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Fantasy', 'Yarrow Cheney, Scott Mosier', 'Michael LeSieur, Tommy Swerdlow', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Rashida Jones, Kenan Thompson, Cameron Seely, Angela Lansbury, Pharrell Williams, Ramone Hamilton, Sam Lavagnino', 'PG', 'The Grinch hatches a scheme to ruin Christmas when the residents of Whoville plan their annual holiday celebration.', 'The Grinch hatches a scheme to ruin Christmas when the residents of Whoville plan their annual holiday celebration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smxA8yvZ0LzDPer9BIRd4pyOpx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360920'),
  ('214283468232176167', 'The Grinch Grinches the Cat in the Hat', 1982, 'Animation, Family, Music, TV Movie', 'Bill Perez', 'Dr. Seuss', 'Mason Adams, Bob Holt, Frank Welker, Joe Eich', 'G', 'The Cat in the Hat is all set for a lovely picnic, but the evil Grinch changes his plans by inventing a contraption that captures noise and makes it sound ferocious. The Cat has to save the world from the clutches of the Grinch and the only way to do it is to reach Grinch''s soft spot.', 'The Cat in the Hat is all set for a lovely picnic, but the evil Grinch changes his plans by inventing a contraption that captures noise and makes it sound ferocious. The Cat has to save the world from the clutches of the Grinch and the only way to do it is to reach Grinch''s soft spot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBESaIVmnw9LevvsSwyzET1dOeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46963'),
  ('769965272761674534', 'The Grissom Gang', 1971, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Aldrich, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Leon Griffiths', 'Kim Darby, Scott Wilson, Tony Musante, Robert Lansing, Connie Stevens, Wesley Addy, Ralph Waite, Irene Dailey', 'R', 'Violent crime caper set in 1930s Kansas in which a gang kidnap an heiress and attempt to recover a ransom. However, the scheme is jeopardised when the leader falls in love with their beautiful captive.', 'Violent crime caper set in 1930s Kansas in which a gang kidnap an heiress and attempt to recover a ransom. However, the scheme is jeopardised when the leader falls in love with their beautiful captive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gZQqXBEbrUhzNoPP8cUqysdn9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79645'),
  ('1052956529864237607', 'The Grocer''s Son', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Éric Guirado, Laurent Brunet', 'Florence Vignon, Éric Guirado', 'Nicolas Cazalé, Clotilde Hesme, Daniel Duval, Jeanne Goupil, Liliane Rovère, Paul Crauchet, Chad Chenouga, Benoît Giros', null, 'Antoine Sforza, a thirty-year-old young man, left his village ten years before in order to start a new life in the big city, but now that his father, a traveling grocer, is in hospital after a stroke, he more or less reluctantly accepts to come back to replace him in his daily rounds.', 'Antoine Sforza, a thirty-year-old young man, left his village ten years before in order to start a new life in the big city, but now that his father, a traveling grocer, is in hospital after a stroke, he more or less reluctantly accepts to come back to replace him in his daily rounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sHrsllHOtr1voW5Pc8dNOQIiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8049'),
  ('950834086139128279', 'The Grocery Boy', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', null, 'Mickey (and Pluto) are delivering a grocery order to Minnie. She pretends not to notice for a while, but when he gets hit on the head by an iron, she drops her pretense and rushes to his side. Mickey then helps with the dinner preparations, but Pluto steals the turkey, and a chase ensues. There''s also a 4-layer cake that you just know is going to get ruined spectacularly.', 'Mickey (and Pluto) are delivering a grocery order to Minnie. She pretends not to notice for a while, but when he gets hit on the head by an iron, she drops her pretense and rushes to his side. Mickey then helps with the dinner preparations, but Pluto steals the turkey, and a chase ensues. There''s also a 4-layer cake that you just know is going to get ruined spectacularly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5EFFrx4HXtWXkGjNdEx4Nrj4PW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156510'),
  ('305217256205694153', 'The Groom', 1960, 'Drama', 'Elem Klimov', null, null, null, 'A young schoolboy tries to help the girl he likes to pass a test.', 'A young schoolboy tries to help the girl he likes to pass a test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndoQ6fvPb9dmYWShQuDdHu5VbHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48779'),
  ('361274583980301345', 'The Groom Wore Spurs', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Richard Whorf, J. Peverell Marley, Tom Andre', 'Robert Libott, Frank Burt', 'Ginger Rogers, Jack Carson, Joan Davis, Stanley Ridges, John Litel, James Brown, Victor Sen Yung, Mira McKinney', null, 'Pretty female attorney Abigail "AJ" Furnival is hired to keep high-flying cowboy movie star Ben Castle out of trouble in Las Vegas. Despite his many faults, Abigail falls in love with and marries Ben, with the hope that she can mold him into the virtuous hero he plays on the screen.', 'Pretty female attorney Abigail "AJ" Furnival is hired to keep high-flying cowboy movie star Ben Castle out of trouble in Las Vegas. Despite his many faults, Abigail falls in love with and marries Ben, with the hope that she can mold him into the virtuous hero he plays on the screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2x5DQspkalxq84AN9Wj7tynRuVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121247'),
  ('1053432495462637376', 'The Groomsmen', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'William Rexer, Edward Burns, Andrea O''Connor', 'Edward Burns', 'Edward Burns, John Leguizamo, Matthew Lillard, Donal Logue, Jay Mohr, Brittany Murphy, Heather Burns, Shari Albert', 'R', 'Blue-collar Paulie prepares for fatherhood and his forthcoming wedding to Sue by hanging out with his groomsmen. Brother Jimbo, cousin Mike, and his pals fill the reunion with drinking, boys-will-be-boys antics and a few unexpected personal confessions. But, when the bonding devolves into accusations and regret, Paulie has to decide whether he''s ready to tie the knot and take this big step into adulthood.', 'Blue-collar Paulie prepares for fatherhood and his forthcoming wedding to Sue by hanging out with his groomsmen. Brother Jimbo, cousin Mike, and his pals fill the reunion with drinking, boys-will-be-boys antics and a few unexpected personal confessions. But, when the bonding devolves into accusations and regret, Paulie has to decide whether he''s ready to tie the knot and take this big step into adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIlcGSfSsw31aSAD2cTBkdFwZbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14963'),
  ('361111209011580510', 'The Groove Tube', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Ken Shapiro, Bob Bailin', 'Ken Shapiro, Lane Sarasohn', 'Ken Shapiro, Richard Belzer, Chevy Chase, Buzzy Linhart, Richmond Baier, Berkeley Harris, Jennifer Welles, Lane Sarasohn', 'R', 'Television programming takes it on the chin in this ribald spoof of the networks.', 'Television programming takes it on the chin in this ribald spoof of the networks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyfmgTW3a0gftxgVptvKBAf9GqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27977'),
  ('984012534519112898', 'The Grotesque', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'John-Paul Davidson, Andrew Dunn', 'Patrick McGrath', 'Alan Bates, Theresa Russell, Sting, Lena Headey, Jim Carter, Anna Massey, Trudie Styler, Maria Aitken', null, 'Sir Hugo is more interested in reconstructing dinosaur bones than in paying attention to his wife, Lady Harriet. He''s not thrilled when daughter Cleo brings home her betrothed, Sidney, who aspires to be a poet. The new butler, Fledge, provides Lady Harriet with the attention she''s been missing and then seduces Sidney. Did he have a role in Sidney''s disappearance as well?', 'Sir Hugo is more interested in reconstructing dinosaur bones than in paying attention to his wife, Lady Harriet. He''s not thrilled when daughter Cleo brings home her betrothed, Sidney, who aspires to be a poet. The new butler, Fledge, provides Lady Harriet with the attention she''s been missing and then seduces Sidney. Did he have a role in Sidney''s disappearance as well?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6fBarsRWowdt1SN2lcge6iiuQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67750'),
  ('251767757201726401', 'The Grotto', 2020, 'Horror', 'Arthur Vinciprova', 'Arthur Vinciprova', 'Carolina Ferraz, Arthur Vinciprova, Nayara Justino, Pietro Mário, Monica Izidoro, Luciene Martes, Fábio Soares, Jhenifer Emerick', null, 'Four bodies are found at a cave accident and forensics point to the only survivor as the culprit. He denies guilt, accusing his wife of committing the crime. But how is this so? She is one of the deceased.', 'Four bodies are found at a cave accident and forensics point to the only survivor as the culprit. He denies guilt, accusing his wife of committing the crime. But how is this so? She is one of the deceased.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBdoS8tjWubpEyQnqmM6tpZR3GU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758510'),
  ('212544630174220391', 'The Ground Beneath My Feet', 2019, 'Drama', 'Marie Kreutzer, Leena Koppe', 'Marie Kreutzer', 'Valerie Pachner, Pia Hierzegger, Mavie Hörbiger, Michelle Barthel, Marc Benjamin, Axel Sichrovsky, Dominic Marcus Singer, Meo Wulf', null, 'Lola controls her personal life with the same ruthless efficiency she uses to optimize profits in her job as a business consultant. But when a tragic event forces the past back into her life, Lola''s grip on reality seems to slips away.', 'Lola controls her personal life with the same ruthless efficiency she uses to optimize profits in her job as a business consultant. But when a tragic event forces the past back into her life, Lola''s grip on reality seems to slips away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feR8f0Z02G2pQD6oySuMvHL45ZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568789'),
  ('747103328229471162', 'The Ground Beneath Our Feet', 2026, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Lauren Havel', 'Jennifer Havel', 'Elliana Mckean, Mirabelle Bishaw, Eric Johnson, Addilyn Lewis, Addison Fitzpatrick', null, 'Emma Bryant feels swallowed by the growing darkness of today''s culture. Forced to move in with her grandpa, she stumbles upon an old diary that transports her into a world far different from her own. There, Emma realizes something vital is missing in the 21st century. Determined to uncover it, she searches tirelessly—only to learn it cannot be acquired, but must be received.', 'Emma Bryant feels swallowed by the growing darkness of today''s culture. Forced to move in with her grandpa, she stumbles upon an old diary that transports her into a world far different from her own. There, Emma realizes something vital is missing in the 21st century. Determined to uncover it, she searches tirelessly—only to learn it cannot be acquired, but must be received.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Ff%2Fgracenote%2Ff71d77729ed4ffa08b590ff8a0b5c1a0.jpg', 'plex:movie:the-ground-beneath-our-feet'),
  ('877251152752338086', 'The Groundhogs', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Élie Chouraqui, Robert Alazraki', 'Élie Chouraqui, Danièle Thompson', 'Jean-Hugues Anglade, Jacqueline Bisset, Christine Boisson, André Dussollier, Gérard Lanvin, Virginie Ledoyen, Marie Trintignant', null, 'A story of a family with numerous members drowned in their sentimental problems.', 'A story of a family with numerous members drowned in their sentimental problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6DqmgX8EcGLVDoSP61S9GY3G4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70908'),
  ('134884557694249388', 'The Groundstar Conspiracy', 1972, 'Mystery, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Lamont Johnson, Michael Reed, Roger Good', 'Douglas Heyes', 'George Peppard, Michael Sarrazin, Christine Belford, Cliff Potts, James Olson, Tim O''Connor, James McEachin, Alan Oppenheimer', 'PG', 'A break-in and sabotage attempt occurs at a top secret research institute and the culprit is cornered and captured. The problem is that he''s been badly injured and claims to have lost his memory entirely. A cat-and-mouse game ensues between investigator Tuxan, the mystery intruder Welles and the people who sent him on the mission.', 'A break-in and sabotage attempt occurs at a top secret research institute and the culprit is cornered and captured. The problem is that he''s been badly injured and claims to have lost his memory entirely. A cat-and-mouse game ensues between investigator Tuxan, the mystery intruder Welles and the people who sent him on the mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSfdGDEGxfQqc1fTEjIvZz3RccQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72114'),
  ('1078824158233430618', 'The Group', 1966, 'Drama', 'Dan Eriksen, Sidney Lumet, Willis Conner', 'Sidney Buchman', 'Candice Bergen, Joan Hackett, Elizabeth Hartman, Shirley Knight, Joanna Pettet, Mary-Robin Redd, Jessica Walter, Kathleen Widdoes', null, 'It''s 1933, and eight young women are friends and members of the upper-class group at a private girl''s school, about to graduate and start their own lives. The film documents the years between their graduation and the beginning of the World War in Europe, and shows, in a serialized style, their romances and marriages, their searches for careers or meaning in their lives, their highs and their lows.', 'It''s 1933, and eight young women are friends and members of the upper-class group at a private girl''s school, about to graduate and start their own lives. The film documents the years between their graduation and the beginning of the World War in Europe, and shows, in a serialized style, their romances and marriages, their searches for careers or meaning in their lives, their highs and their lows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oeVm3Tg24mf04D8IxZbh5mjLRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84278'),
  ('367963191284616385', 'The Grudge', 2004, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Takashi Shimizu, Hideo Yamamoto, Satoshi Kanda', 'Takashi Shimizu, Stephen Susco', 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Jason Behr, Takako Fuji, Yuya Ozeki, William Mapother, Clea DuVall, KaDee Strickland, Grace Zabriskie', 'PG-13', 'An American nurse living and working in Tokyo is exposed to a mysterious supernatural curse, one that locks a person in a powerful rage before claiming their life and spreading to another victim.', 'An American nurse living and working in Tokyo is exposed to a mysterious supernatural curse, one that locks a person in a powerful rage before claiming their life and spreading to another victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vPAVPKYexQVmvC578wPLn2CGCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1970'),
  ('429950048947774501', 'The Grudge', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Brent Bell, Nicolas Pesce, Chris Johnson', 'Nicolas Pesce, Jeff Buhler', 'Andrea Riseborough, Demián Bichir, John Cho, Lin Shaye, Jacki Weaver, Betty Gilpin, William Sadler, Frankie Faison', 'R', 'After a young mother murders her family in her own house, a detective attempts to investigate the mysterious case, only to discover that the house is cursed by a vengeful ghost. Now targeted by the demonic spirits, the detective must do anything to protect herself and her family from harm.', 'After a young mother murders her family in her own house, a detective attempts to investigate the mysterious case, only to discover that the house is cursed by a vengeful ghost. Now targeted by the demonic spirits, the detective must do anything to protect herself and her family from harm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN7JHlHOT9rHNDU27tfYqhABBj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465086'),
  ('64983337752586528', 'The Grudge 2', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Takashi Shimizu, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Stephen Susco', 'Amber Tamblyn, Edison Chen, Takako Fuji, Ohga Tanaka, Sarah Michelle Gellar, Arielle Kebbel, Teresa Palmer, Misako Uno', 'PG-13', 'A young woman encounters a malevolent supernatural force while searching for her missing sister in Tokyo, a mean high school prank goes horribly wrong, and strange things begin happening in a Chicago apartment building.', 'A young woman encounters a malevolent supernatural force while searching for her missing sister in Tokyo, a mean high school prank goes horribly wrong, and strange things begin happening in a Chicago apartment building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHLeYXqA8P0jVIY2C8kQFyQTzkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1975'),
