  ('704956485210950717', 'The Gruesome Twosome', 1967, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis, Roy Collodi, Allison Louise Downe', 'Allison Louise Downe', 'Elizabeth Davis, Gretchen Wells, Chris Martell, Rodney Bedell, Ray Sager, Ronnie Cass, Karl Stoeber, Dianne Wilhite', 'NR', 'A demented elderly woman has her mentally incompetent son kill and scalp various young women to use their hair for her wig shop while a persistent co-ed tries to link various killings on a local Florida college campus to them.', 'A demented elderly woman has her mentally incompetent son kill and scalp various young women to use their hair for her wig shop while a persistent co-ed tries to link various killings on a local Florida college campus to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akgVApkJXIF5LUXusj2VsoHuB3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48885'),
  ('502639776583632417', 'The Gruffalo', 2009, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Max Lang, Jakob Schuh', 'Jakob Schuh, Max Lang, Julia Donaldson', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Rob Brydon, Robbie Coltrane, James Corden, John Hurt, Tom Wilkinson', 'G', 'The magical tale of a mouse who sets foot on a woodland adventure in search of a nut. Encountering predators who all wish to eat him - Fox, Owl and Snake - the brave mouse creates a terrifying, imaginary monster to frighten them away. But what will the mouse do when he meets this frightful monster for real?', 'The magical tale of a mouse who sets foot on a woodland adventure in search of a nut. Encountering predators who all wish to eat him - Fox, Owl and Snake - the brave mouse creates a terrifying, imaginary monster to frighten them away. But what will the mouse do when he meets this frightful monster for real?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/154eUuLvPnI0mwVDGpMgUyniFEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28118'),
  ('955154258068520116', 'The Gruffalo''s Child', 2011, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Johannes Weiland, Uwe Heidschötter, Karen Lindsay-Stewart', 'Julia Donaldson, Johanna Stuttmann', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Shirley Henderson, Robbie Coltrane, Rob Brydon, John Hurt, Tom Wilkinson, James Corden, Phoebe Givron-Taylor', null, 'A follow up to the 2009 animated feature and adapted from the childrens'' book by Julia Donaldson and Alex Scheffler. The Gruffalo''s child explores the deep dark wood in search of the big bad mouse and meets the Snake, Owl and Fox in the process. She eventually finds the mouse, who manages to outwit her like the Gruffalo before!', 'A follow up to the 2009 animated feature and adapted from the childrens'' book by Julia Donaldson and Alex Scheffler. The Gruffalo''s child explores the deep dark wood in search of the big bad mouse and meets the Snake, Owl and Fox in the process. She eventually finds the mouse, who manages to outwit her like the Gruffalo before!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8fu0eATvUWtmR9CsDlL1gwqTcp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81684'),
  ('714329791050329410', 'The Grumpy', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Alessandro Metz', 'Castellano, Pipolo', 'Adriano Celentano, Debra Feuer, Jean Sorel, Mattia Sbragia, Angela Finocchiaro, Peppe Lanzetta, Percy Hogan, Franco Diogene', null, 'Traveling from New York to Italia, pretty Mary rushes into moody macho lawyer Tito. The girl immediately falls for the guy with the gruffy manners and in an very impertinent way, she leans on him as she gets in trouble: Not only that she gets tied up in her suite by some Gangsters, but also, her new husband is found dead.', 'Traveling from New York to Italia, pretty Mary rushes into moody macho lawyer Tito. The girl immediately falls for the guy with the gruffy manners and in an very impertinent way, she leans on him as she gets in trouble: Not only that she gets tied up in her suite by some Gangsters, but also, her new husband is found dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0QTnKEBP67A2vjU60wIqg91nP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35634'),
