  ('595724147146055717', 'The Guilty', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Anthony Waller, Tobias A. Schliessler', 'Simon Burke', 'Bill Pullman, Devon Sawa, Gabrielle Anwar, Angela Featherstone, Joanne Whalley, Darcy Belsher, Jaimz Woolvett, Ken Tremblett', 'R', 'Callum Crane, a lawyer and would-be federal judge, jeopardizes his chances at a judgeship by forcing himself on his secretary. He then worsens the situation by trying to have the woman murdered. Further complicating matters, he assigns the task to a young man who, unbeknownst to Crane, is actually his son, Nathan. Nathan refuses to do the deed, but not before informing several people, one of whom tries to take on the job.', 'Callum Crane, a lawyer and would-be federal judge, jeopardizes his chances at a judgeship by forcing himself on his secretary. He then worsens the situation by trying to have the woman murdered. Further complicating matters, he assigns the task to a young man who, unbeknownst to Crane, is actually his son, Nathan. Nathan refuses to do the deed, but not before informing several people, one of whom tries to take on the job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXhL95BYYfy9uSld68RHsmRfcqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55101'),
