  ('768275283137296544', 'The Guilty Are Among Us', 1964, 'Crime, Drama', 'Metin Erksan', 'Metin Erksan', 'Belgin Doruk, Tamer Yiğit, Ekrem Bora, Leyla Sayar, Erol Taş, Atıf Kaptan, Hakkı Haktan, Faik Coşkun', null, 'In the mansion of a rich family living in Istanbul, a very valuable necklace is stolen. Suspecting that the thief is someone from inside the house, the owners start to approach the people working in the house with class differences and prejudices. The thieves realize that the necklace is fake.', 'In the mansion of a rich family living in Istanbul, a very valuable necklace is stolen. Suspecting that the thief is someone from inside the house, the owners start to approach the people working in the house with class differences and prejudices. The thieves realize that the necklace is fake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNIrFOMyEca5iEB7Pke0QJd21xh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270409'),
